values
  ('627277722521165431', 'Non più di uno', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Berto Pelosso, Mario Vulpiani, Beatrice Banfi', 'Berto Pelosso', 'Renato Pozzetto, Maddalena Crippa, Giulia Fossà, Cinzia Leone, Giorgio Del Bene, Orsetta Gregoretti, Lauro Versari, Manuela Gatti', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxr5rap9FKfLmi71hZ8MtIebTCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315798'),
  ('456995868657455154', 'Non si ruba a casa dei ladri', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giorgio Melidoni, Matteo Parenti', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Massimo Ghini, Stefania Rocca, Manuela Arcuri, Maurizio Mattioli, Teco Celio, Lorenzo Balducci, Liliana Vitale', null, 'Antonio, an honest citizen, seeks his revenge against Simone, a dishonest politician. Antonio initially wanted to report him but then, knowing Italy, a country in which the justice process is very long and uncertain, he decides to take revenge in another way: he discovers that his enemy has hidden the proceeds of his misdeeds in a Swiss bank and decides to organize a hit to get back what was stolen from him. To accomplish the feat, Antonio sets up a small gang, made up of non-professionals who have only one thing in common: they too have been defrauded by corrupt politics. The heist takes place in Zurich where the bank in which Simone hid the money is based. With a series of unpredictable consequences, and with a funny substitution of people (Antonio and his wife pretend to be Simone and his partner), a comic clockwork mechanism starts. And the heist begins.', 'Antonio, an honest citizen, seeks his revenge against Simone, a dishonest politician. Antonio initially wanted to report him but then, knowing Italy, a country in which the justice process is very long and uncertain, he decides to take revenge in another way: he discovers that his enemy has hidden the proceeds of his misdeeds in a Swiss bank and decides to organize a hit to get back what was stolen from him. To accomplish the feat, Antonio sets up a small gang, made up of non-professionals who have only one thing in common: they too have been defrauded by corrupt politics. The heist takes place in Zurich where the bank in which Simone hid the money is based. With a series of unpredictable consequences, and with a funny substitution of people (Antonio and his wife pretend to be Simone and his partner), a comic clockwork mechanism starts. And the heist begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sOVH4xOOhvKQjMSDi0lUjP9mwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424009'),
  ('946715747556434862', 'Non smettere di sognare', 2009, 'Drama', 'Roberto Burchielli', null, 'Alessandra Mastronardi, Roberto Farnesi, Tormento', null, 'Stella lives in Genoa with his sister and his alcoholic stepfather. His is not an easy life, and that to remain divided between his work in the harbor by day and dancer by night, despite his dream of becoming a professional dancer gives strength to continue. However, later the death of his mother is forced to put aside their aspirations.', 'Stella lives in Genoa with his sister and his alcoholic stepfather. His is not an easy life, and that to remain divided between his work in the harbor by day and dancer by night, despite his dream of becoming a professional dancer gives strength to continue. However, later the death of his mother is forced to put aside their aspirations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GU1hBn3zg16XYTFiXauBMeB9oq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565349'),
  ('401433451682551949', 'Non ti pago!', 1942, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Carpentieri, Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Rodolfo Lombardi', 'Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Titina De Filippo, Peppino De Filippo, Vanna Vanni, Giorgio De Rege, Paolo Stoppa, Italia Marchesini, Vasco Creti', null, 'The owner of a lottery store refuses to pay a large sum won by one of his workers that he hates, because that man received the winning numbers in a dream.', 'The owner of a lottery store refuses to pay a large sum won by one of his workers that he hates, because that man received the winning numbers in a dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CsQcBLQWbYfX6w9PgG5crBwpHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82692'),
  ('848603970194341669', 'Non-Fiction', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Olivier Assayas, Yorick Le Saux, Aaron Dormer', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Guillaume Canet, Juliette Binoche, Vincent Macaigne, Christa Théret, Nora Hamzawi, Pascal Greggory, Laurent Poitrenaux, Sigrid Bouaziz', 'R', 'Alain, a successful Parisian publisher struggling to adapt to the digital revolution, has major doubts about the new manuscript of Léonard, one of his long-time authors — another work of auto-fiction recycling his love affair with a minor celebrity. Selena, Alain’s wife, a famous stage actress, is of the opposite opinion.', 'Alain, a successful Parisian publisher struggling to adapt to the digital revolution, has major doubts about the new manuscript of Léonard, one of his long-time authors — another work of auto-fiction recycling his love affair with a minor celebrity. Selena, Alain’s wife, a famous stage actress, is of the opposite opinion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlic9fFnAsJcS5xIFyVhMtYCVU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471856'),
  ('505634370942025054', 'Non-Stop', 2014, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jaume Collet-Serra, Flavio Martínez Labiano, Nithya Shrinivasan', 'John W. Richardson, Christopher Roach, Ryan Engle', 'Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Scoot McNairy, Michelle Dockery, Nate Parker, Jason Butler Harner, Corey Stoll, Omar Metwally', 'PG-13', 'Bill Marks is a Federal Air Marshall for whom every day is the same until this one. On this plane ride, he starts receiving text messages from someone claiming to be on the flight and threatening to kill passengers. In a race against the clock, he must identify and stop the killer to save everyone on board.', 'Bill Marks is a Federal Air Marshall for whom every day is the same until this one. On this plane ride, he starts receiving text messages from someone claiming to be on the flight and threatening to kill passengers. In a race against the clock, he must identify and stop the killer to save everyone on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Nkgaj3X0W2jHQ1TzHEgWFpN3kJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225574'),
  ('397672075248282093', 'Non-Stop New York', 1937, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Romance', 'Robert Stevenson, Louis Levy, Mutz Greenbaum', 'Curt Siodmak', 'John Loder, Anna Lee, Francis L. Sullivan, Frank Cellier, Desmond Tester, Athene Seyler, William Dewhurst, Drusilla Wills', 'NR', 'A young woman finds herself as the intended victim of a murder plot on a transatlantic flight from London to New York.', 'A young woman finds herself as the intended victim of a murder plot on a transatlantic flight from London to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u74Cxb0VAz7lzItFWQKLKoy6ACa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216873'),
  ('297375391426794829', 'Non-Stop Trouble with my Double', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Reinhard Schwabenitzky, Charly Steinberger', 'Hartmann Schmige, Christian Rateuke', 'Dieter Hallervorden, Gert Burkard, Götz Kauffmann, Ruth-Maria Kubitschek, Tilo Prückner, Winfried Glatzeder, Manfred Lehmann, Friedrich G. Beckhaus', null, 'A wealthy businessman and the owner of a rundown pub share one thing in common - they look like identical twins! When the businessman hears of a plot against him, he hires the pub owner as a decoy. However, the pub owner is accident prone and causes more trouble than he is worth. An action-packed, physical comedy.', 'A wealthy businessman and the owner of a rundown pub share one thing in common - they look like identical twins! When the businessman hears of a plot against him, he hires the pub owner as a decoy. However, the pub owner is accident prone and causes more trouble than he is worth. An action-packed, physical comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY0xrX7dnHShigw0fOX1ZFsg55u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8821'),
  ('857892251248494120', 'Non-Stop Trouble With the Experts', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Reinhard Schwabenitzky', null, 'Dieter Hallervorden, Walo Lüönd, Peter Fricke, Gert Haucke, Günther Ungeheuer, Jan Fedder, Harry Wüstenhagen, Max Tidof', null, 'Willi Schulze is a car mechanic. Together with Paul, who escaped from an orphanage, he runs a garage. During the testing of a car, Willi finds out the brakes aren''t working that good. A fatal accident can just be prevented. He tries to hitchhike home and gets picked up by American election expert Willy Schneider. Together they also get an accident and both lose their memory. The police assumes Schulze is the election expert and rapidly he turns into the pivot in a stone-hard election-contest.', 'Willi Schulze is a car mechanic. Together with Paul, who escaped from an orphanage, he runs a garage. During the testing of a car, Willi finds out the brakes aren''t working that good. A fatal accident can just be prevented. He tries to hitchhike home and gets picked up by American election expert Willy Schneider. Together they also get an accident and both lose their memory. The police assumes Schulze is the election expert and rapidly he turns into the pivot in a stone-hard election-contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oNGNNnFciIZA3eLKqJwFCahSpt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46654'),
  ('121272918906332167', 'Non-Transferable', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'America Young, Brendan Bradley, Davidson Vorhes', 'Brendan Bradley', 'Ashley Clements, Brendan Bradley, Shanna Malcolm, Katie Wee, Christopher Nicholas Smith, Monika Jolly, Daniel Vincent Gordh, Matthew Scott Montgomery', 'PG-13', 'Amy Tyler has planned the perfect surprise vacation for her boyfriend Josh Merit. But the real surprise is on her when he breaks things off on their anniversary. Stuck with reservations in her ex-boyfriend''s name, Amy''s two best friends suggest if Amy can''t change the tickets ... why not change the guy?', 'Amy Tyler has planned the perfect surprise vacation for her boyfriend Josh Merit. But the real surprise is on her when he breaks things off on their anniversary. Stuck with reservations in her ex-boyfriend''s name, Amy''s two best friends suggest if Amy can''t change the tickets ... why not change the guy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zReGVQHjxVOxZMe4NgjYCq608IB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445500'),
  ('1147565026866049975', 'Nona', 2021, 'Animation', 'Louis Gonzales, Jesse Hollander, Andrea Goh', 'Louis Gonzales', 'Wilma Bonet, Devon Libran', 'G', 'A grandmother is caught between her two favorite things when her granddaughter is unexpectedly dropped off during the day she was planning to spend watching her favorite TV show.', 'A grandmother is caught between her two favorite things when her granddaughter is unexpectedly dropped off during the day she was planning to spend watching her favorite TV show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWlFOOpijBeNMws7KwtFBB79v2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852721'),
  ('206186635825847527', 'Nona. If They Soak Me, I''ll Burn Them', 2019, 'Drama', 'Camila José Donoso, Matías Illanes', 'Camila José Donoso', 'Josefina Ramírez, Eduardo Moscovis, Paula Dinamarca, Gigi Reyes, Nancy Gómez, Daniel Kiblisky, Camila José Donoso, Sebastián Pinto', null, 'Josefina, a radical homemaker, committed a crime of passion that led her to self-exile at a coastal town. She tries to find peace in solitude, immersed in the house routine, while coexisting with a past of lovers and Molotov cocktails. Her body suffers the metamorphosis of aging, and she must undergo cataract surgery.', 'Josefina, a radical homemaker, committed a crime of passion that led her to self-exile at a coastal town. She tries to find peace in solitude, immersed in the house routine, while coexisting with a past of lovers and Molotov cocktails. Her body suffers the metamorphosis of aging, and she must undergo cataract surgery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5fhBCnqCSa1dRW2fBIlhIxPRyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522637'),
  ('848426140765359854', 'None But the Brave', 1965, 'War', 'Frank Sinatra, Harold Lipstein', 'Kikumaru Okuda', 'Tatsuya Mihashi, Takeshi Katō, Homare Suguro, Kenji Sahara, Masahiko Tanimura, Tōru Ibuki, Ryucho Shunputei, Hisao Dazai', 'NR', 'American and Japanese soldiers, stranded on a tiny Pacific island during World War II, must make a temporary truce and cooperate to survive various tribulations. Told through the eyes of the American and Japanese unit commanders, who must deal with an atmosphere of growing distrust and tension between their men.', 'American and Japanese soldiers, stranded on a tiny Pacific island during World War II, must make a temporary truce and cooperate to survive various tribulations. Told through the eyes of the American and Japanese unit commanders, who must deal with an atmosphere of growing distrust and tension between their men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIiPD7Xt196jpf2W8zFHgTg29Oi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43407'),
  ('860676281709491892', 'None But the Lonely Heart', 1944, 'Drama, Romance', 'Clifford Odets, George Barnes, Ruby Rosenberg', 'Clifford Odets', 'Cary Grant, Ethel Barrymore, Barry Fitzgerald, June Duprez, Jane Wyatt, George Coulouris, Dan Duryea, Roman Bohnen', null, 'When an itinerant reluctantly returns home to help his sickly mother run her shop, they''re both tempted to turn to crime to help make ends meet.', 'When an itinerant reluctantly returns home to help his sickly mother run her shop, they''re both tempted to turn to crime to help make ends meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st37wKa1ZUbVSlKFI1fuUWb0rbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52362'),
  ('1043703693524837610', 'None Like Us', 2018, 'Romance', 'Cristina Corna, Roberto Forza, Volfango De Biasi', 'Marco Ponti, Luca Bianchini, Volfango De Biasi', 'Alessandro Preziosi, Sarah Felberbaum, Vincenzo Crea, Sabrina Martina, Leonardo Pazzagli, Christiane Filangieri, Elisa Di Eusanio, Anna Macrì', null, 'The imperfections of love and its bitter consequences in Turin, Italy, during the ‘80s, before the social networks and smartphones. What happens to your heart when you discover that you''re madly in love with your best friend? What happens to your soul when you find out that your teacher and life coach has been hiding a clandestine love with your best friend''s father? What is the true meaning of friendship when you discover that it is the only antidote to heartbreak?', 'The imperfections of love and its bitter consequences in Turin, Italy, during the ‘80s, before the social networks and smartphones. What happens to your heart when you discover that you''re madly in love with your best friend? What happens to your soul when you find out that your teacher and life coach has been hiding a clandestine love with your best friend''s father? What is the true meaning of friendship when you discover that it is the only antidote to heartbreak?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBC1EjLRMRSQz0s0GyjkQPMCE7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548226'),
  ('946427093129595638', 'None Shall Escape', 1944, 'War, Drama', 'André de Toth, Lee Garmes, William A. O''Connor', 'Lester Cole', 'Marsha Hunt, Alexander Knox, Henry Travers, Erik Rolf, Dorothy Morris, Richard Crane, Ruth Nelson, Richard Hale', 'NR', 'Through flashbacks going as far back as the end of WW1, the story of a Nazi war criminal is exposed during his trial.', 'Through flashbacks going as far back as the end of WW1, the story of a Nazi war criminal is exposed during his trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtJdshqBOnasjyBsTDktiI80LWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48989'),
  ('918365013915844903', 'None Too Pleased', 2026, 'Comedy', null, 'Mark Normand', 'Mark Normand', null, 'Mark Normand turns married life, fatherhood and hot-button topics into rapid-fire punchlines in this witty free-for-all where nothing is off limits.', 'Mark Normand turns married life, fatherhood and hot-button topics into rapid-fire punchlines in this witty free-for-all where nothing is off limits.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1tXecciNhN98sXK4quLlVWN1p9O.jpg', 'plex:movie:none-too-pleased'),
  ('339945734805308500', 'Nonfilm', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Vincent Belorgey, Camille Lagache, Guillaume Le Bras, Sébastien Tellier, Philippe Petit, Gaëlle Bona, Frederic Nicolo', null, 'A young actor suddenly wakes up in the middle of the shooting of a movie he doesn''t understand.', 'A young actor suddenly wakes up in the middle of the shooting of a movie he doesn''t understand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKuGXFAbMQh69cBqAEaJITKVZ4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79956'),
  ('225392405609910300', 'Nonnas', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Chbosky, Florian Ballhaus, Vanessa Hoffman', 'Liz Maccie', 'Vince Vaughn, Lorraine Bracco, Talia Shire, Susan Sarandon, Linda Cardellini, Brenda Vaccaro, Drea De Matteo, Joe Manganiello', 'PG', 'After losing his beloved mother, a man risks everything to honor her by opening an Italian restaurant with actual nonnas — grandmothers — as the chefs.', 'After losing his beloved mother, a man risks everything to honor her by opening an Italian restaurant with actual nonnas — grandmothers — as the chefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Bf1xlxLuCHdi74MpdFi2Yz3FGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151039'),
  ('128821058716065209', 'Nonstop Trouble with the Family', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Günter Marczinkowsky, Christian Rateuke, Dieter Hallervorden', 'Hartmann Schmige, Christian Rateuke', 'Dieter Hallervorden, Wolfgang Kieling, Gerhard Wollner, Christoph Hofrichter, Gert Burkard, Harald Effenberg, Gert Haucke, Inge Wolffberg', null, 'A series of murders eliminates the poverty-stricken heirs to a 10 million-dollar fortune while Didi Dodel, the unsuspecting main heir, blithely escapes the attempts on his life. After a wealthy miser dies and leaves his fortune to Didi and five others, the five each hit upon the idea of eliminating Didi from the list (Didi does not know he has been named), but they do not realize how fate can step in and alter the best and worst of intentions.', 'A series of murders eliminates the poverty-stricken heirs to a 10 million-dollar fortune while Didi Dodel, the unsuspecting main heir, blithely escapes the attempts on his life. After a wealthy miser dies and leaves his fortune to Didi and five others, the five each hit upon the idea of eliminating Didi from the list (Didi does not know he has been named), but they do not realize how fate can step in and alter the best and worst of intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mxfpVif2GHjgEhqyp0FTKIpGDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11181'),
  ('338363571006097371', 'Noor', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'Sunhil Sippy, Keiko Nakahara', null, 'Sonakshi Sinha, Gareth Lawrence, Kanan Gill, Shibani Dandekar, Purab Kohli, Sunny Leone, Diljit Dosanjh, Chloé Booyens', null, 'The jumbled up, crazy and happening life of journalist Noor takes a dramatic turn when she comes across a news breaking cover story', 'The jumbled up, crazy and happening life of journalist Noor takes a dramatic turn when she comes across a news breaking cover story', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guyCaip5KScqgtMQsDH9Ac3spmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411625'),
  ('457833981349428225', 'Noose', 1948, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edmond T. Gréville, Terry Hunter, Cliff Owen', 'Richard Llewellyn', 'Carole Landis, Derek Farr, Joseph Calleia, Stanley Holloway, Nigel Patrick, John Slater, Edward Rigby, Reginald Tate', null, 'Set in post Second World War Britain, Noose is the story of black market racketeers who face attempts to bring them to justice by an American fashion journalist, her ex-army fiancée and a gang of honest toughs from a local gym. When a corpse turns up at black market front The Blue Moon Club, Yank reporter Carole Landis starts snooping, much to gang boss Joseph Calleia’s annoyance. And soon there’s a hit man on the way...', 'Set in post Second World War Britain, Noose is the story of black market racketeers who face attempts to bring them to justice by an American fashion journalist, her ex-army fiancée and a gang of honest toughs from a local gym. When a corpse turns up at black market front The Blue Moon Club, Yank reporter Carole Landis starts snooping, much to gang boss Joseph Calleia’s annoyance. And soon there’s a hit man on the way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYTFDSlAuQzdw6jgEnybl5Zmgzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80090'),
  ('1041882638239859613', 'Nope', 2022, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Thomas Patrick Smith, Wayne Witherspoon, Liz Tan', 'Jordan Peele', 'Daniel Kaluuya, Keke Palmer, Brandon Perea, Michael Wincott, Steven Yeun, Wrenn Schmidt, Keith David, Devon Graye', 'R', 'Residents in a lonely gulch of inland California bear witness to an uncanny, chilling discovery.', 'Residents in a lonely gulch of inland California bear witness to an uncanny, chilling discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcKVlWaNVVVFQwro3nLXqPljcYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762504'),
  ('1050473757553801965', 'Nora Prentiss', 1947, 'Drama', 'James Wong Howe, Vincent Sherman, James McMahon', 'N. Richard Nash', 'Ann Sheridan, Kent Smith, Bruce Bennett, Robert Alda, Rosemary DeCamp, John Ridgely, Robert Arthur, Wanda Hendrix', 'NR', 'Quiet, organised Dr Talbot meets nightclub singer Nora Prentiss when she is slightly hurt in a street accident. Despite her misgivings they become heavily involved and Talbot finds he is faced with the choice of leaving Nora or divorcing his wife. When a patient expires in his office, a third option seems to present itself.', 'Quiet, organised Dr Talbot meets nightclub singer Nora Prentiss when she is slightly hurt in a street accident. Despite her misgivings they become heavily involved and Talbot finds he is faced with the choice of leaving Nora or divorcing his wife. When a patient expires in his office, a third option seems to present itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivIS8hNCg5B9SNAjHh0CDx7JHUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26592'),
  ('272587415628742016', 'Nora Roberts'' Angels Fall', 2007, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ralph Hemecker, Joel Ransom', null, 'Heather Locklear, Johnathon Schaech, Gary Hudson, Derek Hamilton, Linda Darlow, Lisa Marie Caruk, Len Crowther, Pete Seadon', null, 'A woman starts a new life in a small Wyoming mountain town after suffering a traumatic event on the other side of the country - but one day, she witnesses a murder in the woods...', 'A woman starts a new life in a small Wyoming mountain town after suffering a traumatic event on the other side of the country - but one day, she witnesses a murder in the woods...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIaAXZmxxqG369VOf3uGNlb2bjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30335'),
  ('27660367099258561', 'Nora Roberts'' Carolina Moon', 2007, 'TV Movie, Crime', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Claire Forlani, Oliver Hudson, Jacqueline Bisset, Jonathan Scarfe, Chad Willett, Josie Davis, Shaun Johnston, Greg Lawson', null, 'A woman who has psychic visions returns to her hometown to exorcise her demons. Once there she finds both danger and love.', 'A woman who has psychic visions returns to her hometown to exorcise her demons. Once there she finds both danger and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81ZkfbaFlihJyObWOdYVJFaxNET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24810'),
  ('8789609310654186', 'Nora Roberts'' Midnight Bayou', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ralph Hemecker, Anghel Decca', null, 'Jerry O''Connell, Lauren Stamile, Isabella Hofmann, Alan Ritchson, Faye Dunaway, Ashley LeConte Campbell, Bianca Malinowski, Ciera Payton', null, 'The new owner of a supposedly haunted New Orleans plantation manor uncovers a shocking secret that has been hidden for over 100 years.', 'The new owner of a supposedly haunted New Orleans plantation manor uncovers a shocking secret that has been hidden for over 100 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbFoRAGuxMk1cYGGz7iBfrDhGXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33314'),
  ('187786490539549518', 'Nora Roberts'' Montana Sky', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mike Robe, Eric Van Haren Noman', null, 'Charlotte Ross, Diane Ladd, Ashley Williams, Laura Mennell, Nathaniel Arcand, Aaron Pearl, Tom Carey, John Corbett', null, 'The wealthy stock dealer bequeaths his Montana farm to the three daughters provided they would live there together at least for a year.', 'The wealthy stock dealer bequeaths his Montana farm to the three daughters provided they would live there together at least for a year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qivNMkGRJQatBQ86DonJWBnS0Gc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18033'),
  ('519386513304785236', 'Nora Roberts'' Tribute', 2009, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Martha Coolidge', 'Gary Tieche', 'Brittany Murphy, Jason Lewis, Christian Oliver, Diana Scarwid, Tippi Hedren, Tiffany Morgan, Griff Furst, Wallace Merck', 'PG', 'A former child star buys her grandmother''s house to rescue it from ruin but her hope for serenity is soon eclipsed by haunting dreams of her famous grandmother, who died of a supposed overdose in the house more than 30 years ago.', 'A former child star buys her grandmother''s house to rescue it from ruin but her hope for serenity is soon eclipsed by haunting dreams of her famous grandmother, who died of a supposed overdose in the house more than 30 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5od91BiXm2AyS1EzSnRfiNSQYl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43303'),
  ('697974000538561690', 'Nora''s Will', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mariana Chenillo, Alberto Anaya', 'Mariana Chenillo', 'Fernando Luján, Enrique Arreola, Ari Brickman, Juan Carlos Colombo, Enrique Cueva, Marina de Tavira, Max Kerlow, Verónica Langer', null, 'Jose learns that Nora, the woman he was married to for 30 years and from whom divorced, has committed suicide. The rabbi explains Joseph that due to the celebrations this time of the year, if Nora is not buried that same day, they should wait at least 5 days for the funeral. Nora had planned before his death, a Machiavellian plan in order that Joseph was the one who has to take care of his funeral. But Nora forgot a small detail, a mysterious photograph stored under her bed, that will remind Joseph that the greatest love stories, sometimes are hidden in the smallest places.', 'Jose learns that Nora, the woman he was married to for 30 years and from whom divorced, has committed suicide. The rabbi explains Joseph that due to the celebrations this time of the year, if Nora is not buried that same day, they should wait at least 5 days for the funeral. Nora had planned before his death, a Machiavellian plan in order that Joseph was the one who has to take care of his funeral. But Nora forgot a small detail, a mysterious photograph stored under her bed, that will remind Joseph that the greatest love stories, sometimes are hidden in the smallest places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDviOAe987MuWeb4QIGGOqVtF2q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72172'),
  ('439243646330860232', 'Norbert', 2025, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'José Corral Llorente', 'José Corral Llorente', 'Fernando Cabrera, Olga Velasco, Eduardo Gutiérrez, Javier Sáez, Isabel Donate, Sandra Jara, David García, Pedro Tena Ramos', null, 'Norbert an incompetent spy from a sad, bureaucratic and grey nation will become a key player to thwart the plans of his own government, in an exciting quest that will see him travel alongside strange companions.', 'Norbert an incompetent spy from a sad, bureaucratic and grey nation will become a key player to thwart the plans of his own government, in an exciting quest that will see him travel alongside strange companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaIpaxEeHLydtlag1SdiXDmQLkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1323853'),
  ('335080202816932902', 'Norbert(a)', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Sonia Escolano, Belén López Albert, David Valldepérez', 'Sonia Escolano', 'Luis Bermejo, Adriana Ozores, Mariona Terés, María Romanillos, Adelfa Calvo, Carmen Balagué, María Lanau, Ramón Aguirre', null, 'Norberto has spent a lifetime with María. They are humble, from the neighborhood, and from time to time robbers. But Norberto needs to take a turn to feel alive, free, and to be herself. An unexpected confession will jeopardize his entire life.', 'Norberto has spent a lifetime with María. They are humble, from the neighborhood, and from time to time robbers. But Norberto needs to take a turn to feel alive, free, and to be herself. An unexpected confession will jeopardize his entire life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6jynvaweawrhqg4RwxpkbYJVQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143295'),
  ('634631454383524229', 'Norbit', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Brian Robbins, Clark Mathis, Andy Gill', 'Jay Scherick, Eddie Murphy, David Ronn', 'Eddie Murphy, Thandiwe Newton, Terry Crews, Clifton Powell, Lester Speight, Cuba Gooding Jr., Eddie Griffin, Katt Williams', 'PG-13', 'A mild-mannered guy who is engaged to a monstrous woman meets the woman of his dreams, and schemes to find a way to be with her.', 'A mild-mannered guy who is engaged to a monstrous woman meets the woman of his dreams, and schemes to find a way to be with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XcZ5NzygPp54csxCnzvQKuxFL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9757'),
  ('1024774300282972182', 'Norbourg', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Maxime Giroux, Sara Mishara', 'Simon Lavoie', 'Vincent-Guillaume Otis, François Arnaud, Christine Beaulieu, Alexandre Goyette, Richard Fréchette, Paul Doucet, Jean-François Beaupré, Guy Thauvette', null, 'The story of Vincent Lacroix, a businessman convicted of defrauding thousands of investors and embezzling over $130 million in mid-2000s Quebec, Canada. Inspector and auditor Éric Asselin is mandated to monitor the activities of the Norbourg firm. Literally fascinated by the audacity of Vincent Lacroix, the investigator leaves his post and becomes his right hand man. Norbourg then thwarts the investigations and checks by embezzling hundreds of millions of dollars. But the party can''t last forever when the company is surrounded from all sides.', 'The story of Vincent Lacroix, a businessman convicted of defrauding thousands of investors and embezzling over $130 million in mid-2000s Quebec, Canada. Inspector and auditor Éric Asselin is mandated to monitor the activities of the Norbourg firm. Literally fascinated by the audacity of Vincent Lacroix, the investigator leaves his post and becomes his right hand man. Norbourg then thwarts the investigations and checks by embezzling hundreds of millions of dollars. But the party can''t last forever when the company is surrounded from all sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpIlm4mxcbJfIE8AtaNkQ3nzii9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887864'),
  ('791920034697134210', 'Noriko''s Dinner Table', 2005, 'Drama, Horror', 'Sion Sono, Sohei Tanikawa, Shukei Amano', 'Sion Sono', 'Kazue Fukiishi, Tsugumi, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Ken Mitsuishi, Shirô Namiki, Sanae Miyata, Yoko Mitsuya, Tamae Ando', null, 'A teenager named Noriko Shimabara runs away from her family in Toyokawa, to meet Kumiko, the leader of an Internet BBS, Haikyo.com. She becomes involved with Kumiko''s family circle, which grows darker after the mass suicide of 54 high school girls.', 'A teenager named Noriko Shimabara runs away from her family in Toyokawa, to meet Kumiko, the leader of an Internet BBS, Haikyo.com. She becomes involved with Kumiko''s family circle, which grows darker after the mass suicide of 54 high school girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1bhnvxfxVkLAsg7vPg6LfV7TdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42041'),
  ('985723350395236743', 'Norm Macdonald: Hitler''s Dog, Gossip & Trickery', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Liz Plonka, Jay Lafayette', 'Norm Macdonald', 'Norm Macdonald', null, 'In this new stand-up special, Norm Macdonald delivers sly, deadpan observations from an older -- and perhaps even wiser -- point of view.', 'In this new stand-up special, Norm Macdonald delivers sly, deadpan observations from an older -- and perhaps even wiser -- point of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRmKJiLQ6oGCpJyDqtxv8LSgCW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456193'),
  ('428848787953735323', 'Norm Macdonald: Nothing Special', 2022, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Norm Macdonald, Jordan Levy, Dylan Sanford', 'Norm Macdonald', 'Norm Macdonald, Dave Chappelle, David Letterman, Conan O''Brien, Adam Sandler, Molly Shannon, David Spade', 'R', 'In his final comedy special, Norm Macdonald ponders casinos, cannibalism, living wills and why you have to be ready for whatever life throws your way.', 'In his final comedy special, Norm Macdonald ponders casinos, cannibalism, living wills and why you have to be ready for whatever life throws your way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwQJSMxMn4aIlgNzHIp8HRKIKcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975088'),
  ('869147811239493118', 'Norm of the North', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Trevor Wall', 'Malcolm T. Goldman, Daniel Altiere, Steven Altiere', 'Rob Schneider, Heather Graham, Maya Kay, Ken Jeong, Bill Nighy, Colm Meaney, Charlie Adler, Gabriel Iglesias', 'PG', 'Polar bear Norm and his three Arctic lemming buddies are forced out into the world once their icy home begins melting and breaking apart. Landing in New York, Norm begins life anew as a performing corporate mascot, only to discover that his new employers are directly responsible for the destruction of his polar home.', 'Polar bear Norm and his three Arctic lemming buddies are forced out into the world once their icy home begins melting and breaking apart. Landing in New York, Norm begins life anew as a performing corporate mascot, only to discover that his new employers are directly responsible for the destruction of his polar home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouaoVSV7aOSWTNnQ9iDA1jw0pgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276905'),
  ('413845867054067359', 'Norma Jean & Marilyn', 1996, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Tim Fywell, John Thomas', 'Jill Isaacs', 'Ashley Judd, Mira Sorvino, Josh Charles, Ron Rifkin, David Dukes, Peter Dobson, Taylor Nichols, John Rubinstein', 'R', 'This film follows Norma Jean from her simple, ambitious youth to her sex star pinnacle and back down. She moves from lover to lover in order to further her career. She finds fame but never happiness, only knowing seduction but not love.', 'This film follows Norma Jean from her simple, ambitious youth to her sex star pinnacle and back down. She moves from lover to lover in order to further her career. She finds fame but never happiness, only knowing seduction but not love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQ1ZrGxA0N6cgeTTl1vZhrdp30C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41127'),
  ('506086381114576630', 'Norma Rae', 1979, 'Drama', 'Martin Ritt, James Nicholson, Skip Surguine', 'Irving Ravetch, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'Sally Field, Beau Bridges, Ron Leibman, Pat Hingle, Barbara Baxley, Gail Strickland, Morgan Paull, Robert Broyles', 'PG', 'Norma Rae is a southern textile worker employed in a factory with intolerable working conditions. This concern about the situation gives her the gumption to be the key associate to a visiting labor union organizer. Together, they undertake the difficult, and possibly dangerous, struggle to unionize her factory.', 'Norma Rae is a southern textile worker employed in a factory with intolerable working conditions. This concern about the situation gives her the gumption to be the key associate to a visiting labor union organizer. Together, they undertake the difficult, and possibly dangerous, struggle to unionize her factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6au7WBVYoKhV1jORyFSIRszb46S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40842'),
