  ('423227988631047540', 'Normal', 2003, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jane Anderson, Alar Kivilo', null, 'Tom Wilkinson, Jessica Lange, Hayden Panettiere, Clancy Brown, Richard Bull, Joseph Sikora, Mary Seibel, Danny Goldring', null, 'A Midwestern husband and father announces his plan to have a sex change operation.', 'A Midwestern husband and father announces his plan to have a sex change operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIVHUZYRGW7HHirQUTen4anfYZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67809'),
  ('835776552242852419', 'Normal', 2007, 'Drama', 'Carl Bessai, Allie Amy Goodfellow, Carl Bessai', 'Travis McDonald', 'Carrie-Anne Moss, Kevin Zegers, Callum Keith Rennie, Andrew Airlie, Tygh Runyan, Camille Sullivan, Lauren Lee Smith, Michael Riley', null, 'A deadly car accident brings together a group of previously unrelated people, each of whom is forced to deal with the emotional fallout.', 'A deadly car accident brings together a group of previously unrelated people, each of whom is forced to deal with the emotional fallout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i833frx7UyaJCW8y0RK5wj4xBzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38051'),
  ('230083920285062514', 'Normal', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yann Chemin, Léo Bourdon, Olivier Babinet', 'Olivier Babinet, Juliette Sales, Fabien Suarez', 'Justine Lacroix, Benoît Poelvoorde, Steve Tientcheu, Pablo Pauly, Sofian Khammes, Joseph Rozé, Geoffrey Carey, Mayline Dubois', null, '14-year-old Lucie is a resourceful teenager who takes care of her loving yet unreliable father, William, who has multiple sclerosis. Whilst William hangs out in his wardrobe and devises pranks and jokes to make his daughter smile, Lucie tries her best at school while juggling a job in a sandwich shop and all the chores at home. Her vividly imaginative mind and the novel she is writing are her only distractions. But when a social worker is appointed to visit them, Lucie and William elaborate a complex plan to make social services believe they live a perfectly normal life.', '14-year-old Lucie is a resourceful teenager who takes care of her loving yet unreliable father, William, who has multiple sclerosis. Whilst William hangs out in his wardrobe and devises pranks and jokes to make his daughter smile, Lucie tries her best at school while juggling a job in a sandwich shop and all the chores at home. Her vividly imaginative mind and the novel she is writing are her only distractions. But when a social worker is appointed to visit them, Lucie and William elaborate a complex plan to make social services believe they live a perfectly normal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNmqLUaQ7tdRdhzDy5oXi2KXj5I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964917'),
  ('923546573001890917', 'Normal', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Ben Wheatley, Armando Salas, Jonnie Katz', 'Derek Kolstad', 'Bob Odenkirk, Henry Winkler, Lena Headey, Ryan Allen, Billy MacLellan, Brendan Fletcher, Peter Shinkoda, Jess McLeod', 'R', 'Interim sheriff Ulysses, called to the snowbound town of Normal, MN, uncovers an international criminal conspiracy at the heart of the seemingly quaint whistle-stop when he comes to the aid of a bank-robbing couple caught up in a deadly mess.', 'Interim sheriff Ulysses, called to the snowbound town of Normal, MN, uncovers an international criminal conspiracy at the heart of the seemingly quaint whistle-stop when he comes to the aid of a bank-robbing couple caught up in a deadly mess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHP7nurzOYGHNcNK1O4naVzsGCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242332'),
  ('568020516008254091', 'Normal Adolescent Behavior', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Beth Schacter, Harlan Bosmajian', 'Beth Schacter', 'Amber Tamblyn, Ashton Holmes, Kelli Garner, Daryl Sabara, Laila Liliana Garro, Kelly Lynch, Raviv Ullman, Stephen Colletti', 'R', 'High school student Wendy has an odd relationship with her five friends: They''re openly sexual with each other, swapping partners every week. But this is all thrown into turmoil when she meets Sean, a new student in school who has a crush on her. Wendy wants to be with Sean, but doesn''t want to disappoint her friends, whom she has known since grade school. When she does decide to leave them, her best friend, Billie, threatens revenge.', 'High school student Wendy has an odd relationship with her five friends: They''re openly sexual with each other, swapping partners every week. But this is all thrown into turmoil when she meets Sean, a new student in school who has a crush on her. Wendy wants to be with Sean, but doesn''t want to disappoint her friends, whom she has known since grade school. When she does decide to leave them, her best friend, Billie, threatens revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XtjR1MM0jgjJSr1TI4hyvbl9sz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20478'),
  ('868412525353172845', 'Normal Life', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'John McNaughton, Jean de Segonzac', 'Peg Haller, Bob Schneider', 'Ashley Judd, Luke Perry, Bruce A. Young, Jim True-Frost, Edmund Wyson, Michael Skewes, Scott Cummins, Kevin Mukherji', 'R', 'Chris Anderson and his wife Pam live a fairly normal life until Chris loses his job on the police force and secretly turns to robbing banks to make his wife''s dreams come true. Upon discovering his secret, she joins his deadly crime wave and together they terrorize an unsuspecting suburban town.', 'Chris Anderson and his wife Pam live a fairly normal life until Chris loses his job on the police force and secretly turns to robbing banks to make his wife''s dreams come true. Upon discovering his secret, she joins his deadly crime wave and together they terrorize an unsuspecting suburban town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keQ3yXWkPN1tmKt45bFBtGVokSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23223'),
  ('261146187004662193', 'Normal Love', 1965, null, 'Jack Smith', null, 'Mario Montez, Tiny Tim, Diana Baccus, Beverly Grant, David Sachs, Tony Conrad, Angus MacLise, Naomi Levine', null, 'A follow-up to now legendary film Flaming Creatures. This vivid, full-color homage to B-movies is a dizzying display of camp that clearly affirms Smith’s role as the driving force behind underground cinema and performance art of the post-war era. The director was known to constantly re-edit the film, often during screenings as it was still unspooling from the projector.', 'A follow-up to now legendary film Flaming Creatures. This vivid, full-color homage to B-movies is a dizzying display of camp that clearly affirms Smith’s role as the driving force behind underground cinema and performance art of the post-war era. The director was known to constantly re-edit the film, often during screenings as it was still unspooling from the projector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNWsaxmaPFWzOIi6FCHn6rNdXZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126372'),
  ('629501503956037032', 'Normal People Are Nothing Exceptional', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Laurence Ferreira Barbosa, Antoine Héberlé, Aude Cathelin', 'Cédric Kahn', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Melvil Poupaud, Marc Citti, Claire Laroche, Frédéric Diefenthal, Serge Hazanavicius, Marianne Groves, Sandrine Kiberlain', null, 'Martine is 25. Since breaking up with François, she has the feeling that the world is caving in on her. Between small jobs and one-night stands, she can''t seem to get a fix on herself. In desperation, after a last quarrel with François, she unintentionally causes an accident that leads her to the emergency ward of a psychiatric hospital. During her brief stay, she unexpectedly sparks into life. She takes an interest in two young patients, Pierre and Anne, convinced that she is doing the right thing in supervising their love life...', 'Martine is 25. Since breaking up with François, she has the feeling that the world is caving in on her. Between small jobs and one-night stands, she can''t seem to get a fix on herself. In desperation, after a last quarrel with François, she unintentionally causes an accident that leads her to the emergency ward of a psychiatric hospital. During her brief stay, she unexpectedly sparks into life. She takes an interest in two young patients, Pierre and Anne, convinced that she is doing the right thing in supervising their love life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXnhW8Kk6bCAsPV9jBl6pPTs4X8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65849'),
  ('889287215329391233', 'Norman', 2010, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Segal, Darren Genet', 'Talton Wingate', 'Dan Byrd, Emily VanCamp, Richard Jenkins, Adam Goldberg, Billy Lush, Sewell Whitney, John Aylward, Camille Mana', 'R', 'A teenager pretends to be dying from cancer as a way to cope with the realities of his daily existence and his father''s terminal illness.', 'A teenager pretends to be dying from cancer as a way to cope with the realities of his daily existence and his father''s terminal illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uN5YbewCGghe6htT6cjyrtuORm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50590'),
  ('116541506016056359', 'Norman, le spectacle de la maturité', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Norman Thavaud, Kader Aoun', null, 'Norman Thavaud', null, 'Norman, one of France''s longest-running YouTube stars, returns to the stage for his second French stand-up tour, after testing his jokes out for months and "maturing".', 'Norman, one of France''s longest-running YouTube stars, returns to the stage for his second French stand-up tour, after testing his jokes out for months and "maturing".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxGeygk95GOgNF7JKZ2DWkfcHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:771594'),
