  ('1091024595289264086', 'Normandy - Neman', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Jacques Natteau, Jean Dréville, Damir Vyatich-Berezhnykh', 'Elsa Triolet, Charles Spaak, Konstantin Simonov', 'Pierre Trabaud, Giani Esposito, Gérard Buhr, Vladimir Gusev, Nikolai Rybnikov, Gennadiy Yukhtin, Yuri Medvedev, Georges Rivière', null, 'A certain number of French fighter pilots who will not accept the Second Armistice at Compiègne nor Vichy''s orders decide to join the USSR. Once they have reached Moscow they resume training and form a squadron they call "Normandie". Reinforced in 1944, the squadron wins many victories. Following the acts of valor displayed by its pilots during the Battle of the Nieman River, it becomes the "Normandie-Niemen" squadron for the rest of times...', 'A certain number of French fighter pilots who will not accept the Second Armistice at Compiègne nor Vichy''s orders decide to join the USSR. Once they have reached Moscow they resume training and form a squadron they call "Normandie". Reinforced in 1944, the squadron wins many victories. Following the acts of valor displayed by its pilots during the Battle of the Nieman River, it becomes the "Normandie-Niemen" squadron for the rest of times...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMlXEZyC6zJdVji7eqCDX2WCB2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278284'),
  ('1027835775054171358', 'Normandy Nude', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Claude Larrieu, Philippe Le Guay', 'Olivier Dazat, Philippe Le Guay', 'François Cluzet, Toby Jones, François-Xavier Demaison, Arthur Dupont, Grégory Gadebois, Vincent Regan, Colin Bates, Philippe Rebbot', null, 'At the Mêle sur Sarthe, a small Norman village, farmers are affected by a crisis. Georges Balbuzard, the mayor of the city, is not one to let them down and decides to try everything to save his village...', 'At the Mêle sur Sarthe, a small Norman village, farmers are affected by a crisis. Georges Balbuzard, the mayor of the city, is not one to let them down and decides to try everything to save his village...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18PbqXl0PKTTptyuKd7PQciXdry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492550'),
  ('763237211770279748', 'Noroi: The Curse', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Isamu Nagaseki, Koji Shiraishi, Shozo Morishita', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Jin Muraki, Marika Matsumoto, Satoru Jitsunashi, Rio Kanno, Tomono Kuga, Shûta Kambayashi, Takashi Kakizawa, Yoshiki Tano', 'NR', 'A documentary filmmaker explores seemingly unrelated paranormal incidents connected by the legend of an ancient demon.', 'A documentary filmmaker explores seemingly unrelated paranormal incidents connected by the legend of an ancient demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vA7uZSMx8VL6LIuNFPnymwkRPBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21506'),
  ('48626656400994266', 'Noroît', 1976, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jacques Rivette, William Lubtchansky', 'Eduardo de Gregorio, Marilù Parolini, Jacques Rivette', 'Bernadette Lafont, Geraldine Chaplin, Kika Markham, Babette Lamy, Élisabeth Lafont, Danièle Rosencranz, Carole Laurenty, Anne-Marie Fijal', null, 'After her brother was killed by a notorious all-female pirate gang, Morag dedicates her life to bringing the murderers to justice. Soon, she has become an important member of the pirate gang and has begun acquiring the loyalty of key members. Eventually, she makes her move and challenges the leader, a demi-god, known as "The Daughter of the Sun."', 'After her brother was killed by a notorious all-female pirate gang, Morag dedicates her life to bringing the murderers to justice. Soon, she has become an important member of the pirate gang and has begun acquiring the loyalty of key members. Eventually, she makes her move and challenges the leader, a demi-god, known as "The Daughter of the Sun."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7woe4dKZg6L7lXMGK5YAZVMY7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66556'),
  ('731140903664796132', 'Norske byggeklosser', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Pål Bang-Hansen', null, 'Rolv Wesenlund, Bjørn Sand, Thea Stabell, Arve Opsahl, Bent Bang-Hansen, Ingeborg Cook, Dag Frøland, Gunnar Haugan', null, 'A young couple decides to build their dream house, but run into numerous complications in the process. Everything from useless carpenters to building control gets in their way. Norwegian comedian Rolv Wesenlund plays 7 different roles in this movie.', 'A young couple decides to build their dream house, but run into numerous complications in the process. Everything from useless carpenters to building control gets in their way. Norwegian comedian Rolv Wesenlund plays 7 different roles in this movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fhyrUePfGEeqJGVKdmwebtcdPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24642'),
  ('133579111131670873', 'Norte, the End of History', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lav Diaz, Larry Manda, Hazel Orencio', 'Rody Vera, Lav Diaz', 'Sid Lucero, Angeli Bayani, Archie Alemania, Soliman Cruz, Hazel Orencio, Mae Paner, Perry Dizon, Moira Lang', null, 'An embittered law student commits a brutal double murder; a family man takes the fall and is forced to take a harsh sentence; and a mother and her two children wander the countryside in search of some kind of redemption.', 'An embittered law student commits a brutal double murder; a family man takes the fall and is forced to take a harsh sentence; and a mother and her two children wander the countryside in search of some kind of redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23FlJD2ykd4M7RTQ7A9HNayYOQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186975'),
  ('362965744507329939', 'North', 1994, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Adam Greenberg, Rob Reiner', 'Alan Zweibel, Andrew Scheinman', 'Elijah Wood, Bruce Willis, Jason Alexander, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Jon Lovitz, Alan Arkin, Dan Aykroyd, Kathy Bates', 'PG', 'Eleven-year-old North has had it with his parents. They are always busy with their careers and don''t give North the attention he needs, so he files a lawsuit against them. The judge rules that North should either find new parents or return to his own parents within two months. Thus North starts off on a journey around the world to find parents that really care about him.', 'Eleven-year-old North has had it with his parents. They are always busy with their careers and don''t give North the attention he needs, so he files a lawsuit against them. The judge rules that North should either find new parents or return to his own parents within two months. Thus North starts off on a journey around the world to find parents that really care about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4JEG7dstmurXMUPOW9Jy6UDR9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31586'),
  ('972310081608346225', 'North', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rune Denstad Langlo, Philip Øgaard', 'Erlend Loe', 'Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Kyrre Hellum, Marte Aunemo, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Lars Olsen, Astrid Solhaug, Even Vesterhus, Ragnhild Vannebo', null, 'Following a nervous breakdown, ski athlete Jomar has isolated himself in a lonely existence as the guard of a ski park. When he learns that he might be the father of a child way up north, he sets on a strange and poetic journey through Norway on a snowmobile, with 5 liters of alcohol as sole provisions. On this trip through amazing arctic landscapes, Jomar seems to do everything in his power to avoid reaching his destination. He meets other tender and confused souls, who will all contribute to push Jomar further along his reluctant journey towards the brighter side of life.', 'Following a nervous breakdown, ski athlete Jomar has isolated himself in a lonely existence as the guard of a ski park. When he learns that he might be the father of a child way up north, he sets on a strange and poetic journey through Norway on a snowmobile, with 5 liters of alcohol as sole provisions. On this trip through amazing arctic landscapes, Jomar seems to do everything in his power to avoid reaching his destination. He meets other tender and confused souls, who will all contribute to push Jomar further along his reluctant journey towards the brighter side of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwGHjCALrH2PACg5WQzyItnZDFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26584'),
  ('1031844647454982916', 'North Country', 2005, 'Drama', 'Niki Caro, Chris Menges, Mali Finn', 'Michael Seitzman', 'Charlize Theron, Frances McDormand, Woody Harrelson, Sean Bean, Jeremy Renner, Richard Jenkins, Sissy Spacek, Thomas Curtis', 'R', 'A fictionalized account of the first major successful sexual harassment case in the United States — Jenson vs. Eveleth Mines, where a woman who endured a range of abuse while working as a miner filed and won the landmark 1984 lawsuit.', 'A fictionalized account of the first major successful sexual harassment case in the United States — Jenson vs. Eveleth Mines, where a woman who endured a range of abuse while working as a miner filed and won the landmark 1984 lawsuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upxUN4zmX79o49mBW9htKZDeNq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9701'),
  ('673736444975748646', 'North Dallas Forty', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ted Kotcheff, Paul Lohmann', 'Ted Kotcheff, Frank Yablans, Peter Gent', 'Nick Nolte, Mac Davis, Charles Durning, Dayle Haddon, Bo Svenson, John Matuszak, Steve Forrest, G.D. Spradlin', 'R', 'A semi-fictional account of life as a professional football player. Loosely based on the Dallas Cowboys team of the early 1970s.', 'A semi-fictional account of life as a professional football player. Loosely based on the Dallas Cowboys team of the early 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e9IeZPFmApZZ37ixq9QhYZXURq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29786'),
  ('691630210791788378', 'North Face', 2008, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, History, Thriller', 'Philipp Stölzl, Kolja Brandt', 'Johannes Naber, Chris Silber, Rupert Henning', 'Benno Fürmann, Florian Lukas, Johanna Wokalek, Georg Friedrich, Simon Schwarz, Ulrich Tukur, Erwin Steinhauer, Branko Samarovski', 'NR', 'North Face tells the story of two German climbers Toni Kurz and Andreas Hinterstoisser and their attempt to scale the deadly North Face of the Eiger.', 'North Face tells the story of two German climbers Toni Kurz and Andreas Hinterstoisser and their attempt to scale the deadly North Face of the Eiger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onTd66RoxdrLKUhtcS1IOwdvjCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16436'),
  ('1034512195587413667', 'North Hollywood', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicolo Carlson, Mikey Alfred, Ayinde Anderson', 'Mikey Alfred', 'Ryder McLaughlin, Miranda Cosgrove, Vince Vaughn, Angus Cloud, Nico Hiraga, Aramis Hudson, Bobby Worrest, Tyshawn Jones', 'NR', 'A kid must decide between choosing the future his father wants and following his dream of becoming a pro skater.', 'A kid must decide between choosing the future his father wants and following his dream of becoming a pro skater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLVxpEkiSs8OnOqg8QmLT7Bs09e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681355'),
  ('307275093109686949', 'North Korean Partisan in South Korea', 1990, 'War, History, Drama', 'Chung Ji-young, You Yong-kil, Kim Dong-ho', 'Jang Sun-woo', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Choi Jin-sil, Choi Min-soo, Lee Hye-young, Kang Tae-ki, Twist Kim, Cho Hyoung-ki, Dokgo Young-jae', null, 'Reporter for a North Korean news service joins the partisans when the Americans and UN forces invade South Korea.', 'Reporter for a North Korean news service joins the partisans when the Americans and UN forces invade South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsKtvnxGUNBqFXokBHMoXpiSz8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79894'),
  ('745487893344372131', 'North Sea Hijack', 1980, 'Action', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Tony Imi, Michael Stevenson', 'Jack Davies', 'Roger Moore, Anthony Perkins, James Mason, David Hedison, Michael Parks, Jack Watson, David Wood, Jeremy Clyde', 'PG', 'When terrorists take over two oil rigs, and threaten to blow them up if their demands are not met, an eccentric anti-terrorism expert volunteers his unique commando unit to stop them.', 'When terrorists take over two oil rigs, and threaten to blow them up if their demands are not met, an eccentric anti-terrorism expert volunteers his unique commando unit to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7YvYI95fGgadM1Vsz15UbscI9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390253'),
  ('71274379202342453', 'North Sea Is Death Sea', 1976, 'Drama', 'Hark Bohm, Wolfgang Treu', 'Hark Bohm', 'Uwe Bohm, Dschingis Bowakow, Marquard Bohm, Herma Koehn, Rolf Becker, Katja Bowakow, Günter Lohmann, Corinna Schmidt', null, '14-year-old Uwe lives in a suburban Hamburg housing estate. Besides trouble, the boy has not much to expect from his parents. To get his hands on some money, he prizes open vending machines, and to let out his frustration, he beats up "wogs". Among them is Dschingis, his nemesis. But one day, the rivals make peace. They become friends because they realize that they have the same problems and are driven by the same dreams and hopes.', '14-year-old Uwe lives in a suburban Hamburg housing estate. Besides trouble, the boy has not much to expect from his parents. To get his hands on some money, he prizes open vending machines, and to let out his frustration, he beats up "wogs". Among them is Dschingis, his nemesis. But one day, the rivals make peace. They become friends because they realize that they have the same problems and are driven by the same dreams and hopes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12jlG2C9SMEKwSCT5e3PYDYASbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36137'),
  ('408767658938256646', 'North Sea Texas', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bavo Defurne', 'Yves Verbraeken, Bavo Defurne', 'Jelle Florizoone, Mathias Vergels, Eva van der Gucht, Thomas Coumans, Ben Van den Heuvel, Nathan Naenen, Nina Marie Kortekaas, Noor Ben Taouet', 'NR', 'A teen boy living in a small town on the Belgian coast finds his ordinary life take an unexpected turn when a handsome traveler blows through town.', 'A teen boy living in a small town on the Belgian coast finds his ordinary life take an unexpected turn when a handsome traveler blows through town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLmcMgjW8sM9vVqXopZa97RICWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100898'),
  ('1127064836922321526', 'North Shore', 1987, 'Romance, Action, Drama', 'William Phelps', 'William Phelps, Randal Kleiser', 'Matt Adler, Gregory Harrison, Nia Peeples, John Philbin, Gerry Lopez, Laird Hamilton, Robbie Page', 'PG', 'On a small stretch of coastline as powerful as a man''s will, Rick Kane came to surf the big waves. He found a woman who would show him how to survive, and a challenge unlike any other.', 'On a small stretch of coastline as powerful as a man''s will, Rick Kane came to surf the big waves. He found a woman who would show him how to survive, and a challenge unlike any other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYXZHdoxWbbqNacbxCrDoVFbiBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22915'),
  ('346784348637757151', 'North Star', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Nils Gaup, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Sergio Donati, Lorenzo Donati, Paul Ohl', 'James Caan, Christopher Lambert, Catherine McCormack, Burt Young, Morten Faldaas, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Jacques François, Frank Salsedo', null, 'Set during the Alaskan gold rush of the late 1800s. In his efforts to gain control of a small mining town, Sean McLennon is buying up every claim that becomes available, usually after the deaths of the previous owners at the hands of McLennon''s ''assistants''. One of the miners targeted by McLennon, a half-Indian hunter named Hudson Saanteek, manages to escape his hired thugs and comes back into town looking to re-establish his claim and get revenge. McLennon and his men have the advantage of numbers and weapons, but Saanteek has his survival skills and knowledge of the Alaskan wilderness.', 'Set during the Alaskan gold rush of the late 1800s. In his efforts to gain control of a small mining town, Sean McLennon is buying up every claim that becomes available, usually after the deaths of the previous owners at the hands of McLennon''s ''assistants''. One of the miners targeted by McLennon, a half-Indian hunter named Hudson Saanteek, manages to escape his hired thugs and comes back into town looking to re-establish his claim and get revenge. McLennon and his men have the advantage of numbers and weapons, but Saanteek has his survival skills and knowledge of the Alaskan wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuai9NBKZX0RmGDwTuGvpyPV8mx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200383'),
  ('248048678894403596', 'North Station', 2002, 'Family, Drama', 'Jean-Claude Lord, Serge Desrosiers', 'Daniel Morin, Denyse Benoît', 'Benoît Brière, Catherine Florent, Xavier Morin-Lefort, Lansana Kourouma, Roxane Gaudette-Loiseau, Renée Claude, Jean-Claude Germain, Louis-Georges Girard', null, 'In 1950, in a small village called Northern Station, Samuel, a young mailman and his girlfriend, Évelyne, spend hours replying to letters that children have sent to Santa Claus. While delivering the letters on Christmas Eve, Samuel dies of cold in the forest. He finds himself in the magic land of Santa Claus, where he becomes an elf in charge of answering Santa’s mail. Fifty years later, Samuel opens a letter from Satia, a young girl from Northern Station who asks Santa Claus if he will save her grandmother, who is seriously ill. With the help of his friend, Howie, the young elf decides to go to the village for grant the child’s wish. However, it turns out that Satia’s grandmother is none other than Évelyne.', 'In 1950, in a small village called Northern Station, Samuel, a young mailman and his girlfriend, Évelyne, spend hours replying to letters that children have sent to Santa Claus. While delivering the letters on Christmas Eve, Samuel dies of cold in the forest. He finds himself in the magic land of Santa Claus, where he becomes an elf in charge of answering Santa’s mail. Fifty years later, Samuel opens a letter from Satia, a young girl from Northern Station who asks Santa Claus if he will save her grandmother, who is seriously ill. With the help of his friend, Howie, the young elf decides to go to the village for grant the child’s wish. However, it turns out that Satia’s grandmother is none other than Évelyne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SsN1lK1ZmlG9Zdo3yo3Z3gGWPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428419'),
  ('293437119850328843', 'North Terminal', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Lucrecia Martel, Mauricio Asial', 'Lucrecia Martel', 'Julieta Laso, Mariana Carrizo, Noelia Sinkunas, Lorena Carpanchay, Daniel "Bubu" Ríos, Yamila "B Yami" Barrionuevo, Macarena "Maka" Fuentes, Margarita "Mar" Pérez', null, 'During the 2020 lockdown, Lucrecia Martel returns to her home in Salta, Argentina’s most conservative region. Here she follows Julieta Laso who, like a muse, introduces her to a group of female artists and defiant people who exchange glances and opinions around a fire.', 'During the 2020 lockdown, Lucrecia Martel returns to her home in Salta, Argentina’s most conservative region. Here she follows Julieta Laso who, like a muse, introduces her to a group of female artists and defiant people who exchange glances and opinions around a fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAHQpxIyYMuZ13oazjRhxiF38AH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870487'),
  ('14625792347275154', 'North to Alaska', 1960, 'Western, Comedy, Romance', 'Henry Hathaway, Leon Shamroy', 'John Lee Mahin, Martin Rackin, Claude Binyon', 'John Wayne, Stewart Granger, Ernie Kovacs, Fabian, Capucine, Mickey Shaughnessy, Karl Swenson, Kathleen Freeman', 'NR', 'After striking gold in Alaska, the romantic George sends his womanizing partner Sam to bring his fiancée up from Seattle. When Sam finds that she has already married, he returns instead with Angel, a dancer originally from France.', 'After striking gold in Alaska, the romantic George sends his womanizing partner Sam to bring his fiancée up from Seattle. When Sam finds that she has already married, he returns instead with Angel, a dancer originally from France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HSf0NsKtEy2w5qIJqpP5BppZkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6523'),
  ('664422332460680333', 'North West Frontier', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama', 'J. Lee Thompson, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Robin Estridge, Frank S. Nugent', 'Kenneth More, Lauren Bacall, Herbert Lom, Wilfrid Hyde-White, I.S. Johar, Ursula Jeans, Eugene Deckers, Ian Hunter', 'NR', 'In the rebellious northern frontier province of colonial India, British Army Captain Scott, a young prince and the boy''s governess escape by an obsolete train as they are relentlessly pursued by Muslim rebels intent on assassinating the prince.', 'In the rebellious northern frontier province of colonial India, British Army Captain Scott, a young prince and the boy''s governess escape by an obsolete train as they are relentlessly pursued by Muslim rebels intent on assassinating the prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjjmsCtXVz2vI03se29DPNjf6ZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58902'),
  ('276792763022043775', 'North West Mounted Police', 1940, 'Action, Western, Adventure, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Arthur Rosson, W. Howard Greene', 'Alan Le May, Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Gary Cooper, Madeleine Carroll, Paulette Goddard, Preston Foster, Robert Preston, Akim Tamiroff, George Bancroft, Lynne Overman', 'NR', 'Texas Ranger Dusty Rivers ("Isn''t that a contradiction in terms?", another character asks him) travels to Canada in the 1880s in search of Jacques Corbeau, who is wanted for murder. He wanders into the midst of the Riel Rebellion, in which Métis (people of French and Native heritage) and Natives want a separate nation. Dusty falls for nurse April Logan, who is also loved by Mountie Jim Brett. April''s brother is involved with Courbeau''s daughter Louvette, which leads to trouble during the battles between the rebels and the Mounties. Through it all Dusty is determined to bring Corbeau back to Texas (and April, too, if he can manage it.)', 'Texas Ranger Dusty Rivers ("Isn''t that a contradiction in terms?", another character asks him) travels to Canada in the 1880s in search of Jacques Corbeau, who is wanted for murder. He wanders into the midst of the Riel Rebellion, in which Métis (people of French and Native heritage) and Natives want a separate nation. Dusty falls for nurse April Logan, who is also loved by Mountie Jim Brett. April''s brother is involved with Courbeau''s daughter Louvette, which leads to trouble during the battles between the rebels and the Mounties. Through it all Dusty is determined to bring Corbeau back to Texas (and April, too, if he can manage it.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qM5Ld0eL4sRHEt84nf8VV1QGGth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83360'),
  ('381972915941968272', 'Northanger Abbey', 2007, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jon Jones, Ciarán Tanham', 'Andrew Davies', 'Felicity Jones, Carey Mulligan, JJ Feild, Geraldine James, Sylvestra Le Touzel, Desmond Barrit, William Beck, Gerry O''Brien', 'NR', 'A young woman''s penchant for sensational Gothic novels leads to misunderstandings in the matters of the heart.', 'A young woman''s penchant for sensational Gothic novels leads to misunderstandings in the matters of the heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmJ0CVnrMMfTXXWwqvVH5a4CqNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18093'),
  ('650561201011644299', 'Northeast', 2005, 'Drama', 'Santiago Otheguy, Juan Diego Solanas, Félix "Chango" Monti', null, 'Carole Bouquet, Aymará Rovera, Mercedes Sampietro, Jorge Román, Ignacio Jiménez', null, 'An accidental meeting between a French woman who goes to South America to adopt a baby and an Argentinian woman who with her small son leaves their hopeless village in search for a better life changes both of their lives forever.', 'An accidental meeting between a French woman who goes to South America to adopt a baby and an Argentinian woman who with her small son leaves their hopeless village in search for a better life changes both of their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lK8W7ILxlifrGAvLPnP9JZTMnKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7276'),
  ('943998748780109621', 'Northern Comfort', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Hafsteinn Gunnar Sigurðsson, Niels Thastum, Martin Ware', 'Tobias Munthe, Hafsteinn Gunnar Sigurðsson, Halldór Laxness Halldórsson', 'Lydia Leonard, Timothy Spall, Ella Rumpf, Simon Manyonda, Emun Elliott, Sverrir Gudnason, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Rob Delaney', null, 'A special forces veteran, an uptight property developer, an influencer with half a million followers and an incompetent instructor are thrown together on a high-end fear of flying course. The course''s final challenge is an experience flight from London to Iceland, which ends up being a horrendous ordeal. Lost in Iceland, freezing and terrified, they must find a way of facing their fears and working together to spread their wings... and fly.', 'A special forces veteran, an uptight property developer, an influencer with half a million followers and an incompetent instructor are thrown together on a high-end fear of flying course. The course''s final challenge is an experience flight from London to Iceland, which ends up being a horrendous ordeal. Lost in Iceland, freezing and terrified, they must find a way of facing their fears and working together to spread their wings... and fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugGhGBjM77ctVB2VSmQP0RJOnMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986843'),
  ('433249618744933938', 'Northern Lights', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Linda Yellen, Joseph Yacoe', null, 'Diane Keaton, Maury Chaykin, Joseph Cross, Kathleen York, John Hoffman, Crystal Verge, John R. Taylor, Sheila Patterson', null, 'A stranger''s call informs Roberta that her estranged brother Frank has died in a small town under bizarre circumstances. Ben, his best friend from college, also gets the call. Arriving just in time for his funeral, it becomes quickly obvious to them that the little slice of small-town America in which they find themselves is like an episode of The Twilight Zone featuring Frank''s eccentric friends, his amazing secrets and his stunning final request. Both Ben and Roberta are shocked to discover that Frank not only had a child, but that he has left them responsible for his son''s care.', 'A stranger''s call informs Roberta that her estranged brother Frank has died in a small town under bizarre circumstances. Ben, his best friend from college, also gets the call. Arriving just in time for his funeral, it becomes quickly obvious to them that the little slice of small-town America in which they find themselves is like an episode of The Twilight Zone featuring Frank''s eccentric friends, his amazing secrets and his stunning final request. Both Ben and Roberta are shocked to discover that Frank not only had a child, but that he has left them responsible for his son''s care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihbttaRj7eN90e745Km4Gf6Vef8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257179'),
  ('391832836736892495', 'Northern Lights', 2009, 'TV Movie, Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Mike Robe, Craig Wrobleski', null, 'LeAnn Rimes, Eddie Cibrian, Rosanna Arquette, Jayne Eastwood, William MacDonald, Greg Lawson, Christianne Hirt, Adrian Hough', null, 'Hoping to leave behind troubled days in the Baltimore city police department, Nate Burns journeys to Alaska, where he takes up a quiet life as a small-town sheriff and begins a romance with spirited bush pilot Meg Galligan). But when Meg''s father turns up dead, Burns finds himself thrust into the limelight of a dangerous murder investigation.', 'Hoping to leave behind troubled days in the Baltimore city police department, Nate Burns journeys to Alaska, where he takes up a quiet life as a small-town sheriff and begins a romance with spirited bush pilot Meg Galligan). But when Meg''s father turns up dead, Burns finds himself thrust into the limelight of a dangerous murder investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ap8E0FvOMf8IVDkPOakEx41Grpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21657'),
  ('97064043095356552', 'Northern Lights of Christmas', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Wright, Rudolf Blahacek', 'B.E. Brauner, James Iver Mattson', 'Ashley Williams, Corey Sevier, Genelle Williams, Laura Miyata, Jefferson Brown, Art Hindle, Bill Lake, Alix Sideris', null, 'Zoey Hathaway has been working towards her lifelong goal of being a pilot for years, but everything is thrown off-course when she unexpectedly inherits a reindeer farm, along with the dangerously handsome ranch hand Alec Wynn. Now buried in taking care of reindeer and all the Christmas responsibilities, Zoey thinks life has delivered her a strange and cumbersome blow, and she isn’t sure about Alec, who has his own ideas how best to run things. Alec, who has never had many people have faith in him, opens up when Zoey invests trust in him, and the two find themselves falling for each other. Could they both find happiness in the most unlikely of circumstances right before Christmas?', 'Zoey Hathaway has been working towards her lifelong goal of being a pilot for years, but everything is thrown off-course when she unexpectedly inherits a reindeer farm, along with the dangerously handsome ranch hand Alec Wynn. Now buried in taking care of reindeer and all the Christmas responsibilities, Zoey thinks life has delivered her a strange and cumbersome blow, and she isn’t sure about Alec, who has his own ideas how best to run things. Alec, who has never had many people have faith in him, opens up when Zoey invests trust in him, and the two find themselves falling for each other. Could they both find happiness in the most unlikely of circumstances right before Christmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67QB6sqUxhV5lhuF6zIdYcNPYSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550079'),
  ('845027296982120071', 'Northern Limit Line', 2015, 'War, History', 'Yoon Jong-han, Kim Hak-soon, Kim Hyung-koo', 'Kim Hak-soon', 'Kim Moo-yul, Jin Goo, Lee Hyun-woo, Lee Chung-ah, Song Jae-ho, Kim Ji-hoon, Lee Wan, Kwon Hwa-woon', null, 'In this true story from 2002, South Korean patrol boats engaged in a deadly battle with North Korean patrol boats who crossed the maritime border known the Northern Limit Line and attacked.', 'In this true story from 2002, South Korean patrol boats engaged in a deadly battle with North Korean patrol boats who crossed the maritime border known the Northern Limit Line and attacked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hM4Ji2b7dhrR7F9I0pcjyVa0nAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343843'),
  ('1098766667771480260', 'Northern Pursuit', 1943, 'Adventure, War, Drama', 'James McMahon, Don Siegel, Leo F. Forbstein', 'William Faulkner', 'Errol Flynn, Julie Bishop, Helmut Dantine, Gene Lockhart, John Ridgely, Tom Tully, Alec Craig, Rose Higgins', 'NR', 'Canadian Mountie Steve Wagner captures a German Luftwaffe officer on a spy mission, who later escapes from the prison camp. To catch the spy ring, the Mounties employ a ruse so that the spies, believing Steve to be sympathetic, enlist him in their plans.', 'Canadian Mountie Steve Wagner captures a German Luftwaffe officer on a spy mission, who later escapes from the prison camp. To catch the spy ring, the Mounties employ a ruse so that the spies, believing Steve to be sympathetic, enlist him in their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tLScsS98Q9rohkX13guzsnTjIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55239'),
  ('1018683123345697928', 'Northern Skies Over Empty Space', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alejandra Márquez Abella, Claudia Becerril Bulos', 'Gabriel Nuncio, Alejandra Márquez Abella', 'Gerardo Trejoluna, Paloma Petra, Juan Daniel Garcia Treviño, Mayra Hermosillo, Raúl Briones, Dolores Heredia, Fernando Bonilla, Francisco Barreiro', null, 'Don Reynaldo is a renowned hunter in decline. When the threat of losing his heritage and his father''s legacy appears, the dynamics with his family, his workers and the land will be dangerously disrupted.', 'Don Reynaldo is a renowned hunter in decline. When the threat of losing his heritage and his father''s legacy appears, the dynamics with his family, his workers and the land will be dangerously disrupted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCPbqPSwfmtOO0pNDSDVccLVq3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926325'),
  ('948101827704547178', 'Northern Soul', 2014, 'Music, Drama', 'Elaine Constantine, John William Turner', 'Elaine Constantine', 'Elliot James Langridge, Josh Whitehouse, Antonia Thomas, Steve Coogan, James Lance, Ashley Taylor Dawson, Christian McKay, Lisa Stansfield', 'PG-13', 'Set in 1974, an authentic and uplifting tale of two friends whose horizons are opened up by the discovery of black American soul music.', 'Set in 1974, an authentic and uplifting tale of two friends whose horizons are opened up by the discovery of black American soul music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajnHRtHP2QUtoJ7VeAVP3E9gaI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297265'),
  ('86787127333354951', 'Northern Wind', 2018, 'Drama', 'Walid Mattar, Martin Rit, Salem Daldoul', 'Leyla Bouzid, Walid Mattar, Claude Le Pape', 'Mohamed Amine Hamzaoui, Philippe Rebbot, Kacey Mottet Klein, Corinne Masiero', null, 'North of France. Hervé''s factory is relocated. He is the only worker to resign himself to it because he pursues another destiny: to become a fisherman and to transmit this passion to his son. Suburbs of Tunis. The factory is relocated. Foued, unemployed, thinks there is a way to cure his mother, and especially to seduce the girl he loves. The trajectories of Hervé and Foued are similar and answer to each other.', 'North of France. Hervé''s factory is relocated. He is the only worker to resign himself to it because he pursues another destiny: to become a fisherman and to transmit this passion to his son. Suburbs of Tunis. The factory is relocated. Foued, unemployed, thinks there is a way to cure his mother, and especially to seduce the girl he loves. The trajectories of Hervé and Foued are similar and answer to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugpdgXgM0a6Nf2Yeoc02WeYsjcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497766'),
  ('401293732310353639', 'Northfork', 2003, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Michael Polish, Adam Rehmeier, M. David Mullen', 'Michael Polish, Mark Polish', 'James Woods, Nick Nolte, Claire Forlani, Daryl Hannah, Douglas Sebern, Ben Foster, Anthony Edwards, Duel Farnes', 'PG-13', 'The year is 1955, and a great flood is coming to Northfork, Montana. A new hydroelectric dam is about to be installed in the mountains above the town, ready to submerge the valley in the name of progress. It is the responsibility of a six-man Evacuation Committee to relocate the townsfolk to higher ground. Most have duly departed, but a few stubborn stragglers remain – among them a priest caring for a sickly orphan, a boy whose fevered visions are leading him to believe he is a member of a roaming band of lost angels desperately searching for a way home.', 'The year is 1955, and a great flood is coming to Northfork, Montana. A new hydroelectric dam is about to be installed in the mountains above the town, ready to submerge the valley in the name of progress. It is the responsibility of a six-man Evacuation Committee to relocate the townsfolk to higher ground. Most have duly departed, but a few stubborn stragglers remain – among them a priest caring for a sickly orphan, a boy whose fevered visions are leading him to believe he is a member of a roaming band of lost angels desperately searching for a way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jb3qheP75UgVibpnfubotrBDY5v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32235'),
  ('1009549708314499191', 'Northmen: A Viking Saga', 2014, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Robyn Glaser, Nicolette Louw, Megan Truter', 'Matthias Bauer, Bastian Zach', 'Ryan Kwanten, James Norton, Ed Skrein, Tom Hopper, Charlie Murphy, Leo Gregory, Ken Duken, Anatole Taubman', 'R', 'A band of Vikings cross enemy lines and a panicked race begins. The losers will pay with their lives.', 'A band of Vikings cross enemy lines and a panicked race begins. The losers will pay with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bx70ZCmLlzu0kALPGoiBezGPG7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286873'),
  ('442407382011520242', 'Northpole', 2014, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Family', 'Douglas Barr, Pierre Jodoin', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Josh Hopkins, Max Charles, Bailee Madison, Candice Glover, Robert Wagner, Jill St. John, Joanna Noyes', 'G', 'Northpole, the magical city where Santa and his elves live and work is in trouble. Families around the globe have gotten too busy to enjoy the season together, and Northpole depends on their holiday happiness to keep running. In the hopes of turning things around, a determined young elf befriends a little boy with a lot of spirit. His skeptical journalist mom doesn’t have room in her heart for anything but the facts, so it’s going to take a little nudge from his charming teacher to create an unbeatable Christmas team to turn around this town and share the importance of the season with the whole world.', 'Northpole, the magical city where Santa and his elves live and work is in trouble. Families around the globe have gotten too busy to enjoy the season together, and Northpole depends on their holiday happiness to keep running. In the hopes of turning things around, a determined young elf befriends a little boy with a lot of spirit. His skeptical journalist mom doesn’t have room in her heart for anything but the facts, so it’s going to take a little nudge from his charming teacher to create an unbeatable Christmas team to turn around this town and share the importance of the season with the whole world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1J0eisyWjmaZLXYDszjWbNpnKt9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299579'),
  ('793953636915283137', 'Northpole: Open for Christmas', 2015, 'TV Movie, Family, Fantasy', 'Douglas Barr, Pierre Jodoin', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Lori Loughlin, Bailee Madison, Dermot Mulroney, Paul Stewart, Marcia Bennett, Ava Telek, James Thomas, Anana Rydvald', null, 'A successful businesswoman, Mackenzie, inherits her beloved aunt''s inn, and chooses to restore the hotel to its original grandeur only to sell it right before Christmas. Unbeknownst to Mackenzie, she receives some unexpected help from a team of elves headed by the cheerful Clementine, who helps Mackenzie rediscover the true meaning of Christmas.', 'A successful businesswoman, Mackenzie, inherits her beloved aunt''s inn, and chooses to restore the hotel to its original grandeur only to sell it right before Christmas. Unbeknownst to Mackenzie, she receives some unexpected help from a team of elves headed by the cheerful Clementine, who helps Mackenzie rediscover the true meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hbdsTv0hoV3ScEbqmqi16xRp2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339543'),
  ('811055416187364179', 'Northwest', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Noer, Magnus Nordenhof Jønck, Emil Sparre-Ulrich', 'Michael Noer, Rasmus Heisterberg', 'Gustav Dyekjær Giese, Oscar Dyekjær Giese, Lene Maria Christensen, Annemieke Bredahl Peppink, Nicholas Westwood Kidd, Roland Møller, Dulfi Al-Jabouri, Ali Abdul Amir Najel', null, 'Nordvest is a gangsterfilm set in the suburbs of Copenhagen. Casper (18), the oldest of 3 siblings, survives life on the streets by committing burglaries for the neighbourhood boss, Jamal. When Casper gets an offer to work for Jamal’s rival Björn, he jumps at the chance for a better life, making his way into a world of drugs and prostitution. As things escalate between Björn and Jamal, Casper finds himself and his family dead center of a conflict, that threatens to destroy them.', 'Nordvest is a gangsterfilm set in the suburbs of Copenhagen. Casper (18), the oldest of 3 siblings, survives life on the streets by committing burglaries for the neighbourhood boss, Jamal. When Casper gets an offer to work for Jamal’s rival Björn, he jumps at the chance for a better life, making his way into a world of drugs and prostitution. As things escalate between Björn and Jamal, Casper finds himself and his family dead center of a conflict, that threatens to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wYYMhv5S0yegXPXg8QttaElAQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161491'),
  ('306742903246245857', 'Northwest Hounded Police', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Bill Thompson, Frank Graham', null, 'The wolf escapes from Alka-Fizz prison, but persistent Sergeant McPoodle (Droopy) of the Canadian Mounties follows his trail wherever he goes.', 'The wolf escapes from Alka-Fizz prison, but persistent Sergeant McPoodle (Droopy) of the Canadian Mounties follows his trail wherever he goes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NXCNwkwCTsrzlRZCY5Tg50Ty3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86737'),
  ('887773422514544374', 'Northwest Passage', 1940, 'Adventure, History, War, Drama', 'King Vidor, Harrold Weinberger, Robert A. Golden', 'Talbot Jennings, Laurence Stallings', 'Spencer Tracy, Robert Young, Walter Brennan, Ruth Hussey, Nat Pendleton, Louis Hector, Robert Barrat, Lumsden Hare', 'NR', 'Based on the Kenneth Roberts novel of the same name, this film tells the story of two friends who join Rogers'' Rangers, as the legendary elite force engages the enemy during the French and Indian War. The film focuses on their famous raid at Fort St. Francis and their marches before and after the battle.', 'Based on the Kenneth Roberts novel of the same name, this film tells the story of two friends who join Rogers'' Rangers, as the legendary elite force engages the enemy during the French and Indian War. The film focuses on their famous raid at Fort St. Francis and their marches before and after the battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1J3K23jhEEt2uezEvYY0YtatWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43805'),
  ('442603464244863723', 'Norwegian Wood', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Trần Anh Hùng, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Yu Koreyasu', 'Trần Anh Hùng', 'Kenichi Matsuyama, Rinko Kikuchi, Kiko Mizuhara, Reika Kirishima, Eriko Hatsune, Tetsuji Tamayama, Tokio Emoto, Kengo Kora', null, 'Toru recalls his life in the 1960s, when his friend Kizuki killed himself and he grew close to Naoko, Kizuki''s girlfriend, and another woman, the outgoing, lively Midori.', 'Toru recalls his life in the 1960s, when his friend Kizuki killed himself and he grew close to Naoko, Kizuki''s girlfriend, and another woman, the outgoing, lively Midori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnTbsvghYlN8B3vhhxPOezimOGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57703'),
  ('239392017048339884', 'Noryang: Deadly Sea', 2023, 'War, Action, History, Drama', 'Kim Tae-sung, O Seok-pil, Kim Gyeong-seok', 'Kim Han-min, Lee Na-ra, Yoon Hong-gi', 'Kim Yun-seok, Baek Yoon-sik, Jung Jae-young, Huh Joon-ho, Kim Sung-kyu, Lee Kyoo-hyung, Lee Mu-saeng, Choi Deok-moon', null, 'The Imjin War reaches its seventh year in December of 1598. Admiral Yi Sun-shin learns that the Wa invaders in Joseon are preparing for a swift withdrawal following the deathbed orders of their leader Toyotomi Hideyoshi. Determined to destroy the enemy once and for all, Admiral Yi leads an allied fleet of Joseon and Ming ships to mount a blockade and annihilate the Wa army. However, once Ming commander Chen Lin is bribed into lifting the blockade, Wa lord Shimazu Yoshihiro and his Satsuma army sail to the Wa army''s rescue at Noryang Strait.', 'The Imjin War reaches its seventh year in December of 1598. Admiral Yi Sun-shin learns that the Wa invaders in Joseon are preparing for a swift withdrawal following the deathbed orders of their leader Toyotomi Hideyoshi. Determined to destroy the enemy once and for all, Admiral Yi leads an allied fleet of Joseon and Ming ships to mount a blockade and annihilate the Wa army. However, once Ming commander Chen Lin is bribed into lifting the blockade, Wa lord Shimazu Yoshihiro and his Satsuma army sail to the Wa army''s rescue at Noryang Strait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRvL19WMG883eFyfs3wBRxf6Vx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660360'),
  ('63602217486031476', 'Nos amis les flics', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Bob Swaim', 'Mathieu Fabiani, Bob Swaim, Laurent Chalumeau', 'Daniel Auteuil, Frédéric Diefenthal, Lorànt Deutsch, Pascal Elbé, Édouard Montoute, Armelle Deutsch, Atmen Kelif, François Levantal', null, 'Une bande de jeunes voyous inoffensifs vivote de petits coups. Après un braquage loupé, ils se trouvent dans l''impossibilité de régler leurs dettes au caïd du coin, qui, pour le rembourser, leur propose le cambriolage d''une fondation d''art moderne. Mais rien ne se passe comme prévu et tout s''enchaîne... mal.', 'Une bande de jeunes voyous inoffensifs vivote de petits coups. Après un braquage loupé, ils se trouvent dans l''impossibilité de régler leurs dettes au caïd du coin, qui, pour le rembourser, leur propose le cambriolage d''une fondation d''art moderne. Mais rien ne se passe comme prévu et tout s''enchaîne... mal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njz5tpvoP63XAwBgGq4hNO3ILwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40569'),
  ('517848626037952894', 'Nos Embalos de Ipanema', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antônio Calmon, Célia Jaguaribe, André Palluch', 'Sylvan Paezzo, Antônio Calmon, Armando Costa', 'André De Biase, Angelina Muniz, Zaira Zambelli, Paulo Villaça, Selma Egrei, Roberto Bonfim, Gracinda Freire, Ronaldo Santos', null, 'Toquinho is a young man living in Marechal Hermes, a poor neighborhood in Rio de Janeiro, together with his widow mother and a younger sister. Although he is poor, he is also ambitious, and wants to change his life. He spends all his time on the beach, at Arpoador, Ipanema, where he dreams to become a famous surfer. Besides, he usually finds Patricia there, a rich and liberated young woman, whom he likes a lot. To impress Patricia and satisfy some of her wishes, he lets himself be seduced by André, a gay guy who, in return for his sexual favors, promises him a trip to Hawaii for a surf championship.', 'Toquinho is a young man living in Marechal Hermes, a poor neighborhood in Rio de Janeiro, together with his widow mother and a younger sister. Although he is poor, he is also ambitious, and wants to change his life. He spends all his time on the beach, at Arpoador, Ipanema, where he dreams to become a famous surfer. Besides, he usually finds Patricia there, a rich and liberated young woman, whom he likes a lot. To impress Patricia and satisfy some of her wishes, he lets himself be seduced by André, a gay guy who, in return for his sexual favors, promises him a trip to Hawaii for a surf championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaebyLhHwfSPmrIp2hsOVn7Qdpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264576'),
  ('899441734368170420', 'Nos enfants chéris', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Benoît Cohen', 'Benoît Cohen, Eléonore Pourriat', 'Mathieu Demy, Romane Bohringer, Mathias Mlekuz, Laurence Côte, Fabio Zenoni, Eléonore Pourriat, Julien Boisselier, Alain Fromager', null, '30 ans, l''âge des responsabilités... Martin s''apprête à partir en vacances avec sa femme Ariane et sa fille Cerise, 4 mois... C''est alors qu''il croise Constance, son ex, son amour de jeunesse, elle-même flanquée de deux marmots. C''est décidé : on passera quelques jours ensemble, au soleil, dans la maison familiale. Comme au bon vieux temps.', '30 ans, l''âge des responsabilités... Martin s''apprête à partir en vacances avec sa femme Ariane et sa fille Cerise, 4 mois... C''est alors qu''il croise Constance, son ex, son amour de jeunesse, elle-même flanquée de deux marmots. C''est décidé : on passera quelques jours ensemble, au soleil, dans la maison familiale. Comme au bon vieux temps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNJSZ4oV2QLawaZRci6GrpUik04.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38200'),
  ('572513201976812603', 'Nos veremos esta noche, mi amor', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Romance', 'Paco Arasanz, Víctor Arroyo', 'Paco Arasanz', 'Jose Diego Celsi, Nora Cervantes, Favour David Iyawe, Marila Lombrozo, María Monroy', null, 'Two intertwined tales of love, guilt, and mystery. Miguel is emotionally stuck, obsessed with reliving his wedding day. Separately, influencers probe strange murders at a convent.', 'Two intertwined tales of love, guilt, and mystery. Miguel is emotionally stuck, obsessed with reliving his wedding day. Separately, influencers probe strange murders at a convent.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlRM3ssH2JAxWlgSZKxQjeVpmyoo.jpg', 'plex:movie:nos-veremos-esta-noche-mi-amor'),
