  ('616611399990780079', 'Nostalgia for the Light', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Patricio Guzmán, Katell Djian', 'Patricio Guzmán', 'Gaspar Galaz, Lautaro Núñez, Luís Henríquez, Miguel, Victor Gonzalez, Vicky Saaveda, Violeta Berrios, George Preston', null, 'In Chile''s Atacama Desert, astronomers peer deep into the cosmos in search for answers concerning the origins of life. Nearby, a group of women sift through the sand searching for body parts of loved ones, dumped unceremoniously by Pinochet''s regime.', 'In Chile''s Atacama Desert, astronomers peer deep into the cosmos in search for answers concerning the origins of life. Nearby, a group of women sift through the sand searching for body parts of loved ones, dumped unceremoniously by Pinochet''s regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8NsCokx3dveFDL1YAvJPWHkrDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72721'),
