  ('585834751603811266', 'Nostalgic Christmas', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'J.B. Sugar, David Perrault', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis', 'Brooke D''Orsay, Trevor Donovan, Jenna Weir, Ron Lea, Tara Joshi, Eugene Clark, Vanessa Burns, Chad Willett', null, 'When Anne helps her father close the family''s toy store, what she finds will help inspire an entire town that is need of some Christmas cheer.', 'When Anne helps her father close the family''s toy store, what she finds will help inspire an entire town that is need of some Christmas cheer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYmvx1UxiUwBJ7AaKbQk8vlUR3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630894'),
  ('858821812672099993', 'Nostos', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Action', 'Mauro Zingarelli, Gianluca Palma', 'Tommaso Renzoni', 'Francesco Foti, Aurora Giovinazzo, Matteo Quinzi', null, 'In 2059, in a broken-down world, silicon has become the most precious material on the planet. A man and a girl barter transistors and microchips for a few larvae and some water. Their routine will be broken by the discovery of a forgotten heirloom, something that the man will not want to part with.', 'In 2059, in a broken-down world, silicon has become the most precious material on the planet. A man and a girl barter transistors and microchips for a few larvae and some water. Their routine will be broken by the discovery of a forgotten heirloom, something that the man will not want to part with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yAfNQnq08sHLHLuH45O8jFQTc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004615'),
  ('552419045112933869', 'Nostos: The Return', 1990, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Franco Piavoli, Giuseppe Marcoli, Carlo Malacchini', 'Franco Piavoli', 'Luigi Mezzanotte, Branca de Camargo, Alex Carozzo, Paola Agosti, Giuseppe Marcoli, Mariella Fabbris, Lucilla Giagnoni', null, 'At the end of the war, Odysseus, the wandering hero, with his companions begins his sail back home to the Mediterranean. The conclusion of his adventure is delayed by many natural obstacles and he takes an internal journey of fleeting memories of his childhood, his parents, love for a beautiful girl, nostalgia for the past, regret for what he did, and the deep silence that envelops everything. He confronts the most terrible loneliness following a shipwreck in which all the comrades perish.', 'At the end of the war, Odysseus, the wandering hero, with his companions begins his sail back home to the Mediterranean. The conclusion of his adventure is delayed by many natural obstacles and he takes an internal journey of fleeting memories of his childhood, his parents, love for a beautiful girl, nostalgia for the past, regret for what he did, and the deep silence that envelops everything. He confronts the most terrible loneliness following a shipwreck in which all the comrades perish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDSH9Pxmj0MtXPYd0f8SiXdGJ88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237957'),
  ('53749807946116089', 'Nostradamus', 1994, 'Drama, History', 'Roger Christian, Denis Crossan', 'Knut Boeser', 'Tchéky Karyo, F. Murray Abraham, Rutger Hauer, Amanda Plummer, Julia Ormond, Assumpta Serna, Anthony Higgins, Diana Quick', 'R', 'A dramatic retelling of the life of Michel de Nostredame, from his early work as a plague doctor to his time at the court of Catherine de Medici, after he became famed for his prophetic almanacs. Stars Rutger Hauer and Julia Ormond.', 'A dramatic retelling of the life of Michel de Nostredame, from his early work as a plague doctor to his time at the court of Catherine de Medici, after he became famed for his prophetic almanacs. Stars Rutger Hauer and Julia Ormond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbjPR7FoKUUv4uR4dwzO7ce4aTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48485'),
