  ('988689455846782071', 'Not a Love Story', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ram Gopal Varma, M Ravichandran Thevar, Sapan Narula', null, 'Deepak Dobriyal, Ajay Gehi, Mahie Gill, Zakir Hussain, Rasika Joshi, Darshan Jariwala, Neil Bhoopalam, Prabhleen Sandhu', null, 'An aspiring movie actress and her boyfriend are arrested and charged with homicide.', 'An aspiring movie actress and her boyfriend are arrested and charged with homicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTenAYOVzLqi5yM4tOqoxxtjcXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73242'),
  ('274964060451430653', 'Not A Minute To Lose', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Jose Eduardo Cortes Moreno, Luis Eduardo Reyes, Fido Pérez-Gavilán', 'Adriana Pelusi', 'Ana Serradilla, Christopher Von Uckermann, Ofelia Medina, José Carlos Femat, Esmeralda Pimentel, Claudia Ramírez, Antonio de la Vega, Leonardo de Lozanne', null, 'Elisa is an old-fashioned girl who receives the visit of her future self, who advises her to take the risk and invite Carlos, his best friend, on a date. She has always been attracted to him.', 'Elisa is an old-fashioned girl who receives the visit of her future self, who advises her to take the risk and invite Carlos, his best friend, on a date. She has always been attracted to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gtjQYkWNyrarQt0svA7rKLf5EN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467980'),
  ('40003951725281006', 'Not All Men, But...', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Michel Leclerc, David Cailley, Pascal Morucci', 'Michel Leclerc, Baya Kasmi', 'Léa Drucker, Benjamin Lavernhe, Judith Chemla, Julia Piaton, Vincent Elbaz, Melha Bedia, Félix Moati, Philippe Uchan', null, 'Simone, a cop with conservative ideas, infiltrates a feminist collective. However, her cover is thin. To divert attention and get out of this bad situation, Simone finds nothing better than to randomly accuse a man of having raped her.', 'Simone, a cop with conservative ideas, infiltrates a feminist collective. However, her cover is thin. To divert attention and get out of this bad situation, Simone finds nothing better than to randomly accuse a man of having raped her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpJuR5lgPewWVFs2N8o20rQ25AI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235298'),
  ('786021080873428337', 'Not All Were Murderers', 2006, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Jo Baier', 'Jo Baier', 'Nadja Uhl, Axel Prahl, Hannelore Elsner, Dagmar Manzel, Merab Ninidze, Katharina Thalbach, Maria Simon, Richy Müller', null, 'Based on the childhood memories of actor Michael Degen, the movie deals with the everyday struggle to survive as a Jewish boy in Nazi Germany. As his father had died in 1940 after being released from the Sachsenhausen concentration camp, Michael and his mother fear to be deported themselves. They manage to live in Berlin with false names and faked papers, hidden by several, often broken, people...', 'Based on the childhood memories of actor Michael Degen, the movie deals with the everyday struggle to survive as a Jewish boy in Nazi Germany. As his father had died in 1940 after being released from the Sachsenhausen concentration camp, Michael and his mother fear to be deported themselves. They manage to live in Berlin with false names and faked papers, hidden by several, often broken, people...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYD4FyqgRpnpVYV9943hDV79V2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155445'),
  ('39367342076333873', 'Not Angels But Angels', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Wiktor Grodecki, Frank Beauvais, Petr Samec', 'Wiktor Grodecki', 'Tom Novy, Joseph Gregori, Eda, Honza, Jarda, Joseph, Lada, Libor', null, 'Interviews with a procurer and with nineteen boys and young men who are prostitutes in Prague. The youths range in age from 14 to 19. They hustle at the central train station and at clubs. Most of their clients are foreign tourists, many are German. The youths talk about why they hustle, their first trick, prices, dangers, what they know about AIDS, their fears (disease and loneliness), and how they imagine their futures. The film''s title, its liturgical score, much of it elegiac, and shots of the city''s statues of angels underline the vulnerability and callow lack of sophistication of the young men.', 'Interviews with a procurer and with nineteen boys and young men who are prostitutes in Prague. The youths range in age from 14 to 19. They hustle at the central train station and at clubs. Most of their clients are foreign tourists, many are German. The youths talk about why they hustle, their first trick, prices, dangers, what they know about AIDS, their fears (disease and loneliness), and how they imagine their futures. The film''s title, its liturgical score, much of it elegiac, and shots of the city''s statues of angels underline the vulnerability and callow lack of sophistication of the young men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2E9d1Usule98ofykymjGx8MUW2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327175'),
  ('1143397181064360947', 'Not Another Happy Ending', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'John McKay, George Geddes, Jonathan Farmer', 'David Solomons', 'Karen Gillan, Stanley Weber, Iain De Caestecker, Henry Ian Cusick, Kate Dickie, Amy Manson, Freya Mavor, Gary Lewis', null, 'When a struggling publisher discovers his only successful author is blocked, he knows he has to unblock her or he''s finished. With her newfound success, she''s become too happy and she can''t write when she''s happy. The only trouble is, the worse he makes her feel, the more he realizes he''s in love with her.', 'When a struggling publisher discovers his only successful author is blocked, he knows he has to unblock her or he''s finished. With her newfound success, she''s become too happy and she can''t write when she''s happy. The only trouble is, the worse he makes her feel, the more he realizes he''s in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsJTUA3zVFva5I8Zo1pygKvTt6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203321'),
  ('182473952464277250', 'Not Another Teen Movie', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Joel Gallen, Reynaldo Villalobos, Daniel Silverberg', 'Mike Bender, Adam Jay Epstein, Phil Beauman', 'Chyler Leigh, Chris Evans, Jaime Pressly, Eric Christian Olsen, Mia Kirshner, Deon Richmond, Eric Jungmann, Ron Lester', 'R', 'On a bet, a gridiron hero at John Hughes High School sets out to turn a bespectacled plain Jane into a beautiful and popular prom queen in this outrageous send-up of the teen movies of the 1980s and ''90s.', 'On a bet, a gridiron hero at John Hughes High School sets out to turn a bespectacled plain Jane into a beautiful and popular prom queen in this outrageous send-up of the teen movies of the 1980s and ''90s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZaGxvj1mqdKVLpSloq4mzS7SK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11397'),
  ('759017377172600681', 'Not as a Stranger', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stanley Kramer, Franz Planer', 'Edna Anhalt, Edward Anhalt', 'Robert Mitchum, Olivia de Havilland, Frank Sinatra, Gloria Grahame, Broderick Crawford, Charles Bickford, Myron McCormick, Lon Chaney Jr.', 'NR', 'Lucas Marsh, an intern bent upon becoming a first-class doctor, not merely a successful one. He courts and marries the warm-hearted Kristina, not out of love but because she is highly knowledgeable in the skills of the operating room and because she has frugally put aside her savings through the years. She will be, as he shrewdly knows, a supportive wife in every way. She helps make him the success he wants to be and cheerfully moves with him to the small town in which he starts his practice. But as much as he tries to be a good husband to the undemanding Kristina, Marsh easily falls into the arms of a local siren and the patience of the long-sorrowing Kristina wears thin.', 'Lucas Marsh, an intern bent upon becoming a first-class doctor, not merely a successful one. He courts and marries the warm-hearted Kristina, not out of love but because she is highly knowledgeable in the skills of the operating room and because she has frugally put aside her savings through the years. She will be, as he shrewdly knows, a supportive wife in every way. She helps make him the success he wants to be and cheerfully moves with him to the small town in which he starts his practice. But as much as he tries to be a good husband to the undemanding Kristina, Marsh easily falls into the arms of a local siren and the patience of the long-sorrowing Kristina wears thin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gN054EboHPbRIjVDXUrbcaQDleU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76117'),
  ('975719598309036930', 'Not by Chance', 2007, 'Drama', 'Philippe Barcinski, Joana Cooper, Isabella Teixeira', 'Fabiana Werneck Barcinski, Philippe Barcinski, Eugênio Puppo', 'Rodrigo Santoro, Leonardo Medeiros, Letícia Sabatella, Branca Messina, Rita Batata, Cássia Kis, Silvio Matos, Graziella Moretto', null, 'Enio is a middle-aged man who lives in solitude after a failed relationship. Pedro, 30, dates Teresa, who is moving to her home. He inherited a carpentry from his father and a taste for the pool. When a traffic accident crosses the parallel trajectories of the two, the imponderable imposes itself and the uncontrol begins.', 'Enio is a middle-aged man who lives in solitude after a failed relationship. Pedro, 30, dates Teresa, who is moving to her home. He inherited a carpentry from his father and a taste for the pool. When a traffic accident crosses the parallel trajectories of the two, the imponderable imposes itself and the uncontrol begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkR2QEWJDXLpBwFu9GVRUUaeU6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132635'),
  ('810703381146284984', 'Not Cinderella''s Type', 2018, 'Romance', 'Brian Brough, Brian Brough', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Paris Warner, Tim Flynn, Tanner Gillman, JJ Neward, Scott Christopher, Andrea Adamson, Ariana Bagley, Mia Bagley', 'NR', 'Indy lives with her aunt and uncle and believes her life is fine until an accident brings a new guy into her life. Bryant Bailey is not Indy''s type - she''s never been into guys like him. But then again, she''s never really known anyone so stubborn and caring that can also help her discover who she is and what she''s worth. A modern telling of Cinderella, based on the novel by Jenni James.', 'Indy lives with her aunt and uncle and believes her life is fine until an accident brings a new guy into her life. Bryant Bailey is not Indy''s type - she''s never been into guys like him. But then again, she''s never really known anyone so stubborn and caring that can also help her discover who she is and what she''s worth. A modern telling of Cinderella, based on the novel by Jenni James.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi9L5tFIKvYehUQQHigbtrjB75I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486753'),
  ('949550476588078665', 'Not Cool', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Paladino, Shane Dawson', 'Dan Schoffer', 'Shane Dawson, Cherami Leigh, Drew Monson, Lisa Schwartz, Michelle Veintimilla, Terri Middleton, Carly Otte, Kurt Angle', 'R', 'Former prom king Scott returns home for Thanksgiving break and gets dumped by his long-term girlfriend. With his world turned upside down, Scott strikes an unlikely friendship with former classmate Tori, an ugly duckling who blossomed in her first semester of college, and they embark on an outrageous adventure through their hometown. But when Scott and Tori start falling in love, they realize that a few months away may have changed them more than they realized.', 'Former prom king Scott returns home for Thanksgiving break and gets dumped by his long-term girlfriend. With his world turned upside down, Scott strikes an unlikely friendship with former classmate Tori, an ugly duckling who blossomed in her first semester of college, and they embark on an outrageous adventure through their hometown. But when Scott and Tori start falling in love, they realize that a few months away may have changed them more than they realized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikLuZGHTYTVYHDBPsN8dPnoVnYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292483'),
  ('1041825374935019789', 'Not Dead Yet', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sam Hull', 'Susan Hess', 'Susan Hess, Betty Moyer, Sherilyn Lawson, David Ogden Stiers, Seymour Cassel, Jill Andre, Ellery Abel, Allen Nause', null, 'A poignant comedy about three midlife women who join forces to revive their acting careers, "Not Dead Yet" brings a dramatic new perspective to a range of women''s issues rarely embraced by American cinema.', 'A poignant comedy about three midlife women who join forces to revive their acting careers, "Not Dead Yet" brings a dramatic new perspective to a range of women''s issues rarely embraced by American cinema.', null, 'tmdb:movie:381272'),
  ('313699897290213358', 'Not Delivered', 1958, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gilles Grangier', null, 'Paul Meurisse, Jeanne Moreau, Serge Reggiani, Gert Fröbe, Reggie Nalder, Simone Renant, Robert Porte, Fernand Sardou', null, 'After resolving to start a new life with his girlfriend Jacqueline, Bastien Sassey decides to give up working as a courier for drugs traffickers. So that he and Jacqueline can make a fresh start he agrees to take on one more job for a large sum of cash, but he betrays his employer.', 'After resolving to start a new life with his girlfriend Jacqueline, Bastien Sassey decides to give up working as a courier for drugs traffickers. So that he and Jacqueline can make a fresh start he agrees to take on one more job for a large sum of cash, but he betrays his employer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9waimjJA4qAyLnasNvpsMIPEOgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245875'),
  ('833647730748980938', 'Not Easily Broken', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bill Duke, Geary McLeod, Stephen Harrison', 'Brian Bird', 'Morris Chestnut, Taraji P. Henson, Maeve Quinlan, Kevin Hart, Jenifer Lewis, Eddie Cibrian, Wood Harris, Niecy Nash', 'PG', 'A car accident and shifting affections test the bond between a married couple.', 'A car accident and shifting affections test the bond between a married couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HJ39DnQyfU3ISk0XREXiAhdQZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14834'),
  ('805486878553036774', 'Not Everybody''s Lucky Enough to Have Communist Parents', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Jacques Zilbermann, Bruno Delbonnel, Thierry Jault', 'Nicolas Boukhrief, Jean-Jacques Zilbermann', 'Josiane Balasko, Maurice Bénichou, Catherine Hiegel, Jean-François Dérec, Viktor Neznanov, Aleksandr Piskaryov, Aleksey Maslov, Jérémy Davis', null, 'This bright domestic drama captures a moment in time when, for a large number of idealistic and grateful French men and women, the promise of Russian communism was bright, and everything Russian was a source of joy and amazement. In the story, Irene was rescued from Auschwitz by soldiers from the U.S.S.R., and since that time she has enthusiatically considered Russia to be the source of hope in the world. Her more pragmatic husband has, by 1958, grown somewhat weary of her enthusiasm, which has led her to decorate their apartment with anything Russian she can get her hands on. Matters come to a head when she is befriended by three members of the Red Army Choir during their tour of Paris.', 'This bright domestic drama captures a moment in time when, for a large number of idealistic and grateful French men and women, the promise of Russian communism was bright, and everything Russian was a source of joy and amazement. In the story, Irene was rescued from Auschwitz by soldiers from the U.S.S.R., and since that time she has enthusiatically considered Russia to be the source of hope in the world. Her more pragmatic husband has, by 1958, grown somewhat weary of her enthusiasm, which has led her to decorate their apartment with anything Russian she can get her hands on. Matters come to a head when she is befriended by three members of the Red Army Choir during their tour of Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oki99ybGoqo4RYsQWaqOPFnJd1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78340'),
  ('1002710184169609006', 'Not Everything That Flies Is a Bird', 1970, 'Animation', 'Borislav Šajtinac', 'Borislav Šajtinac', null, null, 'The film describes the suffering of a character who is renovating his house while being confronted with a monstrous bird which is terrorising and oppressing him. It should be read as a parable of the 1968 Soviet invasion of Czechoslovakia. The film was subject to severe criticism at the 1970 Oberhausen film festival in Germany in 1970, in particular from directors from South American communist countries.', 'The film describes the suffering of a character who is renovating his house while being confronted with a monstrous bird which is terrorising and oppressing him. It should be read as a parable of the 1968 Soviet invasion of Czechoslovakia. The film was subject to severe criticism at the 1970 Oberhausen film festival in Germany in 1970, in particular from directors from South American communist countries.', null, 'tmdb:movie:217705'),
  ('857369216598979787', 'Not Fade Away', 2012, 'Drama', 'David Chase, Eigil Bryld', 'David Chase', 'John Magaro, James Gandolfini, Bella Heathcote, Jack Huston, Will Brill, Dominique McElligott, Molly Price, Isiah Whitlock Jr.', 'R', 'Set in suburban New Jersey in the 1960s, a group of friends form a rock band and try to make it big.', 'Set in suburban New Jersey in the 1960s, a group of friends form a rock band and try to make it big.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHYG8V2L4mjQSOiTFG6jheMXZOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128270'),
  ('269074068854002210', 'Not for All the World', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ciro D''Emilio, Salvatore Landi', 'Ciro D''Emilio, Cosimo Calamini', 'Guido Caprino, Antonella Attili, Boris Isaković, Irene Casagrande, Antonio Zavatteri, Valentina Carnelutti, Diego Ribon, Samuele Teneggi', null, 'Bernardo is a charming, successful man, full of friends, always frantically searching for his freedom. For a bad twist of fate one day everything changes, putting him in front of a choice: accept what has happened or become someone else, to take back what life has taken from him.', 'Bernardo is a charming, successful man, full of friends, always frantically searching for his freedom. For a bad twist of fate one day everything changes, putting him in front of a choice: accept what has happened or become someone else, to take back what life has taken from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxWZzvnl01ap9KT6MN4latSYmmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834127'),
  ('855765433836663359', 'Not for Publication', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Paul Bartel, George Tirl', 'Paul Bartel, John Meyer', 'Nancy Allen, David Naughton, Laurence Luckinbill, Alice Ghostley, Richard Paul, Cork Hubbert, Jeanne Evans, Don Peoples', 'R', 'A tabloid reporter and her new photographer, who''ve recently started working for the mayor of New York City, stumble upon evidence of conspiracy and political corruption that may involve their beloved mayor.', 'A tabloid reporter and her new photographer, who''ve recently started working for the mayor of New York City, stumble upon evidence of conspiracy and political corruption that may involve their beloved mayor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHOXFtHjTjpsmAgn8e9GuJFZzAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105488'),
  ('660958928175580055', 'Not for the Young', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Giuliano Sangiorgi, Giovanni Veronesi, Tani Canevari', 'Ilaria Macchia', 'Filippo Scicchitano, Giovanni Anzaldo, Sara Serraiocco, Sergio Rubini, Nino Frassica, Luis Rielo, Claudio Corinaldesi, Linda Messerklinger', null, 'Frustrated with their lack of upward mobility, some young Italians move to Cuba to start a wi-fi café and attempt to build a new life.', 'Frustrated with their lack of upward mobility, some young Italians move to Cuba to start a wi-fi café and attempt to build a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mA20EhHQ3cb54R3LO0zQ0ATNN9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442419'),
  ('465419981917246789', 'Not For, or Against (Quite the Contrary)', 2003, 'Drama, Crime', 'Cédric Klapisch, Bruno Delbonnel, Ophélie Gelber', 'Santiago Amigorena, Alexis Galmot, Cédric Klapisch', 'Marie Gillain, Diane Kruger, Camille Natta, Simon Abkarian, Dimitri Storoge, Vincent Elbaz, Zinedine Soualem, Natacha Lindinger', null, '"Ni Pour, Ni Contre" tracks the fall of a young TV camerawoman, Caty, after she becomes involved with a group of petty criminals and their enigmatic leader, Jean. The gang lives hand-to-mouth until the day Jean plans a daring bank robbery. Although other gang members feel out of their league, Jean persuades them to take part and Caty finds herself in a hellish world of betrayal, violence and murder.', '"Ni Pour, Ni Contre" tracks the fall of a young TV camerawoman, Caty, after she becomes involved with a group of petty criminals and their enigmatic leader, Jean. The gang lives hand-to-mouth until the day Jean plans a daring bank robbery. Although other gang members feel out of their league, Jean persuades them to take part and Caty finds herself in a hellish world of betrayal, violence and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgd2DStNLE8zblUPJcez6r3Y3b5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11958'),
  ('758139982743181462', 'Not Forgotten', 2009, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Dror Soref, Steven Bernstein, Rachel Quinn', 'Tomás Romero, Dror Soref', 'Simon Baker, Paz Vega, Michael DeLorenzo, Chloë Grace Moretz, Ken Davitian, Claire Forlani, Gedde Watanabe, Mark Rolston', 'R', 'Set in a Tex-Mex border town, Not Forgotten is a classic psychological thriller about Jack and Amaya Bishop, a couple who must come to terms with their tortured pasts in order to save their kidnapped daughter. It is a tale taut with intrigue and steeped in Latino mysticism, where the line between what''s real and what''s imagined becomes hopelessly blurred.', 'Set in a Tex-Mex border town, Not Forgotten is a classic psychological thriller about Jack and Amaya Bishop, a couple who must come to terms with their tortured pasts in order to save their kidnapped daughter. It is a tale taut with intrigue and steeped in Latino mysticism, where the line between what''s real and what''s imagined becomes hopelessly blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRFrQ7XeD25ErwZMRgawcPrWlTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22135'),
