  ('965961877719008960', 'Not Friends', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pasit Tandaechanurat, Karnsiree Kunsophon, Sasiphon Chinakat', 'Atta Hemwadee', 'Anthony Buisseret, Pisitpol Ekpongpisit, Thitiya Jirapornsilp, Tanakorn Tiyanont, Ingkarat Damrongsakkul, Natticha Chantaravareelrkha, Jirapat Siwakosit, Panachanok Wattanavrangkul', null, 'A group of high school students who dream of making films set out to make a short film based on the life of a classmate. However, they discover a secret that could change their vision of filmmaking forever.', 'A group of high school students who dream of making films set out to make a short film based on the life of a classmate. However, they discover a secret that could change their vision of filmmaking forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3uTKXGNRrRCeCNIFvmpmDCmo5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093215'),
