  ('248747640359657759', 'Not just The Shorts + 1 hour of unreleased sketches', 2003, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Marina Massironi', null, 'This is the first volume of the true story of Aldo, Giovanni and Giacomo in the Mondadori humorous series. This first cult object of the series contains two hours of laughter, provoked by the version of the show "I Corti", in the splendor of its complete remastering, and by an hour and twenty minutes of special content including unpublished sketches, interviews, comments and anecdotes behind the scenes.', 'This is the first volume of the true story of Aldo, Giovanni and Giacomo in the Mondadori humorous series. This first cult object of the series contains two hours of laughter, provoked by the version of the show "I Corti", in the splendor of its complete remastering, and by an hour and twenty minutes of special content including unpublished sketches, interviews, comments and anecdotes behind the scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssxIo2omywIdooWE4zualx8NChZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480312'),
  ('577973431265984745', 'Not Knowing', 2019, 'Drama', 'Leyla Yılmaz', 'Leyla Yılmaz', 'Emir Özden, Senan Kara, Yurdaer Okur, Levent Üzümcü, Çetin Sarıkartal, Ulaşcan Kutlu, Arın Kuşaksızoğlu, Arda Anarat', null, 'Selma and Sinan are a couple who now find it difficult to endure each other. At the end of high school, rumors start circulating about their son Umut, who is gay. While Selma and Sinan are trying to cope with their tiring marriage, Umut suddenly disappears.', 'Selma and Sinan are a couple who now find it difficult to endure each other. At the end of high school, rumors start circulating about their son Umut, who is gay. While Selma and Sinan are trying to cope with their tiring marriage, Umut suddenly disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bcAvDv0JOFynr5i7DjC5brPrqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638574'),
