  ('428504932882486631', 'Not of This World', 1999, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Luca Bigazzi, Riccardo Cannone', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Gualtiero Rosella, Lucia Maria Zei', 'Margherita Buy, Silvio Orlando, Carolina Freschi, Maria Cristina Minerva, Sonia Gessner, Alessandro Di Natale, Riccardo De Torrebruna, Stefano Abbati', null, 'The rumpled owner of a dry-cleaning firm joins forces with a nun to care for an abandoned baby.', 'The rumpled owner of a dry-cleaning firm joins forces with a nun to care for an abandoned baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdGlOyxwfuKhJfPK7viApoZl2LU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63263'),
  ('433374712719912645', 'Not Okay', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Quinn Shephard, Robby Baumgartner, Neil Daly', 'Quinn Shephard', 'Zoey Deutch, Mia Isaac, Dylan O''Brien, Nadia Alexander, Tia Dionne Hodge, Negin Farsad, Embeth Davidtz, Brennan Brown', 'R', 'An ambitious young woman, desperate for followers and fame, fakes a trip to Paris to up her social media presence. When a terrifying incident takes place in the real world and becomes part of her imaginary trip, her white lie becomes a moral quandary that offers her all the attention she’s wanted.', 'An ambitious young woman, desperate for followers and fame, fakes a trip to Paris to up her social media presence. When a terrifying incident takes place in the real world and becomes part of her imaginary trip, her white lie becomes a moral quandary that offers her all the attention she’s wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1q3FkqFHBkMeKnHiS6GYgdLvUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838330'),
  ('823634803775135173', 'Not on My Watch', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Emmanuelle Cuau , Sabine Lancelin', 'Raphaëlle Desplechin, Emmanuelle Cuau , Eric Barbier', 'Virginie Efira, Gilbert Melki, Marilyne Canto, Renan Prévot, Jean-Baptiste Blanc, Zacharie Chasseriaud, René Remblier, Yvonnick Chedemois', null, 'A single mother gets entangled in a web of lies to protect her sons.', 'A single mother gets entangled in a web of lies to protect her sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4oyHW6D5VBFzqGes1F2sXmU1Yw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428753'),
  ('408717486460125465', 'Not on the Lips', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alain Resnais, Renato Berta', 'André Barde', 'Sabine Azéma, Isabelle Nanty, Audrey Tautou, Pierre Arditi, Darry Cowl, Jalil Lespert, Daniel Prévost, Lambert Wilson', null, 'A musical drawing room farce set in Paris in October, 1925. Gilberte, in middle-age, flirts with men but loves her husband Georges, wishing he were more demonstrative. He''s negotiating a deal with an American, Eric Thomson, who turns out to be Gilberte''s first husband from an annulled and secret stateside marriage. Along with her sister Arlette, Gilberte begs Eric not to tell Georges about the marriage. Meanwhile, a young artist, Charly, pursues Gilberte while Arlette tries to match him with the young Huguette, who loves him. Will Eric play along or try to re-win Gilberte''s affection? Can Gilberte play one off against another? And who will manage to kiss whom on the lips?', 'A musical drawing room farce set in Paris in October, 1925. Gilberte, in middle-age, flirts with men but loves her husband Georges, wishing he were more demonstrative. He''s negotiating a deal with an American, Eric Thomson, who turns out to be Gilberte''s first husband from an annulled and secret stateside marriage. Along with her sister Arlette, Gilberte begs Eric not to tell Georges about the marriage. Meanwhile, a young artist, Charly, pursues Gilberte while Arlette tries to match him with the young Huguette, who loves him. Will Eric play along or try to re-win Gilberte''s affection? Can Gilberte play one off against another? And who will manage to kiss whom on the lips?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpfbKUkvOrv0atZMlHAzNqAAhEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51945'),
  ('288973703355379431', 'Not One Less', 1999, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yimou, Hou Yong, Xie Dongshen', 'Xiangsheng Shi', 'Wei Minzhi, Zhang Huike, Tian Zhenda, Gao Enman, Sun Zhimei, Feng Yuying, Li Fanfan, Zhang Yichang', 'G', 'Set in the People''s Republic of China during the 1990s, the film centers on a 13-year-old substitute teacher, Wei Minzhi, in the Chinese countryside. Called in to substitute for a village teacher for one month, Wei is told not to lose any students.', 'Set in the People''s Republic of China during the 1990s, the film centers on a 13-year-old substitute teacher, Wei Minzhi, in the Chinese countryside. Called in to substitute for a village teacher for one month, Wei is told not to lose any students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eERKaWCIRh3a8rPjUu1z34OYZD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36210'),
  ('159000251827751063', 'Not Quite Dead Yet', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Shinji Hamasaki, Tetsuya Kondoh, Hisayoshi Yamashita', 'Yoshimitsu Sawamoto', 'Suzu Hirose, Ryo Yoshizawa, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Lily Franky, Yukiyoshi Ozawa, Tae Kimura, Shota Matsuda, Ryo Kato', null, 'After Nanase''s father drops dead due to a drug that causes temporal death for 2 days, she is named the president of his pharmaceutical company. Nanase endeavors to prevent her father''s enemies from prematurely cremating his body before the drug can wear off and allow him to revive.', 'After Nanase''s father drops dead due to a drug that causes temporal death for 2 days, she is named the president of his pharmaceutical company. Nanase endeavors to prevent her father''s enemies from prematurely cremating his body before the drug can wear off and allow him to revive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixjO8gFzmzfSUSj7H4sDXG2wsqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669663'),
  ('1088683964447326889', 'Not Quite Hollywood', 2008, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Mark Hartley, Germain McMicking, Karl von Moller', 'Mark Hartley', 'Phillip Adams, Glory Annen, Christine Amor, Victoria Anoux, Briony Behets, Steve Bisley, Jamie Blanks, Graeme Blundell', 'R', 'As Australian cinema broke through to international audiences in the 1970s through respected art house films like Peter Weir''s "Picnic At Hanging Rock," a new underground of low-budget exploitation filmmakers were turning out considerably less highbrow fare. Documentary filmmaker Mark Hartley explores this unbridled era of sex and violence, complete with clips from some of the scene''s most outrageous flicks and interviews with the renegade filmmakers themselves.', 'As Australian cinema broke through to international audiences in the 1970s through respected art house films like Peter Weir''s "Picnic At Hanging Rock," a new underground of low-budget exploitation filmmakers were turning out considerably less highbrow fare. Documentary filmmaker Mark Hartley explores this unbridled era of sex and violence, complete with clips from some of the scene''s most outrageous flicks and interviews with the renegade filmmakers themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4J0mFMjeondUYT2zqlYb350tWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16194'),
  ('612278581679197151', 'Not Quite Human', 1987, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Steven Hilliard Stern, Ken Lamkin', 'Alan Ormsby, Seth McEvoy', 'Jay Underwood, Alan Thicke, Robyn Lively, Joseph Bologna, Robert Harper, Kristy Swanson, Lili Haydn, Judy Starr', null, 'Dr. Jonas Carson, a scientist, invents Chip, an android teenager. Dr. Carson sends Chip to school with his daughter Becky to see whether an android could interact with others. But his former employer decides to try and make a profit by stealing the mechanical boy.', 'Dr. Jonas Carson, a scientist, invents Chip, an android teenager. Dr. Carson sends Chip to school with his daughter Becky to see whether an android could interact with others. But his former employer decides to try and make a profit by stealing the mechanical boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7W9CyqfOJ06Oi5rXm8uQ4Yi9OSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20473'),
  ('164998093939358768', 'Not Quite Human II', 1989, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Comedy, Family', 'Eric Luke', 'Eric Luke, Kevin Osborn, Seth McEvoy', 'Jay Underwood, Alan Thicke, Robyn Lively, Greg Mullavey, Katie Barberi, Dey Young, Scott Nell, Mark Arnott', 'NR', 'Chip, the android boy is back. This time, he is off to college, suffering from a computer virus and in love with Roberta, another android. Will there be a happy ending?', 'Chip, the android boy is back. This time, he is off to college, suffering from a computer virus and in love with Roberta, another android. Will there be a happy ending?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8zKCS4Lwi7Yraij5yZAHPJFikF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45249'),
  ('998723341332799727', 'Not Reconciled', 1965, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub', 'Henning Harmssen, Georg Zander, Ulrich Hopmann, Ernst Kutzinski, Jochem Grüner, Günter Göbel, Klaus Weyer, Karl Bodenschatz', null, 'A story about the continuity and collapse of history, the power of suppression, and the terror of reconciliation; loyalty, treason and revenge. In a brave cinematic game, Heinrich Böll’s story Billiards at Half-Past Nine is split up into cracks, blocks, breaks and sudden turns, as the life story of a German family, covering numerous generations, is propelled forward.', 'A story about the continuity and collapse of history, the power of suppression, and the terror of reconciliation; loyalty, treason and revenge. In a brave cinematic game, Heinrich Böll’s story Billiards at Half-Past Nine is split up into cracks, blocks, breaks and sudden turns, as the life story of a German family, covering numerous generations, is propelled forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cg85XzG0dziEV7hiktTGyhNKbBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128846'),
  ('681658022148081304', 'Not Safe for Work', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Joe Johnston, Jonathan Taylor', 'Simon Boyes', 'Max Minghella, JJ Feild, Tom Gallop, Christian Clemenson, Eloise Mumford, Michael Gladis, Molly Hagan, Marina Black', null, 'Tom, a legal firm assistant, spots a suspicious man outside the court and follows him. Later, he gets trapped in a building with the same man who turns out to be a hitman.', 'Tom, a legal firm assistant, spots a suspicious man outside the court and follows him. Later, he gets trapped in a building with the same man who turns out to be a hitman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSSMXBKwoTXGVOiy2WsGOUlOzv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256347'),
  ('524129754324820028', 'Not Since You', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeff Stephenson, Helge Gerull', 'Jeff Stephenson, Brent Laffoon, Jane Kelly Kosek', 'Desmond Harrington, Kathleen Robertson, Jon Abrahams, Sunny Mabrey, Will Estes, Elden Henson, Sara Rue, Christian Kane', 'PG-13', 'A romantic drama about a tight-knit group of college friends who graduated from NYU the year of 9/11 and reunite years later for a weekend wedding in Georgia. Unresolved conflicts and love affairs spark again.', 'A romantic drama about a tight-knit group of college friends who graduated from NYU the year of 9/11 and reunite years later for a weekend wedding in Georgia. Unresolved conflicts and love affairs spark again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TuMMOJP1EnnkkxUSOjD35WcrUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49674'),
  ('747105948157164484', 'Not Such An Easy Life', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Félix Viscarret, Óscar Durán', 'Félix Viscarret', 'Miki Esparbé, Álex García, Ana Polvorosa, Olaya Caldera, Julián Villagrán, Ramón Barea, Xabi Valcarcel', null, 'Today Isaías runs back and forward between the park where he plays with his kids and his architecture studio, where he complains to his colleague Nico. No matter where he is, Isaías feels he should be somewhere else. And when he''s with Ainhoa, his wife, they realise just how tiring children can be when they''re so young. In the park, he makes friends with Sonia, the mother of another child, from whom he learns that raising children and coming of age isn''t that easy. It never was.', 'Today Isaías runs back and forward between the park where he plays with his kids and his architecture studio, where he complains to his colleague Nico. No matter where he is, Isaías feels he should be somewhere else. And when he''s with Ainhoa, his wife, they realise just how tiring children can be when they''re so young. In the park, he makes friends with Sonia, the mother of another child, from whom he learns that raising children and coming of age isn''t that easy. It never was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ftLEBMfgMWXr2w4ZTOJ1R5P9nv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814309'),
  ('1066210788362133196', 'Not Suitable For Children', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lachlan Milne, Nikki Barrett, Karan Monkhouse', 'Michael Lucas', 'Ryan Kwanten, Sarah Snook, Ryan Corr, Bojana Novaković, Laura Brent, Alice Parkinson, Susan Prior, Lewis Fitz-Gerald', null, 'A young playboy who learns he has one month until he becomes infertile sets out to procreate as much as possible.', 'A young playboy who learns he has one month until he becomes infertile sets out to procreate as much as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYxr14jTu02noGxXRqPDJgK37wC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120292'),
  ('248022062034835198', 'Not the End', 2018, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'José Esteban Alenda, César Esteban Alenda, Ángel Amorós', 'José Esteban Alenda, César Esteban Alenda', 'Javier Rey, María León, Juan Carlos Sánchez, Mari Paz Sayago, Paco Ochoa, Roberto Campillo, Asencio Salas, Paco Mora', null, 'Javier comes from the future to recover María''s lost love. Together, they relive the magic of the day they met and repeat the journey they made from a sunrise in Madrid to a sunset on the Andalusian coast. Everything to get María to be the full of life girl he once fell in love with.', 'Javier comes from the future to recover María''s lost love. Together, they relive the magic of the day they met and repeat the journey they made from a sunrise in Madrid to a sunset on the Andalusian coast. Everything to get María to be the full of life girl he once fell in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KVfHK3dujgFocsPD8YkSuMgWto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517999'),
  ('722120742077815576', 'Not Very Normal Activities', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Maurice Barthélemy, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Maurice Barthélemy', 'Norman Thavaud, Stéfi Celma, Maurice Barthélemy, Rufus, François Bureloup, Mauricette Gourdon, Michel Scourneau, Dominique Marcas', null, 'An isolated house, a young couple, a perverted videographer, a mute. All of which leads to normal activities... but not quite! A parody of Paranormal Activity.', 'An isolated house, a young couple, a perverted videographer, a mute. All of which leads to normal activities... but not quite! A parody of Paranormal Activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49uCkXL7OrU3GM040cAKPJGiLtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163433'),
  ('107704994919855332', 'Not Wanted', 1949, 'Drama', 'Elmer Clifton, Henry Freulich, Ida Lupino', 'Paul Jarrico, Ida Lupino', 'Sally Forrest, Keefe Brasselle, Leo Penn, Dorothy Adams, Wheaton Chambers, Rita Lupino, Audrey Farr, Carole Donne', null, 'After a beautiful but unsophisticated girl is seduced by a worldly piano player and gives up her out-of-wedlock baby, her guilt compels her to kidnap another child.', 'After a beautiful but unsophisticated girl is seduced by a worldly piano player and gives up her out-of-wedlock baby, her guilt compels her to kidnap another child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubSC4Ryy1RjNmGPutHedrwCdPEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126265'),
  ('906432589075702212', 'Not With My Wife, You Don''t!', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Norman Panama, Charles Lang, Jack Aldworth', 'Norman Panama, Larry Gelbart, Peter Barnes', 'Tony Curtis, Virna Lisi, George C. Scott, Carroll O''Connor, Richard Eastham, Eddie Ryder, George Tyne, Ann Doran', 'NR', 'During the Korean War, Italian nurse Virna Lisi falls in love with two American fliers, Tony Curtis and George C. Scott. Lisi marries Curtis after he convinces her that Scott has been killed in a plane crash. She soon discovers Scott is alive, but remains happily married to Curtis until Scott re-enters their lives 14 years later.', 'During the Korean War, Italian nurse Virna Lisi falls in love with two American fliers, Tony Curtis and George C. Scott. Lisi marries Curtis after he convinces her that Scott has been killed in a plane crash. She soon discovers Scott is alive, but remains happily married to Curtis until Scott re-enters their lives 14 years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCy2FIPC1xC1TZPNbDTMIU9H3I0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91422'),
  ('485014818427761377', 'Not Without Hope', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Joe Carnahan, Juan Miguel Azpiroz, Abigail Borg', 'Joe Carnahan, E. Nicholas Mariani', 'Zachary Levi, Josh Duhamel, Quentin Plair, Terrence Terrell, Marshall Cook, JoBeth Williams, Floriana Lima, Jessica Blackmore', 'R', 'A group of friends'' fishing boat capsizes off the coast of Mexico and they''re left alone stranded at sea and struggling for survival.', 'A group of friends'' fishing boat capsizes off the coast of Mexico and they''re left alone stranded at sea and struggling for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5WJMJ6DWPFK0Gx0Ongh0FZBAlK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339849'),
  ('600271756194267356', 'Not Without My Daughter', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Hannan, Brian Gilbert', 'David W. Rintels', 'Sally Field, Alfred Molina, Sheila Rosenthal, Roshan Seth, Sarah Badel, Mony-Rey, Georges Corraface, Mary Nell Santacroce', 'PG-13', 'An American woman, trapped in Islamic Iran by her brutish husband, must find a way to escape with her daughter as well.', 'An American woman, trapped in Islamic Iran by her brutish husband, must find a way to escape with her daughter as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEMncPIHISpaIJmYaIstS0TVnb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9585'),
  ('653946060595093126', 'Not Without My Handbag', 1993, 'Comedy, Animation, Horror', 'Boris Kossmehl', 'Andrea Friedrich, Boris Kossmehl', 'Robert Booth, Geraldine McEwan, Andrea Friedrich, Alain Debray', 'NR', 'A bizarre, anarchic animation, in which a young girl sees her aunt dragged to hell for missing a payment on the washing machine, only for the undead relative to return from the netherworld to collect her handbag.', 'A bizarre, anarchic animation, in which a young girl sees her aunt dragged to hell for missing a payment on the washing machine, only for the undead relative to return from the netherworld to collect her handbag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRcOEuGRNXNz5Ln6YkuVzOwQrJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54827'),
