  ('461985744144592594', 'Notes Towards an African Orestes', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Giorgio Pelloni', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Gato Barbieri, Donald F. Moye, Marcello Melis, Yvonne Murray, Archie Savage, Pier Paolo Pasolini', null, 'The director presents takes and scenes filmed on location in Africa for a film-that-never-was, a black Oresteia.', 'The director presents takes and scenes filmed on location in Africa for a film-that-never-was, a black Oresteia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZyohZM4zHgILgQlBr7xWK5v8qm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19930'),
  ('1144181228734537388', 'Nothing', 2003, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Derek Rogers, Vincenzo Natali, Bill Spahic', 'Andrew Lowery, Andrew Miller', 'David Hewlett, Andrew Miller, Gordon Pinsent, Marie-Josée Croze, Andrew Lowery, Elana Shilling, Soo Garay, Martin Roach', 'R', 'The film tells the story of two good friends who live together, Andrew, an agoraphobic travel agent who works from his home, and Dave, a loser who works in an office where he is treated with contempt. Just when it seems things can''t get any worse for the two, the entire world outside of their house disappears and is replaced with an endless white void.', 'The film tells the story of two good friends who live together, Andrew, an agoraphobic travel agent who works from his home, and Dave, a loser who works in an office where he is treated with contempt. Just when it seems things can''t get any worse for the two, the entire world outside of their house disappears and is replaced with an endless white void.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vefWBq6xpeMYtF7ROgGfXLdp5Qu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10981'),
  ('591052919497645527', 'Nothing About Robert', 1999, 'Drama', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Christophe Pollock', 'Pascal Bonitzer', 'Fabrice Luchini, Sandrine Kiberlain, Valentina Cervi, Michel Piccoli, Bernadette Lafont, Laurent Lucas, Denis Podalydès, Nathalie Boutefeu', null, 'Didier never knew that a wrong film review of a film which he did not bother to watch would land him in numerous troubles.', 'Didier never knew that a wrong film review of a film which he did not bother to watch would land him in numerous troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHUzO3a0KpcKlfwo09VZksjQUWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72375'),
  ('52915661729568025', 'Nothing Bad Can Happen', 2013, 'Drama, Horror, Crime', 'Katrin Gebbe, Moritz Schultheiß', 'Katrin Gebbe', 'Julius Feldmeier, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Gro Swantje Kohlhof, Annika Kuhl, Daniel Michel, Uwe Dag Berlin, Christoph Jacobi, Til-Niklas Theinert', null, 'Tore, a young lost soul involved with an underground Christian punk movement, falls in with a dysfunctional family who test his seemingly unwavering faith.', 'Tore, a young lost soul involved with an underground Christian punk movement, falls in with a dysfunctional family who test his seemingly unwavering faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKso4HbH3tfcp8Gn90567aZH0xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188758'),
  ('679125006996961410', 'Nothing But a Man', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Roemer, Robert M. Young', 'Michael Roemer, Robert M. Young', 'Ivan Dixon, Abbey Lincoln, Julius Harris, Gloria Foster, Martin Priest, Leonard Parker, Yaphet Kotto, Stanley Greene', null, 'A proud black man and his school-teacher wife face discriminatory challenges in 1960s America.', 'A proud black man and his school-teacher wife face discriminatory challenges in 1960s America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vWkmRHsX1yIUJSimDKEJLU4UkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91721'),
  ('32196062131743601', 'Nothing But the Best', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Clive Donner, Nicolas Roeg, Peter Price', 'Frederic Raphael', 'Alan Bates, Denholm Elliott, Millicent Martin, Harry Andrews, Pauline Delaney, Godfrey Quigley, Alison Leggatt, Lucinda Curtis', 'NR', 'Success has James Brewster''s name written all over it, and he also has his heart set on his boss''s daughter. A con artist hires him to help out on a bank scheme, but then again, James will do anything to get rich and be the most successful businessman in Britain-even if it means murder!!!', 'Success has James Brewster''s name written all over it, and he also has his heart set on his boss''s daughter. A con artist hires him to help out on a bank scheme, but then again, James will do anything to get rich and be the most successful businessman in Britain-even if it means murder!!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3v1Lofl5c3JUcQScV90HTFkxb4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143839'),
  ('940881222199180430', 'Nothing But the Night', 1973, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Peter Sasdy, Kenneth Talbot, Ariel Levy', 'Brian Hayles', 'Christopher Lee, Peter Cushing, Diana Dors, Georgia Brown, Keith Barron, Gwyneth Strong, Fulton Mackay, Michael Gambon', 'PG', 'When various trustees of the Van Traylen Orphanage begin dying in close order, it''s at first written off as a coincidence. But, when a school bus accident very nearly takes out three more of them along with a group of orphans, Col. Bingham and his pathologist friend, Mark, begin looking into the deaths. They come to think the answer lies with one of the girls on the bus, who has vivid memories of things she could not possibly have seen.', 'When various trustees of the Van Traylen Orphanage begin dying in close order, it''s at first written off as a coincidence. But, when a school bus accident very nearly takes out three more of them along with a group of orphans, Col. Bingham and his pathologist friend, Mark, begin looking into the deaths. They come to think the answer lies with one of the girls on the bus, who has vivid memories of things she could not possibly have seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ul8TfnX9iyOjbdT5DXzkg1VNWHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29596'),
  ('138639880937105804', 'Nothing but the Truth', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Elliott Nugent, Charles Lang, Hal Walker', 'Don Hartman, Ken Englund', 'Bob Hope, Paulette Goddard, Edward Arnold, Leif Erickson, Helen Vinson, Willie Best, Catherine Doucet, Glenn Anders', 'NR', 'A stockbroker bets his new partners $10,000 that he can tell the truth, and only the truth, for twenty-four hours.', 'A stockbroker bets his new partners $10,000 that he can tell the truth, and only the truth, for twenty-four hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAO75S7H4XeScobq9l9wCrtQsB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96346'),
  ('618616905437612659', 'Nothing But the Truth', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rod Lurie, Alik Sakharov', 'Rod Lurie', 'Kate Beckinsale, Matt Dillon, Angela Bassett, Alan Alda, Vera Farmiga, David Schwimmer, Courtney B. Vance, Noah Wyle', 'R', 'When reporter Rachel Armstrong writes a story that reveals the identity of a covert CIA operative, the government demands that Rachel reveal her source. She defies the special prosecutor and is thrown in jail. Meanwhile, her attorney, Albert Burnside argues her case all the way to the U.S. Supreme Court.', 'When reporter Rachel Armstrong writes a story that reveals the identity of a covert CIA operative, the government demands that Rachel reveal her source. She defies the special prosecutor and is thrown in jail. Meanwhile, her attorney, Albert Burnside argues her case all the way to the U.S. Supreme Court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueJXKG3PFoDPEhcKtIjP52fCRQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14637'),
