  ('14088887972767366', 'Nothing But Trouble', 1991, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Dan Aykroyd, Dean Cundey, Princess O''Mahoney', 'Dan Aykroyd', 'Chevy Chase, Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Demi Moore, Daniel Baldwin, Taylor Negron, Raymond J. Barry, Tupac Shakur', 'PG-13', 'While attempting to seduce gorgeous lawyer Diane Lightson, wealthy gadabout Chris Thorne agrees to drive her to Atlantic City, N.J. But, when some reckless driving draws the attention of a deeply critical cop, they and the flamboyant "Brazillionaires" who tagged along end up in the court of a grotesque and vengeful judge, who has a special vendetta against the wealthy and erudite.', 'While attempting to seduce gorgeous lawyer Diane Lightson, wealthy gadabout Chris Thorne agrees to drive her to Atlantic City, N.J. But, when some reckless driving draws the attention of a deeply critical cop, they and the flamboyant "Brazillionaires" who tagged along end up in the court of a grotesque and vengeful judge, who has a special vendetta against the wealthy and erudite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Apk5Hbby70diyeMHd2VhxUSHNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11933'),
  ('752763258344906352', 'Nothing Can Stop Us Now', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Cecinelli, Claudio Zamarion', 'Ivan Silvestrini, Luigi Cecinelli', 'Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Federico Costantini, Vincenzo Alfieri, Guglielmo Amendola, Maria Chiara Augenti, Serena Autieri, Paolo Calabresi, Massimo Ghini', null, 'The training trip of 4 "special" boys, one narcoleptic, one internet-dependent, one suffering from Tourette''s Syndrome and one obsessed with hygiene towards self-affirmation and acceptance of one''s differences.', 'The training trip of 4 "special" boys, one narcoleptic, one internet-dependent, one suffering from Tourette''s Syndrome and one obsessed with hygiene towards self-affirmation and acceptance of one''s differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuWfwEkK10bL0pJ1Kw0K3O26dXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227075'),
  ('208188098628669315', 'Nothing Can''t Be Undone by a HotPot', 2024, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Ding Sheng, Ding Yu', 'Xiu Xiaonan, Ding Sheng, Wang Hang', 'Yang Mi, Yu Qian, Tian Yu, Yu Ailei, Li Jiuxiao, Huang Xiaolei', null, 'Man is doing, and heaven is watching. After all, man''s calculations are not as good as heaven''s calculations. Four strangers were sharing the spoils in the backstage warehouse of the theater, unexpectedly getting involved in a murder case. A hot pot was boiling with endless suspense, and greed and deception triggered a series of reversals. Finally, the special identities of the four gradually surfaced, and the mysterious truth was about to be revealed', 'Man is doing, and heaven is watching. After all, man''s calculations are not as good as heaven''s calculations. Four strangers were sharing the spoils in the backstage warehouse of the theater, unexpectedly getting involved in a murder case. A hot pot was boiling with endless suspense, and greed and deception triggered a series of reversals. Finally, the special identities of the four gradually surfaced, and the mysterious truth was about to be revealed', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t23kWsejljyDq2hDXxhUMjMxR2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210377'),
  ('321609135030184739', 'Nothing Compares', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Kathryn Ferguson, Luke Jacobs', 'Eleanor Emptage, Kathryn Ferguson, Michael Mallie', 'Sinéad O''Connor, John Reynolds, Margo Harkin, Kathleen Hanna, Brian D''Arcy, Jeannette Byrne, Paul Byrne, Clodagh Latimer', 'NR', 'Since the beginning of her career, Sinéad O’Connor has used her powerful voice to challenge the narratives she was surrounded by while growing up in predominantly Roman Catholic Ireland. Despite her agency, depth and perspective, O’Connor’s unflinching refusal to conform means that she has often been patronized and unfairly dismissed as an attention-seeking pop star.', 'Since the beginning of her career, Sinéad O’Connor has used her powerful voice to challenge the narratives she was surrounded by while growing up in predominantly Roman Catholic Ireland. Despite her agency, depth and perspective, O’Connor’s unflinching refusal to conform means that she has often been patronized and unfairly dismissed as an attention-seeking pop star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GndW8LtfOonZsqmV3XKgxvmNeY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913845'),
  ('83907609210968177', 'Nothing Else Matters', 2008, 'Drama', 'Daniela Knapp, Julia von Heinz', 'John Quester, Julia von Heinz', 'Paula Kalenberg, Marie-Luise Schramm, Benjamin Kramme, Vinzenz Kiefer, Toni Osmani, Martin Ontrop, Katy Karrenbauer, Anja Beatrice Kaul', null, 'Carla, the runaway with high aims. Lucie, the street girl. Interchanged identities and a shared baby. Collage of a fateful year.', 'Carla, the runaway with high aims. Lucie, the street girl. Interchanged identities and a shared baby. Collage of a fateful year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN3SZ8O22bWQKWPnLXYS1YEOL7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10813'),
  ('745087756830858522', 'Nothing Ever Happens', 1963, 'Drama', 'Juan Antonio Bardem', 'Juan Antonio Bardem, Alfonso Sastre', 'Corinne Marchand, Antonio Casas, Julia Gutiérrez Caba, Alfonso Godá, José Franco, Rafael Bardem, Matilde Muñoz Sampedro, Jean-Pierre Cassel', null, 'A French vedette is forced to leave her touring company behind after she suffers a medical emergency in a village near Burgos, Spain. Her arrival causes a commotion amongst the small-minded inhabitants, most notably her doctor and his wife.', 'A French vedette is forced to leave her touring company behind after she suffers a medical emergency in a village near Burgos, Spain. Her arrival causes a commotion amongst the small-minded inhabitants, most notably her doctor and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKTYkKQgdSS2JkcEHqn38phQETR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140398'),
  ('281870452172595690', 'Nothing Funny', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marek Koterski, Bogdan Stachurski', 'Marek Koterski', 'Cezary Pazura, Marek Kondrat, Ewa Błaszczyk, Henryk Bista, Jerzy Bończak, Krzysztof Kowalewski, Wojciech Wysocki, Piotr Machalica', null, 'One day, hospital orderlies, watching corpse in the morgue, recognize film director. Man, even though he died, he begins to remember his life. He made a career making movies, had numerous mistresses, but never realized their dreams. His life was interspersed with many setbacks that enfeebled him from the inside. Although he made a career in film, he was not happy with his life.', 'One day, hospital orderlies, watching corpse in the morgue, recognize film director. Man, even though he died, he begins to remember his life. He made a career making movies, had numerous mistresses, but never realized their dreams. His life was interspersed with many setbacks that enfeebled him from the inside. Although he made a career in film, he was not happy with his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/safG3ShLh8BtAGyw77qXHz5wXu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24768'),
  ('561248524975128384', 'Nothing in Common', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, John A. Alonzo', 'Rick Podell, Michael Preminger', 'Tom Hanks, Jackie Gleason, Eva Marie Saint, Héctor Elizondo, Barry Corbin, Bess Armstrong, Sela Ward, Cindy Harrell', 'PG', 'A successful advertising executive finds his freewheeling life crashing to a halt when his parents end their longtime marriage.', 'A successful advertising executive finds his freewheeling life crashing to a halt when his parents end their longtime marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2G6Idl1CKJwOt8aFsnJk08sfDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29968'),
  ('344097291370240734', 'Nothing in Return', 2015, 'Drama', 'Daniel Guzmán, Josu Inchaustegui', 'Daniel Guzmán', 'Miguel Herrán, Antonio Bachiller, Antonia Guzmán, Felipe García Vélez, Luis Tosar, María Miguel, Miguel Rellán, Adelfa Calvo', null, 'One summer, Dario flees the hellish environment of his home. Luismi, unconditional friend, a poor devil with pretensions of winning, and Antonia, an old woman who collects abandoned his motorcar furniture, become his new family. Three generations living together in a city too big to be alone.', 'One summer, Dario flees the hellish environment of his home. Luismi, unconditional friend, a poor devil with pretensions of winning, and Antonia, an old woman who collects abandoned his motorcar furniture, become his new family. Three generations living together in a city too big to be alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1a4LucsNHNsyl33ZVyiEaXbTHOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326198'),
  ('853559127624607655', 'Nothing Is Impossible', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matt Shapira, Eitan Almagor', 'Tommy Blaze, Andrea Gyertson Nasfell', 'David A.R. White, Nadia Bjorlin, Steven Bauer, Harry Lennix, Robert Amaya, Stella Parton, Mark Christopher Lawrence, Peter Aylward', 'PG', 'When an NBA team suddenly announces open tryouts, a high school janitor gets a second chance at both love and life.', 'When an NBA team suddenly announces open tryouts, a high school janitor gets a second chance at both love and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QNqDa8aKylMzSHDWHbhPVxDgla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061089'),
  ('161300206758152965', 'Nothing Lasts Forever', 1984, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Fred Schuler, Tom Schiller', 'Tom Schiller', 'Zach Galligan, Apollonia van Ravenstein, Bill Murray, Sam Jaffe, Imogene Coca, Clarice Taylor, Anita Ellis, Dan Aykroyd', 'PG', 'An artist fails a test and is required to direct traffic in New York City''s Holland Tunnel. He winds up falling in love with a beautiful woman, who takes him to the moon on a Lunar Cruiser.', 'An artist fails a test and is required to direct traffic in New York City''s Holland Tunnel. He winds up falling in love with a beautiful woman, who takes him to the moon on a Lunar Cruiser.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6ECO9HVTo4bCYtUfqShMyQKy4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52826'),
  ('16157643066209851', 'Nothing Lasts Forever', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Heloísa Passos, Jason Kohn', null, null, null, 'Hidden from public view, a war is raging inside the diamond industry. When filmmaker Jason Kohn infiltrates this highly secretive world, he uncovers a vast, far reaching crime that threatens the value of every diamond ever mined. At stake is nothing less than the universal symbol of love and commitment - the engagement ring.', 'Hidden from public view, a war is raging inside the diamond industry. When filmmaker Jason Kohn infiltrates this highly secretive world, he uncovers a vast, far reaching crime that threatens the value of every diamond ever mined. At stake is nothing less than the universal symbol of love and commitment - the engagement ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNbM3Zhdg6Ocl8HsVmCdapgE56m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916392'),
  ('634285272325793258', 'Nothing Left to Fear', 2013, 'Horror', 'Anthony Leonardi III', 'Jonathan W.C. Mills', 'Clancy Brown, James Tupper, Anne Heche, Ethan Peck, Jennifer Stone, Rebekah Brandes, Heather Roop, Michelle DeVito', 'R', 'Wendy, her husband Dan and their kids have just moved to the small town of Stull, Kansas, where Dan is the new pastor. But in this sleepy community of friendly neighbors, a horrific series of occurrences awaits them: Their teenage daughter is being tormented by grisly visions. Her younger sister has been marked for a depraved ritual. And deep within the heartland darkness, one of The Seven Gates of Hell demands the blood of the innocent to unleash the creatures of the damned.', 'Wendy, her husband Dan and their kids have just moved to the small town of Stull, Kansas, where Dan is the new pastor. But in this sleepy community of friendly neighbors, a horrific series of occurrences awaits them: Their teenage daughter is being tormented by grisly visions. Her younger sister has been marked for a depraved ritual. And deep within the heartland darkness, one of The Seven Gates of Hell demands the blood of the innocent to unleash the creatures of the damned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65aDPoEpgFvnAK1bgZysjxgSgyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209901'),
  ('690073281372623152', 'Nothing Like a Dame', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Eben Bolter, Roger Michell', null, 'Maggie Smith, Judi Dench, Eileen Atkins, Joan Plowright, Robert Altman, Frank Finlay, John Gielgud, Julian Glover', null, 'BBC Arena''s documentary on the Dames of British Theatre and film featuring Maggie Smith, Eileen Atkins, Judi Dench and Joan Plowright on screen together for the first time as they reminisce over a long summer weekend in a house Joan once shared with Sir Laurence Olivier.', 'BBC Arena''s documentary on the Dames of British Theatre and film featuring Maggie Smith, Eileen Atkins, Judi Dench and Joan Plowright on screen together for the first time as they reminisce over a long summer weekend in a house Joan once shared with Sir Laurence Olivier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97Sa893QJNfT5WGkewPzBv3usfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513648'),
  ('554550729511168505', 'Nothing Like the Holidays', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Richard S. Lederer, Jennifer Deigl, Scott Kevan', 'Alison Swan, Rick Najera', 'Alfred Molina, Elizabeth Peña, Freddy Rodríguez, Luis Guzmán, Jay Hernandez, John Leguizamo, Debra Messing, Vanessa Ferlito', 'PG-13', 'It’s Christmastime and the far-flung members of the Rodriguez family are converging at their parents’ home in Chicago to celebrate the season and rejoice in their youngest brother’s safe return from combat overseas.', 'It’s Christmastime and the far-flung members of the Rodriguez family are converging at their parents’ home in Chicago to celebrate the season and rejoice in their youngest brother’s safe return from combat overseas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veP26wuib65SnkFjyLgFeIWeFzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25852'),
  ('317495782567773635', 'Nothing Personal', 1980, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Bloomfield, Laszlo George, Arthur Ibbetson', 'Robert Kaufman', 'Donald Sutherland, Suzanne Somers, Lawrence Dane, Roscoe Lee Browne, Dabney Coleman, Sean McCann, Chief Dan George, John Dehner', 'PG', 'Environmentally concerned lawyer Abigail Adams works with Professor Roger Keller in his effort to protect baby seals from slaughter.', 'Environmentally concerned lawyer Abigail Adams works with Professor Roger Keller in his effort to protect baby seals from slaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goUabGmcoDUHqltTXXNafznPycB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255837'),
  ('495650481216360915', 'Nothing Personal', 1996, 'Drama', 'Thaddeus O''Sullivan, Dick Pope, Clodagh Conroy', 'Daniel Mornin', 'Ian Hart, John Lynch, James Frain, Michael Gambon, Gary Lydon, Rúaidhrí Conroy, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Jeni Courtney', null, 'A raw depiction of the Belfast ''troubles'' as savage tribal warfare. Set shortly after the 1975 cease fire, the film focuses on the tribulations of Kenny, Protestant leader of a group of Shankill Road Loyalists, and his one-time friend Liam, a Catholic.', 'A raw depiction of the Belfast ''troubles'' as savage tribal warfare. Set shortly after the 1975 cease fire, the film focuses on the tribulations of Kenny, Protestant leader of a group of Shankill Road Loyalists, and his one-time friend Liam, a Catholic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEv3mKU7TMQJDUnPoIDsO0QTts2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125587'),
  ('961366269747874568', 'Nothing Personal', 2009, 'Drama', 'Urszula Antoniak, Daniël Bouquet, Charlie Endean', 'Urszula Antoniak', 'Lotte Verbeek, Stephen Rea, Tom Charlfa, Ann Marie Horan, Fintan Halpenny, Sean McRonnel, Paul Ronan, Fiona Kelly', 'PG-13', 'Alone in her empty flat, from her window Anne observes the people passing by who nervously snatch up the personal belongings and pieces of furniture she has put out on the pavement. Her final gesture of taking a ring off her finger signals she is leaving her previous life in Holland behind. She goes to Ireland, where she chooses to lead a solitary, wandering existence, striding through the austere landscapes of Connemara. During her travels, she discovers a house that is home to a hermit, Martin.', 'Alone in her empty flat, from her window Anne observes the people passing by who nervously snatch up the personal belongings and pieces of furniture she has put out on the pavement. Her final gesture of taking a ring off her finger signals she is leaving her previous life in Holland behind. She goes to Ireland, where she chooses to lead a solitary, wandering existence, striding through the austere landscapes of Connemara. During her travels, she discovers a house that is home to a hermit, Martin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GavXEdItxmP51soWRPPMVRQweV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45806'),
  ('926679547228553610', 'Nothing Sacred', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, Fred Spencer, W. Howard Greene', 'Ben Hecht', 'Carole Lombard, Fredric March, Charles Winninger, Walter Connolly, Sig Ruman, Frank Fay, Troy Brown Sr., Maxie Rosenbloom', 'NR', 'When a small-town girl is incorrectly diagnosed with a rare, deadly disease, an unknowing newspaper columnist turns her into a national heroine.', 'When a small-town girl is incorrectly diagnosed with a rare, deadly disease, an unknowing newspaper columnist turns her into a national heroine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqu30x75SjsPNyDN0A5VedoEqyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37650'),
  ('642394897846136750', 'Nothing Serious', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Lee Sung-jae, Lee Dong-hwa, Jeong Ga-young', 'Wang Hye-ji, Jeong Ga-young', 'Son Suk-ku, Jeon Jong-seo, Gong Min-jeung, Kim Seul-gi, Bae Yu-ram, Kim Jae-hwa, Im Sung-jae, Lim Sun-woo', null, 'Woo-ri, 32, and Ja-young, 28, who both dislike being alone but have particular anxieties when it comes to dating, meet through an app.', 'Woo-ri, 32, and Ja-young, 28, who both dislike being alone but have particular anxieties when it comes to dating, meet through an app.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXG2cSa4QUf5qbgs02T77qHlmLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736545'),
  ('970525956016625349', 'Nothing to Declare', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Dany Boon, Pierre Aïm', 'Yaël Boon, Dany Boon', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Dany Boon, Julie Bernard, Christel Pedrinelli, Joachim Ledeganck, Jean-Paul Dermont, Karin Viard, François Damiens', null, 'During the elimination of the Belgian/French border in the 90s, a Belgian customs officer is forced to team up with one of his French counterparts.', 'During the elimination of the Belgian/French border in the 90s, a Belgian customs officer is forced to team up with one of his French counterparts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqJmmfVavVX9F9De3LQLDlGPc6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52077'),
  ('416295998242161702', 'Nothing to Hide', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fred Cavayé, Denis Rouden, Michaël Laguens', 'Fred Cavayé, Paolo Genovese, Filippo Bologna', 'Bérénice Bejo, Stéphane De Groodt, Suzanne Clément, Roschdy Zem, Doria Tillier, Vincent Elbaz, Grégory Gadebois, Fleur Fitoussi', null, 'To spice up a dinner party, old friends agree to share every private message that pops up on their phones -- with disastrous results.', 'To spice up a dinner party, old friends agree to share every private message that pops up on their phones -- with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGCN6PLWaxlRzNoie3WEnnoxlGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487476'),
  ('1135393349657524661', 'Nothing to Lose', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime, Action, Adventure', 'Steve Oedekerk, Donald E. Thorin, John H. Radulovic', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Martin Lawrence, Tim Robbins, John C. McGinley, Giancarlo Esposito, Kelly Preston, Michael McKean, Rebecca Gayheart, Irma P. Hall', 'R', 'Advertising executive Nick Beame learns that his wife is sleeping with his employer. In a state of despair, he encounters a bumbling thief whose attempted carjacking goes awry when Nick takes him on an involuntary joyride. Soon the betrayed businessman and the incompetent crook strike up a partnership and develop a robbery-revenge scheme. But it turns out that some other criminals in the area don''t appreciate the competition.', 'Advertising executive Nick Beame learns that his wife is sleeping with his employer. In a state of despair, he encounters a bumbling thief whose attempted carjacking goes awry when Nick takes him on an involuntary joyride. Soon the betrayed businessman and the incompetent crook strike up a partnership and develop a robbery-revenge scheme. But it turns out that some other criminals in the area don''t appreciate the competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umbzQyRMeB1oHTKiymTlH591xNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11676'),
  ('206756464608982160', 'Nothing to Lose', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Pieter Kuijpers, Bert Pot', 'Pieter Kuijpers, Paul Jan Nelissen', 'Theo Maassen, Lisa Smit, Bob Schwarze, Ria Marks, Flip Filz, Romana Vrede, Martijn de Rijk, Menno van Beekum', null, 'A man convicted of killing his own father and sister escapes from a long-stay criminal hospital to track down his estranged mother, whom he believes can prove his innocence.', 'A man convicted of killing his own father and sister escapes from a long-stay criminal hospital to track down his estranged mother, whom he believes can prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si4L3xy6GM7NMVcbqYPEjHqpOWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7267'),
  ('850270267948511195', 'Nothing to Lose', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Alexandre Avancini, Pedro Cardillo, Suzy Milstein', 'Stephen P. Lindsey, Emílio Boechat', 'Petrônio Gontijo, Day Mesquita, Beth Goulart, Dalton Vigh, Eduardo Galvão, André Gonçalves, Marcello Airoldi, César Mello', null, 'Authorized biopic of Brazilian evangelical bishop Edir Macedo, founder of the Universal Church of the Kingdom of God and owner of Record TV network. Based on a book trilogy of the same name, the movie tells the story of the self-made man who faced several moments of turbulence while pursuing his conviction.', 'Authorized biopic of Brazilian evangelical bishop Edir Macedo, founder of the Universal Church of the Kingdom of God and owner of Record TV network. Based on a book trilogy of the same name, the movie tells the story of the self-made man who faced several moments of turbulence while pursuing his conviction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Qk9eD3ZqmJ7V8bB28H7gUd1FPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502581'),
  ('59412205393454754', 'Nothing to Lose 2', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alexandre Avancini, Pedro Cardillo', 'Stephen P. Lindsey, Emílio Boechat', 'Petrônio Gontijo, Day Mesquita, Beth Goulart, Dalton Vigh, Eduardo Galvão, César Mello, Leonardo Franco, Raphael Viana', null, 'After leaving prison in 1992, Edir Macedo goes through a series of trials: the inappropriate conduct of other bishops of the Church, the attack of politicians and Catholics, his mother''s illness and the tragedy of the collapse of the roof of a Church in São Paulo .', 'After leaving prison in 1992, Edir Macedo goes through a series of trials: the inappropriate conduct of other bishops of the Church, the attack of politicians and Catholics, his mother''s illness and the tragedy of the collapse of the roof of a Church in São Paulo .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UESbGhUBez8iu4CqVhhmpIueJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580077'),
  ('212571996483182339', 'Nothing to Report', 1973, 'War', 'Yves Boisset', 'Roland Perrot', 'Jacques Spiesser, Jacques Weber, Jean-François Balmer, Jacques Villeret, Claude Brosset, Roland Blanche, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Hamid Djellouli', null, 'In 1956, the professional army of France lacks the manpower to keep the peace in Algeria, the colony which the country is determined to hold on to at any price. For this reason, reservists are called up and subject to an intense period of training before being sent to the front. Rémy March, Alain Charpentier and Raymond Dax are three such young men who have no interest in the military escapade and are reluctant conscripts. What they witness in Algeria will appall and transform them. Rape, torture, executions... there is no end to the atrocities in which they become unwilling participants. No wonder the French military are so willing to proclaim that there is nothing to report...', 'In 1956, the professional army of France lacks the manpower to keep the peace in Algeria, the colony which the country is determined to hold on to at any price. For this reason, reservists are called up and subject to an intense period of training before being sent to the front. Rémy March, Alain Charpentier and Raymond Dax are three such young men who have no interest in the military escapade and are reluctant conscripts. What they witness in Algeria will appall and transform them. Rape, torture, executions... there is no end to the atrocities in which they become unwilling participants. No wonder the French military are so willing to proclaim that there is nothing to report...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEhxEyue2rT22p6i4zYNwHcGp3j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138587'),
  ('781121516645476154', 'Nothing Underneath', 1985, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giuseppe Maccari, Giacomo Lesina', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina, Franco Ferrini', 'Tom Schanley, Renée Simonsen, Donald Pleasence, Nicola Perring, Cyrus Elias, Maria McDonald, Catherine Noyes, Paolo Tomei', null, 'Bob Crane has long maintained a psychic connection to his twin sister, Jessica, who works as a fashion model in Milan. When Bob senses that his sister might be injured or killed, he travels to Italy to look for her, only to discover that she''s vanished without a trace. Enlisting the help of about-to-retire Commissioner Danesi, Bob soon finds himself embroiled in a web of mystery and terror, when a scissors wielding killer begins to strike and all clues lead back to Jessica...', 'Bob Crane has long maintained a psychic connection to his twin sister, Jessica, who works as a fashion model in Milan. When Bob senses that his sister might be injured or killed, he travels to Italy to look for her, only to discover that she''s vanished without a trace. Enlisting the help of about-to-retire Commissioner Danesi, Bob soon finds himself embroiled in a web of mystery and terror, when a scissors wielding killer begins to strike and all clues lead back to Jessica...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjUbUqkKmajJL184Mbzz2VE92qz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62558'),
  ('757439882459700684', 'Notorious', 2009, 'Music, Drama, History', 'George Tillman Jr., Michael Grady', 'Reggie Rock Bythewood, Cheo Hodari Coker', 'Jamal Woolard, Derek Luke, Naturi Naughton, Anthony Mackie, Antonique Smith, Angela Bassett, Marc John Jefferies, Sean Ringgold', 'R', '"Notorious" is the story of Christopher Wallace. Through raw talent and sheer determination, Wallace transforms himself from Brooklyn street hustler (once selling crack to pregnant women) to one of the greatest rappers of all time: The Notorious B.I.G. Follow his meteoric rise to fame and his refusal to succumb to expectations - redefining our notion of "The American Dream."', '"Notorious" is the story of Christopher Wallace. Through raw talent and sheer determination, Wallace transforms himself from Brooklyn street hustler (once selling crack to pregnant women) to one of the greatest rappers of all time: The Notorious B.I.G. Follow his meteoric rise to fame and his refusal to succumb to expectations - redefining our notion of "The American Dream."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62NsZPgueSiE8y7dqtU3FSLFwYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14410'),
  ('436990506335793100', 'Notre Dame', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Valérie Donzelli, Lazare Pedron', 'Benjamin Charbit, Valérie Donzelli', 'Valérie Donzelli, Pierre Deladonchamps, Thomas Scimeca, Bouli Lanners, Virginie Ledoyen, Isabelle Candelier, Philippe Katerine, Samir Guesmi', null, 'Maud is an architect and a mother. Due to a misunderstanding, she wins the competition to refurbish the parvis of Notre-Dame. Torn between these responsibilities and love issues, she will go through an emotional storm.', 'Maud is an architect and a mother. Due to a misunderstanding, she wins the competition to refurbish the parvis of Notre-Dame. Torn between these responsibilities and love issues, she will go through an emotional storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qLNdJ3dXpb0bBZGUJizNDokMm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582886'),
  ('1143350902047815017', 'Notre Dame de Paris - Live Arena di Verona', 2002, 'Drama, Music, Romance, TV Movie', 'Gilles Maheu', 'Luc Plamondon', 'Lola Ponce, Giò di Tonno, Vittorio Matteucci, Matteo Setti, Marco Guerzoni, Graziano Galatone, Claudia D''Ottavi', null, 'Notre Dame de Paris tells the story of Quasimodo, the hunchbacked bell-ringer of the cathedral of Notre-Dame and of his impossible and tragic love for Esmeralda, a beautiful gypsy. A love condemned by injustice and hypocrisy. Quasimodo forced by his ugliness to look at the world from the top of a tower one day he falls madly in love with Esmeralda who sees dancing and singing on the square in front of the cathedral. But Esmeralda is in love with Febo, the handsome captain of the King''s guards. Febo is fiancé of Fiordaliso, a young and rich bourgeois, but the exotic and sensual beauty of the gypsy does not leave indifferent the man who immediately falls in love with her. Even Frollo, the archdeacon of the cathedral, is attracted by the gypsy and spying on the moves of the two lovers in a raptus of jealousy and repressed carnal desire to get rid of the rival stabbing Febo behind.', 'Notre Dame de Paris tells the story of Quasimodo, the hunchbacked bell-ringer of the cathedral of Notre-Dame and of his impossible and tragic love for Esmeralda, a beautiful gypsy. A love condemned by injustice and hypocrisy. Quasimodo forced by his ugliness to look at the world from the top of a tower one day he falls madly in love with Esmeralda who sees dancing and singing on the square in front of the cathedral. But Esmeralda is in love with Febo, the handsome captain of the King''s guards. Febo is fiancé of Fiordaliso, a young and rich bourgeois, but the exotic and sensual beauty of the gypsy does not leave indifferent the man who immediately falls in love with her. Even Frollo, the archdeacon of the cathedral, is attracted by the gypsy and spying on the moves of the two lovers in a raptus of jealousy and repressed carnal desire to get rid of the rival stabbing Febo behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2seSHHCR1rddiy2befy6vfflB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402804'),
  ('1130736200012135258', 'Notre Musique', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Julien Hirsch, Aurélien Poitrimoult', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Sarah Adler, Nade Dieu, Rony Kramer, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, George Aguilar, Ferlyn Brass, Leticia Gutiérrez, Aline Schulmann', null, 'A three-chapter (Hell, Purgatory and Paradise) meditation on the city of Sarajevo in the wake of the Bosnian war, on Palestine and Israel, and on war itself.', 'A three-chapter (Hell, Purgatory and Paradise) meditation on the city of Sarajevo in the wake of the Bosnian war, on Palestine and Israel, and on war itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdVNsn6om2DHOeRyyQtyrYqWKHF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26347'),
  ('92887381314290411', 'Notre-Dame de Paris', 1998, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Gilles Amado, Gilles Maheu', 'Luc Plamondon', 'Hélène Ségara, Daniel Lavoie, Bruno Pelletier, Garou, Patrick Fiori, Luc Mervil, Julie Zenatti', null, 'A musical adaptation of Victor Hugo''s novel "Notre Dame de Paris" which follows the gypsy dancer Esmeralda and the three men who vie for her love: the kind hunchback Quadimodo, the twisted priest Frollo, and the unfaithful soldier Phoebus.', 'A musical adaptation of Victor Hugo''s novel "Notre Dame de Paris" which follows the gypsy dancer Esmeralda and the three men who vie for her love: the kind hunchback Quadimodo, the twisted priest Frollo, and the unfaithful soldier Phoebus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fbjHojfDInGnYKVNOhPALdFa31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56759'),
  ('554613471115473636', 'Notre-Dame on Fire', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Jean-Marie Dreujou, Matthieu de la Mortière', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Thomas Bidegain', 'Samuel Labarthe, Jean-Paul Bordes, Mickaël Chirinian, Jérémie Laheurte, Maximilien Seweryn, Garlan Le Martelot, Dimitri Storoge, Pierre Lottin', null, 'A film relating from the inside the Notre-Dame de Paris fire of April 2019.', 'A film relating from the inside the Notre-Dame de Paris fire of April 2019.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXj3FqzQABWsElUuT9y3WhfGPdT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811596'),
  ('987170440602074795', 'Notte italiana', 1987, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Bruno Nicolai, Agostino Castiglioni', 'Franco Bernini, Carlo Mazzacurati', 'Marco Messeri, Giulia Boschi, Remo Remotti, Silvana De Santis, Antonio Petrocelli, Eraldo Turra, Filippo Cilloni, Roberto Citran', null, 'Otello Morsiani, a north-eastern-italian lawyer, takes the job of estimating land holdings on the Po Delta, which are intended to be expropriated to make way for a national park. The lawyer soon discovers that in that area, once target of methane extraction, the soil is now at risk to sink, due to hydrogeological disturbance: in the meanwhile, he also digs out a mystery tied to a death dating back twenty years before.', 'Otello Morsiani, a north-eastern-italian lawyer, takes the job of estimating land holdings on the Po Delta, which are intended to be expropriated to make way for a national park. The lawyer soon discovers that in that area, once target of methane extraction, the soil is now at risk to sink, due to hydrogeological disturbance: in the meanwhile, he also digs out a mystery tied to a death dating back twenty years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deO4xFTINsWg2QD4dznhGQVtX1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262672'),
  ('74568140205998059', 'Notte prima degli esami 3.0', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tommaso Renzoni', 'Tommaso Renzoni, Fausto Brizzi', 'Tommaso Cassissa, Sabrina Ferilli, Adriano Moretti', null, 'On the eve of high school, a group of Roman students find themselves living their last great adventure together: secret loves, betrayals, friendships put to the test and desperate plans to deceive the school''s most dreaded teacher.', 'On the eve of high school, a group of Roman students find themselves living their last great adventure together: secret loves, betrayals, friendships put to the test and desperate plans to deceive the school''s most dreaded teacher.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FakMWdGoPmiBNBTCX3WpMLr8q2u3.jpg', 'plex:movie:notte-prima-degli-esami-3-0'),
  ('138968696750949486', 'Notti in bianco, baci a colazione', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Francesco Mandelli, Massimo Schiavon', 'Salvatore De Mola', 'Alessio Vassallo, Ilaria Spada, Giordano De Plano, Tess Masazza, Niccolò Senni, Enzo Garinei, Michael Ounsa, Daniela Amato', null, 'Matteo, a forty-year-old cartoonist, divides his time between work and family and nurtures the dream of publishing his own comic book starring Solo Valentine, a selfish superhero who uses his powers only for himself. He is married to Paola, a successful writer. A pleasant family picture, with three daughters, Virginia (9), Ginevra (6), Melania (2), and two dogs, is thrown into crisis when Sara, an old acquaintance of Matteo''s, reappears with an offer he cannot refuse: to publish his comic book on condition that he moves to Paris.', 'Matteo, a forty-year-old cartoonist, divides his time between work and family and nurtures the dream of publishing his own comic book starring Solo Valentine, a selfish superhero who uses his powers only for himself. He is married to Paola, a successful writer. A pleasant family picture, with three daughters, Virginia (9), Ginevra (6), Melania (2), and two dogs, is thrown into crisis when Sara, an old acquaintance of Matteo''s, reappears with an offer he cannot refuse: to publish his comic book on condition that he moves to Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqXz2Uk52B3fELfaHENfnCDSZbn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826763'),
  ('698238835646460427', 'Notting Hill', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Coulter, Roger Michell, Christopher Newman', 'Richard Curtis', 'Julia Roberts, Hugh Grant, Gina McKee, Tim McInnerny, Rhys Ifans, Emma Chambers, Hugh Bonneville, Richard McCabe', 'PG-13', 'London bookstore owner William Thacker''s quiet life turns upside down when a chance encounter with famous actress Anna Scott sparks an unlikely romance challenged by their vastly different worlds.', 'London bookstore owner William Thacker''s quiet life turns upside down when a chance encounter with famous actress Anna Scott sparks an unlikely romance challenged by their vastly different worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHRIf2XHeQMbyRb3HUx19SF5Ujw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509'),
  ('1056663180172220297', 'Notturno', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Gianfranco Rosi, Giuseppe Del Volgo, Gianfranco Rosi', 'Gianfranco Rosi', null, null, 'Shot over three years on the borders between Iraq, Kurdistan, Syria and Lebanon, the film depicts the everyday struggles of people attempting to rebuild their lives amongst the devastating effects of civil wars, dictatorships, foreign invasions, and the deadly presence of ISIS.', 'Shot over three years on the borders between Iraq, Kurdistan, Syria and Lebanon, the film depicts the everyday struggles of people attempting to rebuild their lives amongst the devastating effects of civil wars, dictatorships, foreign invasions, and the deadly presence of ISIS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncvrZmFYoLdl9xWnGRNFK5iCg1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539529'),
  ('7006833753667127', 'Nour', 2020, 'Drama', 'Maurizio Zaccaro, Fabio Olmi', 'Maurizio Zaccaro, Monica Zapelli, Imma Vitelli', 'Sergio Castellitto, Linda Mresy, Raffaella Rea, Valeria D''Obici, Thierry Toscan, Fabio Bussotti, Martina Palmitesta', null, 'After a shipwreck, a Syrian girl arrives alone on a Sicilian island. A doctor sets out to find her origins and her mother.', 'After a shipwreck, a Syrian girl arrives alone on a Sicilian island. A doctor sets out to find her origins and her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wZa0MRe54EZa4DDpBA3KrKk5wR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654896'),
  ('1008297318192371155', 'Nous York', 2012, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Géraldine Nakache, Hervé Mimran, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Hervé Mimran, Géraldine Nakache', 'Leïla Bekhti, Géraldine Nakache, Manu Payet, Nader Boussandel, Baptiste Lecaplain, Marthe Villalonga, Dree Hemingway, Sienna Miller', null, 'Thirty-somethings Michaël, Nabil and Sylvain head to New York to surprise their friend Samia on her birthday, secretly arranged with the help of another friend, Gabrielle. The two women had moved to NYC two years previously to try their luck. Samia shares a fabulous loft with a renowned American actress and works as her assistant. Gabrielle has a more mundane job in a small retirement home. Transposed to New York, the close bonds formed over the years between the five friends from a housing project on the outskirts of Paris take on a different aspect. The laughter and emotion is dictated by the adventures they share during their stay, from the daily lives of the women to the discovery of this cult city.', 'Thirty-somethings Michaël, Nabil and Sylvain head to New York to surprise their friend Samia on her birthday, secretly arranged with the help of another friend, Gabrielle. The two women had moved to NYC two years previously to try their luck. Samia shares a fabulous loft with a renowned American actress and works as her assistant. Gabrielle has a more mundane job in a small retirement home. Transposed to New York, the close bonds formed over the years between the five friends from a housing project on the outskirts of Paris take on a different aspect. The laughter and emotion is dictated by the adventures they share during their stay, from the daily lives of the women to the discovery of this cult city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzLo4istGVrOinSzR2dUG5qFcUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141581'),
  ('986092093453360739', 'Nouvelle Vague', 1990, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, William Lubtchansky, Claude Chiquet', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Alain Delon, Domiziana Giordano, Jacques Dacqmine, Christophe Odent, Roland Amstutz, Cécile Reigher, Laurence Côte, Joe Sheridan', null, 'Composed entirely of literary quotations from many different sources and from several historical periods, the loose narrative concerns a drifter found by a rich woman who soon falls in love with him. A drowning accident takes place and the drifter dies, but some time later he reappears in the woman’s life looking for a job. Or could it be the man’s twin brother?', 'Composed entirely of literary quotations from many different sources and from several historical periods, the loose narrative concerns a drifter found by a rich woman who soon falls in love with him. A drowning accident takes place and the drifter dies, but some time later he reappears in the woman’s life looking for a job. Or could it be the man’s twin brother?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFofqGMcfiIoDISZBjctw2qggla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32691'),
  ('621290866396395663', 'Nouvelle Vague', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Richard Linklater, David Chambille, Sarah Andriamanankaja', 'Holly Gent, Laetitia Masson, Vincent Palmo Jr.', 'Guillaume Marbeck, Zoey Deutch, Aubry Dullin, Adrien Rouyard, Antoine Besson, Jodie Ruth-Forest, Bruno Dreyfürst, Benjamin Cléry', 'R', 'After writing for Cahiers du cinéma, a young Jean-Luc Godard decides making films is the best film criticism. He convinces producer Georges de Beauregard to fund a low-budget feature, and creates a treatment with fellow New Wave filmmaker François Truffaut about a gangster couple. The result? Breathless, one of the first features of the Nouvelle Vague era of French cinema.', 'After writing for Cahiers du cinéma, a young Jean-Luc Godard decides making films is the best film criticism. He convinces producer Georges de Beauregard to fund a low-budget feature, and creates a treatment with fellow New Wave filmmaker François Truffaut about a gangster couple. The result? Breathless, one of the first features of the Nouvelle Vague era of French cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfE7DZ0DPgme6I58dlYp1Bo9xeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1254808'),
  ('358304927905910491', 'Nova Lituania', 2020, 'Drama', 'Karolis Kaupinis, Simonas Glinskis, Sabina Katkeviciute', 'Karolis Kaupinis', 'Aleksas Kazanavičius, Vaidotas Martinaitis, Valentinas Masalskis, Rasa Samuolytė, Roberta Sirgedaitė, Eglė Gabrėnaitė, Julius Žalakevičius, Vidmantas Fijalkauskas', null, 'During the interwar period, a Lithuanian geography professor tries to convince the government to establish a backup state overseas, in order to save their country from ruin. However, the idea is mostly mocked and opposed. Still, there is hope in the secret support from the elderly prime minister, who has become disillusioned with politics.', 'During the interwar period, a Lithuanian geography professor tries to convince the government to establish a backup state overseas, in order to save their country from ruin. However, the idea is mostly mocked and opposed. Still, there is hope in the secret support from the elderly prime minister, who has become disillusioned with politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdJlh4KjnJeJJjbJDYZp5Gp3lAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609025'),
  ('916753374392650242', 'Nova Zembla', 2011, 'History, Drama', 'Reinout Oerlemans, Lennert Hillege', 'Hugo Heinen, Gerrit de Veer', 'Robert de Hoog, Jan Decleir, Derek de Lint, Doutzen Kroes, Victor Reinier, Juda Goslinga, Bas Keijzer, Teun Kuilboer', null, 'Gerrit de Veer, a novice writer on a 16th-century Dutch merchant vessel, chronicles the daring mission to discover a trade route across the North Pole to Asia. But the heroic journey turns into tragedy when the ship gets stuck in the relentless, penetrating ice. The men are forced to spend the winter on the frozen, arctic wasteland of Nova Zembla, fighting polar bears, hunger and lethal temperatures. Their chances of making it until the following spring are virtually zero.', 'Gerrit de Veer, a novice writer on a 16th-century Dutch merchant vessel, chronicles the daring mission to discover a trade route across the North Pole to Asia. But the heroic journey turns into tragedy when the ship gets stuck in the relentless, penetrating ice. The men are forced to spend the winter on the frozen, arctic wasteland of Nova Zembla, fighting polar bears, hunger and lethal temperatures. Their chances of making it until the following spring are virtually zero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg4aTHsc5yvD9DsEYsUfhHNVkH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79040'),
  ('16307474631817135', 'November', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Achero Mañas, Juan Carlos Gómez', null, 'Óscar Jaenada, Ingrid Rubio, Javier Ríos, Adriana Domínguez, Jordi Padrosa, Núria Gago, Juanma Rodríguez, Héctor Alterio', null, 'Impelled by a spirit which still preserves a patina of idealism, Alfredo arrives to Madrid with the intention to create "a performance that is free, straight from the heart, capable of making people feel alive". His concept of what acting should be begins beyond the stage, out in the streets face to face with the public. Outdoors, in any town square, in a park or in the city''s most commercial street, Alfredo and his troupe November start the show; demons to provoke passers-by, displays of social conscience, actions taken to the extreme to put the forces of law and order on full alert. There are no limits, no censorship; only ideas which are always valid so long as the public ceases to be the public and becomes part of the show swept by surprise, fear, tears or laughter. Theater as life, life as theater… there is no longer any difference.', 'Impelled by a spirit which still preserves a patina of idealism, Alfredo arrives to Madrid with the intention to create "a performance that is free, straight from the heart, capable of making people feel alive". His concept of what acting should be begins beyond the stage, out in the streets face to face with the public. Outdoors, in any town square, in a park or in the city''s most commercial street, Alfredo and his troupe November start the show; demons to provoke passers-by, displays of social conscience, actions taken to the extreme to put the forces of law and order on full alert. There are no limits, no censorship; only ideas which are always valid so long as the public ceases to be the public and becomes part of the show swept by surprise, fear, tears or laughter. Theater as life, life as theater… there is no longer any difference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K52ZhGL1XfD4Ds33WZIYHFpNum.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9775'),
  ('783499546094214653', 'November', 2004, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nancy Schreiber, Greg Harrison', 'Benjamin Brand', 'Courteney Cox, James Le Gros, Michael Ealy, Nora Dunn, Nick Offerman, Anne Archer, Matthew Carey, Robert Wu', 'R', 'Sophie Jacobs is going through the most difficult time of her life. Now, she just has to find out if it''s real.', 'Sophie Jacobs is going through the most difficult time of her life. Now, she just has to find out if it''s real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqCn3bYlG85dlVdUBd5Vjv3i0Qg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1424'),
  ('500957896669004741', 'November', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Horror', 'Kadri Kask, Helen Valkna, Rainer Sarnet', 'Rainer Sarnet', 'Rea Lest-Liik, Jörgen Liik, Arvo Kukumägi, Heino Kalm, Meelis Rämmeld, Katariina Unt, Taavi Eelmaa, Dieter Laser', null, 'In a poor Estonian village, a group of peasants use magic and folk remedies to survive the winter, and a young woman tries to get a young man to love her.', 'In a poor Estonian village, a group of peasants use magic and folk remedies to survive the winter, and a young woman tries to get a young man to love her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMqtCSzSAB9Aiw8yiuUKBoxEeAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437583'),
  ('355676663984209269', 'November', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Cédric Jimenez, Nicolas Loir, Fabien Vergez', 'Olivier Demangel', 'Jean Dujardin, Anaïs Demoustier, Sandrine Kiberlain, Jérémie Renier, Lyna Khoudri, Cédric Kahn, Sofian Khammes, Sami Outalbali', null, 'In November 2015, a series of unprecedented and deadly attacks hits Paris. The anti-terrorist police led by Heloise and her chief commander Fred face an unprecedented level of pressure. In a race against the clock, they must find the perpetrators of the attacks as quickly as possible before they can strike again, travelling across Europe and beyond in one of the biggest manhunts in history.', 'In November 2015, a series of unprecedented and deadly attacks hits Paris. The anti-terrorist police led by Heloise and her chief commander Fred face an unprecedented level of pressure. In a race against the clock, they must find the perpetrators of the attacks as quickly as possible before they can strike again, travelling across Europe and beyond in one of the biggest manhunts in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5wae5M81jLTuv3WbCJfORxapRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823951'),
  ('955094197160062820', 'November 30th', 1995, 'Drama', 'Daniel Fridell, Bengt Widell', 'Daniel Fridell', 'Göran Gillinger, María Celedonio, Ray Jones IV, Jonas Karlsson, Frida Hallgren, Goran Marjanović, Peter L. Abrahamsson, Stefan Sauk', null, 'On November 30th (the date when King Karl XII died) there will usually be demonstrations by hyper-national and neo-Nazi groups, and also democratic counter demonstrations. The plot of "West Side Story" is transferred to the Stockholmian suburb Alby where many immigrants live. But the film is no plagiarism, in particular no so because many scenes have the intensive character of live transmission. The boy (Adam) belongs to a Nazi group whose racial attitude is foremost directed against immigrants with ''wrong'' colour of hair or skin. The girl (Julia) belongs to a family of political fugitives from Peru. Adam and Julia immediately fall in great and reciprocal love, and there are highly emotional love scenes. Therefore Adam breaks with his group. But when his best friend is killed by Julia''s brother, he kills the brother. In turn the couple is hunted by the police and Julia''s relatives. Both Adam and Julia are finally murdered. The film takes no step toward reconciliation.', 'On November 30th (the date when King Karl XII died) there will usually be demonstrations by hyper-national and neo-Nazi groups, and also democratic counter demonstrations. The plot of "West Side Story" is transferred to the Stockholmian suburb Alby where many immigrants live. But the film is no plagiarism, in particular no so because many scenes have the intensive character of live transmission. The boy (Adam) belongs to a Nazi group whose racial attitude is foremost directed against immigrants with ''wrong'' colour of hair or skin. The girl (Julia) belongs to a family of political fugitives from Peru. Adam and Julia immediately fall in great and reciprocal love, and there are highly emotional love scenes. Therefore Adam breaks with his group. But when his best friend is killed by Julia''s brother, he kills the brother. In turn the couple is hunted by the police and Julia''s relatives. Both Adam and Julia are finally murdered. The film takes no step toward reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXxQykGtBthp9Mnrj6NfwXEVnRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77343'),
  ('744460069631754274', 'November Child', 2008, 'Drama', 'Christian Schwochow, Frank Lamm', 'Heide Schwochow, Christian Schwochow', 'Anna Maria Mühe, Ulrich Matthes, Christine Schorn, Hermann Beyer, Yevgeni Sitokhin, Ilja Pletner, Thorsten Merten, Adrian Topol', null, 'Malchow, German Democratic Republic, 1980. 20-year-old Anne is hiding Juri, a deserter of the Red Army. The two fall in love with each other. But their love is threatened: there is an arrest warrant and possibly a death sentence waiting for Juri. The two leave the country and flee to the West, leaving Anne’s six-month-old daughter Inga behind. Inga grows up with her grandparents and thinks that her mother died during a swimming accident. 25 years later she meets the literature professor Robert, who sends her on the trail of her past. He met Inga’s mother Anne during one of his seminars. At first Inga is resistant, but then she asks for Robert’s help. Together they take off on a journey through Germany, in search of Inga’s mother Anne...', 'Malchow, German Democratic Republic, 1980. 20-year-old Anne is hiding Juri, a deserter of the Red Army. The two fall in love with each other. But their love is threatened: there is an arrest warrant and possibly a death sentence waiting for Juri. The two leave the country and flee to the West, leaving Anne’s six-month-old daughter Inga behind. Inga grows up with her grandparents and thinks that her mother died during a swimming accident. 25 years later she meets the literature professor Robert, who sends her on the trail of her past. He met Inga’s mother Anne during one of his seminars. At first Inga is resistant, but then she asks for Robert’s help. Together they take off on a journey through Germany, in search of Inga’s mother Anne...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEJpJtT1MeP5WfzQdSdbnJdLycz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12565'),
  ('879855401042089677', 'November Criminals', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sacha Gervasi, Mihai Malaimare Jr.', 'Sacha Gervasi, Steven Knight', 'Ansel Elgort, Chloë Grace Moretz, David Strathairn, Catherine Keener, Terry Kinney, Cory Hardrict, Philip Ettinger, Danny Flaherty', 'PG-13', 'When Addison investigates the murder of his friend Kevin with the help of Phoebe, they discover that the truth is darker than they had ever imagined.', 'When Addison investigates the murder of his friend Kevin with the help of Phoebe, they discover that the truth is darker than they had ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j22QBwmEClhpGiRrELXiEBOw81D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317091'),
  ('860363097966744058', 'Novia, esposa y amante', 1981, null, 'Tulio Demicheli', null, 'Daniela Romo, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Raúl Ramírez, Guillermo Capetillo, Víctor Junco, Tito Junco', null, 'Aspiring actress finds herself sidetracked from her goals when she gets romanced-up by her director. It''s all downhill from there.', 'Aspiring actress finds herself sidetracked from her goals when she gets romanced-up by her director. It''s all downhill from there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLUD1GmN7LMtITZBXC3KT5CmHKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441780'),
  ('325400270565561091', 'Novios por Navidad', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Henry Colmenares', 'César Sierra, Annie Van der Dys', 'Gonzalo García Vivanco, Marjorie de Sousa', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isUvxW0QNji65PFFtsktvk0yqcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1224439'),
  ('314265446033506523', 'Novitiate', 2017, 'Drama', 'Margaret Betts, Kat Westergaard, Justin Mickelson', 'Margaret Betts', 'Margaret Qualley, Melissa Leo, Julianne Nicholson, Dianna Agron, Lisa Stewart, Morgan Saylor, Liana Liberato, Rebecca Dayan', 'R', 'In the early 1960s, during the Vatican II era, a young woman training to become a nun struggles with issues of faith, sexuality and the changing church.', 'In the early 1960s, during the Vatican II era, a young woman training to become a nun struggles with issues of faith, sexuality and the changing church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntsyazWKclgwObVftWVVAEBcvRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411976'),
  ('612835152555155733', 'Novo', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Pierre Limosin, Julien Hirsch', 'Jean-Pierre Limosin, Christophe Honoré', 'Eduardo Noriega, Anna Mouglalis, Paz Vega, Nathalie Richard, Éric Caravaca, Julie Gayet, Agathe Dronne, Lény Bueno', null, 'After an injury, Graham suffers from short-term memory loss, which causes him to fall back into the abyss of amnesia every 10 minutes. Those around him both profit and suffer from his condition -- his sex-crazed boss, Sabine, tricks him into regular trysts, while his family tries to come to terms with the situation. But when temp Irene starts working at Graham''s company, they fall into an affair that begins to make a mark on his memory.', 'After an injury, Graham suffers from short-term memory loss, which causes him to fall back into the abyss of amnesia every 10 minutes. Those around him both profit and suffer from his condition -- his sex-crazed boss, Sabine, tricks him into regular trysts, while his family tries to come to terms with the situation. But when temp Irene starts working at Graham''s company, they fall into an affair that begins to make a mark on his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvLuYTjKxsuglCyhOT4zg9Vb0Ww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60015'),
  ('689378279123283620', 'Novocaine', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'David Atkins, Vilko Filač, Craig Jackson', 'David Atkins', 'Steve Martin, Helena Bonham Carter, Laura Dern, Lynne Thigpen, Chelcie Ross, Polly Noonan, JoBe Cerny, Elias Koteas', 'R', 'A dentist finds himself a murder suspect after a sexy patient seduces him into prescribing her drugs.', 'A dentist finds himself a murder suspect after a sexy patient seduces him into prescribing her drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZVFepWKzYho4DLhyFVuRk7klZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20794'),
  ('671227051797983094', 'Novocaine', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Dan Berk, Robert Olsen, Jacques Jouffret', 'Lars Jacobson', 'Jack Quaid, Amber Midthunder, Ray Nicholson, Jacob Batalon, Betty Gabriel, Matt Walsh, Conrad Kemp, Evan Hengst', 'R', 'When the girl of his dreams is kidnapped, everyman Nate turns his inability to feel pain into an unexpected strength in his fight to get her back.', 'When the girl of his dreams is kidnapped, everyman Nate turns his inability to feel pain into an unexpected strength in his fight to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmMHGz9dVRaMY6rRAlEX4W0Wdhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195506'),
  ('896644003380792229', 'Now & Later', 2009, 'Drama', 'Philippe Diaz, Denise Brassard', 'Philippe Diaz', 'Keller Wortham, Shari Solanis, Luis Fernandez-Gil, Adrian Quiñonez, Marcellina Walker', 'R', 'Sex, politics and American culture are mixed into a combustible combination in Now & Later. Angela is an illegal Latina immigrant living in Los Angeles who stumbles across Bill, a disgraced banker on the run. She takes him in. Through passionate sex, soul-searching conversations ranging from politics to philosophy, and other worldly pleasures, Angela introduces Bill to another worldview. As their affair heats up, the course of Bill''s life begins to take an abrupt and unexpected turn.', 'Sex, politics and American culture are mixed into a combustible combination in Now & Later. Angela is an illegal Latina immigrant living in Los Angeles who stumbles across Bill, a disgraced banker on the run. She takes him in. Through passionate sex, soul-searching conversations ranging from politics to philosophy, and other worldly pleasures, Angela introduces Bill to another worldview. As their affair heats up, the course of Bill''s life begins to take an abrupt and unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jzfAMLbTfHaGiNn6hGKty0OzDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68335'),
  ('1054181714537186999', 'Now and Forever', 1934, 'Drama', 'Henry Hathaway, Harry Fischbeck', 'Vincent Lawrence, Sylvia Thalberg', 'Gary Cooper, Shirley Temple, Carole Lombard, Guy Standing, Charlotte Granville, Gilbert Emery, Henry Kolker, Tetsu Komai', null, 'Freewheeling wanderer Jerry Day and his beautiful wife Toni are at odds over their lifestyle. Jerry can''t accept responsibility, but Toni yearns for a family and a settled life. Then the Days ''rediscover'' Jerry''s young daughter Pennie, who has been living with his rich deceased wife''s family. Pennie appears to be just what Jerry needs to mend his swindling ways and lead a straight life. Then a corruptible influence enters his life.', 'Freewheeling wanderer Jerry Day and his beautiful wife Toni are at odds over their lifestyle. Jerry can''t accept responsibility, but Toni yearns for a family and a settled life. Then the Days ''rediscover'' Jerry''s young daughter Pennie, who has been living with his rich deceased wife''s family. Pennie appears to be just what Jerry needs to mend his swindling ways and lead a straight life. Then a corruptible influence enters his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbIsZSPNfXj0ujRQIVuR9ZrT6A1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51277'),
  ('526654193772918546', 'Now and Then', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lesli Linka Glatter, Ueli Steiger', 'I. Marlene King', 'Christina Ricci, Rosie O''Donnell, Thora Birch, Melanie Griffith, Gaby Hoffmann, Demi Moore, Ashleigh Aston Moore, Rita Wilson', 'PG-13', 'Waxing nostalgic about the bittersweet passage from childhood to puberty, four childhood girlfriends — Teeny, Chrissy, Samantha and Roberta — recall the magical summer of 1970. During their walk down memory lane, they reconcile experiences with boys, secrets, bullies and more.', 'Waxing nostalgic about the bittersweet passage from childhood to puberty, four childhood girlfriends — Teeny, Chrissy, Samantha and Roberta — recall the magical summer of 1970. During their walk down memory lane, they reconcile experiences with boys, secrets, bullies and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q31Ks8oAmM4Nq2CcGjyYYpdBAmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9263'),
  ('833888970237535399', 'Now Hear This', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'G', 'In this surreal cartoon that plays with the idea of sound effects, a near-deaf old man finds one of the devil''s lost horns and tries to use it as an ear trumpet.', 'In this surreal cartoon that plays with the idea of sound effects, a near-deaf old man finds one of the devil''s lost horns and tries to use it as an ear trumpet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6s32KJEzF8saRma2Y0BBNg2l8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102188'),
  ('1031557544736707690', 'Now I Met Her', 2026, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Xiao Luxi, Zilong Liu', 'Xiao Luxi, Wu Fuli, Zhang Yuxin', 'Ma Sichun, White-K, Huang Minghao, Sunny Sun, Liang Jingkang, Ji Jiahe, Wang Tianfang', null, 'An 18-year-old discovers his late mother’s diary and begins piecing together the exuberant, complicated life she once led.', 'An 18-year-old discovers his late mother’s diary and begins piecing together the exuberant, complicated life she once led.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jv5NlASaYmGkaIad07g0iu0s75B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421609'),
  ('1119541250454410062', 'Now Is Good', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ol Parker, Erik Wilson', 'Ol Parker', 'Dakota Fanning, Jeremy Irvine, Kaya Scodelario, Olivia Williams, Paddy Considine, Edgar Canham, Joe Cole, Rose Leslie', 'PG-13', 'A girl dying of leukemia compiles a list of things she''d like to do before passing away. Topping the list is her desire to lose her virginity.', 'A girl dying of leukemia compiles a list of things she''d like to do before passing away. Topping the list is her desire to lose her virginity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOBHF6qWtMkzwpnrLDTKJPAb3zH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90369'),
  ('744138118915164509', 'Now Judge...', 1966, 'Drama', 'Nikolay Topchiy, Vladimir Dovgan, Yu. Khomenko', 'Aleksandr Korneychuk', 'Pyotr Glebov, Irina Vavilova, Georgi Zhzhyonov, Boris Livanov, Ninel Myshkova, Gennadi Karnovich-Valua, Gennadiy Yukhtin', null, 'The fate of Illarion Groza was tragic. Many years ago, upon returning from the front, he learned that his wife had given birth to a daughter by an Italian officer, and he shot her with his machine gun. But even now, Illarion cannot forget his wife, forgive her betrayal, or justify his cruelty. And that is why his relationship with his daughter Yulka is so dramatic and tense... The artist Bogutovsky, who lives in the captivity of false pompous art, carries the burden of past years... After hearing Illarion''s story, the writer Iskra destroys the manuscript of his play: life turns out to be much more complicated than he imagined.', 'The fate of Illarion Groza was tragic. Many years ago, upon returning from the front, he learned that his wife had given birth to a daughter by an Italian officer, and he shot her with his machine gun. But even now, Illarion cannot forget his wife, forgive her betrayal, or justify his cruelty. And that is why his relationship with his daughter Yulka is so dramatic and tense... The artist Bogutovsky, who lives in the captivity of false pompous art, carries the burden of past years... After hearing Illarion''s story, the writer Iskra destroys the manuscript of his play: life turns out to be much more complicated than he imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8ggBsgDvkB3BZcmAfinEl7PZZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636261'),
  ('697704005025489366', 'Now or Never', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Fred C. Newmeyer, Hal Roach', 'H.M. Walker, Sam Taylor', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, Anna Mae Bilson, Roy Brooks, Sammy Brooks, William Gillespie, Wally Howe, Charles Stevenson', 'NR', 'A young man, unaccustomed to children, must accompany a young girl on a train trip.', 'A young man, unaccustomed to children, must accompany a young girl on a train trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4RBncEQp1REwvF9AqJ19YyVmNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53518'),
  ('343458358866232384', 'Now or Never', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Roy Bava, Lucio Pellegrini, Gherardo Gossi', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Roan Johnson, Angelo Carbone', 'Jacopo Bonvicini, Violante Placido, Edoardo Gabbriellini, Elio Germano, Camilla Filippi, Paolo Sassanelli, Thomas Trabacchi, Toni Bertorelli', null, '2001. Soon-to-be-graduate David gets involved in the anti-globalization movement after falling for activist Viola in the months preceding the fateful events of the G8 summit in Genoa.', '2001. Soon-to-be-graduate David gets involved in the anti-globalization movement after falling for activist Viola in the months preceding the fateful events of the G8 summit in Genoa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIiaessOGWwtKKLzWrjQq3XBQ9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138449'),
  ('789649459899695480', 'Now That Summer Is Gone', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Frank Tashlin, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Summer is gone, and throughout the forest young squirrels are working hard gathering acorns for the long cold winter ahead. But one such squirrel has a better idea: winning acorns by shooting dice.', 'Summer is gone, and throughout the forest young squirrels are working hard gathering acorns for the long cold winter ahead. But one such squirrel has a better idea: winning acorns by shooting dice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KbEKB5EPwO21OjYv0kiOJ1J3MD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164794'),
  ('220105067810207603', 'Now Where Did the Seventh Company Get to?', 1973, 'Comedy, War', 'Robert Lamoureux, Bernard Toublanc-Michel, Bernard Cassan', 'Robert Lamoureux', 'Pierre Mondy, Jean Lefebvre, Aldo Maccione, Érik Colin, Alain Doutey, Robert Lamoureux, Pierre Tornade, Jacques Marin', null, '1940: During the chaotic running fights of the French army the 7th company disappears - nobody knows they''ve been taken captive. Only their scouting patrol, three witty but lazy guys, can escape and now wanders around behind the German lines. They''d like to just stay out the fights, but a Lieutenant urges them to use a captured truck to break through to their troops.', '1940: During the chaotic running fights of the French army the 7th company disappears - nobody knows they''ve been taken captive. Only their scouting patrol, three witty but lazy guys, can escape and now wanders around behind the German lines. They''d like to just stay out the fights, but a Lieutenant urges them to use a captured truck to break through to their troops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGbSIQ9HumvikBxllond5uCVXjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93289'),
  ('236542854422270997', 'Now You See Him, Now You Don''t', 1972, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Robert Butler', 'Joseph L. McEveety', 'Kurt Russell, Cesar Romero, Joe Flynn, Jim Backus, William Windom, Frank Welker, Joyce Menges, Michael McGreevey', 'G', 'Dexter Riley is a science student at Medfield College who inadvertently invents a liquid capable of rendering objects and people invisible. Before Dexter and his friends, Debbie and Richard Schuyler, can even enjoy their spectacular discovery, corrupt businessman A.J. Arno plots to get his greedy hands on it. Slapstick hijinks ensue as Dexter and his pals try to thwart the evil Arno before he can use the invisibility spray to rob a bank.', 'Dexter Riley is a science student at Medfield College who inadvertently invents a liquid capable of rendering objects and people invisible. Before Dexter and his friends, Debbie and Richard Schuyler, can even enjoy their spectacular discovery, corrupt businessman A.J. Arno plots to get his greedy hands on it. Slapstick hijinks ensue as Dexter and his pals try to thwart the evil Arno before he can use the invisibility spray to rob a bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80q0lUxs7lsSTTAbt7wPCVWzJLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24236'),
  ('397344700599271298', 'Now You See It...', 2005, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Mystery', 'Duwayne Dunham, Robert Seaman, Ann C. Salzer', 'Bill Fritz', 'Aly Michalka, Johnny Pacar, Frank Langella, Brendan Hill, Chris Olivero, Gabriel Sunday, Amanda Shaw, Deneen Tyler', 'G', 'While producing a reality TV show, a teenager meets a magician whose powers are real but put him in danger.', 'While producing a reality TV show, a teenager meets a magician whose powers are real but put him in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rr9fg4Z3lOWIaB0l62T4aFxIhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26267'),
  ('1030460260244239232', 'Now You See Me', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Louis Leterrier, Mitchell Amundsen, Larry Fong', 'Edward Ricourt, Ed Solomon, Boaz Yakin', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Woody Harrelson, Isla Fisher, Dave Franco, Mark Ruffalo, Mélanie Laurent, Morgan Freeman, Michael Caine', 'PG-13', 'An FBI agent and an Interpol detective track a team of illusionists who pull off bank heists during their performances and reward their audiences with the money.', 'An FBI agent and an Interpol detective track a team of illusionists who pull off bank heists during their performances and reward their audiences with the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWsNYbrqy1p1w6K9zRk0mSchztT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75656'),
  ('592300783587256623', 'Now You See Me 2', 2016, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jon M. Chu, Peter Deming, Stuart Kearns', 'Ed Solomon', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Mark Ruffalo, Woody Harrelson, Dave Franco, Daniel Radcliffe, Lizzy Caplan, Morgan Freeman, Jay Chou', 'PG-13', 'One year after outwitting the FBI and winning the public’s adulation with their mind-bending spectacles, the Four Horsemen resurface only to find themselves face to face with a new enemy who enlists them to pull off their most dangerous heist yet.', 'One year after outwitting the FBI and winning the public’s adulation with their mind-bending spectacles, the Four Horsemen resurface only to find themselves face to face with a new enemy who enlists them to pull off their most dangerous heist yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A81kDB6a1K86YLlcOtZB27jriJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291805'),
  ('612772055267038467', 'Now You See Me: Now You Don''t', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ruben Fleischer, Dominic Hyman, George Richmond', 'Michael Lesslie, Paul Wernick, Rhett Reese', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Dominic Sessa, Ariana Greenblatt, Justice Smith, Rosamund Pike, Woody Harrelson, Dave Franco, Isla Fisher', 'PG-13', 'The original Four Horsemen reunite with a new generation of illusionists to take on powerful diamond heiress Veronika Vanderberg, who leads a criminal empire built on money laundering and trafficking. The new and old magicians must overcome their differences to work together on their most ambitious heist yet.', 'The original Four Horsemen reunite with a new generation of illusionists to take on powerful diamond heiress Veronika Vanderberg, who leads a criminal empire built on money laundering and trafficking. The new and old magicians must overcome their differences to work together on their most ambitious heist yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD3Eey4e4Z259XLm3eD3WGcoJAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425274'),
  ('1145821442504404093', 'Now You Tell One', 1926, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Harold L. Muller, Charles R. Bowers', null, 'Charles R. Bowers', null, 'The Liars Club is holding their contest to see who can tell the most unbelievable story, with a gold medallion waiting to be awarded to the winner. Disappointed with the other members'' bland efforts, one member brings in Charley Bowers, who has an extraordinary tale to tell. Charley claims to have invented a magic potion that enables him to grow absolutely anything by a simple grafting process, and he proceeds to tell his story to the club.', 'The Liars Club is holding their contest to see who can tell the most unbelievable story, with a gold medallion waiting to be awarded to the winner. Disappointed with the other members'' bland efforts, one member brings in Charley Bowers, who has an extraordinary tale to tell. Charley claims to have invented a magic potion that enables him to grow absolutely anything by a simple grafting process, and he proceeds to tell his story to the club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e91VbaBmSzdVM5RQvYXh4NCGeDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119024'),
  ('247918285957298514', 'Now, Voyager', 1942, 'Romance, Drama', 'Irving Rapper, Leo F. Forbstein, Sol Polito', 'Casey Robinson', 'Bette Davis, Paul Henreid, Claude Rains, Gladys Cooper, Bonita Granville, John Loder, Ilka Chase, Lee Patrick', 'NR', 'A woman suffers a nervous breakdown and an oppressive mother before being freed by the love of a man she meets on a cruise.', 'A woman suffers a nervous breakdown and an oppressive mother before being freed by the love of a man she meets on a cruise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWtJ1C98fQB1fUDSfqb1NGBPPK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32847'),
  ('778362865768592438', 'Now!', 1965, 'Documentary, Music', 'Santiago Álvarez, Alberto Hernández, Pepin Rodriguez', null, 'Lena Horne', null, 'Using morgue photos, newsreel footage, and a recording by Lena Horne, Cuban filmmaker Santiago Alvarez fired off ''Now!'', one of the most powerful bursts of propaganda rendered in the 1960s.', 'Using morgue photos, newsreel footage, and a recording by Lena Horne, Cuban filmmaker Santiago Alvarez fired off ''Now!'', one of the most powerful bursts of propaganda rendered in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kICPjLSIegbsphO0T18rjC8VzHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145762'),
  ('1089372490226152369', 'Nowhere', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Arturo Smith, Gregg Araki, William Paul Clark', 'Gregg Araki', 'James Duval, Rachel True, Nathan Bexton, Chiara Mastroianni, Debi Mazar, Kathleen Robertson, Joshua Gibran Mayweather, Jordan Ladd', 'NR', 'In Los Angeles, a colorful assortment of bohemians try to make sense of their intersecting lives. The moody Dark Smith, his bisexual girlfriend, her lesbian lover and their shy gay friend plan on attending the wildest party of the year. But they''ll only make it if they can survive the drug trips, suicides, trysts, mutilations and alien abductions that occur as one surreal day unfolds.', 'In Los Angeles, a colorful assortment of bohemians try to make sense of their intersecting lives. The moody Dark Smith, his bisexual girlfriend, her lesbian lover and their shy gay friend plan on attending the wildest party of the year. But they''ll only make it if they can survive the drug trips, suicides, trysts, mutilations and alien abductions that occur as one surreal day unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1TZKfzvATep5x5DthqWjjWtU2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1811'),
  ('711054431810077082', 'Nowhere', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Albert Pintó', 'Seanne Winslow, Indiana Lista, Miguel Ruz', 'Anna Castillo, Tamar Novas, Irina Bravo, Victoria Teijeiro, Lucía Soria, Mary Ruiz, Tony Corvillo, Mariam Torres', 'R', 'A young pregnant woman named Mia escapes from a country at war by hiding in a maritime container aboard a cargo ship. After a violent storm, Mia gives birth to the child while lost at sea, where she must fight to survive.', 'A young pregnant woman named Mia escapes from a country at war by hiding in a maritime container aboard a cargo ship. After a violent storm, Mia gives birth to the child while lost at sea, where she must fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uvCXfpaU1VveV5w9h05OxN0zdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151534'),
  ('756800279110655262', 'Nowhere', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, War, History', 'Simone Massi', 'Alessio Morino, Anne Paschetta, Simone Massi', 'Marco Baliani, Ascanio Celestini, Mimmo Cuticchio, Luigi Lo Cascio, Neri Marcorè, Giovanna Marini, Achille Massi, Gemma Massi', null, 'Three different epochs through the gaze of three children: Zelinda, who loses her mother to the Spanish Flu during World War I and sees the specter of Nazism loom; Assunta, who lives during the Nazi occupation between bombings, raids, and executions; Icaro, who abandons the countryside during the Years of Lead (“Anni di Piombo”) and accepts a new life. A story across the difficulties and the troubles of the 20th century between memories, affection, nostalgia, and gratitude.', 'Three different epochs through the gaze of three children: Zelinda, who loses her mother to the Spanish Flu during World War I and sees the specter of Nazism loom; Assunta, who lives during the Nazi occupation between bombings, raids, and executions; Icaro, who abandons the countryside during the Years of Lead (“Anni di Piombo”) and accepts a new life. A story across the difficulties and the troubles of the 20th century between memories, affection, nostalgia, and gratitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4zurVeaQO4Vvd4bCqVyiNyFmra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000092'),
  ('922452235841882616', 'Nowhere Boy', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sam Taylor-Johnson, James Collins, Alex Oakley', 'Matt Greenhalgh', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Anne-Marie Duff, Kristin Scott Thomas, David Threlfall, David Morrissey, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Josh Bolt, Ophelia Lovibond', null, 'A rebellious teenager, future Beatle John Lennon lives with his Aunt Mimi in working-class mid-1950s Liverpool, England. Mimi''s husband suddenly dies, and John spies his mother Julia at the funeral. Despite Mimi''s misgivings, John intends to have a real relationship with his mother. Julia introduces him to popular music and the banjo and, though a family conflict looms, young John is inspired to form his own band.', 'A rebellious teenager, future Beatle John Lennon lives with his Aunt Mimi in working-class mid-1950s Liverpool, England. Mimi''s husband suddenly dies, and John spies his mother Julia at the funeral. Despite Mimi''s misgivings, John intends to have a real relationship with his mother. Julia introduces him to popular music and the banjo and, though a family conflict looms, young John is inspired to form his own band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rFcosLtBnGL2ru0IPtwx3QSeKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33511'),
  ('108018351816393188', 'Nowhere Boys: The Book of Shadows', 2016, 'Science Fiction', 'Ben Timony, David Caesar, Jaems Grant', 'Tony Ayres, Craig Irvin, Rhys Graham', 'Dougie Baldwin, Joel Lok, Rahart Adams, Matt Testro, Sean Rees-Wemyss, Darci McDonald, Angourie Rice, Michala Banas', null, 'A year after the boys crossed dimensions, discovered magic and battled the restoring demon, they are back home in Bremin and are struggling with everyday teenage life. Felix has high hopes for the four heroes. He wants them to push the limits of their magical ability, working as a team to become masters of the arcane. But although he''s unwilling to admit it, the boys have grown apart. The boys, once in perfect magical and elemental alignment, are a tangle of rivalry and distrust. On the verge of separating, the Nowhere Boys are drawn together for one last spell when Felix discovers a magically sealed ''Book of Shadows''. Unwittingly this releases a powerful force of chaos, and the gang is reluctantly drawn into a showdown that threatens their world and all they love...', 'A year after the boys crossed dimensions, discovered magic and battled the restoring demon, they are back home in Bremin and are struggling with everyday teenage life. Felix has high hopes for the four heroes. He wants them to push the limits of their magical ability, working as a team to become masters of the arcane. But although he''s unwilling to admit it, the boys have grown apart. The boys, once in perfect magical and elemental alignment, are a tangle of rivalry and distrust. On the verge of separating, the Nowhere Boys are drawn together for one last spell when Felix discovers a magically sealed ''Book of Shadows''. Unwittingly this releases a powerful force of chaos, and the gang is reluctantly drawn into a showdown that threatens their world and all they love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBeidAMoaYGSqtRQsmu1o8Slpdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369406'),
  ('327020104688249947', 'Nowhere Girl', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Kensuke Sonomura, Mamoru Oshii', 'Kei Yamamura', 'Nana Seino, Hirotaro Honda, Hinako Tanaka, Ayuri Yoshinaga, Nobuaki Kaneko, Lily, Sergey Kuvaev, Mitsuko Takahashi', null, 'Ai is a student at an all-girls'' art high school. She is known to be extremely gifted in the arts, but the adults around her try to use her and her classmates are jealous of her. Ai suffers because of her situation, but doesn''t have anywhere to escape. Her daily life becomes like a war and she begins to collapse.', 'Ai is a student at an all-girls'' art high school. She is known to be extremely gifted in the arts, but the adults around her try to use her and her classmates are jealous of her. Ai suffers because of her situation, but doesn''t have anywhere to escape. Her daily life becomes like a war and she begins to collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dbMhDiJFf6f4tJUXBKUiv7d2V2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338033'),
  ('20492962875625600', 'Nowhere in Africa', 2001, 'Drama', 'Caroline Link, Gernot Roll', 'Susanne Liebetrau, Caroline Link', 'Juliane Köhler, Merab Ninidze, Sidede Onyulo, Matthias Habich, Lea Kurka, Karoline Eckertz, Gerd Heinz, Hildegard Schmahl', 'R', 'A Jewish woman named Jettel Redlich flees Nazi Germany with her daughter Regina, to join her husband, Walter, on a farm in Kenya. At first, Jettel refuses to adjust to her new circumstances, bringing with her a set of china dishes and an evening gown. While Regina adapts readily to this new world, forming a strong bond with her father''s cook, an African named Owuor.', 'A Jewish woman named Jettel Redlich flees Nazi Germany with her daughter Regina, to join her husband, Walter, on a farm in Kenya. At first, Jettel refuses to adjust to her new circumstances, bringing with her a set of china dishes and an evening gown. While Regina adapts readily to this new world, forming a strong bond with her father''s cook, an African named Owuor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ED1GaTKhHielGYa1giBsxfoacp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1591'),
  ('25406901262200376', 'Nowhere Special', 2020, 'Drama', 'Marius Panduru, Adam Philpott, Carla Stronge', 'Uberto Pasolini', 'James Norton, Daniel Lamont, Eileen O''Higgins, Valerie O''Connor, Stella McCusker, Carol Moore, Valene Kane, Keith McErlean', null, 'John, a 35-year-old window cleaner, has dedicated his life to bringing up his 4-year-old son, Michael, after the child''s mother left them soon after giving birth. When John is given only a few months left to live, he attempts to find a new, perfect family for Michael, determined to shield him from the terrible reality of the situation.', 'John, a 35-year-old window cleaner, has dedicated his life to bringing up his 4-year-old son, Michael, after the child''s mother left them soon after giving birth. When John is given only a few months left to live, he attempts to find a new, perfect family for Michael, determined to shield him from the terrible reality of the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqLI37bbDZP9um0Xu9AFWWYvXzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728142'),
  ('645508571299825554', 'Nowhere to Be Found', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Thomas Michael, Christian Bielz', 'Paolo Mancini, Thomas Michael', 'Kate Drummond, Rya Kihlstedt, Nell Verlaque, Al Mukadam, Joelle Farrow, Mercedes Morris, Ron Lea, Matt Connors', null, 'A mother''s worst nightmare comes true when her teenage daughter goes missing.', 'A mother''s worst nightmare comes true when her teenage daughter goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llnjXuqpoiMdiRmRqygsLXEqT6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590153'),
  ('1059856354933260289', 'Nowhere to Go', 1958, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Seth Holt, Paul Beeson', 'Kenneth Tynan, Seth Holt', 'George Nader, Maggie Smith, Bernard Lee, Geoffrey Keen, Bessie Love, Harry H. Corbett, Andrée Melly, Lionel Jeffries', null, 'A professional thief is sprung from prison with the assistance of a new partner who wants to know where he''s hid his loot.', 'A professional thief is sprung from prison with the assistance of a new partner who wants to know where he''s hid his loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvTAVmQfn68aPrzG4QJg9u1ZT2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50697'),
  ('1074988893471703893', 'Nowhere to Hide', 1987, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mario Azzopardi, Vic Sarin, Claude Brien', 'George Goldsmith', 'Amy Madigan, Daniel Hugh Kelly, Robin MacEachern, Michael Ironside, Chuck Shamata, John Colicos, Garrick Hagon, Vlasta Vrana', 'R', 'Marine officer Rob Cutter and his wife Barbara have a son named Johnny. Rob discovers that two newly delivered helicopters in his squadron have crashed because a defective part, a C-ring, has been made of a weaker, less expensive alloy. Before Rob can go public with this, Rob is killed on the orders of corrupt General Howard, who did not want Rob to go public with the defective part. Howard believes that Barbara, who is also a marine, now has the part, so Howard and his henchmen set out to kill Barbara and Johnny and get the part, but Howard is underestimating what Barbara is willing to do to protect Johnny.', 'Marine officer Rob Cutter and his wife Barbara have a son named Johnny. Rob discovers that two newly delivered helicopters in his squadron have crashed because a defective part, a C-ring, has been made of a weaker, less expensive alloy. Before Rob can go public with this, Rob is killed on the orders of corrupt General Howard, who did not want Rob to go public with the defective part. Howard believes that Barbara, who is also a marine, now has the part, so Howard and his henchmen set out to kill Barbara and Johnny and get the part, but Howard is underestimating what Barbara is willing to do to protect Johnny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI5kfzHIUt8DIhy3D7dtCLU3Llr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91128'),
  ('471865506208168626', 'Nowhere to Hide', 1999, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Lee Myung-se, Haeng-Ki Song, Chung Kwang-suk', 'Lee Myung-se', 'Park Joong-hoon, Ahn Sung-ki, Jang Dong-gun, Choi Ji-woo, Ahn Jae-mo, Sim Cheol-jong, Lee Won-jong, Do Yong-gu', 'R', 'Detective Woo is on the trail of the mysterious gangster Sungmin, a master of disguise who always manages to elude his pursuers. Eventually, the cop tracks down and confronts the master-criminal in the suburbs of a coal-mining town.', 'Detective Woo is on the trail of the mysterious gangster Sungmin, a master of disguise who always manages to elude his pursuers. Eventually, the cop tracks down and confronts the master-criminal in the suburbs of a coal-mining town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4liFY9Xoj6TOfJj57uvQFHjJwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25660'),
  ('794320469386732276', 'Nowhere to Run', 1993, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Robert Harmon, David Gribble, Brian W. Cook', 'Leslie Bohem, Joe Eszterhas, Randy Feldman', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Rosanna Arquette, Kieran Culkin, Ted Levine, Tiffany Taubman, Edward Blatchford, Anthony Starke, Joss Ackland', 'R', 'Escaped convict Sam Gillen single-handedly takes on ruthless developers who are determined to evict a widow with two young children.', 'Escaped convict Sam Gillen single-handedly takes on ruthless developers who are determined to evict a widow with two young children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2FGbyzk2dTAlu37iGeQBbUjLLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10413'),
  ('269422692478279508', 'Nowitzki: The Perfect Shot', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Sebastian Dehnhardt, Peter Wolf', null, 'Dirk Nowitzki, Holger Geschwinder, Kobe Bryant, Michael Finley, Steve Nash, Jason Kidd, Vince Carter, Mark Cuban', 'NR', 'This documentary chronicles the life story of the Dallas Mavericks'' Dirk Nowitzki and his inspiring journey from Germany to superstardom in the NBA.', 'This documentary chronicles the life story of the Dallas Mavericks'' Dirk Nowitzki and his inspiring journey from Germany to superstardom in the NBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38kSPGVG3PevHQdpph8bR7wCERl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291343'),
  ('807293036275951415', 'Nuclear Boy', 2026, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Joren Molter', 'Britt Snel', 'Guus Blanken, Jelka van Houten, Kiara Sastroredjo', null, 'The lonely 17-year-old outcast AIKE (Guus Blanken) craves attention and finds it online where he conducts dangerous chemistry experiments. Hoping to pull Aike out of his internet bubble, his mother (Jelka van Houten), a hardworking nurse, sends him to the scouts to make real friends. When that fails, Aike feels rejected and hurt. To prove himself to the world, he begins his biggest experiment yet: he secretly builds a nuclear breeder reactor in his mother''s shed, encouraged by a growing group of internet followers. This success boosts Aike''s confidence, and he dares to connect with the boys in his scout group. Aike finally feels accepted. But when the reactor becomes uncontrollable, the catastrophic consequences are unimaginable. NUCLEAR BOY is inspired by true events.', 'The lonely 17-year-old outcast AIKE (Guus Blanken) craves attention and finds it online where he conducts dangerous chemistry experiments. Hoping to pull Aike out of his internet bubble, his mother (Jelka van Houten), a hardworking nurse, sends him to the scouts to make real friends. When that fails, Aike feels rejected and hurt. To prove himself to the world, he begins his biggest experiment yet: he secretly builds a nuclear breeder reactor in his mother''s shed, encouraged by a growing group of internet followers. This success boosts Aike''s confidence, and he dares to connect with the boys in his scout group. Aike finally feels accepted. But when the reactor becomes uncontrollable, the catastrophic consequences are unimaginable. NUCLEAR BOY is inspired by true events.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmRzELoMkpKvYqM2Ae6Fj61pNRTb.jpg', 'plex:movie:nuclear-boy'),
  ('740904373131084684', 'Nuclear Hurricane', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Fred Olen Ray, Theo Angell, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Anna Lorenzo', 'Jamie Luner, Jack Scalia, Meredith McGeachie, David Millbern, Eriko Tamura, Erin Gray, Gil Gerard, Jack Heller', null, 'Linda is trapped when the nuclear power plant in which she works threatens a meltdown, while her girlfriend takes on a major storm which could destroy their island home.', 'Linda is trapped when the nuclear power plant in which she works threatens a meltdown, while her girlfriend takes on a major storm which could destroy their island home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztTqZahA0IXUrN9OCQvLIK0xU3q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77523'),
  ('47324441738003307', 'Nuclear Now', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Oliver Stone', 'Joshua S. Goldstein, Oliver Stone', 'Oliver Stone', null, 'With unprecedented access to the nuclear industry in France, Russia, and the United States, Nuclear Now explores the possibility for the global community to overcome the challenges of climate change and energy poverty to reach a brighter future through the power of nuclear energy. Beneath our feet, Uranium atoms in the Earth’s crust hold incredibly concentrated energy. Science unlocked this energy in the mid-20th century, first for bombs and then to power submarines. The United States led the effort to generate electricity from this new source. Yet in the mid-20th century as societies began the transition to nuclear power and away from fossil fuels, a long-term PR campaign to scare the public began, funded in part by coal and oil interests.', 'With unprecedented access to the nuclear industry in France, Russia, and the United States, Nuclear Now explores the possibility for the global community to overcome the challenges of climate change and energy poverty to reach a brighter future through the power of nuclear energy. Beneath our feet, Uranium atoms in the Earth’s crust hold incredibly concentrated energy. Science unlocked this energy in the mid-20th century, first for bombs and then to power submarines. The United States led the effort to generate electricity from this new source. Yet in the mid-20th century as societies began the transition to nuclear power and away from fossil fuels, a long-term PR campaign to scare the public began, funded in part by coal and oil interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdxG11NGlnDUWoSjRRkDKXh34ee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004685'),
  ('262524800517787964', 'Nude', 2010, 'Drama', 'Yûichi Onuma, Shin Hayasaka, Shinya Erikawa', 'Mihiro', 'Naoko Watanabe, Ken Mitsuishi, Aimi Satsukawa, Mihiro, Tsuyoshi Gotô, Kanichi Hiraga, Takaki Uda', null, 'After graduating high school, Hiromi moves from the coastal town of Niigata to Tokyo in the hopes of becoming a famous actress. Her dream seemingly comes true as a manager scouts her off the street. He recruits her as a model but it''s actually to be a "nude" model. It''s not exactly what Hiromi was looking for, but she can''t turn down the opportunity. As her career dwindles, the manager coerces her to make the jump to AV and Hiromi gains a new identity as Mihiro.', 'After graduating high school, Hiromi moves from the coastal town of Niigata to Tokyo in the hopes of becoming a famous actress. Her dream seemingly comes true as a manager scouts her off the street. He recruits her as a model but it''s actually to be a "nude" model. It''s not exactly what Hiromi was looking for, but she can''t turn down the opportunity. As her career dwindles, the manager coerces her to make the jump to AV and Hiromi gains a new identity as Mihiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qCJ8azp70Eacpcha9yubg98ejq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103450'),
  ('64853450489267403', 'Nude', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Tony Sacco, Tony Sacco', null, 'David Bellemere, Steve Shaw, Rachel Cook, Jessica Clements, Ebonee Davis, Jeannie Park, Janine Tugonon, Keilani Asmus', null, 'NUDE explores perceptions of nudity in art by chronicling the creative process of photographer David Bellemere as he''s commissioned by NU Muses founder Steve Shaw to shoot a fine art calendar of nude photographs.', 'NUDE explores perceptions of nudity in art by chronicling the creative process of photographer David Bellemere as he''s commissioned by NU Muses founder Steve Shaw to shoot a fine art calendar of nude photographs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/699DbQ8eTecLmzjTLrao9D5bbpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484133'),
  ('991066193964147497', 'Nude for Satan', 1974, 'Horror', 'Luigi Batzella', 'Luigi Batzella', 'Rita Calderoni, Stelio Candelli, James Harris, Renato Lupi, Iolanda Mascitti, Luigi Antonio Guerra, Barbara Lay, Augusto Boscardini', null, 'Italian Gothic horror that tells the tale of a man who stops at a remote castle hoping to get medical help for an injured woman, only to find the inhabitants mirror the darker sides of the woman and himself.', 'Italian Gothic horror that tells the tale of a man who stops at a remote castle hoping to get medical help for an injured woman, only to find the inhabitants mirror the darker sides of the woman and himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpzVjRkf5tnUxUDiHY3xuYk6O1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35718'),
  ('585906165022034013', 'Nude Nuns with Big Guns', 2010, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy', 'Edwin M. Figueroa, Joseph Guzman', 'Joseph Guzman, Robert James Hayes II', 'Asun Ortega, Bill Oberst Jr., Ivet Corvea, Devanny Pinn, Tawny Amber Young, Maxie J. Santillan Jr., Tomas Boykin, Kimberly Ables Jindra', null, 'Upon taking her vows to become a nun, Sister Sarah is abused, brainwashed and also drugged into submission by the corrupt clergy. On the verge of her own death from a lethal dose of drugs, Sister Sarah receives a message from God telling her to take vengeance on all those who did wrong to her. Armed with God''s will and an arsenal of big guns, she dispenses Judgment Day on her former tormentors. When the church hires the merciless motorcycle gang "Los Muertos" to track down and to kill her they soon realize that this sister is one bad mother.', 'Upon taking her vows to become a nun, Sister Sarah is abused, brainwashed and also drugged into submission by the corrupt clergy. On the verge of her own death from a lethal dose of drugs, Sister Sarah receives a message from God telling her to take vengeance on all those who did wrong to her. Armed with God''s will and an arsenal of big guns, she dispenses Judgment Day on her former tormentors. When the church hires the merciless motorcycle gang "Los Muertos" to track down and to kill her they soon realize that this sister is one bad mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJwUJpHJ8FPyulcnSajSJdKgCMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52208'),
  ('663721841465447071', 'Nude on the Moon', 1961, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Doris Wishman, Raymond Phelan, Raymond Phelan', 'Doris Wishman, Raymond Phelan', 'Marietta, William Mayer, Lester Brown, Pat Reilly, Ira Magee, Lacey Kelly, Shelby Livingston, Robert W. Kyorimee', null, 'Through an unexpected inheritance, a couple of male scientists travel to the moon via a rocket of their own design. There, they find a lush garden paradise rather than a barren wasteland. They''re captured by (semi-nude) telepathic humanoids and taken before the Great Council, where the Moon Goddess decides they should be allowed to continue their experiments. One falls in love, the other seeks to return home.', 'Through an unexpected inheritance, a couple of male scientists travel to the moon via a rocket of their own design. There, they find a lush garden paradise rather than a barren wasteland. They''re captured by (semi-nude) telepathic humanoids and taken before the Great Council, where the Moon Goddess decides they should be allowed to continue their experiments. One falls in love, the other seeks to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBTbmSSRCh6qxpNesRYximBS4gz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50977'),
  ('324650346377489545', 'Nudist Colony of the Dead', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror, Music', 'Craig Bassuk, Mark Pirro', 'Mark Pirro', 'Forrest J. Ackerman, Bea Lindgren, Rae Latt, Braddon Mendelson, Darwyn Carson, Dan Hartel, Kim Kingsley, Dave Robinson', 'R', 'Judge Rhinehole orders the Sunny Buttocks Nudist Camp closed down as an affront to the community. Its members enter into a suicide pact, but vow to return for vengeance. Five years later, a group of Christian campers on a retreat argue religion and perform outrageous production numbers as the group begins experiencing an attrition problem.', 'Judge Rhinehole orders the Sunny Buttocks Nudist Camp closed down as an affront to the community. Its members enter into a suicide pact, but vow to return for vengeance. Five years later, a group of Christian campers on a retreat argue religion and perform outrageous production numbers as the group begins experiencing an attrition problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEWo3ccknl4fIbIqgflF5mRujfq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98209'),
  ('218216527309758566', 'Nuigulumar Z', 2014, 'Horror, Comedy, Action', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Noboru Iguchi, Jun Tsugita', 'Shoko Nakagawa, Sadao Abe, Rina Takeda, Mao Ichimichi, Hiroshi Neko, Koichi Yamadera, Kami Hiraiwa, Koto Takagi', null, 'A gothic lolita merges with a teddy bear to fight zombies and save the world.', 'A gothic lolita merges with a teddy bear to fight zombies and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oE4a7Tzg0tXILaG0h5863UqzZ3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234088'),
  ('575693489168274382', 'Nuisance Bear', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Gabriela Osio Vanden, Jack Weisman', null, 'Mike Tunalaaq Gibbons', null, 'A polar bear is forced to navigate a human world of tourists, wildlife officers, and hunters as its ancient migration collides with modern life. When a sacred predator is branded a nuisance, it becomes unclear who truly belongs in this shared landscape.', 'A polar bear is forced to navigate a human world of tourists, wildlife officers, and hunters as its ancient migration collides with modern life. When a sacred predator is branded a nuisance, it becomes unclear who truly belongs in this shared landscape.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfSV9UNoa0zS3UAKwSWBJuG0YHMw.jpg', 'plex:movie:nuisance-bear-2026-1'),
  ('664980396313000576', 'Nuit d''ivresse', 1985, 'Family, Comedy', 'Alain Dhenaut, Josiane Balasko, Michel Blanc', null, 'Michel Blanc, Josiane Balasko, Jean-François Dérec', null, 'In a bar, ex-TV host Belin meets Frede, an ex-maid who just got out of prison. Between them, they manage to create panic everywhere they go. The next morning Belin has forgotten everything.', 'In a bar, ex-TV host Belin meets Frede, an ex-maid who just got out of prison. Between them, they manage to create panic everywhere they go. The next morning Belin has forgotten everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qf63is3IhUtnJHbdV5ujAJpi5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369631'),
  ('331446685899750935', 'Nuit d''ivresse', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Nauer, Carlo Varini, Étienne Dhaene', 'Josiane Balasko, Thierry Lhermitte', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Josiane Balasko, Gérard Jugnot, Victoria Abril, Ticky Holgado, Jean-Claude Dauphin, Alain Doutey, Guy Laporte', null, 'Jacques Belin, presenter of a silly TV show, gets drunk after receiving an award and misses the train bringing his TV-soap-star fiancée. He meets up with Frède, just out of prison after a three year sentence and, in between numerous arguments and Jacques'' break-up with his girlfriend, the two of them get drunker together, going across Paris in search of more alcohol and adventure.', 'Jacques Belin, presenter of a silly TV show, gets drunk after receiving an award and misses the train bringing his TV-soap-star fiancée. He meets up with Frède, just out of prison after a three year sentence and, in between numerous arguments and Jacques'' break-up with his girlfriend, the two of them get drunker together, going across Paris in search of more alcohol and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uytVJyZAdv9smjsDhTgCuLYcTEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40224'),
  ('795910340083335728', 'Nukie', 1987, 'Family, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Sias Odendal, Michael Pakleppa, Anthony Busbridge', 'Sias Odendal, Ben Taylor', 'Glynis Johns, Steve Railsback, Ronald France, David Fox, Sara Braunstein, Siphiwe Mlangeni, Sipho Mlangeni, Sam Ntsinyi', null, 'A space child, lost in the universe, is abducted by the U. S. Space Foundation. In a desperate intergalactic search for the frightened little alien, his brother Nukie® mistakenly lands in Africa where he is befriended by African twins. Together they journey through the laughter and adventure of talking lions, a greedy witch doctor, a charming chimpanzee, a feisty nun, a compassionate scientist and an outrageous romantic computer named E.D.D.I.', 'A space child, lost in the universe, is abducted by the U. S. Space Foundation. In a desperate intergalactic search for the frightened little alien, his brother Nukie® mistakenly lands in Africa where he is befriended by African twins. Together they journey through the laughter and adventure of talking lions, a greedy witch doctor, a charming chimpanzee, a feisty nun, a compassionate scientist and an outrageous romantic computer named E.D.D.I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZOcdnjbFMg4XrMyGifqt5ankbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84626'),
  ('107738605612038417', 'Nukkad Naatak', 2026, 'Drama', 'Tanmaya Shekhar', 'Tanmaya Shekhar', 'Shivang Rajpal, Danish Husain, Nirmala Hajra, Lalit Saw, Monita Sinha', null, 'After being caught robbing the college canteen, best friends Molshri and Shivang are expelled. To be reinstated, they must enroll five children from an impoverished slum into a local school.', 'After being caught robbing the college canteen, best friends Molshri and Shivang are expelled. To be reinstated, they must enroll five children from an impoverished slum into a local school.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FouT4jOENHVyQ1tvrVK78CP9CBoq.jpg', 'plex:movie:nukkad-naatak'),
  ('412429676261531357', 'NULL', 2021, 'Action, Drama', 'Ethan Jordan', 'Ethan Jordan, Davis Madole', 'Javi Moya, Pan Bridgwater, Logan Taylor, Rebecca Jordan, Kieran Leahy, Sebastiao Martin, Andrew Fugitt, Revanth Kothapali', 'NR', 'A hitman is tasked to take out ex-mobsters when he suddenly hears a voice that questions his morality.', 'A hitman is tasked to take out ex-mobsters when he suddenly hears a voice that questions his morality.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1161605'),
  ('392767526451568367', 'Nulliparous Women', 2020, null, 'Fabia Castro', null, null, null, 'In a pub in Madrid''s downtown, a group of workmates meets to celebrate a birthday party. There, the singular characters share their opinions about education, maternity and other matters about life. In the middle of that, Lucía tries to behave normal, but in her head, there is only one thing: She may be pregnant and if it''s confirmed, she would be forced to face one of the most difficult decisions: became a mother or not. A story about maternity, friendship, and identity.', 'In a pub in Madrid''s downtown, a group of workmates meets to celebrate a birthday party. There, the singular characters share their opinions about education, maternity and other matters about life. In the middle of that, Lucía tries to behave normal, but in her head, there is only one thing: She may be pregnant and if it''s confirmed, she would be forced to face one of the most difficult decisions: became a mother or not. A story about maternity, friendship, and identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2P55Q4sY6sifjuAx2pN5bVOQV4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:742011'),
  ('427041930553858421', 'Numb', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Harris Goldberg, Eric Steelberg', 'Harris Goldberg', 'Matthew Perry, Lynn Collins, Kevin Pollak, Bob Gunton, Helen Shaver, William B. Davis, Mary Steenburgen, Ben Immanuel', 'R', 'Hudson Milbank is a successful Hollywood screenwriter who suddenly and strangely finds himself without any emotional feelings. He tries doctor after doctor and shrink after shrink, but nothing works. The Golf Channel, lesbian exercise classes and a dizzying variety of pills get him through the day, but don''t quite solve his problem. His writing partner tries everything to get him back to normal, but it''s not until Hudson meets Sara that he finds a real motivation to get better and to actually start feeling again. From the writer of Deuce Bigalow, comes NUMB, a romantic comedy following an unusual man looking for strange love.', 'Hudson Milbank is a successful Hollywood screenwriter who suddenly and strangely finds himself without any emotional feelings. He tries doctor after doctor and shrink after shrink, but nothing works. The Golf Channel, lesbian exercise classes and a dizzying variety of pills get him through the day, but don''t quite solve his problem. His writing partner tries everything to get him back to normal, but it''s not until Hudson meets Sara that he finds a real motivation to get better and to actually start feeling again. From the writer of Deuce Bigalow, comes NUMB, a romantic comedy following an unusual man looking for strange love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tH8olC1mCnxqqby8xdNOiy15B1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17106'),
  ('802177533611334582', 'Numb', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Jason R. Goode, Jan Kiesser', 'Andre Harden', 'Jamie Bamber, Marie Avgeropoulos, Aleks Paunovic, Stefanie von Pfetten, Colin Cunningham, Gina Chiarelli, Paul McGillion, Craig Erickson', null, 'Husband and wife, Will and Dawn, are in financial crisis after learning the job Will was counting on to salvage their financial future has disappeared in the midst of a market collapse. They set out to drive home on the winter highway back to their city, and in a moment of altruism, pick up siblings Lee and Cheryl, a pair of hitchhikers on their way to start a new life. In the midst of the night they nearly collide with an old man wandering on the snowy highway, hyperthermic and horrifically frostbitten. While searching for his ID they discover a wad of cash, a hand drawn map with GPS coordinates, and a single gold coin inside his coat. Will and Dawn reluctantly go along with Lee’s plan to report him to the police as a John Doe and pocket the money. In an attempt to save their financial struggles, all four venture off into the snowy wilderness in search of the buried gold.', 'Husband and wife, Will and Dawn, are in financial crisis after learning the job Will was counting on to salvage their financial future has disappeared in the midst of a market collapse. They set out to drive home on the winter highway back to their city, and in a moment of altruism, pick up siblings Lee and Cheryl, a pair of hitchhikers on their way to start a new life. In the midst of the night they nearly collide with an old man wandering on the snowy highway, hyperthermic and horrifically frostbitten. While searching for his ID they discover a wad of cash, a hand drawn map with GPS coordinates, and a single gold coin inside his coat. Will and Dawn reluctantly go along with Lee’s plan to report him to the police as a John Doe and pocket the money. In an attempt to save their financial struggles, all four venture off into the snowy wilderness in search of the buried gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QeDMwG19nc9UNKpomIzI0aCsQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352364'),
  ('1125162946420450306', 'Number 24', 2024, 'War, History, Drama', 'John Andreas Andersen, Pål Ulvik Rokseth', 'Christopher Grøndahl, Vibeke Idsøe, Erlend Loe', 'Sjur Vatne Brean, Erik Hivju, Philip Helgar, Magnus Dugdale, Jakob Maanum Trulsen, Jacob Jensen, Flo Fagerli, Ines Høysæter Asserson', 'R', 'On the brink of the Second World War, a young Norwegian man''s drive to resist the Nazis sets a new course for his future – and the future of his country.', 'On the brink of the Second World War, a young Norwegian man''s drive to resist the Nazis sets a new course for his future – and the future of his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qv7crkk9fzMrvj3WqWU6PiFm12f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1222248'),
  ('752167817795813872', 'Number One', 1969, 'Drama', 'Tom Gries, Philip L. Parslow, Ted Swanson', 'David Moessinger', 'Charlton Heston, Jessica Walter, Bruce Dern, John Randolph, Diana Muldaur, G.D. Spradlin, Steve Franken, Al Hirt', null, 'A former football hero cannot accept his career is over. He loses himself in alcohol and women.', 'A former football hero cannot accept his career is over. He loses himself in alcohol and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBWGjmTIp1tpUAz1RoKBsNw1Z4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88504'),
  ('1082150078003224062', 'Number One', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tonie Marshall, Julien Roux', 'Tonie Marshall, Marion Doussot', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Suzanne Clément, Richard Berry, Sami Frey, Benjamin Biolay, Francine Bergé, Anne Azoulay, John Lynch', null, 'A brilliant and determined female engineer is approached by a network of powerful women with an offer to help become the head of a CAC 40 firm. The conguest, which was at first thrilling, turns to complete war with the men who still dominate.', 'A brilliant and determined female engineer is approached by a network of powerful women with an offer to help become the head of a CAC 40 firm. The conguest, which was at first thrilling, turns to complete war with the men who still dominate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMK6YOeYYodOyGSzTujdTog5WN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451679'),
  ('363747768056051117', 'Number One', 2026, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Kim Tae-yong', null, 'Choi Woo-shik, Jang Hye-jin, Gong Seung-yeon, Kwon Da-ham', null, 'Eighteen-year-old Ha-min suddenly begins to see the number "365" every time he eats his mother''s homemade meal—and the number drops with each bite. Believing it to be a countdown to his mother''s death, he distances himself from her and her cooking. Years later, still haunted by the number, Ha-min lives cautiously, preparing for the worst. Just as he begins to find peace with his girlfriend Ryeo-eun, an unexpected truth turns his world upside down.', 'Eighteen-year-old Ha-min suddenly begins to see the number "365" every time he eats his mother''s homemade meal—and the number drops with each bite. Believing it to be a countdown to his mother''s death, he distances himself from her and her cooking. Years later, still haunted by the number, Ha-min lives cautiously, preparing for the worst. Just as he begins to find peace with his girlfriend Ryeo-eun, an unexpected truth turns his world upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF4kH35jFW3Mxrm35DcK3uM8lOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1411577'),
  ('434291404238440975', 'Number One Fan', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Jeanne Herry, Axel Cosnefroy', 'Jeanne Herry', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Laurent Lafitte, Pascal Demolon, Olivia Côte, Nicolas Bridet, Sébastien Knafo, Muriel Mayette, Benjamin Lavernhe', null, 'Muriel Bayen, a divorced beautician and mother of two, loves to tell stories. She is a huge fan of this singer Vincent Lacroix, in fact she is a dedicated fan. One day Vincent knock on her door and ask for her help.', 'Muriel Bayen, a divorced beautician and mother of two, loves to tell stories. She is a huge fan of this singer Vincent Lacroix, in fact she is a dedicated fan. One day Vincent knock on her door and ask for her help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVBkZ5Crsk4SqN3fvtT4N7wiTOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270919'),
  ('370249352295562730', 'Number Seventeen', 1932, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Jack E. Cox, Alfred Hitchcock, Bryan Langley', 'Alma Reville, Rodney Ackland, Alfred Hitchcock', 'Leon M. Lion, Anne Grey, John Stuart, Donald Calthrop, Barry Jones, Ann Casson, Henry Caine, Garry Marsh', null, 'A gang of jewel thieves hides out in an abandoned London house after a robbery, unaware that a detective is among them in disguise.', 'A gang of jewel thieves hides out in an abandoned London house after a robbery, unaware that a detective is among them in disguise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrz9csver46bnZfHoE9C96DbLkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15007'),
  ('495964535515099943', 'Number Two', 1975, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, William Lubtchansky', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Anne-Marie Miéville', 'Sandrine Battistella, Pierre Oudrey, Alexandre Rignault, Rachel Stefanopoli, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'Jean-Luc Godard mixes video and film in his Grenoble studio, discussing how he secured funding for the film. The action unfolds on two monitors, as a young working-class couple lives in a claustrophobic, high-rise apartment complex and marital discord is set off by the wife’s infidelity.', 'Jean-Luc Godard mixes video and film in his Grenoble studio, discussing how he secured funding for the film. The action unfolds on two monitors, as a young working-class couple lives in a claustrophobic, high-rise apartment complex and marital discord is set off by the wife’s infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlcOoKproGk1zvwIb8Qx3eOJhMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112823'),
  ('477937768461415991', 'Number, Please?', 1920, 'Comedy', 'Hal Roach, Walter Lundin, Fred C. Newmeyer', 'H.M. Walker', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, Roy Brooks, Sunshine Sammy Morrison, Hal Roach, Charles Stevenson, William Gillespie, Fred C. Newmeyer', 'NR', 'While at an amusement park, trying vainly to forget the girl he has lost, a young man sees the girl with her new boyfriend. When her dog gets loose in the park, both suitors have to help her catch it. Then, the girl''s uncle, a balloonist, gives her a pass for two in his balloon, provided that her mother approves. She then offers to take along the first of her admirers who is able to get her mother''s consent.', 'While at an amusement park, trying vainly to forget the girl he has lost, a young man sees the girl with her new boyfriend. When her dog gets loose in the park, both suitors have to help her catch it. Then, the girl''s uncle, a balloonist, gives her a pass for two in his balloon, provided that her mother approves. She then offers to take along the first of her admirers who is able to get her mother''s consent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRtPAAcbhi1CsTm6IFmhLqbspIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44409'),
  ('546744335925325202', 'Numéro 10', 2024, 'Drama', 'David Diane, Cyril Bron', 'Simon Moutaïrou, Rémi Moutaïrou', 'Ibrahim Diallo, Ilyes Djadel, Camille Chamoux, Salim Kissari, Ragnar Le Breton, Chloé Lecerf, Noémie Zeitoun, Isma Kébé', null, '20-year-old Ousmane Diallo is the new international football star. On a night that will mark a turning point in his life, he has to choose which national team he will play for for the rest of his career.', '20-year-old Ousmane Diallo is the new international football star. On a night that will mark a turning point in his life, he has to choose which national team he will play for for the rest of his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7JASLMfrTBjmMtujy4fzwIda6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000891'),
  ('415335432432426021', 'Numero Zero: The Roots of Italian Rap', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Enrico Bisi', 'Enrico Bisi', 'Nicola Peressoni', null, 'In the eighties comes from overseas powerful, unstoppable, the wave of hip hop. Few years later the rap music begins to take roots in Italy with the firts album in 1990. Thus began a golden age that from the undergrowth of the counterculture reaches a diverse audience, passing through the masterpiece of Sangue Misto, the evergreen Kaos and Colle Der Fomento, until the commercial success of Neffa, Frankie Hi-Nrg, Sottotono, Articolo 31 and the debut of a young Fabri Fibra. Then, suddenly, the dark at the dawn of the new millenium. Why? An epic, unique season of musical creativity narrated by its big players and accompanied by the voice of a talented and renowed freestyler grown up with those great musicians: Ensi. - Written by Bisi, Enrico', 'In the eighties comes from overseas powerful, unstoppable, the wave of hip hop. Few years later the rap music begins to take roots in Italy with the firts album in 1990. Thus began a golden age that from the undergrowth of the counterculture reaches a diverse audience, passing through the masterpiece of Sangue Misto, the evergreen Kaos and Colle Der Fomento, until the commercial success of Neffa, Frankie Hi-Nrg, Sottotono, Articolo 31 and the debut of a young Fabri Fibra. Then, suddenly, the dark at the dawn of the new millenium. Why? An epic, unique season of musical creativity narrated by its big players and accompanied by the voice of a talented and renowed freestyler grown up with those great musicians: Ensi. - Written by Bisi, Enrico', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blJjH6NivSFWm3v4dOAOCHmMEI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399983'),
  ('122440807885194946', 'Nun in Rope Hell', 1984, 'Drama, Horror', 'Katsuhiko Fujii, Katsuji Kanazawa, Teio Noda', 'Akira Nakano', 'Miki Takakura, Maya Ito, Asami Ogawa, Hiroshi Unayama, Hiromi Yamaguchi, Shingo Yamamoto, Chigusa Takayama, Kazuko Honjô', null, 'A woman gets caught by the wife of her lover which results in a stabbing. Feeling guilty she runs away and joins a nunnery. But she soon discovers that several nuns and a well known author have turned the place into their own personal S&M playground.', 'A woman gets caught by the wife of her lover which results in a stabbing. Feeling guilty she runs away and joins a nunnery. But she soon discovers that several nuns and a well known author have turned the place into their own personal S&M playground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIkhJdIizqkNW58GImZLxOr3tW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185664'),
  ('744169545164783193', 'Nuns on the Run', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jonathan Lynn, Michael Garfath, Gus Maclean', 'Jonathan Lynn', 'Eric Idle, Robbie Coltrane, Camille Coduri, Janet Suzman, Doris Hare, Lila Kaye, Robert Patterson, Tom Hickey', 'PG-13', 'Set up by their boss to be knocked off following a final heist, soon-to-retire crooks Brian Hope and Charlie McManus get wind of their impending demise and run off with the spoils of their crime. Fleeing their boss, the drug dealers they robbed, the police, and Brian''s angry girlfriend, the duo take refuge in a training convent for nuns. In disguise, they convince Sister Superior that they''re nuns, a charade they''re forced to maintain as their enemies arrive.', 'Set up by their boss to be knocked off following a final heist, soon-to-retire crooks Brian Hope and Charlie McManus get wind of their impending demise and run off with the spoils of their crime. Fleeing their boss, the drug dealers they robbed, the police, and Brian''s angry girlfriend, the duo take refuge in a training convent for nuns. In disguise, they convince Sister Superior that they''re nuns, a charade they''re forced to maintain as their enemies arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adcFqqwa7df4LzvnI8Z0e90rI5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11131'),
  ('399618378292558555', 'Nuns That Bite', 1977, 'Horror', 'Yuji Makiguchi, Kenji Tsukagoshi', 'Seiko Shimura', 'Haruka Tajima, Hiromi Maya, Kaori Serita, Masataka Naruse, Nenji Kobayashi, Akira Shioji, Hiroko Fuji, Misuzu Satô', null, 'A woman on the run is raped, rescued, then raped again. Escaping, she heads for the hills and finds safe haven at a convent. After becoming a postulant (trainee nun), she catches her fellow sisters engaging in lesbianism, fighting over nothing, hurling snakes at each other, and engaging in mild flesh eating.', 'A woman on the run is raped, rescued, then raped again. Escaping, she heads for the hills and finds safe haven at a convent. After becoming a postulant (trainee nun), she catches her fellow sisters engaging in lesbianism, fighting over nothing, hurling snakes at each other, and engaging in mild flesh eating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLIX2Tcfh4z3TVUPNjQj8y1prWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107425'),
  ('566406081157673054', 'Nunzio''s Second Cousin', 1994, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Steven Poster, Tom DeCerchio, Steve Eshelman', 'Tom DeCerchio', 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Miles Perlich, Eileen Brennan, David Fresco, Harry Waters, Jr., Christian J. Meoli, Seth Green, Jarred Blancard', null, 'As Sgt. Randozza, a beefy, gay Chicago cop, leaves a bar with his lover, a gang of high-school punks decide to do some "fag-bashing". Tony''s gun cools them off, and after giving them a brutal verbal dressing down, he forces the leader of the gang, Jimmy, to come to his house the next night for dinner. Jimmy soon gets a harsh lesson in sexual tolerance.', 'As Sgt. Randozza, a beefy, gay Chicago cop, leaves a bar with his lover, a gang of high-school punks decide to do some "fag-bashing". Tony''s gun cools them off, and after giving them a brutal verbal dressing down, he forces the leader of the gang, Jimmy, to come to his house the next night for dinner. Jimmy soon gets a harsh lesson in sexual tolerance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksjb4WlgTlmD4x6jm1eUL0AuTNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410041'),
  ('238849916593103837', 'Nuovo Olimpo', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gianni Romoli', 'Damiano Gavino, Andrea Di Luigi, Luisa Ranieri, Greta Scarano, Aurora Giovinazzo, Alvise Rigo, Giancarlo Commare, Luca Finotti', 'R', 'In 1970s Rome, a casual encounter between Enea and Pietro at a movie theater turns into an unforgettable romance — until destiny pulls them apart.', 'In 1970s Rome, a casual encounter between Enea and Pietro at a movie theater turns into an unforgettable romance — until destiny pulls them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nx8pSvAARYOLlZ2MNBlH7vW9jv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1044648'),
  ('463384150989342241', 'Nur über meine Leiche', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gerhard Schirlo, Rainer Matsutani', 'Rainer Matsutani, Sebastian Niemann', 'Christoph M. Ohrt, Katja Riemann, Ulrike Folkerts, Felix Eitner, Julia Brendler, Udo Kier, David Michael Williamson, Claudia Schlenger', null, 'A cynical and ruthless womanizer dies, but is given the chance to return to life if he manages to save three women within three days, whom he has deprived of their faith in love.', 'A cynical and ruthless womanizer dies, but is given the chance to return to life if he manages to save three women within three days, whom he has deprived of their faith in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWkkLQYyBRmROYXpBIMe7weRGmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9076'),
  ('798909576038505863', 'Nuraghes', 2016, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Mauro Aragoni, Mauro Aragoni, Emilio Canu', 'Mauro Aragoni', 'Salmo, Ally McClelland, Michael Segal', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PIkmfJ3QTdMMBI2UDdNLCIaQ0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447925'),
  ('1007863898803675625', 'Nuremberg', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'James Vanderbilt, Dariusz Wolski, Csilla György', 'James Vanderbilt', 'Russell Crowe, Rami Malek, Michael Shannon, Leo Woodall, John Slattery, Richard E. Grant, Colin Hanks, Mark O''Brien', 'PG-13', 'In postwar Germany, an American psychiatrist must determine whether Nazi prisoners are fit to go on trial for war crimes, and finds himself in a complex battle of intellect and ethics with Hermann Göring, Hitler''s right-hand man.', 'In postwar Germany, an American psychiatrist must determine whether Nazi prisoners are fit to go on trial for war crimes, and finds himself in a complex battle of intellect and ethics with Hermann Göring, Hitler''s right-hand man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cWTGH2svfNHWVRjsfKIBob9pDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214931'),
  ('578734510866479287', 'Nurse 3-D', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Douglas Aarniokoski, Boris Mojsovski, David Rimer', 'Douglas Aarniokoski, David Loughery', 'Paz de la Huerta, Katrina Bowden, Judd Nelson, Corbin Bleu, Boris Kodjoe, Melanie Scrofano, Niecy Nash, Martin Donovan', 'R', 'Abby Russell, a beautiful, dedicated nurse with a sinister side, has a secret life in which she targets and punishes dishonest men.', 'Abby Russell, a beautiful, dedicated nurse with a sinister side, has a secret life in which she targets and punishes dishonest men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZhXsT6ch1Z7NKFspMH7QyfpsBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78383'),
  ('736170416711500001', 'Nurse Abi', 2024, 'Drama', 'Dustin Celestino, Mikko Baldoza', null, 'Vince Rillon, Alessandra Cruz, Marc Capilador, Aina Ashley Roque, Reynaline Delos Santos, Heart Puyong, Virginia Garcia, Robert Kyle Castro', null, 'When overworked graphic designer Roy faints, he wakes up to the beautiful Nurse Abi taking care of him. This starts Roy’s fantasy of going out and sleeping with Nurse Abi. But can he turn this fantasy into a reality?', 'When overworked graphic designer Roy faints, he wakes up to the beautiful Nurse Abi taking care of him. This starts Roy’s fantasy of going out and sleeping with Nurse Abi. But can he turn this fantasy into a reality?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZdtEUML3afyk1eE1hSh286jPtf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301994'),
  ('332480300869094305', 'Nurse Betty', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Neil LaBute, Jean-Yves Escoffier, Albert M. Shapiro', 'John C. Richards, James Flamberg', 'Morgan Freeman, Renée Zellweger, Chris Rock, Greg Kinnear, Aaron Eckhart, Tia Texada, Crispin Glover, Pruitt Taylor Vince', 'R', 'What happens when a person decides that life is merely a state of mind? If you''re Betty, a small-town waitress and soap opera fan from Fair Oaks, Kansas, you refuse to believe that you can''t be with the love of your life just because he doesn''t really exist. After all, life is no excuse for not living. Traumatized by a savage event, Betty enters into a fugue state that allows -- even encourages -- her to keep functioning... in a kind of alternate reality.', 'What happens when a person decides that life is merely a state of mind? If you''re Betty, a small-town waitress and soap opera fan from Fair Oaks, Kansas, you refuse to believe that you can''t be with the love of your life just because he doesn''t really exist. After all, life is no excuse for not living. Traumatized by a savage event, Betty enters into a fugue state that allows -- even encourages -- her to keep functioning... in a kind of alternate reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OCHR9z9k7go669AsShOkTj4CFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10480'),
  ('421041973731074178', 'Nurse Diary: Wicked Finger', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Shinichi Shiratori', 'Rokuro Kumagai', 'Etsuko Hara, Yasuo Arakawa, Yûko Asuka, Yukie Ishii, Sabu Kawahara, Megu Kawashima, Kanji Kume, Setsu Midorikawa', null, 'Ryoko leaves the chaos of her dorm for the peace and quiet of her own place because she wants to keep her relationship with a doctor at Murata Hospital a secret. Unfortunately, that privacy is short-lived as she discovers a “peeping tom” next door neighbor that spies on her all the time. When the doctor’s wife learns of the affair, poor Ryoko gets caught in a web of jilted lovers, frisky lesbians, slapstick sexual assault and embarrassing incidents with household appliances.', 'Ryoko leaves the chaos of her dorm for the peace and quiet of her own place because she wants to keep her relationship with a doctor at Murata Hospital a secret. Unfortunately, that privacy is short-lived as she discovers a “peeping tom” next door neighbor that spies on her all the time. When the doctor’s wife learns of the affair, poor Ryoko gets caught in a web of jilted lovers, frisky lesbians, slapstick sexual assault and embarrassing incidents with household appliances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4m9MNTg2AkB85j3PgLFhmWU2O4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192397'),
  ('526846352482756695', 'Nurse Edith Cavell', 1939, 'Drama, War', 'Herbert Wilcox, Freddie Young, Joseph H. August', 'Michael Hogan', 'Anna Neagle, Edna May Oliver, George Sanders, May Robson, Zasu Pitts, H.B. Warner, Sophie Stewart, Mary Howard', null, 'British nurse Edith Cavell is stationed at a hospital in Brussels during World War I. When the son of a former patient escapes from a German prisoner-of-war camp, she helps him flee to Holland. Outraged at the number of soldiers detained in the camps, Edith, along with a group of sympathizers, devises a plan to help the prisoners escape. As the group works to free the soldiers, Edith must keep her activities secret from the Germans', 'British nurse Edith Cavell is stationed at a hospital in Brussels during World War I. When the son of a former patient escapes from a German prisoner-of-war camp, she helps him flee to Holland. Outraged at the number of soldiers detained in the camps, Edith, along with a group of sympathizers, devises a plan to help the prisoners escape. As the group works to free the soldiers, Edith must keep her activities secret from the Germans', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydEquMTPU1tdsNyzpbt9tBBoAqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218326'),
  ('319275268300995249', 'Nurse on Wheels', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gerald Thomas, Anthony Waye', 'Norman Hudis', 'Juliet Mills, Ronald Lewis, Joan Sims, Noel Purcell, Esma Cannon, Raymond Huntley, Athene Seyler, Norman Rossington', null, 'Quietly competent young Joanna moves with her scatterbrain mother to a country village to take up her first job as District Nurse. She soon overcomes the suspicion of her patients used to someone rather older, while becoming romantically involved with a local farmer - at least until he tries to evict a newly-arrived expectant couple who park their caravan on his land.', 'Quietly competent young Joanna moves with her scatterbrain mother to a country village to take up her first job as District Nurse. She soon overcomes the suspicion of her patients used to someone rather older, while becoming romantically involved with a local farmer - at least until he tries to evict a newly-arrived expectant couple who park their caravan on his land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gj0KESNnsox5joc9UnDLXl77Cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117609'),
  ('484982633940148341', 'Nurse Sherri', 1978, 'Horror', 'Al Adamson, Roger Michaels', 'Michael Bockman, Greg Tittinger', 'Geoffrey Land, Jill Jacobson, Marilyn Joi, Katherine Pass, Prentiss Moulden, Bill Roy, Erwin Fuller, Clay Foster', 'NR', 'A hospital nurse is possessed by an evil spirit, and proceeds to kill off the hospital''s patients.', 'A hospital nurse is possessed by an evil spirit, and proceeds to kill off the hospital''s patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekMJXu0wZ7dWSyV3F7GzBWUADgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114542'),
  ('693707021995419885', 'Nurses for Sale', 1971, 'Adventure, Action', 'Franz Xaver Lederle, Rolf Olsen', 'Rolf Olsen', 'Curd Jürgens, Heinz Reincke, Johanna von Koczian, Herbert Fleischmann, Sieghardt Rupp, Angelika Ott, Christine Schuberth, Ilse Peternell', 'R', 'Hamburg ship captain Markus Jolly is hired to transport a vaccine to a Latin American port, but when the precious cargo is stolen by mobsters, he is falsely accused of engineering the theft.', 'Hamburg ship captain Markus Jolly is hired to transport a vaccine to a Latin American port, but when the precious cargo is stolen by mobsters, he is falsely accused of engineering the theft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdIusZq2cn74W1Oqk8ErA6YeUer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5874'),
  ('655336257156802287', 'Nurses on the Line: The Crash of Flight 7', 1993, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Larry Shaw, Robert Primes, Gary Law', null, 'Lindsay Wagner, Robert Loggia, David Clennon, Paula Marshall, Hilary Edson, Farrah Forke, Jennifer Lopez, Joan McMurtrey', 'PG', 'Student nurses join some doctors to work in a medical station a few hours flying-time from the Mexican town of Catamaco. One of their planes goes down due to an engine malfunction and crashes in the rain forest. This is the story of the attempts to save the lives of the passengers (both nurses and doctors).', 'Student nurses join some doctors to work in a medical station a few hours flying-time from the Mexican town of Catamaco. One of their planes goes down due to an engine malfunction and crashes in the rain forest. This is the story of the attempts to save the lives of the passengers (both nurses and doctors).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ste2WgMUTSv6yHEzvihXZV7KJaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273758'),
  ('120608389814236878', 'Nutcracker Fantasy', 1979, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Takeo Nakamura', 'Shintaro Tsuji', 'Kaoru Sugita, Kō Nishimura, Shizue Natsukawa, Atsuko Ichinomiya, Takao Yamada, Yukari Uehara, Tarō Shigaki, Hisao Dazai', null, 'Based off of the novel, "The Nutcracker and the Mouse King" and the ballet, "The Nutcracker", Sanrio shows their take on the classic story in a stop-motion animated film.', 'Based off of the novel, "The Nutcracker and the Mouse King" and the ballet, "The Nutcracker", Sanrio shows their take on the classic story in a stop-motion animated film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1iEPZuv6vRqqfiZ8qXqKa9KyDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165644'),
  ('749976244848438304', 'Nutcracker: The Motion Picture', 1986, 'Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Carroll Ballard, Stephen H. Burum, Eugene Mazzola', null, 'Hugh Bigney, Patricia Barker, Vanessa Sharp, Wade Walthall, Russell Burnett, Laura Schwenk, Benjamin Houk, Beatrice Bassett', 'G', 'In this Pacific Northwest Ballet performance, it is Christmas Eve and festivities are underway. Clara is excited when her godfather arrives with a bag full of gifts, one of which is an intriguing wooden nutcracker. That night, while the household sleeps, Clara visits the Christmas tree to inspect her nutcracker and soon finds herself immersed in a dream world both dark and enchanting.', 'In this Pacific Northwest Ballet performance, it is Christmas Eve and festivities are underway. Clara is excited when her godfather arrives with a bag full of gifts, one of which is an intriguing wooden nutcracker. That night, while the household sleeps, Clara visits the Christmas tree to inspect her nutcracker and soon finds herself immersed in a dream world both dark and enchanting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEskWZgPj4SCkTMJPDCYxP94CB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71316'),
  ('124079808091226224', 'Nutcrackers', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Gordon Green, Randall Ehrmann, Michael Simmonds', 'Leland Douglas', 'Ben Stiller, Linda Cardellini, Homer Janson, Ulysses Janson, Arlo Janson, Atlas Janson, Toby Huss, Maren Heisler', 'PG-13', 'Just as Mike is on the heels of closing the biggest deal of his career, he''s pulled away from his bachelor life in the big city to a farm in rural Ohio in order to help his recently orphaned nephews find a new home.', 'Just as Mike is on the heels of closing the biggest deal of his career, he''s pulled away from his bachelor life in the big city to a farm in rural Ohio in order to help his recently orphaned nephews find a new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynVqSbqVTvvLka3nDc23iUaKeIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1203236'),
  ('952855523998470446', 'Nuts', 1987, 'Drama', 'Martin Ritt, Andrzej Bartkowiak', 'Alvin Sargent, Tom Topor, Darryl Ponicsan', 'Barbra Streisand, Richard Dreyfuss, Maureen Stapleton, Karl Malden, Eli Wallach, Robert Webber, James Whitmore, Leslie Nielsen', null, 'A high-class call girl accused of murder fights for the right to stand trial rather than be declared mentally incompetent.', 'A high-class call girl accused of murder fights for the right to stand trial rather than be declared mentally incompetent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OW1JuLly9Z6wGZPiHgKpnlRo6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40634'),
  ('131979229084700775', 'Nuts and Volts', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester Cat turns to automation in hopes it will help him catch the fastest mouse in Mexico, Speedy Gonzales. He builds a robot to chase Speedy around their house, but Speedy outsmarts Sylvester''s new mechanical stooge, reducing it to a heap of scrap metal.', 'Sylvester Cat turns to automation in hopes it will help him catch the fastest mouse in Mexico, Speedy Gonzales. He builds a robot to chase Speedy around their house, but Speedy outsmarts Sylvester''s new mechanical stooge, reducing it to a heap of scrap metal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4MpITBuDhvnG544c4jiDZV3AB2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234429'),
  ('652860370153282662', 'Nuts for Love', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Juan Pablo Laplace, Alberto Lecchi', 'Alberto Lecchi', 'Gastón Pauls, Ariadna Gil, Malena Solda, Nicolás Pauls, Nancy Dupláa, Gabriel Goity, Rodrigo de la Serna', null, 'Former Argentine lovers reunite through the years at a concert, at the World Cup and during war with the Falkland Islands.', 'Former Argentine lovers reunite through the years at a concert, at the World Cup and during war with the Falkland Islands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3HZNmUWmcd18DjlmLq16YYPH46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118197'),
  ('443061378629096200', 'Nuts in May', 1976, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Mike Leigh, Michael Williams', 'Mike Leigh', 'Alison Steadman, Roger Sloman, Anthony O''Donnell, Sheila Kelley, Stephen Bill, Richenda Carey, Eric Allan, Matthew Guinness', null, 'A middle-class couple go camping in Dorset, but peace and quiet elude them.', 'A middle-class couple go camping in Dorset, but peace and quiet elude them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ulu4Upu1rpgVS85EuDguFzGC4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265640'),
  ('82259867824926265', 'Nutty But Nice', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Felix Adler, Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Vernon Dent, John Tyrrell, Cy Schindell, Lynton Brent, Ned Glass', 'NR', 'The stooges are singing comedic waiters, enlisted by two doctors to try and cheer up a depressed little girl, whose banker-father has gone missing with $300,000 worth of bonds.', 'The stooges are singing comedic waiters, enlisted by two doctors to try and cheer up a depressed little girl, whose banker-father has gone missing with $300,000 worth of bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0ddn1VQQvr0XQCENNINi1C5JUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115984'),
  ('101713916789030297', 'Nutty Professor II: The Klumps', 2000, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Peter Segal, Dean Semler', 'Zak Penn', 'Eddie Murphy, Janet Jackson, Larry Miller, John Ales, Richard Gant, Anna Maria Horsford, Melinda McGraw, Jamal Mixon', 'PG-13', 'The hilarity begins when professor Sherman Klump finds romance with fellow DNA specialist, Denise Gaines, and discovers a brilliant formula that reverses aging. But Sherman''s thin and obnoxious alter ego, Buddy Love, wants out...and a big piece of the action. And when Buddy gets loose, things get seriously nutty.', 'The hilarity begins when professor Sherman Klump finds romance with fellow DNA specialist, Denise Gaines, and discovers a brilliant formula that reverses aging. But Sherman''s thin and obnoxious alter ego, Buddy Love, wants out...and a big piece of the action. And when Buddy gets loose, things get seriously nutty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8gI95Eio7kAjixyqYHxNKmJTmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12107'),
  ('73479968169177197', 'Nuvvostanante Nenoddantana', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Prabhu Deva, Venu', 'M. S. Raju', 'Siddharth, Trisha Krishnan, Srihari, Prakash Raj, Archana, Santhoshi, Geetha, Sunil Varma', null, 'Siri and Santosh fall in love with each other and plan to get married. However, his mother disapproves of their relationship.', 'Siri and Santosh fall in love with each other and plan to get married. However, his mother disapproves of their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zixbDSR1gOHgcATGdMaq20LjZEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74154'),
  ('846660229985897215', 'Nuvvu Naaku Nachav', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'K. Ravindra Babu, K. Vijaya Bhaskar', 'Trivikram Srinivas', 'Venkatesh, Aarthi Agarwal, Sudeepa, Prakash Raj, Chandramohan, M. S. Narayana, Flora Saini, Brahmanandam', null, 'Venky and Nandini''s relationship changes from mere friendship to something that is more romantic. However, love only blossoms between the two after Nandini''s marriage is fixed elsewhere.', 'Venky and Nandini''s relationship changes from mere friendship to something that is more romantic. However, love only blossoms between the two after Nandini''s marriage is fixed elsewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6F2Y7zddPFZ2ls9OY006egVClP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82255'),
  ('374340480530343257', 'NVA', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Leander Haußmann, Frank Griebe', 'Thomas Brussig, Leander Haußmann', 'Kim Frank, Oliver Bröcker, Detlev Buck, Jasmin Schwiers, Annika Kuhl, Ignaz Kirchner, Maxim Mehmet, Robert Gwisdek', null, 'Somewhere in the GDR, in 1988: young soldier Henrik Heidler starts his service in the National People''s Army, a whole new world. Together with the weighty troublemaker Krüger, Heidler and his fellow soldiers try to somehow do their time between old hands and bureaucrats. It''s not always fun, because the superiors are annoying with socialist propaganda from the day before yesterday, the material and equipment is scarce and not exactly new, while morale is at rock bottom. His relationship with his girlfriend isn''t holding up either. But then Heidler meets Marie, the daughter of commander Kalt of all people, and falls in love. And then, at some point, the Wall comes down and everything changes ... for everyone in the NVA!', 'Somewhere in the GDR, in 1988: young soldier Henrik Heidler starts his service in the National People''s Army, a whole new world. Together with the weighty troublemaker Krüger, Heidler and his fellow soldiers try to somehow do their time between old hands and bureaucrats. It''s not always fun, because the superiors are annoying with socialist propaganda from the day before yesterday, the material and equipment is scarce and not exactly new, while morale is at rock bottom. His relationship with his girlfriend isn''t holding up either. But then Heidler meets Marie, the daughter of commander Kalt of all people, and falls in love. And then, at some point, the Wall comes down and everything changes ... for everyone in the NVA!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktayJKqGW7xvEPCsIWnQR2UtNv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11514'),
  ('58397133004966885', 'NXT Vengeance Day', 2026, 'Action, Sport', null, null, 'Joseph Hendry, Richard Starks, Valerie Loureda, Lea Mitchell, Franki Carissa Strefling', 'TV-PG', 'The 2026 Vengeance Day was a professional wrestling livestreaming event produced by WWE for its NXT brand, held on March 7, 2026, at the WWE Performance Center in Orlando, Florida, and was headlined by Joe Hendry (c) vs. Ricky Saints for the NXT Championship.', 'The 2026 Vengeance Day was a professional wrestling livestreaming event produced by WWE for its NXT brand, held on March 7, 2026, at the WWE Performance Center in Orlando, Florida, and was headlined by Joe Hendry (c) vs. Ricky Saints for the NXT Championship.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwdZKC1xm977qICYc6i6da5dwKbM.jpg', 'plex:movie:nxt-vengeance-day-2026-1'),
  ('889288910052234138', 'NYAD', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Claudio Miranda, Peter Zuccarini, Agueda Anaya Angulo', 'Julia Cox', 'Annette Bening, Jodie Foster, Rhys Ifans, Ethan Jones Romero, Luke Cosgrove, Jeena Yi, Eric T. Miller, Anne Marie Kempf', 'PG-13', 'Athlete Diana Nyad sets out at 60 to achieve a nearly impossible lifelong dream: to swim from Cuba to Florida across more than 100 miles of open ocean.', 'Athlete Diana Nyad sets out at 60 to achieve a nearly impossible lifelong dream: to swim from Cuba to Florida across more than 100 miles of open ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydSqUhKFvg5cZ5OwImmf3K1R6SS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895549'),
  ('121745394827982166', 'NYC: Tornado Terror', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tibor Takács, Lidia Stante, Barry Gravelle', 'T.S. Cook', 'Nicole De Boer, Sebastian Spence, Jerry Wasserman, Winston Rekert, Colby Johannson, Tegan Moss, Jill Morrison, Matthew Harrison', null, 'An unexplained, local split in the atmosphere causes a series of total unpredictable, yet devastating tornadoes. Rookie fireman Brian Flynn gets trapped in the underground sewage with his girlfriend, deputy mayor James ''Jim'' Lawrence and climatologist Dr. Cassie Lawrence''s niece Lori. Mayor Leonardo of New York initially refuses to pay proper attention to the phenomenon, a ''reelection threat'', so the alert status remains too low for long. Atypical lightning discovered inside tornadoes adds unprecedented dangers. The Lawrences and aeronautics renegade Dr. Lars Liggenhorn conceive a possible solution by launching rockets, but NASA''s Dr. Quinn overrules them, imposing standard silver iodine.', 'An unexplained, local split in the atmosphere causes a series of total unpredictable, yet devastating tornadoes. Rookie fireman Brian Flynn gets trapped in the underground sewage with his girlfriend, deputy mayor James ''Jim'' Lawrence and climatologist Dr. Cassie Lawrence''s niece Lori. Mayor Leonardo of New York initially refuses to pay proper attention to the phenomenon, a ''reelection threat'', so the alert status remains too low for long. Atypical lightning discovered inside tornadoes adds unprecedented dangers. The Lawrences and aeronautics renegade Dr. Lars Liggenhorn conceive a possible solution by launching rockets, but NASA''s Dr. Quinn overrules them, imposing standard silver iodine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQKNYo6qxCaQZoXKZswq0GPIDSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55281'),
  ('126715989534462730', 'Nydenion', 2010, 'Science Fiction', 'Jack Moik', 'Thomas Rushforth', 'Andreas Arens, Caspar Arnhold, Michael Arnold, Mirjam Barner, Jack Moik, Annette Schmiedel, Marcos Koutelas, Stephanie Dal Canton', null, 'Over the course of centuries the early colonies have evolved into giant empires, battling for supremacy. In the last 57 years, the death toll has risen to the billions. Rick Walker, former fighter pilot turned disillusioned freelance flyer is hired to transport a mysterious woman to the site of a secret peace negotiation. Cynthia Perkins claims to be a special ambassador who was called upon in secrecy to bring the stalling negotiations back on track. On their way, Walker and Perkins are ambushed by a group of attack fighters and are forced to crash land on a remote planet called Nydenion. Their way to the peace negotiations becomes a fight against time and an enemy that seems to come from the ranks of their own military, an enemy that Walker knows all too well.', 'Over the course of centuries the early colonies have evolved into giant empires, battling for supremacy. In the last 57 years, the death toll has risen to the billions. Rick Walker, former fighter pilot turned disillusioned freelance flyer is hired to transport a mysterious woman to the site of a secret peace negotiation. Cynthia Perkins claims to be a special ambassador who was called upon in secrecy to bring the stalling negotiations back on track. On their way, Walker and Perkins are ambushed by a group of attack fighters and are forced to crash land on a remote planet called Nydenion. Their way to the peace negotiations becomes a fight against time and an enemy that seems to come from the ranks of their own military, an enemy that Walker knows all too well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HC17sXUeUcn5NCL9RFEXD49wfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76456'),
  ('40328258987660186', 'Nymph', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang, Chankit Chamnivikaipong, Chedpong Laoyant', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang', 'Wanida Termthanaporn, Nopachai Jayanama, Chamanun Wanwinwatsara, Porntip Papanai, Supachai Girdsuwan, Natthanan Sonparin, Pairoj Chawalaworn, Chalita Auabumrungjit', null, 'An urban husband and wife travel to the jungle and learn just how precious their relationship is.', 'An urban husband and wife travel to the jungle and learn just how precious their relationship is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHjZT91IchVo53KNk1Tms22jCuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50086'),
  ('231645436765221178', 'Nymphlight', 1957, 'Documentary', 'Joseph Cornell', null, null, null, 'A short, avant-garde movie, starring twelve-year-old ballet student Gwen Thomas, Nymphlight is a lovely blend of fact and fiction, using Bryant Park at the New York Public Library as a stage set for the fantasy inclusion of a certain nymph. A meditation on an ephemeral day in the the life of a park shared by birds, the young and the old.', 'A short, avant-garde movie, starring twelve-year-old ballet student Gwen Thomas, Nymphlight is a lovely blend of fact and fiction, using Bryant Park at the New York Public Library as a stage set for the fantasy inclusion of a certain nymph. A meditation on an ephemeral day in the the life of a park shared by birds, the young and the old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4he6SCv7neXSTPkuGCfv4xo6Wel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189644'),
  ('1009589947682630139', 'Nympho', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Freidric Macapagal Cortez, Charita Castinlag, John Knox Vill', null, 'Jenn Rosa, Vince Rillon, Allen Legazpi, Mark Morales, John Knox Vill, Yan Serna, Rene Durian, Tommy Samonte', null, 'A woman seeking excitement meets a man who brings light and meaning to her world.', 'A woman seeking excitement meets a man who brings light and meaning to her world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9T7J44QFPJPf6CluITKxOZbiNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1549512'),
  ('149116950350747809', 'Nymphomaniac: Vol. I', 2013, 'Drama', 'Pierre Buffin, Lars von Trier, Manuel Alberto Claro', 'Lars von Trier', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Stellan Skarsgård, Stacy Martin, Shia LaBeouf, Christian Slater, Uma Thurman, Sophie Kennedy Clark, Connie Nielsen', 'NR', 'A man named Seligman finds a fainted wounded woman in an alley and he brings her home. She tells him that her name is Joe and that she is nymphomaniac. Joe tells her life and sexual experiences with hundreds of men since she was a young teenager while Seligman tells about his hobbies, such as fly fishing, reading about Fibonacci numbers or listening to organ music.', 'A man named Seligman finds a fainted wounded woman in an alley and he brings her home. She tells him that her name is Joe and that she is nymphomaniac. Joe tells her life and sexual experiences with hundreds of men since she was a young teenager while Seligman tells about his hobbies, such as fly fishing, reading about Fibonacci numbers or listening to organ music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piikL8vRh3s1ysHGTIqaZpdjfNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258216'),
  ('263740965672618994', 'Nymphomaniac: Vol. II', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Lars von Trier, Manuel Alberto Claro, Anders Refn', 'Lars von Trier', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Stellan Skarsgård, Stacy Martin, Shia LaBeouf, Willem Dafoe, Udo Kier, Jean-Marc Barr, Jamie Bell', 'NR', 'The continuation of Joe''s sexually dictated life delves into the darker aspects of her adult life and what led to her being in Seligman''s care.', 'The continuation of Joe''s sexually dictated life delves into the darker aspects of her adult life and what led to her being in Seligman''s care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLUNqgNKuWn667kXCKztSxYbT3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249397'),
  ('786021374825516754', 'O', 2001, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Tim Blake Nelson, Russell Lee Fine', 'Brad Kaaya', 'Mekhi Phifer, Martin Sheen, Josh Hartnett, Andrew Keegan, Julia Stiles, Rain Phoenix, Chris Freihofer, Elden Henson', 'R', 'Even though he''s the only black student at the elite Palmetto Grove Academy, star basketball player Odin James has the adoration of all, including the team''s coach and the Dean''s beautiful daughter Desi. Odin''s troubled friend Hugo, the coach''s son, deeply resentful of his father''s preference of Odin on and off the court, plots a diabolical scheme to sow the seed of mistrust between O and Desi, setting in motion a disturbing chain of events which erupts into a firestorm of breathtaking intensity.', 'Even though he''s the only black student at the elite Palmetto Grove Academy, star basketball player Odin James has the adoration of all, including the team''s coach and the Dean''s beautiful daughter Desi. Odin''s troubled friend Hugo, the coach''s son, deeply resentful of his father''s preference of Odin on and off the court, plots a diabolical scheme to sow the seed of mistrust between O and Desi, setting in motion a disturbing chain of events which erupts into a firestorm of breathtaking intensity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zcnbgNm4Es96sfsgoUavqbAed9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11065'),
  ('105645048533086841', 'O Amor Dá Trabalho', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Paulo de Tarso Disca, Ale McHaddo, Daniela Carvalho', 'Ale McHaddo, Luiz Felipe Mazzoni', 'Leandro Hassum, Flávia Alessandra, Bruno Garcia, Felipe Torres, Monique Alfradique, Tadeu Mello, Luciana Paes, Rogerio Morgado', null, 'The selfish Ancelmo dies and ends up trapped in limbo. To secure his place in heaven, he must practice a good deed and play cupid, as he is tasked with uniting a man and a woman with widely differing personalities.', 'The selfish Ancelmo dies and ends up trapped in limbo. To secure his place in heaven, he must practice a good deed and play cupid, as he is tasked with uniting a man and a woman with widely differing personalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFYmSbOQ1MqnNmKwggTfdm0Rdjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615322'),
  ('894281252592680191', 'O Auto da Boa Mentira', 2021, 'Comedy', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, Kika Cunha, Julia Moraes', 'João Falcão, Tatiana Maciel, Célio Porto', 'Leandro Hassum, Rocco Pitanga, Nanda Costa, Mariana Bassoul, Renato Góes, Cássia Kis, Jackson Antunes, Carlos Gregório', null, 'In four stories inspired by humorous tales by Ariano Suassuna, each created based on phrases by the poet from Paraíba, we meet Helder, Fabiano, Pierce and Lorena, living different situations where, ironically, the lie is always the protagonist.', 'In four stories inspired by humorous tales by Ariano Suassuna, each created based on phrases by the poet from Paraíba, we meet Helder, Fabiano, Pierce and Lorena, living different situations where, ironically, the lie is always the protagonist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUPmGxi00UJhzDYuXbvtCXRZEio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823031'),
  ('391306626153844268', 'O Banquete', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniela Thomas, Inti Briones', 'Beto Amaral, Daniela Thomas', 'Drica Moraes, Mariana Lima, Caco Ciocler, Rodrigo Bolzan, Fabiana Gugli, Gustavo Machado, Chay Suede, Bruna Linzmeyer', null, 'An elegant dinner, which takes place in real time, brings together a group of intellectuals in the early 90s in São Paulo, Brazil: the hosts are the editor of the country''s top news magazine and her husband, the company''s lawyer, and the occasion is the wedding anniversary of the magazine publisher and his wife, a famous theater actress. The publisher has written an open letter to the president of the country, with serious denunciations, which will run in the upcoming issue. He risks being arrested this very evening. As tensions increase with the imminence of prison, secrets come to light revealing the conflict between the ethics sought in public life and the ethics practiced in private life.', 'An elegant dinner, which takes place in real time, brings together a group of intellectuals in the early 90s in São Paulo, Brazil: the hosts are the editor of the country''s top news magazine and her husband, the company''s lawyer, and the occasion is the wedding anniversary of the magazine publisher and his wife, a famous theater actress. The publisher has written an open letter to the president of the country, with serious denunciations, which will run in the upcoming issue. He risks being arrested this very evening. As tensions increase with the imminence of prison, secrets come to light revealing the conflict between the ethics sought in public life and the ethics practiced in private life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL6Jg1tqrNqid5KjogCzXBrIfoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535107'),
  ('266633175024982447', 'O Barato de Iacanga', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Thiago Mattar, André Manfrim, Diego Lajst', 'Thiago Mattar, Guilherme Algon', 'Leivinha, Claudio Prado, Luiz Carlos Maciel, Gilberto Gil, Raul Seixas, Elici Bueno, Amarilis Gibeli, Pena Schmidt', null, 'Participants recall a series of festivals held on a farm in Brazil during the ''70s and ''80s that evolved into liberating celebrations of music.', 'Participants recall a series of festivals held on a farm in Brazil during the ''70s and ''80s that evolved into liberating celebrations of music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDKKaAb0arASTho1JMW4PHGJtJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590712'),
  ('99270178488050453', 'O Beautiful Night', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Robert Spika, Xaver Böhm, Jieun Yi', 'Ariana Berndl, Xaver Böhm', 'Noah Saavedra, Marko Mandić, Eva-Maria Kurz, Vanessa Loibl, Johanna Polley, Peter Clös, Gerhard Bös', null, 'This fiction feature debut by Xaver Böhm is the newest production from Komplizen Film. In this Faustian tale, anxious Yuri finds himself face-to-face with Death. Yuri is forced to confront his fears over the course of a fateful night.', 'This fiction feature debut by Xaver Böhm is the newest production from Komplizen Film. In this Faustian tale, anxious Yuri finds himself face-to-face with Death. Yuri is forced to confront his fears over the course of a fateful night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSdEroRIIji3xxD4kdRDyLwrjtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573893'),
  ('428421582649321151', 'O Brother, Where Art Thou?', 2000, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Joel Coen, Roger Deakins, Betsy Magruder', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen', 'George Clooney, John Turturro, Tim Blake Nelson, John Goodman, Holly Hunter, Chris Thomas King, Charles Durning, Del Pentecost', 'PG-13', 'In the deep south during the 1930s, three escaped convicts search for hidden treasure while a relentless lawman pursues them.', 'In the deep south during the 1930s, three escaped convicts search for hidden treasure while a relentless lawman pursues them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9foMAcLg8GEzzQzer04qOGdD1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134'),
  ('513687405086703395', 'O Concurso', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Hélcio Alemão Nagamine, Pedro Vasconcelos', 'Leonardo Levis, L.G. Tubaldini Jr.', 'Danton Mello, Fábio Porchat, Anderson Di Rizzi, Rodrigo Pandolfo, Carol Castro, Sabrina Sato, Pedro Paulo Rangel, Jackson Antunes', null, 'Four candidates for a federal judge position embark on a madcap, no-holds-barred race to outdo one another, each committing his own brand of mayhem.', 'Four candidates for a federal judge position embark on a madcap, no-holds-barred race to outdo one another, each committing his own brand of mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WmGIGsxURwUYUKShqVxRqajAvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210802'),
  ('1031766689180883551', 'O Coronel e o Lobisomem', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Maurício Farias', 'João Falcão, Guel Arraes, Jorge Furtado', 'Diogo Vilela, Selton Mello, Ana Paula Arósio, Pedro Paulo Rangel, Andréa Beltrão, Othon Bastos, Marco Ricca, Tonico Pereira', null, 'Colonel Furtado struggles to keep his lands, the Sobradinho Farm, and win the heart of his cousin Esmeraldina. In the process, he fights big beasts, experiences the taste of a bohemian life in town, fends usurers and thieves off, and uses all his cunning to get rid of haunting entities. His rival is the man he was brought up with, Pernambuco Nogueira, a werewolf.', 'Colonel Furtado struggles to keep his lands, the Sobradinho Farm, and win the heart of his cousin Esmeraldina. In the process, he fights big beasts, experiences the taste of a bohemian life in town, fends usurers and thieves off, and uses all his cunning to get rid of haunting entities. His rival is the man he was brought up with, Pernambuco Nogueira, a werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxQJNMT3Oc3axg2LtVcMIaDmyVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29009'),
