  ('732557330013909682', 'O Costa d''África', 1954, 'Comedy', 'João Mendes, Victor Bonjour, Henrique Dominguez', 'Vasco Santana, Henrique Santana', 'Vasco Santana, Costinha, Laura Alves, Erico Braga, Francisco Ribeiro, Teresa Gomes, Ana Paula Zeiger, Henrique Santana', null, 'Costa is travelling from Africa to London, and wishes very much to his nephew Amadeu, and see by himself how well he has been invested large sums of money he is been sending him. Amadeu ''borrows'' for 24 hours a wife, a villa, a car, and a servant - for he has been lies to his uncle all the time. All goes well. But, Costa decides to prolong his stay for two weeks...', 'Costa is travelling from Africa to London, and wishes very much to his nephew Amadeu, and see by himself how well he has been invested large sums of money he is been sending him. Amadeu ''borrows'' for 24 hours a wife, a villa, a car, and a servant - for he has been lies to his uncle all the time. All goes well. But, Costa decides to prolong his stay for two weeks...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcpg5SSig6WCJhKW61oW48vr0lU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74718'),
  ('27515929300425322', 'O Costa do Castelo', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur Duarte, Aquilino Mendes', 'João Bastos, Fernando Fragoso', 'Maria Matos, António Silva, Milú, Curado Ribeiro, Hermínia Silva, Manuel Santos Carvalho, Luís de Campos, Maria Olguim', null, 'André (Curado Ribeiro), is a son of a wealthy family who meets a girl called Luisinha (Milu). Luisinha lives at a small pension house with Rita (Maria Olguim) and Januário (João Silva), who are as parents to her, and with mr. Simplício Costa (António Silva), better known as Costa do Castelo, a lazy but highly talented guitar player who together with (Hermínia Silva) reaches success.', 'André (Curado Ribeiro), is a son of a wealthy family who meets a girl called Luisinha (Milu). Luisinha lives at a small pension house with Rita (Maria Olguim) and Januário (João Silva), who are as parents to her, and with mr. Simplício Costa (António Silva), better known as Costa do Castelo, a lazy but highly talented guitar player who together with (Hermínia Silva) reaches success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6zS32V0Z02riKhJu0T0sC56eS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122846'),
  ('554562774946947864', 'O Diário de Tati', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Farias, Janaina Ferreira, Juarez Dagoberto Costa', 'Maria Camargo, Rene Belmonte', 'Heloísa Périssé, Louise Cardoso, Thiago Rodrigues, Marcelo Adnet, Pedro Neschling, Thais Fersoza, Marcos Caruso, Márcia Cabrita', null, 'Tati is a typical teenager, unable to learn mathematics, but very intelligent when creating plans to escape the punishment of the mother. During the summer, she needs to hide that she has to do math classes to improve her grades, conquer Zeca, the most popular boy in school and also care for the heartache of her mother, who wants to try to find a new love.', 'Tati is a typical teenager, unable to learn mathematics, but very intelligent when creating plans to escape the punishment of the mother. During the summer, she needs to hide that she has to do math classes to improve her grades, conquer Zeca, the most popular boy in school and also care for the heartache of her mother, who wants to try to find a new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkSbWAsdUW2DzV7R1gdQ7fCWcJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156033'),
