  ('1125911042957272004', 'O Filho Eterno', 2016, 'Drama, Family', 'Paulo Machline, Carlos Firmino', 'Leonardo Levis', 'Marcos Veras, Débora Falabella, Nila, Augusto Madeira, Uyara Torrente, Rodrigo Ferrarini, Luiz Bertazzo, Greice Barros', null, 'Roberto is in the edge to become a father for the first time. He was already dreaming of the years yet to come, wondering how his son would be. While trying to figure out how to act like a father he must also face and endure a tough reality - to be a Down syndrome child''s dad. Insecure and ashamed of the situation he will have to confront and overcome it.', 'Roberto is in the edge to become a father for the first time. He was already dreaming of the years yet to come, wondering how his son would be. While trying to figure out how to act like a father he must also face and endure a tough reality - to be a Down syndrome child''s dad. Insecure and ashamed of the situation he will have to confront and overcome it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUQoV5uFIllGJyetFGrJE2xZ5ZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417565'),
