  ('410673844059537441', 'O orgasmos tis ageladas', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Olga Malea', 'Olga Malea, Apostolos Alexopoulos', 'Irini Balta, Natalia Stylianou, Eleni Gerasimidou, Katerina Didaskalou, Kostas Koklas, Alexandros Koliopoulos, Vladimiros Kiriakidis, Iro Mane', null, 'Two young women, who live in a provincial town in Thessaly, come of age in their own unique ways. Through flirtations, unrequited love, sexual urges, misunderstandings, and excesses, the two friends quickly realize that their future lies far away from their provincial town. Armed with hope and dreams, they set off for the big city and its opportunities.', 'Two young women, who live in a provincial town in Thessaly, come of age in their own unique ways. Through flirtations, unrequited love, sexual urges, misunderstandings, and excesses, the two friends quickly realize that their future lies far away from their provincial town. Armed with hope and dreams, they set off for the big city and its opportunities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Q4YxW7EgseL4X4znQHQX1QIDuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296363'),
  ('1108041086574199717', 'Ó Paí, Ó 2', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lílis Soares, Viviane Ferreira', 'Daniel Arcades, Viviane Ferreira, Elísio Lopes Jr.', 'Lázaro Ramos, João Pedro Costa, Luciana Souza, Tânia Toko, Érico Brás, Valdineia Soriano, Leno Sacramento, Fábio de Santana', null, 'Experience Roque''s routine years after the first movie. Joana''s tenement is still full of parties, gossip and confusion. The neighborhood prepares for the Iemanjá party, while dealing with the controversies of the neighbors.', 'Experience Roque''s routine years after the first movie. Joana''s tenement is still full of parties, gossip and confusion. The neighborhood prepares for the Iemanjá party, while dealing with the controversies of the neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTus3KG0ZAbqbuHWBafV7Adsbyf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116407'),
