  ('195150079917237394', 'O Shaolin do Sertão', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Dayane Queiroz, Carina Sanginitto, Mikaela Feitosa', 'L.G. Bayão', 'Edmilson Filho, Igor Jansen, Falcão, Fafy Siqueira, Bruna Hamu, Dedé Santana, Frank Menezes, Denis Lacerda', null, 'Aluízio Li is a martial arts fan who lives with his head in the world of fights from dreaming and watching Chinese films. He believes he is a Shaolin monk, dressing and behaving just like his cinematic references. However, he is the subject of mocking jokes in his hometown, Quixadá, in the backlands of Ceará. His days of peace will end when retired MMA fighter Toni Tora Pleura announces a "tour" of challenges to bullies in several cities in the interior of Ceará, including Quixadá.', 'Aluízio Li is a martial arts fan who lives with his head in the world of fights from dreaming and watching Chinese films. He believes he is a Shaolin monk, dressing and behaving just like his cinematic references. However, he is the subject of mocking jokes in his hometown, Quixadá, in the backlands of Ceará. His days of peace will end when retired MMA fighter Toni Tora Pleura announces a "tour" of challenges to bullies in several cities in the interior of Ceará, including Quixadá.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHmD5ziiVvOM1femGTazj4bfkGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420703'),
  ('1136248460085061358', 'O Último Virgem', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Felipe Bretas, Rilson Baco, Julia Equi', 'Felipe Adler, L.G. Bayão', 'Guilherme Prates, Bia Arantes, Fiorella Mattheis, Felipe Adler, Éverlley Santos, Christian Villegas, Gabi Lopes, Camila Mayrink', null, 'Dudu is a shy boy who, in his senior year of high school, is still a virgin. This situation makes him the constant target of jokes from his inseparable friends. One day, at the end of the school year, he is invited by the gorgeous Professor Deborah to take extra lessons at her house. The situation soon causes Dudu and his friends to believe that she is flirting on the boy, who cares more than never about his sexual inexperience.', 'Dudu is a shy boy who, in his senior year of high school, is still a virgin. This situation makes him the constant target of jokes from his inseparable friends. One day, at the end of the school year, he is invited by the gorgeous Professor Deborah to take extra lessons at her house. The situation soon causes Dudu and his friends to believe that she is flirting on the boy, who cares more than never about his sexual inexperience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yVqc1K0XWiJAf6YvRgfzlezvEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322986'),
  ('533250045539780416', 'O Velho Fusca', 2026, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Emiliano Ruschel', 'Bill Labonia', 'Caio Manhente, Tonico Pereira, Cleo', null, 'A sensitive 18-year-old strikes a deal with his hard-edged grandfather to earn a forgotten 1976 VW Bug. As they clash over pride and masculinity, restoring the car forces them to confront old wounds and redefine what it means to be a man.', 'A sensitive 18-year-old strikes a deal with his hard-edged grandfather to earn a forgotten 1976 VW Bug. As they clash over pride and masculinity, restoring the car forces them to confront old wounds and redefine what it means to be a man.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FgWZqofCe5IQXkYFENg6y5Z6N2LK.jpg', 'plex:movie:o-velho-fusca'),
  ('584819537016828318', 'O Vendedor de Passados', 2014, 'Drama', 'Lula Buarque de Hollanda, Toca Seabra', 'Isabel Muniz', 'Lázaro Ramos, Mayana Neiva, Alinne Moraes, Marcello Escorel, Debora Olivieri, Ruth de Souza, Odilon Wagner, Anderson Muller', null, 'A man, who creates pasts for a living, struggles to find his own past while a mysterious woman takes a dangerous step.', 'A man, who creates pasts for a living, struggles to find his own past while a mysterious woman takes a dangerous step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEDegnyXrIDoTKCWHvqCuOhzgOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248549'),
  ('842924352243603628', 'O Vestido', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paulo Thiago, Guy Gonçalves', 'Paulo Thiago, Haroldo Marinho Barbosa', 'Ana Beatriz Nogueira, Leonardo Vieira, Gabriela Duarte, Stela Freitas, Othon Bastos, Ana Lúcia Torre, Daniel Dantas, Paulo José', null, 'Ulisses has failed in his professional life, but leads a happy life with his wife Ângela and their two daughters. Until the day he is introduced to Bárbara, a very beautiful woman living in Rio de Janeiro. Ângela becomes her friend and gives her the dress Ulisses had given her. From then on, marital problems arise, and he becomes increasingly attracted to Bárbara.', 'Ulisses has failed in his professional life, but leads a happy life with his wife Ângela and their two daughters. Until the day he is introduced to Bárbara, a very beautiful woman living in Rio de Janeiro. Ângela becomes her friend and gives her the dress Ulisses had given her. From then on, marital problems arise, and he becomes increasingly attracted to Bárbara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27GZlahF6TE2RCE9ZmFK6Ebgmgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77708'),
  ('1116394525527579707', 'O-Bi, O-Ba: The End of Civilization', 1985, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Piotr Szulkin, Witold Sobociński', 'Piotr Szulkin', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Krystyna Janda, Kalina Jędrusik, Mariusz Dmochowski, Marek Walczewski, Jan Nowicki, Henryk Bista, Leon Niemczyk', null, 'The world has been ravaged by nuclear war. The planet is frozen and radiation kills anyone or anything that ventures outside of ''The Dome''. Soft is a shepherd for the last remnants of humanity who have gathered together as they await rescue from a mysterious craft known only as ''The Ark.'' He wanders among the masses, performing his regular daily tasks; keeping morale from plummeting, wooing prostitutes, squashing rebellions, and sometimes feeding the hungry. But as the true and sinister nature of ''The Dome'' comes to light, Soft must ask himself if humanity is worth saving...', 'The world has been ravaged by nuclear war. The planet is frozen and radiation kills anyone or anything that ventures outside of ''The Dome''. Soft is a shepherd for the last remnants of humanity who have gathered together as they await rescue from a mysterious craft known only as ''The Ark.'' He wanders among the masses, performing his regular daily tasks; keeping morale from plummeting, wooing prostitutes, squashing rebellions, and sometimes feeding the hungry. But as the true and sinister nature of ''The Dome'' comes to light, Soft must ask himself if humanity is worth saving...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opw0YubfwkIECFLsHqdYhvb8K6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71933'),
  ('651295786401208502', 'O-Solar-Meow', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Abe Levitow', null, null, null, 'A supply satellite arrives at the space station where Tom (despite his high-tech gadgets) is having no better luck than usual at catching Jerry before he gets the cheese.', 'A supply satellite arrives at the space station where Tom (despite his high-tech gadgets) is having no better luck than usual at catching Jerry before he gets the cheese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obF9DnzAW6XXsVKMCMNksaPcjMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219570'),
  ('966652384512044241', 'O. Henry''s Full House', 1952, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Henry Hathaway, Henry King, Howard Hawks', 'Ben Roberts, Lamar Trotti, Richard L. Breen', 'Fred Allen, Anne Baxter, Jeanne Crain, Farley Granger, Charles Laughton, Oscar Levant, Marilyn Monroe, Jean Peters', 'NR', 'Five O. Henry stories, each separate. The primary one from the critics'' acclaim was "The Cop and the Anthem". Soapy tells fellow bum Horace that he is going to get arrested so he can spend the winter in a nice jail cell. He fails. He can''t even accost a woman; she turns out to be a streetwalker. The other stories are "The Clarion Call", "The Last Leaf", "The Ransom of Red Chief", and "The Gift of the Magi".', 'Five O. Henry stories, each separate. The primary one from the critics'' acclaim was "The Cop and the Anthem". Soapy tells fellow bum Horace that he is going to get arrested so he can spend the winter in a nice jail cell. He fails. He can''t even accost a woman; she turns out to be a streetwalker. The other stories are "The Clarion Call", "The Last Leaf", "The Ransom of Red Chief", and "The Gift of the Magi".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vznk8LPE5nRRbNjeTG20P42yy2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24006'),
  ('198879434326177823', 'O... Çocukları', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Murat Saraçoğlu', 'Sırrı Süreyya Önder', 'Demet Akbağ, Özgü Namal, Sarp Apak, Altan Erkekli, İpek Tuzcuoğlu, Sezin Akbaşoğulları, Mahir İpek, Deniz Özerman', null, 'After the coup d''état on September 12, 1980, a husband and wife wanted for political crimes decide to flee abroad. But their children are the biggest obstacle to this plan. Before fleeing abroad, they search for a safe place to leave their children. The couple finally chooses Mehtap Anne''s home as the "safest place" for their children. The place where they left their children is actually the "Emanetçi Anne" house, where Mehtap, a former prostitute, takes in the children of other prostitutes who continue to work in the trade after she has left it... Some time after the couple flees abroad, they send an Italian girl to Turkey to retrieve their children. The Italian girl, who wants to take the child left with the "Emanetçi Anne" and bring it to its parents, finds herself caught up in a series of interesting events.', 'After the coup d''état on September 12, 1980, a husband and wife wanted for political crimes decide to flee abroad. But their children are the biggest obstacle to this plan. Before fleeing abroad, they search for a safe place to leave their children. The couple finally chooses Mehtap Anne''s home as the "safest place" for their children. The place where they left their children is actually the "Emanetçi Anne" house, where Mehtap, a former prostitute, takes in the children of other prostitutes who continue to work in the trade after she has left it... Some time after the couple flees abroad, they send an Italian girl to Turkey to retrieve their children. The Italian girl, who wants to take the child left with the "Emanetçi Anne" and bring it to its parents, finds herself caught up in a series of interesting events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brfNqPvCjCu1wXqlRzXWasieqd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27956'),
  ('30069624628001214', 'O.C. and Stiggs', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Robert Altman, Pierre Mignot', 'Donald Cantrell, Ted Mann', 'Daniel H. Jenkins, Neill Barry, Jane Curtin, Paul Dooley, Jon Cryer, Ray Walston, Cynthia Nixon, Dennis Hopper', 'R', 'O.C. and Stiggs aren''t your average unhappy teenagers. They not only despise their suburban surroundings, but they also plot against it. They seek revenge against the upper-middle-class Schwab family, who embody all they detest: excess.', 'O.C. and Stiggs aren''t your average unhappy teenagers. They not only despise their suburban surroundings, but they also plot against it. They seek revenge against the upper-middle-class Schwab family, who embody all they detest: excess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68JG3eNZD6KrGF03Jg0WM0iPll8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27464'),
  ('114452669419682179', 'O.G.', 2018, 'Drama', 'Madeleine Sackler, Wolfgang Held', 'Stephen Belber', 'Jeffrey Wright, Theothus Carter, William Fichtner, Boyd Holbrook, Mare Winningham, David Patrick Kelly, Yul Vazquez, Bahni Turpin', null, 'Louis Menkins is five weeks away from being released after 26 years in prison. He is faced with the decision to put his own release at risk in order to protect a young man named Beecher from growing gang controversies.', 'Louis Menkins is five weeks away from being released after 26 years in prison. He is faced with the decision to put his own release at risk in order to protect a young man named Beecher from growing gang controversies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouf0Hq3dtyryraPAuEZAHSBwtLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506558'),
  ('1006107156021774634', 'O.J.: Made in America', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime, History', 'Ezra Edelman, Nick Higgins', null, 'O. J. Simpson, Nicole Brown Simpson, Marcia Clark, Danny Bakewell Sr., F. Lee Bailey, Peter Hyams, Willie Brown, Harry Edwards', 'NR', 'A chronicle of the rise and fall of O.J. Simpson, whose high-profile murder trial exposed the extent of American racial tensions, revealing a fractured and divided nation.', 'A chronicle of the rise and fall of O.J. Simpson, whose high-profile murder trial exposed the extent of American racial tensions, revealing a fractured and divided nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FW1ViDhIShRpjQx8isstiB6jel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377462'),
  ('914358525410465878', 'O.S.S.', 1946, 'War, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Irving Pichel, Lionel Lindon, John Francis Murphy', 'Robert Thoeren', 'Alan Ladd, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Patric Knowles, John Hoyt, Gloria Saunders, Richard Webb, Richard Benedict, Harold Vermilyea', 'NR', 'The (O)ffice of (S)trategic (S)ervices'' Cmdr. Brady (Patric Knowles) forms Operation "Applejack" (based on a composite of actual incidents during WWII) and sends Lt. (j.g.) Philip Masson, U.S.N.R. aka John Martin as spy Philippe Martine (Alan Ladd) along with Miss Ellen Rogers posing as her college roommate, Madame Elaine Duprez (Geraldine Fitzgerald) and Robert Bouchet, Tech Sgt., A.U.S. as Albert Bernardito (Richard Benedict) to acquire secret Nazi plans. After nearly getting caught they succeed and get new identities. However they discover a secret that could change the war and risk their lives to get the information back to London before it jeopardizes their lives.', 'The (O)ffice of (S)trategic (S)ervices'' Cmdr. Brady (Patric Knowles) forms Operation "Applejack" (based on a composite of actual incidents during WWII) and sends Lt. (j.g.) Philip Masson, U.S.N.R. aka John Martin as spy Philippe Martine (Alan Ladd) along with Miss Ellen Rogers posing as her college roommate, Madame Elaine Duprez (Geraldine Fitzgerald) and Robert Bouchet, Tech Sgt., A.U.S. as Albert Bernardito (Richard Benedict) to acquire secret Nazi plans. After nearly getting caught they succeed and get new identities. However they discover a secret that could change the war and risk their lives to get the information back to London before it jeopardizes their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kt52Hfkgpecujc1YFk8i9zXzWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94641'),
  ('1119002130446347881', 'O.S.S. 117: Mission to Tokyo', 1966, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Michel Boisrond', 'Terence Young, Pierre Foucaud, Marcel Mithois', 'Frederick Stafford, Marina Vlady, Henri Serre, Jitsuko Yoshimura, Valéry Inkijinoff, Jacques Legras, Mario Pisu, Colin Drake', null, 'After an American Navy base is annihilated by a secret weapon, Agent OSS 117 is sent to Japan to investigate the organization that''s claiming responsibility, and threatening the US with another attack, if they don''t pay.', 'After an American Navy base is annihilated by a secret weapon, Agent OSS 117 is sent to Japan to investigate the organization that''s claiming responsibility, and threatening the US with another attack, if they don''t pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGYq9z1i20zIdFdcmd9NwtkM0vI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111475'),
  ('776850023703863373', 'O'' Christmas Tree', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Bert Ring', 'John Loy', 'Ed Asner, Tim Conway, Marie Osmond, Debi Derryberry, Pamela Adlon, Jess Harnell', 'G', 'On Christmas Eve, a forlorn little pine tree feels she is too homely to ever realize her dream of being a real Christmas tree. With the help of a comical Baby Bear, a happy-go-lucky Squirrel, a cynical Nutcracker, and a host of other forest critters, as well as a visit from Santa Claus himself, the little tree discovers the true beauty of the season... shines from within!', 'On Christmas Eve, a forlorn little pine tree feels she is too homely to ever realize her dream of being a real Christmas tree. With the help of a comical Baby Bear, a happy-go-lucky Squirrel, a cynical Nutcracker, and a host of other forest critters, as well as a visit from Santa Claus himself, the little tree discovers the true beauty of the season... shines from within!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIT6DHDRFYektpbwLo1hYUkMV2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50932'),
  ('321693311917137432', 'O'' Romeo', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Ben Bernhard, Konstantin Minnich, Saurabh Goswami, Abhay Datt Sharma, Samir Zaidi', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Rohan Narula, Hussain Zaidi, Priti Shahani', 'Shahid Kapoor, Triptii Dimri, Avinash Tiwary, Nana Patekar, Hussain Dalal', null, 'In post-independence Mumbai, the underworld rises amidst a changing city. This gritty tale explores the criminal landscape of a bygone era, weaving through the streets and shadows of India''s bustling metropolis.', 'In post-independence Mumbai, the underworld rises amidst a changing city. This gritty tale explores the criminal landscape of a bygone era, weaving through the streets and shadows of India''s bustling metropolis.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaTnIGrfVv03FIDsNDuabNsp9yFM.jpg', 'plex:movie:o-romeo'),
  ('281325258874753215', 'O''Dessa', 2025, 'Music, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Geremy Jasper, Rina Yang, Tina Fratnik', 'Geremy Jasper', 'Sadie Sink, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Murray Bartlett, Regina Hall, Pokey LaFarge, Mark Boone Junior, Bree Elrod, Dora Dimić Rakar', 'PG-13', 'A farm girl is on an epic quest to recover a cherished family heirloom. Her journey leads her to a strange and dangerous city where she meets her one true love – but in order to save his soul, she must put the power of destiny and song to the ultimate test.', 'A farm girl is on an epic quest to recover a cherished family heirloom. Her journey leads her to a strange and dangerous city where she meets her one true love – but in order to save his soul, she must put the power of destiny and song to the ultimate test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7EcAvzYaYfKv4JXKroJYfaTzSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075456'),
  ('514021850028538385', 'O''Horten', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bent Hamer, John Christian Rosenlund', 'Bent Hamer', 'Baard Owe, Espen Skjønberg, Ghita Nørby, Bjørn Floberg, Henny Moan, Bjarte Hjelmeland, Kai Remlov, Trond-Viggo Torgersen', null, 'Odd Horton is dependable and contained: he''s a train driver retiring after 40 years of service, living a simple life. His idea of adventure is to fly from one city in Norway to another. Starting on the night of his retirement dinner, Odd has a series of dislocating experiences: a boy insists that Odd sit by his bedside while he falls asleep; misadventure causes Odd to miss his last run; he witnesses an arrest; he assists an old man and makes a friend; he takes a trip with a blindfolded driver; he adopts a dog; he takes stock late one night at the roundhouse; he revisits his mother''s disappointment in him. How should he live the rest of his life?', 'Odd Horton is dependable and contained: he''s a train driver retiring after 40 years of service, living a simple life. His idea of adventure is to fly from one city in Norway to another. Starting on the night of his retirement dinner, Odd has a series of dislocating experiences: a boy insists that Odd sit by his bedside while he falls asleep; misadventure causes Odd to miss his last run; he witnesses an arrest; he assists an old man and makes a friend; he takes a trip with a blindfolded driver; he adopts a dog; he takes stock late one night at the roundhouse; he revisits his mother''s disappointment in him. How should he live the rest of his life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOTDPnPVykfS2WprAJc5mkq5ltu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8933'),
  ('930373622994385729', 'Oasis', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Chang-dong, Kim Kwang-sik, Choi Yeong-taek', 'Lee Chang-dong', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Moon So-ri, Ahn Nae-sang, Ryoo Seung-wan, Son Byung-ho, Kim Jin-goo, Chu Gwi-jeong, Yoon Ga-hyun', null, 'A young man released from prison visits the widow of the man he killed drunk-driving and becomes infatuated with his cerebral palsy-stricken daughter.', 'A young man released from prison visits the widow of the man he killed drunk-driving and becomes infatuated with his cerebral palsy-stricken daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaajiBpeBVbVwovpSQKaMfKRGKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26955'),
  ('3617886294609789', 'Oasis of Fear', 1971, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Umberto Lenzi, Alfio Contini', 'Lucia Drudi Demby, Umberto Lenzi, Antonio Altoviti', 'Irene Papas, Ray Lovelock, Ornella Muti, Michel Bardinet, Jacques Stany, Umberto D''Orsi, Calisto Calisti, Ugo Adinolfi', null, 'Two young sexually free hippies, Dick and Ingrid, finance their travels by selling naked snaps of Ingrid until their plan is brought to an abrupt end by the Police. Forced on the run the two seek refuge at a seemingly empty isolated large villa. As it turns out the house is inhabited by the middle-aged Barbara who invites them in for some potential three-way hanky-panky that soon locks them into something far more twisted and chilling!', 'Two young sexually free hippies, Dick and Ingrid, finance their travels by selling naked snaps of Ingrid until their plan is brought to an abrupt end by the Police. Forced on the run the two seek refuge at a seemingly empty isolated large villa. As it turns out the house is inhabited by the middle-aged Barbara who invites them in for some potential three-way hanky-panky that soon locks them into something far more twisted and chilling!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHpcAw4XOb1NDpseRBM7UxYT6mO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64630'),
  ('994929212565547313', 'Oasis of the Zombies', 1982, 'Horror', 'Claude Panier, Jesús Franco, Max Monteillet', 'Jesús Franco', 'Manuel Gélin, France Lomay, Myriam Landson, Éric Viellard, Caroline Audret, Henri Lambert, Miguel Ángel Aristu, Albino Graziani', null, 'In a remote desert oasis, a fortune in gold was hidden by the Nazis during World War 2. 50 years later, a bunch of fortune-hunters converge on that selfsame oasis. Imagine their discomfiture upon discovering that the gold is being guarded by an army of zombies.', 'In a remote desert oasis, a fortune in gold was hidden by the Nazis during World War 2. 50 years later, a bunch of fortune-hunters converge on that selfsame oasis. Imagine their discomfiture upon discovering that the gold is being guarded by an army of zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2r6rwwHPi0WiBXyPjspsiVrDd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36835'),
  ('318505099379201494', 'Oasis: Knebworth 1996', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jake Scott', null, 'Liam Gallagher, Noel Gallagher, Paul Arthurs, Paul McGuigan, Alan White, John Squire, Nigel Rogers Agogo, Beth Banks', null, 'Oasis Knebworth 1996 - the eagerly anticipated feature length documentary telling the story of the special relationship between Oasis and their fans that made the largest concert of the 90''s possible, directed by Grammy Award-winner Jake Scott. It is told entirely in the moment through the eyes of the fans who were there, built around extensive and never before seen archive concert and backstage footage from the event, with additional interviews with the band and concert organisers. Also included are the full concerts from both nights, edited by Dick Carruthers with audio mixed by Will Shapland in 5.1 surround sound.', 'Oasis Knebworth 1996 - the eagerly anticipated feature length documentary telling the story of the special relationship between Oasis and their fans that made the largest concert of the 90''s possible, directed by Grammy Award-winner Jake Scott. It is told entirely in the moment through the eyes of the fans who were there, built around extensive and never before seen archive concert and backstage footage from the event, with additional interviews with the band and concert organisers. Also included are the full concerts from both nights, edited by Dick Carruthers with audio mixed by Will Shapland in 5.1 surround sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2JnQl0ZSwHCl7zphwsEeM6HTDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850490'),
  ('19549124606560235', 'Oba: The Last Samurai', 2011, 'War, Drama', 'Hideyuki Hirayama, Garry Waller, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Don Jones', 'Yutaka Takenouchi, Toshiaki Karasawa, Mao Inoue, Takayuki Yamada, Tomoko Nakajima, Yoshinori Okada, Sadao Abe, Sean McGowan', null, 'In 1944, the American military lands on the shores of Saipan. Refusing to commit suicide with his superiors or be forced into camps for prisoners of war, Captain Oba Sakae leads a group of his men and other similarly minded local residents into the mountains. Even after hearing reports of the Japanese military''s surrender, Oba dismisses the reports as propaganda and continues to launch guerilla attacks against the American soldiers, earning him the nickname "The Fox". Soon, even the American commander who''s charged with the task of capturing Oba comes to admire his persistent enemy.', 'In 1944, the American military lands on the shores of Saipan. Refusing to commit suicide with his superiors or be forced into camps for prisoners of war, Captain Oba Sakae leads a group of his men and other similarly minded local residents into the mountains. Even after hearing reports of the Japanese military''s surrender, Oba dismisses the reports as propaganda and continues to launch guerilla attacks against the American soldiers, earning him the nickname "The Fox". Soon, even the American commander who''s charged with the task of capturing Oba comes to admire his persistent enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPGTbVADWCAsgUcr4wtjJUpTh8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78486'),
  ('734422659292061952', 'Obaba', 2005, 'Drama', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Pilar López de Ayala, Juan Diego Botto, Bárbara Lennie, Eduard Fernández, Peter Lohmeyer, Héctor Colomé, Pepa López, Txema Blasco', null, 'A rural drama set in Obaba, a mythical region in northern Spain, where a young filmmaker struggled to capture the feel of the area, which in turn leads to a wealth of self-discovery.', 'A rural drama set in Obaba, a mythical region in northern Spain, where a young filmmaker struggled to capture the feel of the area, which in turn leads to a wealth of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvLJfW1soIFBGtexcRaFuMYRDRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115508'),
  ('419379855089465417', 'Obendrüber, da schneit es', 2012, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Vivian Naefe, Peter Döttling', 'Astrid Ruppert', 'Diana Amft, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Gisela Schneeberger, August Zirner, Bibiana Zeller, Fred Stillkrauth, Thomas Loibl, Janina Fautz', null, 'Christmas! Every year, expectations are high again. And that''s why a little dissatisfaction quickly becomes the deepest despair. "Over there, it''s snowing" tells of the joy and sorrow of December 23rd and 24th, as experienced by the residents of a Munich townhouse. The focus is on the freshly separated Miriam, her daughter Julchen and the awkward pastor Gregor.', 'Christmas! Every year, expectations are high again. And that''s why a little dissatisfaction quickly becomes the deepest despair. "Over there, it''s snowing" tells of the joy and sorrow of December 23rd and 24th, as experienced by the residents of a Munich townhouse. The focus is on the freshly separated Miriam, her daughter Julchen and the awkward pastor Gregor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ePJGwA3WNW8X9zaAfSKxgmHV34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245481'),
  ('1026129595177612847', 'Obex', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Albert Birney, Pete Ohs', 'Albert Birney, Pete Ohs', 'Dorothy the Dog, Callie Hernandez, Paisley Isaacs, Frank Mosley, Tyler Davis', 'R', 'Conor Marsh lives a secluded life with his dog, Sandy, until one day he begins playing OBEX, a new, state-of-the-art computer game. When Sandy goes missing, the line between reality and game blurs and Conor must venture into the strange world of OBEX to bring her home.', 'Conor Marsh lives a secluded life with his dog, Sandy, until one day he begins playing OBEX, a new, state-of-the-art computer game. When Sandy goes missing, the line between reality and game blurs and Conor must venture into the strange world of OBEX to bring her home.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd1bd36ba1afdd48e06cff64f4dd3f3ae.jpg', 'plex:movie:obex'),
  ('137888498571602102', 'Obi-Wan Kenobi: A Jedi''s Return', 2022, 'Documentary', 'David Gelb, Chloe Weaver', null, 'Ewan McGregor, Hayden Christensen, Deborah Chow, Moses Ingram, Vivien Lyra Blair, Joby Harold, Rupert Friend, Joel Edgerton', 'PG-13', 'This special explores the return of Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker to the screen, as well as Ewan McGregor and Hayden Christensen to their classic roles. Director Deborah Chow leads the cast and crew as they create new heroes and villains that live alongside new incarnations of beloved Star Wars characters, and an epic story that dramatically bridges the saga films.', 'This special explores the return of Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker to the screen, as well as Ewan McGregor and Hayden Christensen to their classic roles. Director Deborah Chow leads the cast and crew as they create new heroes and villains that live alongside new incarnations of beloved Star Wars characters, and an epic story that dramatically bridges the saga films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQGgvXjoMZf8x1m3BHsMxVXPyck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015606'),
  ('68460782897922152', 'Object of Obsession', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Daniel Carrey, Phil Robinson', 'Brad Marlowe', 'Scott Valentine, Erika Anderson, Elizabeth Whitcraft, Robert Keith, Jane A. Rogers, Jane Higginson, Alisha Das, Ashby Adams', null, 'A divorced woman seeks new sexual adventures in this erotic tale. What she doesn''t count on is that her new lover will take her as a hostage and hold her against her will.', 'A divorced woman seeks new sexual adventures in this erotic tale. What she doesn''t count on is that her new lover will take her as a hostage and hold her against her will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laYcMh2hNjxQMoKfaRSm1YdrAMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278603'),
  ('892323955790402527', 'Objectified', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Gary Hustwit, Luke Geissbühler', null, 'Paola Antonelli, Chris Bangle, Andrew Blauvelt, Erwan Bouroullec, Ronan Bouroullec, Anthony Dunne, Agnete Enga, Dan Formosa', 'NR', 'A feature-length documentary about our complex relationship with manufactured objects and, by extension, the people who design them.', 'A feature-length documentary about our complex relationship with manufactured objects and, by extension, the people who design them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwzizbx09vLedeD2gcAaFbo9fes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23951'),
  ('372334195031594305', 'Objective, Burma!', 1945, 'War, Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Raoul Walsh, James Wong Howe', 'Ranald MacDougall, Lester Cole', 'Errol Flynn, Henry Hull, George Tobias, Anthony Caruso, James Brown, Richard Erdman, Joel Allen, John Alvin', 'NR', 'A group of men parachute into Japanese-occupied Burma with a dangerous and important mission: to locate and blow up a radar station. They accomplish this well enough, but when they try to rendezvous at an old air-strip to be taken back to their base, they find Japanese waiting for them, and they must make a long, difficult walk back through enemy-occupied jungle.', 'A group of men parachute into Japanese-occupied Burma with a dangerous and important mission: to locate and blow up a radar station. They accomplish this well enough, but when they try to rendezvous at an old air-strip to be taken back to their base, they find Japanese waiting for them, and they must make a long, difficult walk back through enemy-occupied jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hq4VhEMseKMZuNUaSExDyqGhja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43490'),
  ('976317015694474451', 'Objective: 500 Million', 1966, 'Action', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer, Alain Levent', 'Jorge Semprún, Pierre Schoendoerffer', 'Bruno Cremer, Marisa Mell, Jean-Claude Rolland, Étienne Bierry, Pierre Fromont, Jean-François Chauvel, D. Zimbaca, Hong Mai Thomas', null, 'Reichau, a former army captain, is back in France after serving three years in prison for belonging to the OAS (Secret Armed Organization), a dissident paramilitary group during the Algerian War. Marked by his past, he does not believe in the values of his country any more. At a loss to know what to do with his life, he agrees one day to take part in a heist set up by Pierre, a pilot, the very man who gave him away in Oran. The operation, in which Yo, a gorgeous woman, participates, consists in stealing a bag containing 55 million francs during a Paris-Bordeaux flight...', 'Reichau, a former army captain, is back in France after serving three years in prison for belonging to the OAS (Secret Armed Organization), a dissident paramilitary group during the Algerian War. Marked by his past, he does not believe in the values of his country any more. At a loss to know what to do with his life, he agrees one day to take part in a heist set up by Pierre, a pilot, the very man who gave him away in Oran. The operation, in which Yo, a gorgeous woman, participates, consists in stealing a bag containing 55 million francs during a Paris-Bordeaux flight...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3htQm2Zsirie3PG28Oz0Ju6XtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3693'),
  ('968126605231069533', 'Objetivo: BI-KI-NI', 1968, 'Action, Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, José Puyol, Andrés Vich', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Gracita Morales, José Luis López Vázquez, Antonio Ozores, Alicia Tomás, Marisol Ayuso, Judith Lorick, Antonio Pica, Emilio Laguna', null, 'In Cape Kennedy, a con man accidentally swallows a valuable microfilm, believing it a pill for heartburn. Parody of the James Bond films.', 'In Cape Kennedy, a con man accidentally swallows a valuable microfilm, believing it a pill for heartburn. Parody of the James Bond films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cs1S83qXfljqEWe9OD4p3fnys4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215597'),
  ('829545852950392622', 'Oblivion', 1994, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Western, Comedy', 'Adolfo Bartoli, Daniel Bărbulescu, Cristian Ciurea', 'Peter David', 'Richard Joseph Paul, Jackie Swanson, Andrew Divoff, Meg Foster, Isaac Hayes, Julie Newmar, Carel Struycken, George Takei', 'PG-13', 'On another planet which resembles the Old West, a die-hard pacifist is forced to re-examine his ways after an evil alien bandit and his gang murder his estranged sheriff father, take over his home town, and threaten his friends.', 'On another planet which resembles the Old West, a die-hard pacifist is forced to re-examine his ways after an evil alien bandit and his gang murder his estranged sheriff father, take over his home town, and threaten his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh1I8pMrXMnjb98gGECfykwu8xX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49050'),
  ('993822445260404102', 'Oblivion', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Mystery', 'Kevin Loo, Joseph Kosinski, Claudio Miranda', 'Karl Gajdusek, Michael Arndt', 'Tom Cruise, Morgan Freeman, Olga Kurylenko, Andrea Riseborough, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Melissa Leo, Zoë Bell, Abigail Lowe', 'PG-13', 'Jack Harper is one of the last few drone repairmen stationed on Earth. Part of a massive operation to extract vital resources after decades of war with a terrifying threat known as the Scavs, Jack’s mission is nearly complete. His existence is brought crashing down when he rescues a beautiful stranger from a downed spacecraft. Her arrival triggers a chain of events that forces him to question everything he knows and puts the fate of humanity in his hands.', 'Jack Harper is one of the last few drone repairmen stationed on Earth. Part of a massive operation to extract vital resources after decades of war with a terrifying threat known as the Scavs, Jack’s mission is nearly complete. His existence is brought crashing down when he rescues a beautiful stranger from a downed spacecraft. Her arrival triggers a chain of events that forces him to question everything he knows and puts the fate of humanity in his hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYLM3GpNUZnoFElPXp1zlhDPdtv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75612'),
  ('506493755338040781', 'Oblivion 2: Backlash', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Western, Comedy', 'Adolfo Bartoli, Daniel Bărbulescu, Aldo Antonelli', 'Peter David', 'Richard Joseph Paul, Jackie Swanson, Andrew Divoff, Meg Foster, Isaac Hayes, Julie Newmar, Carel Struycken, George Takei', 'PG-13', 'In the alien-western world of Oblivion, a suave, yet lethal bounty hunter named Sweeney arrives to arrest the seductive outlaw Lash on multiple charges, including murder. Lash, who just "inherited" a mine of Derconium (the most valuable mineral in the universe) from Crowley in a game of cards, meets up with Redeye''s brother, Jaggar, who wants the mine for himself to rule the galaxy. It''s a fight over Lash between the sheriff of Oblivion, Jaggar, and Sweeney. But who will emerge victorious?', 'In the alien-western world of Oblivion, a suave, yet lethal bounty hunter named Sweeney arrives to arrest the seductive outlaw Lash on multiple charges, including murder. Lash, who just "inherited" a mine of Derconium (the most valuable mineral in the universe) from Crowley in a game of cards, meets up with Redeye''s brother, Jaggar, who wants the mine for himself to rule the galaxy. It''s a fight over Lash between the sheriff of Oblivion, Jaggar, and Sweeney. But who will emerge victorious?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nC88F3tNp1MKSFWMPGEixjqvhu9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80985'),
  ('330072790315345446', 'Oblivion Island: Haruka and the Magic Mirror', 2009, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Shinsuke Sato, Hirofumi Uchihori, Nobumasa Hoshino', 'Otsuichi, Shinsuke Sato', 'Haruka Ayase, Mitsuki Tanimura, Naho Toda, Nao Omori, Miyuki Sawashiro, Iemasa Kayumi, Tamaki Matsumoto, Akihiko Ishizumi', null, 'Your favourite teddy bear. That model kit that took so long to complete. The picture book you used to read over and over again. The shining stone you found that day in the park. Where do all your childhood''s treasures go when you grow up? In this story, we meet fantastic creatures that gather all these little objects that fall into oblivion as they are forgotten by their owners when they step into adulthood. These creatures sneak into our world from a different dimension, and unseen by humans, they take all the ditched and forgotten "treasures" into their world. Here, they use their booty to build their own city, a fairy tale-like place called... Oblivion Island!', 'Your favourite teddy bear. That model kit that took so long to complete. The picture book you used to read over and over again. The shining stone you found that day in the park. Where do all your childhood''s treasures go when you grow up? In this story, we meet fantastic creatures that gather all these little objects that fall into oblivion as they are forgotten by their owners when they step into adulthood. These creatures sneak into our world from a different dimension, and unseen by humans, they take all the ditched and forgotten "treasures" into their world. Here, they use their booty to build their own city, a fairy tale-like place called... Oblivion Island!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6k7UuJadZOnPWQ3KWOcpVOXNgIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39544'),
  ('950072002166829418', 'Oblivion Verses', 2018, 'Drama', 'Alireza Khatami, Antoine Héberlé, Roberto Matus', 'René Ballesteros, Alireza Khatami, Dominique Welinski', 'Juan Margallo, Tomás del Estal, Manuel Morón, Itziar Aizpuru, Gonzalo Robles, Amparo Noguera, Julio Jung, Lucas Bolvarán', null, 'When the elderly caretaker of a remote morgue discovers the body of a young woman killed during a protest, he embarks on a magical odyssey to give her a proper burial before the militia returns.', 'When the elderly caretaker of a remote morgue discovers the body of a young woman killed during a protest, he embarks on a magical odyssey to give her a proper burial before the militia returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huh0JhP2JzXoaF1mdQTIZcCI7Y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471878'),
  ('1151917511731562339', 'Oblomov', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Pavel Lebeshev, Valentin Bobrovsky', 'Alexander Adabashyan, Nikita Mikhalkov', 'Oleg Tabakov, Yuri Bogatyryov, Andrei Popov, Yelena Solovey, Avangard Leontyev, Andrei Razumovsky, Oleg Kozlov, Yelena Kleshchevskaya', null, 'St. Petersburg, mid 19th century: the indolent, middle-aged Oblomov lives in a flat with his older servant, Zakhar. He sleeps much of the day, dreaming of his childhood on his parents'' estate. His boyhood companion, Stoltz, now an energetic and successful businessman, adds Oblomov to his circle whenever he''s in the city, and Oblomov''s life changes when Stoltz introduces him to Olga, lovely and cultured. When Stoltz leaves for several months, Oblomov takes a country house near Olga''s, and she determines to change him: to turn him into a man of society, action, and culture. Soon, Olga and Oblomov are in love; but where, in the triangle, does that leave Stoltz?', 'St. Petersburg, mid 19th century: the indolent, middle-aged Oblomov lives in a flat with his older servant, Zakhar. He sleeps much of the day, dreaming of his childhood on his parents'' estate. His boyhood companion, Stoltz, now an energetic and successful businessman, adds Oblomov to his circle whenever he''s in the city, and Oblomov''s life changes when Stoltz introduces him to Olga, lovely and cultured. When Stoltz leaves for several months, Oblomov takes a country house near Olga''s, and she determines to change him: to turn him into a man of society, action, and culture. Soon, Olga and Oblomov are in love; but where, in the triangle, does that leave Stoltz?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ero51WWvP9UJXPMnH3DyZLjIofR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83446'),
  ('722224946726351571', 'Obra 67', 2014, 'Crime, Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'David Sainz', null, 'Antonio Dechent, Álvaro Pérez, Jacinto Bobo, Daniel Mantero, Ken Appledorn, Ricardo Mena, Ana Saurel, Teresa Segura', null, 'After spending 20 years in prison, notorious villa thief Juan "el Candela" is released and reunited with his son Juan "el Chispa" and his friend Cristo. While "el Candela" tries to adapt to the new world he finds himself in, his son plans to raise money to fulfil his musical dream, using his father as a reference.', 'After spending 20 years in prison, notorious villa thief Juan "el Candela" is released and reunited with his son Juan "el Chispa" and his friend Cristo. While "el Candela" tries to adapt to the new world he finds himself in, his son plans to raise money to fulfil his musical dream, using his father as a reference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlETrxzhyk8oEZzh0R3J2ak7xYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241975'),
  ('233473455597622363', 'Obscene House: Slave Wife', 2020, 'Romance', 'Han Dong-Ho', null, 'Sae Bom, Kim Min-jeong, Min Do-yoon, James, Si Woo', null, 'Hyun-jung, who moved to a local mansion, was delighted with unexpected luck. She hated the noise between the floors so she wanted a quiet place with soundproofing. Since the tenants were mostly working couples, the mansion is quiet like a haunted city.', 'Hyun-jung, who moved to a local mansion, was delighted with unexpected luck. She hated the noise between the floors so she wanted a quiet place with soundproofing. Since the tenants were mostly working couples, the mansion is quiet like a haunted city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VfuzK2Qx1tIGE1nhn2G2ilF7RN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698818'),
  ('703288625899208144', 'Obscene: The Case of Peter Herzl', 1981, 'Drama', 'Hans-Christof Stenzel, Rudolf Blaháček', 'Hans-Christof Stenzel', 'Volker Spengler, Heinz Schubert, Hanno Pöschl, Monica Bleibtreu, Lydia Kreibohm, Karina Fallenstein, Dorothea Moritz, Satan Deutscher', null, 'A West German man, mistaken by the police for a left wing terrorist, hides in Vienna with a prostitute and her incestuous teen daughter. They become both a threesome and a happy surrogate family, but nothing lasts forever.', 'A West German man, mistaken by the police for a left wing terrorist, hides in Vienna with a prostitute and her incestuous teen daughter. They become both a threesome and a happy surrogate family, but nothing lasts forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4miaoCoN2vCckiMXZeGxiA7yiHA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291642'),
  ('54041624935821102', 'Obscuro Barroco', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Evangelia Kranioti, Evangelia Kranioti', null, 'Luana Muniz', null, 'A stream of consciousness from Brazil’s underground flows straight into the heart of the city’s street carnival. In between the masks and the make-up, the young, naked and new bodies and a spectacular firework display, people come into view who have undergone a transformation that makes it difficult to clearly ascribe them to any gender.', 'A stream of consciousness from Brazil’s underground flows straight into the heart of the city’s street carnival. In between the masks and the make-up, the young, naked and new bodies and a spectacular firework display, people come into view who have undergone a transformation that makes it difficult to clearly ascribe them to any gender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYEJMtms9BWJ6ZtAnR6xYhwEjsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493670'),
  ('1144056171002734234', 'Observation Man', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Woo-seong', null, 'Kim Min-jeong, Yoo Jung, Han Seok-bong, Hun-i', null, 'Newly married couple Eun-mi and Seong-soo look ordinary, but they both have their own secrets. Eun-mi enjoys calling her boyfriend to her home while her husband is away on work and Sung-soo enjoys watching his wife have sex with other men through the CCTV in his house. Not being able to get over the excitement he feels by doing that, he tells his wife everything and suggests she has sex with another man again...', 'Newly married couple Eun-mi and Seong-soo look ordinary, but they both have their own secrets. Eun-mi enjoys calling her boyfriend to her home while her husband is away on work and Sung-soo enjoys watching his wife have sex with other men through the CCTV in his house. Not being able to get over the excitement he feels by doing that, he tells his wife everything and suggests she has sex with another man again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BvrsCMgBtfd8kL7m3inaw3mfnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684501'),
  ('646570052954515441', 'Observe and Report', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Jody Hill, Tim Orr, Denise Anderson Poore', 'Jody Hill', 'Seth Rogen, Ray Liotta, Anna Faris, Michael Peña, Dan Bakkedahl, Jesse Plemons, John Yuan, Matt Yuan', 'R', 'Mall security guard Ronnie Barnhardt is called into action to stop a flasher from turning shopper''s paradise into his personal peep show. But when Barnhardt can''t bring the culprit to justice, a surly police detective is recruited to close the case.', 'Mall security guard Ronnie Barnhardt is called into action to stop a flasher from turning shopper''s paradise into his personal peep show. But when Barnhardt can''t bring the culprit to justice, a surly police detective is recruited to close the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHuouWUKlRK0SeIjzTlmtoPLrFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16991'),
  ('709992486510438285', 'Obsessed', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Steve Shill, Ken Seng', 'David Loughery', 'Idris Elba, Beyoncé, Ali Larter, Jerry O''Connell, Christine Lahti, Bruce McGill, Matthew Humphreys, Scout Taylor-Compton', 'PG-13', 'Things couldn''t be better for Derek Charles. He''s just received a big promotion at work, and has a wonderful marriage with his beautiful wife, Sharon. However, into this idyllic world steps Lisa, a temporary worker at Derek''s office. Lisa begins to stalk Derek, jeopardizing all he holds dear.', 'Things couldn''t be better for Derek Charles. He''s just received a big promotion at work, and has a wonderful marriage with his beautiful wife, Sharon. However, into this idyllic world steps Lisa, a temporary worker at Derek''s office. Lisa begins to stalk Derek, jeopardizing all he holds dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x98L6eO7MsvNmXFy8TNza9UdsFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17335'),
  ('933423556614432089', 'Obsessed', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kim Dae-woo, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Oh Tae-kyung, Kim Dae-woo', 'Song Seung-heon, Lim Ji-yeon, Cho Yeo-jeong, On Ju-wan, Yoo Hai-jin, Park Hyuk-kwon, Jang Yun-sil, Kim Hye-na', null, 'A secret, passionate affair happens in the summer of 1969 between Colonel Jin Pyeong, trapped in a loveless marriage with Soo Jin, and Jong Ga Heun, the Chinese-Korean wife of Captain Kyung Woo Jin.', 'A secret, passionate affair happens in the summer of 1969 between Colonel Jin Pyeong, trapped in a loveless marriage with Soo Jin, and Jong Ga Heun, the Chinese-Korean wife of Captain Kyung Woo Jin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fetCtoAvZShCk1nqAWZFuKZschR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269955'),
  ('878626949025612552', 'Obsessed', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Tim Lobov, Denis Veykhman, Igor Voloshin', 'Natalya Kudryashova, Elena Strogaleva, Mikhail Shulman', 'Lukerya Ilyashenko, Oleg Vasilkov, Evgeny Kharitonov, Georgiy Kudrenko, Anastasiya Kuvshinova, Igor Voloshin, Tatyana Yakovenko, Maksim Belborodov', null, 'An attractive young coroner involves herself in a strange relationship with s.e.x, desires, and deaths. The phantasmagoria filled with gore, e.r.o.t.i.c, and mystery unfolds during the serial killer search. The viewer has to guess, who the main protagonist is, and what part is she playing - a victim, a killer, or a mere witness?', 'An attractive young coroner involves herself in a strange relationship with s.e.x, desires, and deaths. The phantasmagoria filled with gore, e.r.o.t.i.c, and mystery unfolds during the serial killer search. The viewer has to guess, who the main protagonist is, and what part is she playing - a victim, a killer, or a mere witness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHaOJitZOP9oJyIzdOvsiEUbjUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937895'),
  ('10234892210609362', 'Obsessed with Vertigo', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Harrison Engle, Larry Mitchell', null, 'Roddy McDowall, Patricia Hitchcock, Robert A. Harris, James C. Katz, Henry Bumstead, Herbert Coleman, Kim Novak, Barbara Bel Geddes', null, 'A documentary about the making and restoration of Alfred Hitchcock''s masterpiece "Vertigo." Narrated by Roddy McDowall, with behind-the-scenes talk from Barbara Bel Geddes, Henry Bumstead, Robert A. Harris, Patricia Hitchcock, James C. Katz, Kim Novak, Peggy Robertson and Martin Scorsese. Brings fresh perspective, not just to the film and the director, but to the Fifties Hollywood as well.', 'A documentary about the making and restoration of Alfred Hitchcock''s masterpiece "Vertigo." Narrated by Roddy McDowall, with behind-the-scenes talk from Barbara Bel Geddes, Henry Bumstead, Robert A. Harris, Patricia Hitchcock, James C. Katz, Kim Novak, Peggy Robertson and Martin Scorsese. Brings fresh perspective, not just to the film and the director, but to the Fifties Hollywood as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vkmnWqyH5jKT7KbznROYBTHliR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238521'),
  ('577275524690014732', 'Obsession', 1949, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Edward Dmytryk, C.M. Pennington-Richards, George Mills', 'Alec Coppel', 'Robert Newton, Phil Brown, Sally Gray, Naunton Wayne, James Harcourt, Betty Cooper, Allan Jeayes, Ronald Adam', 'NR', 'A British psychiatrist devises a devilish revenge plot against his wife''s lover.', 'A British psychiatrist devises a devilish revenge plot against his wife''s lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BlzTHGLBxxCiqY0fTvPqaE2hcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35852'),
  ('959680052665257740', 'Obsession', 1954, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jean Delannoy, Pierre Montazel', 'Antoine Blondin, Jean Delannoy, Roland Laudenbach', 'Michèle Morgan, Raf Vallone, Marthe Mercadier, Jean Gaven, Albert Duvaleix, Robert Dalban, Louis Seigner, Olivier Hussenot', null, 'Hélène and Aldo Giovanni are a circus trapeze double act and a couple. Aldo is temporarily replaced by former-partner Alexandre when the former is injured. The two get into a fight and the following day Alexandre is discovered dead. Hélène suspects her husband is responsible for the murder.', 'Hélène and Aldo Giovanni are a circus trapeze double act and a couple. Aldo is temporarily replaced by former-partner Alexandre when the former is injured. The two get into a fight and the following day Alexandre is discovered dead. Hélène suspects her husband is responsible for the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64GehpDMk6PzjIkL4wKQciljF59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35925'),
  ('555469367444543338', 'Obsession', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Gaidai', 'Leonid Gaidai', 'Aleksandr Demyanenko, Natalya Seleznyova, Vladimir Rautbart, Viktor Pavlov, Valeriy Nosik, Svetlana Ageyeva, Georgi Georgiu, Zoya Fyodorova', null, 'Student Shurik has just two hours before the beginning of the exam and he has no lectures notes.', 'Student Shurik has just two hours before the beginning of the exam and he has no lectures notes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9Ub71szmURhlbThKy9hwUlMUqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435041'),
  ('244584020902784746', 'Obsession', 1976, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Brian De Palma, Vilmos Zsigmond, Bob Bender', 'Paul Schrader', 'Cliff Robertson, Geneviève Bujold, John Lithgow, Sylvia Kuumba Williams, Wanda Blackman, J. Patrick McNamara, Stanley J. Reyes, Nick Kreiger', 'PG', 'A wealthy New Orleans businessman becomes obsessed with a young woman who resembles his late wife.', 'A wealthy New Orleans businessman becomes obsessed with a young woman who resembles his late wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0bOKTldOJVJivmPNGBHfMYJU9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4780'),
  ('733943947176012300', 'Obsession', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller, Music, Romance', 'Peter Sehr, David Watkin', 'Peter Sehr, Marie Noëlle', 'Heike Makatsch, Daniel Craig, Seymour Cassel, Allen Garfield, Marie-Christine Barrault, Daniel Gélin, Inga Busch, Katja Ackermann', null, 'Two men become entangled in a torrid love affair with the same woman. Pierre is Miriam''s longtime lover. John is desperately searching for clues about his past when he and Miriam have a fateful encounter in a Berlin train station. The allure of forbidden love becomes irresistible, and an intense love triangle is ignited. Who will Miriam choose? Who will walk away? For two men who desperately adore the same woman and for the woman who loves them equally...there is no easy way out.', 'Two men become entangled in a torrid love affair with the same woman. Pierre is Miriam''s longtime lover. John is desperately searching for clues about his past when he and Miriam have a fateful encounter in a Berlin train station. The allure of forbidden love becomes irresistible, and an intense love triangle is ignited. Who will Miriam choose? Who will walk away? For two men who desperately adore the same woman and for the woman who loves them equally...there is no easy way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Z3Y42Duzwb51kIEeMnkBOgiuLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98544'),
  ('830576632025396660', 'Obsession', 2015, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Antoinette Beumer, Anke Timmermans, Eddy Stevesyns', 'Dorien Goertzen, Marjolein Beumer', 'Loes Haverkort, Mark van Eeuwen, Peter Paul Muller, Evi van der Laken, Bobby van Vleuten, Jennifer Hoffman, Pierre Boulanger, Tamar Baruch', null, 'Simone inherits a dilapidated farmhouse in France and makes her way there with her husband Eric and their two children. Her dream is to turn the house into a bed and breakfast but as the hectic pace of the rebuilding gets underway, she gets caught up in the romance and chaos of it all. Losing sight of her goals, she must find her way back to the dreams and ambitions which brought her there in the first place.', 'Simone inherits a dilapidated farmhouse in France and makes her way there with her husband Eric and their two children. Her dream is to turn the house into a bed and breakfast but as the hectic pace of the rebuilding gets underway, she gets caught up in the romance and chaos of it all. Losing sight of her goals, she must find her way back to the dreams and ambitions which brought her there in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39dr21LlR2uv7InD04aKbKIXiFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332672'),
  ('1059297616068928105', 'Obsession', 2026, 'Horror', 'Curry Barker, Taylor Clemons, Grayson Alamango Shapiro', 'Curry Barker', 'Michael Johnston, Inde Navarrette, Cooper Tomlinson, Megan Lawless, Andy Richter, Haley Fitzgerald, Darin Toonder, Anthony Pavone', 'R', 'After breaking the mysterious "One Wish Willow" to win his crush''s heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.', 'After breaking the mysterious "One Wish Willow" to win his crush''s heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339713'),
  ('670157068700964764', 'Obsession: A Taste for Fear', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Piccio Raffanini, Romano Albani', 'Jacques Goyard, Piccio Raffanini, Lidia Ravera', 'Virginia Hey, Gérard Darmon, Gioia Scola, Carlo Mucari, Dario Parisini, Carin McDonald, Teagan Clive, Eva Grimaldi', null, 'A photographer''s model is found murdered, sparking a police investigation that targets her ex-boyfriend. As more models die and murder videos surface, the true identity of the killer becomes uncertain.', 'A photographer''s model is found murdered, sparking a police investigation that targets her ex-boyfriend. As more models die and murder videos surface, the true identity of the killer becomes uncertain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hO5sHD7uGaFt49zgwAtSroGGqs5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29189'),
  ('372055426117782093', 'Obsessions', 1969, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Frans Bromet, Hubertus Hagen, Pim de la Parra', 'Martin Scorsese, Wim Verstappen, Pim de la Parra', 'Alexandra Stewart, Dieter Geissler, Tom van Beek, Donald Jones, Elisabeth Versluys, Marijke Boonstra, Vibeke Løkkeberg, Michael Krebs', null, 'A young medical student observes his neighbour''s love life through a hole in his apartment wall.', 'A young medical student observes his neighbour''s love life through a hole in his apartment wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUMHRtDvgxaSFI5FPSgZQBo2cm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287775'),
  ('336797979531420580', 'Obvious Child', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gillian Robespierre, Chris Teague, Laura Klein', 'Gillian Robespierre', 'Jenny Slate, Jake Lacy, Gaby Hoffmann, Paul Briganti, Stephen Singer, Richard Kind, Polly Draper, Gabe Liedman', 'R', 'An immature, newly unemployed comic must navigate the murky waters of adulthood after her fling with a graduate student results in an unplanned pregnancy.', 'An immature, newly unemployed comic must navigate the murky waters of adulthood after her fling with a graduate student results in an unplanned pregnancy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAVuQuboHiqc6ClsFeWQXBHJkOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248774'),
  ('120467841127293601', 'Occhio, malocchio, prezzemolo e finocchio', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Manasse, Angelo Vicari, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Franco Verucci, Romolo Guerrieri, Sergio Martino', 'Johnny Dorelli, Lino Banfi, Janet Ågren, Milena Vukotić, Paola Borboni, Adriana Russo, Dagmar Lassander, Mario Brega', null, 'The film is divided into two episodes, The Hair of Disgrace and The Magician, both focusing on the theme of the occult and beliefs. The title translates as "Eye, Evil Eye, Parsley and Fennel".', 'The film is divided into two episodes, The Hair of Disgrace and The Magician, both focusing on the theme of the occult and beliefs. The title translates as "Eye, Evil Eye, Parsley and Fennel".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSixouCxKXgIlIVGubXFEHq73rz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55493'),
  ('657658588376962983', 'OcchioPinocchio', 1994, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Francesco Nuti, Maurizio Calvesi, Serena Canevari', 'Ugo Chiti, Giovanni Veronesi, Francesco Nuti', 'Francesco Nuti, Chiara Caselli, Joss Ackland, Charles Simon, Jacques Dacqmine, Pina Cei, Leon Askin, Victor Cavallo', null, 'A man with cognitive problems lives and works in a hospice. One day an American banker discovers that the man is his son.', 'A man with cognitive problems lives and works in a hospice. One day an American banker discovers that the man is his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Azugqp4ypmj4gcvl6cl1GJm6iM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160205'),
  ('823763965818160861', 'Occident', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cristian Mungiu, Vivi Drăgan Vasile', 'Cristian Mungiu', 'Alexandru Papadopol, Anca Androne, Tania Popa, Dorel Vișan, Gabriel Spahiu, Ioan Gyuri Pascu, Valeriu Andriuță, Constantin Ghenescu', null, '"Occident" is a bitter comedy about the people who want to emigrate from Romania, and about those who stay behind. The movie has a rich, interesting structure: there are three different stories - a weeklong in the film - that cross, interconnect and happen in the same period. The characters influence each others lives, sometimes even without knowing. Main characters from one story become secondary characters in another story. At the same time, scenes from the first part of the movie bring unexpected facts when seen the second or the third time. The stories do not have just one ending: the first story ends in each of the third parts in a different point, suggesting radically different solutions for the characters. The way in which the director fits time and links events together often produces thematically unexpected results.', '"Occident" is a bitter comedy about the people who want to emigrate from Romania, and about those who stay behind. The movie has a rich, interesting structure: there are three different stories - a weeklong in the film - that cross, interconnect and happen in the same period. The characters influence each others lives, sometimes even without knowing. Main characters from one story become secondary characters in another story. At the same time, scenes from the first part of the movie bring unexpected facts when seen the second or the third time. The stories do not have just one ending: the first story ends in each of the third parts in a different point, suggesting radically different solutions for the characters. The way in which the director fits time and links events together often produces thematically unexpected results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tFMdgCfpbtsNOJ1ILTkQNU2xnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38907'),
  ('402687157543977894', 'Occult', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Koji Shiraishi, Shinobu Kuribayashi', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Shohei Uno, Koji Shiraishi, Akira Takatsuki, Shinobu Kuribayashi, Takashi Nomura, Horiken, Mika Azuma, Koen Kondo', null, 'Koji Shiraishi interviews the survivors of an indiscriminate attack at a sightseeing resort and starts investigating the strange events that have been happening to them.', 'Koji Shiraishi interviews the survivors of an indiscriminate attack at a sightseeing resort and starts investigating the strange events that have been happening to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HW5dqv4Uo77trZ0jg9UqUI5hMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118315'),
  ('709750901438835990', 'Occult Forces', 1943, 'Drama', 'Jean Mamy', 'Jean Marquès-Rivière, Jean Marquès-Rivière', 'Maurice Rémy, Marcel Vibert, Léonce Corne, Auguste Bovério, Gisèle Parry, Pierre Darteuil, Marcel Raine, Louise Flavie', 'PG', 'The film recounts the life of a young member of parliament who joins the Freemasons in order to relaunch his career. He thus learns of how the Freemasons are conspiring with the Jews and the Anglo-American nations to encourage France into a war against Germany.', 'The film recounts the life of a young member of parliament who joins the Freemasons in order to relaunch his career. He thus learns of how the Freemasons are conspiring with the Jews and the Anglo-American nations to encourage France into a war against Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jf1OylVqGceqIGLqz7kLTbdXZwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74713'),
  ('465595041571124272', 'Occupation', 2018, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Luke Sparke', 'Felix Williamson', 'Dan Ewing, Temuera Morrison, Stephanie Jacobsen, Rhiannon Fish, Jacqueline McKenzie, Bruce Spence, Trystan Go, Zachary Garred', 'R', 'Town residents must band together after a devastating alien invasion. As they struggle to survive, they realize they must stay one step ahead of their attackers and work together for a chance to strike back.', 'Town residents must band together after a devastating alien invasion. As they struggle to survive, they realize they must stay one step ahead of their attackers and work together for a chance to strike back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr7MFQAmP30IJZP2FXKhPKbe8IW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503346'),
  ('337621795457827654', 'Occupation 101: Voices of the Silenced Majority', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Abdallah Omeish, Sufyan Omeish, Abdallah Omeish', 'Alison Weir, Abdallah Omeish, Sufyan Omeish', 'Alison Weir', null, 'A thought-provoking documentary on the current and historical causes of the Israeli-Palestinian conflict and U.S. political involvement.', 'A thought-provoking documentary on the current and historical causes of the Israeli-Palestinian conflict and U.S. political involvement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aBwQwNrUOKaRdw1IdXaFz31vyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18152'),
  ('664159649743581332', 'Occupation in 26 Pictures', 1978, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Lordan Zafranović', 'Mirko Kovač, Lordan Zafranović', 'Frano Lasić, Milan Štrljić, Tanja Poberžnik, Boris Kralj, Ivan Klemenc, Gordana Pavlov, Stevo Žigon, Bert Sotlar', null, 'Set in Dubrovnik, this drama chronicles a friendship between three men, that began just before World War II. One of the men is of Italian origin, another is the wealthy heir of a shipping fortune, and the third is the son of a Jewish antique-store owner. Before the war, they are fast friends, enjoying one another''s company at carnivals and at a private fencing club. However, when the war comes, the Italians and Germans move in to create the Independent State of Croatia. The Italian friend becomes a fascist and courts and marries the sister of his rich friend. Soon enough, atrocities are being committed, and anyone suspected of Jewish or Serbian parentage or anti-fascist leanings, is killed.', 'Set in Dubrovnik, this drama chronicles a friendship between three men, that began just before World War II. One of the men is of Italian origin, another is the wealthy heir of a shipping fortune, and the third is the son of a Jewish antique-store owner. Before the war, they are fast friends, enjoying one another''s company at carnivals and at a private fencing club. However, when the war comes, the Italians and Germans move in to create the Independent State of Croatia. The Italian friend becomes a fascist and courts and marries the sister of his rich friend. Soon enough, atrocities are being committed, and anyone suspected of Jewish or Serbian parentage or anti-fascist leanings, is killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJgBu6enCKpvD7ocHDFcOoKJMqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198509'),
  ('468977721785453234', 'Occupation: Rainfall', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Luke Sparke, Wade Muller', 'Luke Sparke', 'Dan Ewing, Jet Tranter, Temuera Morrison, Ken Jeong, Jason Isaacs, Daniel Gillies, Lawrence Makoare, Dena Kaplan', 'R', 'Two years into an intergalactic invasion of Earth, survivors in Sydney, Australia, fight back in a desperate ground war. As casualties mount by the day, the resistance and their unexpected allies, uncover a plot that could see the war come to a decisive end. With the Alien invaders hell-bent on making earth their new home, the race is on to save mankind.', 'Two years into an intergalactic invasion of Earth, survivors in Sydney, Australia, fight back in a desperate ground war. As casualties mount by the day, the resistance and their unexpected allies, uncover a plot that could see the war come to a decisive end. With the Alien invaders hell-bent on making earth their new home, the race is on to save mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpq8XjZ3ZalcbqWOYIdqcV7FbIJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:688258'),
  ('831200468315391661', 'OCD', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Soukarya Ghosal, Aalok Maiti', 'Soukarya Ghosal', 'Jaya Ahsan, Ananda Addhya, Kaushik Sen, Koneenica Banerjee', null, 'Shweta, a doctor obsessed with cleanliness and moral purity, is haunted by a childhood trauma. When she discovers her abuser still lives freely, she plans the perfect revenge.', 'Shweta, a doctor obsessed with cleanliness and moral purity, is haunted by a childhood trauma. When she discovers her abuser still lives freely, she plans the perfect revenge.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fp59Y1kZdo6vNHHOw9GKYwPOjrdN.jpg', 'plex:movie:ocd-2026'),
  ('481975604830350164', 'Ocean Flame', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Liu Fendou, Pakie Chan, Chen Ying', 'Bobo Au', 'Liao Fan, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Simon Yam, Lam Suet, Hai Yitian, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Derek Tsang Kwok-Cheung', 'PG-13', 'A turbulent love affair between a punk and a youthful waitress.', 'A turbulent love affair between a punk and a youthful waitress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tM1TKQlGJMu1LEj78O21TVHFCjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8943'),
  ('790814690630494694', 'Ocean Heaven', 2010, 'Drama', 'Xue Xiaolu, Christopher Doyle', 'Xue Xiaolu', 'Jet Li, Wen Zhang, Gwei Lun-mei, Zhu Yuanyuan, Gao Yuanyuan, Dong Yong, Chen Ran, Yong Mei', null, 'The story of a father''s tireless love for his autistic son. A terminally ill father''s attempt to teach his autistic son the necessary life skills to survive on his own before he passes away. It is also a poignant tribute to the infinite love that parents have for their children and their unending desire to take care and look after them to their best abilities, no matter the struggle, no matter the effort.', 'The story of a father''s tireless love for his autistic son. A terminally ill father''s attempt to teach his autistic son the necessary life skills to survive on his own before he passes away. It is also a poignant tribute to the infinite love that parents have for their children and their unending desire to take care and look after them to their best abilities, no matter the struggle, no matter the effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DKcwFG0tIx1ZpcqkpJ0gBEmIcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54328'),
  ('1125087424462366082', 'Ocean Waves', 1993, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Tomomi Mochizuki, Katsuya Kondo, Atsushi Okui', 'Keiko Niwa', 'Nobuo Tobita, Yoko Sakamoto, Toshihiko Seki, Yuri Amano, Kae Araki, Jun''ichi Kanemaru, Ai Satou, Aya Hisakawa', 'PG-13', 'At Kichijōji Station, Tokyo, Taku Morisaki glimpses a familiar woman on the platform opposite boarding a train. Later, her photo falls from a shelf as he exits his apartment before flying to Kōchi Prefecture. Picking it up, he looks at it briefly before leaving. As the aeroplane takes off, he narrates the events that brought her into his life...', 'At Kichijōji Station, Tokyo, Taku Morisaki glimpses a familiar woman on the platform opposite boarding a train. Later, her photo falls from a shelf as he exits his apartment before flying to Kōchi Prefecture. Picking it up, he looks at it briefly before leaving. As the aeroplane takes off, he narrates the events that brought her into his life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSR1LLMIJZ6WcQEkM82yKy4F9vQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21057'),
  ('652567053642483478', 'Ocean with David Attenborough', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Colin Butfield, Toby Nowlan, Keith Scholey', null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'David Attenborough takes viewers on a breathtaking journey showing there is nowhere more vital for our survival, more full of life, wonder, or surprise, than the ocean. Through spectacular sequences featuring coral reefs, kelp forests and the open ocean, Attenborough shares why a healthy ocean keeps the entire planet stable and flourishing.', 'David Attenborough takes viewers on a breathtaking journey showing there is nowhere more vital for our survival, more full of life, wonder, or surprise, than the ocean. Through spectacular sequences featuring coral reefs, kelp forests and the open ocean, Attenborough shares why a healthy ocean keeps the entire planet stable and flourishing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAKzcqUCP3EK7rgAx9Jj8Futv8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1448497'),
  ('115865160557783442', 'Ocean''s Eight', 2018, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Gary Ross, Eigil Bryld, Chris Shriver', 'Gary Ross, Olivia Milch', 'Sandra Bullock, Cate Blanchett, Anne Hathaway, Mindy Kaling, Sarah Paulson, Awkwafina, Rihanna, Helena Bonham Carter', 'PG-13', 'Debbie Ocean, a criminal mastermind, gathers a crew of female thieves to pull off the heist of the century at New York''s annual Met Gala.', 'Debbie Ocean, a criminal mastermind, gathers a crew of female thieves to pull off the heist of the century at New York''s annual Met Gala.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MvYpKlpFukTivnlBhizGbkAe3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402900'),
  ('158486086026355404', 'Ocean''s Eleven', 1960, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Lewis Milestone, William H. Daniels, Ray Gosnell Jr.', 'Harry Brown, Charles Lederer', 'Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin, Sammy Davis Jr., Peter Lawford, Angie Dickinson, Richard Conte, Cesar Romero, Patrice Wymore', 'NR', 'Danny Ocean and his gang attempt to rob the five biggest casinos in Las Vegas in one night.', 'Danny Ocean and his gang attempt to rob the five biggest casinos in Las Vegas in one night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4R6u7SidBPVXMVzGSysCiRGTRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299'),
  ('864480440198354866', 'Ocean''s Eleven', 2001, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Steven Soderbergh, Blair Huizingh, Robert Woodruff', 'Harry Brown, Charles Lederer', 'George Clooney, Brad Pitt, Andy Garcia, Matt Damon, Julia Roberts, Casey Affleck, Scott Caan, Elliott Gould', 'PG-13', 'Less than 24 hours into his parole, charismatic thief Danny Ocean is already rolling out his next plan: In one night, Danny''s hand-picked crew of specialists will attempt to steal more than $150 million from three Las Vegas casinos. But to score the cash, Danny risks his chances of reconciling with ex-wife, Tess.', 'Less than 24 hours into his parole, charismatic thief Danny Ocean is already rolling out his next plan: In one night, Danny''s hand-picked crew of specialists will attempt to steal more than $150 million from three Las Vegas casinos. But to score the cash, Danny risks his chances of reconciling with ex-wife, Tess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQQCdZrsHtZyR6NbKH2YyCqd2fR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161'),
  ('931095777347168227', 'Ocean''s Thirteen', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Doug J. Meerdink', 'David Levien, Brian Koppelman', 'George Clooney, Brad Pitt, Al Pacino, Matt Damon, Don Cheadle, Bernie Mac, Ellen Barkin, Casey Affleck', 'PG-13', 'Danny Ocean''s team of criminals are back and composing a plan more personal than ever. When ruthless casino owner Willy Bank doublecrosses Reuben Tishkoff, causing a heart attack, Danny Ocean vows that he and his team will do anything to bring down Willy Bank along with everything he''s got. Even if it means asking for help from an enemy.', 'Danny Ocean''s team of criminals are back and composing a plan more personal than ever. When ruthless casino owner Willy Bank doublecrosses Reuben Tishkoff, causing a heart attack, Danny Ocean vows that he and his team will do anything to bring down Willy Bank along with everything he''s got. Even if it means asking for help from an enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBsZs4zYUiUTemqbikTZ76iQRaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298'),
  ('756388588856844722', 'Ocean''s Twelve', 2004, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Easton Michael Smith', 'George Nolfi', 'George Clooney, Julia Roberts, Brad Pitt, Matt Damon, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Andy Garcia, Casey Affleck, Don Cheadle', 'PG-13', 'Despite pulling off one of the biggest heists in Las Vegas history and splitting the $160 million take, each of the infamous Ocean''s crew have tried to go straight, lay low and live a legit life... but that''s proven to be a challenge. Casino owner Terry Benedict demands that Danny Ocean return the money, plus millions more in interest. Unable to come up the cash, the crew is forced to come together to pull off another series of heists, this time in Rome, Paris, and Amsterdam – but a Europol agent is hot on their heels.', 'Despite pulling off one of the biggest heists in Las Vegas history and splitting the $160 million take, each of the infamous Ocean''s crew have tried to go straight, lay low and live a legit life... but that''s proven to be a challenge. Casino owner Terry Benedict demands that Danny Ocean return the money, plus millions more in interest. Unable to come up the cash, the crew is forced to come together to pull off another series of heists, this time in Rome, Paris, and Amsterdam – but a Europol agent is hot on their heels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pE5anFf7nf6ah7V3VRezQ1KSovi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163'),
  ('459078343547909921', 'Oceans', 2010, 'Documentary, Family', 'Jacques Perrin, Luciano Tovoli, David Reichert', 'Christophe Cheysson, Jacques Cluzaud, Laurent Debas', 'Jacques Perrin', 'G', 'An ecological drama/documentary, filmed throughout the globe. Part thriller, part meditation on the vanishing wonders of the sub-aquatic world.', 'An ecological drama/documentary, filmed throughout the globe. Part thriller, part meditation on the vanishing wonders of the sub-aquatic world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIT3G7QoV1vatMCL8TAA3xnkO2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36970'),
  ('986850446667927917', 'Oceans Are the Real Continents', 2023, 'Drama', 'Tommaso Santambrogio, Lorenzo Casadio', 'Tommaso Santambrogio', 'Alexander Diego, Edith Ybarra Clara, Frank Ernesto Lam, Alain Alain Alfonso González, Milagros Llanes Martínez, Lola Amores, Jhon Steven Baldriche, Joel Casanova', null, 'Alex and Edith, a young couple in their 30s, live their relationship made up of small gestures and everyday life among the ruins of Cuban buildings. Milagros, an elderly woman now retired, tries to survive by selling peanuts and spends her days listening to the radio and reading old letters. Frank and Alain, two nine-year-old friends, go to school and dream of emigrating together to the United States to become Major League Baseball players. Against the backdrop of San Antonio De Los Baños, a town in inland Cuba where time seems to stand still, these three narratives and their respective worlds unfold. Over this mosaic of contemporaneity, however, brought to life through the characters'' memories, hovers the specter of separation, the true great scourge of Cuban society.', 'Alex and Edith, a young couple in their 30s, live their relationship made up of small gestures and everyday life among the ruins of Cuban buildings. Milagros, an elderly woman now retired, tries to survive by selling peanuts and spends her days listening to the radio and reading old letters. Frank and Alain, two nine-year-old friends, go to school and dream of emigrating together to the United States to become Major League Baseball players. Against the backdrop of San Antonio De Los Baños, a town in inland Cuba where time seems to stand still, these three narratives and their respective worlds unfold. Over this mosaic of contemporaneity, however, brought to life through the characters'' memories, hovers the specter of separation, the true great scourge of Cuban society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eDQmMAWkBIlsHSOJTtM4W4tVaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157027'),
  ('857284955704921028', 'Oceans Rising', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Adam Lipsius, Darrin Webb', 'Adam Lipsius', 'Jason Tobias, Summer Spiro, Annabel Barrett, Gustavo Escobar, DeJean Brown, Ronak Gandhi, Jeff Harms, Cedric Jonathan', 'NR', 'A scientist readies a boat after his warnings of an Earth-destroying flood are ignored. However, after the disasters reach a peak level of destruction those who maligned the scientist now turn to him in desperation, as he and other refugees look to save the world and stop the disaster using the two Supercolliders on opposite sides of the Atlantic.', 'A scientist readies a boat after his warnings of an Earth-destroying flood are ignored. However, after the disasters reach a peak level of destruction those who maligned the scientist now turn to him in desperation, as he and other refugees look to save the world and stop the disaster using the two Supercolliders on opposite sides of the Atlantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PzeV1qxvSQnu5BdG5tbTmEszDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443109'),
  ('970390167097396123', 'OceanWorld 3D', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Jacques Mantello', 'Francois Mantello, Jean-Jacques Mantello', 'Marion Cotillard', null, 'A 3-D documentary chronicling a sea turtle''s journey across the oceans.', 'A 3-D documentary chronicling a sea turtle''s journey across the oceans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ECOR1bUraejC806e8GBEZPbm6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33627'),
  ('835877517482766231', 'Octaman', 1971, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Harry Essex, Robert Caramico', 'Harry Essex', 'Pier Angeli, Kerwin Mathews, Jeff Morrow, David Essex, Jerome Guardino, Robert Warner, Norman Fields, Jax Jason Carroll', null, 'A scientific team in Mexico discover a pool of unusual baby "octopus-like" specimens. Gathering a few for analysis back at the lab, it is soon discovered that the critters belong to a gangly six-foot half man/half octopus-like creature, that''s pretty angry and wants her ''babies'' returned…', 'A scientific team in Mexico discover a pool of unusual baby "octopus-like" specimens. Gathering a few for analysis back at the lab, it is soon discovered that the critters belong to a gangly six-foot half man/half octopus-like creature, that''s pretty angry and wants her ''babies'' returned…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzMm4o7mWA247zPmLAi4bnturbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91736'),
  ('653702778499651308', 'Octane', 2003, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Marcus Adams, Robin Vidgeon', 'Stephen Volk', 'Madeleine Stowe, Norman Reedus, Bijou Phillips, Mischa Barton, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Leo Gregory, Martin McDougall, Gary Parker', 'R', 'After a family visit, stressed businesswoman Senga Wilson is driving with her rebellious daughter, Nat, down an ominous highway in the middle of the night. After they pick up a weird teenage hitchhiker, their journey goes awry. Nat decides to give her mom the slip and runs off with the hitchhiker at a rest stop. In a desperate search to find her daughter, Senga learns that Nat has been drawn into an evil cult.', 'After a family visit, stressed businesswoman Senga Wilson is driving with her rebellious daughter, Nat, down an ominous highway in the middle of the night. After they pick up a weird teenage hitchhiker, their journey goes awry. Nat decides to give her mom the slip and runs off with the hitchhiker at a rest stop. In a desperate search to find her daughter, Senga learns that Nat has been drawn into an evil cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krCaiVWChpMu8MQhufmjqqmfmGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44289'),
  ('865716257538437430', 'October', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shoojit Sircar, Avik Mukhopadhyay', 'Juhi Chaturvedi', 'Varun Dhawan, Banita Sandhu, Gitanjali Rao, Sahil Vedoliyaa, Isha Chaturvedi, Prateek Kapoor, Iteeva Pandey, Karamveer Kanwar', null, 'Dan, a 21-year-old carefree boy is always surrounded by a bunch of friends and fellow hotel interns who feed off each other''s everyday moments, their ups and downs. Shiuli is also an intern working in the same hotel, who at times is at a receiving end of Dan''s audaciousness. Everything was normal in their life until a sudden turn of events smashes Dan and Shiuli''s lives together, into a bond.', 'Dan, a 21-year-old carefree boy is always surrounded by a bunch of friends and fellow hotel interns who feed off each other''s everyday moments, their ups and downs. Shiuli is also an intern working in the same hotel, who at times is at a receiving end of Dan''s audaciousness. Everything was normal in their life until a sudden turn of events smashes Dan and Shiuli''s lives together, into a bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHUBPUwXkHinq2rIXnnCHsPylD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496527'),
  ('1119778551597792564', 'October (Ten Days that Shook the World)', 1928, 'Drama', 'Eduard Tisse, Grigori Aleksandrov, Sergei Eisenstein', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Sergei Eisenstein', 'Vladimir Popov, Vasili Nikandrov, Layaschenko, Boris Livanov, Mikholyev, Chibisov, Nikolai Padvoisky, Smelsky', null, 'Sergei M. Eisenstein''s docu-drama about the 1917 October Revolution in Russia. Made ten years after the events and edited in Eisenstein''s ''Soviet Montage'' style, it re-enacts in celebratory terms several key scenes from the revolution.', 'Sergei M. Eisenstein''s docu-drama about the 1917 October Revolution in Russia. Made ten years after the events and edited in Eisenstein''s ''Soviet Montage'' style, it re-enacts in celebratory terms several key scenes from the revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sNZPybGgux2keFKxZuKuedrS3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697'),
  ('856110178128023400', 'October Baby', 2011, 'Drama', 'Andrew Erwin, Jon Erwin, Jon Erwin', 'Cecil Stokes, Jon Erwin', 'Rachel Hendrix, Jason Burkey, John Schneider, Jennifer Price, Colleen Trusler, James Austin Johnson, Amisho Lewis, Mary Tolley', 'PG-13', 'A beautiful and naive college freshman discovers that her entire life is a lie and sets out on a road trip with a host of misfits to discover herself and the answers she craves.', 'A beautiful and naive college freshman discovers that her entire life is a lie and sets out on a road trip with a host of misfits to discover herself and the answers she craves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZWU5Hn4lkhid3MqVMCEPk9z9QI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83860'),
  ('683307024905721608', 'October Gale', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Ruba Nadda, Jeremy Benning', 'Ruba Nadda', 'Patricia Clarkson, Scott Speedman, Tim Roth, Callum Keith Rennie, Aidan Devine, Eric Murdoch, Billy MacLellan', null, 'A doctor takes in a mysterious man who washes ashore at her remote cottage with a gunshot wound. Quickly they both learn the killer has arrived to finish the job, while a storm has cut them off from the mainland.', 'A doctor takes in a mysterious man who washes ashore at her remote cottage with a gunshot wound. Quickly they both learn the killer has arrived to finish the job, while a storm has cut them off from the mainland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1S1jh8GNQftHIuFnVRxTNfoXG19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285843'),
  ('958299650085716127', 'October Kiss', 2015, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Lynne Stopkewich, Adam Sliwinski, Jane Victoria King', 'MacKenzie Austin', 'Ashley Williams, Sam Jaeger, Hannah Cheramy, Kiefer O''Reilly, Miranda Frigon, Laura Mitchell, Brad Mann, Connor Fielding', 'PG', 'Poppy Summerall is hired near Halloween as a temporary nanny by Ryan Lawson, a widowed, work-obsessed executive. Through a series of adventures, the eternally optimistic Poppy sets out to teach Ryan and his two young children what is important in life - unconditional love, family and the joy of everyday occurrences. Poppy and Ryan soon find they are drawn to each other. Could it become more than temporary?', 'Poppy Summerall is hired near Halloween as a temporary nanny by Ryan Lawson, a widowed, work-obsessed executive. Through a series of adventures, the eternally optimistic Poppy sets out to teach Ryan and his two young children what is important in life - unconditional love, family and the joy of everyday occurrences. Poppy and Ryan soon find they are drawn to each other. Could it become more than temporary?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckM9x0qecmKmiBpZY7jToGiTAyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362884'),
  ('350163375785479133', 'October November', 2014, 'Drama', 'Götz Spielmann, Martin Gschlacht', 'Götz Spielmann', 'Nora Waldstätten, Ursula Strauss, Peter Simonischek, Sebastian Koch, Johannes Zeiler, Samuel Finzi, Jörn Hentschel, Claudia Martini', null, 'Director Gotz Spielmann follows his acclaimed thriller Revanche with this visually captivating character study, in which a family reunion at a mountainside inn lays bare old wounds and reveals long-held secrets.', 'Director Gotz Spielmann follows his acclaimed thriller Revanche with this visually captivating character study, in which a family reunion at a mountainside inn lays bare old wounds and reveals long-held secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FyYNcu4KvtYrp5lPSAgzwrs0Wn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214074'),
  ('743757388363297443', 'Octobre', 1994, 'Drama', 'Pierre Falardeau, Alain Dostie', 'Pierre Falardeau', 'Hugo Dubé, Luc Picard, Pierre Rivard, Denis Trudel, Serge Houde, Maryse Ouellet, Julie Castonguay, Raymond Leriche', null, 'A dramatization of the abduction and murder of a Quebec government minister by a cell of The Quebec Liberation Front. In October 1970, one group from the same organization kidnapped James Cross, the British Trade Commissioner in Montreal. A few days later, a second group kidnapped Pierre Laporte, a minister of the Liberal government. The film tells the story of this last terrorist cell which ended in the cold blooded murder of Laporte.', 'A dramatization of the abduction and murder of a Quebec government minister by a cell of The Quebec Liberation Front. In October 1970, one group from the same organization kidnapped James Cross, the British Trade Commissioner in Montreal. A few days later, a second group kidnapped Pierre Laporte, a minister of the Liberal government. The film tells the story of this last terrorist cell which ended in the cold blooded murder of Laporte.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31jq6JwW33MXGlF6cxAVbfwWqVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69890'),
  ('982638922554729298', 'Octonauts and the Caves of Sac Actun', 2020, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Blair Simmons', 'Gabe Pulliam', 'Simon Greenall, Paul Panting, Jo Wyatt, Keith Wickham, Michael C. Murphy, Teresa Gallagher, Rob Rackstraw', null, 'The Octonauts embark on an underwater adventure, navigating a set of challenging caves to help a small octopus friend return to the Caribbean Sea.', 'The Octonauts embark on an underwater adventure, navigating a set of challenging caves to help a small octopus friend return to the Caribbean Sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlizMbZByBYPOC4i2AN64e4W1iM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726940'),
  ('1113772602611396192', 'Octonauts and the Ring of Fire', 2021, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Blair Simmons', 'Gabe Pulliam, Stephanie Simpson', 'Teresa Gallagher, Simon Greenall, Michael C. Murphy, Paul Panting, Rob Rackstraw, Keith Wickham, Jo Wyatt, Helen Walsh', 'G', 'In this film''s adventure, a volcano erupts suddenly, suddenly awakening the Pacific Ocean floor of hundreds of volcanoes composed of the "ring of fire", this sudden event quickly turned into a global catastrophe. The volcanic clusters that are about to erupt en masse threaten the horned whales washed ashore by the tsunami, the cap penguins living in the volcanic islands, the equipment of the small column maintenance station, the food planted by plant fish in the marine farms... Not to mention the plants and animals that live in the crater all year after year!', 'In this film''s adventure, a volcano erupts suddenly, suddenly awakening the Pacific Ocean floor of hundreds of volcanoes composed of the "ring of fire", this sudden event quickly turned into a global catastrophe. The volcanic clusters that are about to erupt en masse threaten the horned whales washed ashore by the tsunami, the cap penguins living in the volcanic islands, the equipment of the small column maintenance station, the food planted by plant fish in the marine farms... Not to mention the plants and animals that live in the crater all year after year!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nlutjkR5Y2gCtV7BtrAGo6cOSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765684'),
  ('951498658011377903', 'Octopus', 2000, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'John Eyres, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Michael D. Weiss', 'Jay Harrington, David Beecroft, Carolyn Lowery, Ricco Ross, Ravil Isyanov, Jeff Nuttall, George Stanchev, Martin McDougall', 'PG-13', 'During the Cuban missile crisis in 1962, a Russian submarine strays into American waters. On board is a nuclear cargo destined for Castro. The Americans attack and destroy the sub. 38 years later US submarine Roosevelt is in the same waters. An unknown object attacks and disables the sub with devastating force and drags the vessel to the bottom of the ocean. What lies on the ocean bed beggars belief: dozens of wrecks, among them the sub destroyed 38 years ago. Whatever was on board has fed a creature of unbelievable size and strength! The only way out is the emergency submersible and a passing cruise ship. Above or below the water, there is no escape from the monster mutant octopus with a nuclear diet...', 'During the Cuban missile crisis in 1962, a Russian submarine strays into American waters. On board is a nuclear cargo destined for Castro. The Americans attack and destroy the sub. 38 years later US submarine Roosevelt is in the same waters. An unknown object attacks and disables the sub with devastating force and drags the vessel to the bottom of the ocean. What lies on the ocean bed beggars belief: dozens of wrecks, among them the sub destroyed 38 years ago. Whatever was on board has fed a creature of unbelievable size and strength! The only way out is the emergency submersible and a passing cruise ship. Above or below the water, there is no escape from the monster mutant octopus with a nuclear diet...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8SvBSXyG8aejvpFsTz56b9gZsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41656'),
  ('474093856184574129', 'Octopus 2: River of Fear', 2001, 'Horror, Action', 'Yossi Wein, Peter Belcher', 'Michael D. Weiss', 'Michael Reilly Burke, Meredith Morton, Fredric Lehne, John Thaddeus, Chris Williams, Stoyan Angelov, Paul Vincent O''Connor, Clement Blake', 'R', 'Dead bodies are being found in New York harbor. The police have no clues nor suspects until Nick and his colleague realize the killer is a giant octopus. Everybody, especially the police captain, refuses to believe Nick''s story, and soon the harbor will be filled with boats for the 4th of July celebrations.', 'Dead bodies are being found in New York harbor. The police have no clues nor suspects until Nick and his colleague realize the killer is a giant octopus. Everybody, especially the police captain, refuses to believe Nick''s story, and soon the harbor will be filled with boats for the 4th of July celebrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWjGkVOCa36rK0DLTfC9YQhwV9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42182'),
  ('586481068159294046', 'Octopus with Broken Arms', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jacky Gan, He Shan, Li Tao', 'Li Peng, Wu Wenjing, Chen Sicheng', 'Xiao Yang, Tong Liya, Duan Yihong, Liu Yase, Wang Longzheng, Feng Bing, Zhou Chuchu, Jack Kao', null, 'Coinciding with a grand local holiday celebration, wealthy businessman Zheng Bingrui invites his daughter Tingting''s teacher Li Huiping and a group of classmates'' parents to a party at his home, but Tingting is suddenly kidnapped. Police officer Zhang Jingxian led the team to investigate the case, the kidnappers to Ting Ting life threat, requiring Zheng Li with a huge ransom to the appointment, along the way the two found the kidnapping case behind the hidden secrets ......', 'Coinciding with a grand local holiday celebration, wealthy businessman Zheng Bingrui invites his daughter Tingting''s teacher Li Huiping and a group of classmates'' parents to a party at his home, but Tingting is suddenly kidnapped. Police officer Zhang Jingxian led the team to investigate the case, the kidnappers to Ting Ting life threat, requiring Zheng Li with a huge ransom to the appointment, along the way the two found the kidnapping case behind the hidden secrets ......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npcFyS4d2t3XGtIffINI5AapIst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1311537'),
