  ('877059193122727427', 'Ode to Billy Joe', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Max Baer Jr., Michel Hugo', 'Herman Raucher', 'Robby Benson, Glynnis O''Connor, Joan Hotchkis, Terence Goodman, Sandy McPeak, James Best, Becky Bowen, Simpson Hemphill', 'PG', 'Set in sultry 1950s Mississippi, two teenagers grapple with surging hormones and the enticing promise of love, unknowing of the tragedy that looms ahead.', 'Set in sultry 1950s Mississippi, two teenagers grapple with surging hormones and the enticing promise of love, unknowing of the tragedy that looms ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emiEmqf9KwX2SMJ6lbLMu3Lx3bx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42239'),
  ('389280310414794264', 'Ode to Joy', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jason Winer, David Robert Jones', 'Max Werner', 'Martin Freeman, Morena Baccarin, Jake Lacy, Melissa Rauch, Shannon Woodward, Ellis Rubin, Jane Curtin, Adam Shapiro', 'R', 'Charlie suffers from a serious disease that causes acute narcolepsy whenever he is happy. Although he develops a variety of techniques to deny himself pleasure and deal with his sleep issues, they’re put to the test when he falls in love.', 'Charlie suffers from a serious disease that causes acute narcolepsy whenever he is happy. Although he develops a variety of techniques to deny himself pleasure and deal with his sleep issues, they’re put to the test when he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpYPids0rVYTrtEjKPeXWZNwBk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501989'),
  ('664098945641698758', 'Ode to My Father', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kim Ho-sung, JK Youn, Choi Young-hwan', 'Park Soo-jin', 'Hwang Jung-min, Yunjin Kim, Oh Dal-su, Jung Jin-young, Jang Young-nam, Ra Mi-ran, Uhm Ji-sung, Kim Seul-gi', null, 'Duk-soo lost his father and younger sister while taking refuge during the Korean War. He leaves for Germany to work as a miner and enters the Vietnam War. He wishes to find his sister.', 'Duk-soo lost his father and younger sister while taking refuge during the Korean War. He leaves for Germany to work as a miner and enters the Vietnam War. He wishes to find his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hF1aD28PA8pdqqgjj3UGM70Z37b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313108'),
  ('113766041016269355', 'Ode to the Goose', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jung Hoon, Zhang Lu, Cho Young-jik', 'Zhang Lu', 'Park Hae-il, Moon So-ri, Jung Jin-young, Park So-dam, Dong Bang-woo, Moon Sook, Lee Mi-sook, Kim Hee-jung', null, 'Yoon-young fell for Song-hyeon when she was married to his friend. When she gets divorced, he takes her on a trip to Gunsan, where they stay at a guest house run by a middle-aged man and his autistic daughter.', 'Yoon-young fell for Song-hyeon when she was married to his friend. When she gets divorced, he takes her on a trip to Gunsan, where they stay at a guest house run by a middle-aged man and his autistic daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJJqB7xjewVrkiFzx9jjP2S9p6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546493'),
  ('770038840194840944', 'Odeio o Dia dos Namorados', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, Marcelo Brasil, Tatiana Fragoso', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Heloísa Périssé, Marcelo Saback, Daniel Boaventura, Dani Valente, André Mattos, Danielle Winits, Fernando Caruso, MV Bill', null, 'Débora is an advertiser who has always put her career above her love life. Work and love mix when she runs a campaign for Valentine''s Day, whose client is her ex-boyfriend, who was dumped by her in a humiliating way.', 'Débora is an advertiser who has always put her career above her love life. Work and love mix when she runs a campaign for Valentine''s Day, whose client is her ex-boyfriend, who was dumped by her in a humiliating way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjCP0tJ1LhKJ5SjWI6THka6oGCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201683'),
  ('388442873336325118', 'Odette', 1950, 'War, Drama, History', 'Herbert Wilcox, Mutz Greenbaum, Patricia Smith', 'Warren Chetham-Strode', 'Anna Neagle, Trevor Howard, Marius Goring, Peter Ustinov, Bernard Lee, Maurice Buckmaster, Alfred Schieske, Gilles Quéant', 'NR', 'The film is based on the true story of Special Operations Executive French-born agent Odette Sansom, who was captured by the Germans in 1943, condemned to death and sent to Ravensbrück concentration camp to be executed. However, against all odds she survived the war and testified against the prison guards at the Hamburg Ravensbrück Trials. She was awarded the George Cross in 1946; the first woman ever to receive the award, and the only woman who has been awarded it while still alive. (From Wikipedia, licensed under CC-BY-SA)', 'The film is based on the true story of Special Operations Executive French-born agent Odette Sansom, who was captured by the Germans in 1943, condemned to death and sent to Ravensbrück concentration camp to be executed. However, against all odds she survived the war and testified against the prison guards at the Hamburg Ravensbrück Trials. She was awarded the George Cross in 1946; the first woman ever to receive the award, and the only woman who has been awarded it while still alive. (From Wikipedia, licensed under CC-BY-SA)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrydkCkM5A13H06PrZUSvxjvyfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80636'),
  ('51002142034751516', 'Odette Toulemonde', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Éric-Emmanuel Schmitt, Carlo Varini', 'Éric-Emmanuel Schmitt', 'Catherine Frot, Albert Dupontel, Jacques Weber, Fabrice Murgia, Nina Drecq, Camille Japy, Alain Doutey, Julien Frison', null, 'Objectively, Odette Toulemonde has nothing to be happy about, but is. Balthazar Balsan has everything to be happy about, but isn’t. Odette, awkwardly forty, with a delightful hairdresser son and a daughter bogged down in adolescence, spends her days behind the cosmetic’s counter in a department store and her nights sewing feathers on costumes for Parisian variety shows. She dreams of thanking Balthazar Balsan, her favorite author, to whom – she believes – she owes her optimism. The rich and charming Parisian writer then turns up in her life in an unexpected way.', 'Objectively, Odette Toulemonde has nothing to be happy about, but is. Balthazar Balsan has everything to be happy about, but isn’t. Odette, awkwardly forty, with a delightful hairdresser son and a daughter bogged down in adolescence, spends her days behind the cosmetic’s counter in a department store and her nights sewing feathers on costumes for Parisian variety shows. She dreams of thanking Balthazar Balsan, her favorite author, to whom – she believes – she owes her optimism. The rich and charming Parisian writer then turns up in her life in an unexpected way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwpuTxb9JkBhPBqZs13iTpTjOAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4171'),
  ('573091699321252979', 'Odilon Redon or The Eye Like a Strange Balloon Mounts Toward Infinity', 1995, 'Fantasy', 'Guy Maddin', 'Guy Maddin', 'James Keller, Brandy Bayes, Caelum Vatnsdal, Evan Richards, John Teunissen, Ron Eyolfson', null, 'A father and son rescue the sole survivor of a train crash.', 'A father and son rescue the sole survivor of a train crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HItTv1aM8CXmcDuxUBTuO52z0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128746'),
  ('1041627372743306638', 'Odin: Starlight Mutiny', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Animation', 'Yoshinori Kanada, Masaharu Endo, Koichi Tsunoda', null, 'Keiko Han, Toshio Furukawa, Katsuji Mori, Kazuhiko Kishino, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Norio Wakamoto, Takeshi Katō, Tessyo Genda', null, 'Odin centers around the novice crew of the laser sailing space schooner Starlight as they embark on an historic interstellar test flight. They are intercepted by what seems to be a wrecked spaceship only to find that it contains a lone survivor; a young woman named Sara Cyanbaker. Unknown to the crew at this time, a mechanized space fleet approaches Earth and a scout vessel from that fleet was responsible for the destruction of Sara''s ship.', 'Odin centers around the novice crew of the laser sailing space schooner Starlight as they embark on an historic interstellar test flight. They are intercepted by what seems to be a wrecked spaceship only to find that it contains a lone survivor; a young woman named Sara Cyanbaker. Unknown to the crew at this time, a mechanized space fleet approaches Earth and a scout vessel from that fleet was responsible for the destruction of Sara''s ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Mbi0K7giSgCNwUDMrD6sr9zXUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76731'),
  ('299276383695740571', 'Ödipussi', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Xaver Schwarzenberger, Vicco von Bülow, Wieland Liebske', 'Vicco von Bülow', 'Vicco von Bülow, Evelyn Hamann, Katharina Brauren, Edda Seippel, Richard Lauffen, Klaus Schultz, Rosemarie Fendel, Walter Hoor', null, 'Paul Winkelmann is the CEO of a successful business in Hamburg that he took over after the death of his father eight years ago. But he is still strongly dominated by his 78 year old mother who cares for him as a child, and who cannot understand why he took an apartment on his own after all these years. The real "problem" starts when Paul gets to know psychologist Margarethe Tietze whose relationship to her parents is also not so easy after all.', 'Paul Winkelmann is the CEO of a successful business in Hamburg that he took over after the death of his father eight years ago. But he is still strongly dominated by his 78 year old mother who cares for him as a child, and who cannot understand why he took an apartment on his own after all these years. The real "problem" starts when Paul gets to know psychologist Margarethe Tietze whose relationship to her parents is also not so easy after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akKq4D7XoE7zmNbhRSAeOJgsoL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4645'),
  ('867663099074986924', 'Odissea', 1968, 'TV Movie, Adventure, History', 'Franco Rossi, Piero Schivazappa, Mario Bava', 'Giampiero Bona, Vittorio Bonicelli', 'Bekim Fehmiu, Irene Papas, Michèle Breton, Fausto Tozzi, Roy Purcell, Stefanella Giovannini, Barbara Bach, Vladimir Leib', null, 'Odysseus'' journey told in Homer''s Iliad and Odyssey. After fighting in the Trojan War, Odysseus spends years trying to return home to Itaka.', 'Odysseus'' journey told in Homer''s Iliad and Odyssey. After fighting in the Trojan War, Odysseus spends years trying to return home to Itaka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXvc5x6Xw1nHNdrmU4K1MlFxfss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42853'),
  ('196040117850001511', 'Odnoklassniki.ru: The Magic Laptop', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Pavel Hoodyakov, Maxim Osadchy-Korytkovsky', 'Pavel Hoodyakov, Tair Mamedov, Svyatoslav Savchenko', 'Pyotr Fyodorov, Korneliya Polyak, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Sergey Nikonenko, Sergey Druzyak, Kseniya Sobchak, Zhanna Friske, Timur Yunusov', null, 'An advertising creative in a rut finds his life turned upside down when he discovers his ability to write his wishes into reality.', 'An advertising creative in a rut finds his life turned upside down when he discovers his ability to write his wishes into reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeDr5rq3BNoUsBWOKevugs6Ho7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247849'),
  ('673740381910974605', 'Odor of the Day', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Arthur Davis, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'On a cold winter''s day, a stray dog is looking for shelter, then finds and sneaks into a cabin with an open fireplace and a cozy bed. But he has a stinky rival for occupancy of the cabin - a skunk.', 'On a cold winter''s day, a stray dog is looking for shelter, then finds and sneaks into a cabin with an open fireplace and a cozy bed. But he has a stinky rival for occupancy of the cabin - a skunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLyfAzQ9EZuAWGI3brhbw6ilQ9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237292'),
  ('403444307187075412', 'Odor-Able Kitty', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A cat, tired of being abused by everyone in his neighborhood, disguises himself as a skunk and inadvertently attracts the romantic advances of a real skunk.', 'A cat, tired of being abused by everyone in his neighborhood, disguises himself as a skunk and inadvertently attracts the romantic advances of a real skunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xAOe91FeKcYhjdUyt6069zbZ0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100352'),
  ('800201948876332528', 'Odoru Chibusa', 1984, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Nobumasa Mizunoo, Yoshihiro Kawasaki, Masahito Segawa', 'Masahiro Yoshimoto', 'Kate Asabuki, Mizuho Nakagawa, Kaoru Mizuki, Yūji Nogami, Shinji Sekikawa, Hidekazu Takahara, Masako Urushizawa', null, 'After coming back from a trip a young newlywed wife discovers that her husband has packed up and left. Dark secrets are revealed when she tries to find him.', 'After coming back from a trip a young newlywed wife discovers that her husband has packed up and left. Dark secrets are revealed when she tries to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9J9cqIam0uIRuL1uyVDlJLK4zCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927118'),
  ('509593545909480499', 'Odysseus & the Isle of Mists', 2008, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Terry Ingram, C. Kim Miles, Kevin Leslie', 'Brook Durham', 'Arnold Vosloo, Michael Antonakos, Steve Bacic, JR Bourne, Randal Edwards, Leah Gibson, Sonya Salomaa, Stefanie von Pfetten', null, 'King Odysseus has been away from Ithaca for twenty years.The first ten he spent fighting the Trojan War the last ten he spent fighting to get home. Among his adventures is the tale Homer felt was too horrible to tell, the missing book of the Odyssey known as The Isle of the Mists. Here the Warrior King and his men face the Goddess of the Underworld and her winged horrific creatures.', 'King Odysseus has been away from Ithaca for twenty years.The first ten he spent fighting the Trojan War the last ten he spent fighting to get home. Among his adventures is the tale Homer felt was too horrible to tell, the missing book of the Odyssey known as The Isle of the Mists. Here the Warrior King and his men face the Goddess of the Underworld and her winged horrific creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qulthK4FFQqGFqgqMH5KOWRU8wq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29220'),
  ('661095490837681640', 'Oeconomia', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Carmen Losmann', null, null, null, 'What is money? What are debts? What are the consequences of both? And how can images be found for them? In Oeconomia, Carmen Losmann undertakes a journey in the strategic heartlands of neoliberal policy.', 'What is money? What are debts? What are the consequences of both? And how can images be found for them? In Oeconomia, Carmen Losmann undertakes a journey in the strategic heartlands of neoliberal policy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLHkFKlgy6XzfNU7qZn0q0jqGs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665453'),
  ('422926584571297717', 'Oedipus Mayor', 1996, 'Drama, War', 'Jorge Alí Triana, Rodrigo Ospina, Rodrigo Triana', 'Orlando Senna, Gabriel García Márquez, Stella Malagón Gutiérrez', 'Jorge Perugorría, Ángela Molina, Francisco Rabal, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Jairo Camargo, Miriam Colon, Juan Sebastián Aragón, Marcela Agudelo', null, 'Edipo, is appointed mayor of a town plunged in misery and violence. His first mission is to discover and punish the murderers of Layo, a well-known potentate of the region. His investigation is directed towards all the armed factions that exist in Colombia.', 'Edipo, is appointed mayor of a town plunged in misery and violence. His first mission is to discover and punish the murderers of Layo, a well-known potentate of the region. His investigation is directed towards all the armed factions that exist in Colombia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dHrj4wWdSjs1uL1GruaYkF20FW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207127'),
  ('62434680420305242', 'Oedipus Orca', 1977, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Eriprando Visconti, Mimmola Girosi, Blasco Giurato', 'Eriprando Visconti', 'Rena Niehaus, Michele Placido, Gabriele Ferzetti, Miguel Bosé, Carmen Scarpitta, Piero Faggioni, Vittorio Valsecchi, Enzo Consoli', null, 'Sequel to "La Orca" which follows the life of the kidnapped girl after she returns home to her boyfriend and family. After her kidnap ordeal Alice tries to return to her normal life, but her memories still haunt her and her way to see the world has been changed forever.', 'Sequel to "La Orca" which follows the life of the kidnapped girl after she returns home to her boyfriend and family. After her kidnap ordeal Alice tries to return to her normal life, but her memories still haunt her and her way to see the world has been changed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4giog4dx98lHQ2bjBIlmJ3I4FL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157209'),
  ('179605025295781674', 'Oedipus Rex', 1967, 'Drama', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Jean-Claude Biette, Benoît Lamy', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Franco Citti, Silvana Mangano, Alida Valli, Carmelo Bene, Julian Beck, Luciano Bartoli, Francesco Leonetti, Ahmed Belhachmi', null, 'In pre-war Italy, a young couple have a baby boy. The father, however, is jealous of his son - and the scene moves to antiquity, where the baby is taken into the desert to be killed. He is rescued, given the name Oedipus, and brought up by the King and Queen of Corinth as their son. One day an oracle informs Oedipus that he is destined to kill his father and marry his mother. Horrified, he flees Corinth and his supposed parents - only to get into a fight and kill an older man on the road…', 'In pre-war Italy, a young couple have a baby boy. The father, however, is jealous of his son - and the scene moves to antiquity, where the baby is taken into the desert to be killed. He is rescued, given the name Oedipus, and brought up by the King and Queen of Corinth as their son. One day an oracle informs Oedipus that he is destined to kill his father and marry his mother. Horrified, he flees Corinth and his supposed parents - only to get into a fight and kill an older man on the road…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7R3yPlLdiNhpGzasB8SDCT6Kwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42691'),
  ('62572474488268027', 'Of an Age', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Goran Stolevski, Matthew Chuang, Oliver Tummel', 'Goran Stolevski', 'Elias Anton, Thom Green, Hattie Hook, Toby Derrick, Grace Graznak, Jessica Lu, Verity Higgins, Jack Kenny', 'R', 'A Serbian ballroom dancer experiences an unexpected and intense 24-hour romance with a friend''s older brother.', 'A Serbian ballroom dancer experiences an unexpected and intense 24-hour romance with a friend''s older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hM1WknAN6uOeH2YxTQ9RaI0C3Uj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958340'),
  ('896581541072338630', 'Of Fathers and Sons', 2017, 'Documentary, War', 'Talal Derki, Kahtan Hassoun', null, 'Abu Osama', null, 'Talal Derki returns to his homeland where he gains the trust of a radical Islamist family, sharing their daily life for over two years. His camera focuses on Osama and his younger brother Ayman, providing an extremely rare insight into what it means to grow up in an Islamic Caliphate.', 'Talal Derki returns to his homeland where he gains the trust of a radical Islamist family, sharing their daily life for over two years. His camera focuses on Osama and his younger brother Ayman, providing an extremely rare insight into what it means to grow up in an Islamic Caliphate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nY0ef1kCwu1fUG0mjBq3wWghu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488740'),
  ('455129735055120215', 'Of Feline Bondage', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'June Foray, Mel Blanc', null, 'Tom chases Jerry around a pool hall. Jerry''s fairy godmouse arrives, and Jerry tells the story; she gives him an invisibility potion. Jerry uses this to do some creative barbering on Tom, but when the potion wears off, Tom gets his revenge, and they both have a good laugh.', 'Tom chases Jerry around a pool hall. Jerry''s fairy godmouse arrives, and Jerry tells the story; she gives him an invisibility potion. Jerry uses this to do some creative barbering on Tom, but when the potion wears off, Tom gets his revenge, and they both have a good laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CJQPoA9OfK5v8fuTJc4Sen5ux3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234389'),
  ('957454595112662884', 'Of Fox and Hounds', 1940, 'Animation', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Tex Avery, Mel Blanc', null, 'Willoughby, a big dumb hound, is repeatedly tricked by George, the fox, into jumping off cliffs, among other things.', 'Willoughby, a big dumb hound, is repeatedly tricked by George, the fox, into jumping off cliffs, among other things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGKY7t5UuE3AG2qjqPmtIJCEVyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86739'),
  ('271488796899359743', 'Of Freaks and Men', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Sergey Astakhov', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Sergey Makovetskiy, Dinara Drukarova, Anzhelika Nevolina, Viktor Sukhorukov, Yuriy Galtsev, Alyosha Dyo, Chingiz Tsydendambayev, Vadim Prokhorov', null, 'St. Petersburg, early 20th century. The handsome and secretive Johann specializes in shooting erotic pictures depicting the floggings of bare-bottomed women. With the help of his assistants, the photographic creations gradually penetrate the peaceful households of two upper-class Russian families.', 'St. Petersburg, early 20th century. The handsome and secretive Johann specializes in shooting erotic pictures depicting the floggings of bare-bottomed women. With the help of his assistants, the photographic creations gradually penetrate the peaceful households of two upper-class Russian families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/747Pva2PZtWUPGiQFsILoXLRPHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84002'),
  ('1024907097384387159', 'Of Girls and Horses', 2014, 'Drama', 'Monika Treut, Birgit Möller', 'Monika Treut', 'Ceci Chuh, Alissa Wilms, Vanida Karun, Ellen Grell, Christoph Mulai, Chris Mulai, Christopher Mulai, Christophe Mulai', null, 'Alex is 16, a misfit, a drop-out, a failure. She uses drugs; she cuts herself. She has been sent by her despairing adoptive mother to a farm in northern Germany. At first, Alex hates this remote place and the demanding job of looking after the horses. But under the tutelage of Nina, a 30-something taking a break from city life and her partner, Christine, Alex gradually comes to form a bond with the animals in her charge. Then Kathy arrives at the farm to take a holiday, bringing her own, beautiful horse with her. Alex takes an instant dislike to this privileged newcomer. Slowly, though, the barriers between the two are broken down and Kathy finds herself smitten by the streetwise and energetic Alex. The pair starts horsing around, larking about on the mudflats, until one weekend, when they’re alone at the farm, things spiral out of control.', 'Alex is 16, a misfit, a drop-out, a failure. She uses drugs; she cuts herself. She has been sent by her despairing adoptive mother to a farm in northern Germany. At first, Alex hates this remote place and the demanding job of looking after the horses. But under the tutelage of Nina, a 30-something taking a break from city life and her partner, Christine, Alex gradually comes to form a bond with the animals in her charge. Then Kathy arrives at the farm to take a holiday, bringing her own, beautiful horse with her. Alex takes an instant dislike to this privileged newcomer. Slowly, though, the barriers between the two are broken down and Kathy finds herself smitten by the streetwise and energetic Alex. The pair starts horsing around, larking about on the mudflats, until one weekend, when they’re alone at the farm, things spiral out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kCvsvmVM3pXoyGE2Q4oJ5LftMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319193'),
  ('675826977762553', 'Of Gods and Men', 2010, 'Drama, History', 'Xavier Beauvois, Caroline Champetier, Guillaume Bonnier', 'Xavier Beauvois, Étienne Comar', 'Lambert Wilson, Michael Lonsdale, Olivier Rabourdin, Philippe Laudenbach, Jacques Herlin, Loïc Pichon, Xavier Maly, Jean-Marie Frin', 'PG-13', 'A group of Trappist monks reside in the monastery of Tibhirine in Algeria, where they live in harmony with the largely muslim population. When a bloody conflict between Algeria''s army and Muslim Jihadi insurgents disrupts the peace, they are forced to consider fleeing the monastery and deserting the villagers they have ministered to. In the face of deadly violence the monks wrestle with their faith and their convictions, eventually deciding to stay and help their neighbours keep the army and the insurgents at bay.', 'A group of Trappist monks reside in the monastery of Tibhirine in Algeria, where they live in harmony with the largely muslim population. When a bloody conflict between Algeria''s army and Muslim Jihadi insurgents disrupts the peace, they are forced to consider fleeing the monastery and deserting the villagers they have ministered to. In the face of deadly violence the monks wrestle with their faith and their convictions, eventually deciding to stay and help their neighbours keep the army and the insurgents at bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgrC0w62MCc7Fn77l5RVY0WKv0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46332'),
  ('367759900483014423', 'Of Horses and Men', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Benedikt Erlingsson, Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson', 'Benedikt Erlingsson', 'Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Charlotte Bøving, Steinn Ármann Magnússon, Kristbjörg Kjeld, Helgi Björnsson, Kjartan Ragnarsson, Sigríður María Egilsdóttir, Juan Camillo Roman Estrada', null, 'A country romance about the human streak in the horse and the horse in the human. Love and death become interlaced and with terrible consequences. The fortunes of the people in the country through the horses'' perception.', 'A country romance about the human streak in the horse and the horse in the human. Love and death become interlaced and with terrible consequences. The fortunes of the people in the country through the horses'' perception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eYTn4BrD8ycb3rqlXzd6oPEME4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217708'),
  ('174230886405218480', 'Of Human Bondage', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Cromwell, Henry W. Gerrard, Kenneth Holmes', 'Lester Cohen', 'Leslie Howard, Bette Davis, Frances Dee, Kay Johnson, Reginald Denny, Alan Hale, Reginald Sheffield, Reginald Owen', 'NR', 'A young man finds himself attracted to a cold and unfeeling waitress who may ultimately destroy them both.', 'A young man finds himself attracted to a cold and unfeeling waitress who may ultimately destroy them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpGAPsHnCpifmLKeiLnwNgT157y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43905'),
  ('1149959468357709172', 'Of Human Bondage', 1964, 'Drama', 'Henry Hathaway, Ken Hughes, Bryan Forbes', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Laurence Harvey, Kim Novak, Robert Morley, Siobhán McKenna, Roger Livesey, Jack Hedley, Nanette Newman, Ronald Lacey', 'NR', 'Medical student Philip Carey becomes involved with flirtatious waitress Mildred Rogers. Their love affair is interrupted when Philip is made aware of her constant infidelity. As Mildred quits her job and becomes a prostitute, Philip is still in love with her.', 'Medical student Philip Carey becomes involved with flirtatious waitress Mildred Rogers. Their love affair is interrupted when Philip is made aware of her constant infidelity. As Mildred quits her job and becomes a prostitute, Philip is still in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCJvEJms76nz1rHex3stQrkQRoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120526'),
  ('975112632872532438', 'Of Human Hearts', 1938, 'Drama', 'Clarence Brown, Clyde De Vinna, Douglas Shearer', 'Bradbury Foote', 'Walter Huston, James Stewart, Beulah Bondi, Gene Reynolds, Guy Kibbee, Charles Coburn, John Carradine, Ann Rutherford', 'NR', 'This is a story about family relationships, set in the time before and during the American Civil War. Ethan Wilkins is a poor and honest man who ministers to the human soul, while his son Jason yearns to be a doctor, helping people in the earthly realm. It is a rich story about striving for excellence, the tension of father-son rebellion, and the love of a mother that can never die.', 'This is a story about family relationships, set in the time before and during the American Civil War. Ethan Wilkins is a poor and honest man who ministers to the human soul, while his son Jason yearns to be a doctor, helping people in the earthly realm. It is a rich story about striving for excellence, the tension of father-son rebellion, and the love of a mother that can never die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZaet6DUhDh4pKRHRovdVXokJfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122884'),
  ('898708186437673564', 'Of Life and Love', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Cesare Olivieri, Giuseppe La Torre, Sergio Leone', 'Luigi Zampa, Mario Soldati, Giorgio Pàstina', 'Turi Pandolfini, Natale Cirino, Antonio Nicotra, Myriam Bru, Totò, Aldo Fabrizi, Lucia Bosè, Walter Chiari', null, 'A film made up of four episodes: a jar repairer gets trapped in a vat because of his hunch; a young unmarried mother is forced to beg to buy herself a fan; Rosario Chiarchiaro appears before a law court for casting spells; the discomfort of an overtight jacket gives a wedding witness the strength to persuade the bridegroom''s reluctant parents to bless his union.', 'A film made up of four episodes: a jar repairer gets trapped in a vat because of his hunch; a young unmarried mother is forced to beg to buy herself a fan; Rosario Chiarchiaro appears before a law court for casting spells; the discomfort of an overtight jacket gives a wedding witness the strength to persuade the bridegroom''s reluctant parents to bless his union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/so5RCqDE3IuxAO9KENgJvGpLLce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73833'),
  ('382465482343739430', 'Of Love and Lies', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julien Rappeneau, Pierre Cottereau, Alain Braconnier', 'Julien Rappeneau', 'François Damiens, Maleaume Paquin, André Dussollier, Ludivine Sagnier, Laetitia Dosch, Sébastien Chassagne, Didier Brice, Cassiopée Mayance', null, 'Twelve-year old Theo plays for a local soccer club and has enough talent to eventually go pro. But his father has been on a self-destructive spiral ever since he started drinking and got divorced, and Theo feels powerless and anxious as he watches his dad slowly destroying his own life. But he refuses to give up on him. When a recruiter for a prestigious British club takes notice of him, Theo sees an opportunity to rekindle his father’s hope, but despite all his efforts he is not selected. So he decides to lie and say he was, hoping to make his father happy and proud. Theo’s dad is so overjoyed that he puts all his heart into helping his son prepare for “once-in-a-lifetime opportunity” gradually regaining his taste for life and motivation for the future. Until the lie reaches unforeseen proportions and completely spins out of control. Thankfully, Theo’s little lie has already operated big change and generated so much hope, that life is able to get back on track. Only better!', 'Twelve-year old Theo plays for a local soccer club and has enough talent to eventually go pro. But his father has been on a self-destructive spiral ever since he started drinking and got divorced, and Theo feels powerless and anxious as he watches his dad slowly destroying his own life. But he refuses to give up on him. When a recruiter for a prestigious British club takes notice of him, Theo sees an opportunity to rekindle his father’s hope, but despite all his efforts he is not selected. So he decides to lie and say he was, hoping to make his father happy and proud. Theo’s dad is so overjoyed that he puts all his heart into helping his son prepare for “once-in-a-lifetime opportunity” gradually regaining his taste for life and motivation for the future. Until the lie reaches unforeseen proportions and completely spins out of control. Thankfully, Theo’s little lie has already operated big change and generated so much hope, that life is able to get back on track. Only better!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTF7GK783emPqJvBCwRidP8lTy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589181'),
  ('71230314046843240', 'Of Love and Other Demons', 2009, 'Drama', 'Hilda Hidalgo, Mariana Rodríguez', 'Hilda Hidalgo', 'Pablo Derqui, Eliza Triana, Jordi Dauder, Joaquín Climent, Margarita Rosa de Francisco, Damián Alcázar, Alina Lozano, Martha Lucía Leal', null, 'Based on Gabriel García Márquez''s novel, this is the unsettling story of 13-year-old noble Sierva and the dog bite that changes her life forever. Abandoned, displaced, in the midst of a sexual awakening and finally exorcised, Sierva finds an unlikely ally in a young priest and together they discover passion.', 'Based on Gabriel García Márquez''s novel, this is the unsettling story of 13-year-old noble Sierva and the dog bite that changes her life forever. Abandoned, displaced, in the midst of a sexual awakening and finally exorcised, Sierva finds an unlikely ally in a young priest and together they discover passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmjiwwfT7kRJQ0ATi79upBmSOO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77855'),
  ('277675069929119506', 'Of Love and Shadows', 1994, 'Drama', 'Betty Kaplan, Hugo Lescano, Santiago Carlos Oves', 'Donald Freed', 'Jennifer Connelly, Antonio Banderas, Stefania Sandrelli, Diego Wallraff, Camilo Gallardo, Patricio Contreras, Jorge Rivera López, Angela Ragno', 'R', 'Irene is a magazine editor living under the shadow of the Pinochet dictatorship in Chile. Francisco is a handsome photographer and he comes to Irene for a job. As a sympathizer with the underground resistance movement, Francisco opens her eyes and her heart to the atrocities being committed by the state.', 'Irene is a magazine editor living under the shadow of the Pinochet dictatorship in Chile. Francisco is a handsome photographer and he comes to Irene for a job. As a sympathizer with the underground resistance movement, Francisco opens her eyes and her heart to the atrocities being committed by the state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJuOamSPeB3GBJXhLnwPCcietyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90148'),
  ('1009422534770748070', 'Of Mice and Men', 1939, 'Drama', 'Lewis Milestone, Norbert Brodine', 'Eugene Solow', 'Burgess Meredith, Lon Chaney Jr., Betty Field, Charles Bickford, Roman Bohnen, Bob Steele, Noah Beery Jr., Oscar O''Shea', 'PG', 'An intellectually disabled giant and his level headed guardian find work at a sadistic cowboy''s ranch in depression era America.', 'An intellectually disabled giant and his level headed guardian find work at a sadistic cowboy''s ranch in depression era America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihgGS9K8pCYdgb9SpanxoKcJ0Al.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51802'),
  ('109790211906939826', 'Of Mice and Men', 1992, 'Drama', 'Kenneth MacMillan, Gary Sinise, Michele Panelli-Venetis', 'Horton Foote', 'John Malkovich, Gary Sinise, Ray Walston, Casey Siemaszko, Sherilyn Fenn, John Terry, Richard Riehle, Alexis Arquette', 'PG-13', 'Two drifters, one a gentle but slow giant, try to make money working the fields during the Depression so they can fulfill their dreams.', 'Two drifters, one a gentle but slow giant, try to make money working the fields during the Depression so they can fulfill their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAHLUMZyoW3iwj2b01B2nKcePTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9609'),
  ('532758710447057158', 'Of Skin and Men', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mehdi Ben Attia, Antoine Parouty', 'Mehdi Ben Attia, Martin Drouot', 'Hafsia Herzi, Raouf Ben Amor, Haythem Achour, Sondos Belhassen, Karim Ait M''Hand, Nawel Ben Kraiem, Nasreddine Ben Maati, Abdelhamid Naouara', null, 'Amel is a young photographer. When she loses her husband, her life changes. Encouraged by her father-in-law, she takes a taste of life by photographing street boys. Without fear of being scandalous, she makes the choice to look at men as men look at women.', 'Amel is a young photographer. When she loses her husband, her life changes. Encouraged by her father-in-law, she takes a taste of life by photographing street boys. Without fear of being scandalous, she makes the choice to look at men as men look at women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLtuZVpipV7cVZm9Uu4ua3o748Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486114'),
  ('1145192118722818382', 'Of Special Merit', 1968, null, 'Hellmuth Costard', 'Hellmuth Costard', 'Hellmuth Costard, Hans Toussaint', null, 'An attack on a piece of reactionary German legislation discriminating against young film directors. The film features a head-on, close-up shot of a penis ‘mouthing’ the parliamentary defense of the law by its author. A landmark in political pamphleteering, the film was selected for the 1968 Oberhausen International Short Film Festival by a committee of leading German critics and promptly banned by the city government, causing the withdrawal of almost all German directors from the festival and a national scandal. The title satirically refers to the official certificate of ‘Particularly Valuable’ given each year to the best film shorts by an Establishment selection.', 'An attack on a piece of reactionary German legislation discriminating against young film directors. The film features a head-on, close-up shot of a penis ‘mouthing’ the parliamentary defense of the law by its author. A landmark in political pamphleteering, the film was selected for the 1968 Oberhausen International Short Film Festival by a committee of leading German critics and promptly banned by the city government, causing the withdrawal of almost all German directors from the festival and a national scandal. The title satirically refers to the official certificate of ‘Particularly Valuable’ given each year to the best film shorts by an Establishment selection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tZVRYKF8owGecrWdw4M553sMbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148049'),
  ('380599632703252696', 'Of the Flesh', 1983, 'Drama, Horror', 'Marilou Diaz-Abaya, Manolo R. Abaya', 'Ricardo Lee', 'Charito Solis, Phillip Salvador, Vic Silayan, Cecille Castillo, Joel Torre, Grace Amilbangsa, Pen Medina, Joonee Gamboa', null, 'When Narcing brings home his wife Puring to their hometown Mulawin in the 1930s, it sets off a series of events that include parricide, infidelity, betrayal, guilt and redemption.', 'When Narcing brings home his wife Puring to their hometown Mulawin in the 1930s, it sets off a series of events that include parricide, infidelity, betrayal, guilt and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHv4mY7A2UGnBdwQzoGu5oGkGih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253081'),
  ('140642966794438940', 'Of Things Supernatural', 1959, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jaroslav Mach, Jiří Krejčík, Miloš Makovec', 'František Daniel, Miloš Makovec, Vladimír Bor', 'Ladislav Pešek, Vlastimil Brodský, Felix le Breux, Bohuš Záhorský, Eman Fiala, Rudolf Deyl, Václav Trégl, Miloš Nedbal', null, 'An anthology of three absurd, ironic tales inspired by Čapek’s “Tales from One Pocket” and “Fables and Side Stories,” each showing uncanny forces disrupting ordinary lives: in Krejčík’s “Glorie,” a gentle clerk is haunted by a sudden halo; the other two segments by Mach and Makovec similarly blend everyday routines with ironic, supernatural twists.', 'An anthology of three absurd, ironic tales inspired by Čapek’s “Tales from One Pocket” and “Fables and Side Stories,” each showing uncanny forces disrupting ordinary lives: in Krejčík’s “Glorie,” a gentle clerk is haunted by a sudden halo; the other two segments by Mach and Makovec similarly blend everyday routines with ironic, supernatural twists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pht3WkvKX8kyAO0jHKPtghjaznB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245604'),
  ('1147046600405741026', 'Of Time and the City', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Terence Davies', 'Terence Davies', 'Terence Davies', null, 'British director Terence Davies reflects on his birthplace of Liverpool - his memories of growing up there and how it has changed in the years since - in the process meditating on the internal struggles and conflicts that have wracked him throughout his life and the history of England during the second half of the 20th century.', 'British director Terence Davies reflects on his birthplace of Liverpool - his memories of growing up there and how it has changed in the years since - in the process meditating on the internal struggles and conflicts that have wracked him throughout his life and the history of England during the second half of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kdvuMUOTBkcjtWNwL9W0sEmaQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29785'),
  ('844630177098081670', 'Of Unknown Origin', 1983, 'Horror', 'René Verzier, George P. Cosmatos', 'Brian Taggert', 'Peter Weller, Jennifer Dale, Lawrence Dane, Kenneth Welsh, Louis Del Grande, Shannon Tweed, Keith Knight, Maury Chaykin', 'R', 'A man who recently completed rebuilding a townhouse becomes obsessed with a rat infestation until it becomes an interspecies duel.', 'A man who recently completed rebuilding a townhouse becomes obsessed with a rat infestation until it becomes an interspecies duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btZt9kQIhYTsgoitcYFUhkEUmMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37227'),
  ('201456891948589875', 'Of Whales, the Moon, and Men', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Pierre Perrault, Michel Brault, Marcel Carrière', 'Pierre Perrault, Michel Brault', 'Léopold Tremblay, Alexis Tremblay, Abel Harvey, Louis Harvey, Joachim Harvey, Stanley Jackson, Marie Tremblay', null, 'At the instigation of the filmmakers, the young men of the Ile-aux-Coudres in the middle of the St-Lawrence River try as a memorial to their ancestors to revive the fishing of the belugas interrupted in 1924.', 'At the instigation of the filmmakers, the young men of the Ile-aux-Coudres in the middle of the St-Lawrence River try as a memorial to their ancestors to revive the fishing of the belugas interrupted in 1924.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDFfPk7XoJoK5ldYXyX3RvxuVgp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67403'),
  ('216518918276248141', 'Of Woman and Magic', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Claude Miller', 'Siri Hustvedt', 'Anne Brochet, Mathilde Seigner, Édouard Baer, Annie Noël, Yves Jacques, Jacques Mauclair, Édith Scob, Marc Cennelier', null, 'Claire Weygand, a thirty-year-old young woman who is about to defend her anthropology thesis, unfortunately not only feels bad but even worse and worse with each passing day. The migraine attacks she suffers from indeed keep her from working as hard as she should and in despair she decides to consult Doctor Fish. When the medicine the physician prescribes for her fails, Claire, who can''t take it any more, asks him to hospitalize her. In hospital, Claire shares her room with Odette, a young woman who has lost the use of her legs and Eléonore, a frightening old woman. The third episode from "The Blindfold" by Siri Hustvedt.', 'Claire Weygand, a thirty-year-old young woman who is about to defend her anthropology thesis, unfortunately not only feels bad but even worse and worse with each passing day. The migraine attacks she suffers from indeed keep her from working as hard as she should and in despair she decides to consult Doctor Fish. When the medicine the physician prescribes for her fails, Claire, who can''t take it any more, asks him to hospitalize her. In hospital, Claire shares her room with Odette, a young woman who has lost the use of her legs and Eléonore, a frightening old woman. The third episode from "The Blindfold" by Siri Hustvedt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOHQUDBgyIyP0PA1iuuePeW5jNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68967'),
  ('767415802234857973', 'Of Women and Horses', 2012, 'Drama', 'Patricia Mazuy', null, 'Marina Hands, Bruno Ganz, Josiane Balasko, Lady Amanda Harlech, Isabel Karajan, Olivier Perrier, Lionel Dray, Muftie Alpin', null, 'This microcosm of power and money has no time for Gracieuse, whose only assets are her talent, her fiercely stubborn character, and, most particularly, her determination to succeed. A high tension wire who''s ready to stand up to Franz Mann and to face any obstacle, even if it means stepping outside the law, she pursues her sole obsession: to have a horse to call her own that she will take to the top.', 'This microcosm of power and money has no time for Gracieuse, whose only assets are her talent, her fiercely stubborn character, and, most particularly, her determination to succeed. A high tension wire who''s ready to stand up to Franz Mann and to face any obstacle, even if it means stepping outside the law, she pursues her sole obsession: to have a horse to call her own that she will take to the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYcy4WQxWTmzx6jC6gzQJ4RcacN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114535'),
  ('60573577333632026', 'Off and Running', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Tonie Marshall, Christophe Offenstein, Ophélie Gelber', 'Tonie Marshall', 'Nathalie Baye, Édouard Baer, Guy Marchand, Mélanie Bernier, JoeyStarr, Maurice Bénichou, Bulle Ogier, Sandrine Le Berre', null, 'A missed highway exit leads Darry Marzouki, an unemployed magician, to cross paths with Irène Montier Duval, a wealthy woman carrying a Hermès bag full of cash. Out of love, she acted as an intermediary in an arms deal between a French minister and Korea. When the deal was exposed, the minister tried to pin the blame on her. On the run, she offers to pay Darry to drive her to Geneva in his BMW. The problem? The BMW isn’t his—he impulsively stole it from his hot-tempered brother-in-law, who’s out for blood. Unable to accept Irène’s offer, Darry pretends to be an activist heading to a summit in Locarno. Irène, eager for a change, plays along. They have little in common but spend three unforgettable days together—while being chased by Koreans, French intelligence, a minister, and the furious brother-in-law. In the end, one finds love, the other freedom.', 'A missed highway exit leads Darry Marzouki, an unemployed magician, to cross paths with Irène Montier Duval, a wealthy woman carrying a Hermès bag full of cash. Out of love, she acted as an intermediary in an arms deal between a French minister and Korea. When the deal was exposed, the minister tried to pin the blame on her. On the run, she offers to pay Darry to drive her to Geneva in his BMW. The problem? The BMW isn’t his—he impulsively stole it from his hot-tempered brother-in-law, who’s out for blood. Unable to accept Irène’s offer, Darry pretends to be an activist heading to a summit in Locarno. Irène, eager for a change, plays along. They have little in common but spend three unforgettable days together—while being chased by Koreans, French intelligence, a minister, and the furious brother-in-law. In the end, one finds love, the other freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkv0vO6c5Qlf3TT8xkuiSfE9UCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58943'),
  ('262620496904814783', 'Off Beat', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Michael Dinner, Carlo Di Palma', 'Mark Medoff', 'Judge Reinhold, Meg Tilly, Cleavant Derricks, Joe Mantegna, John Turturro, Amy Wright, Harvey Keitel, Peter Wise', 'PG', 'Joe Gower''s job is skating through library shelves, fetching books. A police officer/friend of his is chosen to participate in a charity dance performance. Gower agrees to take his place in the show by posing as a police officer. He falls for a female officer in the show and gets into various scrapes with fellow cops and also crooks. And he dances.', 'Joe Gower''s job is skating through library shelves, fetching books. A police officer/friend of his is chosen to participate in a charity dance performance. Gower agrees to take his place in the show by posing as a police officer. He falls for a female officer in the show and gets into various scrapes with fellow cops and also crooks. And he dances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lc7Plw3ebetrmGoSq9ads6PNExy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39243'),
  ('636611727746956205', 'Off Beat', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hendrik Hölzemann, Grischa Schmitz, Lars R. Liebold', 'Hendrik Hölzemann', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Jessica Schwarz, Jan-Gregor Kremp, Florian Lukas, Bibiana Beglau, Carlo Ljubek, Volker Spengler, Rosel Zech', null, 'Traumatised paramedic looks for the woman of his dreams.', 'Traumatised paramedic looks for the woman of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGkJpzuTBJH1AHnyDc0qYIxEK2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3539'),
  ('1100057945325865173', 'Off Course', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Nacho G. Velilla, Isaac Vila, Antton Zabala', 'Nacho G. Velilla, Oriol Capel, David S. Olivas', 'Yon González, Julián López, Blanca Suárez, Malena Alterio, Úrsula Corberó, Miki Esparbé, Younes Bachir, Javier Cámara', 'PG', 'Two young Spanish men, with a university education, are tired of unemployment and decide to move to Germany. But soon they will find out that finding a better living is not as easy as they expected.', 'Two young Spanish men, with a university education, are tired of unemployment and decide to move to Germany. But soon they will find out that finding a better living is not as easy as they expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhZWzcIvU5ind2q56qDDoDwKZv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264729'),
  ('187642193404536017', 'Off Course to China', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Paco Caballero, David Valldepérez, Luis Fernández Lago', 'Daniel Monedero, Antonio Sánchez, Oriol Capel', 'Julián López, Miki Esparbé, Carmen Machi, Leo Harlem, Edu Soto, Younes Bachir, Juan Khun, Chacha Huang', 'PG', 'Braulio after his misadventures in Berlin, moves to Hong Kong along with Rafa and Hakan in search of new opportunities. However, it is not easy to succeed in a land where language, culture and customs are very different from Europe.', 'Braulio after his misadventures in Berlin, moves to Hong Kong along with Rafa and Hakan in search of new opportunities. However, it is not easy to succeed in a land where language, culture and customs are very different from Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxXZmELs87vgwfLALNd4lfBQx8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542931'),
  ('864132243421969139', 'Off Limits', 1952, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, J. Peverell Marley, Ralph Axness', 'Jack Sher, Hal Kanter', 'Bob Hope, Mickey Rooney, Marilyn Maxwell, Eddie Mayehoff, Stanley Clements, Jack Dempsey, Marvin Miller, John Ridgely', 'NR', 'Wally Hogan has things going his way. He is the manager-trainer of Bullet Bradley, a fighter who has just won the lightweight championship. However, life suddenly takes a not-so-happy turn when Bullet gets drafted.', 'Wally Hogan has things going his way. He is the manager-trainer of Bullet Bradley, a fighter who has just won the lightweight championship. However, life suddenly takes a not-so-happy turn when Bullet gets drafted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zw865vYCEdP4mIdlzzZ8Kjlxskz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109936'),
  ('1005243004673804963', 'Off Limits', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Christopher Crowe, John J. Connor, Dick Ziker', 'Jack Thibeau, Christopher Crowe', 'Willem Dafoe, Gregory Hines, Fred Ward, Amanda Pays, Scott Glenn, Keith David, David Alan Grier, Lim Kay Tong', 'R', 'McGriff and Albaby are probably doing the worst law enforcement job in the world - they are plain clothes U.S. military policemen on duty in war-time Saigon. However, their job becomes even harder when they start investigating the serial killings of local prostitutes. Their prime suspect is high ranking U.S. Army officer which brings their lives in danger.', 'McGriff and Albaby are probably doing the worst law enforcement job in the world - they are plain clothes U.S. military policemen on duty in war-time Saigon. However, their job becomes even harder when they start investigating the serial killings of local prostitutes. Their prime suspect is high ranking U.S. Army officer which brings their lives in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1c3ueMtlIdu0u5bjEaXLPj2sScG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38617'),
  ('312717459651500094', 'Off Limits', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Nicolas Boukhrief, Dominique Colin', 'Nicolas Boukhrief, Dan Sasson', 'Cécile de France, Fred Testot, Julien Boisselier, Nicolas Marié, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Nanou Garcia, Stéphane Jobert, Jean-Michel Noirey', null, 'During a patrol, Julie and Simon, two police constables, injure a wealthy man who pointlessly killed their partner. This wealthy man in question turns out to be the son of a politician. This is why the two police constables are accused of brutality by the brass. Abandoned by their superiors, the two leading characters will lead an investigation on the drug that caused the politician''s son to be out of his mind.', 'During a patrol, Julie and Simon, two police constables, injure a wealthy man who pointlessly killed their partner. This wealthy man in question turns out to be the son of a politician. This is why the two police constables are accused of brutality by the brass. Abandoned by their superiors, the two leading characters will lead an investigation on the drug that caused the politician''s son to be out of his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZHUvhP6X2dvVOdLgu66NbFSa3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43479'),
  ('943602713648041488', 'Off the Grid', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Johnny Martin, David Stragmeister', 'Jim Agnew', 'Josh Duhamel, Greg Kinnear, María Elisa Camargo, Peter Stormare, Ricky Russert, Michael Zapesotsky, Joe Bucaro III, Daniel Farag', 'R', 'After a morally-bankrupt company tries to weaponize a brilliant scientist''s revolutionary technology, he goes off the grid to safeguard humanity. When the company sends a strike force to find him, they make their biggest mistake of all – they weaponize the man they are trying to catch.', 'After a morally-bankrupt company tries to weaponize a brilliant scientist''s revolutionary technology, he goes off the grid to safeguard humanity. When the company sends a strike force to find him, they make their biggest mistake of all – they weaponize the man they are trying to catch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMUVnkcx2VawTBJYnnnRN8fxJpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1371151'),
  ('87343630316756317', 'Off the Map', 2003, 'Drama', 'Campbell Scott, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Joan Ackermann', 'Amy Brenneman, Valentina de Angelis, Joan Allen, Sam Elliott, J.K. Simmons, J.D. Garfield, Boots Southern, Jim True-Frost', 'PG-13', 'An 11-year-old girl watches her father come down with a crippling depression. Over one summer, she learns answers to several mysteries and comes to terms with love and loss.', 'An 11-year-old girl watches her father come down with a crippling depression. Over one summer, she learns answers to several mysteries and comes to terms with love and loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v3M2fAn5N8A78CZeOGSwSdtPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24078'),
