  ('427078682808210843', 'Off We Go 2', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mariusz Kuczewski, Jakub Jakielaszek', 'Mariusz Kuczewski, Marcin Baczyński', 'Marian Opania, Małgorzata Rożniatowska, Julia Wieniawa, Anita Sokołowska, Mariusz Drężek', null, 'Senior couple Joziek and Ela Gugulak plan to marry after decades together. When the bride vanishes, wedding prep becomes a journey through family history, testing their love while younger relatives face romantic challenges of their own.', 'Senior couple Joziek and Ela Gugulak plan to marry after decades together. When the bride vanishes, wedding prep becomes a journey through family history, testing their love while younger relatives face romantic challenges of their own.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaoMEQbYMfFx8i8rHKFdLrVRXyDV.jpg', 'plex:movie:dalej-jazda-2'),
