  ('784604946127272770', 'Off-Season', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Iris Wong, Laurent Herbiet, Dominique Bouilleret', null, 'Emmanuelle Devos, Éric Caravaca, Simon Abkarian, Robert Plagnol, Lise Lamétrie, Stefan Crepon, Christophe Tek, Igor Skreblin', null, 'A seaside resort in the middle of winter, with its abandoned beach bars and rain-battered alleys, can easily flank the drone. Refugees on the top floor of a building in La Grande Motte, Carole and Richard Lazure have zero morale: swindled by their tax advisor and badly defended by an incompetent lawyer, they lost their business, their house and no longer even enough to buy the essentials. The eruption into their life of a childhood friend of Richard, a talkative talker with questionable dating, could be a game-changer - or make their situation worse.', 'A seaside resort in the middle of winter, with its abandoned beach bars and rain-battered alleys, can easily flank the drone. Refugees on the top floor of a building in La Grande Motte, Carole and Richard Lazure have zero morale: swindled by their tax advisor and badly defended by an incompetent lawyer, they lost their business, their house and no longer even enough to buy the essentials. The eruption into their life of a childhood friend of Richard, a talkative talker with questionable dating, could be a game-changer - or make their situation worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9MWaiCekJPfVuH3DhwLs711jUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900516'),
