  ('991164198906905928', 'Office Killer', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Cindy Sherman, Russell Lee Fine, Jude Gorjanc', 'Todd Haynes', 'Carol Kane, Molly Ringwald, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Barbara Sukowa, Mike Hodge, Doug Barron, Linda Powell, Albert Macklin', 'R', 'When Dorine Douglas'' job as proofreader for Constant Consumer magazine is turned into an at-home position during a downsizing, she doesn''t know how to cope. But after accidentally killing one of her co-workers, she discovers that murder can quench the loneliness of her home life, as a macabre office place forms in her basement, populated by dead co-workers.', 'When Dorine Douglas'' job as proofreader for Constant Consumer magazine is turned into an at-home position during a downsizing, she doesn''t know how to cope. But after accidentally killing one of her co-workers, she discovers that murder can quench the loneliness of her home life, as a macabre office place forms in her basement, populated by dead co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytPjWp5LMW5jV9IVrcv6yTsxDTH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49728'),
  ('837854490971650835', 'Office Love: Behind Closed Doors', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yasuaki Uegaki, Kenichi Ikeda, Seisaku Kimura', 'Toshimichi Saeki', 'Rei Akasaka, Kurumi Jōgenji, Junpei Kusami, Koichi Ueda, Shigeki Ishii, Kenji Kodama, Tamaki Komiyama, Erika Imamura', null, 'Reiko is a high class call girl employed by a large corporation. She’ll do anything necessary to help her employer land new business, including kinky sex and humiliation, to please her high class clientele. Secretly bedding rival company executives on her own time, Reiko’s world turns upside down when a former lover comes back to her for affection. The problem is he’s married! With yet another shy employee vying for her attention, Reiko gets caught in a triple tryst that could change her future forever.', 'Reiko is a high class call girl employed by a large corporation. She’ll do anything necessary to help her employer land new business, including kinky sex and humiliation, to please her high class clientele. Secretly bedding rival company executives on her own time, Reiko’s world turns upside down when a former lover comes back to her for affection. The problem is he’s married! With yet another shy employee vying for her attention, Reiko gets caught in a triple tryst that could change her future forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSsbtRfYx8S5FLCbgEFQuKZpoDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262743'),
  ('255056743013531195', 'Office Race', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jared Lapidus', 'Jared Lapidus, James Kilmoon', 'Beck Bennett, Joel McHale, Kelsey Grammer, Kylie Bunbury, JB Smoove, Alyson Hannigan, Erinn Hayes, Geoffrey Arend', null, 'An unambitious office worker goes to great lengths—specifically 26.2 miles—to one up his exercise-obsessed, micromanaging boss.', 'An unambitious office worker goes to great lengths—specifically 26.2 miles—to one up his exercise-obsessed, micromanaging boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdJmHYCef3AoWFyVE2jzVCRdbgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160016'),
  ('455166480811581467', 'Office Romance', 1977, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Valentina Shchedrina', 'Emil Braginskiy, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Alisa Freyndlikh, Andrey Myagkov, Svetlana Nemolyaeva, Oleg Basilashvili, Liya Akhedzhakova, Lyudmila Ivanova, Pyotr Shcherbakov, Nelli Pshyonnaya', null, 'Anatoly Novoseltsev is a mousy single father and office stumblebum working at a statistics bureau in Moscow. In the hopes of being promoted, he is coaxed into charming his disagreeable and seemingly unfeeling boss, Ludmila Kalugina, or "Meany" as she''s otherwise known by her subordinates. Helped by his colleagues Olya and Yura, Anatoly attempts to ease the yoke of Ms. Kalugina, and what follows in the wake of his graceless manoeuvres is completely unforeseen, as he awakens a side to her not yet known, even to herself..', 'Anatoly Novoseltsev is a mousy single father and office stumblebum working at a statistics bureau in Moscow. In the hopes of being promoted, he is coaxed into charming his disagreeable and seemingly unfeeling boss, Ludmila Kalugina, or "Meany" as she''s otherwise known by her subordinates. Helped by his colleagues Olya and Yura, Anatoly attempts to ease the yoke of Ms. Kalugina, and what follows in the wake of his graceless manoeuvres is completely unforeseen, as he awakens a side to her not yet known, even to herself..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21TgZRiA5gDlyCwQEyYqZcqwMgN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31139'),
  ('536456237740620060', 'Office Space', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mike Judge', 'Mike Judge', 'Mike Judge', null, 'Milton, a put-upon office worker hounded by his boss, talks to the camera about his troubles, picks his nose, and threatens to burn the building down.', 'Milton, a put-upon office worker hounded by his boss, talks to the camera about his troubles, picks his nose, and threatens to burn the building down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veLbJnhSAmTP3pLkCJFFJcWuv4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284557'),
