  ('956865865086914676', 'Officer Downe', 2016, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime', 'Shawn Crahan, Gerardo Madrazo', 'Joe Casey', 'Kim Coates, Luna Lauren Vélez, Sona Eyambe, Reno Wilson, Bruno Gunn, Tracy Vilar, Meadow Williams, Shawn Crahan', 'R', 'A rookie cop is tasked with shadowing Officer Downe, a no-nonsense LAPD cop with regenerative powers, as he wages an ultra-violent war against the nefarious villains of Los Angeles.', 'A rookie cop is tasked with shadowing Officer Downe, a no-nonsense LAPD cop with regenerative powers, as he wages an ultra-violent war against the nefarious villains of Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2caCEdkXWIuNQsnrcfLD6BrioJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401061'),
  ('742132669750509602', 'Officer Duck', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi, Bill MacIntyre, Jack Cutting', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Officer Donald Duck (Officer #13) is assigned to apprehend a criminal named Tiny Tom. Donald assumes by the name that he''ll be a pushover but when he reaches Tom''s hideout, he discovers "Tiny" Tom is actually a hulking Pete who immediately disposes of Donald. Donald decides to use strategy and is able to reenter Pete''s house disguised as a baby who Pete surprisingly warms to. When Pete discovers Donald, he chases him down the street but is finally apprehended by Donald''s marching police colleagues who make the arrest.', 'Officer Donald Duck (Officer #13) is assigned to apprehend a criminal named Tiny Tom. Donald assumes by the name that he''ll be a pushover but when he reaches Tom''s hideout, he discovers "Tiny" Tom is actually a hulking Pete who immediately disposes of Donald. Donald decides to use strategy and is able to reenter Pete''s house disguised as a baby who Pete surprisingly warms to. When Pete discovers Donald, he chases him down the street but is finally apprehended by Donald''s marching police colleagues who make the arrest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/772S3sLTj8gyzggTJ1Bth9uQCgk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74615'),
  ('564688598478154977', 'Officer of the Year', 2011, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lim Chan-ik, Cho Sang-yun', 'Yoon Soon-yong, Lim Chan-ik, Choi Jin-won', 'Park Joong-hoon, Lee Sun-kyun, Lee Sung-min, Kim Jung-tae, Ko Joo-yeon, Han Soo-yeon, Kang Ki-hwa, Jeong Do-won', null, 'Two police stations from neighboring precincts are in constant fierce competition with each other, including for the Officer of the Year award. But then a high-profile case forces them to work together.', 'Two police stations from neighboring precincts are in constant fierce competition with each other, including for the Officer of the Year award. But then a high-profile case forces them to work together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFmXevN16w6WpclP0SEAlgWfOXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71620'),
  ('624561500836791093', 'Officer on Duty', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jithu Ashraf, Roby Varghese Raj', 'Shahi Kabir', 'Kunchacko Boban, Priyamani, Jagadish, Vishak Nair, Ramzan Muhammed, Vaisakh Shankar, Vishnu G. Varrier, Amit Eapen', null, 'A demoted police inspector investigates a counterfeit jewelry racket, becoming entangled in a dangerous web of crime that puts his life at stake.', 'A demoted police inspector investigates a counterfeit jewelry racket, becoming entangled in a dangerous web of crime that puts his life at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucwirgaK4v9ylQyDkwoXJtDIlf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1281091'),
  ('100119532551583035', 'Officers', 1971, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Vladimir Rogovoy, Mikhail Kirillov, Boris Koreshkov', 'Kirill Rapoport, Boris Vasilyev', 'Alina Pokrovskaya, Georgiy Yumatov, Vasili Lanovoy, Aleksandr Voevodin, Andrei Anisimov, Natalya Rychagova, Andrei Gromov, Yuriy Sorokin', null, 'Two friends are army officers, and the turbulent times throw them from the Civil War in the early 20s to the Soviet conflict in Finland, from China to the Urals.', 'Two friends are army officers, and the turbulent times throw them from the Civil War in the early 20s to the Soviet conflict in Finland, from China to the Urals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ig4COIGS7WE3AR2YoJyRso6NYt8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65386'),
  ('460980412174275446', 'Official Competition', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arnau Valls Colomer, Angie Paul Risque, Gastón Duprat', 'Mariano Cohn, Andrés Duprat, Gastón Duprat', 'Antonio Banderas, Penélope Cruz, Oscar Martínez, José Luis Gómez, Manolo Solo, Nagore Aranburu, Irene Escolar, Pilar Castro', 'R', 'When a billionaire entrepreneur impulsively decides to create an iconic movie, he demands the best. Renowned filmmaker Lola Cuevas is recruited to mastermind this ambitious endeavour. Completing the all-star team are two actors with massive talent but even bigger egos: Hollywood heartthrob Félix Rivero and radical theatre actor Iván Torres. Both are legends, but not exactly best friends. Through a series of increasingly eccentric trials set by Lola, Félix and Iván must confront not only each other but also their own legacies. Who will be left when the cameras finally start rolling?', 'When a billionaire entrepreneur impulsively decides to create an iconic movie, he demands the best. Renowned filmmaker Lola Cuevas is recruited to mastermind this ambitious endeavour. Completing the all-star team are two actors with massive talent but even bigger egos: Hollywood heartthrob Félix Rivero and radical theatre actor Iván Torres. Both are legends, but not exactly best friends. Through a series of increasingly eccentric trials set by Lola, Félix and Iván must confront not only each other but also their own legacies. Who will be left when the cameras finally start rolling?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvsiRSy1kIwlySogzOxkCFrJWYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668640'),
  ('818598912349981080', 'Official Opening of McTaggart Esplanade', 1927, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A local occasion filmed at Rapahoe Beach on the West Coast of the South Island.', 'A local occasion filmed at Rapahoe Beach on the West Coast of the South Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCmkpAd73NMhb98IaFaLau0sNXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526748'),
  ('293338465770064958', 'Official Secrets', 2019, 'Thriller, History, Drama', 'Sarah MacFarlane, Jen Ainsley, Toni Staples', 'Gavin Hood, Sara Bernstein, Gregory Bernstein', 'Keira Knightley, Matt Smith, Ralph Fiennes, Adam Bakri, Matthew Goode, Rhys Ifans, Indira Varma, John Heffernan', 'R', 'The true story of British intelligence whistleblower Katharine Gun who—prior to the 2003 Iraq invasion—leaked a top-secret NSA memo exposing a joint US-UK illegal spying operation against members of the UN Security Council. The memo proposed blackmailing member states into voting for war.', 'The true story of British intelligence whistleblower Katharine Gun who—prior to the 2003 Iraq invasion—leaked a top-secret NSA memo exposing a joint US-UK illegal spying operation against members of the UN Security Council. The memo proposed blackmailing member states into voting for war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyCGqSkT3PqLYQXiWs4FCVJBAYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393624'),
  ('724947578675257552', 'Offline: Are You Ready for the Next Level?', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Florian Schnell', 'Florian Schnell, Jan Cronauer', 'Moritz Jahn, Mala Emde, Florence Kasumba, Ugur Ekeroglu, Henning Peker, Daniele Rizzo, David Schütter, Hannes Wegener', null, 'Champion gamer Jan has to fight for his digital identity, winning back his real life as well.', 'Champion gamer Jan has to fight for his digital identity, winning back his real life as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBmD9nzmBeT0bXzVbPIVyaBIi9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442133'),
  ('702045985809608428', 'OffOn', 1968, null, 'Scott Bartlett', null, null, null, 'The human eye, the human form, the human face: these are the three central images of this avant-garde collage and kaleidoscope of shifting and fractured images, changing colors, and pulsing rhythms. Near the end, a tree appears briefly, and birds fly - first white, then red and blue. Celtic knots morph from one to another. The images become Rorschach tests although the mood, driven by the rapid changing images and the soundtrack, remains frantic.', 'The human eye, the human form, the human face: these are the three central images of this avant-garde collage and kaleidoscope of shifting and fractured images, changing colors, and pulsing rhythms. Near the end, a tree appears briefly, and birds fly - first white, then red and blue. Celtic knots morph from one to another. The images become Rorschach tests although the mood, driven by the rapid changing images and the soundtrack, remains frantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpcJbVYaI6SazuWXshXy467SPQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132159'),
  ('536579602587698745', 'Offroad', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Elmar Fischer, Philipp Kirsamer', 'Elmar Fischer, Susanne Hertel', 'Nora Tschirner, Elyas M''Barek, Maximilian von Pufendorf, Tonio Arango, Thomas Fränzel, Stefan Rudolf, Axel Milberg, Dominic Raacke', null, 'Meike has had enough of a comfortable life and ventures out on a risky off-road adventure in a jeep she bought at auction.', 'Meike has had enough of a comfortable life and ventures out on a risky off-road adventure in a jeep she bought at auction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx2bXpD4FZoUiOmWyZiPy3v4dLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83729'),
  ('185549781279455643', 'Offseason', 2022, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Mac Fisken, Mickey Keating, Jorge L. Rivera', 'Mickey Keating', 'Jocelin Donahue, Joe Swanberg, Richard Brake, Melora Walters, Jeremy Gardner, Jonathan Medina, Eliza Shin, Jess Varley', null, 'Upon receiving a mysterious letter that her mother''s grave has been vandalized, Marie travels to the desolate island town where she''s buried. Just as she arrives, the island closes for the season, leaving Marie trapped in a nightmare.', 'Upon receiving a mysterious letter that her mother''s grave has been vandalized, Marie travels to the desolate island town where she''s buried. Just as she arrives, the island closes for the season, leaving Marie trapped in a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlX4WdEMzVomRukPjVQx6U9jtBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796256'),
  ('996785906447774356', 'Offshoring', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Ali Bougheraba, Justine Arrestier, Amrith Nambiar', 'Ali Bougheraba', 'Redouane Bougheraba, Vanessa Guide, Ahassan Uddin, Antoine Gouy, Josiane Balasko, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Nino Arial, Rajiv Gandola', null, 'The day Redouane is going to get his promotion and finally become a foreman, he learns that the mattress factory where he works is being relocated to India. Determined to keep his promotion, he agrees to leave while having the guarantee of being paid double and takes his partner Marguerite with him. Once there, he discovers that his boss has duped him, he will indeed be paid double but in rupees. Furious, he decides to take revenge by teaching the teams the best of French social rights: strikes, demonstrations and RTT with the sole aim of overthrowing his boss. Between culture clash and social struggle, Redouane leads an unexpected revolution that could well change the destiny of the factory... and his own.', 'The day Redouane is going to get his promotion and finally become a foreman, he learns that the mattress factory where he works is being relocated to India. Determined to keep his promotion, he agrees to leave while having the guarantee of being paid double and takes his partner Marguerite with him. Once there, he discovers that his boss has duped him, he will indeed be paid double but in rupees. Furious, he decides to take revenge by teaching the teams the best of French social rights: strikes, demonstrations and RTT with the sole aim of overthrowing his boss. Between culture clash and social struggle, Redouane leads an unexpected revolution that could well change the destiny of the factory... and his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzMRYg60DcGtzSxbtnrIVrIP8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1294174'),
  ('652727139664627152', 'Offside', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Serdar Akar, Mehmet Aksin', null, 'Müjde Ar, Savaş Dinçel, Rafet El Roman, Erkan Can, Şahnaz Çakıralp, Uğur Polat, Sezai Aydın, İsmail İncekara', null, 'Thirtysomething Suat still lives with his parents and works at his father''s store when not practicing as goalie for the local football team, Esnaf Spor. The neighborhood''s greatest wish is for Esnaf Spor to win the amateur league championship.', 'Thirtysomething Suat still lives with his parents and works at his father''s store when not practicing as goalie for the local football team, Esnaf Spor. The neighborhood''s greatest wish is for Esnaf Spor to win the amateur league championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YZLclSNUVT6ssKktg9unvGAGG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23537'),
  ('317430874985835681', 'Offside', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jafar Panahi, Mahmoud Kalari, Rami Agami', 'Shadmehr Rastin, Jafar Panahi', 'Sima Mobarak-Shahi, Shayesteh Irani, Ayda Sadeqi, Golnaz Farmani, Mahnaz Zabihi, Nazanin Sediq-zadeh, Safar Samandar, M. Kheyrabadi', null, 'During the 2006 World Cup qualifying match between Iran and Bahrain, numerous young women are caught and rounded up for dressing as men so they could gain access to the game. Guarded by several soldiers in a holding pen, the women attempt to keep updated on the score.', 'During the 2006 World Cup qualifying match between Iran and Bahrain, numerous young women are caught and rounded up for dressing as men so they could gain access to the game. Guarded by several soldiers in a holding pen, the women attempt to keep updated on the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BDtD58nuNFyByMAoTLdFNHX5qZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13209'),
  ('679353101129996697', 'Offspring', 2009, 'Horror', 'Andrew van den Houten', 'Jack Ketchum', 'Jessica Butler, Leigh Shannan Feldpausch, Holter Graham, Amy Hargreaves, Art Hindle, Erick Kastel, Tommy Nelson, Spencer List', null, 'The local sheriff of Dead River, Maine, thought he had killed them off ten years ago -- a primitive, cave-dwelling tribe of cannibalistic savages. But somehow the clan survived. To breed. To hunt. To kill and eat. And now the peaceful residents of this isolated town are fighting for their lives...', 'The local sheriff of Dead River, Maine, thought he had killed them off ten years ago -- a primitive, cave-dwelling tribe of cannibalistic savages. But somehow the clan survived. To breed. To hunt. To kill and eat. And now the peaceful residents of this isolated town are fighting for their lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5i09QGn22eTxbLPCsjr90sFcnWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24868'),
  ('416754291954899914', 'Oficina do Diabo', 2025, 'Drama, Family', 'Filipe Valerim, André Brandão, Isabela Fuzaro', 'Elton Mesquita, Filipe Valerim', 'Roberto Mallet, Felipe de Barros, Sergio Barreto, Elizângela, Isabela Tortato, Rafael Senatore, Felipe Folgosi', null, 'In a competition in Hell, a master devil instructs his apprentice on human behavior while following the path of a "client" at the crossroads between good and evil.', 'In a competition in Hell, a master devil instructs his apprentice on human behavior while following the path of a "client" at the crossroads between good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FLLIBXhSrqtGlmgmKylBeEIOaJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159596'),
  ('660617542767836881', 'Oflu Hoca''nın Şifresi 2', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Adem Kılıç', 'Zeynep Kaya', 'Çetin Altay, Ahmet Varlı, Köksal Engür, Başak Daşman, Nihan Büyükağaç, Ayşegül Günay, Eser Eyüboğlu, Mehtap Bayri', null, 'Eyeing another shot at soccer club presidency, Ahmet draws up a plan that mires him in complicated nuptial agreements and a clumsy kidnapping scheme.', 'Eyeing another shot at soccer club presidency, Ahmet draws up a plan that mires him in complicated nuptial agreements and a clumsy kidnapping scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8RIJBWwMvBeN3MNKOj29MxCsRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394612'),
  ('435937905818467844', 'Oflu Hodja''s Code', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Adem Kılıç', 'Hilmi Alişanoğlu, Engin Elgün, Ferhat Ergün', 'Çetin Altay, Ahmet Varlı, Köksal Engür, Didem Balçın, Metin Büktel, Onur Dilber, Mehtap Bayri, Timur Ölkebaş', null, 'A famous imam from Northern Anatolia gets into competition with contractor Ahmet to become the president of a football club which is called ''Doganspor''. Moreover, the imam also appears as a guest on a television show to answer funny questions about Islam.', 'A famous imam from Northern Anatolia gets into competition with contractor Ahmet to become the president of a football club which is called ''Doganspor''. Moreover, the imam also appears as a guest on a television show to answer funny questions about Islam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RB3vy60Kdrtnb5GfDNzpmbYr9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346098'),
  ('381283771660104745', 'Often an Orphan', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Abandoned in the country by his old master, Charlie Dog tries to force himself upon farmer Porky Pig, playing upon his sympathies with a histrionic rendition of the horrors of big-city life.', 'Abandoned in the country by his old master, Charlie Dog tries to force himself upon farmer Porky Pig, playing upon his sympathies with a histrionic rendition of the horrors of big-city life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0CQrclLvMKDhME36akcYJboz0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237304'),
  ('75377743759511846', 'Oggy and the Cockroaches: The Movie', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Olivier Jean-Marie, Didier Degand, Marine Robert', 'Olivier Jean-Marie', 'Don Michael Paul, Tony Sampson', null, 'Ever since the world was born, two forces have been locked in perpetual battle. Their struggle is so Manichean, so ferocious, so Herculean that it makes the clash between good and evil look like a game of checkers! This ancestral duel is so ancient and so merciless that it can only be, Oggy against the Cockroaches!', 'Ever since the world was born, two forces have been locked in perpetual battle. Their struggle is so Manichean, so ferocious, so Herculean that it makes the clash between good and evil look like a game of checkers! This ancestral duel is so ancient and so merciless that it can only be, Oggy against the Cockroaches!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKUMAflFNp7sWGPjOSqw16J0X72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205048'),
  ('555871258023130279', 'Ogni maledetto Natale', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Arianna Dell''Arti, Chiara della Longa, Giovanni Galassi', 'Giacomo Ciarrapico, Mattia Torre, Luca Vendruscolo', 'Alessandro Cattelan, Marco Giallini, Corrado Guzzanti, Valerio Mastandrea, Alessandra Mastronardi, Laura Morante, Francesco Pannofino, Caterina Guzzanti', null, 'Massimo Marinelli Lops and Giulia Colardo meet by chance in Rome and fall in love. Giulia asks Massimo to spend Christmas Eve with her family.', 'Massimo Marinelli Lops and Giulia Colardo meet by chance in Rome and fall in love. Giulia asks Massimo to spend Christmas Eve with her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfPHGoD5LawbLgDYrJD7GqguExb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306523'),
  ('889895494799498518', 'Ogre', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, Thomas M. Harting, Arlene L. Arnold', 'Chuck Reeves', 'John Schneider, Ryan Kennedy, Katharine Isabelle, Brendan Fletcher, Chelan Simmons, Andrew Wheeler, Kyle Labine, Kimberley Warnat', 'R', 'A vicious Ogre rules over a town that has been stuck in time since the 1800''s.', 'A vicious Ogre rules over a town that has been stuck in time since the 1800''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJsxsaFnvt964EB4y4Uf7J79npV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18044'),
  ('1117134168131969302', 'Ogre', 2022, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Arnaud Malherbe', null, 'Ana Girardot, Samuel Jouy, Giovanni Pucci, Fabien Houssaye, Albertine Rivière, Félix Malherbe, Emile Thenard, Roman Malherbe', null, 'Six-year-old Jules and his mother Chloé land in deserted French countryside. To start a new life, far from a painful past, she has accepted to take over the village school. But the apparently quiet community is consumed by the unexplained disappearance of a little boy months ago. Mathieu, the town doctor, is not insensible to the newcomer’s charm. As he becomes closer to Chloé, her son Jules grows increasingly anxious. He knows it, he can feel it: Mathieu is the beast, that now wants to devour him and take his mother away.', 'Six-year-old Jules and his mother Chloé land in deserted French countryside. To start a new life, far from a painful past, she has accepted to take over the village school. But the apparently quiet community is consumed by the unexplained disappearance of a little boy months ago. Mathieu, the town doctor, is not insensible to the newcomer’s charm. As he becomes closer to Chloé, her son Jules grows increasingly anxious. He knows it, he can feel it: Mathieu is the beast, that now wants to devour him and take his mother away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QxtIzY8vRI4FV2hHUNrN9JifYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746339'),
  ('893656159645530984', 'Ogres', 2016, 'Drama', 'Hadrien Bichet, Léa Fehner', 'Léa Fehner, Brigitte Sy, Catherine Paillé', 'Adèle Haenel, Marc Barbé, François Fehner, Marion Bouvarel, Inès Fehner, Lola Dueñas, Philippe Cataix', null, 'There''s drama aplenty for the travelling theatre company Chekhov Cabaret. The actors share the good times and the bad as a nomadic tribe where work and private life always mingle. They don’t mince words, these obstreperous actors with a sardonic sense of humour. Theatre always comes first.', 'There''s drama aplenty for the travelling theatre company Chekhov Cabaret. The actors share the good times and the bad as a nomadic tribe where work and private life always mingle. They don’t mince words, these obstreperous actors with a sardonic sense of humour. Theatre always comes first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6bnTcg2wHAkqmVB5TZIBdsX3jG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378446'),
  ('427505187295632636', 'Ogroff', 1983, 'Horror', 'Norbert Moutier', 'Norbert Moutier', 'Norbert Moutier, Robert Alaux, Françoise Deniel, Pierre Pattin, Alain Petit, Jean-Pierre Putters, Christophe Lemaire, Michel Pratt', null, 'Ogroff, an AWOL-solider-turned-hermit, lives in the French backwoods, and, still believing war to be raging, slaughters anyone who enters them. One day, a family''s car breaks down in Ogroff''s domain and a fight for their lives begins.', 'Ogroff, an AWOL-solider-turned-hermit, lives in the French backwoods, and, still believing war to be raging, slaughters anyone who enters them. One day, a family''s car breaks down in Ogroff''s domain and a fight for their lives begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFc5G5yNKj7DO8ZkzDPrYpp30GF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105907'),
  ('1151052700366982228', 'Oh Belinda', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Deniz Yorulmazer', 'Hakan Bonomo', 'Neslihan Atagül, Necip Memili, Serkan Çayoğlu, Meral Çetinkaya, Beril Pozam, Efe Tunçer, Gamze Karaduman, Sacide Taşaner', 'R', 'A young actor''s perfect life takes a madcap turn when she agrees to star in a commercial — and suddenly gets transported to her character''s world.', 'A young actor''s perfect life takes a madcap turn when she agrees to star in a commercial — and suddenly gets transported to her character''s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MI2WO2ThKMz8LSdpxBvaIAt8FE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994751'),
  ('37400700891571427', 'Oh Darling! Yeh Hai India!', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Ketan Mehta, Prashant Narayanan, W. B. Rao', 'Parvati Balagopalan, Deepa Sahi', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Deepa Sahi, Javed Jaffrey, Anupam Kher, Amrish Puri, Prashant Narayanan, Kader Khan, Paresh Rawal', null, 'Miss India and an aspiring actor spend a night together roaming the streets of Mumbai and unwittingly clash paths with a megalomaniacal gangster planning to take over India.', 'Miss India and an aspiring actor spend a night together roaming the streets of Mumbai and unwittingly clash paths with a megalomaniacal gangster planning to take over India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucnBBenE8HzcqbEz21Hu097BRel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160243'),
  ('783890893149453788', 'Oh Dear Harry!', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Jean Girault', null, 'Dieter Hallervorden, Iris Berben, Jacques Marin, Manfred Lehmann, Lisa Helwig, Nino Korda, Volker Prechtel, Fritz Pauli', null, 'Down-on-his-luck private detective Harry Werner just wants a quiet life, but trouble always finds him. When he stumbles into a case involving a missing woman, shady criminals, and a suitcase full of secrets, Harry realises he''s in way over his head. A mix of comedy, noir, and chaos, this quirky caper proves that bad luck is Harry’s only constant companion.', 'Down-on-his-luck private detective Harry Werner just wants a quiet life, but trouble always finds him. When he stumbles into a case involving a missing woman, shady criminals, and a suitcase full of secrets, Harry realises he''s in way over his head. A mix of comedy, noir, and chaos, this quirky caper proves that bad luck is Harry’s only constant companion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbyrAIh0uMbi2XU5dexntkbQDIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46454'),
  ('326277672665065467', 'Oh Dem Watermelons', 1965, 'Music', 'Robert Nelson', 'Robert Nelson', 'R.G. Davis, Saul Landau', null, 'Commissioned by the San Francisco Mime Troupe as a short to be screened during intermission for its rather infamous 1965 Minstrel Show (Civil Rights from the Cracker Barrel), which assaulted racial stereotypes by wildly exaggerating them. Scored by Steve Reich. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'Commissioned by the San Francisco Mime Troupe as a short to be screened during intermission for its rather infamous 1965 Minstrel Show (Civil Rights from the Cracker Barrel), which assaulted racial stereotypes by wildly exaggerating them. Scored by Steve Reich. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buOWeBFd4wfKPqlmbR7FbprFnqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104863'),
  ('742290615159083250', 'Oh Islam', 1961, 'War, Drama, History', 'Ali Ismail, Andrew Marton, Saleh Fawzy', 'Robert Andrews', 'Lobna Abdel Aziz, Ahmed Mazhar, Farid Shawqy, Rushdy Abaza, Emad Hamdy, Mahmoud El Meligy, Tahiya Cariocca, Hussein Reyaad', null, 'Set in the 14th century. Under their leader Timur, the Tartar hordes invade the Middle East and take over areas as widespread as Persia, Azerbaijan, Egypt, and Syria. A lowly woman from a harem (Lubna Aziz) rises to lead the Egyptians against the invaders.', 'Set in the 14th century. Under their leader Timur, the Tartar hordes invade the Middle East and take over areas as widespread as Persia, Azerbaijan, Egypt, and Syria. A lowly woman from a harem (Lubna Aziz) rises to lead the Egyptians against the invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7x73jxhpIVn8lQ7Yt4hayWPQgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334231'),
  ('824562044633094179', 'Oh Les Filles!', 2019, 'Documentary', 'François Armanet, Guillaume Schiffman, Romain Carcanade', 'François Armanet, Bayon', 'Jehnny Beth, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Françoise Hardy, Camélia Jordana, Vanessa Paradis, Catherine Ringer, Rahim C Redcar, Elli Medeiros', null, 'What if French Rock were born with Edith Piaf? From sweet sixties pop to today''s gender-indifferent anthems, from feminist rebels of the seventies to fashion icons of the social media age, from Françoise Hardy to Christine & The Queens, via Vanessa Paradis, Catherine Ringer, Charlotte Gainsbourg and many more, Oh Les Filles! tells the untold story of French female rock stars. Narrated by Clémence Poésy, this groundbreaking documentary combines interviews and iconic footage to radically reverse perspectives and give the patriarchy a kick!', 'What if French Rock were born with Edith Piaf? From sweet sixties pop to today''s gender-indifferent anthems, from feminist rebels of the seventies to fashion icons of the social media age, from Françoise Hardy to Christine & The Queens, via Vanessa Paradis, Catherine Ringer, Charlotte Gainsbourg and many more, Oh Les Filles! tells the untold story of French female rock stars. Narrated by Clémence Poésy, this groundbreaking documentary combines interviews and iconic footage to radically reverse perspectives and give the patriarchy a kick!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpnavt6pRk6ZqZr6Q1TALwoZoHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602163'),
  ('10109757411841101', 'Oh Lucy!', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Atsuko Hirayanagi, Paula Huidobro, Blake Brewer', 'Atsuko Hirayanagi', 'Shinobu Terajima, Soseki Yamatoya, Miyu Yagyu, Kayano Masuyama, Miyoko Yamaguchi, Hajime Inoue, Suzuka Ohgo, Shioli Kutsuna', 'NR', 'A lonely, chain-smoking office lady in Tokyo falls for her teacher when she decides to take English lessons. When her teacher disappears, she sets out on a journey to find him.', 'A lonely, chain-smoking office lady in Tokyo falls for her teacher when she decides to take English lessons. When her teacher disappears, she sets out on a journey to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZ9zniDlKpgKRMtMqs1RS5DJhmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430644'),
  ('208880103701905999', 'Oh Mercy', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Irina Lubtchansky, Marion Dehaene', 'Léa Mysius, Arnaud Desplechin', 'Léa Seydoux, Sara Forestier, Roschdy Zem, Antoine Reinartz, Sébastien Delbaere, Elléonore Lemattre, Roxane Dubart, Antoni Mignon', null, 'A police chief in northern France tries to solve a case where an old woman was brutally murdered on Christmas Eve. However, in a neighborhood rife with crime, everyone seems to be a suspect.', 'A police chief in northern France tries to solve a case where an old woman was brutally murdered on Christmas Eve. However, in a neighborhood rife with crime, everyone seems to be a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAto9h3A42MuB1uaMtClI8E2yVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574097'),
  ('694921375745676147', 'Oh Mom!', 2026, 'Comedy, Family', 'Oleh Borshchevskyi', 'Oleksandr Brahin, Yevhen Taller', 'Olena Kravets, Ada Rohovtseva, Kateryna Kuznetsova', null, 'How much is contained in these two words-irritation, tenderness, laughter, love. And a little shame, when she knows everything about you. Even what you yourself have forgotten. This film is about all mothers and for all of us.', 'How much is contained in these two words-irritation, tenderness, laughter, love. And a little shame, when she knows everything about you. Even what you yourself have forgotten. This film is about all mothers and for all of us.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiHnnVivV1387DVPvj3iBHwNB0kS.jpg', 'plex:movie:nu-mam-2026'),
  ('589927474891055266', 'Oh My Ghost', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Poj Arnon, Panya Nimchareonpong, Siam Thongbaiyai', null, 'Jaturong Mokjok, Ekkachai Srivichai, Channarong Khuntee-tao, Yingsak Jonglertjesdawong, Jaroenporn Onlamai, Sudarat Butrprom, Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Wiradit Srimalai', null, 'A group of friends encounters a folk spirit in their apartment, and their harebrained attempts to banish the ghost soon backfire.', 'A group of friends encounters a folk spirit in their apartment, and their harebrained attempts to banish the ghost soon backfire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGs7D42mttDX7zLcbxlkjrbQ9fo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249222'),
  ('1036608498406440857', 'Oh My Ghost : The Finale', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Poj Arnon, Worapat Chittkhaew, Tananat Sukjarearn', 'Poj Arnon', 'Jaturong Mokjok, Jaroenporn Onlamai, Wiradit Srimalai, Pantipha Arunwattanachai, Kanticha Chumma, Archariya Sritha, Jampar Saenprom, Ronnakorn Songsaeng', null, 'Strange things begin happening to Kouy, the beloved son of Taew, prompting her to seek help from Panda, the calm twin of the mischievous ghost Pancake.', 'Strange things begin happening to Kouy, the beloved son of Taew, prompting her to seek help from Panda, the calm twin of the mischievous ghost Pancake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h59dS8S28ANNfWj5nuga2PveHPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216195'),
  ('1002570778994415689', 'Oh My God!', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Giorgio Amato, Bruno Cascio, Vincenzo Mauro', 'Giorgio Amato', 'Carlo Caprioli, Anna Maria De Luca, Stefano Fregni, Giulia Gualano, Alessio De Persio, Mimmo Ruggiero, Daniele Monterosi, Vanni Fois', null, 'What would happen today in a society which defines itself Catholic and Christian if Jesus really came back as announced in the Gospels? Who would take him seriously? And what difficulties would Jesus encounter today to be recognized?', 'What would happen today in a society which defines itself Catholic and Christian if Jesus really came back as announced in the Gospels? Who would take him seriously? And what difficulties would Jesus encounter today to be recognized?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfBrCrXZom9WWDoi4z2ahtATwbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514705'),
  ('704822047405846558', 'Oh My Goodness!', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Tirard, Nicolas Tonnerre, Emmanuelle Fourault', 'Laurent Tirard', 'Valérie Bonneton, Camille Chamoux, Claire Nadeau, Guilaine Londez, Louise Malek, Sidse Babett Knudsen, François Morel, Claire Duburcq', null, 'Five nuns set their sights on winning the cash prize in a major cycling race to raise money to renovate a dilapidated hospice. The only hitch is that none of them can ride a bicycle.', 'Five nuns set their sights on winning the cash prize in a major cycling race to raise money to renovate a dilapidated hospice. The only hitch is that none of them can ride a bicycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruDwzv8fiweqYVD53GfH2NVrtCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885243'),
  ('370228863186465596', 'Oh My Kadavule', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ashwath Marimuthu, Vidhu Ayanna', 'Ashwath Marimuthu', 'Ashok Selvan, Ritika Singh, Vani Bhojan, Shah Ra, M. S. Bhaskar, Gajaraj, Vijay Sethupathi, Gautham Vasudev Menon', null, 'Arjun is conveniently married to his best friend Anu and their marriage turns out to be a nightmare since he is not really in love with her. When things get tough Arjun gets a second chance in life that could change his path and perspective altogether.', 'Arjun is conveniently married to his best friend Anu and their marriage turns out to be a nightmare since he is not really in love with her. When things get tough Arjun gets a second chance in life that could change his path and perspective altogether.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuQwtFEm4DlzK3EnZ5VWefVXZvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631637'),
  ('826360638367843575', 'Oh Olsun', 1973, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Tarık Akan, Hale Soygazi, Münir Özkul, Hulusi Kentmen, Kemal Sunal, Halit Akçatepe, Adile Naşit, Mürüvvet Sim Caymaz', null, 'A tycoon tries to teach some life lessons to his three spoiled sons by making them work on the floor of his factory, where one of them falls in love.', 'A tycoon tries to teach some life lessons to his three spoiled sons by making them work on the floor of his factory, where one of them falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TgwgoxMwtSmrQwWaEJD1kG8zbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110029'),
  ('463530147467078605', 'Oh Schucks...! Here Comes UNTAG', 1990, 'Comedy', 'David Lister, James Robb, Diana Keam', 'Leon Schuster', 'Leon Schuster, Bill Flynn, Casper De Vries, Michelle Bestbier, Ron Smerczak, Thomas Mogotlane, Kurt Egelhof, Eric Nobbs', null, 'Kwagga Robertse owns a farm shop in the fictional Southern African country of Nambabwe and usually cons foreign tourists by pretending to kill a lion, thus earning him the nickname ''Urumbo'' (Lion Killer) from the country''s natives. Kwagga is upset when the UN sends a platoon of incompetent soldiers with the United Nations Transition Assistance Group (U.N.T.A.G.), to monitor the peace process, and ensure free and fair elections after the Nambabwean War for Independence. The U.N.T.A.G''s American leader, Major Bradick D. Mackay and his second-in-command, Captain Zapman are offered a diamond worth a lot of money in the U.S., and they must pay 200,000 USD to Duan Robertse, Kwagga''s competitive brother trying to buy a farm left to them by their dead father.', 'Kwagga Robertse owns a farm shop in the fictional Southern African country of Nambabwe and usually cons foreign tourists by pretending to kill a lion, thus earning him the nickname ''Urumbo'' (Lion Killer) from the country''s natives. Kwagga is upset when the UN sends a platoon of incompetent soldiers with the United Nations Transition Assistance Group (U.N.T.A.G.), to monitor the peace process, and ensure free and fair elections after the Nambabwean War for Independence. The U.N.T.A.G''s American leader, Major Bradick D. Mackay and his second-in-command, Captain Zapman are offered a diamond worth a lot of money in the U.S., and they must pay 200,000 USD to Duan Robertse, Kwagga''s competitive brother trying to buy a farm left to them by their dead father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHnqC66Zz0GVeaVBKn7kROzCZFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16419'),
  ('952881994952928446', 'Oh Sheep!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gottfried Mentor', 'Gottfried Mentor, Max Lang', 'David Steffen, Gottfried Mentor, Michael Heberlein', 'PG-13', 'Two flocks of sheep are searching for companionship. But their shepherds, being at odds with each other, do everything to keep them separated.', 'Two flocks of sheep are searching for companionship. But their shepherds, being at odds with each other, do everything to keep them separated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4C9z5cul3PavyRpCnyYbzo4u5wa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553708'),
  ('1005376306319039469', 'Oh What Beautiful Legs!', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Jaime Contreras, Agustín Martínez Solares', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Germán Valdés, Rosita Quintana, Nelly Montiel, Jorge Reyes, Nicolás Rodríguez, Ramón Valdés, Francisco Reiguera, Julián de Meriche', null, 'A man hired to impersonate a bankrupt business mogul who is currently on the run from creditors sets out organize a musical starring beauties from Brazil, Mexico, and Spain in this Spanish-language comedy starring popular funnyman Tin Tan (Germán Valdés). Now, as the hapless imposter attempts to finance a musical without any money, he also discovers just how difficult it can be to juggle three beautiful starlets who all have eyes for their presumably wealthy producer. Another common English translation of the title of this film is Tender Pumpkins or Tender Little Pumpkins (although a direct translation is Baby Zucchini).', 'A man hired to impersonate a bankrupt business mogul who is currently on the run from creditors sets out organize a musical starring beauties from Brazil, Mexico, and Spain in this Spanish-language comedy starring popular funnyman Tin Tan (Germán Valdés). Now, as the hapless imposter attempts to finance a musical without any money, he also discovers just how difficult it can be to juggle three beautiful starlets who all have eyes for their presumably wealthy producer. Another common English translation of the title of this film is Tender Pumpkins or Tender Little Pumpkins (although a direct translation is Baby Zucchini).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GLtooRW6rk15DWvSgzrwQAt3s6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120300'),
  ('900481368520098418', 'Oh Where', 1975, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Orhan Aksoy, Tolgay Ziyal, Ergun Sozen', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Tarık Akan, Gülşen Bubikoğlu, Hulusi Kentmen, Adile Naşit, Halit Akçatepe, Nilgün Atılgan, Aydan Adan, Hayati Hamzaoğlu', null, 'Three boys are having their higher education in Istanbul. In fact, they are messing around and dealing with radical politics, girls and gamble. However, the oldest discovers love, and the three realize it is time for change.', 'Three boys are having their higher education in Istanbul. In fact, they are messing around and dealing with radical politics, girls and gamble. However, the oldest discovers love, and the three realize it is time for change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yQal36JhCFTxPtJWRlh0CyhErz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157559'),
  ('388467614992670495', 'Oh Willy...', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama', 'Emma De Swaef, Marc James Roels', 'Emma De Swaef, Marc James Roels', null, null, 'Forced to return to his naturist roots, Willy bungles his way into noble savagery.', 'Forced to return to his naturist roots, Willy bungles his way into noble savagery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jz0QXTdeWzBZ2NnFSh0k3RbphM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180685'),
  ('730876065018663584', 'Oh, Beautiful Istanbul', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Gani Turanlı', 'Safa Önal, Ayşe Şasa', 'Sadri Alışık, Ayla Algan, Diclehan Baban, Feridun Çölgeçen, Danyal Topatan, İhsan Yüce, Asım Nipton, Güngör Denizaşan', null, 'The lovely Ayşe moves from her country village to Istanbul in the hope of becoming an actress. One day she meets Haşmet, a grumpy, world-weary street photographer. He takes it upon himself to cure Ayşe of what he sees as her blind optimism, but some of it begins to rub off on the old cynic.', 'The lovely Ayşe moves from her country village to Istanbul in the hope of becoming an actress. One day she meets Haşmet, a grumpy, world-weary street photographer. He takes it upon himself to cure Ayşe of what he sees as her blind optimism, but some of it begins to rub off on the old cynic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6WZvO6YLt88rgPNvxU4vTeWzmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143729'),
  ('166525658345999251', 'Oh, Canada', 2024, 'Drama', 'Andrew Wonder, Paul Schrader, Zachary Citarella', 'Paul Schrader', 'Richard Gere, Uma Thurman, Jacob Elordi, Michael Imperioli, Victoria Hill, Caroline Dhavernas, Penelope Mitchell, Kristine Froseth', 'NR', 'Famed Canadian-American leftist documentary filmmaker Leonard Fife was one of sixty thousand draft evaders and deserters who fled to Canada to avoid serving in Vietnam. Now in his late seventies, Fife is dying of cancer in Montreal and has agreed to a final interview in which he is determined to bare all his secrets at last, to demythologize his mythologized life.', 'Famed Canadian-American leftist documentary filmmaker Leonard Fife was one of sixty thousand draft evaders and deserters who fled to Canada to avoid serving in Vietnam. Now in his late seventies, Fife is dying of cancer in Montreal and has agreed to a final interview in which he is determined to bare all his secrets at last, to demythologize his mythologized life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKDR5AYXRTPb751oc7xK2Ay3PH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113583'),
  ('511888026672136876', 'Oh, Doctor!', 1917, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, George Peters', null, 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Buster Keaton, Al St. John, Alice Mann, Alice Lake', 'NR', 'Roscoe is a doctor who falls in love with a pretty woman whose boyfriend, in turn, falls in love with Roscoe''s wife''s jewelry.', 'Roscoe is a doctor who falls in love with a pretty woman whose boyfriend, in turn, falls in love with Roscoe''s wife''s jewelry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oU1zIvo9gexkprcSnHJQZHgec3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51469'),
  ('418929502018581410', 'Oh, God!', 1977, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Carl Reiner, Victor Hsu, David Nicksay', 'Larry Gelbart', 'John Denver, George Burns, Teri Garr, Donald Pleasence, Ralph Bellamy, William Daniels, Barnard Hughes, Paul Sorvino', 'PG', 'When God appears to an assistant grocery manager as a good natured old man, the Almighty selects him as his messenger for the modern world.', 'When God appears to an assistant grocery manager as a good natured old man, the Almighty selects him as his messenger for the modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QrIWpKS24thkL0g4HrRYAznFDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24032'),
  ('727746206233344866', 'Oh, God! Book II', 1980, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Gilbert Cates, Ralph Woolsey', 'Fred S. Fox, Hal Goldman, Melissa Miller', 'George Burns, Suzanne Pleshette, David Birney, Louanne, John Louie, Conrad Janis, Anthony Holland, Hugh Downs', 'PG', 'God appears before 11-year-old Tracy Richards to ask for her help to spread his word and influence over the world which she suggests the slogan ''Think God.'' Naturaly, Tracy''s divorced parents think Tracy''s crazy, and plot to halt her ''heaven-sent'' mission to spread God''s word.', 'God appears before 11-year-old Tracy Richards to ask for her help to spread his word and influence over the world which she suggests the slogan ''Think God.'' Naturaly, Tracy''s divorced parents think Tracy''s crazy, and plot to halt her ''heaven-sent'' mission to spread God''s word.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihrglsyt0fOWfqOnmHbnAZGv4RZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38147'),
  ('882574418101914121', 'Oh, God! You Devil', 1984, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Paul Bogart, King Baggot, Cynthia Webster', 'Andrew Bergman', 'George Burns, Ted Wass, Roxanne Hart, Ron Silver, James Cromwell, Eugene Roche, Janet Brandt, Robert Desiderio', 'PG', 'George Burns is back as God, but oops, here he is as Satan, too. A young rock star is ready to sell his soul to Satan, and Satan is all too happy to oblige. Oops! Seems the fellow was watched over by God as a baby, so now the almighty and his nemesis have to duke it out over the soul.', 'George Burns is back as God, but oops, here he is as Satan, too. A young rock star is ready to sell his soul to Satan, and Satan is all too happy to oblige. Oops! Seems the fellow was watched over by God as a baby, so now the almighty and his nemesis have to duke it out over the soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5h3BXUQfOPPaKMaq3nsOi5H1Bl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38148'),
  ('388289551765912639', 'Oh, Hello on Broadway', 2017, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Robin Mishkin Abrams, Alex Timbers, Luke McCoubrey', 'John Mulaney, Nick Kroll', 'Nick Kroll, John Mulaney, Steve Martin, Matthew Broderick', null, 'Two delusional geriatrics reveal curious pasts, share a love of tuna and welcome a surprise guest in this filming of the popular Broadway comedy show.', 'Two delusional geriatrics reveal curious pasts, share a love of tuna and welcome a surprise guest in this filming of the popular Broadway comedy show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sgAcBkhKoazB4xFwiYfWIdLMNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460822'),
  ('281953779510179592', 'Oh, Hi!', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Thriller', 'Sophie Brooks, Conor Murphy, Nicholas R. Bell', 'Sophie Brooks', 'Molly Gordon, Logan Lerman, Geraldine Viswanathan, John Reynolds, David Cross, Polly Draper, Desmin Borges, Diana Irvine', 'R', 'Iris and Isaac''s first weekend away as a couple is going so well — until Isaac mentions he didn’t know they were a couple. Convinced she''s met her perfect guy and that he''s just confused, Iris goes to increasingly ridiculous and irrational lengths to prove to Isaac that they are meant to be together.', 'Iris and Isaac''s first weekend away as a couple is going so well — until Isaac mentions he didn’t know they were a couple. Convinced she''s met her perfect guy and that he''s just confused, Iris goes to increasingly ridiculous and irrational lengths to prove to Isaac that they are meant to be together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nBOFo78pKgzLipgGZhC8VA33wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339658'),
  ('996625675516573680', 'Oh, If I Only Were a Man', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Stefanos Fotiadis, Nikos Varveris', 'Stefanos Fotiadis', 'Maro Kodou, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Giannis Michalopoulos, Yorgos Moutsios, Nana Skiada, Nikos Rizos, Katerina Yioulaki, Takis Hristoforidis', null, 'Frustrated and unemployed after being sexually harassed repeatedly, Stella decides to play the role of a guy, using the identity of her twin brother (who is living in Australia) hoping to get a job. She immediately wins the trust of her new employers and soon gets promoted to manager. The troubles begin when she falls in love with her boss'' son.', 'Frustrated and unemployed after being sexually harassed repeatedly, Stella decides to play the role of a guy, using the identity of her twin brother (who is living in Australia) hoping to get a job. She immediately wins the trust of her new employers and soon gets promoted to manager. The troubles begin when she falls in love with her boss'' son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6G5WpozQuPTZ8cRYjBS7gI8oxhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453095'),
  ('2774982580159843', 'Oh, Karol!', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Roman Załuski, Stanisław Moszuk', 'Ilona Łepkowska', 'Jan Piechociński, Marta Klubowicz, Dorota Kamińska, Danuta Kowalska, Jolanta Nowak, Ewa Sałacka, Urszula Beata Kasprzak, Zofia Czerwińska', null, 'Karol has everything. He has three mistresses in addition to the bride. He is charming, loves sex and enslaves women in the blink of an eye. He''s also well aware of that women like and uses it for his benefits.', 'Karol has everything. He has three mistresses in addition to the bride. He is charming, loves sex and enslaves women in the blink of an eye. He''s also well aware of that women like and uses it for his benefits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ArBQ5cJzgUU2hVECIZyyIHotHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81297'),
  ('353260723090066391', 'Oh, Love… How Have You Put Me!', 1951, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Ezequiel Carrasco, Julio Cahero', null, 'Germán Valdés, Rebeca Iturbide, Marcelo Chávez, Jorge Reyes, Mimí Derba, Arturo Soto Rangel, Pascual García Peña, Manuel Valdés', null, 'A low-class baker accidentally gets to know an attractive but bitter fiancée. By getting her snobby, dead-pan family to spend some time with his scumbag friends, he changes their lives, while at the time stealing the girl''s heart.', 'A low-class baker accidentally gets to know an attractive but bitter fiancée. By getting her snobby, dead-pan family to spend some time with his scumbag friends, he changes their lives, while at the time stealing the girl''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbdYlO5zLiLH1Mt4KLLlgArgKeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338365'),
  ('1114244475855571877', 'Oh, mia bella matrigna', 1976, null, 'Guido Leoni', 'Guido Leoni, Luigi Angelo, Sandro Leoni', 'Sabina Ciuffini, Gianfranco De Angelis, Crippy Yocard, Gloria Piedimonte, Maurice Ronet', null, 'Dad’s new wife, Lalla, is young, very young. Maybe too young. His son Claudio falls in love with her, but there’s something wrong with him. He has a complicated relationship with the memory of his mother, who died in a car accident years ago. The two lovers plan a murder, but not of the same person…', 'Dad’s new wife, Lalla, is young, very young. Maybe too young. His son Claudio falls in love with her, but there’s something wrong with him. He has a complicated relationship with the memory of his mother, who died in a car accident years ago. The two lovers plan a murder, but not of the same person…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Jq0LZwUuZfJpNIWb1vsFVsxdDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220010'),
  ('1129266716906950661', 'Oh, Moon!', 1988, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Reha Erdem', 'Reha Erdem', 'Yeşim Tozan, Gülsen Tuncer, Nurinisa Yıldırım, Münir Özkul, Arif Pişkin, Özcan Özgür, Bijen Yüceer, Ertuğrul İlgin', null, 'Eleven-year-old Yekta lives in a crumbling island mansion with her strict aunts and ailing grandfather, yearning for her absent mother. As dreams and surreal visions shape her solitude, she sets out in search of a mythical seagull with a child’s head.', 'Eleven-year-old Yekta lives in a crumbling island mansion with her strict aunts and ailing grandfather, yearning for her absent mother. As dreams and surreal visions shape her solitude, she sets out in search of a mythical seagull with a child’s head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rqjglWPOIYGlz6DKQEYk4KhO9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61387'),
  ('325245944925701505', 'Oh, Mr. Porter!', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Varnel', 'J.O.C. Orton, Val Guest, Marriott Edgar', 'Will Hay, Moore Marriott, Graham Moffatt, Percy Walsh, Dave O''Toole, Sebastian Smith, Agnes Lauchlan, Dennis Wyndham', null, 'Comedy in which a bungling railway worker is given the job of stationmaster at a rundown station in rural Ireland, where his sidekicks are a toothless old gaffer and a portly young loudmouth. Hilarious adventures ensue, including a locomotive chase after gunrunners make off with a train.', 'Comedy in which a bungling railway worker is given the job of stationmaster at a rundown station in rural Ireland, where his sidekicks are a toothless old gaffer and a portly young loudmouth. Hilarious adventures ensue, including a locomotive chase after gunrunners make off with a train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1g55vwgSnq8WjB47bGFdGhrjoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61483'),
  ('504181410702441421', 'Oh, Ramona!', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cristina Jacob', 'Cristina Jacob, Alex Coteț, Andrei Ciobanu', 'Bogdan Iancu, Aggy K. Adams, Basil Eidenbenz, Holly Horne, Adina Ștețcu, Mihaela Mihut, Ioachim Ciobanu, Smiley', 'R', 'Oh, Ramona! seeks the transformation of Andrew from a teenager into an adult who lives candidly and selflessly his first love story, innocent and uninvolved, alternating with the second, intense and insane story, incapable of making a choice.', 'Oh, Ramona! seeks the transformation of Andrew from a teenager into an adult who lives candidly and selflessly his first love story, innocent and uninvolved, alternating with the second, intense and insane story, incapable of making a choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mscdZrk8k6VTVOgbVF5IpsaA8sK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582186'),
  ('99118320091990260', 'Oh, Serafina!', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alberto Lattuada', null, 'Renato Pozzetto, Dalila Di Lazzaro, Angelica Ippolito, Marisa Merlini, Gino Bramieri, Aldo Giuffrè, Fausto Tozzi, Enrico Beruschi', null, 'Augusto Valle is a successful young industrialist who weds Palmira, the girl working in his factory, and the two have a child despite the infant''s uncertain legitimacy. Scheming to control her husband''s fortune, Palmira has affairs with both the mayor and the judge to have Augusto committed to a mental institution. While there, he falls in love with Serafina Vitali, a young woman who was also put away.', 'Augusto Valle is a successful young industrialist who weds Palmira, the girl working in his factory, and the two have a child despite the infant''s uncertain legitimacy. Scheming to control her husband''s fortune, Palmira has affairs with both the mayor and the judge to have Augusto committed to a mental institution. While there, he falls in love with Serafina Vitali, a young woman who was also put away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqbf8868nG668wliFFWKSgDRxN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82066'),
  ('463134256990493541', 'Oh, Teacher!', 1927, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Oswald''s sweetheart is stolen by a schoolyard bully, so he has to fight him during recess to win her back.', 'Oswald''s sweetheart is stolen by a schoolyard bully, so he has to fight him during recess to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnmibGAJD6BQWj1rnHlzyIPAqRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33711'),
  ('1048520087180561504', 'Oh, What a Knight', 1928, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Oswald is riding along on his horse having a merry old time when the two of them fall down a hill, right up to a castle. Oswald whistles for the princess, who blows him a kiss as she appears on a balcony. He reaches her by lassoing the balcony and tying the other end of the rope to his horse''s tail, using it as a tightrope. A rival knight suddenly appears and Oswald falls off the balcony, startled. He manages to climb back up and the two fight for the princess.', 'Oswald is riding along on his horse having a merry old time when the two of them fall down a hill, right up to a castle. Oswald whistles for the princess, who blows him a kiss as she appears on a balcony. He reaches her by lassoing the balcony and tying the other end of the rope to his horse''s tail, using it as a tightrope. A rival knight suddenly appears and Oswald falls off the balcony, startled. He manages to climb back up and the two fight for the princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vu3iAFqyQYBYdwQYqPzj8ADlBj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39820'),
  ('301331875888040765', 'Oh, What a Night', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Eric Till, Brian R.R. Hebb', 'Richard Nielsen', 'Corey Haim, Barbara Williams, Keir Dullea, Geneviève Bujold, Andrew Miller, Kirsten Kieferle, Joseph Ziegler, Robbie Coltrane', 'PG-13', 'During the summer of 1955, seventeen-year-old Eric Hansen embarks on a journey in his new town, a journey which will change his life forever.', 'During the summer of 1955, seventeen-year-old Eric Hansen embarks on a journey in his new town, a journey which will change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHawV1vEKJYNPWswlIX0FxqjFCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4205'),
  ('56711761457666625', 'Oh, Woe Is Me', 1993, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Caroline Champetier, Natalie Engelstein', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Gérard Depardieu, Laurence Masliah, Bernard Verley, Aude Amiot, Roland Blanche, Marc Betton, François Germond, Jean-Louis Loca', null, 'This complex allegorical tale tells the story of man’s quest for spiritual meaning. When God enters the body of 1980s filmmaker Simon Donnadieu, his wife Rachel realizes that something has gone awry, but chooses to remain faithful to her erratically-behaving husband.', 'This complex allegorical tale tells the story of man’s quest for spiritual meaning. When God enters the body of 1980s filmmaker Simon Donnadieu, his wife Rachel realizes that something has gone awry, but chooses to remain faithful to her erratically-behaving husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3u5DZuVEKLHFmTmVoZc78V5JCzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52713'),
  ('202547657707085213', 'Oh! Heavenly Dog', 1980, 'Comedy, Crime, Fantasy', 'Joe Camp, Don Reddy', 'Rod Browning, Joe Camp, Lou Breslow', 'Benjean, Chevy Chase, Jane Seymour, Omar Sharif, Robert Morley, Lorenzo Music, Stuart Germain, Alan Sues', 'PG', 'Browning is a PI with a bad cold, who''s sent to investigate a case by a mysterious client. He stumbles across the body of a young woman and is stabbed to death, and when he wakes up in heaven, they tell him he''s "marginal material," and they can only decide on his final destination through one last assignment: to go back and solve his own murder. As a dog. A cute fluffy little dog (Benji). Undaunted, Browning begins to investigate the case as best he can around his canine disabilities (dialing the phone presents a special challenge) to solve the murders, save the girl, and see justice done.', 'Browning is a PI with a bad cold, who''s sent to investigate a case by a mysterious client. He stumbles across the body of a young woman and is stabbed to death, and when he wakes up in heaven, they tell him he''s "marginal material," and they can only decide on his final destination through one last assignment: to go back and solve his own murder. As a dog. A cute fluffy little dog (Benji). Undaunted, Browning begins to investigate the case as best he can around his canine disabilities (dialing the phone presents a special challenge) to solve the murders, save the girl, and see justice done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snlRys3j7LI5i4u3uw3mvFWBqXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26179'),
