  ('788106477524830780', 'Oh! My God Returns', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Song Chang-yong', 'Song Chang-yong', 'Choi Sung-kook, Kim Sung-kyung, Lee Jun-hyeok, Song Sam-dong, Bae Jin-woong, Im So-mi, Kim Chae-yeon', null, 'During the 1997 IMF when collecting gold was part of a movement, Sang-hoon who wanted to be something cooler, was the owner of a boarding house which wasn''t doing very well. His wife Ji-won failed to get overdue bills and the two are about to go bankrupt. To make things worse, a loan shark starts bullying Sang-hoon for money and in the end, Sang-hoon decides to do something about it.', 'During the 1997 IMF when collecting gold was part of a movement, Sang-hoon who wanted to be something cooler, was the owner of a boarding house which wasn''t doing very well. His wife Ji-won failed to get overdue bills and the two are about to go bankrupt. To make things worse, a loan shark starts bullying Sang-hoon for money and in the end, Sang-hoon decides to do something about it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VDNEnJGdiZu4sS8skeiplE2JDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456476'),
  ('343432363151133573', 'Oh! My Gran', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Je-woo, Park Si-hwan, Jung Se-kyo', 'Kim Soo-jin', 'Na Moon-hee, Lee Hee-jun, Choi Won-young, Park Ji-young, Jeon Bae-soo, Kim Yae-eun, Kim Sun-kyung, Kim Jung-young', null, 'A man''s daughter is the victim of a brutal hit-and-run car accident. The only witness is the man''s dementia-ridden old mother who barely remember any details. The two must work together to find the culprit.', 'A man''s daughter is the victim of a brutal hit-and-run car accident. The only witness is the man''s dementia-ridden old mother who barely remember any details. The two must work together to find the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSeqDPusxGZv1lq7lgKeGldZdMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602623'),
  ('425051955126043948', 'Oh! Sabella', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Franco Montemurro, Vito Minore', 'Remigio Del Grosso, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Dino Risi', 'Peppino De Filippo, Tina Pica, Renato Salvatori, Sylva Koscina, Paolo Stoppa, Rossella Como, Mara Maryl, Dolores Palumbo', null, 'Raffaele, a Neapolitan student, get the news that his beloved grandmother Sabella is dying. He immediately goes to Pollena to be beside her.', 'Raffaele, a Neapolitan student, get the news that his beloved grandmother Sabella is dying. He immediately goes to Pollena to be beside her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34Y2TteaIIUOufv2ZuCJPixqkxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62457'),
