  ('157946297658339246', 'Oh! What a Lovely War', 1969, 'Comedy, Music, War', 'Richard Attenborough, Gerry Turpin', 'Joan Littlewood', 'Laurence Olivier, Vanessa Redgrave, Maggie Smith, John Mills, Corin Redgrave, Maurice Roëves, Ian Holm, Juliet Mills', 'G', 'The working-class Smiths change their initially sunny views on World War I after the five boys of the family witness the harsh reality of trench warfare.', 'The working-class Smiths change their initially sunny views on World War I after the five boys of the family witness the harsh reality of trench warfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLAYzMNOos506tcKYXxIDvupY5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21335'),
  ('339988711574794595', 'Oh. What. Fun.', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Michael Showalter, Jim Frohna, John Tagamolila', 'Michael Showalter, Chandler Baker', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Denis Leary, Felicity Jones, Chloë Grace Moretz, Dominic Sessa, Jason Schwartzman, Rafaella Karnaby, Drake Shehan', 'PG-13', 'Claire Clauster is the glue that holds her chaotic, lovable family together at the holidays. But this year, after planning a special outing for them, they make a crucial mistake and leave her home alone. Fed up and feeling under appreciated, she sets off on an impromptu adventure of her own. As her family scrambles to find her, Claire discovers the unexpected magic of a Christmas gone off-script.', 'Claire Clauster is the glue that holds her chaotic, lovable family together at the holidays. But this year, after planning a special outing for them, they make a crucial mistake and leave her home alone. Fed up and feeling under appreciated, she sets off on an impromptu adventure of her own. As her family scrambles to find her, Claire discovers the unexpected magic of a Christmas gone off-script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qynCyBKCJUUcj4wo4PE2aQVvote.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261825'),
