  ('653016402700171179', 'Oil Gobblers', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Jan Svěrák, Ladislav Štěpán', 'Jan Svěrák', 'Lubomír Beneš, Jiří Němec, Ivo Kašpar, Jan Rokyta, Emil Nedbal, Čestmír Řanda', null, 'A zoologist and a biochemist go out into an oilfield with a cameraman and filmmaker to observe and study the elusive oil gobblers.', 'A zoologist and a biochemist go out into an oilfield with a cameraman and filmmaker to observe and study the elusive oil gobblers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN3JNjMg5rJNT8k5JuPjru2doD2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162771'),
  ('852938145200256936', 'Oil Lamps', 1971, 'Drama', 'Josef Ryzec, Miloš Kohout, Juraj Herz', 'Juraj Herz, Václav Šašek, Lubor Dohnal', 'Iva Janžurová, Petr Čepek, Marie Rosůlková, Ota Sklenčka, Vladimír Jedenáctík, Karel Chromík, Jana Plichtová, Karel Černoch', 'PG', 'In 1900, Stepha, the vivacious 30 year old daughter of a wealthy couple, agrees to marry her cousin Paul, who has accumulated large debts as an Austrian army officer. Paul refuses to work or to consummate the marriage, and then his health steadily declines.', 'In 1900, Stepha, the vivacious 30 year old daughter of a wealthy couple, agrees to marry her cousin Paul, who has accumulated large debts as an Austrian army officer. Paul refuses to work or to consummate the marriage, and then his health steadily declines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zkyhnTl28rif6zEKrOrD044d30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148758'),
  ('834864088016004339', 'Oil On Canvas', 2019, 'Drama', 'Pablo Lavado, Mireya Muñoz Guerrero', 'Pablo Lavado, Any Anderson', 'José Pastor, Chico García, Ceci Urbano, Jesús Moya, Sarah Benavente, Juan Antonio Hidalgo, Pilar Jiménez, Marta Velázquez', null, 'María, a young student of Fine Arts, decides to spend a weekend with Julio, her partner, in the house of her parents'' town. Once there, the young woman will have to face a reality already forgotten. The solid mentality of her family means that practically nothing has changed in the life of his brother Hugo and his father, Arturo', 'María, a young student of Fine Arts, decides to spend a weekend with Julio, her partner, in the house of her parents'' town. Once there, the young woman will have to face a reality already forgotten. The solid mentality of her family means that practically nothing has changed in the life of his brother Hugo and his father, Arturo', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLNfKYBbxWmJe7ZXULRyf1F2O4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586597'),
