  ('1021205554106491914', 'Oily to Bed, Oily to Rise', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Andrew Bennison, Mauri Grashin', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Dick Curtis, Eddie Laughton, James Craig, Dorothy Comingore, Eva McKenzie', 'NR', 'Once again, the Stooges are three hapless tramps. After nearly destroying a farmer''s (Richard Fiske) pile of firewood, the boys come to the assistance of the Widow Jenkins (Eva McKenzie), who has just been cheated out of her land by a trio of swindlers (Dick Curtis, Eddie Laughton, James Craig). Attempting to fix the woman''s well, the Stooges instead unleash an oil geyser. They manage to retrieve the deed to the land and are allowed to marry the now wealthy Widow Jenkins'' daughters. Moe tells Curly to wish for quintuplets, and Curly replies, "We''ll honeymoon in Canada!" (a reference to the Dionne quintuplets).', 'Once again, the Stooges are three hapless tramps. After nearly destroying a farmer''s (Richard Fiske) pile of firewood, the boys come to the assistance of the Widow Jenkins (Eva McKenzie), who has just been cheated out of her land by a trio of swindlers (Dick Curtis, Eddie Laughton, James Craig). Attempting to fix the woman''s well, the Stooges instead unleash an oil geyser. They manage to retrieve the deed to the land and are allowed to marry the now wealthy Widow Jenkins'' daughters. Moe tells Curly to wish for quintuplets, and Curly replies, "We''ll honeymoon in Canada!" (a reference to the Dionne quintuplets).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avZBQEDqehnas8C6kUl7RzEgyzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115930'),
  ('183349121925087512', 'Oink', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Peter Mansfelt, Mascha Halberstad', 'Fiona van Heemstra', 'Hiba Ghafry, Kees Prins, Jelka van Houten, Henry van Loon, Matsen Montsma, Loes Luca, Johnny Kraaijkamp Jr., Alex Klaasen', null, 'A young girl sets out to prove to her disapproving mother she can house-train the endearing but unruly little piglet she gets as a birthday gift from her estranged oddball grandfather.', 'A young girl sets out to prove to her disapproving mother she can house-train the endearing but unruly little piglet she gets as a birthday gift from her estranged oddball grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1LxkaSS6FqWDwbNOnxAeb5mXrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916423'),
