  ('458544073252018096', 'Oklahoma!', 1999, 'Romance, Music, Western', 'John Owen Edwards, Chris Hunt, Trevor Nunn', null, 'Hugh Jackman, Josefina Gabrielle, Shuler Hensley, Peter Polycarpou, Maureen Lipman, Jimmy Johnston, Vicki Simon, David Shelmerdine', 'NR', 'A dark-themed and redesigned West End production of Rodgers & Hammerstein''s seminal Broadway musical tells the story of farm girl Laurey and her courtship by two rival suitors, cowboy Curly and the sinister and frightening farmhand Jud.', 'A dark-themed and redesigned West End production of Rodgers & Hammerstein''s seminal Broadway musical tells the story of farm girl Laurey and her courtship by two rival suitors, cowboy Curly and the sinister and frightening farmhand Jud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHRP7Z3g16HV8LKL1zpqQ1Yjb8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27074'),
  ('110093307470136228', 'Ökozid', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Andres Veiel', 'Andres Veiel, Jutta Doberstein', 'Edgar Selge, Ulrich Tukur, Nina Kunzendorf, Friederike Becht, Sven Schelker, Martina Eitner-Acheampong, Frank Röth, Hans-Jochen Wagner', null, 'The consequences of the climate catastrophe are dramatic in 2034. Drought and floods destroy the livelihoods of millions of people. After the third storm tide in a row, the headquarters of the International Court of Justice in The Hague was evacuated. In a provisional interim building in Berlin, the climate catastrophe becomes the subject of legal proceedings. Two lawyers represent 31 countries of the global South, which are doomed to destruction without the support of the international community.', 'The consequences of the climate catastrophe are dramatic in 2034. Drought and floods destroy the livelihoods of millions of people. After the third storm tide in a row, the headquarters of the International Court of Justice in The Hague was evacuated. In a provisional interim building in Berlin, the climate catastrophe becomes the subject of legal proceedings. Two lawyers represent 31 countries of the global South, which are doomed to destruction without the support of the international community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mT5t3gmtrWXhsYvRSrBGK0hkOyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765079'),
  ('238990754090258263', 'Oktapodi', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Action', 'Thierry Marchand, Julien Bocabeille, Olivier Delabarre', null, null, null, 'Two Octopi fight for their lives with a stubborn restaurant cook in a comical escape through the streets of a small Greek village.', 'Two Octopi fight for their lives with a stubborn restaurant cook in a comical escape through the streets of a small Greek village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DFjdPQuv9Ryo1psjj02FgixG6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46343'),
  ('505744796573621108', 'Okul', 2004, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yağmur Taylan, Durul Taylan', 'Doğu Yücel', 'Burak Altay, Nehir Erdoğan, Berk Hakman, Cem Kılıç, Sinem Kobal, Melisa Sözen, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Ali Sunal', null, 'The film revolves around a young group of spoiled teenagers and their struggle to prepare for the standardized test required to get into university. All of a sudden a ghost enters their lives, scares and incites them to misbehave.', 'The film revolves around a young group of spoiled teenagers and their struggle to prepare for the standardized test required to get into university. All of a sudden a ghost enters their lives, scares and incites them to misbehave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikvF78Z9l5sdbh11sniRytIZ7f3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54671'),
  ('1025486393391724615', 'Okuni and Gohei', 1952, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masayoshi Kawanishi, Kazuo Yamada', 'Toshio Yasumi', 'Michiyo Kogure, Tomiemon Otomo, So Yamamura, Jun Tazaki, Yōnosuke Toba, Eiko Miyoshi, Kamatari Fujiwara, Yoshiko Hirose', null, 'A high-born woman named Okuni travels around the country with Gohei, a samurai retainer who is in service to her. They are in search of Tomonojo, who has killed the man who was Okuni’s husband and Gohei’s master, and they cannot return to their lord’s home until they have fulfilled their duty of hunting down and killing Tomonojo.', 'A high-born woman named Okuni travels around the country with Gohei, a samurai retainer who is in service to her. They are in search of Tomonojo, who has killed the man who was Okuni’s husband and Gohei’s master, and they cannot return to their lord’s home until they have fulfilled their duty of hunting down and killing Tomonojo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCJd2vkp5M3BybiVfZtStO8MaSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47101'),
  ('109820018124307585', 'OL renzoku rape: Kyonyû musaboru', 1990, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Hisayasu Satō, Masashi Inayoshi, Takaaki Hashiguchi', 'Shirō Yumeno', 'Shiina Itô, Masahiro Yoshida, Kyoko Nakamura, Aya Midorikawa, Mami Ichinose, Masahiko Sakata', null, 'Following cosmetic surgery to enhance her breasts, an office worker is raped. The rapist''s son, after setting his distinctly Oedipal gaze on his father''s busty victim, locates her and they begin an ill-fated sadomasochistic affair that leads to a bloody killing spree.', 'Following cosmetic surgery to enhance her breasts, an office worker is raped. The rapist''s son, after setting his distinctly Oedipal gaze on his father''s busty victim, locates her and they begin an ill-fated sadomasochistic affair that leads to a bloody killing spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YBko8Ty3THFoJZI1Y7At8QSDgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451767'),
