  ('637087025210764111', 'Old Boys', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Xiao Yang', 'Xiao Yang', 'Xiao Yang, Wang Taili, Yu Xinhe, Han Qiuchi', null, '"Old Boys" talks the story of two high school friends who formed a band to participate in "Happy Boys" talent show at their middle age as a song could get them back to their youth and back to the past. This touching "Old Boys" theme song also moved all the audience.', '"Old Boys" talks the story of two high school friends who formed a band to participate in "Happy Boys" talent show at their middle age as a song could get them back to their youth and back to the past. This touching "Old Boys" theme song also moved all the audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFESyoz5ejZEdt12cnCPPKD9xv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65681'),
  ('1147496789134466137', 'Old Boys', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Nanu Segal, Toby MacDonald', 'Luke Ponte, Freddy Syborn', 'Alex Lawther, Jonah Hauer-King, Pauline Étienne, Denis Ménochet, Joshua McGuire, Nicholas Rowe, Nicholas Agnew, Giles Malcolm', null, 'In the school-set re-working of Cyrano, an awkward but imaginative pupil helps the handsome but spectacularly dim school-hero pursue the fiery daughter of a visiting French teacher.', 'In the school-set re-working of Cyrano, an awkward but imaginative pupil helps the handsome but spectacularly dim school-hero pursue the fiery daughter of a visiting French teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CeLDFEGXfOQJeGyNafhC0jas5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498301'),
  ('710629831103918636', 'Old Boys: The Way of the Dragon', 2014, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tony Cheung Tung-Leung, Xiao Yang', 'Xiao Yang', 'Wang Taili, Xiao Yang, Qu Jingjing, Kerry Berry Brogan', null, 'Old Boys: The Way of the Dragon is a bittersweet, sentimental tale of a hapless pair of amateur Chinese musicians called the Chopsticks Brothers trying, and for many years failing, to make it as musicians.', 'Old Boys: The Way of the Dragon is a bittersweet, sentimental tale of a hapless pair of amateur Chinese musicians called the Chopsticks Brothers trying, and for many years failing, to make it as musicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ao4wxEpHTJRmPQ22aiPe577hF9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289449'),
  ('682082024291725999', 'Old Cats', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sebastián Silva, Pedro Peirano, Sebastián Silva', 'Pedro Peirano, Sebastián Silva', 'Bélgica Castro, Claudia Celedón, Catalina Saavedra, Alejandro Sieveking, Alejandro Goic, Alicia Rodríguez, Diego Casanueva, Pablo Toro', 'NR', 'Isidora, an old woman, discovers that her mind is quickly deteriorating. At an apparently relaxed dinner table, she will desperately try to hide her state from her daughter, a demanding woman who awaits any sign of senility in order to take way everything she has.', 'Isidora, an old woman, discovers that her mind is quickly deteriorating. At an apparently relaxed dinner table, she will desperately try to hide her state from her daughter, a demanding woman who awaits any sign of senility in order to take way everything she has.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPdyNU9UF1QMLwMVzUxbYpuRe8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112555'),
  ('1002636985453089980', 'Old Czech Legends', 1953, 'Animation, History', 'Jiří Trnka, Emanuel Franek, Ludvík Hájek', 'Jiří Trnka, Jiří Brdečka', 'Zdeněk Štěpánek, Karel Höger, Václav Vydra, Eduard Kohout, Růžena Nasková, Otomar Krejča', null, 'A monumental piece of art bringing the heroes of the ancient Czech myths back to life. The picture consists of seven parts: Cech the Forefather, Bivoj, Libuse, Premysl, Girls War, Horymir, Lucka War.', 'A monumental piece of art bringing the heroes of the ancient Czech myths back to life. The picture consists of seven parts: Cech the Forefather, Bivoj, Libuse, Premysl, Girls War, Horymir, Lucka War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndY6drkD2uauSEnMXiEexGYORyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257098'),
  ('283659703187488729', 'Old Dads', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Bill Burr, Drew Ann Rosenberg, Melanie Grefé', 'Bill Burr, Ben Tishler', 'Bill Burr, Bobby Cannavale, Bokeem Woodbine, Katie Aselton, Reign Edwards, Jackie Tohn, Miles Robbins, Rachael Harris', 'R', 'A cranky middle-aged dad and his two best friends find themselves out of step in a changing world of millennial CEOs and powerful preschool principals.', 'A cranky middle-aged dad and his two best friends find themselves out of step in a changing world of millennial CEOs and powerful preschool principals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krA2iXd1PK1vhg4jeWfbSD4fSJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987917'),
  ('839302074917556542', 'Old Dogs', 2009, 'Comedy, Family', 'Walt Becker, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Thomas Robinson Harper', 'David Diamond, David Weissman', 'John Travolta, Robin Williams, Kelly Preston, Conner Rayburn, Ella Bleu Travolta, Lori Loughlin, Seth Green, Bernie Mac', 'PG', 'Charlie and Dan have been best friends and business partners for thirty years; their Manhattan public relations firm is on the verge of a huge business deal with a Japanese company. With two weeks to sew up the contract, Dan gets a surprise: a woman he married on a drunken impulse nearly nine years before (annulled the next day) shows up to tell him he''s the father of her twins, now seven, and she''ll be in jail for 14 days for a political protest. Dan volunteers to keep the tykes, although he''s uptight and clueless. With Charlie''s help is there any way they can be dad and uncle, meet the kids'' expectations, and still land the account?', 'Charlie and Dan have been best friends and business partners for thirty years; their Manhattan public relations firm is on the verge of a huge business deal with a Japanese company. With two weeks to sew up the contract, Dan gets a surprise: a woman he married on a drunken impulse nearly nine years before (annulled the next day) shows up to tell him he''s the father of her twins, now seven, and she''ll be in jail for 14 days for a political protest. Dan volunteers to keep the tykes, although he''s uptight and clueless. With Charlie''s help is there any way they can be dad and uncle, meet the kids'' expectations, and still land the account?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u056hk3at4ukf9DWASVjogXyZfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22949'),
  ('518368002757475918', 'Old Enough', 1984, 'Drama', 'Marisa Silver, Michael Ballhaus, Lisa Hsia', 'Marisa Silver', 'Sarah Boyd, Rainbow Harvest, Neill Barry, Alyssa Milano, Danny Aiello, Susan Kingsley, Roxanne Hart, Fran Brill', 'PG', 'The 12 years old well-bred Lonnie meets the impudent Karen on the street. They spend some time together and Karen teaches Lonnie some of her favorite occupancies, like make-up, shoplifting, skipping school and lying to the parent about it, but confessing to the priest later. But Karen also learns some honesty from Lonnie. A film about social differences and growing up.', 'The 12 years old well-bred Lonnie meets the impudent Karen on the street. They spend some time together and Karen teaches Lonnie some of her favorite occupancies, like make-up, shoplifting, skipping school and lying to the parent about it, but confessing to the priest later. But Karen also learns some honesty from Lonnie. A film about social differences and growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrcrdkFmBf4lxHedsePrvSuKlsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104043'),
  ('635745025734524800', 'Old Fashioned', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Simon Roca, Antonin Peretjatko', 'Antonin Peretjatko', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Josiane Balasko, Philippe Katerine, William Lebghil, Sergi López, Philippe Duquesne, Olivier Broche, Jocelyne Augier', null, 'Paul Château-Têtard, a 45-year-old bachelor from the best of Parisian nobility, has – for the first time in his life – to take the Metro, and even buy a ticket. It is with extraordinary luck that the beautiful young Ava happens to be sitting at the counter: a spark ignites and wedding bells begin ringing in the distance.', 'Paul Château-Têtard, a 45-year-old bachelor from the best of Parisian nobility, has – for the first time in his life – to take the Metro, and even buy a ticket. It is with extraordinary luck that the beautiful young Ava happens to be sitting at the counter: a spark ignites and wedding bells begin ringing in the distance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIgbRvb4Q8Id1cbZuWJPWLmIpgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660955'),
  ('1143587676285773172', 'Old Fox', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hsiao Ya-chuan, Lin Tse-chung, Hsiu-Luan Lee', 'Adrienne Iwen Chan, Hsiao Ya-chuan', 'Bai Run-yin, Liu Kuan-ting, Akio Chen, Eugenie Liu, Mugi Kadowaki, Jag Huang, James Wen, Yang Li-yin', null, 'Set in the late 1980s, this family drama is about an 11-year-old boy who befriends his landlord, nicknamed Old Fox, and learns from him how to survive in a rapidly changing world as well as things his poor father would never be able to teach him.', 'Set in the late 1980s, this family drama is about an 11-year-old boy who befriends his landlord, nicknamed Old Fox, and learns from him how to survive in a rapidly changing world as well as things his poor father would never be able to teach him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uICCMO1IlD5RSdqb5MwxhmNUaPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006012'),
  ('1132852837810705933', 'Old Glory', 1939, 'Animation, History, Family', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, John Deering, John Litel', 'NR', 'Porky Pig balks at learning the Pledge of Allegiance until Uncle Sam appears to him in a dream and gives him a lesson in American history.', 'Porky Pig balks at learning the Pledge of Allegiance until Uncle Sam appears to him in a dream and gives him a lesson in American history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTvNdSET4DLQsGtrTrm0uzbkT7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121163'),
  ('83027642153017911', 'Old Goriot', 2004, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jean-Daniel Verhaeghe', null, 'Charles Aznavour, Tchéky Karyo, Malik Zidi, Maruschka Detmers, Nadia Barentin, Florence Darel, Rosemarie La Vaullée, Pierre Vernier', null, 'A poor but ambitious young man arrives in Paris and settles down in the boarding house run by Madame Vauquer. He soon gets to know the guests: Victorine Taillefer, a young lady her rich father refuses to recognize; Horace Bianchon, a medical student; Monsieur Vautrin, a mysterious and disconcerting man; Goriot, a rich merchant who spent all his fortune for his daughters, Delphine and Anastasie, to make a rich marriage. Eugène becomes friends with Goriot but while the former, thanks to his cousin Madame de Beauséant, is introduced in high society, Goriot, both exploited and scoffed at by his daughters, continues his descent into hell.', 'A poor but ambitious young man arrives in Paris and settles down in the boarding house run by Madame Vauquer. He soon gets to know the guests: Victorine Taillefer, a young lady her rich father refuses to recognize; Horace Bianchon, a medical student; Monsieur Vautrin, a mysterious and disconcerting man; Goriot, a rich merchant who spent all his fortune for his daughters, Delphine and Anastasie, to make a rich marriage. Eugène becomes friends with Goriot but while the former, thanks to his cousin Madame de Beauséant, is introduced in high society, Goriot, both exploited and scoffed at by his daughters, continues his descent into hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jS8zvXiofMrPmIn4qWQ0Tjl8dFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319661'),
  ('288370847469636576', 'Old Gringo', 1989, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Luis Puenzo, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Aída Bortnik, Luis Puenzo', 'Jane Fonda, Gregory Peck, Jimmy Smits, Gabriela Roel, Patricio Contreras, Sergio Calderón, Guillermo Ríos, Jim Metzler', 'R', 'A writer forms a triangle with a schoolmarm and a Mexican general on the run.', 'A writer forms a triangle with a schoolmarm and a Mexican general on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNy1OOaCXJ6IQOrZaeLhDGnt4XD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43345'),
  ('891480804428985334', 'Old Guy', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Simon West, Martin Ahlgren', 'Greg Johnson', 'Christoph Waltz, Lucy Liu, Cooper Hoffman, Karishma Navekar, Desmond Edwards, Ryan McParland, Ann Akinjirin, Charlie Hamblett', 'R', 'Stuck at a dead end but vying for the love of spunky club manager Anata, aging contract killer Danny Dolinski is thrilled when The Company pulls him back in the field, but only to train Gen Z newcomer Wihlborg, a prodigy assassin with an attitude.', 'Stuck at a dead end but vying for the love of spunky club manager Anata, aging contract killer Danny Dolinski is thrilled when The Company pulls him back in the field, but only to train Gen Z newcomer Wihlborg, a prodigy assassin with an attitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mr46kEBqDreAeZyDxD1ZtJhLyON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077782'),
  ('717108672195277124', 'Old Henry', 2021, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'John Matysiak, Corey Rich, Randolph Easy', 'Potsy Ponciroli', 'Tim Blake Nelson, Scott Haze, Gavin Lewis, Stephen Dorff, Trace Adkins, Richard Speight Jr., Max Arciniega, Brad Carter', 'NR', 'A widowed farmer and his son warily take in a mysterious, injured man with a satchel of cash. When a posse of men claiming to be the law come for the money, the farmer must decide who to trust. Defending a siege of his homestead, the farmer reveals a talent for gun-slinging that surprises everyone calling his true identity into question.', 'A widowed farmer and his son warily take in a mysterious, injured man with a satchel of cash. When a posse of men claiming to be the law come for the money, the farmer must decide who to trust. Defending a siege of his homestead, the farmer reveals a talent for gun-slinging that surprises everyone calling his true identity into question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eE1SL0QoDsvAMqQly56IkRtlN1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785663'),
  ('662312506823865574', 'Old Ironsides', 1926, 'History, Drama', 'James Cruze, Alfred Gilks', 'Dorothy Arzner', 'Charles Farrell, Esther Ralston, Wallace Beery, George Bancroft, Charles Hill Mailes, Johnnie Walker, Eddie Fetherston, George Godfrey', 'NR', 'An embellished account of the 1803 expedition by famed frigate U.S.S. Constitution--a.k.a. "Old Ironsides"--against the Barbary pirates then terrorizing American shipping, focusing on the crew and passengers of a fictional merchant ship, The Esther, who fall afoul of the same pirates and thus become involved with the Constitution''s mission.', 'An embellished account of the 1803 expedition by famed frigate U.S.S. Constitution--a.k.a. "Old Ironsides"--against the Barbary pirates then terrorizing American shipping, focusing on the crew and passengers of a fictional merchant ship, The Esther, who fall afoul of the same pirates and thus become involved with the Constitution''s mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hmuwRtktkXsK2u0hGuMuEprHQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190163'),
  ('433380082106903068', 'Old Joy', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kelly Reichardt, Peter Sillen', 'Jonathan Raymond, Kelly Reichardt', 'Daniel London, Will Oldham, Tanya Smith, Robin Rosenberg, Keri Moran, Autumn Campbell, Steven Doughton, Matt McCormick', 'NR', 'Soon to be a father, Mark feels the pressure of domestic responsibility closing in, so he is more than happy to accept when his old friend Kurt proposes a camping trip in the Oregon wilderness. During their time together, the men come to grips with the changes in their lives and the effect on their relationship.', 'Soon to be a father, Mark feels the pressure of domestic responsibility closing in, so he is more than happy to accept when his old friend Kurt proposes a camping trip in the Oregon wilderness. During their time together, the men come to grips with the changes in their lives and the effect on their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdFKZOf0LtPpGq8be9T8qsNHTbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26518'),
  ('620752280881211887', 'Old King Cole', 1933, 'Animation', 'David Hand', null, 'Allan Watson, Alberta Perkins, Cora Hunter Parks, Dorothy Compton, Mary Moder, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Old King Cole throws party and invites all of the Mother Goose characters. He warns them that they must leave at midnight. Another collection of characters puts on a stage show. The Ten Little Indian Boys get everyone dancing along. The Hickory Dickory Dock mice announce midnight, and everyone leaves, back into their books.', 'Old King Cole throws party and invites all of the Mother Goose characters. He warns them that they must leave at midnight. Another collection of characters puts on a stage show. The Ten Little Indian Boys get everyone dancing along. The Hickory Dickory Dock mice announce midnight, and everyone leaves, back into their books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qnPnif5p24FbKZpypfH4Ob5K2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57646'),
  ('289940832800704884', 'Old MacDonald Duck', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Farmer Donald goes through his farmer day until a fly causes him to lose control while milking a cow.', 'Farmer Donald goes through his farmer day until a fly causes him to lose control while milking a cow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldYQCb8ddqDYcnoJtiOLjJHcAOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74654'),
  ('937586022633068040', 'Old Man', 1997, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Kees Van Oostrum, John Kent Harrison', null, 'Jeanne Tripplehorn, Arliss Howard, Leo Burmester, Daro Latiolais, Ray McKinnon, Jerry Leggio, Horace Trahan', null, 'A prisoner set on serving his time gets recruited to save a pregnant woman trapped in a tree during the Great Flood of 1927. A massive storm drives them farther from their destination and they soon must decide to go off on their own or find their way home.', 'A prisoner set on serving his time gets recruited to save a pregnant woman trapped in a tree during the Great Flood of 1927. A massive storm drives them farther from their destination and they soon must decide to go off on their own or find their way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTCdSR51750QyOzRWIfREidvxmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226520'),
  ('370376974568281023', 'Old Man', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Alex Vendler, Michael T. Meador, Chelsea Meador', 'Joel Veach', 'Stephen Lang, Marc Senter, Patch Darragh, Liana Wright-Mark', 'NR', 'Deep in the woods, a lost hiker stumbles upon the cabin of an erratic and reclusive old man. What starts off as cordial conversation soon turns dangerous as it becomes clear that one or both of them might be hiding a terrifying secret.', 'Deep in the woods, a lost hiker stumbles upon the cabin of an erratic and reclusive old man. What starts off as cordial conversation soon turns dangerous as it becomes clear that one or both of them might be hiding a terrifying secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ro9PBCgUzNzmuKNLysopX0RBLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766220'),
  ('7420150443521493', 'Old Man Khottabych', 1957, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Gennadi Kazansky, Lev Makhtin, Mikhail Shamkovich', 'Lazar Lagin', 'Nikolai Volkov St., Aleksei Litvinov, Gennadi Khudyakov, Lev Kovalchuk, Olga Cherkasova, Maya Blinova, Efim Kopelyan, Aleksandr Larikov', null, 'A boy named Volka discovers an ancient vessel on the bottom of a river. When he opens it, a genie emerges from there. He calls himself Hassan Abdurrahman ibn Khottab, or in Russian style Khottabych. Grateful Khottabych is ready to fulfill any of Volka''s wishes. But it appears that Volka should use the powers of the genie carefully, for they can have undesirable results.', 'A boy named Volka discovers an ancient vessel on the bottom of a river. When he opens it, a genie emerges from there. He calls himself Hassan Abdurrahman ibn Khottab, or in Russian style Khottabych. Grateful Khottabych is ready to fulfill any of Volka''s wishes. But it appears that Volka should use the powers of the genie carefully, for they can have undesirable results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YzxhZDa7zzuGiBPcFzgUPVRLTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71103'),
  ('838424515314423061', 'Old Man Made in Spain', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater', 'Pedro Masó, Vicente Coello', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Mónica Randall, Mabel Karr, Florinda Chico, Rafaela Aparicio', null, 'A widow shepherd who lives at the Aragonese Pyrenees sees how his three young daughters, Cándida, Visi, and Nieves, go to Madrid to find a better life and leave him alone. There they all get married, have sons and forget their father. One day, Marcelino receives a letter from Cándida, who wants him to stay with her family for some time. What she really wants is some help from her father, as she''s not able to take care of her ten daughters and her upcoming child. Marcelino goes to Madrid, but, once there, he only finds an unknown, frantic and hostile world, and also three unhappy daughters...', 'A widow shepherd who lives at the Aragonese Pyrenees sees how his three young daughters, Cándida, Visi, and Nieves, go to Madrid to find a better life and leave him alone. There they all get married, have sons and forget their father. One day, Marcelino receives a letter from Cándida, who wants him to stay with her family for some time. What she really wants is some help from her father, as she''s not able to take care of her ten daughters and her upcoming child. Marcelino goes to Madrid, but, once there, he only finds an unknown, frantic and hostile world, and also three unhappy daughters...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMArAYv7cYAlABOvl0j56kcI8kX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85886'),
  ('299996597965513895', 'Old Men in New Cars: In China They Eat Dogs II', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Henrik Kristensen, Lasse Spang Olsen, Emil Øigaard', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Kim Bodnia, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Tomas Villum Jensen, Brian Patterson, Torkel Petersson, Iben Hjejle, Jens Okking, Jacob Haugaard', null, 'The last wish of the dying "Monk" is for his foster child, Harald, to find his real son, Ludvig. But the latter is currently in a Swedish prison cell...', 'The last wish of the dying "Monk" is for his foster child, Harald, to find his real son, Ludvig. But the latter is currently in a Swedish prison cell...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2KH5TlEcYPvinmwsJj4ULc1xDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10751'),
  ('82129583358199511', 'Old Men: Robbers', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Nikolay Nemolyaev, Genri Abramyan', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Emil Braginskiy', 'Yuriy Nikulin, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Olga Aroseva, Andrey Mironov, Yuri Belov, Valentina Talyzina, Nina Agapova, Roman Filippov', null, 'An old detective does not want to retire. The only way out is to prove to his boss that he still can catch criminals. The problem is that there were no crimes recently to work on. Together with his retired friend he decides to commit a perfect crime himself and then quickly solve it. Real problems start when a real criminal steals money he has stolen.', 'An old detective does not want to retire. The only way out is to prove to his boss that he still can catch criminals. The problem is that there were no crimes recently to work on. Together with his retired friend he decides to commit a perfect crime himself and then quickly solve it. Real problems start when a real criminal steals money he has stolen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCoon0OCV0eT3MKRrnEOkU4j0JH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46010'),
  ('78740907743033862', 'Old Partner', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Lee Chung-ryoul', 'Lee Chung-ryoul', 'Won-gyoon Choi, Sam-soon Lee', null, 'An elderly farmer lives out his final days with his wife and a loyal ox in the Korean countryside.', 'An elderly farmer lives out his final days with his wife and a loyal ox in the Korean countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VXEigBojfUJluRGuGdRq7h9Qnm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47748'),
