  ('56606396835320092', 'Old Songs About the Main Thing 3', 1998, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Vasili Pichul', 'Armen Grigoryan', 'Aleksandr Demyanenko, Yuriy Yakovlev, Leonid Kuravlyov, Mikhail Pugovkin, Natalya Seleznyova, Leonid Agutin, Aleksey Kortnev, Natasha Korolyova', null, 'An unofficial sequel to the movie "Ivan Vasilyevich Changes His Profession". The events take place on New Year''s Eve 1997-1998, 24 years after the events of the movie. According to the plot, the main characters (Shurik, Bunsha, Zina and Ulyana Andreyevna) are going to celebrate New Year''s Eve, and the engineer Alexander Sergeyevich Timofeev (Shurik) decides to present his recreated (and modernized) time machine to the guests. Having gone to the XVI century, they find there an aged Georges Miloslavsky, who has been sitting as regent for 25 years instead of Ivan the Terrible, who has run away; the Tsar was so inspired by the profession of Zina and Yakin that he decided to try his hand at filmmaking and went to "Mosfilm" instead of the Tsar''s chambers. In an effort to correct the disruption of the course of history, the heroes re-engage the time machine and travel back to the 1970s in search of the Tsar, who dreams of becoming an actor.', 'An unofficial sequel to the movie "Ivan Vasilyevich Changes His Profession". The events take place on New Year''s Eve 1997-1998, 24 years after the events of the movie. According to the plot, the main characters (Shurik, Bunsha, Zina and Ulyana Andreyevna) are going to celebrate New Year''s Eve, and the engineer Alexander Sergeyevich Timofeev (Shurik) decides to present his recreated (and modernized) time machine to the guests. Having gone to the XVI century, they find there an aged Georges Miloslavsky, who has been sitting as regent for 25 years instead of Ivan the Terrible, who has run away; the Tsar was so inspired by the profession of Zina and Yakin that he decided to try his hand at filmmaking and went to "Mosfilm" instead of the Tsar''s chambers. In an effort to correct the disruption of the course of history, the heroes re-engage the time machine and travel back to the 1970s in search of the Tsar, who dreams of becoming an actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60vUKLZVI9i3F4lR7HZjtqhO8Ag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661725'),
  ('918232309039844218', 'Old Stone', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Johnny Ma', 'Johnny Ma', 'Chen Gang, Nai An, Wang Hongwei, Zebin Zhang, Xue''er Luo', null, 'When a drunken passenger causes taxi driver Lao Shi to swerve and hit a motorcyclist, he stops to help the victim. As no ambulance arrives he drives him to the hospital, but soon has to face the rules of today''s Kafkaesque China. With his family and life endangered, he desperately seeks a way out.', 'When a drunken passenger causes taxi driver Lao Shi to swerve and hit a motorcyclist, he stops to help the victim. As no ambulance arrives he drives him to the hospital, but soon has to face the rules of today''s Kafkaesque China. With his family and life endangered, he desperately seeks a way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEhHepHn00aQ0Dni8GrJHTRoFuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382653'),
  ('724855366225599436', 'Old Well', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wu Tianming, Zhang Yimou, Wangcai Chen', '郑义', 'Zhang Yimou, Lü Liping, Niu Xingli, Ding Weimin, Yan Xie, Li Jingjing, Tan Xihe, Yujin Liang', null, 'A married village worker teams up with an old girlfriend to try to dig a well for his water-starved village. The well collapses and they are trapped. Their enforced confinement leads to them exploring their feelings for each other and those around them.', 'A married village worker teams up with an old girlfriend to try to dig a well for his water-starved village. The well collapses and they are trapped. Their enforced confinement leads to them exploring their feelings for each other and those around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDKqDQu8daPdDQHPGOXLgbgA8AJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127200'),
  ('262926458604644943', 'Old White Man', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Simon Verhoeven, Jo Heim, Daniela Tolkien', 'Simon Verhoeven', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Nadja Uhl, Elyas M''Barek, Friedrich von Thun, Denise M''Baye, Michael Maertens, Juri Sam Winkler, Momo Beier', null, 'In order to finally get that long-awaited promotion, Heinz Hellmich, an old white man, has to show his "wokest" side at work. When he invites his superiors to a private dinner at his home, his family''s politically correct façade quickly begins to crumble and the evening takes a hair-raising turn.', 'In order to finally get that long-awaited promotion, Heinz Hellmich, an old white man, has to show his "wokest" side at work. When he invites his superiors to a private dinner at his home, his family''s politically correct façade quickly begins to crumble and the evening takes a hair-raising turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32rESYjhBkSYo4cXoEIOGJEQMk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219560'),
  ('379905214397999532', 'Old Yeller', 1957, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, Western', 'Robert Stevenson, Charles P. Boyle', 'Fred Gipson, William Tunberg', 'Tommy Kirk, Dorothy McGuire, Fess Parker, Kevin Corcoran, Jeff York, Beverly Washburn, Chuck Connors, Spike', 'G', 'Young Travis Coates is left to take care of the family ranch with his mother and younger brother while his father goes off on a cattle drive in the 1860s. When a yellow mongrel comes for an uninvited stay with the family, Travis reluctantly adopts the dog.', 'Young Travis Coates is left to take care of the family ranch with his mother and younger brother while his father goes off on a cattle drive in the 1860s. When a yellow mongrel comes for an uninvited stay with the family, Travis reluctantly adopts the dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Xe7AB0ffhGPSdBZ4qJ9AKJfllL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22660'),
  ('132003632567678422', 'Oldboy', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Action', 'Chung Chung-hoon, Lee Kae-byeok, Jung Sik', 'Lim Joon-hyung, Hwang Jo-yoon, Park Chan-wook', 'Choi Min-sik, Yoo Ji-tae, Kang Hye-jung, Kim Byeong-ok, Ji Dae-han, Oh Dal-su, Lee Seung-shin, Yoon Jin-seo', 'R', 'With no clue how he came to be imprisoned, drugged and tortured for 15 years, a desperate man seeks revenge on his captors.', 'With no clue how he came to be imprisoned, drugged and tortured for 15 years, a desperate man seeks revenge on his captors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWDtjs568ZfOTMbURQBYuT4Qxka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670'),
  ('159036172073406575', 'Oldboy', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Action', 'Spike Lee, Sean Bobbitt, Michael A. Pinckney', 'Hwang Jo-yoon, Lim Joon-hyung, Park Chan-wook', 'Josh Brolin, Elizabeth Olsen, Sharlto Copley, Samuel L. Jackson, Michael Imperioli, Pom Klementieff, James Ransone, Max Casella', 'R', 'A man has only three and a half days and limited resources to discover why he was imprisoned in a nondescript room for 20 years without any explanation.', 'A man has only three and a half days and limited resources to discover why he was imprisoned in a nondescript room for 20 years without any explanation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iX93YdBrZA1EpGbphmjf4ARj1Za.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87516'),
  ('111979866016829419', 'Oldboys', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nikolaj Steen', 'Nikolaj Steen', 'Kristian Halken, Robert Hansen, Laura Christensen, Rasmus Bjerg, Leif Sylvester, Ole Thestrup, Niels Skousen, Bodil Jørgensen', null, 'Now in his fifties, Vagn leads a solitary life and plays football with a group of similarly aged men, some even older. After being left behind at a petrol station by his teammates on their way to a match in Sweden, he encounters a young habitual offender and together they set off in hot pursuit of Vagn''s buddies. A Nordic road movie taking in a whole series of comic, serious and, above all, well-written scenarios.', 'Now in his fifties, Vagn leads a solitary life and plays football with a group of similarly aged men, some even older. After being left behind at a petrol station by his teammates on their way to a match in Sweden, he encounters a young habitual offender and together they set off in hot pursuit of Vagn''s buddies. A Nordic road movie taking in a whole series of comic, serious and, above all, well-written scenarios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjJgTgxPjkVutOXSnWxKGD63mTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41454'),
  ('711835337491074136', 'Older Gods', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'David A. Roberts, Shaun Bishop', 'David A. Roberts', 'Rory Wilson, Leuan Coombs, Lynsey Bennett-Thompson, Jonathan Keeble, Scott Bishop, Keith Lupton, Nicole Carino, Dylan Runge', null, 'After the disappearance of his troubled friend, American Chris Rivers travels to the remote Welsh countryside to investigate what happened – leading him to a dark apocalyptic cult.', 'After the disappearance of his troubled friend, American Chris Rivers travels to the remote Welsh countryside to investigate what happened – leading him to a dark apocalyptic cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCL4U4nySiijUF2wTuB247KJbmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088080'),
  ('1149192606782805805', 'Older Than America', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Georgina Lightning, Shane F. Kelly, Steve Speers', 'Christine K. Walker, Georgina Lightning', 'Adam Beach, Tantoo Cardinal, Bradley Cooper, Glen Gould, Dan Harrison, Sarah Agnew, Wes Studi, Chris Mulkey', null, 'The truth of the past come to light in a series of haunting visions in this drama. The strange visions grow more vivid with each passing day, a young woman of Native American heritage begins piecing together a Catholic priests diabolical plot to prevent her mother from revealing the atrocities that unfolded at a Native Indian boarding school.', 'The truth of the past come to light in a series of haunting visions in this drama. The strange visions grow more vivid with each passing day, a young woman of Native American heritage begins piecing together a Catholic priests diabolical plot to prevent her mother from revealing the atrocities that unfolded at a Native Indian boarding school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyYmrGcvkV9rIq25ITbqN8xQ009.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49429'),
  ('381291721060581455', 'Oldies But Goodies', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Levy, Annaelle Menoni, Valérie Xae', 'Kev Adams', 'Kev Adams, Daniel Prévost, Liliane Rovère, Firmine Richard, Jean Reno, Chantal Ladesou, Enrico Macias, Amanda Lear', null, 'As the Lino Vartan shelter, which takes orphans and seniors in, has to shut down for health issues, Milann has no choice but to accept the invitation of a retirement home in the south of France.', 'As the Lino Vartan shelter, which takes orphans and seniors in, has to shut down for health issues, Milann has no choice but to accept the invitation of a retirement home in the south of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LfutB4uv1w6H2td1F6Hw7HpAym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083300'),
  ('469607787844957997', 'Olé', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion, Melchiorre Galassi', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Massimo Boldi, Vincenzo Salemme, Enzo Salvi, Daryl Hannah, Natalia Estrada, Francesca Lodo, Brigitta Boccoli, Armando De Razza', null, 'Two quarreling teachers vie for the same woman. In the same time the two will have to accompany a class on a trip in Spain.', 'Two quarreling teachers vie for the same woman. In the same time the two will have to accompany a class on a trip in Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYomOfi50vsrxfQmPeKubLO6ZhX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103112'),
  ('668506202516236387', 'Olé !', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Florence Quentin, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Alexis Quentin, Florence Quentin', 'Gad Elmaleh, Gérard Depardieu, Sabine Azéma, Valeria Golino, Gaëlle Bona, Valentin Merlet, Mar Sodupe, Isabelle Caubère', null, 'Ramon Holgado is the driver of a big boss, as well as his confidant, his golf partner, and the alibi of his escapades. His wife, Carmen, dreams of returning to sunny Andalusia.', 'Ramon Holgado is the driver of a big boss, as well as his confidant, his golf partner, and the alibi of his escapades. His wife, Carmen, dreams of returning to sunny Andalusia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkTTHdZ1IPvVnx4e5VaVceQ8YoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72822'),
  ('469802509397102834', 'Oleanna', 1994, 'Drama', 'David Mamet, Andrzej Sekula, Cara Giallanza', 'David Mamet', 'William H. Macy, Debra Eisenstadt', 'R', 'Carol, a college student, comes to John''s office, her professor, to discuss the grade she has received for one of her papers.', 'Carol, a college student, comes to John''s office, her professor, to discuss the grade she has received for one of her papers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WqNryGHUxtVqvQK7JZYy2jnpxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33633'),
  ('425780993824932319', 'Oleksa Dovbush', 1960, 'Drama, History, Adventure', 'Viktor Ivanov, Vadym Illienko, Anatolii Bukovskyi', 'Lyubomir Dmiterko', 'Afanasi Kochetkov, Nataliia Naum, Oleg Borisov, Nikolai Muravyov, Misha Chernov, Mark Pertsovskiy, Nadezhda Cherednichenko, Dmytro Milyutenko', null, 'The story of the "Hutsul Robin Hood" Oleksa Dovbush, an 18th century Carpathian Mountains outlaw who''s a popular figure of Ukrainian legend.', 'The story of the "Hutsul Robin Hood" Oleksa Dovbush, an 18th century Carpathian Mountains outlaw who''s a popular figure of Ukrainian legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VzdY0xkKTzarWFCfQbyhEqDl4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422846'),
  ('907505105209916496', 'Olga', 2004, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jayme Monjardim, Ricardo Della Rosa, Malu Miranda', 'Rita Buzzar', 'Camila Morgado, Caco Ciocler, Edgar Amorim, Leona Cavalli, Eliane Giardini, Zécarlos Machado, Osmar Prado, Werner Schünemann', 'PG-13', 'Based upon the true story of Olga Benário, the German-born wife of Brazilian communist leader Luís Carlos Prestes. During the dictatorship of Getúlio Vargas (1930-1945) she was arrested and sent to Nazi Germany, where she was put to death in a concentration camp. After World War II began, Vargas decided to uphold the Allies.', 'Based upon the true story of Olga Benário, the German-born wife of Brazilian communist leader Luís Carlos Prestes. During the dictatorship of Getúlio Vargas (1930-1945) she was arrested and sent to Nazi Germany, where she was put to death in a concentration camp. After World War II began, Vargas decided to uphold the Allies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zym9l0b5eu6fDeBXJzbDuVYMOVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34671'),
  ('765974430468334362', 'Olga', 2021, 'Drama', 'Lucie Baudinaud, Alla Samoilenko, Elie Grappe', 'Raphaëlle Desplechin, Elie Grappe', 'Anastasia Budiashkina, Thea Brogli, Sabrina Rubtsova, Caterina Barloggio, Tatiana Mikhina, Jérôme Martin, Alicia Onomor, Lou Steffen', null, '2013. Exiled in Switzerland, Olga, a talented and passionate 15-year-old Ukrainian gymnast, is trying to secure a place in the National Sports Centre. But the Euromaidan revolt erupts in Kyiv, and suddenly her loved ones are involved. While the girl is adapting to her new country and preparing for the European Championships, the Ukrainian revolution makes its way into her life, and nothing will ever be the same again.', '2013. Exiled in Switzerland, Olga, a talented and passionate 15-year-old Ukrainian gymnast, is trying to secure a place in the National Sports Centre. But the Euromaidan revolt erupts in Kyiv, and suddenly her loved ones are involved. While the girl is adapting to her new country and preparing for the European Championships, the Ukrainian revolution makes its way into her life, and nothing will ever be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weLIf43ZUoGj1SuI3PLLlYSZW6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749142'),
  ('357459944209010311', 'Olga''s Girls', 1964, 'Horror, Crime', 'Joseph P. Mawra, William Rose', 'Joseph P. Mawra', 'Audrey Campbell, Dolly Simmons, Alice Denham, Darlene Bennett, Cynthia Grey, Jane Hill, Ann Pepper, Loloni Nocolo', null, 'Ruthless narcotics dealer and white slavery ring leader Olga keeps her harem of girls in line by hooking them on addictive drugs. Olga suspects an informant in their midst and uses various brutal methods of torture to weed out the squealer. Meanwhile, several of Olga''s girls plot their revenge against Olga for her continual sadistic treatment of them.', 'Ruthless narcotics dealer and white slavery ring leader Olga keeps her harem of girls in line by hooking them on addictive drugs. Olga suspects an informant in their midst and uses various brutal methods of torture to weed out the squealer. Meanwhile, several of Olga''s girls plot their revenge against Olga for her continual sadistic treatment of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSquMVZDex6eEy1BtXNCrjWaBWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80676'),
  ('1133766162582766090', 'Olga''s House of Shame', 1964, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Rose, Joseph P. Mawra', null, 'Audrey Campbell, Judy Young, W.B. Parker, Ella Daphni, Alice Denham, Brenda Denaut, Josel, Connie Oliver', null, 'In this third installment of the "Olga" series, our heroine adds jewel smuggling to her repertoire of dope pushing and white slavery. As the vicious Olga (Audrey Campbell) expands her criminal empire, she also encounters more resistance as a string of once-trusted partners turn traitor in an effort to steal the successful racket out from under her. The result is exactly what fans of the series expect, a barrage of torture scenes featuring soldering irons, floggings, spankings, and even an electric chair. As with its predecessors, Olga''s House of Shame is a silent black and white film with narration to explain the action, but even with direct commentary it''s difficult to keep track of the characters and Campbell (who is occasionally caught laughing out loud at the absurdity of it all) has all the menace of a kindergarten teacher, even when wielding a machete.', 'In this third installment of the "Olga" series, our heroine adds jewel smuggling to her repertoire of dope pushing and white slavery. As the vicious Olga (Audrey Campbell) expands her criminal empire, she also encounters more resistance as a string of once-trusted partners turn traitor in an effort to steal the successful racket out from under her. The result is exactly what fans of the series expect, a barrage of torture scenes featuring soldering irons, floggings, spankings, and even an electric chair. As with its predecessors, Olga''s House of Shame is a silent black and white film with narration to explain the action, but even with direct commentary it''s difficult to keep track of the characters and Campbell (who is occasionally caught laughing out loud at the absurdity of it all) has all the menace of a kindergarten teacher, even when wielding a machete.', 'https://image.tmdb.o