ho can foresee the future. Geun-hyeok is perfect and Mi-jeong loves her husband but she can''t help feeling unsteady. Tae-sik leaves on a suicide journey and meets Mi-jeong. They fall in love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hRAm3H3wwBGRBCre6xfQfpwmHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482706'),
  ('312049465369349945', 'Olimpia', 2018, 'Animation, Thriller, Drama, History', 'José Manuel Cravioto', null, 'Nicolasa Ortíz Monasterio, Luis Curiel, Daniel Mandoki, Diego Cataño, Lumi Cavazos, Tiaré Scanda, Mariana Azcárate, Valentina Buzzurro', null, 'The film tells the story of Raquel, Rodolfo and Hernán, members of a brigade at the UNAM during the student movement in Mexico in 1968. Through their photographs, films and writings, we will know the history of the day that the army took the university and how their students united, shouted and never forgot.', 'The film tells the story of Raquel, Rodolfo and Hernán, members of a brigade at the UNAM during the student movement in Mexico in 1968. Through their photographs, films and writings, we will know the history of the day that the army took the university and how their students united, shouted and never forgot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/my9vUV1un8XWyDkjgEpLwNS3iS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551641'),
  ('1050798917247164362', 'Olive, the Other Reindeer', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Steve Moore, John A. Davis', 'Steve Young', 'Drew Barrymore, Ed Asner, Dan Castellaneta, Joe Pantoliano, Peter MacNicol, Matt Groening, Jay Mohr, Billy West', 'G', 'After mis-hearing a radio broadcast about Santa canceling his Christmas trip due to an injured reindeer, Olive the dog decides to travel to the North Pole and volunteer to be a replacement. Unfortunately, Olive must deal with an evil postman who''s tired of handling all the extra Christmas mail. Will Martini the penguin be able to help Olive realize her dream?', 'After mis-hearing a radio broadcast about Santa canceling his Christmas trip due to an injured reindeer, Olive the dog decides to travel to the North Pole and volunteer to be a replacement. Unfortunately, Olive must deal with an evil postman who''s tired of handling all the extra Christmas mail. Will Martini the penguin be able to help Olive realize her dream?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utTSbxaQImY5HhcqB1FdQsXoR5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13379'),
  ('28360633359442789', 'Oliver & Company', 1988, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'George Scribner', 'Jim Cox, James Mangold, Tim Disney', 'Joey Lawrence, Billy Joel, Cheech Marin, Richard Mulligan, Roscoe Lee Browne, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Bette Midler, Dom DeLuise', 'G', 'Putting its own ''twist'' on the story of Oliver Twist, the orange runt of a litter of kittens must fight for survival on the rough streets on New York City, finding unlikely friends in the dogs owned by a down-on-his luck man named Fagin. Soon, Oliver and his new band of comrades must fight for survival when Fagin is unable to pay his debts.', 'Putting its own ''twist'' on the story of Oliver Twist, the orange runt of a litter of kittens must fight for survival on the rough streets on New York City, finding unlikely friends in the dogs owned by a down-on-his luck man named Fagin. Soon, Oliver and his new band of comrades must fight for survival when Fagin is unable to pay his debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8XqdiZ0Oxu5iXF9SiFub9Lae8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12233'),
  ('204364232196476145', 'Oliver the Eighth', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Lloyd French', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Mae Busch, Jack Barty', 'NR', 'Barbershop owners Stan and Ollie answer an ad in the newspaper from a wealthy widow looking for a husband. Ollie only mails in his response and is invited to the widow''s mansion. Stan discovers his unmailed letter and insists on tagging along. At the mansion, the widow''s creepy butler informs them that the woman is crazy. She was once jilted by an Oliver and now her hobby is marrying Olivers and then slitting their throats. Now the boys must figure out how to escape.', 'Barbershop owners Stan and Ollie answer an ad in the newspaper from a wealthy widow looking for a husband. Ollie only mails in his response and is invited to the widow''s mansion. Stan discovers his unmailed letter and insists on tagging along. At the mansion, the widow''s creepy butler informs them that the woman is crazy. She was once jilted by an Oliver and now her hobby is marrying Olivers and then slitting their throats. Now the boys must figure out how to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbcVU4sbBlcY9tJIyssMUQIdcPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48890'),
  ('1016766718715591463', 'Oliver Twist', 1922, 'Drama', 'Frank Lloyd, Robert Martin, Glen MacWilliams', 'Walter Anthony', 'Jackie Coogan, James A. Marcus, Aggie Herring, Lewis Sargent, Joan Standing, Carl Stockdale, Edouard Trebaol, Lon Chaney', null, 'When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he''s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin''s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.', 'When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he''s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin''s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eWIAOAvSUssq8m3N2QqTAT6syN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47720'),
