  ('796498763844114813', 'Oliver!', 1968, 'Drama, Family', 'Carol Reed, Oswald Morris, Colin M. Brewer', 'Vernon Harris', 'Ron Moody, Shani Wallis, Oliver Reed, Harry Secombe, Mark Lester, Jack Wild, Joseph O''Conor, Peggy Mount', 'G', 'Musical adaptation of Charles Dickens'' Oliver Twist, a classic tale of an orphan who runs away from the workhouse and joins up with a group of boys headed by the Artful Dodger and trained to be pickpockets by master thief Fagin.', 'Musical adaptation of Charles Dickens'' Oliver Twist, a classic tale of an orphan who runs away from the workhouse and joins up with a group of boys headed by the Artful Dodger and trained to be pickpockets by master thief Fagin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XJgoaOWKrqxkKeBKWLKSigqG8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17917'),
  ('225259911972637917', 'Oliver''s Story', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Korty, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Erich Segal, John Korty', 'Ryan O''Neal, Candice Bergen, Nicola Pagett, Edward Binns, Benson Fong, Charles Haid, Kenneth McMillan, Ray Milland', 'PG', 'Oliver Barrett IV is emotionally devastated by the death of his wife Jenny, and, while he tries to lose himself in his work as a lawyer, the long hours don''t ease his pain, especially when he finds that his leftist views conflict with those of the senior partners at the firm. Eventually, Oliver''s inconsolable grief begins to alienate those around him, until he finds new love with Marcie Bonwit, the wealthy and beautiful heiress to the Bonwit Teller fortune. Despite his affection for her, Oliver finds it difficult to leave the memory of Jenny behind, which causes major problems in their relationship.', 'Oliver Barrett IV is emotionally devastated by the death of his wife Jenny, and, while he tries to lose himself in his work as a lawyer, the long hours don''t ease his pain, especially when he finds that his leftist views conflict with those of the senior partners at the firm. Eventually, Oliver''s inconsolable grief begins to alienate those around him, until he finds new love with Marcie Bonwit, the wealthy and beautiful heiress to the Bonwit Teller fortune. Despite his affection for her, Oliver finds it difficult to leave the memory of Jenny behind, which causes major problems in their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5cXRwLomgwodwopFST6UG7WzeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163631'),
  ('669692340540855347', 'Olivia', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacqueline Audry, Christian Matras, Claude Pinoteau', 'Colette Audry, Pierre Laroche', 'Edwige Feuillère, Simone Simon, Marie-Claire Olivia, Yvonne de Bray, Suzanne Dehelly, Marina de Berg, Lesly Meynard, Rina Rhéty', null, '"Olivia" captures the awakening passions of an English adolescent sent away for a year to a small finishing school outside Paris. The innocent but watchful Olivia develops an infatuation for her headmistress Julie and through this screen of love observes the tense romance between Julie and the other head of the school Cara in its final months.', '"Olivia" captures the awakening passions of an English adolescent sent away for a year to a small finishing school outside Paris. The innocent but watchful Olivia develops an infatuation for her headmistress Julie and through this screen of love observes the tense romance between Julie and the other head of the school Cara in its final months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kVDX2TRoRPFoduH64vLnX4Yr8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257862'),
  ('829893947314226155', 'Olivia', 1978, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Steve Binder', null, 'Olivia Newton-John, Andy Gibb, Gary Frank, Agnetha Fältskog, Björn Ulvaeus, Benny Andersson, Anni-Frid Lyngstad', 'PG', 'This one hour special, aired May 17, 1978, features Olivia singing many of her hits with special guests Andy Gibb, ABBA, the Southern Californian Community Choir, and Gary Frank.', 'This one hour special, aired May 17, 1978, features Olivia singing many of her hits with special guests Andy Gibb, ABBA, the Southern Californian Community Choir, and Gary Frank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JD9ZYn0jwkWp4pvlnREcZF3c3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533038'),
  ('157023573209032199', 'Olivia', 1983, 'Crime, Horror, Drama, Romance', 'Ulli Lommel, Ulli Lommel, Jon Kranhouse', 'Ulli Lommel, John P. Marsh, Ron Norman', 'Suzanna Love, Robert Walker Jr., Bibbe Hansen, Jeff Winchester, Nicholas Love, Amy Robinson, Kenneth Robert Shippy, Michael Evans', null, 'Nightmares of the past haunt the beautiful, mysterious Olivia, a London resident who begins a passionate affair with American businessman Mike. Trapped in a loveless marriage and traumatized by memories of her mother''s brutal murder, Olivia hopes her lover will offer a chance at a new life. However, ghostly voices and brutal murders ignite a fiendish, twist-filled story of double identities, deception, and erotic terror.', 'Nightmares of the past haunt the beautiful, mysterious Olivia, a London resident who begins a passionate affair with American businessman Mike. Trapped in a loveless marriage and traumatized by memories of her mother''s brutal murder, Olivia hopes her lover will offer a chance at a new life. However, ghostly voices and brutal murders ignite a fiendish, twist-filled story of double identities, deception, and erotic terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CXHkW4ugxo18vlCGIuNVK7mGsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224626'),
  ('961326111330729444', 'OLIVIA RODRIGO: driving home 2 u (a SOUR film)', 2022, 'Music, Documentary', 'Stacey Lee, Zoë Yi', null, 'Olivia Rodrigo, Dan Nigro, Jacob Collier, Blu DeTiger, Towa Bird, Heather Elizabeth Baker, Stevie Blacke, Hayley Brownell', 'PG-13', 'Grammy® winner singer-songwriter Olivia Rodrigo takes a familiar road trip from Salt Lake City, where she began writing her debut album “SOUR,” to Los Angeles. Along the way, Rodrigo recounts the memories of writing and creating her record-breaking debut album and shares her feelings as a young woman navigating a specific time in her life. Through new live arrangements of her songs, intimate interviews and never-before-seen footage from the making of the album, audiences will follow Olivia along on a cinematic journey exploring the story of “SOUR.”', 'Grammy® winner singer-songwriter Olivia Rodrigo takes a familiar road trip from Salt Lake City, where she began writing her debut album “SOUR,” to Los Angeles. Along the way, Rodrigo recounts the memories of writing and creating her record-breaking debut album and shares her feelings as a young woman navigating a specific time in her life. Through new live arrangements of her songs, intimate interviews and never-before-seen footage from the making of the album, audiences will follow Olivia along on a cinematic journey exploring the story of “SOUR.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8tVvNTIDL2KP7a5iLDtqF2NhNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939790'),
  ('379574700868149821', 'Olivia Rodrigo: GUTS World Tour', 2024, 'Music', 'James B. Merryman, Peter Forster, Brett Turnbull', null, 'Olivia Rodrigo, Hayley Brownell, Camila Mora, Moa Munoz, Emily Rosenfield, Daisy Spencer, India Carney, Anilee List', 'PG-13', 'At a sold-out concert in her hometown of LA, Olivia Rodrigo pours her heart into an electrifying night of chart-topping hits and pop-rock power ballads.', 'At a sold-out concert in her hometown of LA, Olivia Rodrigo pours her heart into an electrifying night of chart-topping hits and pop-rock power ballads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6uuhdwzJpyMoYS0LGOoCnkgLXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1365141'),
  ('413626529732293781', 'Olivier, Olivier', 1992, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Agnieszka Holland, Bernard Zitzermann, Michel Ferry', 'Agnieszka Holland, Yves Lapointe', 'François Cluzet, Grégoire Colin, Marina Golovine, Brigitte Roüan, Frédéric Quiring, Emmanuel Morozof, Faye Gatteau, Carole Lemerle', null, 'Olivier, the nine-year-old son of Elisabeth and Serge, a country veterinarian, vanishes one afternoon on the way to his grandmother''s house. The emotional aftermath of his disappearance sends his father packing and nearly destroys his mother.', 'Olivier, the nine-year-old son of Elisabeth and Serge, a country veterinarian, vanishes one afternoon on the way to his grandmother''s house. The emotional aftermath of his disappearance sends his father packing and nearly destroys his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCQu2vWMuVKzKTRhDdPCwYTJhZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124096'),
  ('182786977692551890', 'Olla', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marie Zoubian, Ariane Labed, Balthazar Lab', 'Ariane Labed', 'Romanna Lobach, Grégoire Tachnakian, Jenny Bellay, Gall Gaspard, Ginger Romàn', null, 'After answering an ad on a dating website for Eastern European women, Olla leaves Ukraine and heads to French suburbia to move in with Pierre, who lives with his elderly mother. However, the suburbia cannot temper her desires, and nothing goes as expected.', 'After answering an ad on a dating website for Eastern European women, Olla leaves Ukraine and heads to French suburbia to move in with Pierre, who lives with his elderly mother. However, the suburbia cannot temper her desires, and nothing goes as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71J4r662Mm7QjjXhVa9ncpDEWUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597121'),
  ('16690582381905579', 'Ollie Hopnoodle''s Haven of Bliss', 1988, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Dick Bartlett, Mike Dempsey, D''Arcy Marsh', 'Jean Shepherd', 'Jerry O''Connell, James B. Sikking, Dorothy Lyman, Jean Shepherd, Cameron Johann, Bill McDonald, Marjorie O''Neill-Butler, W. Clapham Murray', null, 'From Jean Shepherd (A Christmas Story) comes the story of 14 year old Ralphie''s first job, and the family vacation the family is planning to a rustic fishing cabin on Lake Michigan. Originally made for the Disney Channel, this film is a delightful family comedy.', 'From Jean Shepherd (A Christmas Story) comes the story of 14 year old Ralphie''s first job, and the family vacation the family is planning to a rustic fishing cabin on Lake Michigan. Originally made for the Disney Channel, this film is a delightful family comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEFq8YMgrWPzTP3GCPr9GCLoIQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75132'),
  ('290697082697933086', 'Òlòtūré', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kenneth Gyang, Idowu Adedapo, Malcolm McLean', 'Craig Freimond, Yinka Ogun', 'Sharon Ooja, Blossom Chukwujekwu, Omoni Oboli, Omowunmi Dada, Bukola Oladipupo, Kemi Lala Akindoju, Ikechukwu Onunaku, Ada Ameh', null, 'In Lagos, Nigeria, young, naive Nigerian journalist Òlòtūré goes undercover to expose the shady underworld of human trafficking. Unused to this brutal environment, crawling with ruthless traders and pimps, Òlòtūré finds warmth and friendship with Blessing, Linda and Beauty, the prostitutes she lives with. However, she gets drawn into their lifestyle and finds it difficult to cope. In her quest to uncover the truth, she pays the ultimate price - one that takes her to the verge of no return.', 'In Lagos, Nigeria, young, naive Nigerian journalist Òlòtūré goes undercover to expose the shady underworld of human trafficking. Unused to this brutal environment, crawling with ruthless traders and pimps, Òlòtūré finds warmth and friendship with Blessing, Linda and Beauty, the prostitutes she lives with. However, she gets drawn into their lifestyle and finds it difficult to cope. In her quest to uncover the truth, she pays the ultimate price - one that takes her to the verge of no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28bglTF4bqQwyXWoS8pawIY5AOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642803'),
  ('517197355359601957', 'Olur Olur!', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Kerem Çakıroğlu, Erkan Özkan', 'Alper Kul', 'Alper Kul, Şinasi Yurtsever, Onur Buldu, Selin Yeninci, Ayça Varlıer, Taner Ergör, Onur Atilla, Aylin Kontente', null, 'Pharmacy apprentice Ali suddenly reunites with his childhood crush Ayça and, desperate to win her over, enlists a life coach, only to get into a series of hilarious misadventures with his coach and assistant.', 'Pharmacy apprentice Ali suddenly reunites with his childhood crush Ayça and, desperate to win her over, enlists a life coach, only to get into a series of hilarious misadventures with his coach and assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFXWYO1lpFksgeWKlffA51VrGXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327038'),
  ('133811906319334644', 'Olvido', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Inés París, Mamen Tortosa, Alba Álvarez', 'Fermín Palacios', 'María Caballero, Morgan Blasco, Javier Butler, Jorge Cabrera, Carlos Olalla, Magüi Mira, Álvaro Báguena, Ramón Ródenas', null, 'After the Turia River overflows its banks, journalist Olvido and police sergeant Fermín investigate the appearance of six bodies with strange scars that point to a dark conspiracy.', 'After the Turia River overflows its banks, journalist Olvido and police sergeant Fermín investigate the appearance of six bodies with strange scars that point to a dark conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muGQcQHEH988Q9drYMhtOj2YMDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1152774'),
  ('535653369904505044', 'Olympia Part One: Festival of the Nations', 1938, 'Documentary', 'Hans Scheib, Guzzi Lantschner, Kurt Neubert', 'Leni Riefenstahl', 'David Albritton, Arvo Askola, Jack Beresford, Erwin Blask, Sulo Bärlund, Ibolya Csák, Glenn Cunningham, Henri de Baillet-Latour', 'NR', 'Starting with a long and lyrical overture, evoking the origins of the Olympic Games in ancient Greece, Riefenstahl covers twenty-one athletic events in the first half of this two-part love letter to the human body and spirit, culminating with the marathon, where Jesse Owens became the first track and field athlete to win four gold medals in a single Olympics.', 'Starting with a long and lyrical overture, evoking the origins of the Olympic Games in ancient Greece, Riefenstahl covers twenty-one athletic events in the first half of this two-part love letter to the human body and spirit, culminating with the marathon, where Jesse Owens became the first track and field athlete to win four gold medals in a single Olympics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49KaePhxdoM3TkJHo8zaoCFEJ6X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677'),
  ('731362146706985950', 'Olympia Part Two: Festival of Beauty', 1938, 'Documentary', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Willy Hameister, Albert Kling', 'Leni Riefenstahl', 'Sheigo Arai, Albert Bachmann, Daniel Barrow, Jack Beresford, Ralf Berzsenyi, Ferenc Csík, Richard Degener, Willemijntje den Ouden', 'NR', 'Part two of Leni Riefenstahl''s monumental examination of the 1938 Olympic Games, the cameras leave the main stadium and venture into the many halls and fields deployed for such sports as fencing, polo, cycling, and the modern pentathlon, which was won by American Glenn Morris.', 'Part two of Leni Riefenstahl''s monumental examination of the 1938 Olympic Games, the cameras leave the main stadium and venture into the many halls and fields deployed for such sports as fencing, polo, cycling, and the modern pentathlon, which was won by American Glenn Morris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oleIfZJ4NZebY9ETjoaZoTXYDLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685'),
  ('380392176951608557', 'Olympiad', 1971, 'Animation', 'Lillian Schwartz', null, null, null, 'Study in motion based on Muybridge’s photographs of man running.', 'Study in motion based on Muybridge’s photographs of man running.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg5MNwi2vOI35c4AHO7Vi6TaLFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147721'),
  ('921926157742122570', 'Olympus Has Fallen', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Antoine Fuqua, Conrad W. Hall, Sean Ryan Jennings', 'Katrin Benedikt, Creighton Rothenberger', 'Gerard Butler, Aaron Eckhart, Finley Jacobsen, Dylan McDermott, Rick Yune, Morgan Freeman, Cole Hauser, Radha Mitchell', 'R', 'When the White House (Secret Service Code: "Olympus") is captured by a terrorist mastermind and the President is kidnapped, disgraced former Presidential guard Mike Banning finds himself trapped within the building. As the national security team scrambles to respond, they are forced to rely on Banning''s inside knowledge to help retake the White House, save the President and avert an even bigger disaster.', 'When the White House (Secret Service Code: "Olympus") is captured by a terrorist mastermind and the President is kidnapped, disgraced former Presidential guard Mike Banning finds himself trapped within the building. As the national security team scrambles to respond, they are forced to rely on Banning''s inside knowledge to help retake the White House, save the President and avert an even bigger disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3GTFGwesNBNd0t1hiLaEk1iqZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117263'),
  ('254827404961767141', 'Om', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Upendra', 'Upendra', 'Shiva Rajkumar, Prema, Sadhu Kokila, Srishanthi, G.V. Shivanand, Upasane Seetharam, Honnavalli Krishna', null, 'Satya, the son of a priest, leads a straightforward life until he meets the girl of his dreams. His love for her drags him into the world of crime, making him lose everyone he is close to.', 'Satya, the son of a priest, leads a straightforward life until he meets the girl of his dreams. His love for her drags him into the world of crime, making him lose everyone he is close to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28yfNSdZ7iDgz1x7BMEuw4mXAnf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357856'),
  ('770069953467470533', 'Om Dar-B-Dar', 1988, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Kamal Swaroop, Gurdeep Singh, Milind Ranade', null, 'Anita Kanwar, Gopi Desai, Lalit Tiwari, Bhairavchandra Sharma, Lakshminarayan Shastri, Ramesh Mathur, Aditya Lakhia, Manish Gupta', null, 'Om, an adolescent boy living in an Indian village, is good at only one thing: holding his breath for a long time. His father Babuji left his government job to dedicate his time to astrology. Fascinated with magic and religion, Om visits a fantasy city and takes a home close to a frog pond.', 'Om, an adolescent boy living in an Indian village, is good at only one thing: holding his breath for a long time. His father Babuji left his government job to dedicate his time to astrology. Fascinated with magic and religion, Om visits a fantasy city and takes a home close to a frog pond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEXzSx9P7f40rntpsRgn1dZegVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242618'),
  ('171983465419242005', 'Om Jai Jagadish', 2002, 'Drama', 'Anupam Kher', null, 'Waheeda Rehman, Anil Kapoor, Fardeen Khan, Abhishek Bachchan, Mahima Chaudhry, Urmila Matondkar, Tara Sharma, Annu Kapoor', null, 'Widowed Mrs. Saraswati Batra (Waheeda Rehman) has brought up three sons with a lot of care and love. Her eldest son Om (Anil Kapoor) is very honest and diligent; her two other sons Jai (Fardeen Khan), and Jagdish (Abhishek Bachchan) also live in the same house. this is their story', 'Widowed Mrs. Saraswati Batra (Waheeda Rehman) has brought up three sons with a lot of care and love. Her eldest son Om (Anil Kapoor) is very honest and diligent; her two other sons Jai (Fardeen Khan), and Jagdish (Abhishek Bachchan) also live in the same house. this is their story', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdKXPLHY2O6Wgx5kNoCLmEEqFbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33146'),
  ('313765742725992383', 'Om Shanti Om', 2007, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Farah Khan, Pooja Desai, Zoa Morani', 'Farah Khan, Mushtaq Sheikh', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Deepika Padukone, Arjun Rampal, Kirron Kher, Shreyas Talpade, Javed Sheikh, Asawari Joshi, Yuvika Chaudhary', 'PG', 'Reincarnated 30 years after being killed in a suspicious on-set fire, a small-time actor is determined to punish the person who ignited the blaze.', 'Reincarnated 30 years after being killed in a suspicious on-set fire, a small-time actor is determined to punish the person who ignited the blaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oArsQTD4bPPMtRjqr03SO9W6phF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8079'),
  ('1102541604089471447', 'Omagh', 2005, 'Drama', 'Pete Travis, Donal Gilligan, Rory Bruen', 'Paul Greengrass, Guy Hibbert', 'Gerard McSorley, Michèle Forbes, Brenda Fricker, Stuart Graham, Peter Ballance, Brendan Coyle, Ian McElhinney, Stanley Townsend', null, 'The movie starts at the 1998 bomb attack by the Real IRA at Omagh, Northern Ireland. The attack killed 31 people. Michael Gallagher one of the relatives of the victims starts an examination to bring the people responsible to court.', 'The movie starts at the 1998 bomb attack by the Real IRA at Omagh, Northern Ireland. The attack killed 31 people. Michael Gallagher one of the relatives of the victims starts an examination to bring the people responsible to court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIvDkfyQldeLXtkuXIcafk1bXma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5413'),
  ('452531000050955483', 'Omar', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Hany Abu-Assad, Ehab Assal', 'Hany Abu-Assad', 'Adam Bakri, Waleed Zuaiter, Leem Lubany, Samer Bisharat, Eyad Hourani, Mousa Habiib Allah, Doraid Liddawi, Adi Krayem', null, 'The drama, the story of three childhood friends and a young woman who are torn apart in their fight for freedom, is billed as the first fully-financed film to come out of the Palestinian cinema industry.', 'The drama, the story of three childhood friends and a young woman who are torn apart in their fight for freedom, is billed as the first fully-financed film to come out of the Palestinian cinema industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzCdtXQYdLPrNr16Ld5ZowavKoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187028'),
  ('790988013255629865', 'Omar & Salma 2', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ahmed ElBadry, Raouf Abdul Aziz', 'Tamer Hosny', 'Tamer Hosny, Mai Ezz ElDein, Ezzat Abu Ouf, Mirhan Hussein, Maysara, Dalia Badr, Reda Hamed, Magdy Badr', null, 'Now parents, Omar and Salma hit some obstacles while raising their two children and staying in love after the honeymoon ends.', 'Now parents, Omar and Salma hit some obstacles while raising their two children and staying in love after the honeymoon ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3T9m6IdrcepbBIwWnCKxqtdvT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57407'),
