  ('947079392534100493', 'Omar Gatlato', 1976, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Merzak Allouache, Smaïl Lakhdar-Hamina', 'Merzak Allouache', 'Boualem Benani, Aziz Degga, Farida Mestoul, Abdelkrim Baba Aissa, Areski Nebti, Abdelkader Chaou, Rabah Leghaa', null, 'Omar, a young man, lives a simple life with his family and suffers from loneliness. His life changes when he tries to bond with a girl he barely knows.', 'Omar, a young man, lives a simple life with his family and suffers from loneliness. His life changes when he tries to bond with a girl he barely knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RIKxlOy61GyHq5DOCHwJABSTEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172319'),
  ('217696201495883802', 'Omar Killed Me', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Roschdy Zem', null, 'Sami Bouajila, Maurice Bénichou, Denis Podalydès, Salomé Stévenin, Nozha Khouadra, Afida Tahri, Yanis Abdellaoui, Ayoub El Mahlili', null, 'In the summer of 1991 an elderly woman Ghislaine Marchal is found murdered in the basement of her home with the message "Omar M''a Tuer" (Omar has kill me) written beside in her own blood. Despite a lack of forensic or DNA evidence, her Moroccan gardener Omar Raddad is found guilty and sentenced to 18 years in a French prison. Shocked by the case, and convinced of his innocence, journalist Pierre-Emmanuel Vaugrenard moves to Nice to investigate, and uncover the truth...', 'In the summer of 1991 an elderly woman Ghislaine Marchal is found murdered in the basement of her home with the message "Omar M''a Tuer" (Omar has kill me) written beside in her own blood. Despite a lack of forensic or DNA evidence, her Moroccan gardener Omar Raddad is found guilty and sentenced to 18 years in a French prison. Shocked by the case, and convinced of his innocence, journalist Pierre-Emmanuel Vaugrenard moves to Nice to investigate, and uncover the truth...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GB43STXPG9zncFZTEXj9vu57EZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68178'),
  ('526371375603353959', 'Ombline', 2012, 'Drama', 'Virginie Saint-Martin, Stéphane Cazes', 'Stéphane Cazes', 'Mélanie Thierry, Nathalie Bécue, Corinne Masiero, Catherine Salée, Dounya Hdia, Gaëlle Jeantet, Marta Corton Vinals, Patrice Bouret', null, 'Ombline, a 20-year-old woman, is sent to prison for three years after committing a violent assault on a police officer. Just when she has lost all hope for the future, she discovers that she is pregnant. The law allows her to rear her newborn for the first 18 months of its life, after which time the child must be given up and placed into state care. Ombline has no intention of surrendering her beloved little boy and is prepared to do anything to convince the authorities that she is capable of rearing the child after she has left prison. As her maternal instincts assert themselves, the young woman finds she has a cause worth fighting for, and an opportunity to rebuild her shattered life…', 'Ombline, a 20-year-old woman, is sent to prison for three years after committing a violent assault on a police officer. Just when she has lost all hope for the future, she discovers that she is pregnant. The law allows her to rear her newborn for the first 18 months of its life, after which time the child must be given up and placed into state care. Ombline has no intention of surrendering her beloved little boy and is prepared to do anything to convince the authorities that she is capable of rearing the child after she has left prison. As her maternal instincts assert themselves, the young woman finds she has a cause worth fighting for, and an opportunity to rebuild her shattered life…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vJglzToaM3A62wASgbzPA2h6Ny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147656'),
  ('801969406218933183', 'Omega Cop', 1990, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Paul Kyriazi', 'Denny Grayson', 'Ronald L. Marchini, Adam West, Jennifer Jostyn, Stuart Whitman, Troy Donahue, D.W. Landingham, Mike Bristow, Sean P. Donahue', null, 'The year is 1999. John Travis is the toughest cop alive... In fact the only cop alive. He and his elite force stand between murderous mutants and the remains of humanity...', 'The year is 1999. John Travis is the toughest cop alive... In fact the only cop alive. He and his elite force stand between murderous mutants and the remains of humanity...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uD1Qv1DfsmlCYOsByE4IuRthip6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56723'),
  ('180422428480725339', 'Omega Doom', 1996, 'Science Fiction', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian', 'Ed Naha', 'Rutger Hauer, Shannon Whirry, Norbert Weisser, Tina Cote, Anna Katarina, Jill Pierce, Simon Poland, Cynthia Ireland', 'PG-13', 'After earth is taken over by an army of robots, the small number of humans left are forced into hiding. In the nuclear winter, only droids walk the face of the earth, in fear of the rumored human resurgence, and in search of a hidden cache of weapons. One robot, his evil circuits destroyed, enters a small town where a robot civil war is taking place.', 'After earth is taken over by an army of robots, the small number of humans left are forced into hiding. In the nuclear winter, only droids walk the face of the earth, in fear of the rumored human resurgence, and in search of a hidden cache of weapons. One robot, his evil circuits destroyed, enters a small town where a robot civil war is taking place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8gSAdGQRxf4eGOSueff1LjZREW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17135'),
  ('720840719716421185', 'Omelia Contadina', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Alice Rohrwacher, JR, Berto', 'Ales Jusifovski', 'Iris Pulvano, Luciano Vergaro, Dario Sforza, Emanuele La Barbera, Elisa Cortese', null, 'A farming community gathers on a plateau on the border of three regions for the funeral of traditional agriculture. It’s a film to ward off the disappearance of a millenary culture.', 'A farming community gathers on a plateau on the border of three regions for the funeral of traditional agriculture. It’s a film to ward off the disappearance of a millenary culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDET3wpW3XoXovWLF6UqDSR6QBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728131'),
  ('785101065285739223', 'Omen', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Luis Alcoriza, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'David Reynoso, Lucha Villa, Eric del Castillo, Fabiola Falcón, Pancho Córdova, Enrique Lucero, Anita Blanch, Carmen Montejo', null, 'While attending the birth of Isabel, the wife of foreigner Felipe, Mama Santos predicts that "something terrible is going to happen in the town." From this omen, calamities will torment the locals.', 'While attending the birth of Isabel, the wife of foreigner Felipe, Mama Santos predicts that "something terrible is going to happen in the town." From this omen, calamities will torment the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqc9bbAwUQx2jzAXemvF0PXLWsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203946'),
  ('138576539601780997', 'Omen', 2023, 'Drama', 'Fabrice Couchard, Eloïse Berteau, Baloji Tshiani', 'Baloji Tshiani', 'Marc Zinga, Yves-Marina Gnahoua, Marcel Otete Kabeya, Eliane Umuhire, Lucie Debay, Denis Mpunga, Bongeziwe Mabandla, Guetty Lembe', null, 'After spending years in Belgium, a young Congolese man returns to his birthplace of Kinshasa to confront the intricacies of his family and culture.', 'After spending years in Belgium, a young Congolese man returns to his birthplace of Kinshasa to confront the intricacies of his family and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HgCEfROW5U3dyBwXgT3ztkOBWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889818'),
  ('1025904083564759343', 'Omen IV: The Awakening', 1991, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Kelsey T. Howard, Rachel Leiterman, Harvey Bernhard', 'Brian Taggert', 'Faye Grant, Michael Woods, Michael Lerner, Madison Mason, Ann Hearn, Jim Byrnes, Don S. Davis, Asia Vieira', 'PG', 'Damien Thorn is dead, but his prophecy is reborn in a mysterious girl named Delia, who is adopted by two attorneys.', 'Damien Thorn is dead, but his prophecy is reborn in a mysterious girl named Delia, who is adopted by two attorneys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRcRyiVRnR1u3LJQL8VMryvyatF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17792'),
  ('331721532535272553', 'Omer the Tourist in Star Trek', 1973, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Özdemir Öğüt, Hulki Saner, Çetin Gürtop', 'Ferdi Merter', 'Sadri Alışık, Erol Amaç, Ferdi Merter, Cemil Şahbaz, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Elif Pektaş, Sule Tinaz, Oytun Şanal', null, 'The spaceship Enterprise under the command of Captain Kirk has embarked on a new mission. They need to receive the reports from Professor Krater, who lives alone with his wife on the planet Orin 7. Mister Spak lands on the planet with a team. However, one of the crew dies unexpectedly. The doctor had difficulty determining the cause of death. The killer is the professor''s wife Nancy. The professor decides to lure a creature from ancient times to the planet with a time machine to save him. Omar, a tourist, is about to be married to a woman he didn''t know at the time. During the wedding ceremony, the machine pulls Omar to Orin 7. The tourist thinks that Omar survived. But the adventure is just beginning.', 'The spaceship Enterprise under the command of Captain Kirk has embarked on a new mission. They need to receive the reports from Professor Krater, who lives alone with his wife on the planet Orin 7. Mister Spak lands on the planet with a team. However, one of the crew dies unexpectedly. The doctor had difficulty determining the cause of death. The killer is the professor''s wife Nancy. The professor decides to lure a creature from ancient times to the planet with a time machine to save him. Omar, a tourist, is about to be married to a woman he didn''t know at the time. During the wedding ceremony, the machine pulls Omar to Orin 7. The tourist thinks that Omar survived. But the adventure is just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWhdubU5pYm9I8KSg7vG0DUHawr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161334'),
  ('972349960411100831', 'Ömerçip', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Zeki Alasya', 'Kemal Kenan Ergen', 'Mehmet Ali Erbil, Aşkın Nur Yengi, Onur Selimbeyoğlu, Zeki Alasya, Suzan Avcı, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Göksel Kortay, Erdal Tosun', null, 'This is the millennium version of the old black and white movies produced by Erler film.. The stories of those movies were like fairy tales to its audiences. Years passed and now we are to witness the the funny story of the rich girl Melek, her boy friend Adnan, the cab driver, their bright son Omer, the sweet Hulusi Bey, Necdet the chef, Kayhan the butler, Suzan the trouble making nanny, Coskun the rapist, Nuri the psychopath, and Onder the thief of hearts!', 'This is the millennium version of the old black and white movies produced by Erler film.. The stories of those movies were like fairy tales to its audiences. Years passed and now we are to witness the the funny story of the rich girl Melek, her boy friend Adnan, the cab driver, their bright son Omer, the sweet Hulusi Bey, Necdet the chef, Kayhan the butler, Suzan the trouble making nanny, Coskun the rapist, Nuri the psychopath, and Onder the thief of hearts!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9si14kEWWuO74PVX2e1kDM3fww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331125'),
  ('572410393187870972', 'Omertà', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Luc Dionne', 'Luc Dionne', 'Michel Côté, Patrick Huard, Rachelle Lefevre, Stéphane Rousseau, René Angélil, Michel Dumont, Paolo Noël, Mélissa Désormeaux-Poulin', null, 'When a worldwide plot to divert gold which was placed in central banks all across North America is investigated, Pierre Gauthier is summoned to lead the inquiry. Gauthier however is soon betrayed, and finds himself going head to head with the "capo" of Montreal Mafia.', 'When a worldwide plot to divert gold which was placed in central banks all across North America is investigated, Pierre Gauthier is summoned to lead the inquiry. Gauthier however is soon betrayed, and finds himself going head to head with the "capo" of Montreal Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avRSXaWaPn5OdcBQwjp5wOTvacl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148864'),
  ('326554843469614010', 'Omertà', 2018, 'Action, Drama', 'Hansal Mehta, Anuj Dhawan', 'Hansal Mehta, Mukul Dev', 'Rajkummar Rao, Timothy Ryan Hickernell, Rajesh Tailang, Rupinder Nagra, Keval Arora, Orvana Ghai, Kallirroi Tziafeta, Harmeet Singh Sawhney', null, 'A dramatization of the complex and dangerous life of Omar Sheikh. A convicted terrorist who many believe had financial connections to 9/11, Sheikh is widely known as the man responsible forthe 2002 kidnapping and murder of Wall Street Journal reporter Daniel Pearl.', 'A dramatization of the complex and dangerous life of Omar Sheikh. A convicted terrorist who many believe had financial connections to 9/11, Sheikh is widely known as the man responsible forthe 2002 kidnapping and murder of Wall Street Journal reporter Daniel Pearl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47YDdPKM5qmuOWjxwOcQJtobpqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475250'),
  ('1052201217592721643', 'OMG 2', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amit Rai, Amalendu Chaudhary, Indu Sharma', 'Amit Rai', 'Pankaj Tripathi, Akshay Kumar, Yami Gautam Dhar, Pavan Malhotra, Arun Govil, Govind Namdeo, Aarush Varma, Geeta Agrawal Sharma', null, 'Life is bliss until one day Kanti Sharan Mudgal’s son Vivek is blamed for immoral conduct and expelled from school. Overwhelmed, Kanti plans to leave town until a divine intervention leads him to seek justice by taking those responsible to court.', 'Life is bliss until one day Kanti Sharan Mudgal’s son Vivek is blamed for immoral conduct and expelled from school. Overwhelmed, Kanti plans to leave town until a divine intervention leads him to seek justice by taking those responsible to court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kApiO3oL6t100aCtkcwEhk2kqgK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888710'),
