  ('569876748851615125', 'One and Four', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jigme Trinley, Lü Songye', 'Jigme Trinley', 'Jinpa, Tenzin Dhargye, Wang Zheng, Kunde, Tsemdo Thar', null, 'It’s the late 1990s in a remote Tibetan forest where poaching is widespread. A ranger is visited by one man after another, all strange...', 'It’s the late 1990s in a remote Tibetan forest where poaching is widespread. A ranger is visited by one man after another, all strange...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JSS2O70l2JpNiQcKD90LDPgzmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878977'),
  ('780583878993705129', 'One and Only', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dong Chengpeng, Qian Tiantian', 'Dong Chengpeng, Su Biao', 'Huang Bo, Wang Yibo, Liu Mintao, Yue Yunpeng, Xiao Shenyang, Chu Xiaoxiang, Song Zuer, Wang Feifei', null, 'Ding Lei, a street dance veteran, invites a young entertainer to join his club. However, they are faced with a series of challenges.', 'Ding Lei, a street dance veteran, invites a young entertainer to join his club. However, they are faced with a series of challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOydVSDGAtb01dr9d97s8bZSFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006485'),
  ('952174976216580607', 'One and Thousand Nights', 2020, 'Drama', 'Élie Girard, Laurent Brunet', 'Élie Girard', 'Aurélien Gabrielli, Raphaël Quenard, Mohammed Sadi, Jonas Bloquet, Antoine Reinartz, Lenny Kefif Pierrel, Natascha Wiese', null, 'Victor, Cyprien and Guillaume have known each other since high school. One day, Victor tells them some news that will put their friendship to the test.', 'Victor, Cyprien and Guillaume have known each other since high school. One day, Victor tells them some news that will put their friendship to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32Ad3kWetycSCY8GxCQqZb7i5Ox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785426'),
  ('625153040582521213', 'One Battle After Another', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime, Comedy', 'Paul Thomas Anderson, Michael Bauman, Adam Somner', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Sean Penn, Chase Infiniti, Benicio del Toro, Regina Hall, Teyana Taylor, Wood Harris, Tony Goldwyn', 'R', 'Washed-up revolutionary Bob exists in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited, self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her, father and daughter both battling the consequences of his past.', 'Washed-up revolutionary Bob exists in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited, self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her, father and daughter both battling the consequences of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbBWwxBht4JFP5PsuJ5onpMqugW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1054867'),
  ('375420293491759977', 'One Body Too Many', 1944, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Fred Jackman Jr., Frank McDonald', 'Maxwell Shane, Winston Miller', 'Jack Haley, Jean Parker, Bela Lugosi, Blanche Yurka, Lyle Talbot, Douglas Fowley, Fay Helm, Lucien Littlefield', 'NR', 'An insurance salesman, Albert Tuttle, is hired as a body guard for a millionaire.', 'An insurance salesman, Albert Tuttle, is hired as a body guard for a millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uds2Nw8jwJlARSbgG8xw9I8jboY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23281'),
  ('644609237178254710', 'One Breath', 2016, 'Drama', 'Christian Zübert, The Chau Ngo', 'Ipek Zübert, Christian Zübert', 'Jördis Triebel, Chara Mata Giannatou, Benjamin Sadler, Apostolis Totsikas, Nike Maria Vassil, Marlen Diekhoff, Ipek Zübert, Isaak Dentler', null, 'A nightmarish crisis occurs after a pregnant young Greek immigrant takes a job as a nanny to a young professional couple, in this stunning drama from Germany’s Christian Zübert.', 'A nightmarish crisis occurs after a pregnant young Greek immigrant takes a job as a nanny to a young professional couple, in this stunning drama from Germany’s Christian Zübert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCyyTF5jvkDRCSXGEu2qev8N9w5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356200'),
  ('226435377874476802', 'One Breath', 2020, 'Drama', 'Elena Hazanova, Ilya Ovsenev', 'Andrey Ivanov, Alyona Alova, Stanislav Gnezdilov', 'Viktoriya Isakova, Maksim Sukhanov, Vladimir Yaglych, Sergey Sosnovsky, Filipp Ershov, Stasya Miloslavskaya, Vladislav Vetrov, Artyom Tkachenko', null, 'Following her divorce, Marina thinks that she’ll never meet love again. Little does she know that one day, she’ll find the love of her life in freediving, one of the most extreme sports in existence, built on diving as deep as possible on a single breath. In the vast, mysterious realm of the sea, Marina not only regains her sense of peace and well being, but also redefines her existence.', 'Following her divorce, Marina thinks that she’ll never meet love again. Little does she know that one day, she’ll find the love of her life in freediving, one of the most extreme sports in existence, built on diving as deep as possible on a single breath. In the vast, mysterious realm of the sea, Marina not only regains her sense of peace and well being, but also redefines her existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ndtcaGu99eMQ74sF9YMOcQ2zzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579647'),
  ('593094746606035332', 'One by One', 1968, 'Western', 'Rafael Romero Marchent', 'Fabrizio Carpi, Odoardo Fiory, Marino Girolami', 'Peter Lee Lawrence, Guglielmo Spoletini, Sydney Chaplin, Dyanik Zurakowska, Eduardo Fajardo, Alfonso Rojas, Aurora Bautista, Lucio De Santis', null, 'Bill learns that his father, during the American Civil War, was accused of theft and killed. Convinced of his innocence, Bill discovers the true robbers.', 'Bill learns that his father, during the American Civil War, was accused of theft and killed. Convinced of his innocence, Bill discovers the true robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzLTRVa7kyHVeCaduUGgxaXt4sV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145382'),
  ('146196296596773919', 'One Cab''s Family', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', 'Rich Hogan, Roy Williams', 'Daws Butler, June Foray', 'NR', 'A happily married pair of taxicabs are delighted when Junior enters their lives, but this delight turns to consternation when he states his ambition to become a hotrodder..', 'A happily married pair of taxicabs are delighted when Junior enters their lives, but this delight turns to consternation when he states his ambition to become a hotrodder..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRexKuKKtPs4z9m9hNYQreaoc4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86747'),
