  ('627668029919403128', 'One Cut of the Dead Spin-Off: In Hollywood', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Yûya Nakaizumi, Takeshi Sone', 'Shinichiro Ueda', 'Yuzuki Akiyama, Sakina Asamori, Nozomi de Lencquesaing, Takuya Fujimura, Ayana Gôda, Takayuki Hamatsu, Manabu Hosoi, Hiroshi Ichihara', null, 'Cast and crew reunite to film a spin-off, this time set in Hollywood, boasting more zealous zombies and beefed up with international characters.', 'Cast and crew reunite to film a spin-off, this time set in Hollywood, boasting more zealous zombies and beefed up with international characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofeIRwBVZqXZgGdUndp6lvYII5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593580'),
  ('739889643037785632', 'One Damned Day at Dawn... Django Meets Sartana!', 1970, 'Western', 'Demofilo Fidani, Franco Villa', 'Demofilo Fidani, Mila Vitelli Valenza', 'Jack Betts, Fabio Testi, Dino Strano, Benito Pacifico, Simonetta Vitelli, Luciano Conti, Roberto Danesi, Attilio Dottesio', null, 'The small desert town of Black City is held in a reign of terror by a nasty gang of criminals lead by the ruthless Bud Willer. Earnest, but inexperienced Sheriff Jack Ronson arrives in town to establish law and order. Mysterious bounty hunter Django helps Ronson out.', 'The small desert town of Black City is held in a reign of terror by a nasty gang of criminals lead by the ruthless Bud Willer. Earnest, but inexperienced Sheriff Jack Ronson arrives in town to establish law and order. Mysterious bounty hunter Django helps Ronson out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZOXraUmUAGhr9TuWrzP4zUMK9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115353'),
  ('328555031688786758', 'One Dark Night', 1982, 'Horror', 'Tom McLoughlin, Hal Trussell', 'Michael Hawes, Tom McLoughlin', 'Meg Tilly, Melissa Newman, Robin Evans, Leslie Speights, Donald Hotton, Adam West, E. G. Daily, David Mason Daniels', 'PG', 'A strange man named Karl Rhamarevich dies shortly after discovering a way to become even more powerful in death through telekinesis. On the night of his burial in a crypt, Julie is to spend the night there as part of an initiation rite, supervised by two other girls. The crypt becomes a scene of horror as Raymar returns to life and deploys his horrifying telekinetic powers.', 'A strange man named Karl Rhamarevich dies shortly after discovering a way to become even more powerful in death through telekinesis. On the night of his burial in a crypt, Julie is to spend the night there as part of an initiation rite, supervised by two other girls. The crypt becomes a scene of horror as Raymar returns to life and deploys his horrifying telekinetic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df0WGZyEBNylPvLKX4rqKKYS6ha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37935'),
  ('219176780651113663', 'One Day', 1997, 'Animation', 'Marie Paccou', null, 'Christine Gagnieux', null, 'Originating from the filmmaker’s childhood confusion over an English expression regarding sex, Marie Paccou’s 1998 animation is the absurd, yet emotive tale of a woman who wakes one day to find a small man growing out of her abdomen.', 'Originating from the filmmaker’s childhood confusion over an English expression regarding sex, Marie Paccou’s 1998 animation is the absurd, yet emotive tale of a woman who wakes one day to find a small man growing out of her abdomen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6JcHq3qACtrGj4kIICkGcnNKqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71053'),
  ('437430448078178735', 'One Day', 2010, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Feng Hsin-hua, Hou Chi-jan', 'Hou Chi-jan', 'Nikki Hsieh, Bryan Shu-Hao Chang, Gwen Yao, Yuan Shanshan', null, 'A woman is transported into a world as strange and beautiful as her dreams in this fantasy. Singing, who comes from a family of poor shopkeepers, earns her living as a cleaning woman on a ferry that services a military base. Singing has a recurring dream in which she meets a handsome stranger who speaks in language she cannot understand, and one day on the ferry she meets Tsai Hsien-tsung, a soldier who resembles the man in her dreams. The soldier is immediately smitten with Singing, and when the power goes out on the ferry, the two are thrown into a strange netherworld where they sail to South America on a deserted vessel as Singing loses her heart to the military man.', 'A woman is transported into a world as strange and beautiful as her dreams in this fantasy. Singing, who comes from a family of poor shopkeepers, earns her living as a cleaning woman on a ferry that services a military base. Singing has a recurring dream in which she meets a handsome stranger who speaks in language she cannot understand, and one day on the ferry she meets Tsai Hsien-tsung, a soldier who resembles the man in her dreams. The soldier is immediately smitten with Singing, and when the power goes out on the ferry, the two are thrown into a strange netherworld where they sail to South America on a deserted vessel as Singing loses her heart to the military man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zKryl9PknGGZ92TntwMxfOuzKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50718'),
  ('275000922810881046', 'One Day', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lone Scherfig, Denis Schnegg, Maj-Britt La Cour', 'David Nicholls', 'Anne Hathaway, Jim Sturgess, Tom Mison, Jodie Whittaker, Rafe Spall, Patricia Clarkson, Ken Stott, Romola Garai', 'PG-13', 'A romantic comedy centered on Dexter and Emma, who first meet during their graduation in 1988 and proceed to keep in touch regularly. The film follows what they do on July 15 annually, usually doing something together.', 'A romantic comedy centered on Dexter and Emma, who first meet during their graduation in 1988 and proceed to keep in touch regularly. The film follows what they do on July 15 annually, usually doing something together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9jMwSg4IavdD8wqdYnyW5w3Mvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51828'),
  ('563072818650029492', 'One Day', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Siwawut Sewatanon, Parama Malakul Na Ayudhaya, Siwawut Sewatanon', 'Banjong Pisanthanakun, Chantavit Dhanasevi, Nontra Kumwong', 'Chantavit Dhanasevi, Nittha Jirayungyurn, Theerapat Sajakul, Prim Bulakul, Kris Srepoomseth, Somyot Matures, Suttatip Wutchaipradit, Rermthon Kemapech', null, 'A woman suffers from a rare form of temporary amnesia, lasting for a day. Her shy colleague, who is secretly in love with her, tells her that they are a couple in order to experience being with her for just one day.', 'A woman suffers from a rare form of temporary amnesia, lasting for a day. Her shy colleague, who is secretly in love with her, tells her that they are a couple in order to experience being with her for just one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbYj8XuzuXTDkM26KMYeOk4mNga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420541'),
  ('886922745795798317', 'One Day', 2017, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Lee Yoon-ki, Choi Sang-ho', null, 'Kim Nam-gil, Chun Woo-hee, Jung Sun-kyung, Im Hwa-young, Park Hee-von, Yoon Je-moon, Kim Ye-joon, Kim Jung-hyun', null, 'A man, who witnessed his wife''s suicide, gradually cures his emotional scars through a fateful encounter with the spirit of a woman in coma.', 'A man, who witnessed his wife''s suicide, gradually cures his emotional scars through a fateful encounter with the spirit of a woman in coma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9z07Xth5VLQYmc5RbrfiStbcIBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446138'),
  ('913841128978960442', 'One Day a Man Bought a House', 1998, 'Animation', 'Pyotr Sapegin', 'Pyotr Sapegin', 'Odd Børretzen', null, 'A man buys a house on a hill. A rat was there first, and proves to be unusually difficult to remove; it seems to think all the man''s attempts to kill it are actually gifts. It loves the taste of the poison, thinks the trap is a sculpture, and so forth.', 'A man buys a house on a hill. A rat was there first, and proves to be unusually difficult to remove; it seems to think all the man''s attempts to kill it are actually gifts. It loves the taste of the poison, thinks the trap is a sculpture, and so forth.', null, 'tmdb:movie:224447'),
  ('258831081347004433', 'One Day as a Lion', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Swab, Will Stone', 'Scott Caan', 'Scott Caan, Frank Grillo, Marianne Rendón, J.K. Simmons, Taryn Manning, George Carroll, Virginia Madsen, Billy Blair', 'R', 'Jackie Powers will stop at nothing to prevent his son from following him into a life of crime. With his mob employer in pursuit, a chance encounter at a roadside diner charts a new path.', 'Jackie Powers will stop at nothing to prevent his son from following him into a life of crime. With his mob employer in pursuit, a chance encounter at a roadside diner charts a new path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxSKca4dNlk7O7PMiEYT203vlIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070777'),
  ('473626606554135414', 'One Day in a Life', 2008, 'Drama', 'Stefano Tummolini', null, 'Antonio Merone, Lucia Mascino, Francesco Grifoni, Chiara Francini, Tiziana Avarista, Mario Grossi, Francesco Zecca, Francesco D''Aiello', null, 'Salvatore is a handsome man edging into middle age who spends his days savoring the beauty of the Italian seaside. One morning, Salvatore is taking in the sunrise over the dunes when he meets a beautiful woman, leading to a romantic interlude between them. It would seem to be an encouraging way to start the day, but Salvatore and his new lover soon happen upon a group of beachcombers who engage them in a conversation about love, philosophy and the future. What began as a beautiful day takes a subtle, unexpected turn and Salvatore begins contemplating the uncertain path of his life and wondering where he could go from here.', 'Salvatore is a handsome man edging into middle age who spends his days savoring the beauty of the Italian seaside. One morning, Salvatore is taking in the sunrise over the dunes when he meets a beautiful woman, leading to a romantic interlude between them. It would seem to be an encouraging way to start the day, but Salvatore and his new lover soon happen upon a group of beachcombers who engage them in a conversation about love, philosophy and the future. What began as a beautiful day takes a subtle, unexpected turn and Salvatore begins contemplating the uncertain path of his life and wondering where he could go from here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p39qg0znPtIkStoCneej4wd8KSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115096'),
  ('798461444955453148', 'One Day in Europe', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Hannes Stöhr, İlker Çatak', 'Hannes Stöhr', 'Megan Gay, Luidmila Tsvetkova, Andrey Sokolov, Florian Lukas, Erdal Yıldız, Miguel de Lira, Péter Scherer, Boris Arquier', null, 'One day in Europe shows stories set in four European countries. All of them involve thievery in some way or the other. The protagonists are strangers in the respective country. For none of them their stay turns out as planned.', 'One day in Europe shows stories set in four European countries. All of them involve thievery in some way or the other. The protagonists are strangers in the respective country. For none of them their stay turns out as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKNUDZy2L2IbPifjdbaswYWRJ34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9047'),
  ('68243167103741094', 'One Day in September', 1999, 'Documentary, History', 'Kevin Macdonald', null, 'Michael Douglas, Ankie Spitzer, Jamal Al Gashey, Gerald Seymour, Axel Springer, Gad Zahari, Shmuel Lalkin, Manfred Schreiber', 'R', 'The full story of the 1972 Munich Olympics Massacre and the Israeli revenge operation ''Wrath of God.'' The 1972 Munich Olympics were interrupted by Palestinian terrorists taking Israeli athletes hostage. Besides footage taken at the time, we see interviews with the surviving terrorist, Jamal Al Gashey, and various officials detailing exactly how the police, lacking an anti-terrorist squad and turning down help from the Israelis, botched the operation.', 'The full story of the 1972 Munich Olympics Massacre and the Israeli revenge operation ''Wrath of God.'' The 1972 Munich Olympics were interrupted by Palestinian terrorists taking Israeli athletes hostage. Besides footage taken at the time, we see interviews with the surviving terrorist, Jamal Al Gashey, and various officials detailing exactly how the police, lacking an anti-terrorist squad and turning down help from the Israelis, botched the operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsxtkcidi7flgxWERBSnwtyH1JJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34045'),
  ('1073418040849279856', 'One Day in the Life of Andrei Arsenevich', 1999, 'TV Movie, Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Chris Marker', 'Chris Marker', 'Andrei Tarkovsky, Marina Vlady, Eva Mattes, Alexandra Stewart, Margarita Terekhova, Michał Leszczyłowski, Valérie Mairesse, Chris Marker', null, 'Chris Marker’s portrait of Russian filmmaker Andrei Tarkovsky documents the director at work on his final film, The Sacrifice, during the last year of his life. Interweaving behind-the-scenes footage with excerpts from Tarkovsky’s earlier works, Marker crafts a moving reflection on the artist’s vision, methods, and enduring legacy.', 'Chris Marker’s portrait of Russian filmmaker Andrei Tarkovsky documents the director at work on his final film, The Sacrifice, during the last year of his life. Interweaving behind-the-scenes footage with excerpts from Tarkovsky’s earlier works, Marker crafts a moving reflection on the artist’s vision, methods, and enduring legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjmIEFMoKHUbkYS0inZgQ1S3RiP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137196'),
  ('952778410265077733', 'One Day More', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Carnera, Marcella Libonati, Massimo Venier', 'Michele Pellegrini, Federica Pontremoli, Massimo Venier', 'Fabio Volo, Isabella Ragonese, Camilla Filippi, Pietro Ragusa, Irene Ferri, Roberto Citran, Lino Toffolo, Luciana Littizzetto', null, 'Giacomo is a 40-year-old man who works for a big company in Milan. To avoid working on weekends, he lies about having a girlfriend whose character he creates based upon a girl he sees every morning.', 'Giacomo is a 40-year-old man who works for a big company in Milan. To avoid working on weekends, he lies about having a girlfriend whose character he creates based upon a girl he sees every morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Q2jNCr38n4T09Wdr87v77hw6pa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79836'),
  ('1000722331161703781', 'One Day My Father Will Come', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Martin Valente', 'Martin Valente, Gianguido Spinelli', 'Gérard Jugnot, François Berléand, Olivia Ruiz, Jamie Bamber, Laurence Arné, Anne-Cécile Crapie, Laurent Mouton, Hubert Saint-Macary', null, 'Bernard - advanced rich snob, Gustave - the poor prodigal alcoholic. Both are absolutely sure that they are the fathers of Chloe and go along on her quest. Imagine their surprise when it turns out that Chloe''s father''s place is already occupied by an imposter...', 'Bernard - advanced rich snob, Gustave - the poor prodigal alcoholic. Both are absolutely sure that they are the fathers of Chloe and go along on her quest. Imagine their surprise when it turns out that Chloe''s father''s place is already occupied by an imposter...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Z6aBJTYnrb6MLMhndjA4JHvOQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103126'),
  ('301689671744225283', 'One Day We''ll Talk About Today', 2020, 'Drama', 'Angga Dwimas Sasongko, Widya Fajriah, Yadi Sugandi', 'Jenny Jusuf, Angga Dwimas Sasongko, Melarissa Sjarief', 'Rachel Amanda, Rio Dewanto, Sheila Dara Aisha, Donny Damara, Susan Bachtiar, Oka Antara, Niken Anjani, Ardhito Pramono', 'G', 'Harboring a deep secret, a seemingly happy family confronts the trauma of years past as a clash between generations threatens to separate them.', 'Harboring a deep secret, a seemingly happy family confronts the trauma of years past as a clash between generations threatens to separate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n84V5KItbDoTQiWSzxGVbixnpzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613710'),
  ('603077788423884124', 'One Day with the Devil', 1945, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Jaime Salvador', 'Cantinflas, Andrés Soler, Miguel Arenas, Susana Cora, Hernán Vera, Rafael Icardo, Óscar Pulido, Manuel Dondé', null, 'Cantinflas, on a drunken night, becomes Army soldier. Soon, he meets the Devil who tries to make it an evil being.', 'Cantinflas, on a drunken night, becomes Army soldier. Soon, he meets the Devil who tries to make it an evil being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyaahRe35jJTmwN91PUsL92vhjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41305'),
  ('147879777977791161', 'One Day, You Will Reach the Sea', 2022, 'Drama', 'Tai Ouchi, Ryutaro Nakagawa', 'Ryutaro Nakagawa, Eiji Umehara', 'Yukino Kishii, Minami Hamabe, Yosuke Sugino, Haya Nakazaki, Mayu Tsuruta, Tomoko Nakajima, Ken Mitsuishi, Yuzumi Shintani', null, 'This work is a 12-year story of Mana, a woman who cannot accept the death of her best friend, staring at her as she tries to step forward while having deep sorrow.', 'This work is a 12-year story of Mana, a woman who cannot accept the death of her best friend, staring at her as she tries to step forward while having deep sorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SlX5FeFarhW4GhqqmCvlRtbkbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923837'),
  ('1135837964171723068', 'One Deadly Summer', 1983, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Jean Becker, Étienne Becker', 'Sébastien Japrisot', 'Isabelle Adjani, Alain Souchon, Suzanne Flon, Jenny Clève, Maria Machado, Evelyne Didi, Jean Gaven, François Cluzet', 'R', 'In spring 1976, a 19-year-old beauty, her German-born mother, and her crippled father move to the town of a firefighter nicknamed Pin-Pon. Everyone notices the provocative Eliane. She singles out Pin-Pon and soon is crying on his shoulder (she''s myopic and hates her reputation as a dunce and as easy); she moves in with him, knits baby clothes, and plans their wedding. Is this love or some kind of plot? She asks Pin-Pon''s mother and aunt about the piano in the barn: who delivered it on a November night in 1955? Why does she want to know, and what does it have to do with her mother''s sorrows, her father''s injury, this quick marriage, and the last name on her birth certificate?', 'In spring 1976, a 19-year-old beauty, her German-born mother, and her crippled father move to the town of a firefighter nicknamed Pin-Pon. Everyone notices the provocative Eliane. She singles out Pin-Pon and soon is crying on his shoulder (she''s myopic and hates her reputation as a dunce and as easy); she moves in with him, knits baby clothes, and plans their wedding. Is this love or some kind of plot? She asks Pin-Pon''s mother and aunt about the piano in the barn: who delivered it on a November night in 1955? Why does she want to know, and what does it have to do with her mother''s sorrows, her father''s injury, this quick marriage, and the last name on her birth certificate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVShoNWphKc5txc3sfl6Uf8OU92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9041'),
  ('469307717278032832', 'One December Night', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Kristoffer Carrillo, Clare Niederpruem, Bruno Michels', null, 'Eloise Mumford, Brett Dalton, Jasmine Forsberg, Andrew Durand, Beth Fowler, Didi Conn, Bruce Campbell, Peter Gallagher', 'G', 'Two music managers must put their history aside to oversee the televised reunion performance of their rock star fathers with a fractured past.', 'Two music managers must put their history aside to oversee the televised reunion performance of their rock star fathers with a fractured past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtzju1ZyZOEC6Vr29zqYaxfJAhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876444'),
  ('944344284151873078', 'One Desire', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jerry Hopper, Maury Gertsman', 'Lawrence Roman, Robert Blees', 'Anne Baxter, Rock Hudson, Julie Adams, Carl Benton Reid, Natalie Wood, William Hopper, Betty Garde, Barry Curtis', null, 'The "one desire" of ex-gambler Clint Saunders and bar woman Tacey Cromwell is to escape their shady former lives and settle down to respectability. With Clint''s younger brother and an orphaned girl in tow, the couple moves to a Colorado mining town where their love is tested by Judith Watrous, daughter of the town banker, who has her sights on Clint.', 'The "one desire" of ex-gambler Clint Saunders and bar woman Tacey Cromwell is to escape their shady former lives and settle down to respectability. With Clint''s younger brother and an orphaned girl in tow, the couple moves to a Colorado mining town where their love is tested by Judith Watrous, daughter of the town banker, who has her sights on Clint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NLRDKTZtW4wlUjSQQeob6sgWuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130629'),
  ('96208109184604490', 'One Direction: This Is Us', 2013, 'Documentary, Music', 'Morgan Spurlock, Neil Harvey', null, 'Harry Styles, Zayn Malik, Niall Horan, Louis Tomlinson, Liam Payne, Simon Cowell, Martin Scorsese, Chris Rock', 'PG', '"One Direction: This Is Us" is a captivating and intimate all-access look at life on the road for the global music phenomenon. Weaved with stunning live concert footage, this inspiring feature film tells the remarkable story of Niall, Zayn, Liam, Harry and Louis'' meteoric rise to fame, from their humble hometown beginnings and competing on the X-Factor, to conquering the world and performing at London’s famed O2 Arena. Hear it from the boys themselves and see through their own eyes what it''s really like to be One Direction.', '"One Direction: This Is Us" is a captivating and intimate all-access look at life on the road for the global music phenomenon. Weaved with stunning live concert footage, this inspiring feature film tells the remarkable story of Niall, Zayn, Liam, Harry and Louis'' meteoric rise to fame, from their humble hometown beginnings and competing on the X-Factor, to conquering the world and performing at London’s famed O2 Arena. Hear it from the boys themselves and see through their own eyes what it''s really like to be One Direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b720e7DW3nqRJaUH9xpTtvYhnUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164558'),
  ('351240141815906395', 'One Direction: Up All Night - The Live Tour', 2012, 'Music', 'Andy Saunders', null, 'Harry Styles, Zayn Malik, Liam Payne, Niall Horan, Louis Tomlinson, Josh Devine, Dan Richards, Jon Shone', null, 'Up All Night: The Live Tour is a DVD release from the British-Irish boy band One Direction, which was released on 28 May 2012. The video concert DVD was recorded as part of One Direction''s Up All Night Tour at the International Centre in Bournemouth, includes songs from their multi-platinum debut album Up All Night and five covers, including "I Gotta Feeling", "Stereo Hearts", "Valerie", "Torn" and "Use Somebody".', 'Up All Night: The Live Tour is a DVD release from the British-Irish boy band One Direction, which was released on 28 May 2012. The video concert DVD was recorded as part of One Direction''s Up All Night Tour at the International Centre in Bournemouth, includes songs from their multi-platinum debut album Up All Night and five covers, including "I Gotta Feeling", "Stereo Hearts", "Valerie", "Torn" and "Use Somebody".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evC6gDZCufGYMkLFTRbDe07UG8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111349'),
  ('1066330533957974510', 'One Direction: Where We Are - The Concert Film', 2014, 'Music, Documentary', 'Paul Dugdale', null, 'Harry Styles, Zayn Malik, Liam Payne, Niall Horan, Louis Tomlinson', 'PG', 'Where We Are: Live from San Siro Stadium features the entire 23 track concert filmed at San Siro Stadium in Milan in June 2014, as well as 24 minutes of bonus content including backstage footage of One Direction and their crew.', 'Where We Are: Live from San Siro Stadium features the entire 23 track concert filmed at San Siro Stadium in Milan in June 2014, as well as 24 minutes of bonus content including backstage footage of One Direction and their crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b8DHnN9R8lRMbflfnNAV87qGZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283559'),
  ('375054130852076069', 'One Down, Two to Go', 1982, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Fred Williamson, James Lemmo', 'Fred Williamson', 'Fred Williamson, Jim Brown, Jim Kelly, Richard Roundtree, Paula Sills, Laura Loftus, Joe Spinell, Tom Signorelli', 'R', 'A pair of tough cops go after the mob who jinxed the martial arts tournament and injured their buddy.', 'A pair of tough cops go after the mob who jinxed the martial arts tournament and injured their buddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hK4BJHgN5gzlkL5tuJdwPrpGTW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96448'),
  ('929295690052712151', 'One Droopy Knight', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Michael Lah', null, 'Bill Thompson', null, 'Sir Droopalot and Sir Butchalot (Droopy and Butch) vie with each other to kill a dragon that is terrorizing their kingdom. Whomever vanquishes the dragon will marry the king''s daughter.', 'Sir Droopalot and Sir Butchalot (Droopy and Butch) vie with each other to kill a dragon that is terrorizing their kingdom. Whomever vanquishes the dragon will marry the king''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lkHcXaS4RQxjw9UpSfltkihAsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144239'),
  ('919021992957409593', 'One Eight Seven', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ericson Core, Kevin Reynolds', 'Scott Yagemann', 'Samuel L. Jackson, John Heard, Kelly Rowan, Clifton Collins Jr., Tony Plana, Karina Arroyave, Lobo Sebastian, Jack Kehler', 'R', 'After surviving a stabbing by a student, teacher Trevor Garfield moves from New York to Los Angeles. There, he resumes teaching as a substitute teacher.', 'After surviving a stabbing by a student, teacher Trevor Garfield moves from New York to Los Angeles. There, he resumes teaching as a substitute teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPmmyspi1MZBItSvfx40qwep8ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6072'),
  ('612629325747150028', 'One False Move', 1991, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Carl Franklin, James L. Carter, Tony Schwartz', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Tom Epperson', 'Bill Paxton, Cynda Williams, Billy Bob Thornton, Michael Beach, Jim Metzler, Earl Billings, Natalie Canerday, Robert Ginnaven', 'R', 'Following a series of drug deals and murders, three criminals -- Fantasia, Ray Malcolm and Pluto -- travel from Los Angeles to Houston, finally arriving in a small Arkansas town to go into hiding. Two detectives from the LAPD, who are already on the case, contact the town''s sheriff, Dale Dixon, to alert him of the fugitives'' presence in the area. Underestimating Dixon, the criminals have no idea what they are about to face.', 'Following a series of drug deals and murders, three criminals -- Fantasia, Ray Malcolm and Pluto -- travel from Los Angeles to Houston, finally arriving in a small Arkansas town to go into hiding. Two detectives from the LAPD, who are already on the case, contact the town''s sheriff, Dale Dixon, to alert him of the fugitives'' presence in the area. Underestimating Dixon, the criminals have no idea what they are about to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5xCkGw4jutMcc8nmWLKNzbDKht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21128'),
  ('122459210781352500', 'One Fast Move', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Kelly Blatz, Luca Del Puppo', 'Kelly Blatz', 'KJ Apa, Eric Dane, Maia Reficco, Edward James Olmos, Austin North, Jackson Hurst, Adam Thomas Ziemba, Libby Blake', 'R', 'A dishonorably discharged soldier seeks out his estranged father to help him pursue his dream of becoming a professional motorcycle racer. While training, he meets a small-town, aspiring singer and a motorcycle shop owner who begin to break down the walls his father''s absence had built up.', 'A dishonorably discharged soldier seeks out his estranged father to help him pursue his dream of becoming a professional motorcycle racer. While training, he meets a small-town, aspiring singer and a motorcycle shop owner who begin to break down the walls his father''s absence had built up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdBUjfbdr1ymS0kycAT7qguOmWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1281826'),
  ('597311458653729312', 'One Fine Day', 1996, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Hoffman, Oliver Stapleton', 'Terrel Seltzer, Ellen Simon', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, George Clooney, Mae Whitman, Alex D. Linz, Charles Durning, Jon Robin Baitz, Ellen Greene, Amanda Peet', 'PG', 'Melanie Parker, an architect and mother of Sammy, and Jack Taylor, a newspaper columnist and father of Maggie, are both divorced. They meet one morning when overwhelmed Jack is left unexpectedly with Maggie and forgets that Melanie was to take her to school. As a result, both children miss their school field trip and are stuck with the parents. The two adults project their negative stereotypes of ex-spouses on each other, but end up needing to rely on each other to watch the children as each must save his job. Humor is added by Sammy''s propensity for lodging objects in his nose and Maggie''s tendency to wander.', 'Melanie Parker, an architect and mother of Sammy, and Jack Taylor, a newspaper columnist and father of Maggie, are both divorced. They meet one morning when overwhelmed Jack is left unexpectedly with Maggie and forgets that Melanie was to take her to school. As a result, both children miss their school field trip and are stuck with the parents. The two adults project their negative stereotypes of ex-spouses on each other, but end up needing to rely on each other to watch the children as each must save his job. Humor is added by Sammy''s propensity for lodging objects in his nose and Maggie''s tendency to wander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NiRRR7JDNHOr21JNoGRxPWh9vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7300'),
  ('302388846226559491', 'One Fine Day', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Le Guay', 'Olivier Dazat, Philippe Le Guay', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Constance Dollé, Catherine Chevallier, Bernard Bloch, Anne Consigny, Manuela Gourary, Anne Le Ny, Rufus', null, 'François Berthier’s life is a series of unfortunate events. One day, however, a miracle occurs for François and his expected misfortune is changed to never-ending luck.', 'François Berthier’s life is a series of unfortunate events. One day, however, a miracle occurs for François and his expected misfortune is changed to never-ending luck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BVEKW1ye0XJONS3hb4bbgTA2XP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13044'),
  ('871368573694004481', 'One Fine Morning', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Clémence Catto, Thomas Colban, Marie Doller', 'Mia Hansen-Løve', 'Léa Seydoux, Pascal Greggory, Melvil Poupaud, Nicole Garcia, Camille Leban Martins, Sarah Le Picard, Pierre Meunier, Fejria Deliba', 'R', 'With a father suffering from neurodegenerative disease, a young woman lives with her eight-year-old daughter. While struggling to secure a decent nursing home, she runs into an unavailable friend with whom she embarks on an affair.', 'With a father suffering from neurodegenerative disease, a young woman lives with her eight-year-old daughter. While struggling to secure a decent nursing home, she runs into an unavailable friend with whom she embarks on an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekqrjI2w1xl7Q3OdexkFLz38BG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747779'),
  ('93679144975360507', 'One Fine Spring Day', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hur Jin-ho, Ryu Jang-ha, Kim Hyung-koo', 'Hur Jin-ho, Ryu Jang-ha, Lee Suk-yeon', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Lee Young-ae, Baek Seong-hee, Park In-hwan, Shin Shin-ae, Baek Jong-hak, Lee Moon-sik, Son Young-soon', null, 'A recording engineer falls for a radio announcer after they work together to capture sounds of the natural world.', 'A recording engineer falls for a radio announcer after they work together to capture sounds of the natural world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p31oIzxbbUcbxvUDsD4VuC2chyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95453'),
  ('947834838292559930', 'One Flew Over the Cuckoo''s Nest', 1975, 'Drama', 'Miloš Forman, Haskell Wexler, Irby Smith', 'Lawrence Hauben, Bo Goldman', 'Jack Nicholson, Brad Dourif, Louise Fletcher, Danny DeVito, William Redfield, Scatman Crothers, Christopher Lloyd, Will Sampson', 'R', 'A petty criminal fakes insanity to serve his sentence in a mental ward rather than prison. He soon finds himself as a leader to the other patients—and an enemy to the cruel, domineering nurse who runs the ward.', 'A petty criminal fakes insanity to serve his sentence in a mental ward rather than prison. He soon finds himself as a leader to the other patients—and an enemy to the cruel, domineering nurse who runs the ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjWsMh72V6d8KRLV4EOoSJLT1H7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510'),
  ('201301096876123737', 'One Foot in Heaven', 1941, 'Drama', 'Irving Rapper, Charles Rosher', 'Casey Robinson, Hartzell Spence', 'Fredric March, Martha Scott, Beulah Bondi, Gene Lockhart, Elisabeth Fraser, Harry Davenport, Laura Hope Crews, Grant Mitchell', 'NR', 'Episodic look at the life of a minister and his family as they move from one parish to another.', 'Episodic look at the life of a minister and his family as they move from one parish to another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsQkW4kgaJME7emvrZfIpCkAT6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84086'),
  ('1128205953808992526', 'One Foot in Hell', 1960, 'Western', 'James B. Clark', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Alan Ladd, Don Murray, Dan O''Herlihy, Dolores Michaels, Barry Coe, Larry Gates, Karl Swenson, John Alexander', null, 'Mitch Barrett becomes embittered because his wife is allowed to die when he can''t pay for the medicine she needs. The remorseful townspeople hire Mitch to be a deputy sheriff, thereby enabling him to plot an elaborate bank robbery with the help of an artist, a pickpocket, a gunslinger and a bar-girl.', 'Mitch Barrett becomes embittered because his wife is allowed to die when he can''t pay for the medicine she needs. The remorseful townspeople hire Mitch to be a deputy sheriff, thereby enabling him to plot an elaborate bank robbery with the help of an artist, a pickpocket, a gunslinger and a bar-girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlHc2pdYFolQxsdC90vbV5yhtLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118697'),
  ('840203523205910344', 'One for All', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mimmo Calopresti, Stefano Falivene', 'Mimmo Calopresti, Monica Zapelli', 'Giorgio Panariello, Isabella Ferrari, Thomas Trabacchi, Fabrizio Ferracane, Lorenzo Barone, Irene Casagrande, Priscillia Martin, Gianfilippo Grasso', null, 'The relationship between three lifelong friends is put to the test by a long-ago secret and a present-day crime committed by one of their children.', 'The relationship between three lifelong friends is put to the test by a long-ago secret and a present-day crime committed by one of their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8derPZQDd3nVi4qnm9EZyRvGBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370080'),
  ('260574907944541708', 'One for All', 2020, 'Drama', 'Bet Rourich, David Ilundain, Carles Curt', 'Coral Cruz, Valentina Viso', 'David Verdaguer, Patricia López Arnaiz, Clara Segura, Ana Labordeta, Jorge Pobes, Valèria Endrino, Betsy Túrnez, Miguel Ángel Tirado', null, 'A substitute teacher takes on a job as a year 6 class teacher in a village he does not know. He has to help a student adjust back into school, although none of his classmates want him there.', 'A substitute teacher takes on a job as a year 6 class teacher in a village he does not know. He has to help a student adjust back into school, although none of his classmates want him there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JkJdOFx9jG3qQO4JI5kt3X0Yn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651391'),
  ('62300840907101569', 'One for the Money', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Julie Anne Robinson, James Whitaker', 'Stacy Sherman, Liz Brixius, Karen Ray', 'Katherine Heigl, Jason O''Mara, Daniel Sunjata, John Leguizamo, Sherri Shepherd, Debbie Reynolds, Patrick Fischler, Harry O''Toole', 'PG-13', 'An unemployed lingerie buyer convinces her bail bondsman cousin to give her a shot as a bounty hunter. Her first assignment is to track down a former cop on the run for murder – the same man who broke her heart years before. With the help of some friends and the best bounty hunter in the business, she slowly learns what it takes to be a true bounty hunter.', 'An unemployed lingerie buyer convinces her bail bondsman cousin to give her a shot as a bounty hunter. Her first assignment is to track down a former cop on the run for murder – the same man who broke her heart years before. With the help of some friends and the best bounty hunter in the business, she slowly learns what it takes to be a true bounty hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeltLl5jLUl9d96tpKkCAWu4JWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54054'),
  ('527319127053101133', 'One for the Road', 2009, 'Drama', 'Philippe Godeau, Hubert Engammare, Stéphane Manaranche', 'Agnès de Sacy, Philippe Godeau', 'François Cluzet, Mélanie Thierry, Michel Vuillermoz, Anne Consigny, Éric Naggar, Marilyne Canto, Bernard Campan, Lionnel Astier', null, 'Herve, the head of a press agency, is traveling fast down a road headed in only one direction: self-destruction. He is an alcoholic, and his drinking is wrecking his marriage, family and career. In desperation and still in denial, he checks into a detox clinic in Geneva, his last-chance saloon. There he meets a group of fellow sufferers and one person in particular, a young woman named Magali, who help him to see life other than through the bottom of an empty bottle.', 'Herve, the head of a press agency, is traveling fast down a road headed in only one direction: self-destruction. He is an alcoholic, and his drinking is wrecking his marriage, family and career. In desperation and still in denial, he checks into a detox clinic in Geneva, his last-chance saloon. There he meets a group of fellow sufferers and one person in particular, a young woman named Magali, who help him to see life other than through the bottom of an empty bottle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8ywKSabFCfADWgGkeRI39kOlf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55355'),
  ('787642880441780618', 'One for the Road', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Eva López Sánchez', null, 'Juan Pablo Campa, Sebastián Hiriart, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Gabino Rodríguez, Liz Gallardo, Montserrat de León, Alberto Guerra, Lisa Owen', null, 'Friday night in Mexico City... guided by three different ways of understanding the world, 20-year-olds, Juan, Rodrigo and Christian live after-hour adventures of friendship, love, and respect in a city marked by social differences.', 'Friday night in Mexico City... guided by three different ways of understanding the world, 20-year-olds, Juan, Rodrigo and Christian live after-hour adventures of friendship, love, and respect in a city marked by social differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjVX1dQaMfOHh1fxvMLRiAktoZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186074'),
  ('1017869326412357209', 'One for the Road', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jack Zagha Kababie', 'Jack Zagha Kababie, Yossy Zagha, David Desola', 'José Carlos Ruiz, Eduardo Manzano, Luis Bayardo, Pedro Weber ''Chatanuga'', Magda Vizcaíno', null, 'Three octogenarians set out on a trip in order to fulfill the dying wish of a lifelong friend, in spite of the disapproval of their families and the limitations of their advanced age. Along the way, they find themselves embroiled in a series of comedic misadventures and meet a cast of colorful characters. Their journey fundamentally alters each characters'' sense of self and their place in the world. There is, indeed, life after 80.', 'Three octogenarians set out on a trip in order to fulfill the dying wish of a lifelong friend, in spite of the disapproval of their families and the limitations of their advanced age. Along the way, they find themselves embroiled in a series of comedic misadventures and meet a cast of colorful characters. Their journey fundamentally alters each characters'' sense of self and their place in the world. There is, indeed, life after 80.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agE1mnnc5aTSN2Lw7BPaG6yNhhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268847'),
  ('197148955970715195', 'One for the Road', 2022, 'Drama', 'Nottapon Boonprakob, Natdanai Naksuwan, Boonyanuch Kraithong', 'Puangsoi Aksornsawang, Nottapon Boonprakob, Nattawut Poonpiriya', 'Thanapob Leeratanakachorn, Natara Nopparatayapon, Ploi Horwang, Siraphan Wattanajinda, Violette Wautier, Chutimon Chuengcharoensukying, Thaneth Warakulnukroh, Rhatha Phongam', null, 'Boss, an elusive bar owner living in New York, reunites with his estranged best friend, Aood, for a roadtrip in Thailand after Aood has been diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'Boss, an elusive bar owner living in New York, reunites with his estranged best friend, Aood, for a roadtrip in Thailand after Aood has been diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDpFHT2dXI2IDdYwGCSWql6uoql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776545'),
  ('965922181733006951', 'One for the Road', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nina Haun, Markus Goller, Philip Peschlow', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Frederick Lau, Nora Tschirner, Burak Yiğit, Friederike Becht, Godehard Giese, Nina Kunzendorf, Henning Peker, Eva Weißenborn', null, 'As a construction manager, drinking is more of a normality for Mark than not drinking. In addition to his work on construction sites, during business dinners and sprawling Berlin party nights, there is always a reason for him to fully indulge in alcohol intoxication. When he tries to drive his car out of a no-parking zone in a drunken stupor one night, he is promptly checked and immediately loses his driver''s license. For Mark, this is reason enough to make a bet with his best friend Nadim: He wants to manage not to touch any alcohol until he has his driver''s license again.', 'As a construction manager, drinking is more of a normality for Mark than not drinking. In addition to his work on construction sites, during business dinners and sprawling Berlin party nights, there is always a reason for him to fully indulge in alcohol intoxication. When he tries to drive his car out of a no-parking zone in a drunken stupor one night, he is promptly checked and immediately loses his driver''s license. For Mark, this is reason enough to make a bet with his best friend Nadim: He wants to manage not to touch any alcohol until he has his driver''s license again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DqPake4eaECbpHuXZdwaQ5ayOZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897833'),
  ('347579079393602476', 'One Fourty', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Ulrich Seidl', 'Ulrich Seidl', 'Karl Wallner', null, 'The story of a 50-year-old dwarf who stopped growing at 1 meter 40 and plays the piano.', 'The story of a 50-year-old dwarf who stopped growing at 1 meter 40 and plays the piano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOgCE8cx7bc3YzV6MtoSdraB8HE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56513'),
  ('443154661713442985', 'One Frightened Night', 1935, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ernest Miller, Christy Cabanne', 'Wellyn Totman', 'Charley Grapewin, Lucien Littlefield, Mary Carlisle, Regis Toomey, Arthur Hohl, Fred Kelsey, Evalyn Knapp, Clarence Wilson', 'NR', 'Eccentric tycoon Jasper Whyte hosts a dinner at his mansion and announces that he will divide his money and give each guest a million dollars before the stroke of midnight. When his long-lost granddaughter suddenly arrives, Whyte changes his mind and proclaims that she will receive his entire fortune. A second lady appears at the estate, claiming that she is actually Whyte''s granddaughter, Doris Waverly, and the first woman is found murdered in her room! With each guest possessing a motive, the mystery of the killer''s identity briskly unfolds through a stirring series of surprises.', 'Eccentric tycoon Jasper Whyte hosts a dinner at his mansion and announces that he will divide his money and give each guest a million dollars before the stroke of midnight. When his long-lost granddaughter suddenly arrives, Whyte changes his mind and proclaims that she will receive his entire fortune. A second lady appears at the estate, claiming that she is actually Whyte''s granddaughter, Doris Waverly, and the first woman is found murdered in her room! With each guest possessing a motive, the mystery of the killer''s identity briskly unfolds through a stirring series of surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpWhx5xXn1DuiPfeVseuR7zNheK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29324'),
  ('440898223826869407', 'One Froggy Evening', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'William Roberts', 'NR', 'A workman finds a singing frog in the cornerstone of an old building being demolished. But when he tries to cash in on his discovery, he finds the frog will sing only for him, and just croak for the talent agent and the audience in the theater he''s spent his life savings on.', 'A workman finds a singing frog in the cornerstone of an old building being demolished. But when he tries to cash in on his discovery, he finds the frog will sing only for him, and just croak for the talent agent and the audience in the theater he''s spent his life savings on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k56XBWKTBQJ5qx3Pod6tQPI9arE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53211'),
  ('825525925522615723', 'One from the Heart', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Arne Schmidt, Dan Attias', 'Armyan Bernstein, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Teri Garr, Frederic Forrest, Raúl Juliá, Nastassja Kinski, Lainie Kazan, Harry Dean Stanton, Allen Garfield, Jeff Hamlin', 'R', 'In a dazzling, dreamlike Las Vegas, longtime couple Hank and Frannie break up on their fifth anniversary and each pursue the fantasy of new love over one neon-soaked night—he with a free-spirited acrobat, she with a seductive musician. But as illusion and reality blur, both must decide whether passion or devotion truly defines the heart.', 'In a dazzling, dreamlike Las Vegas, longtime couple Hank and Frannie break up on their fifth anniversary and each pursue the fantasy of new love over one neon-soaked night—he with a free-spirited acrobat, she with a seductive musician. But as illusion and reality blur, both must decide whether passion or devotion truly defines the heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EyIQksa8C9tm82rHIJYGQXZ5Vs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41291'),
  ('696859089066017667', 'One Girl For Two Men', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Nikos Tsiforos, Giannis Dalianidis, Polyvios Vasileiadis', 'Alekos Alexandrakis, Zoe Laskari, Kostas Voutsas, Rena Vlahopoulou, Martha Karagianni, Giannis Vogiatzis, Periklis Hristoforidis, Alekos Tzanetakos', null, 'Kimon and Aris are brothers, still they are completely different characters. Kimon, the eldest one, is a serious, conceivable, and stubbornly man who refuses to marry. In opposite, Aris is an open-minded, lively and austere man. Their older sister Polyxeni is trying to bring them closer. Aris wants to meet his girlfriend, Myrto to his brother, but he fears that he will reject her because she is a singer so he convinces him to recruit her as his secretary by concealing her real identity.', 'Kimon and Aris are brothers, still they are completely different characters. Kimon, the eldest one, is a serious, conceivable, and stubbornly man who refuses to marry. In opposite, Aris is an open-minded, lively and austere man. Their older sister Polyxeni is trying to bring them closer. Aris wants to meet his girlfriend, Myrto to his brother, but he fears that he will reject her because she is a singer so he convinces him to recruit her as his secretary by concealing her real identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bajUohg5ZyynEFf16BIlZlz5uU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332304'),
  ('81046771730156739', 'One Girl''s Confession', 1953, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hugo Haas, Paul Ivano', 'Hugo Haas', 'Cleo Moore, Hugo Haas, Glenn Langan, Helene Stanton, Anthony Jochim, Burt Mustin, Leonid Snegoff, James Nusser', 'NR', 'Cleo Moore stars as Mary Adams, whose first step on the road to ruin is a $25,000 robbery. Mary hides the money, then confesses to the crime, secure in the belief that she can dig up the loot upon her release from prison.', 'Cleo Moore stars as Mary Adams, whose first step on the road to ruin is a $25,000 robbery. Mary hides the money, then confesses to the crime, secure in the belief that she can dig up the loot upon her release from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jYENnzcpIETsMHPNj0pLpAKjZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25787'),
  ('804447960863445239', 'One Good Cop', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Heywood Gould, Ralf D. Bode', 'Heywood Gould', 'Michael Keaton, Rene Russo, Anthony LaPaglia, Kevin Conway, Rachel Ticotin, Tony Plana, Benjamin Bratt, Charlayne Woodard', 'R', 'When his partner is killed in the line of duty, Artie Lewis becomes the legal guardian of his three orphaned girls. But during his investigation of the case, Lewis finds his life – and that of his newfound family – on the line. That''s when the guilty crime-lord comes face to face with one man''s rage, one man''s fury, one man''s justice.', 'When his partner is killed in the line of duty, Artie Lewis becomes the legal guardian of his three orphaned girls. But during his investigation of the case, Lewis finds his life – and that of his newfound family – on the line. That''s when the guilty crime-lord comes face to face with one man''s rage, one man''s fury, one man''s justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGhP7xi3Dm7dDgg7JbnQvTPBgYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71142'),
  ('546584170907793081', 'One Good Turn', 1931, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne', 'Stan Laurel, James Parrott, Charley Rogers', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Mary Carr, James Finlayson, Billy Gilbert, Dorothy Granger, Harry ''Snub'' Pollard', 'NR', 'Down and out Stan and Ollie beg for food from a friendly old lady who provides them with sandwiches. While eating, they overhear the lady''s landlord tell her he''s going to throw her out because she can''t pay her mortgage. They don''t realize that the old lady is really rehearsing for a play. Stan and Ollie decide to help the old lady by selling their car. During the auction a drunk puts a wallet in Stan''s pocket. Ollie accuses Stan of robbing the old lady, but when the truth is revealed Stan takes revenge on Ollie.', 'Down and out Stan and Ollie beg for food from a friendly old lady who provides them with sandwiches. While eating, they overhear the lady''s landlord tell her he''s going to throw her out because she can''t pay her mortgage. They don''t realize that the old lady is really rehearsing for a play. Stan and Ollie decide to help the old lady by selling their car. During the auction a drunk puts a wallet in Stan''s pocket. Ollie accuses Stan of robbing the old lady, but when the truth is revealed Stan takes revenge on Ollie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HHDx94rrlVD3C3PBZmrOPJYJQZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48903'),
  ('526701319310188944', 'One Good Turn', 1955, 'Comedy', 'John Paddy Carstairs, Robert Asher, Philip Martell', 'John Paddy Carstairs, Maurice Cowan, Ted Willis', 'Norman Wisdom, Joan Rice, Shirley Abicair, Thora Hird, William Russell, Joan Ingram, Richard Caldicot, Marjorie Fender', null, 'Norman is the oldest orphan at Greenwood Children''s Home and now acts as their caretaker. All the orphans are very happy and well cared for. The adventures start when a nasty property developer who is also the chairman of the orphanage board wants to close the orphanage and build a factory on the site. The children are sent to Brighton for the day and Norman is very excited because he''s "Never seen the Sea". When they get back they discover the plan to close the orphanage and have to decide what to do', 'Norman is the oldest orphan at Greenwood Children''s Home and now acts as their caretaker. All the orphans are very happy and well cared for. The adventures start when a nasty property developer who is also the chairman of the orphanage board wants to close the orphanage and build a factory on the site. The children are sent to Brighton for the day and Norman is very excited because he''s "Never seen the Sea". When they get back they discover the plan to close the orphanage and have to decide what to do', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRdAqCoXbj7idpX3Ng35eL8ohax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38385'),
  ('106257268475196683', 'One Got Fat', 1963, 'Documentary', 'William Dale Jennings', 'William Dale Jennings', 'Edward Everett Horton', null, 'This bicycle-safety film shows children what can happen when bicycles are driven carelessly and recklessly.', 'This bicycle-safety film shows children what can happen when bicycles are driven carelessly and recklessly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwAUohYRePaP6WUkU96a6qtzJEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240547'),
  ('386256728893537061', 'One Ham''s Family', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Kent Rogers, Sara Berner', null, 'A hungry wolf with ham in the shape of a pig kid stands in for Santa Claus.', 'A hungry wolf with ham in the shape of a pig kid stands in for Santa Claus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54okhCqkzK1qd6aaN4UN0Qvz5P7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86749'),
  ('686248169564772013', 'One Hamlet Less', 1973, 'Drama', 'Carmelo Bene, Luigi Mezzanotte, Mario Masini', 'Carmelo Bene', 'Carmelo Bene, Luciana Cante, Sergio Di Giulio, Franco Leo, Lydia Mancinelli, Luigi Mezzanotte, Isabella Russo, Giuseppe Tuminelli', null, 'The Prince of Denmark, Hamlet, is little interested in family affairs and the fate of the kingdom, and not at all attracted by a doll-like Ophelia sucking his finger. Annoyed by his friend Horatio, who tells him of the apparition of his father''s spectre that would like to drive him to revenge, and by Polonius, Ophelia''s father, who psychoanalyses him by explaining the Oedipus complex, he imagines escaping to Paris with Kate, the leading actress of the company performing in Elsinore, to become a playwright.', 'The Prince of Denmark, Hamlet, is little interested in family affairs and the fate of the kingdom, and not at all attracted by a doll-like Ophelia sucking his finger. Annoyed by his friend Horatio, who tells him of the apparition of his father''s spectre that would like to drive him to revenge, and by Polonius, Ophelia''s father, who psychoanalyses him by explaining the Oedipus complex, he imagines escaping to Paris with Kate, the leading actress of the company performing in Elsinore, to become a playwright.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lBFF9zNuaFoxD6J5u3xwczjixM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198546'),
  ('1064085061380901311', 'One Hand Can''t Clap', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Ondříček, Oldřich Mach, Richard Řeřicha', 'Ivan Trojan', 'Jiří Macháček, Marek Taclík, Ivan Trojan, Klára Pollertová, Isabela Smečková-Bencová, Kristína Lukešová, Vladimír Dlouhý, David Matásek', null, 'When Standa is released from jail, he feels a brighter future is about to take hold. Instead, his bad luck grows, thanks to a new acquaintance.', 'When Standa is released from jail, he feels a brighter future is about to take hold. Instead, his bad luck grows, thanks to a new acquaintance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jKejKdB2eqySFfosF0SsEMxswo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41218'),
  ('706370403471155697', 'One Hell of a Holiday!', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Víctor García León', 'Manuel Burque, Josep Gatell', 'Tito Valverde, Gracia Olayo, Toni Acosta, Ernesto Sevilla, Daniela Rubio, Ramón Barea, Nuria Herrero, Marta de Toro', null, 'It tells the story of Manuela and José. Even though they are delighted with taking care of their grandchildren, they are a bit fed up with no longer having time to dedicate to themselves.', 'It tells the story of Manuela and José. Even though they are delighted with taking care of their grandchildren, they are a bit fed up with no longer having time to dedicate to themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ji9EP9bdyftAhGWNd1560Z5F1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926924'),
  ('455304689968021635', 'One Hour Girlfriend', 2026, 'Drama', 'Gregory Hatanaka', 'Gregory Hatanaka', 'Sofia Papuashvili, Phillip Kim Marra, Chris Spinelli', null, 'A reclusive man hires a woman for a one-hour companion visit, treating intimacy as a controlled experiment. As the hour unfolds, emotional barriers erode, forcing him to confront love, time, and loss.', 'A reclusive man hires a woman for a one-hour companion visit, treating intimacy as a controlled experiment. As the hour unfolds, emotional barriers erode, forcing him to confront love, time, and loss.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FljMS38mjFF2PQPlNqxWlnmKEH2H.jpg', 'plex:movie:one-hour-girlfriend'),
  ('396798918407250253', 'One Hour Photo', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jeff Cronenweth, Mark Romanek, Seth Edelstein', 'Mark Romanek', 'Robin Williams, Connie Nielsen, Michael Vartan, Gary Cole, Erin Daniels, Clark Gregg, Nick Searcy, Dylan Smith', 'R', 'Sy Parrish has lovingly developed photographs for the Yorkin family since their son was a baby. But as the Yorkins'' lives become fuller, Sy''s only seems lonelier, until he eventually convinces himself he''s part of their family. When Sy''s picture-perfect fantasy collides with an ugly dose of reality, a bizarre and thrilling confrontation ensues.', 'Sy Parrish has lovingly developed photographs for the Yorkin family since their son was a baby. But as the Yorkins'' lives become fuller, Sy''s only seems lonelier, until he eventually convinces himself he''s part of their family. When Sy''s picture-perfect fantasy collides with an ugly dose of reality, a bizarre and thrilling confrontation ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuSIN3Nq6dmaA8LZSkASpQueFO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9357'),
  ('361664083748323780', 'One Hour with You', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Victor Milner, George Cukor', 'Samson Raphaelson', 'Maurice Chevalier, Jeanette MacDonald, Genevieve Tobin, Charles Ruggles, Roland Young, Josephine Dunn, Richard Carle, Barbara Leonard', 'NR', 'Andre and Colette Bertier are happily married. When Colette introduces her husband to her flirtatious best friend, Mitzi, he does his best to resist her advances. But she is persistent, and very cute, and he succumbs. Mitzi''s husband wants to divorce her, and has been having her tailed. Andre gets caught, and must confess to his wife. But Colette has had problems resisting the attentions of another man herself, and they forgive each other.', 'Andre and Colette Bertier are happily married. When Colette introduces her husband to her flirtatious best friend, Mitzi, he does his best to resist her advances. But she is persistent, and very cute, and he succumbs. Mitzi''s husband wants to divorce her, and has been having her tailed. Andre gets caught, and must confess to his wife. But Colette has had problems resisting the attentions of another man herself, and they forgive each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVDJZXwHKD0NgHaHZrkHuqHsJyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43145'),
  ('835195962601023342', 'One Hundred and One Dalmatians', 1961, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Wolfgang Reitherman, Clyde Geronimi, Hamilton Luske', null, 'Rod Taylor, J. Pat O''Malley, Betty Lou Gerson, Martha Wentworth, Ben Wright, Cate Bauer, David Frankham, Frederick Worlock', 'G', 'When a litter of dalmatian puppies are abducted by the minions of Cruella De Vil, the parents must find them before she uses them for a diabolical fashion statement.', 'When a litter of dalmatian puppies are abducted by the minions of Cruella De Vil, the parents must find them before she uses them for a diabolical fashion statement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSlYq6FrBUviGSEh8v4L9nrSnBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12230'),
  ('39296957494733013', 'One Hundred and One Nights', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Éric Gautier, Agnès Varda, Didier Rouget', 'Agnès Varda', 'Michel Piccoli, Marcello Mastroianni, Henri Garcin, Julie Gayet, Mathieu Demy, Emmanuel Salinger, Anouk Aimée, Fanny Ardant', null, 'Monsieur Cinema, a hundred years old, lives alone in a large villa. His memories fade away, so he engages a young woman to tell him stories about all the movies ever made.', 'Monsieur Cinema, a hundred years old, lives alone in a large villa. His memories fade away, so he engages a young woman to tell him stories about all the movies ever made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHyi6Ro293kZlYctdPXnzPVndRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94771'),
  ('793499028839178420', 'One Hundred Children Waiting for a Train', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Ignacio Agüero, Jaime Reyes, Jorge Roth', 'Ignacio Agüero', 'Alicia Vega', null, 'Tells the story of a group of Chilean children who discover a larger reality and a different world through the cinema. Each Saturday, Alicia Vega transforms the chapel of Lo Hermida into a film screening room as she conducts a workshop for children under the auspices of the Catholic church. The hundred or so children involved had never seen a movie, and in the workshop they see and learn about the cinema: photograms and moving images, projection, camera angles and movement, film genres, and much more. And they watch movies: Chaplin, Disney, Lamorisse''s ''The Red Balloon,'' the Lumieres'' ''The Arrival of the Train to the Station.'' Finally, each child designs his own film with drawings. And then, for the first time in most of their lives, the children got to the movies in downtown Santiago.', 'Tells the story of a group of Chilean children who discover a larger reality and a different world through the cinema. Each Saturday, Alicia Vega transforms the chapel of Lo Hermida into a film screening room as she conducts a workshop for children under the auspices of the Catholic church. The hundred or so children involved had never seen a movie, and in the workshop they see and learn about the cinema: photograms and moving images, projection, camera angles and movement, film genres, and much more. And they watch movies: Chaplin, Disney, Lamorisse''s ''The Red Balloon,'' the Lumieres'' ''The Arrival of the Train to the Station.'' Finally, each child designs his own film with drawings. And then, for the first time in most of their lives, the children got to the movies in downtown Santiago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4gWxNamkmODDAujxk6LiiY4JI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130269'),
  ('870570741998961516', 'One Hundred Days After Childhood', 1975, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sergey Solovyov, Leonid Kalashnikov, V. Skorobogatov', 'Aleksandr Aleksandrov, Sergey Solovyov', 'Tatyana Drubich, Irina Malysheva, Yuri Agilin, Sergey Shakurov, Nina Menshikova, Boris Tokarev, Arina Aleynikova, Andrei Zvyagin', null, 'Pioneer leader Serge, a sculptor, decides to work in a new plastic material, among creatively gifted children in a camp located in an old mansion. Pioneer Lopukhin is so in love with his classmate Ergolina that he does not notice how fascinated Sonya Zagremukhina is with him. Showing their emotions and moods helps their participation in the production of the play "Masquerade" by Lermontov, and the play itself imperceptibly turns into a drama with unexpected confessions, insults, jealousy, and outbursts. The teens are so busy with their feelings that they do not pay attention to the pedagogical ideas of Pioneer Serge, and by the end of the film, with no additional encouragement, they are ready for a commemoration of first love.', 'Pioneer leader Serge, a sculptor, decides to work in a new plastic material, among creatively gifted children in a camp located in an old mansion. Pioneer Lopukhin is so in love with his classmate Ergolina that he does not notice how fascinated Sonya Zagremukhina is with him. Showing their emotions and moods helps their participation in the production of the play "Masquerade" by Lermontov, and the play itself imperceptibly turns into a drama with unexpected confessions, insults, jealousy, and outbursts. The teens are so busy with their feelings that they do not pay attention to the pedagogical ideas of Pioneer Serge, and by the end of the film, with no additional encouragement, they are ready for a commemoration of first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1z3ZnRLsvkAjEjxPL70SPiCx3Qe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48623'),
  ('594554001103812871', 'One Hundred Days in Palermo', 1984, 'Drama, Crime', 'Giuseppe Ferrara, Silvio Fraschetti, Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Pier Giovanni Anchisi, Giuseppe Tornatore, Riccardo Iacona', 'Lino Ventura, Giuliana De Sio, Arnoldo Foà, Lino Troisi, Stefano Satta Flores, Adalberto Maria Merli, Accursio Di Leo, Anita Zagaria', null, 'In the late 1970s and early 80s, assassinations in Sicily get the attention of Communist deputy, Pio La Torre, who appeals to General Carlo Alberto Dalla Chiesa to become prefect in Palermo and take on the Mafia. Dalla Chiesa approaches the job with the same focus and methods he used in hunting down the Red Brigade.', 'In the late 1970s and early 80s, assassinations in Sicily get the attention of Communist deputy, Pio La Torre, who appeals to General Carlo Alberto Dalla Chiesa to become prefect in Palermo and take on the Mafia. Dalla Chiesa approaches the job with the same focus and methods he used in hunting down the Red Brigade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne5swwgHXQRKlHqxl3NZZGZMaKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48112'),
  ('179749874785696647', 'One Hundred Men and a Girl', 1937, 'Comedy, Music', 'Henry Koster, Joseph A. Valentine', 'Charles Kenyon, Bruce Manning, James Mulhauser', 'Deanna Durbin, Leopold Stokowski, Adolphe Menjou, Alice Brady, Eugene Pallette, Mischa Auer, Billy Gilbert, Alma Kruger', 'NR', 'The daughter of a struggling musician forms a symphony orchestra made up of his unemployed friends and through persistence, charm and a few misunderstandings, is able to get Leopold Stokowski to lead them in a concert that leads to a radio contract.', 'The daughter of a struggling musician forms a symphony orchestra made up of his unemployed friends and through persistence, charm and a few misunderstandings, is able to get Leopold Stokowski to lead them in a concert that leads to a radio contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWCDQRYTq4rnD7sVh1p959mEASe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61647'),
  ('221333486547118475', 'One Hundred Nails', 2007, 'Drama', 'Ermanno Olmi, Fabio Olmi, Gaia Gorrini', 'Ermanno Olmi', 'Raz Degan, Luna Bendandi, Amina Syed, Michele Zattara, Damiano Scaini, Franco Andreani, Andrea Lanfredi, Carlo Faroni', null, 'An Italian professor seeks refuge in the quiet, peaceful ruins of an old building.', 'An Italian professor seeks refuge in the quiet, peaceful ruins of an old building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjlRCKbFFmslXvHDoSQgClC2qNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24165'),
  ('1111406460804140558', 'One Hundred Thousand Bad Jokes', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Li Shujie, Hengyu Lu', null, 'Ajie, Wang Zhen, Baomu Zhongyang, Shan Xin, Qiuxiang Shen, Sheng Feng, Hengyu Lu, Li Xiaomeng', null, 'Chinese animated fantasy comedy based on classic stories.', 'Chinese animated fantasy comedy based on classic stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5coSOwM3ePFZLoZtjAFu1yYIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323182'),
  ('970806983520580212', 'One Hundred Thousand Bad Jokes II', 2017, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Li Shujie, Hengyu Lu, 黄漾波', null, 'Wang Zhen, Shan Xin', null, 'Gods from East, West, and North send delegates to seize a truncheon from the Southern God to prevent wars from bursting out through the whole galaxy.', 'Gods from East, West, and North send delegates to seize a truncheon from the Southern God to prevent wars from bursting out through the whole galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svZE0BvXujrn9elcqA5uCOQfpBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474386'),
  ('754289044885108160', 'One Hundredth of a Second', 2006, 'Drama, War', 'Susan Jacobson', null, 'Heather Cameron-McLintock, Emma Cleasby, Richard Dillane, Luciano Dodero, Julie Legrand, Johnny Palmiero', null, 'Kate is a talented photojournalist. She risks her life to deliver powerful images to the waiting world until a photograph of a Girl changes her life forever.', 'Kate is a talented photojournalist. She risks her life to deliver powerful images to the waiting world until a photograph of a Girl changes her life forever.', null, 'tmdb:movie:341445'),
  ('155870996877835993', 'One Husband Too Many', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Louis Choquette', 'Samantha Mazéras', 'Lorie Pester, Alain Delon, Alexandre Varga, Philippe Bas, Jean-Luc Bideau, Cyrielle Clair, Scali Delpeyrat, Marie Boissard', null, 'At just 28 years old, Stéphanie Lempereur believes she has achieved all her dreams. She has just been appointed editor-in-chief of GLAM, a prestigious fashion magazine, and the charming Grégoire de Rougemont, a lawyer from a good family, has asked her to marry him. The only catch: Stéphanie lied about her modest origins to get where she is, and... she is still married to Alex, her childhood sweetheart! Back in Calais, faced with her husband, her family, and her roots, Stéphanie begins to doubt her life choices...', 'At just 28 years old, Stéphanie Lempereur believes she has achieved all her dreams. She has just been appointed editor-in-chief of GLAM, a prestigious fashion magazine, and the charming Grégoire de Rougemont, a lawyer from a good family, has asked her to marry him. The only catch: Stéphanie lied about her modest origins to get where she is, and... she is still married to Alex, her childhood sweetheart! Back in Calais, faced with her husband, her family, and her roots, Stéphanie begins to doubt her life choices...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXWXwVZlNM3ilN4t7PPDqRlM7C9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241982'),
  ('712951198070815419', 'One in a Hundred Thousand', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Koichiro Miki', null, 'Alan Shirahama, Yuna Taira, Eiji Okuda, Jin Shirasu, Mio Yuki, Yusuke Sugiyama', null, 'Rino Sakuragi (Yuna Taira) is a high school student. She is good friends with Ren Kiritani (Alan Shirahama) who attends the same high school. They have been close since their middle school days. Rino holds special feelings for Ren Kiritani, but she is unable to tell him how she feels because he is popular. One day, Ren confesses to Rino that he likes her. They begin to date and enjoy their time together, but Rino is diagnosed with ALS (amyotrophic lateral sclerosis).', 'Rino Sakuragi (Yuna Taira) is a high school student. She is good friends with Ren Kiritani (Alan Shirahama) who attends the same high school. They have been close since their middle school days. Rino holds special feelings for Ren Kiritani, but she is unable to tell him how she feels because he is popular. One day, Ren confesses to Rino that he likes her. They begin to date and enjoy their time together, but Rino is diagnosed with ALS (amyotrophic lateral sclerosis).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yx69pjdFMzRiH4duoA1KBjLUzAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746547'),
  ('1027153328961973193', 'One in a Million', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Hannes Holm, Måns Herngren, Mats Olofson', 'Måns Herngren, Hannes Holm', 'Tomas von Brömssen, Ulla Skoog, Gösta Ekman, Tintin Anderzon, Lars Engström, Jacob Ericksson, Per Fritzell, Vanna Rosenberg', null, 'Torsten Södergren lives in a normal house with his normal family in a completely normal city. Every morning he greets his normal neighbours before getting into his normal car and drives the usual way to his ordinary work at an ordinary bank. But one day he is fired from his work after twenty years of loyal service. Now he is prepared to do anything to get it back...', 'Torsten Södergren lives in a normal house with his normal family in a completely normal city. Every morning he greets his normal neighbours before getting into his normal car and drives the usual way to his ordinary work at an ordinary bank. But one day he is fired from his work after twenty years of loyal service. Now he is prepared to do anything to get it back...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/horgafDVIKzo70V8i1fbbagUHqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77331'),
  ('440460382620358728', 'One in a Thousand', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Armin Marchesini Weihmuller, Lucas Gabriel Olivares, Clarisa Navas', 'Clarisa Navas', 'Sofía Cabrera, Ana Carolina García, Mauricio Vila, Luis Molina, Marianela Iglesia, Pilar Rebull Cubells, Victoria Cussigh, Rosa Melgarejo', null, 'Set in a community of project houses, Iris, a young woman with a tough past, meets Renata and feels immediately attracted to her. A tender coming of age story about friendship and first love in a hostile environment.', 'Set in a community of project houses, Iris, a young woman with a tough past, meets Renata and feels immediately attracted to her. A tender coming of age story about friendship and first love in a hostile environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpDP9162IHGeDt8qvcognuuBmDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656276'),
  ('18178800811305627', 'One in the Chamber', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'William Kaufman, Mark Rutledge, Craig Borden', 'Benjamin Shahrabani, Derek Kolstad', 'Dolph Lundgren, Cuba Gooding Jr., Leo Gregory, Billy Murray, Claudia Bassols, Louis Mandylor, Slavi Slavov', 'R', 'A seasoned assassin plays both sides in a Russian gang war and becomes the target of an unknown enemy.', 'A seasoned assassin plays both sides in a Russian gang war and becomes the target of an unknown enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QQu9v0AwjO0fIj4pnpiBYhGk0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122924'),
  ('678817356685185309', 'One Kiss', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Luca Bigazzi, Ivan Cotroneo', 'Ivan Cotroneo, Monica Rametta', 'Rimau Grillo Ritzberger, Valentina Romani, Leonardo Pazzagli, Thomas Trabacchi, Susy Laude, Simonetta Solder, Giorgio Marchesi, Laura Mazzi', null, 'Lorenzo, Blue and Antonio have a lot in common: they are sixteen, attending the same class in the same school in a small town in the northeast, each have a family that loves them. And all three, though for different reasons, have come to be isolated from other peers. Their new friendship helps them to resist, until the mechanical attraction and fear the judgment of others do not grasp them unprepared.', 'Lorenzo, Blue and Antonio have a lot in common: they are sixteen, attending the same class in the same school in a small town in the northeast, each have a family that loves them. And all three, though for different reasons, have come to be isolated from other peers. Their new friendship helps them to resist, until the mechanical attraction and fear the judgment of others do not grasp them unprepared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQw1JGdeMzaAADZVZPbFm6OKowR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390669'),
  ('406160254633879299', 'One Last Adventure: The Making of Stranger Things 5', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Martina Radwan, Martina Radwan', null, 'Ross Duffer, Matt Duffer, Paul Dichter, Kate Trefry, Caitlin Schneiderhan, Shawn Levy, Lampton Enochs, Chris Trujillo', 'PG-13', 'An inside look at the years of effort and craft that went into the final installment of the Duffer Brothers'' generation-defining series.', 'An inside look at the years of effort and craft that went into the final installment of the Duffer Brothers'' generation-defining series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iX3ccl1TUNZgu4cNUm1pRLcevww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1610413'),
  ('92803850810257475', 'One Last Dance', 2003, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Lisa Niemi', 'Lisa Niemi, Kevin Bernhardt', 'Patrick Swayze, Lisa Niemi, George De La Pena, Matthew Walker, Stefan Wenta, Timothy Webber, Marie Stillin, Aundra Ford', 'PG-13', 'In the wake of tragedy, a renowed New York dance company is on the brink of collapse. After leaving the dance world for good, Travis, Chrissa, and Max are pulled in to resurrect the dance that shattered their careers. They have one last chance to save the company, re-connect with the passion and magic, and prove that miracles really can happen.', 'In the wake of tragedy, a renowed New York dance company is on the brink of collapse. After leaving the dance world for good, Travis, Chrissa, and Max are pulled in to resurrect the dance that shattered their careers. They have one last chance to save the company, re-connect with the passion and magic, and prove that miracles really can happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoowMfEOxI93VQxt0qoqcqPJi13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25665'),
  ('624324554864276224', 'One Last Deal', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Brendan Muldowney, Narayan Van Maele', 'Peter Howlett', 'Danny Dyer, Elliott Rogers, Carlos Bardem, Katy Cavanagh, Dagmar Döring', null, 'A veteran sports agent races to secure a final lucrative contract for his star client, as both their careers and lives hang in the balance.', 'A veteran sports agent races to secure a final lucrative contract for his star client, as both their careers and lives hang in the balance.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F8%2Fgracenote%2F8dc3f96b97d89c814b6a64dcc3960c0e.jpg', 'plex:movie:one-last-deal-2026'),
  ('409187826175414440', 'One Last Thing...', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Christopher Norr, Alex Steyermark, Urs Hirschbiegel', 'Barry Stringfellow', 'Michael Angarano, Matt Bush, Gideon Glick, Cynthia Nixon, Gia Carides, Johnny Messner, Sunny Mabrey, Richie Rich', 'R', 'Sixteen-year-old Dylan is dying of cancer. When a charitable organization offers to grant Dylan his final wish, the teen has a surprising request: to meet supermodel Nikki Sinclair. Much to his mother''s dismay, Dylan, with the help of his best friends, goes to New York to fulfill his dream.', 'Sixteen-year-old Dylan is dying of cancer. When a charitable organization offers to grant Dylan his final wish, the teen has a surprising request: to meet supermodel Nikki Sinclair. Much to his mother''s dismay, Dylan, with the help of his best friends, goes to New York to fulfill his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjyod5CrKYCZnEGvf8ZkxhLOTk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15075'),
  ('935245674038077332', 'One Life', 2011, 'Documentary, Family', 'Martha Holmes, Mike Gunton', 'Mike Gunton, Martha Holmes', 'Daniel Craig', null, 'One Life captures unprecedented and beautiful sequences of animal behaviour guaranteed to bring you closer to nature than ever before, as well as a second disc packed full of never before seen extras including an exclusive making of featurette narrated by Daniel Craig.', 'One Life captures unprecedented and beautiful sequences of animal behaviour guaranteed to bring you closer to nature than ever before, as well as a second disc packed full of never before seen extras including an exclusive making of featurette narrated by Daniel Craig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zorlrbxahQjtIy6rHovTBTK8FcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75720'),
  ('521927326729058321', 'One Little Indian', 1973, 'Family, Comedy, Western', 'Bernard McEveety, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Harry Spalding', 'James Garner, Vera Miles, Pat Hingle, Morgan Woodward, John Doucette, Robert Pine, Clay O''Brien, Bruce Glover', 'G', 'An Army deserter flees by camel across the desert with a caucasian boy raised by Indians.', 'An Army deserter flees by camel across the desert with a caucasian boy raised by Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPwJ82UoWF1NvC3prhlQ3WMNhKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45827'),
  ('1062326795792818056', 'One Lives By Love', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Silvano Agosti', null, 'Silvano Agosti', null, 'Through interviews with prostitutes, transsexuals, marginalized people, and the disabled, the director tells a series of stories about sexuality and feelings. An investigation that becomes a quest to explore the other side of love.', 'Through interviews with prostitutes, transsexuals, marginalized people, and the disabled, the director tells a series of stories about sexuality and feelings. An investigation that becomes a quest to explore the other side of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJiXOr025tNdwnPYDB6T0S4YZxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258139'),
  ('22602932062223390', 'One Long Winter Without Fire', 2005, 'Drama', 'Greg Zglinski', null, 'Aurélien Recoing, Marie Matheron, Gabriela Muskała, Nathalie Boulin, Blerim Gjoci, Antonio Buíl, Michel Voïta', null, 'Six months after losing their five years old daughter in a fire in the barn of their little farm, Jean and his wife Laure are facing troubles in their relationship and financial problems. Laure grieves the loss of their daughter and blames herself for her absence and Jean for his negligence for the fire; Jean is trying to rise from the ashes and somehow rebuild his life; and the insurance company refuses to pay the prize for the accident. Jean asks for a job in a mill to a friend to make money and support the psychiatric treatment of Laure. In his new job, he meets and becomes friend of the Kosovo refugee''s siblings Kastriot and Labinota, while the Laure''s sister Valérie separates them. Jean feels the passion of love and sense of life in his relationship with Labinota, who had her life destroyed with the war.', 'Six months after losing their five years old daughter in a fire in the barn of their little farm, Jean and his wife Laure are facing troubles in their relationship and financial problems. Laure grieves the loss of their daughter and blames herself for her absence and Jean for his negligence for the fire; Jean is trying to rise from the ashes and somehow rebuild his life; and the insurance company refuses to pay the prize for the accident. Jean asks for a job in a mill to a friend to make money and support the psychiatric treatment of Laure. In his new job, he meets and becomes friend of the Kosovo refugee''s siblings Kastriot and Labinota, while the Laure''s sister Valérie separates them. Jean feels the passion of love and sense of life in his relationship with Labinota, who had her life destroyed with the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVG047woetxczRad94i95ZxDZVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95307'),
  ('653929760110593606', 'One Love', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paula Hernández, Guillermo Nieto, Verónica Bruno', 'Paula Hernández, Leonel D''Agostino', 'Diego Peretti, Elena Roger, Luis Ziembrowski, Alan Daicz, Denise Groesman, Agustín Pardella, Nicolás Rodríguez Ciotti, Toto Rovito', null, 'A summer vacation in the 70s. Lalo and Bruno are teenagers doing nothing on days full of nothing. But on a hot and humid afternoon, and without asking for permission, Lisa arrives smashing more than the letargy of the town. Thirty years later Lisa comes again to interfere in the lives of these two adults.', 'A summer vacation in the 70s. Lalo and Bruno are teenagers doing nothing on days full of nothing. But on a hot and humid afternoon, and without asking for permission, Lisa arrives smashing more than the letargy of the town. Thirty years later Lisa comes again to interfere in the lives of these two adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuBSFC1ghs2TeUiqzQN9YlURsAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138167'),
  ('1150311589639040249', 'One Love', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ahmet Katıksız, Serkan Güler', 'Serkan Yoruk, Ahmet Katıksız', 'Ekin Koç, Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Fikret Kuşkan, Sibel Taşçıoğlu, Ali Seçkiner Alıcı, Serkan Ercan, Erdem Akakçe, Sekvan Serinkaya', null, 'The mid 90’s. Turkey’s political instability, inflation and hopelesness on people were increased. In those years when all hope was lost, people deeply bond with Bold Pilot and Halis Karataş who win every race coming from the last place. People see themselves at the point where this horse and jockey are: at the back. This duo make people to believe that everybody can win. The race ends at the finish line and the first to cross this line are Bold Pilot and Halis riding it.', 'The mid 90’s. Turkey’s political instability, inflation and hopelesness on people were increased. In those years when all hope was lost, people deeply bond with Bold Pilot and Halis Karataş who win every race coming from the last place. People see themselves at the point where this horse and jockey are: at the back. This duo make people to believe that everybody can win. The race ends at the finish line and the first to cross this line are Bold Pilot and Halis riding it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlbdp77MMh1R0TWRZjsYGQTLIVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568021'),
  ('1121374886951465236', 'One Love Manchester', 2017, 'Music', 'Hamish Hamilton', null, 'Ariana Grande, Sara Cox, Ore Oduba, Anita Rani, Nick Grimshaw, Mac Miller, Pharrell Williams, Miley Cyrus', null, 'Live coverage of the concert set up by Ariana Grande at Old Trafford cricket ground to benefit those affected by the May 2017 Manchester bomb attack. Performers include Ariana Grande, Justin Bieber, Coldplay, Katy Perry, Take That, Pharrell Williams, Niall Horan, Miley Cyrus, Usher, Robbie Williams, Little Mix and The Black Eyed Peas.', 'Live coverage of the concert set up by Ariana Grande at Old Trafford cricket ground to benefit those affected by the May 2017 Manchester bomb attack. Performers include Ariana Grande, Justin Bieber, Coldplay, Katy Perry, Take That, Pharrell Williams, Niall Horan, Miley Cyrus, Usher, Robbie Williams, Little Mix and The Black Eyed Peas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vj3mxbLcp3BYltcqLk1cDQgvnCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460492'),
  ('677374929254959612', 'One Magic Christmas', 1985, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Phillip Borsos, Frank Tidy, Tony Lucibello', 'Thomas Meehan', 'Mary Steenburgen, Gary Basaraba, Elisabeth Harnois, Arthur Hill, Wayne Robson, Jan Rubeš, Elias Koteas, Robbie Magwood', 'G', 'Ginny Grainger, a young mother, rediscovers the joy and beauty of Christmas, thanks to the unshakable faith of her six-year-old daughter Abbie and Gideon, Ginny''s very own guardian angel.', 'Ginny Grainger, a young mother, rediscovers the joy and beauty of Christmas, thanks to the unshakable faith of her six-year-old daughter Abbie and Gideon, Ginny''s very own guardian angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiKa6GhHDPRLgo4VAFRmeMBrvdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13380'),
  ('508835612115934697', 'One Man a Week', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Ana de la Reguera, Marco Polo Constandse, Tonatiuh Martínez', 'Itzel Lara, Adriana Pelusi', 'Roberto Quijano, Carlos ''Capi'' Pérez, Fernando Álvarez Rebeil, Patricia Garza, Epy Vélez', null, 'A divorced woman rebuilds her life and opens up to love again. Her journey through dating apps leads to funny and unpredictable situations until she discovers self-love is most important.', 'A divorced woman rebuilds her life and opens up to love again. Her journey through dating apps leads to funny and unpredictable situations until she discovers self-love is most important.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrHwOvosfDFRsjBihdh9dIHnMgbO.jpg', 'plex:movie:one-man-a-week'),
  ('504000118754816617', 'One Man and his Cow', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mohamed Hamidi, Elin Kirschfink', 'Alain-Michel Blanc, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Mohamed Hamidi', 'Fatsah Bouyahmed, Lambert Wilson, Jamel Debbouze, Julia Piaton, Hajar Masdouki, Abdellah Chakiri, Amal El Atrache, Fehd Benchemsi', null, 'An Algerian man''s life-long dream finally comes true when he receives an invitation to take his cow Jacqueline to the Paris International Agriculture Fair.', 'An Algerian man''s life-long dream finally comes true when he receives an invitation to take his cow Jacqueline to the Paris International Agriculture Fair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkEvayLdaQFO34cPnwjGw9LAr0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377799'),
  ('120573934605611509', 'One Man Army', 1994, 'Action, Crime', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Bobby P. Santiago, Henry Strzalkowski', 'Daryl Haney', 'Jerry Trimble, Melissa Moore, Dennis Hayden, Rick Dean, Yvonne Michelle, "Yup", Paul Holmes, James Gregory Paolleli', null, 'Kickboxing champ Jerry Trimble plays a straight shooting man caught up in the politics of a crooked little town. To get to the truth about his grandfather''s death, he must first kick out the criminals --including the sheriff-- effectively putting an end to their illegal smuggling, gambling and prostitution rings. But the worst crime of all turns out to be in his very own backyard.', 'Kickboxing champ Jerry Trimble plays a straight shooting man caught up in the politics of a crooked little town. To get to the truth about his grandfather''s death, he must first kick out the criminals --including the sheriff-- effectively putting an end to their illegal smuggling, gambling and prostitution rings. But the worst crime of all turns out to be in his very own backyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyrAE9BTOwriGEYjK0VbsThmVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220975'),
  ('669229288772220913', 'One Man Band', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'Mark Andrews, Andrew Jimenez', 'Andrew Jimenez, Mark Andrews', null, 'G', 'With one coin to make a wish at the piazza fountain, a peasant girl encounters two competing street performers who''d prefer the coin find its way into their tip jars. The little girl, Tippy, is caught in the middle as a musical duel ensues between the one-man-bands.', 'With one coin to make a wish at the piazza fountain, a peasant girl encounters two competing street performers who''d prefer the coin find its way into their tip jars. The little girl, Tippy, is caught in the middle as a musical duel ensues between the one-man-bands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfwUfeodlhuYJTYxUbelMLIQbnH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13933'),
  ('1057430143821258086', 'One Man Up', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Pasquale Mari, Enzo Di Terlizzi', 'Paolo Sorrentino', 'Toni Servillo, Andrea Renzi, Nello Mascia, Antonino Bruschetta, Roberto De Francesco, Angela Goodwin, Enrica Rosso, Clotilde Sabatino', 'NR', 'Two men, both named Antonio Pisapia, see their lives go downhill in 1980s Naples. One is a crooner embroiled in a sex scandal; the other is a football player whose career is cut short by an injury.', 'Two men, both named Antonio Pisapia, see their lives go downhill in 1980s Naples. One is a crooner embroiled in a sex scandal; the other is a football player whose career is cut short by an injury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99MnAxxxatYgG1VPOrbxRc2hVCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53482'),
  ('313036278778518650', 'One Man''s Hero', 1999, 'Western, Action, Drama, History', 'Lance Hool, João Fernandes', 'Milton S. Gelman', 'Tom Berenger, Joaquim de Almeida, Daniela Romo, Mark Moses, Stuart Graham, Gregg Fitzgerald, Don Wycherley, Wolf Muser', 'R', 'One Man''s Hero tells the little-known story of the "St. Patrick''s Battalion" or "San Patricios," a group of mostly Irish and other immigrants of the Catholic faith who deserted to Mexico after encountering religious and ethnic prejudice in the U.S. Army during the Mexican-American War. The plot centers around the personal story of John Riley, an Irishman who had been a sergeant in the American Army who is commissioned as a captain in the Mexican army and commands the battalion, as he leads his men in battle and struggles with authorities on both sides of the border', 'One Man''s Hero tells the little-known story of the "St. Patrick''s Battalion" or "San Patricios," a group of mostly Irish and other immigrants of the Catholic faith who deserted to Mexico after encountering religious and ethnic prejudice in the U.S. Army during the Mexican-American War. The plot centers around the personal story of John Riley, an Irishman who had been a sergeant in the American Army who is commissioned as a captain in the Mexican army and commands the battalion, as he leads his men in battle and struggles with authorities on both sides of the border', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QbunsUllQT0aQWWgMBnSlqwrfF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69848'),
  ('734769889036948779', 'One Man''s Journey', 1933, 'Drama', 'John S. Robertson', 'Lester Cohen, Samuel Ornitz', 'Lionel Barrymore, May Robson, Dorothy Jordan, Joel McCrea, Frances Dee, David Landau, Buster Phelps, June Filmer', 'NR', 'Dr. Eli Watt, a widower, comes to a small town, considering himself a failure in his attempt to have a meaningful career in New York. He raises his son Jimmy as well as Letty, a baby whose mother has died in childbirth and whose father blames Watt and abandons the child. Watt dreams of returning to do research studies, but always something gets in the way: an epidemic, his children''s needs, or the needs of his generally ungrateful patients. Only with the passing years does he come to find that his future isn''t over and his past isn''t quite the failure he believed.', 'Dr. Eli Watt, a widower, comes to a small town, considering himself a failure in his attempt to have a meaningful career in New York. He raises his son Jimmy as well as Letty, a baby whose mother has died in childbirth and whose father blames Watt and abandons the child. Watt dreams of returning to do research studies, but always something gets in the way: an epidemic, his children''s needs, or the needs of his generally ungrateful patients. Only with the passing years does he come to find that his future isn''t over and his past isn''t quite the failure he believed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNY8lSFO6SyyDp5PNEwJIeVJaPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230284'),
  ('1149112577235174930', 'One Meat Brawl', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'On Groundhog Day, Porky Pig goes hunting groundhogs and takes his dopey dog, Mandrake. They soon encounter Grover Groundhog, who is none too thrilled to be the objective of a hunter on his big day.', 'On Groundhog Day, Porky Pig goes hunting groundhogs and takes his dopey dog, Mandrake. They soon encounter Grover Groundhog, who is none too thrilled to be the objective of a hunter on his big day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8PZUa24jvu92tBZ9ahc3wGM4aK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40595'),
  ('1105845577080754439', 'One Mile', 2026, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Thriller, Crime', 'April Telek, Adam Davidson, Alwyn Kumst, Alexis Booth', 'John Hlavin, Rasheed Newson, T.J. Brady', 'Amélie Hoeferle, Sara Canning, Sage Linder, Beverley Elliott, Phil Burke', 'R', 'An ex-special forces operative goes off-the-grid when his daughter is kidnapped by a violent community. Alone and outnumbered, he''s forced to use every skill he has to track them down, take them apart, and bring his daughter home.', 'An ex-special forces operative goes off-the-grid when his daughter is kidnapped by a violent community. Alone and outnumbered, he''s forced to use every skill he has to track them down, take them apart, and bring his daughter home.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F1%2Fgracenote%2F18509553ee08025a68f1ddc3beb8e699.jpg', 'plex:movie:one-mile-2026'),
  ('314624437932129080', 'One Mile Above', 2011, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Jiayi Du, Du Jie', 'Cheng Hsiao-Tse, Zhang Jialu', 'Bryan Shu-Hao Chang, Li Xiaochuan, Doze Niu Cheng-Tse, Yin Yuhang, Tao Li, Tang Zhiping', 'NR', 'Shuhao is a 24 year old Taiwanese university graduate. His older brother Shuwei, whom he has idolized since childhood, dies on a bicycle ride to Lhasa. He decides to complete Shuwei''s journey, hoping to prove himself through this challenging trip. Shuhao''s inexperience almost sees him headed over a cliff one dark night. Food poisoning nearly costs him his life just after surviving an attack by a pack of menacing Tibetan Mastiffs. In the end, Shuhao arrives in Lhasa to see the Potola Palace. His lonely journey, filled with laughter and tears, brings him to the discovery of a new purpose in life.', 'Shuhao is a 24 year old Taiwanese university graduate. His older brother Shuwei, whom he has idolized since childhood, dies on a bicycle ride to Lhasa. He decides to complete Shuwei''s journey, hoping to prove himself through this challenging trip. Shuhao''s inexperience almost sees him headed over a cliff one dark night. Food poisoning nearly costs him his life just after surviving an attack by a pack of menacing Tibetan Mastiffs. In the end, Shuhao arrives in Lhasa to see the Potola Palace. His lonely journey, filled with laughter and tears, brings him to the discovery of a new purpose in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQW5zxfu0AtvmMsHpiACXLzBl0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136779'),
  ('1074138044283136336', 'One Mile: Chapter One', 2026, 'Action, Crime', 'Adam Davidson, Alexis Booth, Alwyn Kumst', 'John Hlavin', 'Ryan Phillippe, Amélie Hoeferle, Sara Canning, Sage Linder, Beverley Elliott, Phil Burke, Gabrielle Jacinto, C. Thomas Howell', 'R', 'After being released from prison, a father tries to reconnect with his daughter by taking her on a tour of college, but they soon find themselves fighting for more than their lost relationship when a murderous cult pursues them.', 'After being released from prison, a father tries to reconnect with his daughter by taking her on a tour of college, but they soon find themselves fighting for more than their lost relationship when a murderous cult pursues them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GZaoYe0mQy211DgDSAxAXr30ul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327688'),
  ('174969168771987230', 'One Mile: Chapter Two', 2026, 'Action, Crime', 'Adam Davidson, Alexis Booth, Alwyn Kumst', 'John Hlavin', 'Ryan Phillippe, Amélie Hoeferle, Sara Canning, Sage Linder, Beverley Elliott, Phil Burke, Gabrielle Jacinto, C. Thomas Howell', 'R', 'Former special forces operative Danny is forced back onto a remote island when a violent, secretive community takes revenge by abducting his daughter Alex, launching a relentless hunt against enemies prepared for his every move.', 'Former special forces operative Danny is forced back onto a remote island when a violent, secretive community takes revenge by abducting his daughter Alex, launching a relentless hunt against enemies prepared for his every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sjc9qXXmQoUWKQ3qIjS1nZaUJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327690'),
  ('1032897648859638883', 'One Million AC/DC', 1969, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ed De Priest, Gary Graver, Ed De Priest', 'Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Susan Berkely, Billy Wolf, Sharon Wells, Natasha, Nancy McGavin, Tod Badker, Tony Brooks, Pam English', null, 'A group of sex-crazed cave people are being harassed by a Tyrannosaurus Rex. While they try to figure out a way to deal with this threat, they have sex and eat a lot.', 'A group of sex-crazed cave people are being harassed by a Tyrannosaurus Rex. While they try to figure out a way to deal with this threat, they have sex and eat a lot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cERieJaGA0RdNNTrqaikRP7Q8FW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92385'),
  ('186845571766832282', 'One Million B.C.', 1940, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Norbert Brodine, Hal Roach, Hal Roach, Jr.', 'Mickell Novack, Joseph Frickert, George Baker', 'Victor Mature, Carole Landis, Lon Chaney Jr., John Hubbard, Mamo Clark, Inez Palange, Edgar Edwards, Nigel De Brulier', null, 'One Million B.C. is a 1940 American fantasy film produced by Hal Roach Studios and released by United Artists. It is also known by the titles Cave Man, Man and His Mate, and Tumak. The film stars Victor Mature as protagonist Tumak, a young cave man who strives to unite the uncivilized Rock Tribe and the peaceful Shell Tribe, Carole Landis as Loana, daughter of the Shell Tribe chief and Tumak''s love interest, and Lon Chaney, Jr. as Tumak''s stern father and leader of the Rock Tribe.', 'One Million B.C. is a 1940 American fantasy film produced by Hal Roach Studios and released by United Artists. It is also known by the titles Cave Man, Man and His Mate, and Tumak. The film stars Victor Mature as protagonist Tumak, a young cave man who strives to unite the uncivilized Rock Tribe and the peaceful Shell Tribe, Carole Landis as Loana, daughter of the Shell Tribe chief and Tumak''s love interest, and Lon Chaney, Jr. as Tumak''s stern father and leader of the Rock Tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quyzMg8yF0zhTW3oLkfY5cV3hPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3592'),
  ('353699960373951268', 'One Million Dollars', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Ettore Scola, Alessandro D''Eva, Dino De Palma', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola', 'Vittorio Gassman, Joan Collins, Jacques Bergerac, Hilda Barry, Dino Curcio, Aldo De Carellis, Pippo Starnazza, Alfredo Marchetti', null, 'Don Giuliano Niccolini Borges, Roman prince and member of the Pontifical Noble Guard, is very much attracted to Jane, an English girl he has met that is accompanying him on a pleasure trip to Switzerland. He has some plans for hanky-panky on their various stops along the route, but Jane has other plans as she is only with him because his car has a special-identification license plate and can go through customs without inspection. The car clears customs as does the stolen million dollars she is smuggling. Sandro, her former boyfriend is following and plans to hi-jack the loot, leaving Jane empty handed.', 'Don Giuliano Niccolini Borges, Roman prince and member of the Pontifical Noble Guard, is very much attracted to Jane, an English girl he has met that is accompanying him on a pleasure trip to Switzerland. He has some plans for hanky-panky on their various stops along the route, but Jane has other plans as she is only with him because his car has a special-identification license plate and can go through customs without inspection. The car clears customs as does the stolen million dollars she is smuggling. Sandro, her former boyfriend is following and plans to hi-jack the loot, leaving Jane empty handed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swnNbQgvrzcYeEmup10k8lhPnS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94136'),
  ('1135917877087506402', 'One Million Years B.C.', 1966, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Don Chaffey, Wilkie Cooper, Dennis Bertera', 'Mickell Novack, Joseph Frickert, George Baker', 'Raquel Welch, John Richardson, Percy Herbert, Robert Brown, Martine Beswick, Jean Wladon, Lisa Thomas, Yvonne Horner', 'NR', 'As the Earth wrestles with its agonizing birth, the peoples of this barren and desolate world struggle to survive. Driven by animal instinct they compete against the harsh conditions, their giant predators, and warring tribes. When two people from opposing clans fall in love, existing conventions are shattered forever as each tribe struggles for supremacy and Man embarks on his tortuous voyage of civilization.', 'As the Earth wrestles with its agonizing birth, the peoples of this barren and desolate world struggle to survive. Driven by animal instinct they compete against the harsh conditions, their giant predators, and warring tribes. When two people from opposing clans fall in love, existing conventions are shattered forever as each tribe struggles for supremacy and Man embarks on his tortuous voyage of civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0UqwGHnC4Lb0Iol8B4pUIBtAh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3591'),
  ('604540003957269243', 'One Million Yen Girl', 2008, 'Drama', 'Yuki Tanada, Kei Yasuda', 'Yuki Tanada', 'Yu Aoi, Ryusei Saito, Mirai Moriyama, Pierre Taki, Sumie Sasaki, Keisuke Horibe, Saya Yūki, Takashi Sasano', null, 'A 21-year-old girl is released from prison, only to deal with the neighborhood gossip about her and family conflicts. She decides to save one million yen, move to where no one knows her and keep repeating the process.', 'A 21-year-old girl is released from prison, only to deal with the neighborhood gossip about her and family conflicts. She decides to save one million yen, move to where no one knows her and keep repeating the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtsVcg3iLYNWmTRgt0FKEcPpsjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69454'),
  ('444594816774027802', 'One Million-Year Trip: Bander Book', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Osamu Tezuka, Hiroshi Nishimura, Satoshi Kato', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Yu Mizushima, Mami Koyama, Masatô Ibu, Iemasa Kayumi, Masako Oka, Tōru Ōhira, Reiko Mutoh, Kyoji Kobayashi', null, 'Bander is a 17-year-old boy from Earth who lives on a distant planet, which is populated by human shape-shifters who feed off of vegetables and animal tails. Violence soon breaks out, as invaders launch an attack on Bander''s new planet. This was Japan''s first 2-hour animated film for television. The program received high ratings when broadcast as part of a set of 24-hour TV programs called "Ai wa Chikyu wo Sukuu" on Nippon Television. After a long gap since his last animated film for television, this work fully reflects Osamu Tezuka''s desire to achieve theatrical quality with this production.', 'Bander is a 17-year-old boy from Earth who lives on a distant planet, which is populated by human shape-shifters who feed off of vegetables and animal tails. Violence soon breaks out, as invaders launch an attack on Bander''s new planet. This was Japan''s first 2-hour animated film for television. The program received high ratings when broadcast as part of a set of 24-hour TV programs called "Ai wa Chikyu wo Sukuu" on Nippon Television. After a long gap since his last animated film for television, this work fully reflects Osamu Tezuka''s desire to achieve theatrical quality with this production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RbRaQNtLkmo1JCAbWW6vgajcvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83212'),
  ('126279625325053495', 'One Minute to Zero', 1952, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Tay Garnett, Lewis J. Rachmil, William E. Snyder', 'Milton Krims, William Wister Haines', 'Robert Mitchum, Ann Blyth, William Talman, Charles McGraw, Margaret Sheridan, Richard Egan, Eduard Franz, Robert Osterloh', 'NR', 'An idealistic United Nations official learns the harrowing truth about war when she falls in love with an American officer charged with the evacuation of civilians. As hostilities escalate, the officer and his small detachment are left to hold the line until allied forces can be brought into action.', 'An idealistic United Nations official learns the harrowing truth about war when she falls in love with an American officer charged with the evacuation of civilians. As hostilities escalate, the officer and his small detachment are left to hold the line until allied forces can be brought into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b25HmJ1qzkBKB8lreqnBHfrZzsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205463'),
  ('418595770364908899', 'One Missed Call', 2003, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Takashi Miike, Kato Fumiaki, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Minako Daira', 'Ko Shibasaki, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Kazue Fukiishi, Anna Nagata, Atsushi Ida, Mariko Tsutsui, Azusa, Karen Ôshima', null, 'People mysteriously start receiving voicemail messages from their future selves, in the form of the sound of them reacting to their own violent deaths, along with the exact date and time of their future death, listed on the message log. The plot thickens as the surviving characters pursue the answers to this mystery which could save their lives.', 'People mysteriously start receiving voicemail messages from their future selves, in the form of the sound of them reacting to their own violent deaths, along with the exact date and time of their future death, listed on the message log. The plot thickens as the surviving characters pursue the answers to this mystery which could save their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ujSEEePCVMyi7Mt1RQMXd6SWmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9694'),
  ('324655151700917235', 'One Missed Call', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Glen MacPherson, Eric Valette, Richard L. Fox', 'Andrew Klavan', 'Shannyn Sossamon, Edward Burns, Ana Claudia Talancón, Ray Wise, Azura Skye, Johnny Lewis, Meagan Good, Jason Beghe', 'PG-13', 'Several people start receiving voice-mails from their future selves -- messages which include the date, time, and some of the details of their deaths.', 'Several people start receiving voice-mails from their future selves -- messages which include the date, time, and some of the details of their deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pIvQaQV0sMHx7d3Ys9qTK9YqTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6933'),
  ('167002854700912195', 'One Missed Call 2', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Renpei Tsukamoto, Renpei Tsukamoto, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Minako Daira', 'Mimura, Hisashi Yoshizawa, Asaka Seto, Shadow Liu Chih-Yuh, Hakobu Okubo, Karen Ôshima, Renji Ishibashi, Haruko Wanibuchi', null, 'A Japanese restaurant cook/owner dies after answering his daughter''s cellphone. Other people are getting strange, same ringtone calls as well and dying painfully. It happened in Taiwan as well. Can the police stop it if it''s a ghost?', 'A Japanese restaurant cook/owner dies after answering his daughter''s cellphone. Other people are getting strange, same ringtone calls as well and dying painfully. It happened in Taiwan as well. Can the police stop it if it''s a ghost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbEtfU4WcwKG84dHpSPJV9KZTqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14021'),
  ('174885940554653435', 'One Missed Call 3: Final', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Manabu Asô, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Minako Daira, Jiro Shin', 'Maki Horikita, Meisa Kuroki, Jang Keun-suk, Erika Asakura, Yû Kamiwaki, Rie Tsuneyoshi, Arisa Naito, Gakuto Furuhara', null, 'The timid, young Asuka is bullied by her classmates. When they embark on a class field trip to Korea, Asuka plans revenge by sending them a cursed phone message they can either pass on or die.', 'The timid, young Asuka is bullied by her classmates. When they embark on a class field trip to Korea, Asuka plans revenge by sending them a cursed phone message they can either pass on or die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3CUkjgEAJoYpcI5MKhhOYnL3lM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55470'),
  ('1045855904628395492', 'One More Kiss', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vadim Jean, Mike Fox', 'Suzie Halewood', 'Valerie Edmond, Gerard Butler, Valerie Gogan, James Cosmo, Danny Nussbaum, Carl Proctor, Dilys Miller, Ron Guthrie', null, 'When Sarah Hopson realizes her successful high-rise New York lifestyle is devoid of meaning, she packs her bags and heads for her home town in the Scottish Borders to look for Sam, her childhood sweetheart and the only man she ever loved. Sam Murray runs a restaurant. He and Sarah grew up together and Sam hoped they''d grow old together. His world fell apart the day Sarah left and now she''s back, standing on his doorstep and telling his wife she''d like to spend some time with him. Written by NybergerMeister', 'When Sarah Hopson realizes her successful high-rise New York lifestyle is devoid of meaning, she packs her bags and heads for her home town in the Scottish Borders to look for Sam, her childhood sweetheart and the only man she ever loved. Sam Murray runs a restaurant. He and Sarah grew up together and Sam hoped they''d grow old together. His world fell apart the day Sarah left and now she''s back, standing on his doorstep and telling his wife she''d like to spend some time with him. Written by NybergerMeister', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAI3HiLpNMhadukT4c4QcqgpHpK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54623'),
  ('224412519694108759', 'One More Shot', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Tang Qiaojia, Tang Hu', 'Shi Chao', 'Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Jiang Yiyi, Wang Zhipeng, Song Ziqiao, Liu Weizhou, Diego Dati, Tang Hu', null, 'After his wife''s death professional bodyguard Lung Wei went overseas to find doctors for his daughter, but instead found a new job as a virtual reality tester.', 'After his wife''s death professional bodyguard Lung Wei went overseas to find doctors for his daughter, but instead found a new job as a virtual reality tester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NwORQmefgrKPfo5eQ3gp8sVAWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875279'),
  ('627761507864713973', 'One More Shot', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'James Nunn, Job Reineke', 'Jamie Russell', 'Scott Adkins, Michael Jai White, Alexis Knapp, Meena Rayann, Waleed Elgadi, Hannah Arterton, Tom Berenger, Jill Winternitz', 'R', 'Following the attack on the black site in Poland, Navy SEAL Jake Harris is ordered to escort terrorist suspect Amin Mansur to Washington D.C. for interrogation. Before the prisoner transfer process is complete, though, the airport is attacked by a group of heavily armed, well-trained mercenaries.', 'Following the attack on the black site in Poland, Navy SEAL Jake Harris is ordered to escort terrorist suspect Amin Mansur to Washington D.C. for interrogation. Before the prisoner transfer process is complete, though, the airport is attacked by a group of heavily armed, well-trained mercenaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XxnWZzhMC1rOzUCJpc6CzmBIQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214314'),
  ('682787122601541162', 'One More Time', 1931, 'Music, Animation, Comedy', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Carman Maxwell', null, 'Foxy the Cop is trying to enforce the law in town, but dangerous drivers and strangers who also kidnap Roxy are making this difficult.', 'Foxy the Cop is trying to enforce the law in town, but dangerous drivers and strangers who also kidnap Roxy are making this difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6axXNBvFYoO3LYEusIk15PlS8SZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162704'),
  ('134629990807955940', 'One More Time', 1970, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Jerry Lewis, David Bracknell, Ernest Steward', 'Michael Pertwee', 'Sammy Davis Jr., Peter Lawford, John Wood, Dudley Sutton, Maggie Wright, Ester Anderson, Percy Herbert, Anthony Nicholls', 'PG', 'London nightclub buddies Salt and Pepper link Pepper''s dead twin to diamond smugglers.', 'London nightclub buddies Salt and Pepper link Pepper''s dead twin to diamond smugglers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iKmyQYfd4xgGSHUMhHsjTbry1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33733'),
  ('994344282296157965', 'One More Time', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Robert Edwards, Anne Etheridge', 'Robert Edwards', 'Christopher Walken, Amber Heard, Kelli Garner, Hamish Linklater, Ann Magnuson, Oliver Platt, Henry Kelemen, Sandra Berrios', null, 'Beautiful aspiring rock star Jude is stuck in a rut - relegated to recording commercial jingles and lost in a series of one night stands. When she is evicted from her Brooklyn apartment, she is forced to move into the Hamptons home of her wealthy - and selfish - father Paul Lombard, an over-the-hill, Sinatra-esque crooner angling for a musical comeback.', 'Beautiful aspiring rock star Jude is stuck in a rut - relegated to recording commercial jingles and lost in a series of one night stands. When she is evicted from her Brooklyn apartment, she is forced to move into the Hamptons home of her wealthy - and selfish - father Paul Lombard, an over-the-hill, Sinatra-esque crooner angling for a musical comeback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrZ1azTISRD91tcYCeMk7lhhYgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321030'),
  ('866598214184523673', 'One More Time', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Parvin Yazdani, Jonatan Etzler, André Forström', 'Tove Forsman, Sofie Forsman', 'Hedda Stiernstedt, Evelyn Mok, Vanna Rosenberg, Tove Edfeldt, Miriam Ingrid, David Tainton, Ahmed Berhan, Lo Kauppi', 'R', 'On her 40th birthday, Amelia makes a fateful wish to be 18 again back in 2002 but soon regrets it when she''s stuck reliving the day over and over again.', 'On her 40th birthday, Amelia makes a fateful wish to be 18 again back in 2002 but soon regrets it when she''s stuck reliving the day over and over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLWDiTJWKgPuyQuuD0zDRhwU2y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100962'),
  ('550202383887737969', 'One More Train to Rob', 1971, 'Western, Comedy', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Alric Edens', 'Don Tait, Dick Nelson', 'George Peppard, Diana Muldaur, John Vernon, France Nuyen, Steve Sandor, Soon-Tek Oh, Richard Loo, Robert Donner', 'PG', 'Harker Flet and compatriots Timothy X. Nolan and Katy, along with three other men, steal $40,000 in money and jewelry from a California train in the gold-mining country of the 1880''s. The six split up and while they are hiding out awaiting the rendezvous to divide the loot, Hark is cornered, framed and sent to prison. He is released after two-and-a-half years and sets out to find Katy and Nolan and get his share of the loot.', 'Harker Flet and compatriots Timothy X. Nolan and Katy, along with three other men, steal $40,000 in money and jewelry from a California train in the gold-mining country of the 1880''s. The six split up and while they are hiding out awaiting the rendezvous to divide the loot, Hark is cornered, framed and sent to prison. He is released after two-and-a-half years and sets out to find Katy and Nolan and get his share of the loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEepyzaikVucRY8ENbueONo1G3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142148'),
  ('133987637765279520', 'One Must Live Dangerously', 1975, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Claude Makovski, Nelly Kaplan', 'Nelly Kaplan, Claude Makovski, Claude Veillot', 'Annie Girardot, Claude Brasseur, Hans Christian Blech, Sydne Rome, Roger Blin, Daniel Ivernel, Gérard Séty, Roland Lesaffre', null, 'Richard is a private detective. He makes a good money from marital infidelity: the deceived husband and wife generously paid him for proof of their infidelity "halves"...', 'Richard is a private detective. He makes a good money from marital infidelity: the deceived husband and wife generously paid him for proof of their infidelity "halves"...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jRlrQR4FTfUMcTrTJHLz5LBhcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102323'),
  ('7962731960875628', 'One Mysterious Night', 1944, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Budd Boetticher, L. William O''Connell, Milton Feldman', 'Paul Yawitz, Jack Boyle', 'Chester Morris, Janis Carter, William Wright, Richard Lane, George E. Stone, Robert B. Williams, Mark Roberts, Dorothy Malone', 'NR', 'After a rare gem is stolen from an exhibition at a posh hotel, Inspector Farraday decides to recruit former thief Boston Blackie to find the stone. Along with his assistant, "The Runt", Blackie focuses his investigation on the hotel manager, George Daley, and his sister, Eileen. Through disguises and ruses, Blackie and the Runt try to trick their way to discovering the thieves.', 'After a rare gem is stolen from an exhibition at a posh hotel, Inspector Farraday decides to recruit former thief Boston Blackie to find the stone. Along with his assistant, "The Runt", Blackie focuses his investigation on the hotel manager, George Daley, and his sister, Eileen. Through disguises and ruses, Blackie and the Runt try to trick their way to discovering the thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxwh3o5mRGIZF0StbXPe2CV8zjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69700'),
  ('98852516846557236', 'One Nation, One King', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Julien Hirsch, Pierre Schoeller', 'Pierre Schoeller', 'Gaspard Ulliel, Adèle Haenel, Olivier Gourmet, Louis Garrel, Izïa Higelin, Noémie Lvovsky, Céline Sallette, Denis Lavant', null, '„Un peuple et son roi" crosses the destinies of the men and women of the population, and those of historical figures. Their meeting place is the newly founded National Assembly. At the heart of the story lie the fate of the king and the birth of the French Republic.', '„Un peuple et son roi" crosses the destinies of the men and women of the population, and those of historical figures. Their meeting place is the newly founded National Assembly. At the heart of the story lie the fate of the king and the birth of the French Republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHry6P7kIlGXlDbkmNPicqaJrJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463387'),
  ('279073267950451284', 'One Night', 2012, 'Drama', 'Lucas Belvaux, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Lucas Belvaux', 'Yvan Attal, Sophie Quinton, Nicole Garcia, François Feroleto, Natacha Régnier, Patrick Descamps, Didier Sandre, Bernard Mazzinghi', null, 'In the harbor city of Le Havre, France, a woman is stabbed during the night, just below the windows of her neighborhood. Pierre (Yvan Attal) has witnessed the murder, and heard the wails of the women crying for help. So have the neighbors, certainly. But at the end, nobody called the police. Nevertheless, sorrows are too heavy for Pierre, which feel the needs to tell everything to his wife (Sophie Quinton), and to the police. During the investigation, it appears that 38 people witnessed the murdering, and none reacted...', 'In the harbor city of Le Havre, France, a woman is stabbed during the night, just below the windows of her neighborhood. Pierre (Yvan Attal) has witnessed the murder, and heard the wails of the women crying for help. So have the neighbors, certainly. But at the end, nobody called the police. Nevertheless, sorrows are too heavy for Pierre, which feel the needs to tell everything to his wife (Sophie Quinton), and to the police. During the investigation, it appears that 38 people witnessed the murdering, and none reacted...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtMWw10XHdRce57jAdpH2YAv55x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95191'),
  ('357311277188288110', 'One Night', 2019, 'Drama', 'Kazuya Shiraishi, Katsuhito Motegi, Atsuhiro Nabeshima', 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Takeru Satoh, Ryohei Suzuki, Mayu Matsuoka, Yuko Tanaka, Takuma Otoo, Mariko Tsutsui, Yōsuke Asari, Hanae Kan', null, 'A family reunites after 15 years. They each have a story to tell as they have not forgotten what happened years ago.', 'A family reunites after 15 years. They each have a story to tell as they have not forgotten what happened years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCmC9JNQ5qDYnU4Z4fo6f2u8W9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595112'),
  ('285948343500953171', 'One Night at McCool''s', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Harald Zwart, Karl Walter Lindenlaub', 'Stan Seidel', 'Matt Dillon, Liv Tyler, Michael Douglas, Paul Reiser, Reba McEntire, John Goodman, Richard Jenkins, Andrew Dice Clay', 'R', 'On an ordinary night, in an ordinary part of town, a beautiful young woman walks into a bar. Her name is Jewel, and before long she is chatting to bartender Randy. The pair leave together, but he ends up getting into a tussle with her criminal boyfriend, who she then shoots dead, later persuading Randy to take the rap for her. But this isn''t the end of it, as both Randy''s cousin Carl and the detective assigned to the murder case also fall for Jewel''s charms and find themselves caught up in the ensuing events. It seems that any man who meets Jewel falls instantly in love with her, and she''s going to use this fully to her own advantage, leaving a trail of havoc in her wake. It also seems that she is going to get away with it - that is, until Randy decides to hire a hitman...', 'On an ordinary night, in an ordinary part of town, a beautiful young woman walks into a bar. Her name is Jewel, and before long she is chatting to bartender Randy. The pair leave together, but he ends up getting into a tussle with her criminal boyfriend, who she then shoots dead, later persuading Randy to take the rap for her. But this isn''t the end of it, as both Randy''s cousin Carl and the detective assigned to the murder case also fall for Jewel''s charms and find themselves caught up in the ensuing events. It seems that any man who meets Jewel falls instantly in love with her, and she''s going to use this fully to her own advantage, leaving a trail of havoc in her wake. It also seems that she is going to get away with it - that is, until Randy decides to hire a hitman...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIJAjhdMqraB1tkSii9BWuUXd8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2144'),
  ('1014322211160784250', 'One Night in Bangkok', 2020, 'Action, Thriller', 'Wych Kaosayananda, Wych Kaosayananda, Prasit Wongjiraithitikarn', 'Wych Kaosayananda', 'Mark Dacascos, Vanida Golten, Michael S. New, Kane Kosugi, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Julie Condra, Charlie Ruedpokanon, Prinya Intachai', 'R', 'A hit man named Kai flies into Bangkok, gets a gun, and orders a cab. He offers a professional female driver big money to be his all-night driver. But when she realizes Kai is committing brutal murders at each stop, it''s too late to walk away. Meanwhile, an offbeat police detective races to decode the string of slayings before more blood is spilled.', 'A hit man named Kai flies into Bangkok, gets a gun, and orders a cab. He offers a professional female driver big money to be his all-night driver. But when she realizes Kai is committing brutal murders at each stop, it''s too late to walk away. Meanwhile, an offbeat police detective races to decode the string of slayings before more blood is spilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4kPwXPlM1iy8Jf3S1uuLuwqQAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721452'),
  ('122456277257376528', 'One Night in Miami...', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mark Anthony Little, Kevin O''Neil, Kate Ransome Wilcox', 'Kemp Powers', 'Kingsley Ben-Adir, Eli Goree, Aldis Hodge, Leslie Odom Jr., Joaquina Kalukango, Nicolette Robinson, Michael Imperioli, Lawrence Gilliard Jr.', 'R', 'In the aftermath of Cassius Clay''s defeat of Sonny Liston in 1964, the boxer meets with Malcolm X, Sam Cooke and Jim Brown to change the course of history in the segregated South.', 'In the aftermath of Cassius Clay''s defeat of Sonny Liston in 1964, the boxer meets with Malcolm X, Sam Cooke and Jim Brown to change the course of history in the segregated South.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DLUb9PTDqXMSgsD7RmiJs7ZJIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661914'),
  ('66888065817801886', 'One Night in Paris', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Mehdi Idir', null, 'Roman Frayssinet, Kyan Khojandi, Djimo Salim, Kev Adams, Bun-hay Mean, Vérino, Hakim Jemili, Pierre-Emmanuel Barré', null, 'Mixing sketches with rapid-fire sets, this special brings together top comedians from France''s stand-up scene as they explore life during the pandemic.', 'Mixing sketches with rapid-fire sets, this special brings together top comedians from France''s stand-up scene as they explore life during the pandemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpOKq3yTnSxjbjxonKt1tNFVni0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879931'),
  ('1125535163479913546', 'One Night in Supermarket', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Yang Qing', 'Yang Qing', 'Li Xiaolu, Xu Zheng, Qiao Renliang, Zhao Yingjun, Zhang Jiayi, Yang Qing, Li Wei Jian, Wang Dongfang', null, 'A supermarket employees plots revenge against his bosses who refused to pay out a winning lottery ticket.', 'A supermarket employees plots revenge against his bosses who refused to pay out a winning lottery ticket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UU4DIAiZDYYmCJynmg7y14VPEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64377'),
  ('115383392785423176', 'One Night in the Tropics', 1940, 'Music, Comedy', 'A. Edward Sutherland, Joseph A. McDonough, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Gertrude Purcell, Charles Grayson', 'Allan Jones, Nancy Kelly, Robert Cummings, Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Mary Boland, William Frawley, Peggy Moran', 'NR', 'Jim "Lucky" Moore, an insurance salesman, comes up with a novel policy for his friend, Steve: a ''love insurance policy'', that will pay out $1-million if Steve does not marry his fiancée, Cynthia. The upcoming marriage is jeopardized by Steve''s ex-girlfriend, Mickey, and Cynthia''s disapproving Aunt Kitty. The policy is underwritten by a nightclub owner, Roscoe, who sends two enforcers - Abbott and Costello - to ensure that the wedding occurs as planned.', 'Jim "Lucky" Moore, an insurance salesman, comes up with a novel policy for his friend, Steve: a ''love insurance policy'', that will pay out $1-million if Steve does not marry his fiancée, Cynthia. The upcoming marriage is jeopardized by Steve''s ex-girlfriend, Mickey, and Cynthia''s disapproving Aunt Kitty. The policy is underwritten by a nightclub owner, Roscoe, who sends two enforcers - Abbott and Costello - to ensure that the wedding occurs as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpyQH6JTH7K9frevWmCPQ7U3U6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29605'),
