  ('748258107156201589', 'One of Them Days', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Lawrence Lamont, Ava Berkofsky, Colin Flaherty', 'Syreeta Singleton', 'Keke Palmer, SZA, Joshua David Neal, Aziza Scott, Patrick Cage, Katt Williams, Maude Apatow, Vanessa Bell Calloway', 'R', 'Best friends and roommates Dreux and Alyssa are about to have One of Them Days. When they discover Alyssa’s boyfriend has blown their rent money, the duo finds themselves going to extremes in a comical race against the clock to avoid eviction and keep their friendship intact.', 'Best friends and roommates Dreux and Alyssa are about to have One of Them Days. When they discover Alyssa’s boyfriend has blown their rent money, the duo finds themselves going to extremes in a comical race against the clock to avoid eviction and keep their friendship intact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccn6bFUA5DECjA3Lo0CuJqGNQCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280672'),
  ('837075772306163909', 'One of Those Days When Hemme Dies', 2024, 'Drama', 'Murat Fıratoğlu, Selahattin Kerem Köz, Semih Yıldız', 'Murat Fıratoğlu', 'Murat Fıratoğlu, Sefer Fıratoğlu, Salih Taşçı, Güneş Sayın, Ali Barkın, Fırat Bozan, Mehmet Talay, Ramazan Zincirkıran', null, 'Eyüp works relentlessly under the blazing sun during a tomato harvest in southeastern Turkey, driven by the urgent need to settle an impending debt. After a clash with his supervisor, he roams the city in search of a radical solution.', 'Eyüp works relentlessly under the blazing sun during a tomato harvest in southeastern Turkey, driven by the urgent need to settle an impending debt. After a clash with his supervisor, he roams the city in search of a radical solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceuU2DIr9GZmt584t0SUGyvCdZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320279'),
