  ('727922485211432583', 'One on One', 2017, 'Romance', 'Jeong Mi-na', null, 'Seo Han, Yoon Se-na, Sang Woo, Baek Se-ri, Ahn So-hee', null, 'Do-yeong is unemployed after graduating college of physical education but gets a job as a trainer in the gym. There, he meets Se-hee, a beautiful and famous sports caster who lives in his neighborhood. He tries to buy her attention but fails several times. Meanwhile, Do-yeong finds out that the gym is planning a way to use Se-hee and he sets out to save her. What is going on during the 1:1 sessions at the gym and what is the plot behind it?', 'Do-yeong is unemployed after graduating college of physical education but gets a job as a trainer in the gym. There, he meets Se-hee, a beautiful and famous sports caster who lives in his neighborhood. He tries to buy her attention but fails several times. Meanwhile, Do-yeong finds out that the gym is planning a way to use Se-hee and he sets out to save her. What is going on during the 1:1 sessions at the gym and what is the plot behind it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ7A6bubHPxKSOJjiZdx0z33fKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471831'),
  ('816856559630891331', 'One on Top of the Other', 1969, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Lucio Fulci, Massimo Castellani, Albino Cocco', 'José Luis Martínez Mollá, Lucio Fulci, Roberto Gianviti', 'Jean Sorel, Marisa Mell, Elsa Martinelli, Alberto de Mendoza, John Ireland, Riccardo Cucciolla, Franco Balducci, Bill Vanders', null, 'A San Francisco doctor encounters a prostitute who bears a striking resemblance to his late wife.', 'A San Francisco doctor encounters a prostitute who bears a striking resemblance to his late wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHq7UY8edzYHoVjkhJVXln8sWYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2993'),
  ('126658668630745291', 'One or the Other of Us', 1974, 'Thriller', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Charly Steinberger, Gaby Werth', 'Manfred Purzer', 'Klaus Schwarzkopf, Elke Sommer, Jürgen Prochnow, Ulla Jacobsson, Kristina Nel, Walter Gross, Anita Kupsch, Berta Drews', null, 'Psychological thriller that focuses on the intense conflict between a university professor and a blackmailer.', 'Psychological thriller that focuses on the intense conflict between a university professor and a blackmailer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htPpTe7ONEVSiy41dyc3IEswttd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197964'),
  ('764516658818061115', 'One Out of Two', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eugenio Cappuccio, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Fabio Volo, Eugenio Cappuccio, Francesco Cenni', 'Fabio Volo, Anita Caprioli, Giuseppe Battiston, Ninetto Davoli, Tresy Taddei, Paola Rota, Francesco Crescimone, Manuela Spartà', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coZghndxx0OAgGFslG4ru1bkvb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48239'),
  ('909685849397028826', 'One Perfect Day', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Jee-woon, Kim Woo-hyung', 'Kim Jee-woon', 'Yoon Kye-sang, Park Shin-hye, Park Soo-jin, Ahn Nae-sang, Kim Pub-lae', null, 'Searching for love, a young man goes through a series of unsuccessful dates. As yet another girl walks out on him he laments on his father''s life advice.', 'Searching for love, a young man goes through a series of unsuccessful dates. As yet another girl walks out on him he laments on his father''s life advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOKtvuLpJERID6xVV77u7KVWkxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193696'),
  ('229599446365356190', 'One Perfect Wedding', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Gary Yates, Dave T. Nall, Dana Barnaby', 'Erinne Dobson', 'Taylor Cole, Jack Turner, Rukiya Bernard, Dewshane Williams, Linda Ko, Lossen Chambers, Amitai Marmorstein, Blake Stadel', 'G', 'With Cara leaving on an international book tour in two weeks and Ben’s business expansion keeping him busy, the couple decides they won’t let work commitments postpone their nuptials any longer. With the help of their best friends Megan and Sean, Cara and Ben feel nothing can stop them from having the perfect wedding.', 'With Cara leaving on an international book tour in two weeks and Ben’s business expansion keeping him busy, the couple decides they won’t let work commitments postpone their nuptials any longer. With the help of their best friends Megan and Sean, Cara and Ben feel nothing can stop them from having the perfect wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqhml0SdBMHJ0VmpDGU73BQdA36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795982'),
  ('905531787801649749', 'One Piece "3D2Y": Overcome Ace''s Death! Luffy''s Vow to his Friends', 2014, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Aya Komaki, Yukihiko Nakao, Kodai Watanabe', 'Hirohiko Uesaka, Jin Tanaka, Tomohiro Nakayama', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Arata Furuta, Bin Shimada, Fumihiko Tachiki, Hiroaki Hirata, Hirohiko Kakegawa', 'PG-13', 'The special takes place during the two year before the Straw Hats reunite on Sabody. Luffy is currently in Rusukaina training to get stronger to take on the New World. However the training is interrupted when Hancock''s sisters, Marigold and Sandersonia, are kidnapped by the Byrnndi World, a pirate who was locked away on Level 6 of Impel Down but escaped during Luffy''s invasion to save Ace, in order to lure Hancock to him and use her as a hostage against the World Government due to her Shichibukai status. Thus Luffy and Hancock head off to confront him and save Hancock''s sisters.', 'The special takes place during the two year before the Straw Hats reunite on Sabody. Luffy is currently in Rusukaina training to get stronger to take on the New World. However the training is interrupted when Hancock''s sisters, Marigold and Sandersonia, are kidnapped by the Byrnndi World, a pirate who was locked away on Level 6 of Impel Down but escaped during Luffy''s invasion to save Ace, in order to lure Hancock to him and use her as a hostage against the World Government due to her Shichibukai status. Thus Luffy and Hancock head off to confront him and save Hancock''s sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caUI7YlhVXykFWQ7Ul7RQ2wQRpv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290271'),
  ('388875430635247452', 'One Piece 3D: Gekisou! Trap Coaster', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Hiroaki Hirata, Kappei Yamaguchi, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', null, 'Luffy continues his voyage with the Straw Hat Pirates in hopes of becoming the Pirate King. That is until he crosses paths with one of the Marine’s most intelligent captains, Captain Trap. Determined to capture Luffy, the captain attacks the Thousand Sunny with various traps he created. His intention is to make Luffy his right hand man.', 'Luffy continues his voyage with the Straw Hat Pirates in hopes of becoming the Pirate King. That is until he crosses paths with one of the Marine’s most intelligent captains, Captain Trap. Determined to capture Luffy, the captain attacks the Thousand Sunny with various traps he created. His intention is to make Luffy his right hand man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnCH5BL1Oamkj1JqZhSv9wcpJuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462387'),
  ('656110002108397128', 'One Piece 3D: Straw Hat Chase', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Hiroyuki Satou, Masanori Ikeda', 'Yasuyuki Tsutsumi', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', 'PG-13', 'One Piece 3D: Straw Hat Chase is the 11th One Piece film of the series, and is set before the time-skip. This is One Piece''s first movie release to be in 3D CGI. The movie is also the first One Piece film since Movie 3 to be a double-feature. This time, the film was featured with "Toriko 3D: Gourmet Adventure", both being billed as the "Jump Heroes Film". The double-feature was released on March 19, 2011.', 'One Piece 3D: Straw Hat Chase is the 11th One Piece film of the series, and is set before the time-skip. This is One Piece''s first movie release to be in 3D CGI. The movie is also the first One Piece film since Movie 3 to be a double-feature. This time, the film was featured with "Toriko 3D: Gourmet Adventure", both being billed as the "Jump Heroes Film". The double-feature was released on March 19, 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYm3oEPiQJ9RV5QdyudwUplb9cD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79082'),
  ('738194352653014759', 'One Piece Episode of Merry: The Tale of One More Friend', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Katsumi Tokoro', null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', 'PG-13', 'On a test-run of the Mini Merry, Usopp tells Brook the story of the Going Merry, a ship that served the crew well. However, to the Straw Hats, the Going Merry was not just a ship: It was a priceless, irreplaceable friend. *Scenes have been recreated with brand-new animation.', 'On a test-run of the Mini Merry, Usopp tells Brook the story of the Going Merry, a ship that served the crew well. However, to the Straw Hats, the Going Merry was not just a ship: It was a priceless, irreplaceable friend. *Scenes have been recreated with brand-new animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zeq8BFximXGWbOjUC8XbtYY4Jq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245538'),
  ('1148241233435188689', 'One Piece Episode of Nami: Tears of a Navigator and the Bonds of Friends', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Katsumi Tokoro', null, 'Akemi Okamura, Jurota Kosugi, Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Noriko Hidaka, Masaya Onosaka', 'PG-13', 'After Nami steals the Going Merry, Roronoa Zoro, Usopp, and later Monkey D. Luffy and Sanji (along with Johnny and Yosaku) set after her and wind up in Cocoyasi Village, Nami''s hometown ruled by the tyrannical fishman Arlong. It is here that Nami''s past and true motives come to light.', 'After Nami steals the Going Merry, Roronoa Zoro, Usopp, and later Monkey D. Luffy and Sanji (along with Johnny and Yosaku) set after her and wind up in Cocoyasi Village, Nami''s hometown ruled by the tyrannical fishman Arlong. It is here that Nami''s past and true motives come to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQRqA01wCnJGpxYu2KpZQ2W0osj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215180'),
  ('412391146847786904', 'One Piece Episode of Sabo: The Three Brothers'' Bond - The Miraculous Reunion and the Inherited Will', 2015, 'Action, Animation, TV Movie', 'Gou Koga, Keiichi Ichikawa, Kumi Nakajou', 'Hirohiko Uesaka', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Toru Furuya, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Akemi Okamura, Hideyuki Tanaka, Hiroaki Hirata, Hiroshi Kamiya', 'PG-13', 'From a brotherhood bound by three cups of sake, one brother’s story has yet to be told! Visiting Dressrosa under orders of the Revolutionary Army, Sabo’s top-secret mission derails when Doflamingo announces the grand prize for battling in the Colosseum. The tragedy at Marineford still weighing on his mind, Sabo reunites with his little brother to protect the promises they made with Ace. Now, they’ll fight in disguise for the Colosseum’s ultimate prize: Ace’s Flame-Flame Fruit.', 'From a brotherhood bound by three cups of sake, one brother’s story has yet to be told! Visiting Dressrosa under orders of the Revolutionary Army, Sabo’s top-secret mission derails when Doflamingo announces the grand prize for battling in the Colosseum. The tragedy at Marineford still weighing on his mind, Sabo reunites with his little brother to protect the promises they made with Ace. Now, they’ll fight in disguise for the Colosseum’s ultimate prize: Ace’s Flame-Flame Fruit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yS5z6jMr5reJN6WwtBQcnKQ8b75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373877'),
  ('179868522859779399', 'One Piece Film Red', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Shigefumi Shingaki, Tu Yong-ce, Junichi Hayama', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Shuichi Ikeda, Kaori Nazuka, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'A new adventure begins for Luffy and his crew when mysterious pop superstar Uta unveils her identity — and launches a misguided plan for world peace.', 'A new adventure begins for Luffy and his crew when mysterious pop superstar Uta unveils her identity — and launches a misguided plan for world peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ibfhe4P7rhmn3lrPhOZzIJHA2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900667'),
  ('1015259342209244275', 'One Piece Film: GOLD', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Naoyuki Wada, Hiroaki Miyamoto, Masayuki Sato', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa, Clint Bickham', 'Kazuya Nakai, Mayumi Tanaka, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Ikue Otani, Kazuki Yao', 'PG-13', 'The glittering Gran Tesoro, a city of entertainment beyond the laws of the government, is a sanctuary for the world’s most infamous pirates, Marines, and filthy rich millionaires. Drawn by dreams of hitting the jackpot, Captain Luffy and his crew sail straight for the gold. But behind the gilded curtains lies a powerful king whose deep pockets and deeper ambitions spell disaster for the Straw Hats and the New World alike.', 'The glittering Gran Tesoro, a city of entertainment beyond the laws of the government, is a sanctuary for the world’s most infamous pirates, Marines, and filthy rich millionaires. Drawn by dreams of hitting the jackpot, Captain Luffy and his crew sail straight for the gold. But behind the gilded curtains lies a powerful king whose deep pockets and deeper ambitions spell disaster for the Straw Hats and the New World alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PgiOFTLZXP7emlwcIt0yRasJ9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374205'),
  ('880835744616165271', 'One Piece Film: Strong World', 2009, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Munehisa Sakai, Kazuhiro Yamada, Masayuki Sato', 'Hirohiko Uesaka', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', 'PG-13', '20 years after his escape from Impel Down, the legendary pirate Shiki, the Golden Lion, reappears causing massive upheaval to the Marines. During his long seclusion, he was able to come up with a scheme to bring the World Government to his knees. On his way to execute the plan, Shiki crosses paths with the Straw Hat Pirates and becomes so impressed with Nami''s knowledge of meteorology that he abducts her to forcedly enlist her into his crew. Luffy and the gang end up on a strange land populated with monstrous beasts as they desperately search for Shiki and Nami.', '20 years after his escape from Impel Down, the legendary pirate Shiki, the Golden Lion, reappears causing massive upheaval to the Marines. During his long seclusion, he was able to come up with a scheme to bring the World Government to his knees. On his way to execute the plan, Shiki crosses paths with the Straw Hat Pirates and becomes so impressed with Nami''s knowledge of meteorology that he abducts her to forcedly enlist her into his crew. Luffy and the gang end up on a strange land populated with monstrous beasts as they desperately search for Shiki and Nami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9S39hH4IOX9Hmtn3zho3Wdqem8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41498'),
  ('711404913735767288', 'One Piece Film: Z', 2012, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Tatsuya Nagamine, Takeo Ogiwara, Daiki Nakazawa', 'Osamu Suzuki', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', 'PG-13', 'Zephyr, now known as Z, rides the seas with only one goal: Destroy all pirates and their dreams at becoming King of Pirates. When Luffy and his crew encounter him at sea, not only are they utterly defeated by the man with an arm made of Seastone, Nami, Robin, and Chopper are turned 10 years younger due to Z''s minion Ain. Luffy is so determined to win against him that he does not even notice Z''s master plan that could sacrifice thousands of lives.', 'Zephyr, now known as Z, rides the seas with only one goal: Destroy all pirates and their dreams at becoming King of Pirates. When Luffy and his crew encounter him at sea, not only are they utterly defeated by the man with an arm made of Seastone, Nami, Robin, and Chopper are turned 10 years younger due to Z''s minion Ain. Luffy is so determined to win against him that he does not even notice Z''s master plan that could sacrifice thousands of lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dd0HwfxstffjRgbBcQvtw3uqS6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176983'),
  ('883107843902265644', 'One Piece Special: Open Upon the Great Sea! A Father''s Huge, HUGE Dream!', 2003, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Konosuke Uda', null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Issei Futamata', null, 'Bonnie & Max are crew members of Pirate Zap''s ship. They''re tired of the life they''re in a want to escape. Only problem is they have no money. Three child hostages over heard their conversation and the eldest, Amanda knows where Bonnie & Max can get loaded. As her father was a pro treasure hunter who hid a treasure and made a deal that they can have it. Max & Bonnie agreed and sneaked away with the 3 kids. And spent one month on the small island on where the treasure is said to be. Luffy and his crew got involved with the conflict. And end up battling against the Bayan & Zap Pirates who both want the same thing. And Amanda is the key to locating the treasure. Will the treasure be claimed by the right people?', 'Bonnie & Max are crew members of Pirate Zap''s ship. They''re tired of the life they''re in a want to escape. Only problem is they have no money. Three child hostages over heard their conversation and the eldest, Amanda knows where Bonnie & Max can get loaded. As her father was a pro treasure hunter who hid a treasure and made a deal that they can have it. Max & Bonnie agreed and sneaked away with the 3 kids. And spent one month on the small island on where the treasure is said to be. Luffy and his crew got involved with the conflict. And end up battling against the Bayan & Zap Pirates who both want the same thing. And Amanda is the key to locating the treasure. Will the treasure be claimed by the right people?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wa7I5E9PegOOMVWE0pPLtSAt42S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693356'),
  ('229993281423364722', 'One Piece Special: Protect! The Last Great Stage', 2003, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Konosuke Uda', null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Kappei Yamaguchi, Akemi Okamura, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Issei Futamata', null, 'Aired after Episode 174 - It is the last performance of a great actor and playwright, but several actors suddenly quit. Luckily, the Straw Hats offer to take their place. However, the quitting actors turns out to be more than a coincidence when they meet a Marine with a grudge against the playwright.', 'Aired after Episode 174 - It is the last performance of a great actor and playwright, but several actors suddenly quit. Luckily, the Straw Hats offer to take their place. However, the quitting actors turns out to be more than a coincidence when they meet a Marine with a grudge against the playwright.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/U2TK7SbUMTOz3bNXgkW9CjqkXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364728'),
  ('351615971601623211', 'One Piece Special: The Detective Memoirs of Chief Straw Hat Luffy', 2005, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Shigeru Chiba', null, 'Aired after Episode 253 - In an alternate reality world that takes place in 19th century Japan, Luffy acts as a member of the secret police. This is made up of two adventures. In the first, Buggy makes trouble in the town. In the second, a mysterious girl named Vivi appears. This special contains several cameos from characters throughout the entire series.', 'Aired after Episode 253 - In an alternate reality world that takes place in 19th century Japan, Luffy acts as a member of the secret police. This is made up of two adventures. In the first, Buggy makes trouble in the town. In the second, a mysterious girl named Vivi appears. This special contains several cameos from characters throughout the entire series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5L7NUNTwHYA9TkLK3glf00gMFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364982'),
  ('176997136636883380', 'One Piece: Adventure of Nebulandia', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Konosuke Uda, Yuichiro Nagata, Masaaki Kamada', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', 'PG-13', 'The Foxy Pirates challenge Luffy’s crew in the New World, but the fun and games go belly-up when the Navy’s most brilliant tactician steps in. Before the Straw Hats even know what hit them, they wind up on the island of Nebulandia, an infamous death trap for Devil Fruit users. Luffy must team up with his Davy Back nemesis for a harrowing rescue mission when Zoro, Sanji, and some Foxy Pirates are held hostage!', 'The Foxy Pirates challenge Luffy’s crew in the New World, but the fun and games go belly-up when the Navy’s most brilliant tactician steps in. Before the Straw Hats even know what hit them, they wind up on the island of Nebulandia, an infamous death trap for Devil Fruit users. Luffy must team up with his Davy Back nemesis for a harrowing rescue mission when Zoro, Sanji, and some Foxy Pirates are held hostage!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpHuW2shQwknL5ZaEk3LE8bX1tL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373879'),
  ('157432759221714461', 'One Piece: Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island', 2005, 'Action, Animation, Thriller, Comedy', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Hiroshi Kato, Takaaki Yamashita', 'Masahiro Ito', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Akio Otsuka', 'PG-13', 'The Straw Hats visit a recreational island, run by Baron Omatsuri, who asks them to complete a series of ordeals if they wish to stay on the island. Luffy accepts and the Straw Hats work together to complete them, but as the island''s mysteries unfold, their lives and friendships are put to the test. It''s up to Luffy to stop the Baron''s plot and keep his crew together.', 'The Straw Hats visit a recreational island, run by Baron Omatsuri, who asks them to complete a series of ordeals if they wish to stay on the island. Luffy accepts and the Straw Hats work together to complete them, but as the island''s mysteries unfold, their lives and friendships are put to the test. It''s up to Luffy to stop the Baron''s plot and keep his crew together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueIR4LM4k8eKhSB8gGT9NMhCwGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44729'),
  ('623407011004265225', 'One Piece: Chopper''s Kingdom on the Island of Strange Animals', 2002, 'Action, Animation, Adventure', 'Yutaka Nakashima, Yumiko Kajiwara, Junji Shimizu', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Ai Orikasa, Toshiko Fujita', 'PG-13', 'As the Straw Hat Pirates sail through the Grand Line, a sudden eruption of geysers beneath the Going Merry sends the crew flying over a nearby island. In the chaos, Chopper falls overboard and becomes separated from his friends. While Luffy and the others land on the far side of the island, Chopper finds himself hailed as the new king by the local animals. However, danger looms as a group of human “horn hunters” arrives. Their leader, Count Butler, is a violin-playing man who consumes horns to gain strength, and he seeks to devour the island’s greatest treasure to inherit immense power. Can Luffy and the crew stop Count Butler’s scheme and save the island? And will they be able to show Momambi that not all pirates are the villains he believes them to be?', 'As the Straw Hat Pirates sail through the Grand Line, a sudden eruption of geysers beneath the Going Merry sends the crew flying over a nearby island. In the chaos, Chopper falls overboard and becomes separated from his friends. While Luffy and the others land on the far side of the island, Chopper finds himself hailed as the new king by the local animals. However, danger looms as a group of human “horn hunters” arrives. Their leader, Count Butler, is a violin-playing man who consumes horns to gain strength, and he seeks to devour the island’s greatest treasure to inherit immense power. Can Luffy and the crew stop Count Butler’s scheme and save the island? And will they be able to show Momambi that not all pirates are the villains he believes them to be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YFUMvTV4zOkpUsPAiPgjaMKWYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44725'),
  ('188951843290240613', 'One Piece: Clockwork Island Adventure', 2001, 'Action, Animation, Adventure', 'Takumi Wakao, Yutaka Nakashima, Gou Koga', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Kenyu Horiuchi, Akiko Yajima, Daisuke Gori', 'PG-13', 'Relaxing on a cozy beach, the Straw Hat Pirates are taking a rest from their quest. Right until Luffy noticed the Going Merry has been hijacked and sailed off from the beach. This leads them to search the ship and find the thief who took it from them. They ran into a duo named the Theif Brothers, who informed them that their ship was stolen by a group of pirates called the Trump Kyoudai. When they encountered the Trump Pirates, Nami ended up getting kidnapped as well as Luffy''s hat. They tracked down the pirates to their base on Clockwork Island. Now Luffy, Zoro, Sanji, Usopp, and the Theif Brothers must reclaim the Going Merry, Save Nami, and get back Shank''s straw hat.', 'Relaxing on a cozy beach, the Straw Hat Pirates are taking a rest from their quest. Right until Luffy noticed the Going Merry has been hijacked and sailed off from the beach. This leads them to search the ship and find the thief who took it from them. They ran into a duo named the Theif Brothers, who informed them that their ship was stolen by a group of pirates called the Trump Kyoudai. When they encountered the Trump Pirates, Nami ended up getting kidnapped as well as Luffy''s hat. They tracked down the pirates to their base on Clockwork Island. Now Luffy, Zoro, Sanji, Usopp, and the Theif Brothers must reclaim the Going Merry, Save Nami, and get back Shank''s straw hat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phrVSY5cpUkybc0gU41crWi2XIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23446'),
  ('343494467618418138', 'One Piece: Curse of the Sacred Sword', 2004, 'Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Kazuhisa Takenouchi, Akira Yoshiyasu', 'Yoshiyuki Suga', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Ryoka Yuzuki', 'PG-13', 'The Straw Hat Pirates landed at Asuka Island, home of the most valuable sword in the world: The Seven Star Sword. Which was said to curse anyone who takes it in possession. When they got back to the Going Merry, they discovered that Zoro is missing from his guard duty. Before they could plan out a search party to relocate him. Luffy and friends escape from the port as Marines were on their tail. They found a new place to dock, which is near a village. Whose job is to keep the Seven Star Sword sealed. Soon it was attacked by the Marines, and among them is Zoro. Luffy and the others don''t know why he''s helping out the Marines. But it all comes to conclusion when Luffy encounters Saga: Zoro''s childhood friend from Swordsman training.', 'The Straw Hat Pirates landed at Asuka Island, home of the most valuable sword in the world: The Seven Star Sword. Which was said to curse anyone who takes it in possession. When they got back to the Going Merry, they discovered that Zoro is missing from his guard duty. Before they could plan out a search party to relocate him. Luffy and friends escape from the port as Marines were on their tail. They found a new place to dock, which is near a village. Whose job is to keep the Seven Star Sword sealed. Soon it was attacked by the Marines, and among them is Zoro. Luffy and the others don''t know why he''s helping out the Marines. But it all comes to conclusion when Luffy encounters Saga: Zoro''s childhood friend from Swordsman training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSqxVnjHE7zGAdWkhnQNYLJ2FUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44728'),
  ('1078205562250892503', 'One Piece: Dead End Adventure', 2003, 'Action, Animation, Adventure', 'Konosuke Uda, Takumi Wakao, Kazuhiro Nishikawa', 'Yoshiyuki Suga', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Miki Sakai', 'PG-13', 'Desperate for cash, the Straw Hat Pirates enter a secret race between pirate crews known as the Dead End Competition. There, they must battle against powerful people, including the bounty hunter who wants to kill Gasparde and a climatic battle with Marine-turned-pirate Captain Gasparde.', 'Desperate for cash, the Straw Hat Pirates enter a secret race between pirate crews known as the Dead End Competition. There, they must battle against powerful people, including the bounty hunter who wants to kill Gasparde and a climatic battle with Marine-turned-pirate Captain Gasparde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEJBIHzaW1IoOVHtgblXy76kj4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44727'),
  ('943700610822227876', 'One Piece: Defeat the Pirate Ganzack!', 1998, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Goro Taniguchi, Hisashi Kagawa, Tatsufumi Itoh', 'Hiroaki Kitajima, Goro Taniguchi', 'Urara Takano, Wataru Takagi, Megumi Toyoguchi, Norio Wakamoto, Ikuya Sawaki, Jun Tanaka, Takkô Ishimori', null, 'While Luffy and his crew of Zoro and Nami are starving on their small boat, they are attacked by a large monster. Nami is taken away, while Luffy and Zoro wash up on shore. There they meet a young girl, Medaka, and learn of the sad history of the island. The evil Pirate Ganzack has taken away all the men in the village and enslaved them, including Medaka''s father. Now Luffy, Zoro, and Medaka must infiltrate Ganzack''s base in order to rescue the villagers and Nami.', 'While Luffy and his crew of Zoro and Nami are starving on their small boat, they are attacked by a large monster. Nami is taken away, while Luffy and Zoro wash up on shore. There they meet a young girl, Medaka, and learn of the sad history of the island. The evil Pirate Ganzack has taken away all the men in the village and enslaved them, including Medaka''s father. Now Luffy, Zoro, and Medaka must infiltrate Ganzack''s base in order to rescue the villagers and Nami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98ZSnYpfltah6YuJTkiwHV0O739.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116315'),
  ('1069534713271388932', 'One Piece: Dream Soccer King!', 2002, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Animation', 'Munehisa Sakai', null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Misa Watanabe, Kazuki Yao', null, 'At a huge pillar stadium, the Grand Line Cup Final is being held. The "Straw Hat Pirate Team"(Luffy, Zoro, Usopp, Sanji, and Chopper) are having a tie breaker shoot out against the "Villian All Star Team"(Buggy, Bon Clay, Jango, Hatchan, and a soccer like head player named Odacchi). Everyone of them gets a turn in kicking the ball to the goal. While Coby is taking the goalie position, and isn''t doing too good in blocking the goal. One after another, the game eventually comes to a sudden death match. Which team will win the Grand Line Cup?', 'At a huge pillar stadium, the Grand Line Cup Final is being held. The "Straw Hat Pirate Team"(Luffy, Zoro, Usopp, Sanji, and Chopper) are having a tie breaker shoot out against the "Villian All Star Team"(Buggy, Bon Clay, Jango, Hatchan, and a soccer like head player named Odacchi). Everyone of them gets a turn in kicking the ball to the goal. While Coby is taking the goalie position, and isn''t doing too good in blocking the goal. One after another, the game eventually comes to a sudden death match. Which team will win the Grand Line Cup?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZMYhcTT3H8h93Epm2gCqPDBDmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464198'),
  ('513363874372591275', 'One Piece: Episode of Chopper Plus: Bloom in the Winter, Miracle Cherry Blossom', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Junji Shimizu, Makoto Sonoda, Izumi Hoki', 'Hirohiko Uesaka', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', 'PG-13', 'When Nami falls ill, the Straw Hats seek medical care for her on Drum Island. There they meet reindeer doctor Tony Tony Chopper and the Wapol Pirates.', 'When Nami falls ill, the Straw Hats seek medical care for her on Drum Island. There they meet reindeer doctor Tony Tony Chopper and the Wapol Pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGgZ3nIJt1anC1hOT4Do5mCOqAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44731'),
  ('274731119395263859', 'One Piece: Episode of Luffy - Hand Island Adventure', 2012, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Hiroyuki Morita, Mitsuru Hongo, Hiroshi Shimizu', null, 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Kazuki Yao', null, 'As Luffy and the crew were attacked by several marine warships, they were forced to use a Coup de Burst to escape. Crash landing on an island, the crew decided to explore while some repairments are made. Upon meeting an wax artisan and learning the truth behind the island, Luffy offers his help.', 'As Luffy and the crew were attacked by several marine warships, they were forced to use a Coup de Burst to escape. Crash landing on an island, the crew decided to explore while some repairments are made. Upon meeting an wax artisan and learning the truth behind the island, Luffy offers his help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29SOwiaxybMcSpY8N0rz7u5XGDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172329'),
  ('266045102384125756', 'One Piece: Episode of Skypiea', 2018, 'TV Movie, Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Konosuke Uda, Yuusuke Isouchi, Tetsuya Endo', 'Tomohiro Nakayama', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'PG-13', 'The Straw Hats embark on a dangerous trip to the sky where their destination comes straight out of a fairytale. The island of Skypiea and its grand city of gold await among the clouds, but a clash of winged clans and a man who calls himself God won’t make things easy! Only Luffy can resist this God’s mighty power and light the mysteries of the past.', 'The Straw Hats embark on a dangerous trip to the sky where their destination comes straight out of a fairytale. The island of Skypiea and its grand city of gold await among the clouds, but a clash of winged clans and a man who calls himself God won’t make things easy! Only Luffy can resist this God’s mighty power and light the mysteries of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whvgyEpPqvKXP0vZE4PMkoUmRqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545742'),
  ('1097938392890505618', 'One Piece: Giant Mecha Soldier of Karakuri Castle', 2006, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Konosuke Uda, Eisaku Inoue, Hirosato Onishi', 'Masahiro Ito', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Kazue Ikura, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Goro Inagaki', 'PG-13', 'The Straw Hats visits an island, known as Mecha Island, where a fisherman sings an old folk song about a Golden Crown. Searching for that mysterious treasure, they find a hidden entrance into the island. The island''s leader, Ratchet, impressed with the find and in search of the Golden Crown himself, invites the crew to join him in his search and the crew along with Ratchet and his henchmen enter the cave. As it turns out, the islands true form, is that of a giant turtle. Ratchet, who had known this all along, uses his mechanical castle to take control of the turtle, in order to use it, to take over the world. Now the Straw Hats have to stop not only Ratchet, but also the helpless turtle, from crashing into a nearby island.', 'The Straw Hats visits an island, known as Mecha Island, where a fisherman sings an old folk song about a Golden Crown. Searching for that mysterious treasure, they find a hidden entrance into the island. The island''s leader, Ratchet, impressed with the find and in search of the Golden Crown himself, invites the crew to join him in his search and the crew along with Ratchet and his henchmen enter the cave. As it turns out, the islands true form, is that of a giant turtle. Ratchet, who had known this all along, uses his mechanical castle to take control of the turtle, in order to use it, to take over the world. Now the Straw Hats have to stop not only Ratchet, but also the helpless turtle, from crashing into a nearby island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Pu26TQNiyl8kjNe1sI3NMG2OQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44730'),
  ('206697690214043204', 'One Piece: Heart of Gold', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Tsutomu Ohno, Keiichi Ichikawa, Tatsuya Nagamine', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Kazuki Yao, Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Kappei Yamaguchi', 'PG-13', 'A girl named Olga is pursued by both the World Government and a man named Mad Treasure, as she is the only one who knows the location of the Pure Gold, a substance that can buy the entire world. Olga ends up sailing with the Straw Hat Pirates, and they journey to find the Pure Gold on the lost island of Alchemi, which is located inside the stomach of a large angler fish named Bonbori.', 'A girl named Olga is pursued by both the World Government and a man named Mad Treasure, as she is the only one who knows the location of the Pure Gold, a substance that can buy the entire world. Olga ends up sailing with the Straw Hat Pirates, and they journey to find the Pure Gold on the lost island of Alchemi, which is located inside the stomach of a large angler fish named Bonbori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e91hSNOwrV9FvC8LyaroK8dYTlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433157'),
  ('973827436179241866', 'One Piece: Jango''s Dance Carnival', 2001, 'Music, Animation, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Daisuke Nishio', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Wataru Takagi, Tetsu Inada, Jun Ishikawa', null, 'The Straw Hat Pirates visit Mirrorball Island. Where a big dance carnival is being held. Jango the Hypnotist was there too, to show off his dance moves. Only when he was found by a group of Marines who were about to arrest him. But ended up chasing him throughout the island. Our heroes got involved when one of the Marines recognized Luffy from the wanted poster. And they end up getting chased as well. Soon Jango steals the spotlight of the dance carnival and uses his hypnosis on everyone on the island. And soon everyone including Jango, The StrawHat Pirates, and the marines are all dancing like there''s no tomorrow.', 'The Straw Hat Pirates visit Mirrorball Island. Where a big dance carnival is being held. Jango the Hypnotist was there too, to show off his dance moves. Only when he was found by a group of Marines who were about to arrest him. But ended up chasing him throughout the island. Our heroes got involved when one of the Marines recognized Luffy from the wanted poster. And they end up getting chased as well. Soon Jango steals the spotlight of the dance carnival and uses his hypnosis on everyone on the island. And soon everyone including Jango, The StrawHat Pirates, and the marines are all dancing like there''s no tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0veqgth8KG1h0Dr5an3NQdkqJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464154'),
  ('1152060429351121083', 'One Piece: Romance Dawn Story', 2008, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Action', 'Katsumi Tokoro', 'Tsuyoshi Sakurai', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Kaya Matsutani, Kozo Shioya, Rikiya Koyama, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata', null, 'The Straw Hat Pirates send Luffy to look for food in the Mini Merry II, only for Luffy to get lost and deviate from the path. Then he meets Galley''s ship, a pirate. Meanwhile on an island, they realize that Galley''s pirate ship is approaching, and a young girl named Silk decides to fight to protect her treasure.', 'The Straw Hat Pirates send Luffy to look for food in the Mini Merry II, only for Luffy to get lost and deviate from the path. Then he meets Galley''s ship, a pirate. Meanwhile on an island, they realize that Galley''s pirate ship is approaching, and a young girl named Silk decides to fight to protect her treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKE0fzjVZ1dOeYjfPA8TnIgCstD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422807'),
  ('50572040449130846', 'One Piece: Strong World Episode 0', 2010, 'Action, Animation, Comedy', 'Takashi Hashimoto', null, 'Naoto Takenaka, Chikao Ohtsuka, Mayumi Tanaka, Akemi Okamura, Hiroshi Naka, Unsho Ishizuka, Takehito Koyasu, Minori Matsushima', null, 'The introductory chapter to the movie, Strong World, which depicts the events surrounding Gold Roger''s execution.', 'The introductory chapter to the movie, Strong World, which depicts the events surrounding Gold Roger''s execution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m0FhjQdWhBS3nkRFKIfkwFt1Zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270413'),
  ('409322547406206221', 'One Piece: Take Aim! The Pirate Baseball King', 2004, 'Comedy, Animation, Fantasy', 'Yukio Kaizawa', null, 'Shigeru Chiba, Kazuki Yao', null, 'At a huge baseball stadium ship it''s the Pirate Baseball King playoffs. Hosted by Bon Clay/Mr. 2 & Buggy the Clown. The Straw Hat Pirates are now up showing off their skills in baseball. All 7 of them are up against the Arlong Pirates (This includes Arlong, Momoo, Chuu, Kuroobi, Hacchi, and several Skypiea characters for backup on both teams). This is unlike any ordinary baseball game, as Arlong''s team uses iron spiked balls instead of regular baseballs to make Luffy and his team lose. After one strike out to another, it becomes 3-0 for the final inning. Will Luffy''s team be able to defeat Arlong''s team?', 'At a huge baseball stadium ship it''s the Pirate Baseball King playoffs. Hosted by Bon Clay/Mr. 2 & Buggy the Clown. The Straw Hat Pirates are now up showing off their skills in baseball. All 7 of them are up against the Arlong Pirates (This includes Arlong, Momoo, Chuu, Kuroobi, Hacchi, and several Skypiea characters for backup on both teams). This is unlike any ordinary baseball game, as Arlong''s team uses iron spiked balls instead of regular baseballs to make Luffy and his team lose. After one strike out to another, it becomes 3-0 for the final inning. Will Luffy''s team be able to defeat Arlong''s team?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NJz6sLxEgk5a6u6WCBWs9qVo6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464305'),
  ('770440691221118221', 'One Piece: The Desert Princess and the Pirates: Adventure in Alabasta', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Takahiro Imamura, Takumi Wakao, Tatsuya Nagamine', 'Hirohiko Uesaka', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Ikue Otani, Misa Watanabe, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo', 'PG-13', 'The Straw Hat Pirates are on a quest to save the desert kingdom of Alabasta. A civil war brews among the sands, one started and stirred by the hand of none other than Crocodile and his corrupted Baroque Works gang. The stakes run ever higher as Princess Vivi''s homeland threatens to tear itself apart. More than lives are on the line.', 'The Straw Hat Pirates are on a quest to save the desert kingdom of Alabasta. A civil war brews among the sands, one started and stirred by the hand of none other than Crocodile and his corrupted Baroque Works gang. The stakes run ever higher as Princess Vivi''s homeland threatens to tear itself apart. More than lives are on the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qryaZLg7DkBkZtwKWTH6dfXjT3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25278'),
  ('272135350864832223', 'One Piece: The Movie', 2000, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Junichi Fujise, Hirotoshi Rissen, Junji Shimizu', 'Michiru Shimada', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Yuka Imai, Takeshi Aono, Taiki Matsuno, Nachi Nozawa', null, 'There once was a pirate known as the Great Gold Pirate Woonan, who obtained almost one-third of the world''s gold. Over the course of a few years, the pirate''s existence faded, and a legend grew that he disappeared with his gold to a remote island, an island pirates continue to search for. Aboard the Going Merry, Luffy and his crew, starved and reckless, are robbed of their treasure. In an attempt to get it back, they wreck the getaway ship, guided by a young boy named Tobio, who''s a captured part of El Drago''s pirate crew. El Drago''s love for gold has driven him to look for Woonan''s island, and thanks to Woonan''s treasure map, he finds it. During this time, Luffy''s crew have been split up, and despite their own circumstances, they must find a way to stop El Drago from obtaining Woonan''s gold.', 'There once was a pirate known as the Great Gold Pirate Woonan, who obtained almost one-third of the world''s gold. Over the course of a few years, the pirate''s existence faded, and a legend grew that he disappeared with his gold to a remote island, an island pirates continue to search for. Aboard the Going Merry, Luffy and his crew, starved and reckless, are robbed of their treasure. In an attempt to get it back, they wreck the getaway ship, guided by a young boy named Tobio, who''s a captured part of El Drago''s pirate crew. El Drago''s love for gold has driven him to look for Woonan''s island, and thanks to Woonan''s treasure map, he finds it. During this time, Luffy''s crew have been split up, and despite their own circumstances, they must find a way to stop El Drago from obtaining Woonan''s gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QOrTYafoqzXPWLnR2K8129jTHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19576'),
  ('502201451220506315', 'One Point O', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Renfroe, Marteinn Þórsson, Christopher Soos', 'Jeff Renfroe, Marteinn Þórsson', 'Jeremy Sisto, Udo Kier, Deborah Kara Unger, Lance Henriksen, Bruce Payne, Richard Rees, Constantin Florescu, Ana Maria Popa', 'R', 'Paranoid computer programmer Simon wakes up to find a package in his room one day. Despite attempts at securing his apartment, the packages keep arriving. While cameras watch Simon''s every move, he struggles to find the answers to the mysterious forces taking over his life.', 'Paranoid computer programmer Simon wakes up to find a package in his room one day. Despite attempts at securing his apartment, the packages keep arriving. While cameras watch Simon''s every move, he struggles to find the answers to the mysterious forces taking over his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFiozrJZK6a3BTnkmyDMrTjeVNe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17110'),
  ('548938877128558965', 'One Potato, Two Potato', 1964, 'Drama', 'Larry Peerce, Andrew Laszlo, Bruce Bilson', 'Raphael Hayes, Orville H. Hampton', 'Barbara Barrie, Bernie Hamilton, Richard Mulligan, Harry Bellaver, Marti Mericka, Robert Earl Jones, Vinnette Carroll, Anthony Spinelli', null, 'Study of interracial marriage in the 1960s. A white divorcée falls in love with and marries an African-American man. When her ex-husband sues for custody of her child, arguing that a mixed household is an improper place to raise the girl, the new husband fights for his parental rights in court, fighting against a judge who represents the prejudices of the era.', 'Study of interracial marriage in the 1960s. A white divorcée falls in love with and marries an African-American man. When her ex-husband sues for custody of her child, arguing that a mixed household is an improper place to raise the girl, the new husband fights for his parental rights in court, fighting against a judge who represents the prejudices of the era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e11qlc4rPaYzIigaEfV8XuVtKo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143841'),
  ('266575321316286224', 'One Rainy Afternoon', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Rowland V. Lee, J. Peverell Marley, Percy Ikerd', 'Stephen Morehouse Avery', 'Francis Lederer, Ida Lupino, Hugh Herbert, Erik Rhodes, Roland Young, Liev De Maigret, Georgia Caine, Phyllis Barry', 'NR', 'Suave French actor Philippe Martin provokes a scandal when, in a darkened theater, he mistakes young Monique for his mistress, Yvonne, and tries to kiss her. Charged with assault, the quick-thinking Philippe claims it''s French tradition to do as he did, and is let go. To his surprise, Philippe learns that Monique has paid his fine. As the tabloids exploit the situation, Monique dates Philippe, until a photo appears of him kissing Yvonne.', 'Suave French actor Philippe Martin provokes a scandal when, in a darkened theater, he mistakes young Monique for his mistress, Yvonne, and tries to kiss her. Charged with assault, the quick-thinking Philippe claims it''s French tradition to do as he did, and is let go. To his surprise, Philippe learns that Monique has paid his fine. As the tabloids exploit the situation, Monique dates Philippe, until a photo appears of him kissing Yvonne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57eB4CC6Ru3MOEIMkLaMAhkHUaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206119'),
  ('6174608903636073', 'One Ranger', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jesse V. Johnson', 'Jesse V. Johnson', 'Thomas Jane, Dominique Tipper, John Malkovich, Dean S. Jagger, Patrick Bergin, Nick Moran, Gregory Zaragoza, James Oliver Wheatley', 'R', 'A Texas Ranger is recruited by British Intelligence to track down a dangerous terrorist and stop him from attacking London.', 'A Texas Ranger is recruited by British Intelligence to track down a dangerous terrorist and stop him from attacking London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puffdkze3GZmQHu2Hy8t1XdOYtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093994'),
  ('1133387034748787283', 'One Role for Two', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Anne Giafferi', 'Anne Giafferi', 'Mathilde Seigner, François-Xavier Demaison, Arié Elmaleh, Marie-Anne Chazel, Anne-Sophie Lapix, Juliette Poissonnier, Mathilde Ripley, Léopold Bara', null, 'After a failed plastic surgery, an actress hires a double to replace her on the set - Unaware that it''s her twin sister, whom she didn''t even know existed.', 'After a failed plastic surgery, an actress hires a double to replace her on the set - Unaware that it''s her twin sister, whom she didn''t even know existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cq3CzUQhqhA9N30s8MlzWzIGdM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590986'),
  ('219378149231718576', 'One Room Tenants', 1960, 'Drama', 'Wojciech Has, Stefan Matyjaszkiewicz, Karol Dąbrowski', 'Wojciech Has', 'Mieczysław Gajda, Gustaw Holoubek, Adam Pawlikowski, Anna Lubienska, Beata Tyszkiewicz, Irena Netto, Zdzisław Maklakiewicz, Halina Buyno-Łoza', null, 'A subjective adaptation of a well-known autobiographical novel by Zbigniew Unilowski (screenplay by Wojciech Jerzy Has with dialogues by Stanislaw Dygat). The adventures of the tenants of a sublet room in a Warsaw townhouse inhabited mostly by students and novice writers, presented against the social context of the 1930s.', 'A subjective adaptation of a well-known autobiographical novel by Zbigniew Unilowski (screenplay by Wojciech Jerzy Has with dialogues by Stanislaw Dygat). The adventures of the tenants of a sublet room in a Warsaw townhouse inhabited mostly by students and novice writers, presented against the social context of the 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dagi7G5oWvsuqhkyTsVU0kvbAl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262336'),
  ('757227103698426750', 'One Royal Holiday', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Dustin Rikert, Branden James Maxham', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Laura Osnes, Aaron Tveit, Krystal Joy Brown, Tom McGowan, Victoria Clark, Bradley Rose, Geraldine Leer, Josiah Harvey', 'G', 'When Anna offers a stranded mother and son shelter in a blizzard, she learns that they are the Royal Family of Galwick. Anna shows the Prince how they do Christmas in her hometown, encouraging him to open his heart and be true to himself.', 'When Anna offers a stranded mother and son shelter in a blizzard, she learns that they are the Royal Family of Galwick. Anna shows the Prince how they do Christmas in her hometown, encouraging him to open his heart and be true to himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZMQ6Xp57sXZXzzYUuj4tYkU1MB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737762'),
  ('212919170579752049', 'One Run Elmer', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont, Dwight Warren', null, 'Buster Keaton, Lona Andre, Dewey Robinson, Harold Goodwin, Bobby Dunn, Jim Thorpe', null, 'Elmer owns a gas station out in the California desert. Soon he has a business rival in Jim, who opens up another station, and is also trying to steal Elmer''s girlfriend. She plays both rivals against the other and, because she is a baseball fan, both Elmer and Jim try to show each other up in the big local baseball game.', 'Elmer owns a gas station out in the California desert. Soon he has a business rival in Jim, who opens up another station, and is also trying to steal Elmer''s girlfriend. She plays both rivals against the other and, because she is a baseball fan, both Elmer and Jim try to show each other up in the big local baseball game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TQqdEQgumT8Y6HvofjUQz500P8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53579'),
  ('57143350673046949', 'One Russian Summer', 1973, 'History, Drama', 'Antonio Calenda, Alfio Contini, Nello Vanin', 'Edward Bond, Antonio Calenda, Ugo Pirro', 'Oliver Reed, Claudia Cardinale, John McEnery, Ray Lovelock, Carole André, Zora Velcova, Giuseppe Pisegna, Paola Tedesco', 'R', 'Based on Mikhail Lermontov''s novel Vadim, this costume drama, set in Russia during the 1700s, chronicles the battle between a vengeful, anarchic peasant and the tyrannical landowner who killed his mother and father.', 'Based on Mikhail Lermontov''s novel Vadim, this costume drama, set in Russia during the 1700s, chronicles the battle between a vengeful, anarchic peasant and the tyrannical landowner who killed his mother and father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLTkCw8k3c2oAAzmYXD58UCRLHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339372'),
  ('760784414441368643', 'One Second', 2020, 'Drama', 'Zhao Xiaoding, Zhang Yimou', 'Zou Jingzhi, Zhang Yimou', 'Liu Haocun, Zhang Yi, Fan Wei, Yu Ailei, Shaobo Zhang, Li Xiaochuan, Cao Rui, Ziyue Tang', null, 'A movie fan escapes from a labour camp during the Chinese Cultural Revolution and strikes up a relationship with a homeless female vagabond.', 'A movie fan escapes from a labour camp during the Chinese Cultural Revolution and strikes up a relationship with a homeless female vagabond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7fYH6UwKU1jFXSYHYccXCHeXUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575089'),
  ('911760801377931795', 'One Second Ahead, One Second Behind', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita, Raku Nagao', 'Chen Yu-hsun', 'Masaki Okada, Kaya Kiyohara, Rion Fukumuro, Shohei Shofukutei, Matsumoto Kiyo, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Masaya Katō, Takaya Yamauchi', null, 'Set in Kyoto, Japan, a love story takes place between Hajime and Reika. Hajime is a handsome young man, who is usually a second quicker than everyone else and straightforward. He works at the post office. Reika is a young woman, who is usually a step slower than everyone else. After Valentine''s Day, Hajime wakes up and is unable to remember what happened that day.', 'Set in Kyoto, Japan, a love story takes place between Hajime and Reika. Hajime is a handsome young man, who is usually a second quicker than everyone else and straightforward. He works at the post office. Reika is a young woman, who is usually a step slower than everyone else. After Valentine''s Day, Hajime wakes up and is unable to remember what happened that day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSzoNNXFTXJ9Jqv59b8YNdqZNh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029475'),
  ('135198169937519371', 'One Shocking Moment', 1965, 'Drama', 'Ted V. Mikels, Gregory Sandor, Art Names', 'Ted V. Mikels', 'Gary Kent, Lee Anna, Verné Martine, Maureen Gaffney, Jerry Fitzpatrick, Victor Izay, Jay Fineberg, Dominic Levi', null, 'Hunky businessman Cliff and his sweet wife Mindy move from Grand Rapids, Michigan to Los Angeles, California. They take up residence in an apartment complex where several lovely young ladies also live.', 'Hunky businessman Cliff and his sweet wife Mindy move from Grand Rapids, Michigan to Los Angeles, California. They take up residence in an apartment complex where several lovely young ladies also live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mqbXYdDYicUDGVRyzcPy3I04NB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50978'),
  ('1071786459226401055', 'One Shot', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, War', 'James Nunn, Danny Scott-Smith, Christiaan Faberij de Jonge', 'Jamie Russell', 'Scott Adkins, Ashley Greene, Ryan Phillippe, Emmanuel Imani, Dino Kelly, Jack Parr, Waleed Elgadi, Terence Maynard', 'NR', 'An elite squad of Navy SEALs, on a covert mission to transport a prisoner off a CIA black site island prison, are trapped when insurgents attack while trying to rescue the same prisoner.', 'An elite squad of Navy SEALs, on a covert mission to transport a prisoner off a CIA black site island prison, are trapped when insurgents attack while trying to rescue the same prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OXiTjU30gWtqxmx4BU9RVp2OTv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811592'),
  ('20426990272736652', 'One Sings, the Other Doesn''t', 1977, 'Drama, Music', 'Agnès Varda, Charles Van Damme, Jean-Claude Mallet', 'Agnès Varda', 'Thérèse Liotard, Valérie Mairesse, Robert Dadiès, Mona Mairesse, Francis Lemaire, François Courbin, Salomé Wimille, Nicole Clément', 'NR', 'The intertwined lives of two women in 1970s France, set against the progress of the women''s movement in which Agnes Varda was involved. Pomme and Suzanne meet when Pomme helps Suzanne obtain an abortion after a third pregnancy which she cannot afford. They lose contact but meet again ten years later. Pomme has become an unconventional singer, Suzanne a serious community worker - despite the contrast they remain friends and share in the various dramas of each others'' lives, in the process affirming their different female identities.', 'The intertwined lives of two women in 1970s France, set against the progress of the women''s movement in which Agnes Varda was involved. Pomme and Suzanne meet when Pomme helps Suzanne obtain an abortion after a third pregnancy which she cannot afford. They lose contact but meet again ten years later. Pomme has become an unconventional singer, Suzanne a serious community worker - despite the contrast they remain friends and share in the various dramas of each others'' lives, in the process affirming their different female identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3YTxT8LM1AWeWyrAXd3b0kjjzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63318'),
  ('883531058844821208', 'One Small Hitch', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tari Segal, John Burgess', 'Dode B. Levenson', 'Shane McRae, Aubrey Dollar, Daniel J. Travanti, Janet Ulrich Brooks, Robert Belushi, Rebecca Spence, Heidi Johanningmeier, Mary Jo Faraci', null, 'On a flight home to Chicago for a family wedding, childhood friends Josh and Molly innocently agree to fake a wedding engagement to make Josh''s dying father happy. Things quickly get out of hand with their two boisterous families, and a series of events causes them to pretend to be a couple and start planning a phony wedding. When the playacting begins to foster real feelings, the two must make some serious decisions: Split up and return to their lives in LA, or make a life as a couple back in Chicago?', 'On a flight home to Chicago for a family wedding, childhood friends Josh and Molly innocently agree to fake a wedding engagement to make Josh''s dying father happy. Things quickly get out of hand with their two boisterous families, and a series of events causes them to pretend to be a couple and start planning a phony wedding. When the playacting begins to foster real feelings, the two must make some serious decisions: Split up and return to their lives in LA, or make a life as a couple back in Chicago?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quw2cNXialcL4PIirf38w98d7Si.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166879'),
  ('974358820640381968', 'One Small Problem', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Hernández, Roberto Fiesco', 'Mariano Vera, Anaí López', 'Alfonso Dosal, Regina Blandón, Francesca Mercadante, Jorge Muñiz, Miguel Jiménez, Michelle Rodríguez, Gustavo Egelhaaf, Giovanna Zacarías', null, 'The love of his life hates kids. So when his 9-year-old daughter suggests she pretend to be his sister... what could go wrong?', 'The love of his life hates kids. So when his 9-year-old daughter suggests she pretend to be his sister... what could go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMHw4C1UrQfD7mSdwNGEceMfm88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767479'),
  ('667973608151612135', 'One Small Step', 2018, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Bobby Pontillas, Andrew Chesworth', 'Shaofu Zhang', null, 'G', '​Luna is a vibrant young Chinese-American girl who dreams of becoming an astronaut. From the day she witnesses a rocket launching into space on TV, Luna is driven to reach for the stars. In the big city, Luna lives with her loving father Chu, who supports her with a humble shoe repair business he runs out of his garage. As Luna grows up, she enters college, facing adversity of all kinds in pursuit of her dreams.', '​Luna is a vibrant young Chinese-American girl who dreams of becoming an astronaut. From the day she witnesses a rocket launching into space on TV, Luna is driven to reach for the stars. In the big city, Luna lives with her loving father Chu, who supports her with a humble shoe repair business he runs out of his garage. As Luna grows up, she enters college, facing adversity of all kinds in pursuit of her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O13uunA2LmNvHpr7PjTCDUmSZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549484'),
  ('889320475465362013', 'One Soldier''s Story: The Journey of American Sniper', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Gary Leva', 'Gary Leva', 'Philip Terrence, Andrew Lazar, Jason Hall, Peter Morgan, Bradley Cooper, Taya Kyle, Rob Lorenz, Clint Eastwood', 'NR', 'Join director Clint Eastwood and his creative team, along with Bradley Cooper and Sienna Miller, as they overcome enormous creative and logistic obstacles to make a film that brings the truth of Navy SEAL Chris Kyle''s story to the screen.', 'Join director Clint Eastwood and his creative team, along with Bradley Cooper and Sienna Miller, as they overcome enormous creative and logistic obstacles to make a film that brings the truth of Navy SEAL Chris Kyle''s story to the screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxyn3Prq03I3FIIDobMh3qvbzMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366929'),
  ('299473431028570858', 'One Song a Day Takes Mischief Away', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Krešimir Golik, Ivica Rajković, Drago Bahun', 'Krešimir Golik, Ivo Škrabalo', 'Franjo Majetić, Mirjana Bohanec, Relja Bašić, Mia Oremović, Tomislav Žganec, Vida Jerman, Vanja Timer, Lena Politeo', null, 'Set in pre-World War II Zagreb, the story is seen through the eyes of 6-year-old Perica Šafranek (played by Tomislav Žganec). A dandy from Zagreb, Mr Fulir (played by Relja Bašić), starts flirting with Perica''s mother during a family picnic. At first, Perica''s father doesn''t notice anything, but wants to marry off Perica''s aunt, so he invites the man to their residence. After multiple rendezvous, Perica''s father becomes aware of Fulir''s attempts to seduce his wife.', 'Set in pre-World War II Zagreb, the story is seen through the eyes of 6-year-old Perica Šafranek (played by Tomislav Žganec). A dandy from Zagreb, Mr Fulir (played by Relja Bašić), starts flirting with Perica''s mother during a family picnic. At first, Perica''s father doesn''t notice anything, but wants to marry off Perica''s aunt, so he invites the man to their residence. After multiple rendezvous, Perica''s father becomes aware of Fulir''s attempts to seduce his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0IB5koLpfUFt24mL3CX89eJD3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221244'),
  ('289229910991404245', 'One Special Night', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Roger Young, Guy Dufaux', null, 'James Garner, Julie Andrews, Patricia Charbonneau, Stacy Grant, Stewart Bick, Sam Stone, Danny Mags, Sheena Larkin', null, 'Builder Robert is visiting his ailing wife in a nursing home and is having problems getting a taxi home due to an intense snow storm. One of the doctors, Katherine offers him a lift home however their car gets stuck and they have to spend the night in an empty cabin nearby. They talk and bond, but afterwards seem to have difficulty beginning a relationship.', 'Builder Robert is visiting his ailing wife in a nursing home and is having problems getting a taxi home due to an intense snow storm. One of the doctors, Katherine offers him a lift home however their car gets stuck and they have to spend the night in an empty cabin nearby. They talk and bond, but afterwards seem to have difficulty beginning a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uf3RuZlGZ5YxbvPZnuXycr8PXv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50616'),
  ('702537749318516788', 'One Spy Too Many', 1966, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Joseph Sargent, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Dean Hargrove', 'Robert Vaughn, James Hong, Rip Torn, Cal Bolder, Dorothy Provine, Leo G. Carroll, Yvonne Craig, Carol Williams', 'NR', 'The men from U.N.C.L.E." are back! This time Robert Vaughn and David McCallum must stop the megalomaniac Alexander from committing the world''s greatest crimes.', 'The men from U.N.C.L.E." are back! This time Robert Vaughn and David McCallum must stop the megalomaniac Alexander from committing the world''s greatest crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iquP0WEOuPfC8D2bAEypnjbR3nw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79466'),
  ('61543229266288809', 'One Starry Christmas', 2014, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'John Bradshaw', 'Rickie Castaneda', 'Sarah Carter, Damon Runyan, Paul Popowich, Kathleen Laskey, Neil Crone, George Canyon, Daniel Karasik, Annie Chen', 'G', 'An aspiring astronomy professor finds unexpected Christmas romance when she meets a charming cowboy during her holiday travel. As she decides between this new cowboy and her practical boyfriend, she must decide whether it''s better to play it safe in love, or let an adventurous cowboy steal her heart.', 'An aspiring astronomy professor finds unexpected Christmas romance when she meets a charming cowboy during her holiday travel. As she decides between this new cowboy and her practical boyfriend, she must decide whether it''s better to play it safe in love, or let an adventurous cowboy steal her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkC12zKrnpiTgOuP72eBfAifIy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299574'),
  ('790477871941222333', 'One Stays, the Other Leaves', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Berri, Éric Gautier', 'Claude Berri', 'Daniel Auteuil, Miou-Miou, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Pierre Arditi, Laure Duthilleul, Nathalie Baye, Aïssa Maïga, Noémie Lvovsky', null, 'A story about two couples, longtime friends in which both husbands engage in long-term affairs and, as the title says, ultimately one remains with his wife and one makes a new life with another woman.', 'A story about two couples, longtime friends in which both husbands engage in long-term affairs and, as the title says, ultimately one remains with his wife and one makes a new life with another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifkKLivTgs3TdygZL1LqRn4g9BH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59565'),
  ('513972971562372185', 'One Step from Me', 2021, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'José Mario Salas Boza, José Mario Salas Boza', 'José Mario Salas Boza', 'Johanna Solano, Esteban Hidalgo, Gustavo Rojas, Flor Urbina, Verónica Suarez, Will Salazar, Stefano Rucci, Juan Carlos Castillo', null, 'Tatiana is a journalist with a routine life in all its aspects and a recently failed love relationship. Motivated by her best friend, she decides to make a stop and travel around Costa Rica to find herself and inner peace.', 'Tatiana is a journalist with a routine life in all its aspects and a recently failed love relationship. Motivated by her best friend, she decides to make a stop and travel around Costa Rica to find herself and inner peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12qaWw3KntFPoOCEJFSCLAuL7rN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788905'),
  ('1068559636713312370', 'One Step to Eternity', 1954, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Henri Decoin, Robert Lefebvre', 'Henri Decoin', 'Danielle Darrieux, Michel Auclair, Corinne Calvet, Miriam Di San Servolo, Lyla Rocco, Gérard Buhr', null, 'Francois Roques, a power-and-money-mad editor of a Paris newspaper invites four women to a housewarming at his penthouse apartment. He plans on one of them to meet death by means of a loose railing on the balcony.', 'Francois Roques, a power-and-money-mad editor of a Paris newspaper invites four women to a housewarming at his penthouse apartment. He plans on one of them to meet death by means of a loose railing on the balcony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDetRbtkptZoRWi1FW9sIOM6jya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279818'),
  ('353709314535486498', 'One Summer', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Florence Moncorgé-Gabin, Thierry Verrier, Julien Féret', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Florence Moncorgé-Gabin', 'Catherine Frot, Laura Smet, Grégori Derangère, François Berléand, Mathilde Seigner, Isabelle Sadoyan, Jean-Paul Moncorgé, Samuel Le Bihan', null, 'A hired labourer, Joseph, works on a farm inhabited by Monique, a war widow, and Jeanne, her captivating daughter who longs to escape to the big city.', 'A hired labourer, Joseph, works on a farm inhabited by Monique, a war widow, and Jeanne, her captivating daughter who longs to escape to the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZTEjwjHHYTzVOi4BEpoP3bUUF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60537'),
  ('646371577743386931', 'One Summer', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Michael Wojcichowski, Rich Newey, Matthew Buckler', 'Michael Reisz, Maria Nation', 'Sam Page, Sarah Drew, Amanda Schull, Madeline Grace Popovich, Gavin Borders, Bryant Prince, Elizabeth Becka, Bill Winkler', 'PG', 'Jack takes his son and daughter to his late wife''s beachside hometown hoping to heal and become closer. The summer brings visions of the past that could forge a new path forward.', 'Jack takes his son and daughter to his late wife''s beachside hometown hoping to heal and become closer. The summer brings visions of the past that could forge a new path forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRjSB2Uq3EwGn2ej0I8H78hWaCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858918'),
  ('977667158885386708', 'One Summer Night', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kim Hun', 'Kim Hun', 'Kim Tae-hoon, Choi Jae-sung, Shin Won-ho, Lee Tae-rim, Lee Sang-woo, Kim Chang-jo', null, 'Caught in forbidden love, Yong Joon defects from North Korea, leaving Jae Sung behind. Years later, a reunion forces him to choose between past and present.', 'Caught in forbidden love, Yong Joon defects from North Korea, leaving Jae Sung behind. Years later, a reunion forces him to choose between past and present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAe02txeSy2aFCkUf9i3ttgUM1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453075'),
  ('1145564300377843381', 'One Summer of Happiness', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Arne Mattsson, Göran Strindberg', 'Per Olof Ekström, Arne Mattsson, Olle Hellbom', 'Ulla Jacobsson, Edvin Adolphson, Irma Christenson, Folke Sundquist, John Elfström, Erik Hell, Sten Lindgren, Nils Hallberg', null, 'The young high school graduate Göran and the 17-year-old Kerstin get to know each other on the estate of Göran''s uncle Persson and fall in love. But their relationship is watched suspiciously by the jammed adult world. While Persson has an understanding of the youth, Kerstin''s parents and the pastor of the village rant against the alleged immorality of the young people. Despite all the malice, Göran and Kerstin decide for their love. But this love should last only one summer.', 'The young high school graduate Göran and the 17-year-old Kerstin get to know each other on the estate of Göran''s uncle Persson and fall in love. But their relationship is watched suspiciously by the jammed adult world. While Persson has an understanding of the youth, Kerstin''s parents and the pastor of the village rant against the alleged immorality of the young people. Despite all the malice, Göran and Kerstin decide for their love. But this love should last only one summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pejm19LBXIzYGvthUJTQcqyMgEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56719'),
  ('319948734821281459', 'One Summer Story', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shuichi Okita, Kyouhei Tamazawa, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Retto Tajima, Shuichi Okita, Mitsuhiko Fujiki', 'Moka Kamishiraishi, Kanata Hosoda, Yuki Saito, Etsushi Toyokawa, Yudai Chiba, Kanji Furutachi, Tōru Shinagawa, Hina Yukawa', null, 'Two different high school children - a swimmer and an academic - set off on a quest together one summer.', 'Two different high school children - a swimmer and an academic - set off on a quest together one summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGGFKOymBmbjn1qAHQ6RcyxvUoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646995'),
  ('319034868866194045', 'One Survivor Remembers', 1995, 'Documentary, History', 'Kary Antholis, Erich Roland, Andrzej Jeziorek', null, 'Gerda Weissmann Klein, Kurt Klein, Peter Thomas', null, 'Co-produced by the U.S. Holocaust Memorial Museum Research Institute, this Academy Award-winning documentary relates the harrowing story of Gerda Weissmann Klein and her journey of survival and remembering both before and after the war.', 'Co-produced by the U.S. Holocaust Memorial Museum Research Institute, this Academy Award-winning documentary relates the harrowing story of Gerda Weissmann Klein and her journey of survival and remembering both before and after the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAfNzgIGJmM1pTBPQcjhxTu6APA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57130'),
  ('192806715141820402', 'One Take Only', 2001, 'Crime, Drama', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Decha Srimantra, Songsak Mongkolthong', 'Oxide Pang Chun', 'Pavarit Mongkolpisit, Wanatchada Siwapornchai, Chalermporn Paprach, Tok Payathai, Yopakarn Hgarmsomchart, Parakorn Thanundorn, Kitti Churuang, Chairat Thuttitanont', null, 'Hapless hustler Bank, rescues a miserable young prostitute, Som, from street thugs, and the two begin a quiet romance. When Bank has the opportunity to become a drug-runner for an affluent dealer, he resolves to raise enough money to rescue Som from the sex trade. But, as Bank descends deeper into Bangkok''s violent criminal underworld, the possibility of leaving his old life behind grows ever more distant.', 'Hapless hustler Bank, rescues a miserable young prostitute, Som, from street thugs, and the two begin a quiet romance. When Bank has the opportunity to become a drug-runner for an affluent dealer, he resolves to raise enough money to rescue Som from the sex trade. But, as Bank descends deeper into Bangkok''s violent criminal underworld, the possibility of leaving his old life behind grows ever more distant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNlhXYZZd7peqt5pRTRk34WGw2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101597'),
  ('856672656602706331', 'One Third', 2014, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Shinagawa, Daisuke Soma, Go KINOMOTO', 'Guinoshita Hant', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Koki Tanaka, Ryuichi Kosugi, Mika Nakashima, Yosuke Kubozuka, Shinnosuke Ikehata, Mitsu Dan, Ryo Kimura', null, 'The manger of cabaret club "Hanibani" named Shū, a worker at the club named Koji, and one of the patrons named Ken succeed in robbing a bank. They agree to divide the stolen money equally into three, but they become consumed by greed and try to get more than their share. In addition, a renowned figure is after their money.', 'The manger of cabaret club "Hanibani" named Shū, a worker at the club named Koji, and one of the patrons named Ken succeed in robbing a bank. They agree to divide the stolen money equally into three, but they become consumed by greed and try to get more than their share. In addition, a renowned figure is after their money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krOQjHA6vkJXRzU2Z8trAAChOKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292816'),
  ('810065055839502189', 'One Time Deal', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ara Gabrielyan, Sergey Zaytsev', 'Valentin Ezhov, Albert Ivanov', 'Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Leonid Kuravlyov, Lyubov Polishchuk, Boryslav Brondukov, Anatoly Vedyonkin, Mariya Vinogradova, Boris Ivanov, Nina Krachkovskaya', null, 'A crew of builders in charge of demolition of old buildings in Moscow find hidden treasure inside one of the houses scheduled for demolition. The plot evolves around their attempts to bypass the Soviet authorities and cash the gold.', 'A crew of builders in charge of demolition of old buildings in Moscow find hidden treasure inside one of the houses scheduled for demolition. The plot evolves around their attempts to bypass the Soviet authorities and cash the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GbWj0Dnlj99QODGlC9Ijs87ixd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79233'),
  ('223226424367585307', 'One to Another', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marc Barr, Pascal Arnold, Chris Keohane', 'Pascal Arnold', 'Lizzie Brocheré, Arthur Dupont, Guillaume Baché, Pierre Perrier, Nicolas Nollet, Valérie Mairesse, Karl E. Landler, Matthieu Boujenah', null, 'A story about bunch of people who live in a town in provincial France. At the center of it all is Pierre, a conceited and vain bisexual musician in his late teens who acts as a magnet, to varying degrees, for a whole array of characters - from his sister Lucie, with whom he has a heated incestuous relationship, to a city councilor with whom he participates in gay orgies. When Pierre turns up dead, Lucie investigates the reasons for his demise and charts the network of sadomasochistic relationships that crisscross the town.', 'A story about bunch of people who live in a town in provincial France. At the center of it all is Pierre, a conceited and vain bisexual musician in his late teens who acts as a magnet, to varying degrees, for a whole array of characters - from his sister Lucie, with whom he has a heated incestuous relationship, to a city councilor with whom he participates in gay orgies. When Pierre turns up dead, Lucie investigates the reasons for his demise and charts the network of sadomasochistic relationships that crisscross the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnF2ewdZax4tGhzUU7JYqBGa7FX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12838'),
