  ('336187521083795824', 'One Way', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Tobia Sempi, Andrew Baird', 'Ben Conway', 'mgk, Storm Reid, Drea De Matteo, Travis Fimmel, Kevin Bacon, Luis Da Silva, Jr., Meagan Holder, Rhys Coiro', 'R', 'On the run with a bag full of cash after a robbing his former crime boss—and a potentially fatal wound—Freddy slips onto a bus headed into a rainy night in Georgia. With his life slipping through his fingers, Freddy is left with very few choices to survive.', 'On the run with a bag full of cash after a robbing his former crime boss—and a potentially fatal wound—Freddy slips onto a bus headed into a rainy night in Georgia. With his life slipping through his fingers, Freddy is left with very few choices to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQCxOziq79P3wDsRwQhhkhQyDsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747803'),
  ('183516218594486084', 'One Way Boogie Woogie', 1977, 'Documentary', 'James Benning', 'James Benning', null, null, 'Sixty one-minute shots with no camera movement. This tension between painterly and cinematic space is not only experienced as an intellectual contrast but is also felt as a dialectic between permanence and impermanence.', 'Sixty one-minute shots with no camera movement. This tension between painterly and cinematic space is not only experienced as an intellectual contrast but is also felt as a dialectic between permanence and impermanence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lco4oAic35YUA0ZdvbfKSlQ70f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217477'),
  ('704079954572412275', 'One Way or Another', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Elio Petri, Umberto Angelucci, Giovanni Piccioni', 'Berto Pelosso', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Marcello Mastroianni, Mariangela Melato, Ciccio Ingrassia, Franco Citti, Cesare Gelli, Michel Piccoli, Renato Salvatori', null, 'Set during a retreat of Christian Democrat politicians who practice spiritual exercises together, it is an allegory of corrupted power. Disturbing, claustrophobic settings are the background to a series of mysterious crimes.', 'Set during a retreat of Christian Democrat politicians who practice spiritual exercises together, it is an allegory of corrupted power. Disturbing, claustrophobic settings are the background to a series of mysterious crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AEPuT7lFo0sZgFq8atUioOgagj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47096'),
  ('467175775057621502', 'One Way or Another', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sara Gómez, Luís García Mesa', 'Sara Gómez, Tomás González Pérez', 'Mario Balmaseda, Yolanda Cuéllar, Mario Limonta, Isaura Mendoza, Bobby Carcassés, Sarita Reyes, Othón Blanco, Bárbara Hernández', null, 'In Miraflores, Cuba, the growing romance between Mario, a factory worker, and Yolanda, a schoolteacher, throws into relief the differences in their perspectives and values in Revolutionary Cuba.', 'In Miraflores, Cuba, the growing romance between Mario, a factory worker, and Yolanda, a schoolteacher, throws into relief the differences in their perspectives and values in Revolutionary Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omNcTxVIYGHSFEgqBsU1LnPwstw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162505'),
