  ('257397502761795366', 'One Way Trip', 2016, 'Drama', 'Choi Jung-yol, Lee Hyung-bin, O Seok-pil', 'Choi Jung-yol', 'Kim Ji-soo, Suho, Ryu Jun-yeol, Kim Hee-chan, Kim Dong-wan, Kim Jong-soo, Choi Jun-young, Lee Joo-sil', null, 'Four friends on a trip rescue a woman who is being beaten by a man, only to be pursued by the police. One of them lapses into unconsciousness following an ensuing car accident and the other three are arrested on suspicion of murder.', 'Four friends on a trip rescue a woman who is being beaten by a man, only to be pursued by the police. One of them lapses into unconsciousness following an ensuing car accident and the other three are arrested on suspicion of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYyMhyI0uvjfgFURB3usbl2ufpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381375'),
  ('289795923316860128', 'One Week', 2008, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Michael McGowan, Arthur E. Cooper', 'Michael McGowan', 'Campbell Scott, Joshua Jackson, Liane Balaban, Marc Strange, Gage Munroe, Deirdre Kirby, Fiona Reid, Chuck Shamata', null, 'Ben Tyler has been diagnosed with cancer. With a grim chance of survival in the best case scenario even if he immediately begins treatment, he instead decides to take a motorcycle trip from Toronto through the Canadian prairies to British Columbia.', 'Ben Tyler has been diagnosed with cancer. With a grim chance of survival in the best case scenario even if he immediately begins treatment, he instead decides to take a motorcycle trip from Toronto through the Canadian prairies to British Columbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82phQYJ8plIOVj9vekmB4ALURa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18635'),
  ('1094003584304424665', 'One Week Friends', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shosuke Murakami, Nobushige Fujimoto', 'Yoko Izumisawa', 'Haruna Kawaguchi, Kento Yamazaki, Takashi Matsuo, Shuhei Uesugi, Haori Takahashi, Seika Furuhata, Sairi Ito, Masahiro Komoto', 'PG-13', 'High school student Yuki Hase wants to become close with classmate Kaori Fujimiya who is alway by herself. Kaori Fujimiya refuses to become close with Yuki Hase, because she forgets her friends every new Monday. Even though Kaori tells Yuki why she doesn''t want to become friends, Yuki still wants to become close to her.', 'High school student Yuki Hase wants to become close with classmate Kaori Fujimiya who is alway by herself. Kaori Fujimiya refuses to become close with Yuki Hase, because she forgets her friends every new Monday. Even though Kaori tells Yuki why she doesn''t want to become friends, Yuki still wants to become close to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6UauiNi9G29kFQ6auKmYuBac88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417760'),
  ('72576181208920218', 'One Week Friends', 2022, 'Drama', 'Gavin Lin, Lu Deng', 'Hermes Lu', 'Zhao Jinmai, Lin Yi, Shen Yue, Wang Jiahui, Fan Shiran, Zhang Chenxiao, Dai Wenjun, Yan Fan', null, 'A high school student suffers from a strange amnesia, causing her memories to only last a week. After she befriends a new student, his kindness and persistence make her gradually open up.', 'A high school student suffers from a strange amnesia, causing her memories to only last a week. After she befriends a new student, his kindness and persistence make her gradually open up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Adt7lE79voOqRzYhe4mNnHqUoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945675'),
  ('155019254022280268', 'One Wild Moment', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Claude Berri, André Neau', 'Claude Berri', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Victor Lanoux, Agnès Soral, Christine Dejoux, Martine Sarcey, Robert Bahr, Tiburce Favretto, Tessa Bouché', 'R', 'Pierre, 44, contentedly divorced, takes his teen daughter to the Côte d''Azur along with his friend Jacques and Jacques'' own teen daughter, Françoise. On the topless beaches of Saint-Tropez, Jacques and Pierre discuss marriage and being parents. Then, in a wild moment at a nighttime party, Françoise starts playing with Pierre, and one thing leads to another: they become lovers. After a couple of trysts, Pierre wants out, but Françoise declares her love for him and wants to tell her father about it. She does, but leaves out Pierre''s name, so Jacques enlists Pierre''s help in identifying who seduced his daughter. What will Pierre do?', 'Pierre, 44, contentedly divorced, takes his teen daughter to the Côte d''Azur along with his friend Jacques and Jacques'' own teen daughter, Françoise. On the topless beaches of Saint-Tropez, Jacques and Pierre discuss marriage and being parents. Then, in a wild moment at a nighttime party, Françoise starts playing with Pierre, and one thing leads to another: they become lovers. After a couple of trysts, Pierre wants out, but Françoise declares her love for him and wants to tell her father about it. She does, but leaves out Pierre''s name, so Jacques enlists Pierre''s help in identifying who seduced his daughter. What will Pierre do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jTWy6HPxWyWKwatA0VigoYG9sO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74871'),
  ('896419073548532392', 'One Wild Moment', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pascal Marti, Robert Gantz, Jean-François Richet', 'Lisa Azuelos, Jean-François Richet', 'Vincent Cassel, François Cluzet, Alice Isaaz, Lola Le Lann, Philippe Nahon, Annelise Hesme, Louka Meliava, Noémie Merlant', null, 'Antoine and Laurent, old friends, spend their vacation in Corsica with their respective daughters: seventeen-year-old Louna and eighteen-year-old Marie. One evening at the beach, Louna seduces Laurent. Louna is in love, but for Laurent it was nothing more than a momentary distraction. Without revealing her lover''s name, Louna confides in her father, who tries by any means to discover who his daughter''s lover is. How long will the secret be able to be kept hidden?', 'Antoine and Laurent, old friends, spend their vacation in Corsica with their respective daughters: seventeen-year-old Louna and eighteen-year-old Marie. One evening at the beach, Louna seduces Laurent. Louna is in love, but for Laurent it was nothing more than a momentary distraction. Without revealing her lover''s name, Louna confides in her father, who tries by any means to discover who his daughter''s lover is. How long will the secret be able to be kept hidden?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9NRdRKpaQyrpFpWVjLt6LTZijO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342878'),
  ('205181592478920433', 'One Win', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shin Yeon-shick, Choi Yong-jin, Lee Jun-il', 'Shin Yeon-shick, Cho Eu-gene', 'Song Kang-ho, Park Jeong-min, Jang Yoon-ju, Park Myung-hoon, Lee Min-ji, Shin Yoon-ju, Si Eun-mi, Jang Su-im', null, 'A former volleyball star, Woo-jin has been struggling to keep his children''s volleyball school that''s about to go out of business. Left without much choice, he agrees to coach a women''s volleyball team that is the worst in the league, with only second rate players and an eccentric club owner. According to Woo-jin''s contract, all he needs to do is win just one game.', 'A former volleyball star, Woo-jin has been struggling to keep his children''s volleyball school that''s about to go out of business. Left without much choice, he agrees to coach a women''s volleyball team that is the worst in the league, with only second rate players and an eccentric club owner. According to Woo-jin''s contract, all he needs to do is win just one game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIrL4q8Kbyn2BS5srZlTRhcqM62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714650'),
  ('492736539279068282', 'One Winter Weekend', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Gary Yates, Paul Suderman, Puneet Chawla', 'Erinne Dobson', 'Taylor Cole, Jack Turner, Bea Santos, Rukiya Bernard, Dewshane Williams, Kristen Harris, Eugene Baffoe, David Arial', null, 'Cara, a women’s magazine writer, who gets burned by her boyfriend on New Years’ Eve, decides to go on a dating detox. Challenged by her employer to write about it, she hopes a spontaneous ski getaway with her best friend will spark inspiration. Complicating matters, they discover they’ve double booked their chalet with two eligible men, including Ben, an entrepreneur. When the share-mates get snowed in, Cara and Ben are thrown together.', 'Cara, a women’s magazine writer, who gets burned by her boyfriend on New Years’ Eve, decides to go on a dating detox. Challenged by her employer to write about it, she hopes a spontaneous ski getaway with her best friend will spark inspiration. Complicating matters, they discover they’ve double booked their chalet with two eligible men, including Ben, an entrepreneur. When the share-mates get snowed in, Cara and Ben are thrown together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgSG5ZMJG0BOUo0BJG7PIeSTwCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491411'),
  ('737480315278868067', 'One Woman or Two', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daniel Vigne, Carlo Varini', 'Daniel Vigne, Élisabeth Rappeneau', 'Gérard Depardieu, Sigourney Weaver, Ruth Westheimer, Michel Aumont, Zabou Breitman, Yann Babilée, Maurice Barrier, Jean-Pierre Bisson', 'PG-13', 'An ad executive impersonates an archeology professor to avoid a situation with an obsessed former lover. She enlists the help of a hapless archeologist who is at the airport to pick the real archeology professor. What follows is a series of conflicting and comical situations involving the "switcheroo."', 'An ad executive impersonates an archeology professor to avoid a situation with an obsessed former lover. She enlists the help of a hapless archeologist who is at the airport to pick the real archeology professor. What follows is a series of conflicting and comical situations involving the "switcheroo."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGXGIWSZWpXMqf3NCz321PpJGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191056'),
  ('333809198150723924', 'One Wonderful Sunday', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Akira Kurosawa, Asakazu Nakai, Zenji Koizumi', 'Akira Kurosawa, Keinosuke Uekusa', 'Isao Numasaki, Chieko Nakakita, Atsushi Watanabe, Zeko Nakamura, Toppa Utsumi, Ichiro Namiki, Ichirō Sugai, Masao Shimizu', null, 'Two broke sweethearts wander war-scarred Tokyo on a single Sunday, stretching 35 yen as they chase housing, small pleasures, and a little hope.', 'Two broke sweethearts wander war-scarred Tokyo on a single Sunday, stretching 35 yen as they chase housing, small pleasures, and a little hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JADvAzmEiLaYqnw8eZVOp88q5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45967'),
  ('623597406879292123', 'One World: Together at Home', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alex Coletti', null, 'Jimmy Fallon, Jimmy Kimmel, Stephen Colbert, Taylor Swift, Paul McCartney, Stevie Wonder, Elton John, Billie Joe Armstrong', 'PG', 'A global broadcast & digital special organized by Global Citizen and the World Health Organization featuring comedians, musicians, and actors to raise funds in support of front line health workers in the global response to COVID-19.', 'A global broadcast & digital special organized by Global Citizen and the World Health Organization featuring comedians, musicians, and actors to raise funds in support of front line health workers in the global response to COVID-19.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTgE5tbXTK6loONkHn1Reh8keJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694527'),
  ('385192689338396273', 'One Year, One Night', 2022, 'Drama', 'Irina Lubtchansky, Pol Rodríguez, Cristina Alcalde', 'Isaki Lacuesta, Fran Araújo, Isa Campo', 'Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Noémie Merlant, Quim Gutiérrez, Alba Guilera, Natalia de Molina, Antón Álvarez, Enric Auquer, Blanca Apilánez', null, 'Ramón and Céline are a young couple that attended a concert at the Bataclan theatre in Paris on the fateful night of November 13, 2015. They survive the attack, but when they leave the theatre, they are no longer the same. That night leaves a deep scar on both their lives and each tries to cope.', 'Ramón and Céline are a young couple that attended a concert at the Bataclan theatre in Paris on the fateful night of November 13, 2015. They survive the attack, but when they leave the theatre, they are no longer the same. That night leaves a deep scar on both their lives and each tries to cope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0uxUkswkmNCWn1w0x5920U1DWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769466'),
  ('888796463472987441', 'One-Armed Boxer', 1972, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Mu Tzun-Kue', 'Jimmy Wang Yu', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Lung Fei, Ma Chi, Cindy Tang Hsin, Hsueh Han, Tien Yeh, Shan Mao, Kwan Hung', null, 'A martial-arts student learns the iron fist and death grip techniques to avenge his teacher''s death.', 'A martial-arts student learns the iron fist and death grip techniques to avenge his teacher''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmUlzkwzWZPiGlh4yRmN2wwRCBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49967'),
  ('1089998102937356319', 'One-Eyed Jacks', 1961, 'Western, Drama', 'Marlon Brando, Charles Lang, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Guy Trosper, Calder Willingham', 'Marlon Brando, Karl Malden, Katy Jurado, Ben Johnson, Slim Pickens, Larry Duran, Sam Gilman, Timothy Carey', 'NR', 'Running from the law after a bank robbery in Mexico, Dad Longworth finds an opportunity to take the stolen gold and leave his partner Rio to be captured. Years later, Rio escapes from the prison where he has been since, and hunts down Dad for revenge. Dad is now a respectable sheriff in California, and has been living in fear of Rio''s return.', 'Running from the law after a bank robbery in Mexico, Dad Longworth finds an opportunity to take the stolen gold and leave his partner Rio to be captured. Years later, Rio escapes from the prison where he has been since, and hunts down Dad for revenge. Dad is now a respectable sheriff in California, and has been living in fear of Rio''s return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xal47bRKVIxErB7h2CScY3GBnoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18647'),
  ('279977016268169870', 'One-Eyed Monster', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Adam Fields, Joseph White', 'Adam Fields, Scott Fields, Jordan Fields', 'Jason Graham, Charles Napier, Jeff Denton, Veronica Hart, Bart Fletcher, Jenny Guy, Caleb Mayo, Carmen Hart', null, 'In February 2007, ten people went to the remote mountains of Northern California to shoot an adult movie. What happened next was something no one expected, but everyone saw coming.', 'In February 2007, ten people went to the remote mountains of Northern California to shoot an adult movie. What happened next was something no one expected, but everyone saw coming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXDmkwuWyQTjD8Tz7dJr93z9KdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24133'),
  ('889142654219159368', 'One-Line', 2017, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Yang Kyung-mo, Kang Gook-hyun, Jung Hae-ji', 'Yang Kyung-mo', 'Yim Si-wan, Jin Goo, Park Byung-eun, Lee Dong-hwi, Kim Sun-young, Ahn Se-ha, Kim Hong-pa, Wang Ji-won', null, 'A group of professional con artists scam poor, unsuspecting citizens with fraudulent bank loans. The scams go well for a while, but then they begin to distrust each other.', 'A group of professional con artists scam poor, unsuspecting citizens with fraudulent bank loans. The scams go well for a while, but then they begin to distrust each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcWnGBLJwQeSKAxAINmtDHf6WNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442014'),
  ('342403481761479447', 'One-Minute Time Machine', 2022, 'Mystery, Comedy, Romance', 'Jose Hernandez, Devon Avery, Christos Bitsakos', 'Sean Crouch', 'Erinn Hayes, Brian Dietzen', null, 'Every time the beautiful Regina rejects his advances, James pushes a red button and tries again, all the while unaware of the reality and consequences of his actions.', 'Every time the beautiful Regina rejects his advances, James pushes a red button and tries again, all the while unaware of the reality and consequences of his actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ff8RRzYNIhcylLfFNbKEc4694C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347968'),
  ('37741668747414465', 'One-Percenter', 2023, 'Action', 'Yudai Yamaguchi, Kensuke Sonomura, Akio Kimura', 'Yudai Yamaguchi', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Kohei Fukuyama, Kanon Narumi, Rumika Fukuda, Sho Aoyagi, Norihisa Hiranuma, Togo Ishii, Taro Suruga', null, 'After his devastatingly fast, samurai-style combat approach sets filmmakers against him, a legendary action star films his own movie—on turf claimed by feuding yakuza gangs, including Japan’s deadliest martial arts assassin.', 'After his devastatingly fast, samurai-style combat approach sets filmmakers against him, a legendary action star films his own movie—on turf claimed by feuding yakuza gangs, including Japan’s deadliest martial arts assassin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IPFHdnSgWof5Vu62L8okZG1tt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022632'),
  ('439594848763099136', 'One-Two, Soldiers Were Going...', 1976, 'Drama, War', 'Leonid Bykov, Volodymyr Voitenko, V. Chernolikh', 'Kirill Rapoport, Boris Vasilyev', 'Leonid Bykov, Vladimir Konkin, Mykola Hrynko, Yelena Shanina, Boris Khimichev, Vladimir Gerasimov, Yuriy Sherstnyov, Mikhail Yezepov', null, 'The families of 18 soldiers who heroically died in 1944 are meeting at the place of the squad last battle.', 'The families of 18 soldiers who heroically died in 1944 are meeting at the place of the squad last battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osP88ax4b8RNpGCxeRNXlU1VOiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72614'),
  ('519838622509071613', 'One-Way Ticket to Mombasa', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pekka Uotila, Mark Lwoff, Harri Ylönen', 'Hannu Tuomainen, Atro Lahtela', 'Antti Tarvainen, Joonas Saartamo, Johanna Rönnlöf, Timo Päivänsalo, Liisa Halonen, Anu Hämäläinen, Harri Kettumäki, Micko Hell', null, 'Pete loses his consciousness while playing in a pop band. The diagnosis is harsh and the doctor cannot say for sure whether Pete will celebrate his 18th birthday. One night, encouraged by the vodka on Jusa''s 18th birthday, Pete confesses his love to Kata, his dream girl. Together with Jusa, they go to Lapland where Kata has her summer job. In Jusa''s wild company, Pete experiences something which he never felt before as they decide to take a trip to Mombasa via Lapland.', 'Pete loses his consciousness while playing in a pop band. The diagnosis is harsh and the doctor cannot say for sure whether Pete will celebrate his 18th birthday. One night, encouraged by the vodka on Jusa''s 18th birthday, Pete confesses his love to Kata, his dream girl. Together with Jusa, they go to Lapland where Kata has her summer job. In Jusa''s wild company, Pete experiences something which he never felt before as they decide to take a trip to Mombasa via Lapland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDhfS9JmPpLz1LrCrbvT7eIT2JS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68098'),
  ('1094490660071074712', 'One-way to Moscow', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Micha Lewinsky, Tobias Dengler', 'Plinio Bachmann, Micha Lewinsky, Barbara Sommer', 'Philippe Graber, Miriam Stein, Michael Maertens, Mike Müller, Vera Flück, Kamil Krejčí, Martin Ostermeier, Eva Bay', null, '30 years ago, Switzerland was shaken by a scandal that seems to have already been forgotten: more than 900,000 people were surveilled because of their political convictions. Against the backdrop of this "secret files scandal," Micha Lewinsky sets his film. Conscientious policeman Viktor Schuler is tasked by his superior to infiltrate the Schauspielhaus, a renowned Zurich theatre, in order to keep an eye on its leftist scene. However, Viktor finds himself quite taken with the artist''s life and falls in love with the subversive actress Odile Lehmann.', '30 years ago, Switzerland was shaken by a scandal that seems to have already been forgotten: more than 900,000 people were surveilled because of their political convictions. Against the backdrop of this "secret files scandal," Micha Lewinsky sets his film. Conscientious policeman Viktor Schuler is tasked by his superior to infiltrate the Schauspielhaus, a renowned Zurich theatre, in order to keep an eye on its leftist scene. However, Viktor finds himself quite taken with the artist''s life and falls in love with the subversive actress Odile Lehmann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xkvR747p4DtaO2EaVD167WWFsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662286'),
  ('342336510596005656', 'One-Way to Tomorrow', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ozan Açıktan, Samet Kilic', 'Faruk Özerten', 'Metin Akdülger, Dilan Çiçek Deniz, Tevfik Kartal, Ömür Kayakırılmaz, İsmail Hakkı Şen, Fatma Filiz Sencan', null, 'Two strangers meet on a journey from Ankara to Izmir. Although having a rough start, their relationship takes a different path when they realize they have to confront themselves and would like to clean the slate as they get to know each other.', 'Two strangers meet on a journey from Ankara to Izmir. Although having a rough start, their relationship takes a different path when they realize they have to confront themselves and would like to clean the slate as they get to know each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZ7TH5x2VVZgazvUxbLm4CSdHNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682426'),
  ('1056884973117980173', 'One-Week Bachelors', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Hans Iveberg, Petter Davidson', 'Åke Cato, Jan Richter', 'Gösta Ekman, Janne ''Loffe'' Carlsson, Lena Olin, Mona Seilitz, Börje Nyberg, Peter Harryson, Sten Johan Hedman, Lennart R. Svensson', null, 'Gary''s wife goes away for a week and Gary expects a week of hard work at the office. After having left her at the airport, he misses the bus. But the car mechanic Lasse gives him a ride. Although they are unlike each other, they get to know each other. Gary makes a mess of everything and can''t avoid Lasse.', 'Gary''s wife goes away for a week and Gary expects a week of hard work at the office. After having left her at the airport, he misses the bus. But the car mechanic Lasse gives him a ride. Although they are unlike each other, they get to know each other. Gary makes a mess of everything and can''t avoid Lasse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiQPHqGUJj4KM9mNLlzlKBcFv9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104412'),
  ('67692752984549137', 'One, Two, Three', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Billy Wilder, Daniel L. Fapp, Tom Pevsner', 'I. A. L. Diamond, Billy Wilder', 'James Cagney, Horst Buchholz, Pamela Tiffin, Arlene Francis, Liselotte Pulver, Hanns Lothar, Howard St. John, Leon Askin', 'NR', 'In Cold War-era West Berlin, American Coca-Cola executive C.R. ''Mac'' MacNamara is tasked with playing babysitter to his boss'' spoiled 17-year-old daughter Scarlett, who proves more difficult than anticipated when she reveals that she is pregnant by a Communist.', 'In Cold War-era West Berlin, American Coca-Cola executive C.R. ''Mac'' MacNamara is tasked with playing babysitter to his boss'' spoiled 17-year-old daughter Scarlett, who proves more difficult than anticipated when she reveals that she is pregnant by a Communist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWQE227ub1frfnjP5HZy0wLF0wu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430'),
  ('61616351606087864', 'One, Two, Three, Sun', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gérard de Battista, Bertrand Blier', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Anouk Grinberg, Myriam Boyer, Olivier Martinez, Marcello Mastroianni, Jean-Michel Noirey, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Claude Brasseur, Denise Chalem', null, 'A provocative, seemingly absurd patchwork movie which sends a worthwhile message about hope against all odds, love, children and human understanding. Schoolgirl Victorine has an insane mother and an alcoholic father who can never find his way home in their maze of slum apartment blocks. Aggressive, sexually threatening boys of all ages are everywhere, and while the teacher eventually relents to a gang of adolescent rapists, Victorine gives herself to a rowdy gang of older layabouts, eventually winning the heart of burglar Paul.', 'A provocative, seemingly absurd patchwork movie which sends a worthwhile message about hope against all odds, love, children and human understanding. Schoolgirl Victorine has an insane mother and an alcoholic father who can never find his way home in their maze of slum apartment blocks. Aggressive, sexually threatening boys of all ages are everywhere, and while the teacher eventually relents to a gang of adolescent rapists, Victorine gives herself to a rowdy gang of older layabouts, eventually winning the heart of burglar Paul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBp1NaamNeHZucHanwngMaGAfy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38505'),
  ('395407563193611731', 'One/4', 2026, null, 'Bahubali Palani', 'Bahubali Palani', 'Venkatesh Peddapalem, Aparnaa Mallik, Heena Soni, Aparna Shetty, Srinivas Bhogireddy', null, 'Vizag youngster Kiran lives a normal life until one small mistake turns his entire world upside down. A single tongue slip in front of four unexpected people pulls him into a dangerous circle of crime, betrayal, and survival.', 'Vizag youngster Kiran lives a normal life until one small mistake turns his entire world upside down. A single tongue slip in front of four unexpected people pulls him into a dangerous circle of crime, betrayal, and survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZTFkYmU4ZWMtN2Q4ZS00OWI0LWFmM2UtYTEwYjYyNTkxNTFiXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:one-4-2026'),
  ('841332545585253706', 'Onechanbara: Bikini Samurai Squad', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Yôhei Fukuda, Yôhei Fukuda, Gô Ohara', 'Yasutoshi Murakawa, Yôhei Fukuda', 'Elly Otoguro, Chise Nakamura, Manami Hashimoto, Tarō Suwa, Tomohiro Waki, Tetsu Watanabe, Sari Kurauchi', 'NR', 'In the year 20xx, scientifically created zombies roam the world in record numbers. Despite this, Aya is determined to track down her father''s killer, a person who was once close to her. With sword in hand and wearing nothing but her trademark bikini and cowboy hat, she sets off to settle the score.', 'In the year 20xx, scientifically created zombies roam the world in record numbers. Despite this, Aya is determined to track down her father''s killer, a person who was once close to her. With sword in hand and wearing nothing but her trademark bikini and cowboy hat, she sets off to settle the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8g6cykcOUfdCYeIii84bzNL0gpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37223'),
  ('832454741191418111', 'Onechanbara: The Movie - Vortex', 2009, 'Action, Horror', 'Tsuyoshi Shôji', 'Fukushima Yoshiki', 'Yuu Tejima, Kumi Imura, Akari Ozawa, Rika Kawamura, Chika Arakawa, Hoshina Yôhei', null, 'Sisters Aya and Saki put aside their rivalry and go toe-to-toe with Himiko and her band of zombies. The evil Himiko needs the blood of the young girls to restore her youth, while the sisters need to stop Himiko to save mankind ...', 'Sisters Aya and Saki put aside their rivalry and go toe-to-toe with Himiko and her band of zombies. The evil Himiko needs the blood of the young girls to restore her youth, while the sisters need to stop Himiko to save mankind ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtO5juEVgZQpzoW0lDxpj3NyXBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37225'),
  ('859845225287141361', 'Onegin', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Martha Fiennes, Chris Seagers, Remi Adefarasin', 'Michael Ignatieff, Peter Ettedgui', 'Ralph Fiennes, Liv Tyler, Toby Stephens, Lena Headey, Martin Donovan, Elizabeth Berrington, Alun Armstrong, Simon McBurney', null, 'A virtuous and passionate girl falls in love with a cynical but a dashing aristocrat.', 'A virtuous and passionate girl falls in love with a cynical but a dashing aristocrat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nG5c0Jwy8vxFXZcDMMcrbSCEsrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30237'),
  ('720521169280644553', 'Onegin', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sarik Andreasyan, Kirill Zotkin, Svetlana Ershova', 'Aleksey Gravitskiy', 'Victor Dobronravov, Liza Moryak, Denis Prytkov, Tatyana Sabinova, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Svetlana Nemolyaeva, Alyona Khmelnitskaya, Aleksey Grishin', null, 'Evgeniy Onegin lives in grand style: balls, receptions, theater premieres and other frivolities the capital can offer a young man. But social life has long tired him, so he perceives the news of the illness of his uncle living in the village as an opportunity to escape. However, having reached the estate, Onegin learns about the death of a relative, which, however, does not upset Evgeniy too much. His financial affairs are very sad, and his uncle is rich and has no other heirs. Onegin locks himself in the estate, living in aimless solitude until the owner, who has returned from abroad, appears at the neighboring estate – a young, enthusiastic Vladimir Lenskiy, not yet satiated with life, who introduces Evgeniy to sisters Tatyana and Olga Larin.', 'Evgeniy Onegin lives in grand style: balls, receptions, theater premieres and other frivolities the capital can offer a young man. But social life has long tired him, so he perceives the news of the illness of his uncle living in the village as an opportunity to escape. However, having reached the estate, Onegin learns about the death of a relative, which, however, does not upset Evgeniy too much. His financial affairs are very sad, and his uncle is rich and has no other heirs. Onegin locks himself in the estate, living in aimless solitude until the owner, who has returned from abroad, appears at the neighboring estate – a young, enthusiastic Vladimir Lenskiy, not yet satiated with life, who introduces Evgeniy to sisters Tatyana and Olga Larin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEgFBpDn3V8gu3y9cybQg2IbqxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214871'),
  ('701883254509715912', 'Onesime, Clockmaker', 1912, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Jean Durand', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Ernest Bourbon, Raymond Aimos, Berthe Dagmar, Alphonse Foucher, Édouard Grisollet, Gaston Modot', null, 'In an effort to secure a promised inheritance, Onésime invents a time machine that speeds up activity on earth, hyper-animates men and machines, and telescopes the human life-cycle.', 'In an effort to secure a promised inheritance, Onésime invents a time machine that speeds up activity on earth, hyper-animates men and machines, and telescopes the human life-cycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8etRHjhil5Sa2GvWhYcmQ49L7yd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156126'),
  ('348624481205347203', 'Ong Bak 2', 2008, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Tony Jaa, Panna Rittikrai, Nattawut Kittikhun', 'Panna Rittikrai, Tony Jaa', 'Tony Jaa, Sarunyu Wongkrachang, Sorapong Chatree, Nirut Sirijanya, Primrata Dej-Udom, Petchtai Wongkamlao, Santisuk Promsiri, Patthama Panthong', 'R', 'Tien, the son of Lord Sihadecho — a murdered nobleman — is taken under the wing of Chernang, a renowned warrior and leader of the Pha Beek Krut.', 'Tien, the son of Lord Sihadecho — a murdered nobleman — is taken under the wing of Chernang, a renowned warrior and leader of the Pha Beek Krut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Iue46Q6d1EGMPl7XraeRAMdMoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16353'),
  ('1032556846403621232', 'Ong Bak 3', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Tony Jaa, Panna Rittikrai, Chaowat Phanruangchana', 'Tony Jaa, Panna Rittikrai', 'Tony Jaa, Primrata Dej-Udom, Dan Chupong, Nirut Sirijanya, Petchtai Wongkamlao, Sarunyu Wongkrachang, Sorapong Chatree, Choomporn Theppitak', 'R', 'Tien is captured and almost beaten to death before he is saved and brought back to the Kana Khone villagers. There he is taught meditation and how to deal with his Karma, but very soon his arch rival returns challenging Tien for a final duel.', 'Tien is captured and almost beaten to death before he is saved and brought back to the Kana Khone villagers. There he is taught meditation and how to deal with his Karma, but very soon his arch rival returns challenging Tien for a final duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIVrOJVeLqPz9NwNa0e4FpqJCWK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43209'),
  ('356666516806320327', 'Ong-Bak', 2003, 'Action, Crime', 'Prachya Pinkaew, Nattawut Kittikhun, Sakchai Amattayakul', 'Suphachai Sittiaumponpan', 'Tony Jaa, Petchtai Wongkamlao, Patrarin Punyanutatam, Suchao Pongwilai, Choomporn Theppitak, Cheathavuth Watcharakhun, Wannakit Siriput, Rungrawee Barijindakul', 'R', 'When the head of a statue sacred to a village is stolen, a young martial artist goes to the big city and finds himself taking on the underworld to retrieve it.', 'When the head of a statue sacred to a village is stolen, a young martial artist goes to the big city and finds himself taking on the underworld to retrieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oagqAwp48dMPoCT94yDJUDOCVPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9316'),
  ('146748209446401848', 'Onibi: The Fire Within', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rokurō Mochizuki, Naosuke Imaizumi', 'Toshiyuki Morioka', 'Yoshio Harada, Reiko Kataoka, Show Aikawa, Kazuki Kitamura, Ryushi Mizukami, Hiroyuki Tsunekawa, Yoshiaki Fujita, Ei Kawakami', null, 'After spending over half his life in prison, ex-hitman Kunihiro is determined to go straight. But the shortcomings of the new gangs mean that he is soon having to call on his old-school yakuza talents. And when he falls for Asako, a beautiful piano player, she unknowingly ignites a fire within Kuni that will immolate everything and everybody around him. Regarded by many as his masterpiece, Onibi has all the hallmarks of a Mochizuki film, with the gangster elements tightly compressed and controlled to allow space in which a subdued romance can bloom. Coming from a background in porno cinema, this master of sexual relations injects a fresh passion and tension into the macho world of the yakuza film.', 'After spending over half his life in prison, ex-hitman Kunihiro is determined to go straight. But the shortcomings of the new gangs mean that he is soon having to call on his old-school yakuza talents. And when he falls for Asako, a beautiful piano player, she unknowingly ignites a fire within Kuni that will immolate everything and everybody around him. Regarded by many as his masterpiece, Onibi has all the hallmarks of a Mochizuki film, with the gangster elements tightly compressed and controlled to allow space in which a subdued romance can bloom. Coming from a background in porno cinema, this master of sexual relations injects a fresh passion and tension into the macho world of the yakuza film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKPVWhRNPVzzzIRBdjvOjBvmG7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185110'),
  ('375954440702403053', 'Onimasa: A Japanese Godfather', 1982, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Fujio Morita, Hideo Gosha', 'Kōji Takada', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Masako Natsume, Shima Iwashita, Tetsuro Tamba, Akiko Kana, Emi Shindō, Akiko Nakamura, Mari Natsuki', null, 'Onimasa is the egocentric boss of a small yakuza clan on Shikoku Island, whose criminal duties conflict with his self-image as a chivalrous samurai. His struggles with his boss, the Shikoku Godfather, and the tumultuous life of his adopted daughter, Matsue, form the backdrop of this epic tale of justice, obedience, and bloody vengeance.', 'Onimasa is the egocentric boss of a small yakuza clan on Shikoku Island, whose criminal duties conflict with his self-image as a chivalrous samurai. His struggles with his boss, the Shikoku Godfather, and the tumultuous life of his adopted daughter, Matsue, form the backdrop of this epic tale of justice, obedience, and bloody vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGP9WAxhXFTtEmoemhy3ysIwLkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107641'),
  ('85559694793401680', 'Onks'' Viljoo näkyny?', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Hannu Seikkula, Juha Jalasti', 'Pertti Reponen', 'Heikki Kinnunen, Titta Jokinen, Pirkka-Pekka Petelius, Aake Kalliala, Kristiina Elstelä, Anna Hultin, Klaus Thomasson, Vesa Vierikko', null, 'The hosts of the television program Oma maa mansikka promise 10 million to anyone who manages to turn the remote village of Taka-Surkee into a popular tourist destination. The challenge is taken up by Arvid and Valtte, two Roma men; Naema-Aslak and Soikiapää, two Sami men who are fond of alcohol; and Vähänen, a former bank clerk who worked at the bank before certain irregularities came to light. Taka-Surkee has no town plan, nor much else, but it does have Römppäinen''s kiosk and a man who asks about Viljo. The villagers themselves do not want tourists in their neighborhood, so they decide to put the prize money in a better place...', 'The hosts of the television program Oma maa mansikka promise 10 million to anyone who manages to turn the remote village of Taka-Surkee into a popular tourist destination. The challenge is taken up by Arvid and Valtte, two Roma men; Naema-Aslak and Soikiapää, two Sami men who are fond of alcohol; and Vähänen, a former bank clerk who worked at the bank before certain irregularities came to light. Taka-Surkee has no town plan, nor much else, but it does have Römppäinen''s kiosk and a man who asks about Viljo. The villagers themselves do not want tourists in their neighborhood, so they decide to put the prize money in a better place...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdmfqdGoCr4JwFVTULQO2mS742o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38208'),
  ('612858074009089472', 'Only', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Action, Romance', 'Katie Jackson, Adam Drake, Joth Riggs', 'Takashi Doscher', 'Freida Pinto, Leslie Odom Jr., Chandler Riggs, Jayson Warner Smith, Joshua Mikel, Mark Ashworth, Tia Hendricks, Richard Hempton', 'R', 'After a comet releases a mysterious virus that begins to kill all of the women in the world, a young couple''s relationship is severely tested. They hide out (from both the illness and the savages who hunt the remaining women) in their over-sterilized apartment. Ultimately the duo escapes their self-imposed quarantine to head to the wilderness.', 'After a comet releases a mysterious virus that begins to kill all of the women in the world, a young couple''s relationship is severely tested. They hide out (from both the illness and the savages who hunt the remaining women) in their over-sterilized apartment. Ultimately the duo escapes their self-imposed quarantine to head to the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qFSX4rwNq75j8t79S2Dqg5VsQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597233'),
  ('780172213574432347', 'Only a Mother', 1949, 'Drama', 'Alf Sjöberg, Martin Bodin, Tova Branzell', 'Alf Sjöberg', 'Eva Dahlbeck, Ragnar Falck, Ulf Palme, Hugo Björne, Åke Fridell, Mona Geijer-Falkner, Max von Sydow, Margaretha Krook', null, 'A poor woman in a Swedish farming community struggles to feed her large family and is torn by her passion for two different men.', 'A poor woman in a Swedish farming community struggles to feed her large family and is torn by her passion for two different men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVYm5Ck5eJcpQaM6JgQE6BC8EjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211485'),
  ('746721725763033520', 'Only Angels Have Wings', 1939, 'Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'Howard Hawks, Joseph Walker, Morris Stoloff', 'Jules Furthman', 'Cary Grant, Jean Arthur, Thomas Mitchell, Richard Barthelmess, Rita Hayworth, Allyn Joslyn, Sig Ruman, Victor Kilian', 'NR', 'A traveling performer arrives at a remote South American port town where the head of an air freight service must risk his pilots'' lives to earn a major contract.', 'A traveling performer arrives at a remote South American port town where the head of an air freight service must risk his pilots'' lives to earn a major contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqcwiWancAkjtAQPHr9V3SfJjBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43832'),
  ('111629433963713718', 'Only Blockbusters Left Alive: Monopolizing Film Distribution in Turkey', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Fırat Yücel, Kaan Müjdeci, Evrim Kaya', null, 'Funda Alp, Serkan Çakarer, Sevil Demirci, İrfan Demirkol, Yonca Ertürk, Pelin Esmer, Marsel Kalvo, Mustafa Sönmez', null, 'Turkish film industry has been experiencing a breakthrough in the last ten years. According to 2015 figures, there is a bold uptrend in terms of viewers and film production. Yet without any regulations at work, this growth only made injustices in distribution bigger. While a single cinema chain controls more then 50% of the market, it also started to control distribution and production. In this monopolized environment, there seems to be no country for independent production. With the guidance of producers, distributors, and economists, the film traces the distortion created by the bad economy that has become an obstacle for freedom of choice.', 'Turkish film industry has been experiencing a breakthrough in the last ten years. According to 2015 figures, there is a bold uptrend in terms of viewers and film production. Yet without any regulations at work, this growth only made injustices in distribution bigger. While a single cinema chain controls more then 50% of the market, it also started to control distribution and production. In this monopolized environment, there seems to be no country for independent production. With the guidance of producers, distributors, and economists, the film traces the distortion created by the bad economy that has become an obstacle for freedom of choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irzVgzN4bemJivXgybRpKzeF0c0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400827'),
  ('222863322521899047', 'Only Clouds Move the Stars', 1998, 'Drama, Family', 'Torun Lian, Svein Krøvel', 'Torun Lian', 'Thea Sofie Rusten, Jan Tore Kristoffersen, Jørgen Langhelle, Andrine Sæther, Anneke von der Lippe, Eindride Eidsvold, Kari Simonsen, Bjørn Jenseg', null, 'Eleven year old Maria has lost her little brother to cancer. Having disappeared into herself, her mother is no longer there for Maria and her father struggles to keep the family together. Maria meets Jacob, who is the same age as she, but with a completely different attitude. Jacob is outgoing, exciting, funny and has wisdom way beyond his tender years. He gradually pulls Maria out of her shell and enables her to come to decisions which will affect her entire life.', 'Eleven year old Maria has lost her little brother to cancer. Having disappeared into herself, her mother is no longer there for Maria and her father struggles to keep the family together. Maria meets Jacob, who is the same age as she, but with a completely different attitude. Jacob is outgoing, exciting, funny and has wisdom way beyond his tender years. He gradually pulls Maria out of her shell and enables her to come to decisions which will affect her entire life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHYBu3JoQK8PPUxsldUUWJ4Ovno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17575'),
  ('211349651744789669', 'Only Fools Fall in Love', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Erica Li, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Yuen Wah, Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Billy Lau Nam-Kwong, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Bak Ka-Sin, Roy Chiao', null, 'Poor girl meets rich boy as they quarrel over a food seller''s once a year delicacy. His brother pays her to marry the brother so he can stage an assassination attempt. The attempt doesn''t succeed but the man is reduced to the level of an idiot child and the girl looks after him because of her guilt. She nurses him back to health so that he can resume his place as head of the family.', 'Poor girl meets rich boy as they quarrel over a food seller''s once a year delicacy. His brother pays her to marry the brother so he can stage an assassination attempt. The attempt doesn''t succeed but the man is reduced to the level of an idiot child and the girl looks after him because of her guilt. She nurses him back to health so that he can resume his place as head of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM3dRcWMAyJzD3Dq18cSCFJmzyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112433'),
  ('898695071746621047', 'Only Fools Rush In', 2022, 'Romance, Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Han Han, Bai Yuxia', 'Han Han', 'Liu Haoran, Liu Haocun, Teng Shen, Yin Zheng, Qiao Shan, Zhou Qi, Zhang Youhao, William Feng', null, 'Wu Renyao, who is good at motorcycle stunts, meets his father Wu Renteng, whom he has not seen for many years, and embarks on a road trip to the big city along with a girl named Huan Song and her brother''s motorcade.', 'Wu Renyao, who is good at motorcycle stunts, meets his father Wu Renteng, whom he has not seen for many years, and embarks on a road trip to the big city along with a girl named Huan Song and her brother''s motorcade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyZHVBWtuBwd8TkgnOCqJIzEqbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:827689'),
  ('418800600275602876', 'Only For The Weekend', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Scott Toler Collins, Gianfranco Gaioni, Edoardo Re', 'Gianfranco Gaioni, Giacomo Berdini', 'Matilde Gioli, Francesca Inaudi, Alessandro Roja, Stefano Fresi, Malik Barnhardt, Scott Toler Collins, Marina Rocco, Dov Mamann', null, 'A disgraced copywriter addicted to psychiatric drugs goes through a hell of a weekend to save his marriage.', 'A disgraced copywriter addicted to psychiatric drugs goes through a hell of a weekend to save his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyavkSkUJCkmvrfJQBNJJ8KIDjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405197'),
  ('650853119912657470', 'Only Girls', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Jolivet, Pascal Ridao, Sonia Larue', 'Pierre Jolivet, Simon Michaël', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, François Berléand, Roschdy Zem, Vincent Lindon, Sylvie Testud, Albert Dray, Francis Leplay, Jean-Chrétien Sibertin-Blanc', null, 'After a shoplifter finds herself unexpectedly released on parole, she pays a call on the judge at her flat. The judge, Carole Rewinsky, does not tell Tina that her elease was only a clerical error. The two find they share things in common other than the judicial system, like a mutual interest in shoes. Carole allows Tina to crash on her chesterfield... Carole spots a pimp trolling for young girls at a café. Carole failed to put him away the last time, but now, with Tina agreeing to be the bait, she has a chance for better luck... The two find they complement one another well, like champagne and cassis. Carole needs to go to Annecy to crack a crooked casino case. Annecy happens to be Tina''s home town... Written by David Carless', 'After a shoplifter finds herself unexpectedly released on parole, she pays a call on the judge at her flat. The judge, Carole Rewinsky, does not tell Tina that her elease was only a clerical error. The two find they share things in common other than the judicial system, like a mutual interest in shoes. Carole allows Tina to crash on her chesterfield... Carole spots a pimp trolling for young girls at a café. Carole failed to put him away the last time, but now, with Tina agreeing to be the bait, she has a chance for better luck... The two find they complement one another well, like champagne and cassis. Carole needs to go to Annecy to crack a crooked casino case. Annecy happens to be Tina''s home town... Written by David Carless', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sePVIr96jqSvBmDVxRUoBWj6INM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51860'),
  ('305862508040419626', 'Only God Can Judge Me', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Özgür Yildirim', 'Özgür Yildirim', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Edin Hasanović, Birgit Minichmayr, Peter Simonischek, Franziska Wulf, Alexandra Maria Lara, Tim Wilde', null, 'Ricky spent years behind bars after taking the rap for his brother Rafael and his buddy Latif after a failed robbery. Now, Latif wants to express gratitude by letting Ricky in on a coup that will bring lots of money. After some hesitation, Ricky agrees, and gets his brother Rafael on board. Everything runs smoothly, until police officer Diana turns up on the scene. A nerve-wracking cat and mouse game is set in motion. Director Özgür Yildirim’s most recent film offers insight into Frankfurt’s gangster world. As before in CHIKO – which also starred Moritz Bleibtreu – he portrays the daily life of the criminal underground scene in a large German city.', 'Ricky spent years behind bars after taking the rap for his brother Rafael and his buddy Latif after a failed robbery. Now, Latif wants to express gratitude by letting Ricky in on a coup that will bring lots of money. After some hesitation, Ricky agrees, and gets his brother Rafael on board. Everything runs smoothly, until police officer Diana turns up on the scene. A nerve-wracking cat and mouse game is set in motion. Director Özgür Yildirim’s most recent film offers insight into Frankfurt’s gangster world. As before in CHIKO – which also starred Moritz Bleibtreu – he portrays the daily life of the criminal underground scene in a large German city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5g9EJvlxa54GcWa8HpadAZNjRpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419734'),
  ('768299159818325184', 'Only God Forgives', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Larry Smith, Charlie Sungkawess', 'Nicolas Winding Refn', 'Ryan Gosling, Kristin Scott Thomas, Vithaya Pansringarm, Rhatha Phongam, Gordon Brown, Tom Burke, Byron Gibson, Sahajak Boonthanakit', 'R', 'Julian, who runs a Thai boxing club as a front organization for his family''s drug smuggling operation, is forced by his mother Crystal to find and kill the individual responsible for his brother''s recent death.', 'Julian, who runs a Thai boxing club as a front organization for his family''s drug smuggling operation, is forced by his mother Crystal to find and kill the individual responsible for his brother''s recent death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWjjFSng1JttmDRwDROoGcIArEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77987'),
  ('95125156734829352', 'Only God Knows', 2006, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Carlos Bolado', 'Carlos Bolado, Diane Weipert', 'Diego Luna, Alice Braga, Cecilia Suárez, Jesús Ochoa, Maria Alves, José María Yázpik, Chica Xavier, Claudette Maillé', 'R', 'On a lark in Tijuana, a carefree Brazilian art student crosses paths with a brooding Mexican journalist, sparking a cascade of events across both Mexico and Brazil. As Dolores and Damián discover an intimate love and a mysterious spiritual heritage, they struggle with ever more costly choices.', 'On a lark in Tijuana, a carefree Brazilian art student crosses paths with a brooding Mexican journalist, sparking a cascade of events across both Mexico and Brazil. As Dolores and Damián discover an intimate love and a mysterious spiritual heritage, they struggle with ever more costly choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bcSSmsAKCGlZPVzDcl6xFhD1IU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62045'),
  ('826739193163801438', 'Only God Knows Everything', 2025, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Paek Seung-hwan, Shin Hyun-kyu', 'Ko Joon-seok', 'Shin Seung-ho, Han Ji-eun, Park Myung-hoon, Jeon So-min, You Seong-joo, Lee Jung-ok, Nam Joong-gyu, Paek Joo-hwan', null, 'Do-woon, orphaned and raised by a priest, is ordained as a priest. In the confessional, he hears that his mother was murdered and an evil group reveals itself.', 'Do-woon, orphaned and raised by a priest, is ordained as a priest. In the confessional, he hears that his mother was murdered and an evil group reveals itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Wf8UnuYZiKVpZ975O5rnap89Nk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1097001'),
  ('492080756749414164', 'Only God Sees Me', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bruno Podalydès, Pierre Stoeber', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Denis Podalydès, Jeanne Balibar, Isabelle Candelier, Cécile Bouillot, Michel Vuillermoz, Jean-Noël Brouté, Mouss Zouheyri, Philippe Uchan', null, 'Albert, a sound engineer who is chronically hesitant successively meets three charming young women who will, each in their own way, provoke and help him to get a better hold of himself.', 'Albert, a sound engineer who is chronically hesitant successively meets three charming young women who will, each in their own way, provoke and help him to get a better hold of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joxM6mmFOlH416fYFkLi9HS1ixx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36690'),
