  ('933735222022877880', 'Only Human', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Danny Cohen, Teresa De Pelegrí, Dominic Harari', 'Dominic Harari, Teresa De Pelegrí', 'Norma Aleandro, Guillermo Toledo, Marián Aguilera, Fernando Ramallo, María Botto, Alba Molinero, Max Berliner, Mario Martín', null, 'A mismatched couple discovers that whatever can go wrong will go wrong during a family visit.', 'A mismatched couple discovers that whatever can go wrong will go wrong during a family visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCu06B2kU7D74mmSogY1dJYuQ51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5960'),
  ('315546378351914977', 'Only Love', 1998, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'John Erman, Tony Imi', null, 'Marisa Tomei, Rob Morrow, Mathilda May, Jeroen Krabbé, Georges Corraface, Paul Freeman, Emmy Rossum, Ellen Muth', null, 'Two young lovers whose romantic dreams were shattered, are reunited years later in this sweeping story of fobidden love.', 'Two young lovers whose romantic dreams were shattered, are reunited years later in this sweeping story of fobidden love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Whuoa6pQKSw3g6yiSyW5eOTCVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57111'),
  ('232226999138790858', 'Only Lovers Left Alive', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Jim Jarmusch, Yorick Le Saux, Toby Ashraf', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Tilda Swinton, Tom Hiddleston, Anton Yelchin, Mia Wasikowska, Jeffrey Wright, Slimane Dazi, John Hurt, Carter Logan', 'R', 'A depressed musician reunites with his lover. However, their romance, already played over several centuries, is disrupted by the arrival of her uncontrollable younger sister.', 'A depressed musician reunites with his lover. However, their romance, already played over several centuries, is disrupted by the arrival of her uncontrollable younger sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xY2MhYjFPb4xU3KlBJcFAJmMsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152603'),
  ('564537315611257717', 'Only Mine', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Marius Pessah, Michael Civille, Karim Nabil', 'Matt Young', 'Amber Midthunder, Brett Zimmerman, Chris Browning, Claudia Ferri, Walter Fauntleroy, Lorenzo James Henrie, Ashley Holliday Tavares, Ellen Wroe', null, 'Tormented and left for dead by a scorned lover, a woman finds the strength within herself to recover and retaliate against her abuser.', 'Tormented and left for dead by a scorned lover, a woman finds the strength within herself to recover and retaliate against her abuser.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EbeDRaqYTpkw35ntQGlskuak1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575923'),
  ('572165126638118801', 'Only Old Men Are Going to Battle', 1974, 'War, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Leonid Bykov, Volodymyr Voitenko, Nina Avramenko', 'Yevgeni Onopriyenko, Leonid Bykov, Aleksandr Satsky', 'Leonid Bykov, Serhiy Pidhornyi, Sergei Ivanov, Rustam Sagdullaev, Yevgeniya Simonova, Olga Mateshko, Volodymyr Talashko, Viktor Miroshnichenko', null, 'Alexey Titarenko is very talented pilot and brave leader of "Singing group". He also must look after some new cadets and fight together with them against German Luftwaffe planes. Close to Alexey always are his friends, they are all from different parts of the country, but they all became real brothers.', 'Alexey Titarenko is very talented pilot and brave leader of "Singing group". He also must look after some new cadets and fight together with them against German Luftwaffe planes. Close to Alexey always are his friends, they are all from different parts of the country, but they all became real brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TE8gM826e1OU62AErJ5LS4F1os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37129'),
  ('985485452143307125', 'Only the Animals', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dominik Moll, Patrick Ghiringhelli, Thierry Verrier', 'Dominik Moll, Gilles Marchand', 'Denis Ménochet, Laure Calamy, Damien Bonnard, Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Bastien Bouillon, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Jenny Bellay, Fred Ulysse', null, 'Following the disappearance of the glamorous and secretive Evelyne Ducat during a blizzard in the highlands of southern France, the lives of five people inextricably linked to Evelyne are brought together to devastating effect as the local police investigate the case.', 'Following the disappearance of the glamorous and secretive Evelyne Ducat during a blizzard in the highlands of southern France, the lives of five people inextricably linked to Evelyne are brought together to devastating effect as the local police investigate the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdAS6PT1AZIL7s1q9xTkOMDjU5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574321'),
  ('1021944619689056104', 'Only the Brave', 2006, 'Drama, War', 'Lane Nishikawa, Michael G. Wojciechowski', 'Lane Nishikawa', 'Mark Dacascos, Jennifer Aquino, Jeff Fahey, Gina Hiraizumi, Jason Scott Lee, Emily Liu, Pat Morita, Ken Narasaki', 'R', 'A searing portrait of war and prejudice, ‘Only the Brave’ takes you on a haunting journey into the hearts and minds of the forgotten heroes of WWII – the Japanese-American 100th/442nd. In 1941, when Japan attacked Pearl Harbor, overnight Japanese Americans were put into internment camps for the duration of the war. Determined to prove their loyalty, 1400 Japanese Americans successfully petitioned the government to serve becoming the 100th Infantry Battalion. They were sent to North Africa, Italy and finally France were they performed an impossibly-dangerous rescue of the Texas 36th Division. During their two years of combat these men received an unparalleled 21 Medals of Honor, 9,486 Purple Hearts, 8 Presidential Citations, 53 Distinguished Service Crosses, 588 Silver Stars and 5,200 Bronze stars – making them the most decorated unit of their size in American military history. This is their story.', 'A searing portrait of war and prejudice, ‘Only the Brave’ takes you on a haunting journey into the hearts and minds of the forgotten heroes of WWII – the Japanese-American 100th/442nd. In 1941, when Japan attacked Pearl Harbor, overnight Japanese Americans were put into internment camps for the duration of the war. Determined to prove their loyalty, 1400 Japanese Americans successfully petitioned the government to serve becoming the 100th Infantry Battalion. They were sent to North Africa, Italy and finally France were they performed an impossibly-dangerous rescue of the Texas 36th Division. During their two years of combat these men received an unparalleled 21 Medals of Honor, 9,486 Purple Hearts, 8 Presidential Citations, 53 Distinguished Service Crosses, 588 Silver Stars and 5,200 Bronze stars – making them the most decorated unit of their size in American military history. This is their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgf5T0yy6c6asRbDOk1xa10KTUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31101'),
  ('380236032745737246', 'Only the Brave', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'Joseph Kosinski, Claudio Miranda, Michael Kelem', 'Ken Nolan, Eric Warren Singer', 'Josh Brolin, Miles Teller, Jeff Bridges, Jennifer Connelly, James Badge Dale, Taylor Kitsch, Alex Russell, Andie MacDowell', 'PG-13', 'Members of the Granite Mountain Hotshots battle deadly wildfires to save an Arizona town.', 'Members of the Granite Mountain Hotshots battle deadly wildfires to save an Arizona town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/db5IkOJu9UHktrKroNktw1Z8ARY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395991'),
  ('119478038123707914', 'Only the Dead', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Bill Guttentag, Michael Ware', 'Michael Ware, Bill Guttentag', 'Michael Ware', null, 'A searing account of war correspondent Michael Ware''s seven years reporting in Iraq--an extraordinary journey that takes him into the darkest recesses of the Iraq War and the human soul.', 'A searing account of war correspondent Michael Ware''s seven years reporting in Iraq--an extraordinary journey that takes him into the darkest recesses of the Iraq War and the human soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozqfofwYfzjh5AneTArpr68yuX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344170'),
  ('67887806597649893', 'Only the Lonely', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Columbus, Julio Macat, Paul Vombrack', 'Chris Columbus', 'John Candy, Maureen O''Hara, Ally Sheedy, Kevin Dunn, Milo O''Shea, Bert Remsen, Anthony Quinn, Jim Belushi', 'PG-13', 'Danny Muldoon, a Chicago policeman, still lives with his overbearing mother Rose. He meets and falls in love with Theresa Luna, whose father owns the local funeral parlour. Naturally, his mother objects to the relationship, and Danny and Theresa must either overcome her objections or give up the romance.', 'Danny Muldoon, a Chicago policeman, still lives with his overbearing mother Rose. He meets and falls in love with Theresa Luna, whose father owns the local funeral parlour. Naturally, his mother objects to the relationship, and Danny and Theresa must either overcome her objections or give up the romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfHLYKddffTEfPbnXNrp8Oc4Owj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2611'),
  ('172231305170432902', 'Only the Night', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Xavier Giannoli, Yorick Le Saux', 'Jacques Fieschi, Xavier Giannoli', 'Ludivine Sagnier, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Bruno Todeschini, Florence Loiret Caille, Estelle Vincent, Antoine de Prekel, Barbet Schroeder', null, 'A video library clerk becomes obsessed with a sleepwalking woman and takes it upon himself to save her from catastrophe.', 'A video library clerk becomes obsessed with a sleepwalking woman and takes it upon himself to save her from catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz1ebR3Z0EH53TXj2b8bqU11iv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78322'),
  ('217745292080543309', 'Only the River Flows', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Wei Shujun, Zhiyuan Chengma, Li Xingbo', 'Wei Shujun, Kang Chunlei', 'Zhu Yilong, Chloe Maayan, Hou Tianlai, Tong Linkai, Kang Chunlei, Wang Jianyu, Moxi Zishi, Liu Baisha', null, 'Dedicated police detective Ma Zhe is tasked with solving a series of brutal murders in a rural Chinese town. As pressure mounts from his superiors, a hasty arrest is made, but while his colleagues celebrate, several clues push Ma Zhe deeper into a desperate investigation of his own.', 'Dedicated police detective Ma Zhe is tasked with solving a series of brutal murders in a rural Chinese town. As pressure mounts from his superiors, a hasty arrest is made, but while his colleagues celebrate, several clues push Ma Zhe deeper into a desperate investigation of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdlcJnXY63t17xKFfROfafTbXsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115379'),
  ('810149047582138509', 'Only the Strong', 1993, 'Action, Drama', 'Sheldon Lettich, Edward J. Pei', 'Sheldon Lettich, Luis Esteban', 'Mark Dacascos, Paco Christian Prieto, Stacey Travis, Richard Coca, Geoffrey Lewis, Todd Susman, Jeffrey Anderson-Gunter, Frank Dux', 'PG-13', 'Former Green Beret Louis Stevens returns to his hometown of Miami after completing military service in Brazil, only to learn that his old high school has become a haven for gangs and drug dealers. After Stevens uses his capoeira skills to kick several drug dealers off of the school property, Kerrigan, one of Stevens'' old teachers, sees the impact that Stevens has on the students. Kerrigan gives him the task of teaching Capoeira to a handful of the worst at-risk students at the school.', 'Former Green Beret Louis Stevens returns to his hometown of Miami after completing military service in Brazil, only to learn that his old high school has become a haven for gangs and drug dealers. After Stevens uses his capoeira skills to kick several drug dealers off of the school property, Kerrigan, one of Stevens'' old teachers, sees the impact that Stevens has on the students. Kerrigan gives him the task of teaching Capoeira to a handful of the worst at-risk students at the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPWV5rBhCgzlzhwkpdRG7a7UZqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15797'),
  ('645239388495857710', 'Only the Valiant', 1951, 'Western', 'Gordon Douglas, William Kissell, Lionel Lindon', 'Edmund H. North, Harry Brown', 'Gregory Peck, Barbara Payton, Ward Bond, Gig Young, Neville Brand, Lon Chaney Jr., Jeff Corey, Warner Anderson', 'NR', 'Only the Valiant, a classic western adventure, based on a novel by Charles Marquis Warren, the film tells the story of a Cavalry officer who volunteers for a suicidal mission to fight the hostile Apaches in an effort to prove his loyalty to his men and the woman he loves.', 'Only the Valiant, a classic western adventure, based on a novel by Charles Marquis Warren, the film tells the story of a Cavalry officer who volunteers for a suicidal mission to fight the hostile Apaches in an effort to prove his loyalty to his men and the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j2DB5PBuyxXMDKM8t5sia87wht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56597'),
  ('253397678547371942', 'Only Two Can Play', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Sidney Gilliat, John Wilcox, Douglas Hermes', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Peter Sellers, Mai Zetterling, Virginia Maskell, Raymond Huntley, John Le Mesurier, Richard Attenborough, Marie Devereux, Kenneth Griffith', null, 'John Lewis is bored of his job and his wife. Then Liz, wife of a local councillor, sets her sights on him. But this is risky stuff in a Welsh valleys town - if he and Liz ever manage to consummate their affair, that is.', 'John Lewis is bored of his job and his wife. Then Liz, wife of a local councillor, sets her sights on him. But this is risky stuff in a Welsh valleys town - if he and Liz ever manage to consummate their affair, that is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txgjZ46WTAXyRmQAL1Ab5IagGje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54723'),
  ('267073491960102475', 'Only When I Laugh', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Glenn Jordan, David M. Walsh', 'Neil Simon', 'Marsha Mason, Kristy McNichol, James Coco, Joan Hackett, David Dukes, John Bennett Perry, Guy Boyd, Ed Moore', 'R', 'A boozy Broadway actress comes out of a 12-week cure to face the problems of her best friends as well as her needy daughter. She tries to balance the terrors of returning to work with the demands of all around her with humor and insight, while staying off the booze.', 'A boozy Broadway actress comes out of a 12-week cure to face the problems of her best friends as well as her needy daughter. She tries to balance the terrors of returning to work with the demands of all around her with humor and insight, while staying off the booze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmoUyAX4YaMafcsArz5XiOh5N4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42146'),
  ('1066733704293384690', 'Only Yesterday', 1991, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Isao Takahata, Yoshiharu Sato, Katsuya Kondo', 'Isao Takahata', 'Miki Imai, Toshiro Yanagiba, Yoko Honna, Mayumi Izuka, Masahiro Itou, Chie Kitagawa, Yuuki Masuda, Yuki Minowa', 'PG', 'In lyrical switches between the present and the past, Taeko contemplates the arc of her life, and wonders if she has been true to the dreams of her childhood self.', 'In lyrical switches between the present and the past, Taeko contemplates the arc of her life, and wonders if she has been true to the dreams of her childhood self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOSnFE9e82iH3ZAzSTtuOkBsabJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15080'),
  ('1012644422947143215', 'Only You', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Betty Thomas, Bryan England', 'Wayne Allan Rice', 'Andrew McCarthy, Kelly Preston, Helen Hunt, Daniel Roebuck, Tom McFadden, Joel Murray, Liz Sheridan, Monty Ash', null, 'Dumped by his fiancée, Clifford Godfrey goes on vacation anyway where he ends up torn between a sober party girl and his travel agent.', 'Dumped by his fiancée, Clifford Godfrey goes on vacation anyway where he ends up torn between a sober party girl and his travel agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8Jgus7xXrqg8THp785EFJ3F79W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64039'),
  ('524028892138711798', 'Only You', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Norman Jewison, Sven Nykvist, W. Thomas Snyder', 'Diane Drake', 'Marisa Tomei, Robert Downey Jr., Bonnie Hunt, Joaquim de Almeida, Fisher Stevens, Billy Zane, Adam LeFevre, John Benjamin Hickey', 'PG', 'Two childhood paranormal incidents have convinced schoolteacher Faith Corvatch that her true love is a guy named ''Damon Bradley'', but she has yet to meet him. Preparing to marry podiatrist Dwayne in ten days, Faith receives a phone call from Dwayne''s old classmate Damon Bradley, who is on his way to Venice. She impulsively decides to fly to Italy with the hope of finally encountering the man of her dreams. Accompanying her on the trip is her sister-in-law and best friend Kate, who has just left her husband, Faith''s brother Larry.', 'Two childhood paranormal incidents have convinced schoolteacher Faith Corvatch that her true love is a guy named ''Damon Bradley'', but she has yet to meet him. Preparing to marry podiatrist Dwayne in ten days, Faith receives a phone call from Dwayne''s old classmate Damon Bradley, who is on his way to Venice. She impulsively decides to fly to Italy with the hope of finally encountering the man of her dreams. Accompanying her on the trip is her sister-in-law and best friend Kate, who has just left her husband, Faith''s brother Larry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mLLANXgUg3bibTiUitDlB0NZcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9058'),
  ('1000544383720108305', 'Only You', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Hakan Yonat', 'Aslı Zengin, Ceren Aslan', 'Belçim Bilgin, İbrahim Çelikkol, Erol Demiröz, Cezmi Baskın, Kerem Can, Necmi Yapıcı, Levent Sülün, Barış Arduç', null, 'The passionate love between a former boxer and a beautiful blind woman.', 'The passionate love between a former boxer and a beautiful blind woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uufzCM6Y0XJ4CKz5H7EBqc5yyKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277934'),
  ('889521093940176694', 'Only You', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wendy Ashman, Sean Boyle, Fraser Malcolm', 'Harry Wootliff, Matthieu de Braconier', 'Laia Costa, Josh O''Connor, Lisa McGrillis, Stuart Martin, Peter Wight, Sarkis Ninos, Orion Lee, Bobby Rainsbury', null, 'A madly-in-love young couple''s relationship begins to suffer when they struggle to conceive a child.', 'A madly-in-love young couple''s relationship begins to suffer when they struggle to conceive a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFZUakJrWl5TZmDLKVBtDg9OxmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513432'),
  ('883789946479627840', 'Only You Can Hear Me', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kôichi Nakayama, Tatsuya Ogishima', 'Hiroko Kanasugi', 'Riko Narumi, Keisuke Koide, Nana Katase, Hideo Nakano, Yuko Kotegawa, Kaoru Yachigusa, Mika Hada, Shin Ishikawa', null, 'Ryou is a girl isolated by everyone else in her class, she doesn''t even have a cell phone because no one would call her anyway. One day, she suddenly starts hearing voices of Shinya, who lives in a different prefecture.', 'Ryou is a girl isolated by everyone else in her class, she doesn''t even have a cell phone because no one would call her anyway. One day, she suddenly starts hearing voices of Shinya, who lives in a different prefecture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xZTXsDvHq7q1wBQHNrqL5wHjOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165957'),
  ('515746543724347103', 'Onmyoji', 2001, 'Drama, Horror, History, Action', 'Yojiro Takita, Naoki Kayano', 'Baku Yumemakura, Yasushi Fukuda, Itaru Era', 'Sachiko Kokubu, Mansai Nomura, Hideaki Ito, Eriko Imai, Hiroyuki Sanada, Kenji Yamaki, Houka Kinoshita, Kyoko Koizumi', null, 'During a dark time in the Heian period, when evil forces threaten the kingdom, the emperor relies on the onmyōji to keep the supernatural forces in line. But as political events become highly charged, friction within the order leads to betrayal. Now, Seimei, a talented member of the clan, must face down his master, Dōson, in the hopes of restoring peace to the kingdom.', 'During a dark time in the Heian period, when evil forces threaten the kingdom, the emperor relies on the onmyōji to keep the supernatural forces in line. But as political events become highly charged, friction within the order leads to betrayal. Now, Seimei, a talented member of the clan, must face down his master, Dōson, in the hopes of restoring peace to the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptiwNaV092Ut3qWLnN07fx2hFjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21325'),
  ('354300361416987528', 'Onmyoji II', 2003, 'Action, Drama, Horror', 'Yojiro Takita, Tatsuya Osada, Takeshi Hamada', 'Baku Yumemakura, Itaru Era, Yojiro Takita', 'Mansai Nomura, Kiichi Nakai, Kyoko Fukada, Hideaki Ito, Eriko Imai, Yuko Kotegawa, Hayato Ichihara', null, 'A group of demons in the ancient Japanese capital of Heian is dismembering members of a family of Japanese nobles.', 'A group of demons in the ancient Japanese capital of Heian is dismembering members of a family of Japanese nobles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGptUOgEo8AusrUBtPyjSQRGGoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45719'),
  ('703397900602159877', 'Onnenpeli', 1965, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Risto Jarva, Antti Peippo', 'Risto Jarva, Jaakko Pakkasvirta, Antti Peippo', 'Jaakko Pakkasvirta, Anneli Sauli, Eija Pokkinen, Kaisa Korhonen, Merja Alanen, Markku Annila, Risto Jarva, Heikki Hämäläinen', null, 'Jussi is a magazine editor who lives in an inherited apartment in Kruununhaka with his sister Eeva, who works as a summer editor, and his flight attendant girlfriend Leena.', 'Jussi is a magazine editor who lives in an inherited apartment in Kruununhaka with his sister Eeva, who works as a summer editor, and his flight attendant girlfriend Leena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cML2EUIn22VCF8NuLVO2uTvK7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293109'),
  ('515304901356887157', 'Onoda: 10,000 Nights in the Jungle', 2021, 'Drama, Adventure, War, History', 'Tom Harari, Arthur Harari', 'Arthur Harari, Vincent Poymiro', 'Yuya Endo, Kanji Tsuda, Yuya Matsuura, Tetsuya Chiba, Shinsuke Kato, Kai Inowaki, Issey Ogata, Taiga Nakano', null, 'Japan, 1944. Trained for intelligence work, Hiroo Onoda, 22 years old, discovers a philosophy contrary to the official line: no suicide; stay alive whatever happens; the mission is more important than anything else. Sent to Lubang, a small island in the Philippines where the Americans are about to land, this role will be to wage a guerrilla war until the return of the Japanese troops. The Empire will surrender soon after; Onoda, 10,000 days later.', 'Japan, 1944. Trained for intelligence work, Hiroo Onoda, 22 years old, discovers a philosophy contrary to the official line: no suicide; stay alive whatever happens; the mission is more important than anything else. Sent to Lubang, a small island in the Philippines where the Americans are about to land, this role will be to wage a guerrilla war until the return of the Japanese troops. The Empire will surrender soon after; Onoda, 10,000 days later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKzFwiEm86AVRsefgqODTBjjh98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695089'),
  ('315794702811544597', 'Onward', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Sanjay Bakshi, Adam Habib, Sharon Calahan', 'Dan Scanlon, Keith Bunin, Jason Headley', 'Tom Holland, Chris Pratt, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Octavia Spencer, Mel Rodriguez, Kyle Bornheimer, Lena Waithe, Ali Wong', 'PG', 'In a suburban fantasy world, two teenage elf brothers embark on an extraordinary quest to discover if there is still a little magic left out there.', 'In a suburban fantasy world, two teenage elf brothers embark on an extraordinary quest to discover if there is still a little magic left out there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4aul3FyD3jv3v4bul1IrkWZvzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508439'),
  ('225917805676607350', 'Onyx the Fortuitous and the Talisman of Souls', 2023, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Andrew Bowser', 'Andrew Bowser', 'Andrew Bowser, Olivia Taylor Dudley, Jeffrey Combs, Rivkah Reyes, Terrence ''T.C.'' Carson, Arden Myrin, Melanie Chandra, Barbara Crampton', null, 'Onyx joins a group of fellow occultists to attend a dark ritual at the mansion of their idol, Bartok. Suspecting Bartok’s nefarious intentions, Onyx is suddenly immersed in a world of monsters, mystery, and mayhem.', 'Onyx joins a group of fellow occultists to attend a dark ritual at the mansion of their idol, Bartok. Suspecting Bartok’s nefarious intentions, Onyx is suddenly immersed in a world of monsters, mystery, and mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/devICaLkwCklaehPpajjSd47QLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929230'),
  ('1093112423952905167', 'Ooh...You Are Awful', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Cliff Owen, Derek Whitehurst, John Lageu', 'John Warren, John Singer', 'Dick Emery, Ronald Fraser, Derren Nesbitt, Cheryl Kennedy, Pat Coombs, Liza Goddard, William Franklyn, Norman Bird', null, 'Charlie Tully and womanising Reggie Peek con two rich Italians out of £500,000, but during their flight out, Charlie is arrested for scamming an American and a dog. Reggie stores the money in a Swiss bank and after Charlie is released, is about to tell him where...when he is suddenly killed by Sid Sabbath''s gang, whose girlfriend was dating the (now) deceased! The only leads are four tattoos on the girls Reggie had affairs with while Charlie was in jail, but Sabbath is on Charlie''s trail, and the tricked Italians have contracted the mob - to find the money, and then kill him...', 'Charlie Tully and womanising Reggie Peek con two rich Italians out of £500,000, but during their flight out, Charlie is arrested for scamming an American and a dog. Reggie stores the money in a Swiss bank and after Charlie is released, is about to tell him where...when he is suddenly killed by Sid Sabbath''s gang, whose girlfriend was dating the (now) deceased! The only leads are four tattoos on the girls Reggie had affairs with while Charlie was in jail, but Sabbath is on Charlie''s trail, and the tricked Italians have contracted the mob - to find the money, and then kill him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f44JlUXzlX78A6ciF7jovF3Q7n7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145826'),
  ('15624090737827479', 'Oolong Courtyard: Kung Fu School', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Chu', 'Zhu Lingfeng', 'Wang Ning, Kong Lianshun, Wang Zhi, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Liang Chao, Steven Hao, Zhang Zidong, Xinrui Li', null, 'Apprentices at the Oolong Courtyard school are suspicious when two outsiders try to join the prestigious academy despite their strange behaviour.', 'Apprentices at the Oolong Courtyard school are suspicious when two outsiders try to join the prestigious academy despite their strange behaviour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oIm6OS7Mb7RcGCWxxX0oXBbEWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529011'),
  ('444682388026687633', 'Oomuro-ke: Dear Friends', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Naoyuki Tatsuwa', 'Masahiro Yokotani', 'Emiri Kato, Rina Hidaka, Chiwa Saito, Reo Kurachi, Ayasa Ito, Aoi Koga, Suzuko Mimori, Sumire Uesaka', null, 'The second part of a YuruYuri spin-off duology featuring Sakurako and her sisters.', 'The second part of a YuruYuri spin-off duology featuring Sakurako and her sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4C9ikQa7kS9V0kte4c8lzMdW0oR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211716'),
