  ('1034531050568618237', 'OOO, Den-O, All Riders: Let''s Go Kamen Riders', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Osamu Kaneda, Masao Inokuma, Junpei Shiokawa', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Shu Watanabe, Ryosuke Miura, Dori Sakurada, Toshihiko Seki, Hiroshi Fujioka, Takeshi Sasaki, Riho Takada, Rina Akiyama', null, 'Eiji and Ankh team up with Kotarou and Momotaros as they travel back in time to 1971 aboard the Den-Liner to stop three Mole Imagin. But Ankh’s desire to obtain Core Medals while in the past sets off a chain of events that alters the 40-year history of the Kamen Riders by allowing Shocker to take over the world. It’s up to OOO and New Den-O to restore the timeline!', 'Eiji and Ankh team up with Kotarou and Momotaros as they travel back in time to 1971 aboard the Den-Liner to stop three Mole Imagin. But Ankh’s desire to obtain Core Medals while in the past sets off a chain of events that alters the 40-year history of the Kamen Riders by allowing Shocker to take over the world. It’s up to OOO and New Den-O to restore the timeline!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enCI82X2GmfopmRggt8v4xOPTyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88568'),
  ('1129048636874751002', 'Ooops! Noah Is Gone...', 2015, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Toby Genkel, Seán McCormack, Peter Bohl', 'Marteinn Thorisson', 'Callum Maloney, Dermot Magennis, Ava Connolly, Tara Flynn, Paul Tylak, Aileen Mythen, Patrick Fitzsymons, Alan Stanford', 'G', 'It''s the end of the world. A flood is coming. Luckily for Dave and his son Finny, a couple of clumsy Nestrians, an Ark has been built to save all animals. But as it turns out, Nestrians aren''t allowed. Sneaking on board with the involuntary help of Hazel and her daughter Leah, two Grymps, they think they''re safe. Until the curious kids fall off the Ark. Now Finny and Leah struggle to survive the flood and hungry predators and attempt to reach the top of a mountain, while Dave and Hazel must put aside their differences, turn the Ark around and save their kids. It''s definitely not going to be smooth sailing.', 'It''s the end of the world. A flood is coming. Luckily for Dave and his son Finny, a couple of clumsy Nestrians, an Ark has been built to save all animals. But as it turns out, Nestrians aren''t allowed. Sneaking on board with the involuntary help of Hazel and her daughter Leah, two Grymps, they think they''re safe. Until the curious kids fall off the Ark. Now Finny and Leah struggle to survive the flood and hungry predators and attempt to reach the top of a mountain, while Dave and Hazel must put aside their differences, turn the Ark around and save their kids. It''s definitely not going to be smooth sailing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEJXHgpiKh89Vwjc4XUY5CIgUdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326215'),
  ('706938176680551012', 'Oopiri', 2016, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Vamshi Paidipally, P. S. Vinod', 'Vamshi Paidipally', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Karthi, Tamannaah Bhatia, Jayasudha, Prakash Raj, Ali Basha, Vivek, Anushka Shetty', null, 'A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.', 'A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXsJEdk1P3V2cm2TSRBuG8ZS1pz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369925'),
  ('235301665610456236', 'Oops!', 2003, 'Drama', 'Deepak Tijori', 'Deepak Tijori', 'Kiran Janjani, Vikas Sethi, Mink Brar, Adyasha Satpathy, Mita Vashisht, Kiran Kumar, Amit Singh Thakur', null, 'Jagan, Akash and Nisha belong to a dance club. Their ambition is to become big in the dancing profession. Jagan and Nisha are lovers. Jagan is a middle-class man who dreams of becoming a millionaire over night. In the process he meets an actress named Sonia who offers him a ridiculously large amount of money for a 3 hours strip tease show to be done among a group of ten high society women who are bored with their husbands. Jagan asks his best buddy Akash to accompany him in the job. That show becomes a big hit and Jagan gets another call from Sonia for another strip show. Akash, however, is not comfortable with that profession. Jagan does the solo strip tease. There he meets a sexy older women named Savitha who has a secret identity that will end up compromising Jagan''s world. - Written by gavin', 'Jagan, Akash and Nisha belong to a dance club. Their ambition is to become big in the dancing profession. Jagan and Nisha are lovers. Jagan is a middle-class man who dreams of becoming a millionaire over night. In the process he meets an actress named Sonia who offers him a ridiculously large amount of money for a 3 hours strip tease show to be done among a group of ten high society women who are bored with their husbands. Jagan asks his best buddy Akash to accompany him in the job. That show becomes a big hit and Jagan gets another call from Sonia for another strip show. Akash, however, is not comfortable with that profession. Jagan does the solo strip tease. There he meets a sexy older women named Savitha who has a secret identity that will end up compromising Jagan''s world. - Written by gavin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4jfRyLsAQ1dzepsXpyQp1koFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467219'),
  ('611668088153356349', 'OP Center', 1995, 'Thriller, Action, TV Movie', 'Lewis Teague', null, 'Harry Hamlin, Kim Cattrall, Lindsay Frost, John Savage, Carl Weathers, Bo Hopkins, Ken Howard, Rod Steiger', null, 'Paul Hood is the newly appointed director of the OP Center, a special agency gathering a wide variety of experts monitoring international crisis. On his first day on the job, nuclear missiles are stolen from the former Soviet Union by terrorists. The team must find out who did it, why, and most importantly, where they are heading so they can retrieve them', 'Paul Hood is the newly appointed director of the OP Center, a special agency gathering a wide variety of experts monitoring international crisis. On his first day on the job, nuclear missiles are stolen from the former Soviet Union by terrorists. The team must find out who did it, why, and most importantly, where they are heading so they can retrieve them', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5080d1zSIXZ1rSIvoRHMUrJkgUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65398'),
  ('939707506402054380', 'OPAL', 2020, 'Animation, Horror, Music', 'Jack Stauber', 'Jack Stauber', 'Jack Stauber', null, 'A curious girl investigates the cries she hears coming from a forbidden house across the street.', 'A curious girl investigates the cries she hears coming from a forbidden house across the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rabp6OsDUzUUcL7M5EEl4t1JnhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758803'),
  ('530966056731820288', 'Opal Dream', 2006, 'Drama, Family', 'Peter Cattaneo, Robert Humphreys', 'Peter Cattaneo, Phil Traill, Ben Rice', 'Sapphire Blossom, Christian Byers, Vince Colosimo, Jacqueline McKenzie, Robert Morgan, Anna Linarello, Denise Roberts, Peter Callan', null, 'Pobby & Dingan are invisible. They live in an opal town in Australia and are friends with Kellyanne, the 9 year-old daughter of an opal miner. The film tells the story of the bizarre and inexplicable disappearance of Pobby & Dingan, Kellyanne''s imaginary friends, and the impact this has on her family and the whole town. The story is told through the eyes of Kellyanne''s 11 years old brother Ashmol.', 'Pobby & Dingan are invisible. They live in an opal town in Australia and are friends with Kellyanne, the 9 year-old daughter of an opal miner. The film tells the story of the bizarre and inexplicable disappearance of Pobby & Dingan, Kellyanne''s imaginary friends, and the impact this has on her family and the whole town. The story is told through the eyes of Kellyanne''s 11 years old brother Ashmol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CNwFxtb3TYs1rzBsg9DnoPAbJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15699'),
  ('739821861688747427', 'Open 24 Hours', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dušan Popović, Luka Marković, Padraig Reynolds', 'Padraig Reynolds', 'Vanessa Grasse, Emily Tennant, Brendan Fletcher, Cole Vigue, Daniel O''Meara, Selina Giles, Tomi May, Jovana Miletic', null, 'After setting her serial killer boyfriend on fire, a paranoid delusional woman gets a job at an all-night gas station. The isolation triggers her anxiety and hallucinations, with devastatingly gory results.', 'After setting her serial killer boyfriend on fire, a paranoid delusional woman gets a job at an all-night gas station. The isolation triggers her anxiety and hallucinations, with devastatingly gory results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sH1aoV0lNSJiXVoUs52exYqsjLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532638'),
  ('149298393587722724', 'Open at Night', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Édouard Baer, Yves Angelo', 'Édouard Baer, Benoît Graffin', 'Édouard Baer, Audrey Tautou, Sabrina Ouazani, Grégory Gadebois, Michel Galabru, Christophe Meynet, Jean-Michel Lahmi, Patrick Boshart', null, 'One night to change everything. One night to save a theater, one night to change one''s perspective about life. Luigi will push and pull Faeza with him everywhere around Paris an entire night to save his theater.', 'One night to change everything. One night to save a theater, one night to change one''s perspective about life. Luigi will push and pull Faeza with him everywhere around Paris an entire night to save his theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEH20nWuzDJqS34OU9mf1ZjO2rV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415036'),
  ('518953392208163361', 'Open by Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'David Weaver, Ryan McMaster', 'Amyn Kaderali, Christine Conradt', 'Alison Sweeney, Erica Durance, Brennan Elliott, Michael Karl Richards, Catherine Barroll, Glen Gordon, Iris Quinn, Fred Henderson', 'G', 'When Nicky finds an unopened Christmas card from a high school secret admirer, she and her best friend Simone search to find and thank the anonymous author.', 'When Nicky finds an unopened Christmas card from a high school secret admirer, she and her best friend Simone search to find and thank the anonymous author.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAGrDr0EWqu8ZjCsIYSfuMH32SR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874161'),
  ('429669154804899435', 'Open Cage', 2014, 'Drama', 'Max Zunino, Ángeles Moreno Moreno, Matías Estevez Ciganda', 'Sofía Espinosa, Max Zunino, Fabiola Ramos', 'Sofía Espinosa, Juan Carlos Colombo, Harold Torres, Susana Salazar, Armando Espitia, Juan Manuel Pernas, Laura Almela, Alejandro Reza', null, 'The economy has collapsed. In a universe of moral and economic impoverishment, we find Flavia, a spoiled teenager with artistic aspirations that are somewhat frustrated when she is not accepted at the University. Her neighbor Martin, a mature man with rigid routines, is her antipode. When Flavia meets Martin, there are sparks of friction at all times, and the situation is unlikely to get any better.', 'The economy has collapsed. In a universe of moral and economic impoverishment, we find Flavia, a spoiled teenager with artistic aspirations that are somewhat frustrated when she is not accepted at the University. Her neighbor Martin, a mature man with rigid routines, is her antipode. When Flavia meets Martin, there are sparks of friction at all times, and the situation is unlikely to get any better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXgpg1P7Q9VRj26VEDUgb3yflis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261244'),
  ('488118151543135536', 'Open City', 2008, 'Action, Crime', 'Lee Sang-gi, Lee Seong-hwan', 'Lee Sang-gi', 'Son Ye-jin, Kim Myung-min, Kim Hae-sook, Kim Joon-bae, Park Sung-woong, Yun Yeong-keol, Lee Eun-mi, Park Gil-su', null, 'Jo Dae-yeong is a police officer investigating a pickpocket ring with ties to the Yakuza. One day he rescues Baek Jang-mi from danger, only to discover that she is the boss of the gang he has been tracking.', 'Jo Dae-yeong is a police officer investigating a pickpocket ring with ties to the Yakuza. One day he rescues Baek Jang-mi from danger, only to discover that she is the boss of the gang he has been tracking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJTHBNdBZB1go3ih1VUZsTcHpaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24037'),
  ('829948377580608716', 'Open Doors', 1990, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Giorgia Cecere, Marco Turco', 'Vincenzo Cerami, Alessandro Sermoneta, Gianni Amelio', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Ennio Fantastichini, Renzo Giovampietro, Renato Carpentieri, Tony Palazzo, Tuccio Musumeci, Silverio Blasi, Vitalba Andrea', null, 'Tommaso Scalia is a man who commits three murders: he kills his superior who sacked him, the man who replaced him and his wife. He wants a quick trial and an early execution, but an earnest, principled assistant judge looks for a way to save the murderer from being shot, because he does not belive in capital punishment.', 'Tommaso Scalia is a man who commits three murders: he kills his superior who sacked him, the man who replaced him and his wife. He wants a quick trial and an early execution, but an earnest, principled assistant judge looks for a way to save the murderer from being shot, because he does not belive in capital punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgkt7bouhLrKPB5f60aehqC6OQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60067'),
  ('1113480708906098965', 'Open Eyes', 2013, 'Drama', 'Martín Aletta', 'Martín Aletta', 'Chizuru Lee, Kajima Shozen, Junshin Soga', null, 'In the city with the highest suicide rate and where people don’t look to each other’s eyes, a gaze between two strangers could change the course of the day.', 'In the city with the highest suicide rate and where people don’t look to each other’s eyes, a gaze between two strangers could change the course of the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2daxNHjq4mWpdf2ZwHzJY7qCjbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618769'),
  ('372074005664472045', 'Open Fire', 1988, 'Action, Drama', 'Roger Mende', null, 'David Carradine, Henry Yu Yang, Hugo Stiglitz, Christine Lunde, Kansas Carradine, Wanda Acuna, Jorge Reynoso, Julio Aldama Jr.', null, 'Governor Joe Rouke''s (Carradine) daughter is kidnapped by South American Terrorists while she is on tour with the Children for World Peace Choir. Kung Fu Master ''Ly'', Joe and eight beautiful deadly women (The Panthers), mount an explosive rescue mission.', 'Governor Joe Rouke''s (Carradine) daughter is kidnapped by South American Terrorists while she is on tour with the Children for World Peace Choir. Kung Fu Master ''Ly'', Joe and eight beautiful deadly women (The Panthers), mount an explosive rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUlfUWjV3WXzmc8GXjQx9PUenUI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120815'),
  ('483512126453642133', 'Open Grave', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Gonzalo López-Gallego, José David Montero, Hedvig Király', 'Eddie Borey, Chris Borey', 'Sharlto Copley, Joseph Morgan, Thomas Kretschmann, Erin Richards, Josie Ho, Max Wrottesley, Kati Dombi, Eva Botos', 'R', 'A man awakes -- without memory -- in a pit full of bodies and must figure out if the people who rescued him are the killers, or if he is the murderer.', 'A man awakes -- without memory -- in a pit full of bodies and must figure out if the people who rescued him are the killers, or if he is the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgXcICQjS3aEbxCYgYMroBXyJGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215830'),
  ('49306471393024766', 'Open Graves', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Álvaro de Armiñán, Josu Inchaustegui, Txarly Llorente', 'Roderick Taylor, Bruce A. Taylor', 'Mike Vogel, Eliza Dushku, Ethan Rains, Naike Rivelli, Lindsay Caroline Robba, Gary Piquer, Álex O''Dogherty, Boris Martinez', 'R', 'One day, Jason finds an unusual board game called Mamba. When his surfer friends start to play, the games unleashes its deadly curse, killing the losers in a gruesome fashion. Supposedly it will grant the winner a wish. As his companions die off, Jason decides that the only way he can reverse the tragedy is by continuing to play. With his girlfriend, Erica, Jason rolls the dice and hopes to make his wish before one of them suffers a horrible fate.', 'One day, Jason finds an unusual board game called Mamba. When his surfer friends start to play, the games unleashes its deadly curse, killing the losers in a gruesome fashion. Supposedly it will grant the winner a wish. As his companions die off, Jason decides that the only way he can reverse the tragedy is by continuing to play. With his girlfriend, Erica, Jason rolls the dice and hopes to make his wish before one of them suffers a horrible fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgW8IftK7Bi4PitRTjB0HuzO6mQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28499'),
  ('348924319007241744', 'Open Hearts', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Morten Søborg, Susanne Bier', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Sonja Richter, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Mads Mikkelsen, Paprika Steen, Stine Bjerregaard, Birthe Neumann, Niels Olsen, Ulf Pilgaard', null, 'Cecilie and Joachim are about to get married when a freak car accident leaves Joachim disabled, throwing their lives into a spin. The driver of the other car, Marie, and her family don’t get off lightly, either. Her husband Niels works in the hospital where he meets Cecilie and falls madly in love with her.', 'Cecilie and Joachim are about to get married when a freak car accident leaves Joachim disabled, throwing their lives into a spin. The driver of the other car, Marie, and her family don’t get off lightly, either. Her husband Niels works in the hospital where he meets Cecilie and falls madly in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOrV2fCw2kmSiS4ZMGFPfXqr3lt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102'),
  ('853669038645213414', 'Open House', 1987, 'Horror', 'Robert Hayes, Jag Mundhra', 'David Mickey Evans', 'Joseph Bottoms, Adrienne Barbeau, Rudy Ramos, Mary Stavin, Scott Thompson Baker, Darwyn Swalve, Robert Miano, Page Moseley', 'R', 'Someone is killing off nubile real estate agents. A psychologist doing a therapy talk show begins getting calls from the perpetrator, and cooperates with the police to try and stop him. Unfortunately, his lover is a real estate agent, and when it becomes clear that the madman is getting information for his kills from her discarded home listings, they both become endangered.', 'Someone is killing off nubile real estate agents. A psychologist doing a therapy talk show begins getting calls from the perpetrator, and cooperates with the police to try and stop him. Unfortunately, his lover is a real estate agent, and when it becomes clear that the madman is getting information for his kills from her discarded home listings, they both become endangered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eA9sU9BG26gFVV4l8J6Gn8WZwto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85157'),
  ('264674741421229171', 'Open House', 2010, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Andrew Paquin, Joseph White, Jesse Doland', 'Andrew Paquin', 'Brian Geraghty, Rachel Blanchard, Anna Paquin, Stephen Moyer, Tricia Helfer, Jessica Collins, Larry Sullivan, Mia Riverton', null, 'A murderous couple invade a woman''s home and hold her captive in the basement.', 'A murderous couple invade a woman''s home and hold her captive in the basement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qw1UFEeApWp2NhBjW7uTCYMwat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39959'),
  ('108517993951692255', 'Open My Heart', 2002, 'Drama', 'Giada Colagrande', 'Giada Colagrande', 'Giada Colagrande, Natalie Cristiani, Claudio Botosso, Bice Gasparrini, Filippo Timi, Luisa Merloni', null, 'Maria lives with her 18-year-old sister, Caterina in a small apartment, tutors her at home, lets her out only for dance classes. Yet Maria sees no reason to hide her work as a prostitute from her sister. Men come in and out of the apartment constantly, and Caterina turns up the volume on her music to drown out the sounds from the next room. The film soon reveals that the sisters are in love with each other, a situation that cannot stand, but exactly what prompts the characters'' behavior is rarely clear. Soon after Caterina''s belated discovery of her heterosexuality, she is invited into the bedroom with Maria and a client.', 'Maria lives with her 18-year-old sister, Caterina in a small apartment, tutors her at home, lets her out only for dance classes. Yet Maria sees no reason to hide her work as a prostitute from her sister. Men come in and out of the apartment constantly, and Caterina turns up the volume on her music to drown out the sounds from the next room. The film soon reveals that the sisters are in love with each other, a situation that cannot stand, but exactly what prompts the characters'' behavior is rarely clear. Soon after Caterina''s belated discovery of her heterosexuality, she is invited into the bedroom with Maria and a client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caEUkXmbclgJcGDhyjoZig8YyzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80291'),
  ('12488456726115361', 'Open Range', 2003, 'Western, Drama, Action', 'Kevin Costner, J. Michael Muro, Darren Robson', 'Craig Storper', 'Kevin Costner, Robert Duvall, Michael Gambon, Michael Jeter, Diego Luna, James Russo, Abraham Benrubi, Kim Coates', 'R', 'A former gunslinger is forced to take up arms again when he and his cattle crew are threatened by a corrupt lawman.', 'A former gunslinger is forced to take up arms again when he and his cattle crew are threatened by a corrupt lawman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mrNc88NrUEGtMtat4FD7sfpFrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2055'),
  ('733158366066101686', 'Open Season', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Collinson, Juan Estelrich March, Adolfo Aristarain', 'Liz Charles-Williams, José Antonio Sáinz de Vicuña', 'Peter Fonda, Cornelia Sharpe, John Phillip Law, Richard Lynch, Alberto de Mendoza, William Holden, Helga Liné, Didi Sherman', 'R', 'Three Vietnam vets have become so conditioned to violence that they have developed psychotic tendencies. They kidnap people, brutalize them, then turn them loose and hunt them like animals. However the father of one of their earlier victims is plotting a vicious revenge against them.', 'Three Vietnam vets have become so conditioned to violence that they have developed psychotic tendencies. They kidnap people, brutalize them, then turn them loose and hunt them like animals. However the father of one of their earlier victims is plotting a vicious revenge against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5U0sCJZctGBnHVt60Kl6Nb35S26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80760'),
  ('1088681668071679860', 'Open Season', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Roger Allers, Jill Culton, Anthony Stacchi', 'Sam Harper', 'Martin Lawrence, Ashton Kutcher, Gary Sinise, Debra Messing, Billy Connolly, Georgia Engel, Jon Favreau, Jane Krakowski', 'PG', 'Boog, a domesticated 900lb. Grizzly bear finds himself stranded in the woods 3 days before Open Season. Forced to rely on Elliot, a fast-talking mule deer, the two form an unlikely friendship and must quickly rally other forest animals if they are to form a rag-tag army against the hunters.', 'Boog, a domesticated 900lb. Grizzly bear finds himself stranded in the woods 3 days before Open Season. Forced to rely on Elliot, a fast-talking mule deer, the two form an unlikely friendship and must quickly rally other forest animals if they are to form a rag-tag army against the hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5Lctmkc1yah215Luxmci4djaiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7484'),
  ('552914764501494119', 'Open Season', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Antonin Fourlon, Frédéric Forestier, Christian Abomnes', 'Antonin Fourlon', 'Hakim Jemili, Camille Lou, Didier Bourdon, Thierry Lhermitte, Jean-François Cayrey, Julien Pestel, Chantal Ladesou, Isabelle Candelier', null, 'Flanked by their two children, Simon and Adélaïde decide, like many Parisians today, to leave their two-room apartment for a quieter and more comfortable life in the country. They are seduced by a house in the middle of nature: space, a vegetable garden, a wood adjoining their garden and above all villagers who welcome them with open arms. A dream come true! But the young couple was soon to be disillusioned: the wood was actually a hunting ground for big game! Although the hunters are friendly, they are not willing to give up their territory, making Simon and Adélaïde''s dream of the countryside a living hell. But true to their reputation, our Parisians are not going to let them do it.', 'Flanked by their two children, Simon and Adélaïde decide, like many Parisians today, to leave their two-room apartment for a quieter and more comfortable life in the country. They are seduced by a house in the middle of nature: space, a vegetable garden, a wood adjoining their garden and above all villagers who welcome them with open arms. A dream come true! But the young couple was soon to be disillusioned: the wood was actually a hunting ground for big game! Although the hunters are friendly, they are not willing to give up their territory, making Simon and Adélaïde''s dream of the countryside a living hell. But true to their reputation, our Parisians are not going to let them do it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghr7MVNdznpYyxV661KmeSDEh9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001026'),
  ('1061959159899627950', 'Open Season 2', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Matthew O''Callaghan, Todd Wilderman', 'David I. Stern', 'Joel McHale, Mike Epps, Cody Cameron, Georgia Engel, Jane Krakowski, Billy Connolly, Crispin Glover, Maddie Taylor', 'PG', 'After falling head over hooves in love with Giselle, Elliot''s road to the altar takes a slight detour when Mr. Weenie is kidnapped by a group of pampered pets determined to return him to his owners.', 'After falling head over hooves in love with Giselle, Elliot''s road to the altar takes a slight detour when Mr. Weenie is kidnapped by a group of pampered pets determined to return him to his owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM4bahouPblYcfngZtnNSkaWxCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13690'),
  ('1008211948593499198', 'Open Season 2', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Forestier, Antonin Fourlon, Christian Abomnes', 'Antonin Fourlon', 'Didier Bourdon, Camille Lou, Hakim Jemili, Thierry Lhermitte, Julien Pestel, Jean-François Cayrey, Chantal Ladesou, André Penvern', null, 'Two years after moving to the French countryside and seeing hunting banned, Adelaide and Simon discover that living close to nature can be rewarding, peaceful... and unbelievably boring. Desperate to make new friends, they''re overjoyed when Bernard''s witty, wealthy son Stan and his smart, aristocratic wife Bennie move to town—with kids the same age as theirs. But what seems like a gift from heaven turns out to be a Trojan horse: Stan and Bennie are die-hard coursers, determined to hunt on horseback with their hounds wherever they please. Chaos ensues. The clash becomes a full-blown war as Stan buys up land, bribes the locals, and plans to turn the forest into a playground for the ultra-rich. With help from Bernard and his old hunting buddies, can Addie and Simon rally the villagers and spark a rural revolt to save their peaceful corner of the world?', 'Two years after moving to the French countryside and seeing hunting banned, Adelaide and Simon discover that living close to nature can be rewarding, peaceful... and unbelievably boring. Desperate to make new friends, they''re overjoyed when Bernard''s witty, wealthy son Stan and his smart, aristocratic wife Bennie move to town—with kids the same age as theirs. But what seems like a gift from heaven turns out to be a Trojan horse: Stan and Bennie are die-hard coursers, determined to hunt on horseback with their hounds wherever they please. Chaos ensues. The clash becomes a full-blown war as Stan buys up land, bribes the locals, and plans to turn the forest into a playground for the ultra-rich. With help from Bernard and his old hunting buddies, can Addie and Simon rally the villagers and spark a rural revolt to save their peaceful corner of the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjy5vFVr2FmkNVjHaeKROFgJxGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1437985'),
  ('113563615490120230', 'Open Season 3', 2010, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Cody Cameron', 'David I. Stern', 'Matthew J. Munn, Nika Futterman, Maddie Taylor, Karley Scott Collins, Ciara Bravo, Dana Snyder, Cody Cameron, Steve Schirripa', 'PG', 'Boog, Elliot, and their forest friends return with an all-new adventure, this time in a Big Top Circus! The comedy begins when Boog''s pals choose their family obligations over the annual guy''s trip, and a disappointed Boog decides to take a trip of his own, which leads him right into the middle of a circus ring...literally. When he switches places with a devious look-a-like circus grizzly and falls for an alluring Russian troupe member, he''ll come to realize that maybe you don''t have to choose between family and friendship after all.', 'Boog, Elliot, and their forest friends return with an all-new adventure, this time in a Big Top Circus! The comedy begins when Boog''s pals choose their family obligations over the annual guy''s trip, and a disappointed Boog decides to take a trip of his own, which leads him right into the middle of a circus ring...literally. When he switches places with a devious look-a-like circus grizzly and falls for an alluring Russian troupe member, he''ll come to realize that maybe you don''t have to choose between family and friendship after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEr9fkGLQUWcAnVfDV46L79bdFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51170'),
  ('1113184685121537244', 'Open Season: Scared Silly', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'David Feiss', 'Carlos Kotkin', 'William Townsend, Donny Lucas, Melissa Sturm, Garry Chalk, Kathleen Barr, Trevor Devall, Brian Drummond, Lee Tockar', 'PG', 'The humans and animals believe a werewolf is on the loose, and former hunter Shaw uses the opportunity to re-open the season. Boog, Elliot, and Mr. Weenie have to face their fears and find the werewolf to get the season closed permanently.', 'The humans and animals believe a werewolf is on the loose, and former hunter Shaw uses the opportunity to re-open the season. Boog, Elliot, and Mr. Weenie have to face their fears and find the werewolf to get the season closed permanently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFD3HdVIXVbvVixIGhNmJBaqyAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382517'),
  ('694607473082913822', 'Open the Wall', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Schwochow, Frank Lamm', 'Gerhard Haase-Hindenberg, Heide Schwochow, Rainer Schwochow', 'Charly Hübner, Milan Peschel, Ulrich Matthes, Rainer Bock, Max Hopp, Frederick Lau, Ludwig Trepte, Robert Gallinowski', null, 'A lighthearted look at the opening of the border crossing of Bornholmer Straße in Berlin from the point of view of the confused border guards.', 'A lighthearted look at the opening of the border crossing of Bornholmer Straße in Berlin from the point of view of the confused border guards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqncvbgBM0ybQc5MI8lcJ6V88bI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301633'),
  ('1006185117276561685', 'Open Water', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chris Kentis, Chris Kentis, Laura Lau', null, 'Blanchard Ryan, Daniel Travis, Saul Stein, Michael E. Williamson, Cristina Zenato, John Charles', 'R', 'Two divers are left out at sea without a boat. There’s nothing but water for miles, unless they look at what’s underneath them...', 'Two divers are left out at sea without a boat. There’s nothing but water for miles, unless they look at what’s underneath them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Gy5N0Yp7ocaKBR860v9KDbpYHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83'),
  ('103247087841812067', 'Open Water 2: Adrift', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Hans Horn, Bernhard Jasper, Hendrik Holler', 'Adam Kreutner, David Mitchell', 'Susan May Pratt, Eric Dane, Richard Speight Jr., Niklaus Lange, Ali Hillis, Cameron Richardson', 'R', 'A weekend cruise on a luxurious party yacht goes horribly wrong for a group of old high-school friends when they get stuck in the water many miles from shore and a happy reunion turns into a fight for survival.', 'A weekend cruise on a luxurious party yacht goes horribly wrong for a group of old high-school friends when they get stuck in the water many miles from shore and a happy reunion turns into a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bbQxUlPTBGYSWHMshG6K2MxtSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9592'),
  ('822344251031624039', 'Open Window', 2006, 'Drama', 'Mia Goldman, Denis Maloney', 'Mia Goldman', 'Robin Tunney, Joel Edgerton, Cybill Shepherd, Matt Keeslar, Scott Wilson, Shirley Knight, Elliott Gould, Michaela Conlin', 'R', 'The engagment between a struggling photographer and an assistant professor is marred by an act of violence.', 'The engagment between a struggling photographer and an assistant professor is marred by an act of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85iJq84ywwDHhrVmEPm7QOo9MGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21630'),
  ('426827559719857732', 'Open Windows', 2014, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Jon D. Domínguez', 'Nacho Vigalondo', 'Elijah Wood, Sasha Grey, Neil Maskell, Iván González, Jaime Olías, Adam Quintero, Daniel Pérez Prada, Jake Klamburg', 'R', 'Nick is excited to discover he''s won a dinner date with his favorite actress, Jill Goddard. But when Jill refuses to honor the contest, he receives an offer he can''t refuse: the ability to view Jill secretly via computer. Nick begins watching the unknowing star on her webcam, not realizing that this decision will put himself and Jill at risk as they enter a terrifying world of cat-and-mouse.', 'Nick is excited to discover he''s won a dinner date with his favorite actress, Jill Goddard. But when Jill refuses to honor the contest, he receives an offer he can''t refuse: the ability to view Jill secretly via computer. Nick begins watching the unknowing star on her webcam, not realizing that this decision will put himself and Jill at risk as they enter a terrifying world of cat-and-mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHA9jV7xKWjOvv2lYWxDwAmZjhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151368'),
  ('610302338323756267', 'Open Your Eyes', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Ignacio Gutiérrez-Solana, Hans Burmann', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Mateo Gil', 'Eduardo Noriega, Penélope Cruz, Chete Lera, Fele Martínez, Najwa Nimri, Gérard Barray, Jorge de Juan, Miguel Palenzuela', 'R', 'Handsome 25-year-old Cesar had it all -- a successful career, expensive cars, a swank bachelor''s pad, and an endless string of beautiful and willing women -- until he is thrown into a strange psychological mystery after a car accident scars his face and lands him in prison.', 'Handsome 25-year-old Cesar had it all -- a successful career, expensive cars, a swank bachelor''s pad, and an endless string of beautiful and willing women -- until he is thrown into a strange psychological mystery after a car accident scars his face and lands him in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6g4veF2EUZHEu6hrW8TfTTzjU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1902'),
  ('880674787231600145', 'Opening Day of Close-Up', 1996, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Nanni Moretti, Alessandro Pesci', null, 'Nanni Moretti, Fabia Bergamo, Paolo Di Virgilio, Paola Orfei, Fausto Polacco, Amleto Vitali, Hossain Sabzian, Mohsen Makhmalbaf', null, 'At his cinema in Rome, the Nuovo Sacher, Nanni Moretti anxiously oversees preparations for the premiere of the film Close-up, by Iranian director Abbas Kiarostami. Meanwhile Disney''s The Lion King is taking Italy by storm.', 'At his cinema in Rome, the Nuovo Sacher, Nanni Moretti anxiously oversees preparations for the premiere of the film Close-up, by Iranian director Abbas Kiarostami. Meanwhile Disney''s The Lion King is taking Italy by storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npp2gmmkXsRFA8OvWT57KxyFeuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105514'),
  ('421019787353856631', 'Opening Night', 1977, 'Drama', 'John Cassavetes, Al Ruban, Lisa Hallas-Gottlieb', 'John Cassavetes', 'Gena Rowlands, John Cassavetes, Ben Gazzara, Joan Blondell, Paul Stewart, Zohra Lampert, Laura Johnson, John Tuell', 'PG-13', 'Actress Myrtle Gordon is a functioning alcoholic who is a few days from the opening night of her latest play, concerning a woman distraught about aging. One night a car kills one of Myrtle''s fans who is chasing her limousine in an attempt to get the star''s attention. Myrtle internalizes the accident and goes on a spiritual quest, but fails to finds the answers she is after. As opening night inches closer and closer, fragile Myrtle must find a way to make the show go on.', 'Actress Myrtle Gordon is a functioning alcoholic who is a few days from the opening night of her latest play, concerning a woman distraught about aging. One night a car kills one of Myrtle''s fans who is chasing her limousine in an attempt to get the star''s attention. Myrtle internalizes the accident and goes on a spiritual quest, but fails to finds the answers she is after. As opening night inches closer and closer, fragile Myrtle must find a way to make the show go on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5i1331f4Q2sNHUp9X3BOwWPS2Gg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33665'),
