  ('753836696484128732', 'Operacja Samum', 1999, 'Action', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Paweł Edelman', 'Maciej Dutkiewicz, Robert Brutter', 'Marek Kondrat, Bogusław Linda, Olaf Lubaszenko, Anna Korcz, Radosław Pazura, Tuğrul Çetiner, Tadeusz Huk, Gustaw Holoubek', null, 'The war between Iraq and Kuwait is just about to begin. While all foreigners are leaving Iraq, Pawel, a young Polish engineer is captured by the Iraqi Secret Service. His father, a retired secret service operative goes to Iraq to attempt to rescue him not knowing that he is secretly being used as bait. Now, two Polish secret agents have been assigned by the CIA to attempt a rescue mission. The stakes are high, but are they high enough to risk the life of one of the best officers?', 'The war between Iraq and Kuwait is just about to begin. While all foreigners are leaving Iraq, Pawel, a young Polish engineer is captured by the Iraqi Secret Service. His father, a retired secret service operative goes to Iraq to attempt to rescue him not knowing that he is secretly being used as bait. Now, two Polish secret agents have been assigned by the CIA to attempt a rescue mission. The stakes are high, but are they high enough to risk the life of one of the best officers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPuJJhNCuJoRZyKEQJYjwqw6VUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126838'),
