  ('883403891198210044', 'Operation Avalanche', 2016, 'Thriller, Mystery, Comedy', 'Matt Johnson, Andrew Appelle, Jared Raab', 'Matt Johnson, Josh Boles', 'Matt Johnson, Owen Williams, Jared Raab, Josh Boles, Andrew Appelle, Ray James, Sharon Belle, Krista Madison', 'R', 'In 1967, four undercover CIA agents were sent to NASA posing as a documentary film crew. What they discovered led to one of the biggest conspiracies in American history.', 'In 1967, four undercover CIA agents were sent to NASA posing as a documentary film crew. What they discovered led to one of the biggest conspiracies in American history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ngw7s1fa0eJL19fJ6Jw0bTQg3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376453'),
  ('840584001480529336', 'Operation Bikini', 1963, 'Drama, War', 'Anthony Carras, Gilbert Warrenton', 'John Tomerlin', 'Tab Hunter, Frankie Avalon, Scott Brady, Jim Backus, Gary Crosby, Michael Dante, David Landfield, Jody McCrea', null, 'The film takes place aboard an American submarine in the Pacific during World War II. The sub''s commander is ordered to stop and pick up an underwater demolition team led by Lt. Hayes, whose mission is to locate and destroy a US submarine sunken in a lagoon off Bikini Atoll before the Japanese are able to raise it and capture the advanced radar system on board.', 'The film takes place aboard an American submarine in the Pacific during World War II. The sub''s commander is ordered to stop and pick up an underwater demolition team led by Lt. Hayes, whose mission is to locate and destroy a US submarine sunken in a lagoon off Bikini Atoll before the Japanese are able to raise it and capture the advanced radar system on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fM1wH6VgYjnGKvhebhlfgXbrou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142986'),
  ('1099692990915423270', 'Operation Black Ops', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jamaal Burden', 'Jamaal Burden', 'Tito Ortiz, Cristiane Justino, Kelsey Johnson, Mike Ferguson, Mike Markoff, Paul Bikbili, Alicia Gakima, Rafael Cansino', null, 'A group of mercenaries are hired to overthrow a Neo-Nazi stronghold nestled deep in the heart of Texas, only to discover they are protecting nuclear codes that could ignite World War III.', 'A group of mercenaries are hired to overthrow a Neo-Nazi stronghold nestled deep in the heart of Texas, only to discover they are protecting nuclear codes that could ignite World War III.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMgkjQM2fHirExilsTZWJTqL33G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145491'),
  ('237754542809432816', 'Operation Blood Hunt', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Louis Mandylor, Niccolo De La Fere, Turner Fair', 'Brandon Slagle', 'Quinton ''Rampage'' Jackson, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Louis Mandylor, Sonia Couling, Myles Clohessy, Gary Cairns, Ulf Pilblad, Peter Dobson', null, 'Prolific expert of the occult and whiskey, Reverend Conte, accompanies a ragtag group of military rejects to a remote South Pacific Island to investigate the disappearance of Marines units stationed there in 1944, said to be at the hands of the Japanese Imperial Army. Upon speaking with the island’s inhabitants, they soon discover the Marines had actually been massacred by a group of Lycanthropes, known to most as WEREWOLVES.', 'Prolific expert of the occult and whiskey, Reverend Conte, accompanies a ragtag group of military rejects to a remote South Pacific Island to investigate the disappearance of Marines units stationed there in 1944, said to be at the hands of the Japanese Imperial Army. Upon speaking with the island’s inhabitants, they soon discover the Marines had actually been massacred by a group of Lycanthropes, known to most as WEREWOLVES.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u36L4VEFTRIw11eK3xw8zjT0blT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084222'),
  ('214372818702170534', 'Operation Carwash: A Worldwide Corruption Scandal Made in Brazil', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Marcelo Antunez, Ricardo Karam, Ricardo Lima', 'Thomas Stavros, Gustavo Lipsztein', 'Antonio Calloni, Flávia Alessandra, Bruce Gomlevsky, Marcelo Serrado, Ary Fontoura, João Baldasserini, Rainer Cadete, Roberto Birindelli', null, '2013. During Operation Bidone, the Federal Police seized a truck loaded with palm heart, which contained 697 kg of cocaine. The investigation falls on the team assembled by Ivan Romano, based in Curitiba and composed by Beatriz, Júlio and Ítalo. The traffic connections lead them to the dower Alberto Youssef and later to the former Petrobras director Paulo Roberto Costa, who reveals an immense structure involving builders and the government, in order to divert public money. As the investigation progresses, the group led by Ivan is increasingly approaching some of the country''s most influential politicians.', '2013. During Operation Bidone, the Federal Police seized a truck loaded with palm heart, which contained 697 kg of cocaine. The investigation falls on the team assembled by Ivan Romano, based in Curitiba and composed by Beatriz, Júlio and Ítalo. The traffic connections lead them to the dower Alberto Youssef and later to the former Petrobras director Paulo Roberto Costa, who reveals an immense structure involving builders and the government, in order to divert public money. As the investigation progresses, the group led by Ivan is increasingly approaching some of the country''s most influential politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TRwF9lEuK0jqAcvvMmVEux8sH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457064'),
  ('1068127060191633968', 'Operation Christmas', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'David Weaver', null, 'Tricia Helfer, Marc Blucas, Lisa Durupt, Gabrielle Rose, Jill Teed, Dee Jay Jackson, Barclay Hope, Megan Charpentier', null, 'As her new romance blossoms, a single mother, Olivia, is dismayed when her boyfriend, Scott, a military sergeant, is deployed right before Christmas. Determined to not let it ruin the holidays for her and her children they decide to give back to the struggling military families on his base and, as their efforts go viral, they are rewarded in ways they never imagined.', 'As her new romance blossoms, a single mother, Olivia, is dismayed when her boyfriend, Scott, a military sergeant, is deployed right before Christmas. Determined to not let it ruin the holidays for her and her children they decide to give back to the struggling military families on his base and, as their efforts go viral, they are rewarded in ways they never imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttF3r6VOJwQKgHDtiYWAKlbd7Pm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421631'),
  ('776976667846872762', 'Operation Christmas Drop', 2020, 'Comedy, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Martin Wood, Michael C. Blundell', 'Brian Sawyer, Gregg Rossen', 'Kat Graham, Alexander Ludwig, Virginia Madsen, Janet Kidder, Jeffrey Joseph, Bethany Brown, Trezzo Mahoro, Rohan Campbell', null, 'While gathering evidence to support closing a tropical U.S. Air Force base, a congressional aide warms to its generous captain.', 'While gathering evidence to support closing a tropical U.S. Air Force base, a congressional aide warms to its generous captain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fUcKFDy58DhWYd5Y7Nu5DgpxaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738646'),
  ('922200204944440300', 'Operation Chromite', 2016, 'History, Drama, War, Action', 'Kim Deok-min, Park Jun-gyu, John H. Lee', 'Sean Dulake', 'Lee Jung-jae, Liam Neeson, Lee Beom-soo, Jin Se-yeon, Jung Jun-ho, Kim Seon-a, Yoshihiro Akiyama, Park Sung-woong', 'R', 'A squad of soldiers fight in the Korean War''s crucial Battle of Incheon.', 'A squad of soldiers fight in the Korean War''s crucial Battle of Incheon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9Md7hQTNjFUZF0LgpWpVCS1GcI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407887'),
  ('431118288766871583', 'Operation Cicero', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, History, War', 'Serdar Akar', 'Meriç Aydın, Gürkan Tanyas', 'Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Burcu Biricik, Ertan Saban, Murat Garipağaoğlu, Tamer Levent, Mehmet Ulay, Çiğdem Selişik Onat, Levent Ülgen', null, 'Ilyas Bazna works as a butler in the British Embassy in Turkey during WW2. After Bazna starts to work as a German spy he is going to experience a series of unexpected events.', 'Ilyas Bazna works as a butler in the British Embassy in Turkey during WW2. After Bazna starts to work as a German spy he is going to experience a series of unexpected events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRKL8tCx6pUyE8ae04eWyTa2c5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577114'),
  ('1143485157979037332', 'Operation Cobra', 1997, 'Action', 'Gary Graver, Fred Olen Ray', 'Sean O''Bannon', 'Don Wilson, Evan Lurie, Deepti Bhatnagar, Rick Hill, Tane McClure, Michael Cavanaugh, R. Madhavan, Jillian Kesner', null, 'When Interpol officer Kyle Connors, Don "The Dragon" Wilson, watches his partner die in an explosion, he swears he''ll hunt down the killer. Yanked of the case by Internal Affairs, Connors defied his orders and follows the only lead he has... to India. Now, he is in a strange land where nothing is what it seems. Who can he trust? A beautiful counter-operative? An earnest young cop? A reclusive arms dealer? In a country where assassins come cheap, Connors finds himself in a cobra''s nest of danger and betrayal.', 'When Interpol officer Kyle Connors, Don "The Dragon" Wilson, watches his partner die in an explosion, he swears he''ll hunt down the killer. Yanked of the case by Internal Affairs, Connors defied his orders and follows the only lead he has... to India. Now, he is in a strange land where nothing is what it seems. Who can he trust? A beautiful counter-operative? An earnest young cop? A reclusive arms dealer? In a country where assassins come cheap, Connors finds himself in a cobra''s nest of danger and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8naNIEGCOxwL8IYwyjJAIQtPHje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213103'),
  ('331354149059169920', 'Operation Concrete', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Adrién Porchet', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'Godard returned to Paris briefly before getting a job as a construction worker on a dam project in Switzerland. With the money from the job, he made a short film about the building of the dam called Opération béton (Operation Concrete).', 'Godard returned to Paris briefly before getting a job as a construction worker on a dam project in Switzerland. With the money from the job, he made a short film about the building of the dam called Opération béton (Operation Concrete).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4F7oqyXUU25uxVzdq4NuC3NL1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104975'),
  ('32467644903635506', 'Operation Condor', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Jackie Chan, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Chiu Lo-Kong', 'Jackie Chan, Edward Tang, Fibe Ma Mei-Ping', 'Jackie Chan, Carol Cheng, Eva Cobo, Shôko Ikeda, Vincent Lyn, Jonathan Isgar, Dan Mintz, Božidar Smiljanić', 'PG-13', 'Hired by a Spanish baron, Hong Kong treasure hunter Jackie, a.k.a. "Asian Hawk" and his entourage seek WWII Nazi gold buried in the Sahara Desert.', 'Hired by a Spanish baron, Hong Kong treasure hunter Jackie, a.k.a. "Asian Hawk" and his entourage seek WWII Nazi gold buried in the Sahara Desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25kyDgsGz1HzW4SqJTylhBaU5sW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10975'),
  ('1034076329038307388', 'Operation Crossbow', 1965, 'Drama, War, Thriller', 'Michael Anderson, Erwin Hillier, Basil Rayburn', 'Emeric Pressburger, Derry Quinn, Ray Rigby', 'Sophia Loren, George Peppard, Trevor Howard, John Mills, Richard Johnson, Tom Courtenay, Jeremy Kemp, Anthony Quayle', 'PG-13', 'Allied agents infiltrate the Nazi rocket complex at Peenemunde in order to obtain their secrets and sabotage the plant. The film alternates between German developments of the V-1 missile and V-2 rocket (with a German cast speaking their own language) and discovery by British Intelligence of the weapon.', 'Allied agents infiltrate the Nazi rocket complex at Peenemunde in order to obtain their secrets and sabotage the plant. The film alternates between German developments of the V-1 missile and V-2 rocket (with a German cast speaking their own language) and discovery by British Intelligence of the weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Zxj0YdYf7t7gC63JBDencVKIoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36583'),
  ('775444679641984157', 'Operation Delta Force', 1997, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sam Firstenberg', 'David Sparling', 'Ernie Hudson, Jeff Fahey, Rob Stewart, Frank Zagarino, Hal Holbrook, Joe Lara, Natasha Sutherland, Todd Jensen', null, 'A team of military experts and scientists go after a terrorist group that has seized a deadly virus and is threatening to release it.', 'A team of military experts and scientists go after a terrorist group that has seized a deadly virus and is threatening to release it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UnlTxqaPy8oa7SPC55e2KcQ8u8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66661'),
  ('795721711858254558', 'Operation Delta Force 2: Mayday', 1998, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Yossi Wein', 'Danny Lerner', 'Michael McGrady, John Simon Jones, Robert Patteri, Todd Jensen, Spencer Rochfort, Gavin Hood, J. Kenneth Campbell, Dale Dye', null, 'A ship captained by the father of the leader of Delta Force is taken hostage by terrorists. As might be expected the force is sent in to stop them.', 'A ship captained by the father of the leader of Delta Force is taken hostage by terrorists. As might be expected the force is sent in to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqMIk6mRrCeqE1YqiDYczMedi97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63264'),
  ('73519685350444972', 'Operation Delta Force 3: Clear Target', 1998, 'Action', 'Mark Roper', 'Danny Lerner, David Sparling', 'Bryan Genesse, Greg Collins, Jim Fitzpatrick, John Simon Jones, Gavin Hood, Danny Keogh, Darcy LaPier', 'R', 'The anti-terrorist team Delta Force destroys a billion dollar cocaine stash, to the extreme displeasure of drug cartel leader Umberto Salvatore. To retaliate, he hijacks a stealth submarine and threatens to unleash a biological weapon with the power to kill everyone in New York City.', 'The anti-terrorist team Delta Force destroys a billion dollar cocaine stash, to the extreme displeasure of drug cartel leader Umberto Salvatore. To retaliate, he hijacks a stealth submarine and threatens to unleash a biological weapon with the power to kill everyone in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVDYTfTr0pHqkCrXoIo1e8NsIkx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101180'),
  ('1037361821439363065', 'Operation Delta Force 4: Deep Fault', 1999, 'Action', 'Mark Roper, Adolfo Bartoli', 'David Sparling', 'Greg Collins, Justin Williams, Johnny Messner, Gary Hudson, Hayley DuMond, Joe Lara, John Laughlin, Burnell Tucker', null, 'When a group of seismologists are taken prison, the forces that be know that there is only one team of rescuers to turn to--the highly elite Delta Force. Upon beginning this difficult mission to track down and save the hostages, the men on the Force are met with several surprises--surprises that lead them to think this may be one mission they cannot get out of.', 'When a group of seismologists are taken prison, the forces that be know that there is only one team of rescuers to turn to--the highly elite Delta Force. Upon beginning this difficult mission to track down and save the hostages, the men on the Force are met with several surprises--surprises that lead them to think this may be one mission they cannot get out of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozDBq1ukqtqKTZOtnLjGxEjIiqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116213'),
  ('1121542966327386360', 'Operation Dumbo Drop', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Simon Wincer, Russell Boyd, Robert Donaldson', 'Gene Quintano, Jim Kouf', 'Danny Glover, Ray Liotta, Denis Leary, Doug E. Doug, Corin Nemec, Dinh Thien Le, Tchéky Karyo, Hoang Ly', 'PG', 'Five Green Berets stationed in Vietnam in 1968 grudgingly undertake the mission of a lifetime -- to secretly transport an 8,000-pound elephant through 200 miles of rough jungle terrain. High jinks prevail when Capt. Sam Cahill promises the Montagnard villagers of Dak Nhe that he''ll replace their prized elephant in time for an important ritual. But for Capt. T.C. Doyle, the mission becomes a jumbo-sized headache!', 'Five Green Berets stationed in Vietnam in 1968 grudgingly undertake the mission of a lifetime -- to secretly transport an 8,000-pound elephant through 200 miles of rough jungle terrain. High jinks prevail when Capt. Sam Cahill promises the Montagnard villagers of Dak Nhe that he''ll replace their prized elephant in time for an important ritual. But for Capt. T.C. Doyle, the mission becomes a jumbo-sized headache!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIJlpbMCKg9O1C7gaiyDFaUWf9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27281'),
  ('515357945350692405', 'Operation Dunkirk', 2017, 'War, Action', 'Nick Lyon, Ross Headley', 'Geoff Meed, Stephen Meier', 'Ifan Meredith, Kimberley Hews, Michael Wouters, Kyle Hotz, Tyler Cole, Conner P. Kelley, Darren Hill, Brian M. Alvey', null, 'A band of soldiers tasked with staying behind during the Battle of Dunkirk to rescue a scientist with information that could turn the tide of the war must battle their way through dangerous Nazi territory to complete their mission.', 'A band of soldiers tasked with staying behind during the Battle of Dunkirk to rescue a scientist with information that could turn the tide of the war must battle their way through dangerous Nazi territory to complete their mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1v8ve0MkTQh1K44ndLqlmK096Q6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464867'),
  ('401772134622002285', 'Operation Finale', 2018, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Chris Weitz, Javier Aguirresarobe, Ricardo Méndez Matta', 'Matthew Orton', 'Oscar Isaac, Ben Kingsley, Mélanie Laurent, Peter Strauss, Nick Kroll, Lior Raz, Michael Aronov, Ohad Knoller', 'PG-13', 'In 1960, a team of Israeli secret agents is deployed to find Adolf Eichmann, the infamous Nazi architect of the Holocaust, supposedly hidden in Argentina, and get him to Israel to be judged.', 'In 1960, a team of Israeli secret agents is deployed to find Adolf Eichmann, the infamous Nazi architect of the Holocaust, supposedly hidden in Argentina, and get him to Israel to be judged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oj60k0DMZrCN6Taad4XOjFivyrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493551'),
  ('1111389306501546436', 'Operation Fortune: Ruse de Guerre', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Deniz Göktürk Kobanbay, Alan Stewart, Batuhan Özbulut', 'Guy Ritchie, Ivan Atkinson, Marn Davies', 'Jason Statham, Aubrey Plaza, Cary Elwes, Hugh Grant, Josh Hartnett, Bugzy Malone, Eddie Marsan, Peter Ferdinando', 'R', 'Special agent Orson Fortune and his team of operatives recruit one of Hollywood''s biggest movie stars to help them on an undercover mission when the sale of a deadly new weapons technology threatens to disrupt the world order.', 'Special agent Orson Fortune and his team of operatives recruit one of Hollywood''s biggest movie stars to help them on an undercover mission when the sale of a deadly new weapons technology threatens to disrupt the world order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uo7vWfQUlVwueYTDRicXOJa8Oow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739405'),
  ('504070823839316646', 'Operation Ganymed', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Rainer Erler', 'Rainer Erler', 'Horst Frank, Dieter Laser, Jürgen Prochnow, Uwe Friedrichsen, Claus Theo Gärtner', null, 'A spaceship returns to Earth after several years of space exploration and finds it desolate. Landing in what they believe is Mexico, the crew decides to travel north, and try to find out what happened to Earth during the years they were gone.', 'A spaceship returns to Earth after several years of space exploration and finds it desolate. Landing in what they believe is Mexico, the crew decides to travel north, and try to find out what happened to Earth during the years they were gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW9skCsnvRlHiEw0BUyFgBSjpoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64627'),
  ('121501753075691660', 'Operation Golden Shell', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Cuadri', 'Patxo Tellería', 'Bárbara Mori, Karra Elejalde, Unax Ugalde, Bárbara Goenaga, Jordi Mollà, Mara Escalante, Ramon Agirre, Eneko Arcas', null, 'A con artist owner of a bankrupt film company tries to lure in an investor by hiring a movie star''s look-alike and passing him off as the real deal.', 'A con artist owner of a bankrupt film company tries to lure in an investor by hiring a movie star''s look-alike and passing him off as the real deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kZFKJKWUzu9BfjMUiM5mCIprLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443993'),
  ('999305893515024735', 'Operation Grandma', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Dror Shaul', 'Dror Shaul', 'Rami Heuberger, Ami Smolartchik, Tzach Shpitzen, Einat Weitzman, Danielle Miller', null, 'Mivtza Savta ("Operation Grandma") is a satirical Israeli comedy about three very different brothers trying to get around many obstacles to bury their grandmother on her kibbutz. The story takes place in Israel, in the fictional kibbutz "Asisim".', 'Mivtza Savta ("Operation Grandma") is a satirical Israeli comedy about three very different brothers trying to get around many obstacles to bury their grandmother on her kibbutz. The story takes place in Israel, in the fictional kibbutz "Asisim".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5w3O97oBfoXMcioVDMYOspSOtza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20619'),
  ('60794251425449459', 'Operation Hadal', 2025, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Yaqing Zhi', 'Huang Xuan, Yu Shi, Du Jiang, Jiang Luxia, Wang Yanlin, Elvis Han, Li Jiuxiao, Duan Yihong', 'NR', 'Mercenaries have occupied an offshore platform in Chinese territorial waters by force. The Chinese Navy sets sail to repel the invaders as the Jiao Long commando team prepares for a fierce fight in the deep sea.', 'Mercenaries have occupied an offshore platform in Chinese territorial waters by force. The Chinese Navy sets sail to repel the invaders as the Jiao Long commando team prepares for a fierce fight in the deep sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joALXjCQCKTSDREQEJxn83U4ORK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280330'),
  ('1100853734936723337', 'Operation Holidays', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Claudio Fragasso', 'Gino Capone, Rossella Drudi, Jerry Calà', 'Jerry Calà, Enzo Salvi, Maurizio Mattioli, Massimo Ceccherini, Valeria Marini, Francesco Pannofino, Veronica Ciardi, Rocco Ciarmoli', null, 'Bebo Conforti, a well-known piano bar singer, is forced to flee in the middle of the performance, to avoid a handful of criminals who want to capture him, on the orders of the "ferocious" local boss, Fefè Lucanica. Monica, Fefè''s young and only daughter, has just told him that she is expecting a child with him. Luckily for our chansonnier, Fefè''s henchmen are anything but smart, the Boss despairs by denigrating them, but he is too fond of them to get rid of them. From this manhunt, an unusual "On de road" escape is unleashed, full of misunderstandings, false leads and double truths.', 'Bebo Conforti, a well-known piano bar singer, is forced to flee in the middle of the performance, to avoid a handful of criminals who want to capture him, on the orders of the "ferocious" local boss, Fefè Lucanica. Monica, Fefè''s young and only daughter, has just told him that she is expecting a child with him. Luckily for our chansonnier, Fefè''s henchmen are anything but smart, the Boss despairs by denigrating them, but he is too fond of them to get rid of them. From this manhunt, an unusual "On de road" escape is unleashed, full of misunderstandings, false leads and double truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msctPEG4Kf5KKUxmtUb7VIdIfvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130551'),
  ('348447546936265694', 'Operation Hope - The Children Lost in the Amazon', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Tom Cross', 'Emma Read', null, null, 'The incredible true story of four children, who survive a plane crash deep in the dangerous Colombian Amazon. They are lost and alone for 40 days while the military and indigenous guard race against time to find them.', 'The incredible true story of four children, who survive a plane crash deep in the dangerous Colombian Amazon. They are lost and alone for 40 days while the military and indigenous guard race against time to find them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yynTmGfs01ZX1BurRzygVFkyrLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280368'),
  ('294091279219728103', 'Operation Hyacinth', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Piotr Domalewski, Piotr Sobociński Jr., Lena Jaworska', 'Marcin Ciastoń', 'Tomasz Ziętek, Hubert Miłkowski, Adrianna Chlebicka, Tomasz Schuchardt, Marek Kalita, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Sebastian Stankiewicz, Piotr Trojan', null, 'Not satisfied with the result of a murder investigation in Warsaw''s gay community, an officer in 1980s communist Poland resolves to uncover the truth.', 'Not satisfied with the result of a murder investigation in Warsaw''s gay community, an officer in 1980s communist Poland resolves to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUX2fGa7OV85c6rtjOC351RVeyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809970'),
  ('916399188454611291', 'Operation Java', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Tharun Moorthy, Sudhi Maddison, Faiz Siddik', 'Tharun Moorthy', 'Balu Varghese, Lukman Avaran, Binu Pappu, Irshad, Shine Tom Chacko, Prasanth Alexander, Mamitha Baiju, Vinitha Koshy', null, 'B. Tech graduates Antony and Vinay Dasan are talented, but unemployed. That changes, however, when they approach the cyber cell with a new perspective to a film piracy case.', 'B. Tech graduates Antony and Vinay Dasan are talented, but unemployed. That changes, however, when they approach the cyber cell with a new perspective to a film piracy case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ku1gEhoJgFV2vWe2hBENqSKmLna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792750'),
  ('120699109707933789', 'Operation Just Cause', 2019, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Luis Franco Brantley, Luis Pacheco, Alvis Gonzalez', 'Biviana Márquez, Carlos Carrasco, Manuel Rodríguez', 'Patricia De Leon, Arian Abadi, Aída Morales, Anthony Anel, Aaron Zebede, Miguel Ángel Oyola, Robin Durán, Leo Wiznitzer', null, 'The stories of a Panamanian officer who feels betrayed by his superiors, of a young man from the neighborhood trying to prevent his friends from going out to fight, of a fisherman going through a thousand adventures trying to bury his compadre, of an imprisoned American businessman for conspiring as a CIA agent against the dictatorship and an alcoholic prostitute who cannot escape her past ... all in the middle of the Christmas preparations, just as the US invasion of Panama begins.', 'The stories of a Panamanian officer who feels betrayed by his superiors, of a young man from the neighborhood trying to prevent his friends from going out to fight, of a fisherman going through a thousand adventures trying to bury his compadre, of an imprisoned American businessman for conspiring as a CIA agent against the dictatorship and an alcoholic prostitute who cannot escape her past ... all in the middle of the Christmas preparations, just as the US invasion of Panama begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGylKfbeRqQWc6dwXCssId8kWgf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755378'),
  ('603964253515780613', 'Operation Kid Brother', 1967, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alberto De Martino', 'Stefano Canzio', 'Neil Connery, Daniela Bianchi, Adolfo Celi, Agata Flori, Bernard Lee, Anthony Dawson, Lois Maxwell, Yee-Wah Yang', 'NR', 'The evil crime syndicate Thanatos is bent on taking over the world, using a magnetic wave generator that will cause all metal-based machinery to grind to a halt. However, the well-known British secret agent normally assigned to such tasks isn''t available, so they engage his civilian brother, Neil, to help. Neil, played by Neil Connery, is a world-class plastic surgeon, hypnotist, and lip-reader, which turn out to be precisely the skills required for thwarting Thanatos.', 'The evil crime syndicate Thanatos is bent on taking over the world, using a magnetic wave generator that will cause all metal-based machinery to grind to a halt. However, the well-known British secret agent normally assigned to such tasks isn''t available, so they engage his civilian brother, Neil, to help. Neil, played by Neil Connery, is a world-class plastic surgeon, hypnotist, and lip-reader, which turn out to be precisely the skills required for thwarting Thanatos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcLDzxLlhSEl3a7F11Wdnm0GlMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98085'),
  ('494533599355896975', 'Operation Lady Marlene', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Robert Lamoureux, Marcel Grignon, Jacques Météhen', 'Robert Lamoureux', 'Robert Lamoureux, Michel Serrault, Bernard Ménez, Pierre Tornade, Sybil Danning, Eddi Arent, Eva Astor, Pascale Rivault', null, 'Robert Lamoureux plays a General in the Resistance. With an unlikely team of French patriots, he easily outwits the buffoonish Germans and steals the master copy of their plans to invade England. By doing so, he prevents the invasion and makes it more likely that the Allies will win the war.', 'Robert Lamoureux plays a General in the Resistance. With an unlikely team of French patriots, he easily outwits the buffoonish Germans and steals the master copy of their plans to invade England. By doing so, he prevents the invasion and makes it more likely that the Allies will win the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piBjddAIs3ZuxeNj7x4jjxygtRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117880'),
  ('718353311540129681', 'Operation Leopard', 1980, 'War', 'Raoul Coutard, Georges Liron', 'André G. Brunelin', 'Bruno Cremer, Mimsy Farmer, Jacques Perrin, Giuliano Gemma, Laurent Malet, Pierre Vaneck, Jean-Claude Bouillon, Gérard Essomba', null, 'In May 1978, the mining town of Kolwezi in Katanga, Zaire (now Democratic Republic of Congo, the former Belgian Congo) is under attack from a group of communist guerillas coming from nearby Angola. The Europeans who work for the Belgian mining company and the Blacks who live in the town are taken as hostages by the invaders, who start a blood bath, shooting Europeans as well as Africans. Many of the Europeans being French, the French decide to organize a counter-attack, and to send a Regiment of Paratroopers from the Foreign Legion. The movie follows the stories of Delbart, a former non-commissioned officer, who was about to go back to France with his African wife and his child, Damrémont, who was Delbart''s replacement, Bia, a Zairian doctor, and Annie, an American married to a Belgian engineer as well as Non com Legion officer Federico and the French Ambassador and the Military Attaché.', 'In May 1978, the mining town of Kolwezi in Katanga, Zaire (now Democratic Republic of Congo, the former Belgian Congo) is under attack from a group of communist guerillas coming from nearby Angola. The Europeans who work for the Belgian mining company and the Blacks who live in the town are taken as hostages by the invaders, who start a blood bath, shooting Europeans as well as Africans. Many of the Europeans being French, the French decide to organize a counter-attack, and to send a Regiment of Paratroopers from the Foreign Legion. The movie follows the stories of Delbart, a former non-commissioned officer, who was about to go back to France with his African wife and his child, Damrémont, who was Delbart''s replacement, Bia, a Zairian doctor, and Annie, an American married to a Belgian engineer as well as Non com Legion officer Federico and the French Ambassador and the Military Attaché.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75BY7cj2TQDYRSLms3OS2ZuK9zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96492'),
  ('800565497970270149', 'Operation Mad Ball', 1957, 'Comedy, War', 'Richard Quine, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Arthur Carter, Jed Harris', 'Jack Lemmon, Ernie Kovacs, Kathryn Grant, Arthur O''Connell, Mickey Rooney, Dick York, James Darren, Roger Smith', 'G', 'In this wacky military spoof, Lemmon plays a terminally bored Army private waging a war of wits as he tries to throw a party under the nose of his obnoxious commanding officer.', 'In this wacky military spoof, Lemmon plays a terminally bored Army private waging a war of wits as he tries to throw a party under the nose of his obnoxious commanding officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZKL7oB3NVY94YWN9F3gk55VIH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60387'),
  ('813897428850034670', 'Operation Mekong', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, War', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin', 'Chu Kang-Ki, Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Lau Siu-Kwan', 'Zhang Hanyu, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Joyce Feng, Wu Xudong, Zhan Liguo, Liu Xianda, Sun Chun, Zhao Jian', 'R', 'The Chinese government launches a daring operation to arrest a violent drug cartel following the discovery of thirteen Chinese crew members'' bodies on two ships sailing through the Mekong River.', 'The Chinese government launches a daring operation to arrest a violent drug cartel following the discovery of thirteen Chinese crew members'' bodies on two ships sailing through the Mekong River.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wghFabaZgRorsMQWuPtKUlzq4W1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415214'),
  ('19688498572445918', 'Operation Merry Christmas: The Elf Con', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alonso Iñiguez, Carlos Hidalgo', 'Mauricio Argüelles, César Rodríguez', 'Diana Bovio, Ricardo Polanco, Paco Rueda, Hernán Mendoza, Mariana Gajá, César Rodríguez, Christian Ramos, Karina Gidi', null, 'The plan of three small-time pickpockets to pull the heist of their lives during Christmas, posing as elves in a Christmas show in one of the most exclusive shopping centers in the city where they will collect private information from some wealthy families, then rob their homes while they enjoy their December vacation.', 'The plan of three small-time pickpockets to pull the heist of their lives during Christmas, posing as elves in a Christmas show in one of the most exclusive shopping centers in the city where they will collect private information from some wealthy families, then rob their homes while they enjoy their December vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/is2wNqEH4CBw5JsrWzpDG1boQBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914241'),
  ('968499973785857278', 'Operation Mincemeat', 2022, 'War, History, Drama', 'Sebastian Blenkov, John Madden', 'Michelle Ashford', 'Colin Firth, Matthew Macfadyen, Kelly Macdonald, Penelope Wilton, Johnny Flynn, Jason Isaacs, Mark Gatiss, Hattie Morahan', 'PG-13', 'In 1943, two British intelligence officers concoct Operation Mincemeat, wherein their plan to drop a corpse with false papers off the coast of Spain would fool Nazi spies into believing the Allied forces were planning to attack by way of Greece rather than Sicily.', 'In 1943, two British intelligence officers concoct Operation Mincemeat, wherein their plan to drop a corpse with false papers off the coast of Spain would fool Nazi spies into believing the Allied forces were planning to attack by way of Greece rather than Sicily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfdfh1mK24VujxT5z11732asxdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661231'),
  ('193230146075261876', 'Operation Napoleon', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Óskar Thór Axelsson, Árni Filippusson', 'Marteinn Þórsson', 'Vivian Ólafsdóttir, Jack Fox, Iain Glen, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Atli Óskar Fjalarsson, Þröstur Leó Gunnarsson, Nanna Kristín Magnúsdóttir', null, 'A modern-day lawyer is sucked into an international conspiracy after being accused of a murder she didn''t commit. Her only chance of freedom lies in uncovering the secret of an old German WWII aeroplane, long buried deep beneath the ice, before the CIA.', 'A modern-day lawyer is sucked into an international conspiracy after being accused of a murder she didn''t commit. Her only chance of freedom lies in uncovering the secret of an old German WWII aeroplane, long buried deep beneath the ice, before the CIA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5VLVINzfiltL1fqNLt8oMTWnr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002338'),
  ('260803825754382126', 'Operation Nation', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Piotr Śliskowski, Piotr Kumik', 'Łukasz Sychowicz, Jakub Rużyłło', 'Maciej Musiałowski, Magdalena Maścianica, Borys Szyc, Antoni Królikowski, Cezary Pazura, Piotr Cyrwus, Karol Kadłubiec, Mateusz Król', null, 'A member of a nationalist group in Warsaw begins a forbidden romance with a passionate, left-wing activist, leading to a series of surprising events.', 'A member of a nationalist group in Warsaw begins a forbidden romance with a passionate, left-wing activist, leading to a series of surprising events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyJNumu9bpLCXWcutryAvkVlGhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011367'),
  ('521243985152410273', 'Operation Odessa', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Tiller Russell, Kenny Stoff', null, 'Ludwig Fainberg, Nelson Tony Yester, Kristy Galeota, Tony Galeota, Brent Eaton, Mike McShane, Dick Gregorie', null, 'The stranger-than-fiction true story of a Russian mobster, a Miami playboy, and a Cuban spy who teamed up in the early ''90s to sell a Soviet submarine to the Cali Cartel.', 'The stranger-than-fiction true story of a Russian mobster, a Miami playboy, and a Cuban spy who teamed up in the early ''90s to sell a Soviet submarine to the Cali Cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvCbbNy5NOTQGfDNFwGyh7NtnJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502164'),
  ('458825171132502152', 'Operation Ogre', 1979, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Gillo Pontecorvo, Josetxo San Mateo, Jesús García Gárgoles', 'Ugo Pirro, Giorgio Arlorio, Gillo Pontecorvo', 'Gian Maria Volonté, José Sacristán, Ángela Molina, Eusebio Poncela, Saverio Marconi, Georges Staquet, Nicole Garcia, Féodor Atkine', null, 'Spain, 1973. Dictator Francisco Franco has ruled the country since 1939 with an iron fist; but he is now a very old and sick man. The future of the weakened regime is in danger. Admiral Carrero Blanco is his natural successor. The Basque terrorist gang ETA decides that he must die to prevent the dictatorship from continuing.', 'Spain, 1973. Dictator Francisco Franco has ruled the country since 1939 with an iron fist; but he is now a very old and sick man. The future of the weakened regime is in danger. Admiral Carrero Blanco is his natural successor. The Basque terrorist gang ETA decides that he must die to prevent the dictatorship from continuing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqxC1i7nnCPZM9icd2WeMV0Bpgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64834'),
  ('669260929371665689', 'Operation Overlord', 2021, 'War', 'Brett Bentman', 'Brett Bentman', 'Thom Hallum, Billy Blair, Stacey A. Sheffield, Tom Zembrod, Robert Keith, Tiffany McDonald, Woody Wilson Hall, Birgit Schroeder', null, 'A week before storming the beaches of Normandy, two US Soldiers infiltrate an abandoned complex to rescue a prisoner of war from the clutches of the Nazi regime.', 'A week before storming the beaches of Normandy, two US Soldiers infiltrate an abandoned complex to rescue a prisoner of war from the clutches of the Nazi regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nOL8FuiWdSuQo6uGJaKFfFBTZ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946552'),
  ('915603830802763677', 'Operation Pacific', 1951, 'War, Drama, Action', 'George Waggner, Bert Glennon, Russell Saunders', 'George Waggner', 'John Wayne, Patricia Neal, Ward Bond, Scott Forbes, Philip Carey, Paul Picerni, William Campbell, Kathryn Givney', 'NR', 'During WWII, Duke E. Gifford is second in command of the USS Thunderfish, a submarine which is firing off torpedoes that either explode too early or never explode at all. It''s a dilemma that he''ll eventually take up personally. Even more personal is his quest to win back his ex-wife, a nurse; but he''ll have to win her back from a navy flier who also happens to be his commander''s little brother.', 'During WWII, Duke E. Gifford is second in command of the USS Thunderfish, a submarine which is firing off torpedoes that either explode too early or never explode at all. It''s a dilemma that he''ll eventually take up personally. Even more personal is his quest to win back his ex-wife, a nurse; but he''ll have to win her back from a navy flier who also happens to be his commander''s little brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w76x8HiPPzpnHiaZI7j7rRIk08I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40683'),
  ('928168958708553832', 'Operation Padma', 2026, 'Action', 'Karthikeya V', 'Karthikeya V', 'Naresh Medi, Kannayagari Rajitha Sandy, Ranadheer Beesu, Raghupathi Reddy Gunda', null, 'Intelligence officer Veda discovers a plot against former minister Nandi Kishore. She leads Operation Padma with strategist Madhura and elite agents to stop skilled operative Kuldeep through surveillance and tactics in a race against time.', 'Intelligence officer Veda discovers a plot against former minister Nandi Kishore. She leads Operation Padma with strategist Madhura and elite agents to stop skilled operative Kuldeep through surveillance and tactics in a race against time.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:operation-padma'),
  ('467972776313409702', 'Operation Petticoat', 1959, 'Comedy, War, Romance', 'Russell Harlan, Blake Edwards, Frank Shaw', 'Maurice Richlin, Stanley Shapiro', 'Cary Grant, Tony Curtis, Joan O''Brien, Dina Merrill, Gene Evans, Dick Sargent, Virginia Gregg, Robert F. Simon', 'PG', 'A World War II submarine commander finds himself stuck with a damaged sub, a con-man executive officer, and a group of army nurses.', 'A World War II submarine commander finds himself stuck with a damaged sub, a con-man executive officer, and a group of army nurses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIsm8JvpFZidVxKexv5UgoCjwpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9660'),
  ('524242310707307032', 'Operation Portugal', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Roch Gouédard, Matthieu-David Cournot, Frank Cimière', 'Frank Cimière, Jérôme L''hotsky, D''Jal', 'D''Jal, Léticia Belliccini, Serge Da Silva, Sarah Perles, Pierre Azéma, Farida Ouchani, Carmen Santos, Eric da Costa', null, 'Hakim, 35, a friendly neighborhood cop, must infiltrate the Portuguese community for the purpose of an investigation. But can one become Portuguese in three days? Especially when we know that Hakim is a walking disaster at undercover operations. His clumsiness and bad luck turn his many infiltrations into cataclysms. The case is clearly too big for him. Quickly trapped between his feelings and his mission, Hakim, who lives alone with his mother, will discover a community, but also a family.', 'Hakim, 35, a friendly neighborhood cop, must infiltrate the Portuguese community for the purpose of an investigation. But can one become Portuguese in three days? Especially when we know that Hakim is a walking disaster at undercover operations. His clumsiness and bad luck turn his many infiltrations into cataclysms. The case is clearly too big for him. Quickly trapped between his feelings and his mission, Hakim, who lives alone with his mother, will discover a community, but also a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzTNmjQuF6yFIFVhfp9n3z1Ebm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642684'),
  ('171463125210430821', 'Opération Portugal 2 : La Vie de château', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Lucas Leconte, Frank Cimière', 'Frank Cimière, D''Jal', 'D''Jal, Sarah Perles, Farida Ouchani, Pierre Azéma, Bruno Sanches, Grégoire Bonnet, Aurélie Boquien, Serge Da Silva', null, 'Hakim has to foil the plans of a shady developer : the count of Neuville. Helped by his friends, he seeps into the count''s castle, but he also has to prepare his wedding with Julia.', 'Hakim has to foil the plans of a shady developer : the count of Neuville. Helped by his friends, he seeps into the count''s castle, but he also has to prepare his wedding with Julia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bYMLEFfQfGyX8tXx7X6ebMOhlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155840'),
  ('552315872340996220', 'Operation Red Sea', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, War, Adventure', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Horace Wong Wing-Hang', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin', 'Zhang Yi, Johnny Huang, Hai Qing, Du Jiang, Zhang Hanyu, Jiang Luxia, Wang Yutian, Yin Fang', 'R', 'A squad of the Jiaolong Commando Unit - Sea Dragon, a spec ops team of the Chinese Navy, carries out a hostage rescue operation in the nation of Yewaire, on the Arabian Peninsula, and fiercely fights against local rebel groups and Zaka, a terrorist organization.', 'A squad of the Jiaolong Commando Unit - Sea Dragon, a spec ops team of the Chinese Navy, carries out a hostage rescue operation in the nation of Yewaire, on the Arabian Peninsula, and fiercely fights against local rebel groups and Zaka, a terrorist organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ctXBO0o5fKQvGdSJsPc8TAYCvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460555'),
  ('868384359711715077', 'Operation San Pietro', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lucio Fulci, Francesco Massaro, Erico Menczer', 'Adriano Baracco, Ennio De Concini, Lucio Fulci', 'Lando Buzzanca, Jean-Claude Brialy, Heinz Rühmann, Christine Barclay, Edward G. Robinson, Uta Levka, Antonella Della Porta, Pinuccio Ardia', null, 'Small time crook Napoleone falls into an unlikely gang made up of a gangster, called The Baron, and his two cohorts, Agonia and The Captain, where Napoleone takes them to Rome where they shack up with a shady used car dealer caled Il Cajella to help finance their new life of crime by planing to rob a statue from the Vatican. But a big-time American gangster, named Joe Ventura, hears about the heist and wants the priceless statue for himself by having his mistress, Samantha, come onto and betray the woman-hungry Cajella to give the statue away to her.', 'Small time crook Napoleone falls into an unlikely gang made up of a gangster, called The Baron, and his two cohorts, Agonia and The Captain, where Napoleone takes them to Rome where they shack up with a shady used car dealer caled Il Cajella to help finance their new life of crime by planing to rob a statue from the Vatican. But a big-time American gangster, named Joe Ventura, hears about the heist and wants the priceless statue for himself by having his mistress, Samantha, come onto and betray the woman-hungry Cajella to give the statue away to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33sBavew5h6DyIsnJcj7rIh4odn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90644'),
  ('1041849945317451674', 'Operation Scorpio', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'Richard Yuen Tak, David Lai Tai-Wai', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu, David Lai Tai-Wai, Lui Sau-Fung', 'Chin Ka-Lok, Won Jin, Lau Kar-Leung, Frankie Chan Chi-Leung, May Lo Mei-Wei, Woo Fung, Victor Hon Kwan, Yuen Shun-Yi', null, 'After an aspiring comic book artist rescues a young girl from a prostitution ring, he submits to the teachings of an aging kung fu master in order to take on the local mob boss'' son: a deadly assassin who''s a master of the scorpion kung fu technique.', 'After an aspiring comic book artist rescues a young girl from a prostitution ring, he submits to the teachings of an aging kung fu master in order to take on the local mob boss'' son: a deadly assassin who''s a master of the scorpion kung fu technique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uXkG1AIIXQZ9WIvWPe0sUibNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18855'),
  ('208141822211419421', 'Operation Seawolf', 2022, 'War, Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Steven Luke, Joseph Loeffler', 'Steven Luke', 'Dolph Lundgren, Aaron Courteau, Frank Grillo, Andrew Stecker, Hiram A. Murray, Apostolos Gliarmis, Luke Steinborn, Edgar Damatian', 'NR', 'During the last days of World War II, Germany, desperate for any last grasp to defeat the allied powers, looked to their last remaining weapons and soldiers. The German Navy and the last remaining U-Boats were formed together for one desperate last mission – a mission to attack the United States Homeland, known as Operation Seawolf. Captain Hans Kessler, a grizzled submarine commander from both World Wars, is called into service to make one mission a success and help turn the tide of the war.', 'During the last days of World War II, Germany, desperate for any last grasp to defeat the allied powers, looked to their last remaining weapons and soldiers. The German Navy and the last remaining U-Boats were formed together for one desperate last mission – a mission to attack the United States Homeland, known as Operation Seawolf. Captain Hans Kessler, a grizzled submarine commander from both World Wars, is called into service to make one mission a success and help turn the tide of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqm5EAyC9hJCN5qutuW4Ka1xYbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018494'),
  ('882919144646084200', 'Operation Swallow: The Battle for Heavy Water', 1948, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Hilding Bladh, Marcel Weiss, Jean Dréville', null, 'Frédéric Joliot-Curie, Raoul Dautry, Henki Kolstad, Johannes Eckhoff, Claus Wiese, Øyvind Øyen, Andreas Aabel, Odd Rohde', null, 'A factual reconstruction of the sabotage events which took place to prevent Hitler''s Germany from getting the heavy water needed to make an atomic bomb during the Second World War.', 'A factual reconstruction of the sabotage events which took place to prevent Hitler''s Germany from getting the heavy water needed to make an atomic bomb during the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfPQc79Dbt69wiEWKmNDJAdFz3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76077'),
  ('768945116311223942', 'Operation Taco Gary''s', 2026, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Michael Kvamme, Zoran Popović', 'Michael Kvamme', 'Simon Rex, Dustin Milligan, Brenda Song, Jason Biggs, Arturo Castro, Tony Cavalero, Doug Jones, Stephen Ware', null, 'Two brothers uncover an alien invasion hidden inside a fast-food chain and must save Earth.', 'Two brothers uncover an alien invasion hidden inside a fast-food chain and must save Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soKwdOugcT1XRVd7KpvTMSflz0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130875'),
  ('42995116753076973', 'Operation Thunderbolt', 1977, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Menahem Golan, Adam Greenberg', 'Ken Globus, Menahem Golan', 'Yehoram Gaon, Gila Almagor, Klaus Kinski, Assi Dayan, Shmuel Rodensky, Rolf Eden, Sybil Danning, Arik Lavie', null, 'In July 1976, an Air France flight from Tel-Aviv to Paris via Athens was hijacked and forced to land in Entebbe, Uganda. The Jewish passengers were separated and held hostage in demand to release many terrorists held in Israeli prisons. After much debate, the Israeli government sent an elite commando unit to raid the airfield and release the hostages.', 'In July 1976, an Air France flight from Tel-Aviv to Paris via Athens was hijacked and forced to land in Entebbe, Uganda. The Jewish passengers were separated and held hostage in demand to release many terrorists held in Israeli prisons. After much debate, the Israeli government sent an elite commando unit to raid the airfield and release the hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUJIINnuvIrffm5kZYzJf7sjdaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26113'),
  ('566009249396382512', 'Operation Undead', 2024, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, War', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri, Jariya Suetrong, Arthit Phayomyong', 'Narit Pachoei, Pass Patthanakumjon, Suebpong Srihatrai', 'Chanon Santinatornkul, Awat Ratanapintha, Guntapat Kasemsan Na Ayudhya, Thawatchanin Darayon, Thanadol Auepong, Tanakorn Tiyanont, Tanatwut Rodpai, Jakkrit Sakuldech', null, 'Inexperienced Thai soldiers battle a growing undead menace in this gruesome survival horror. A Japanese military experiment that turns men into monsters escapes containment, it’s up to these troops to save their nation from annihilation.', 'Inexperienced Thai soldiers battle a growing undead menace in this gruesome survival horror. A Japanese military experiment that turns men into monsters escapes containment, it’s up to these troops to save their nation from annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rs10lMBnJFnJX1Y7MYpyB8JiNAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244361'),
  ('677279667914738634', 'Operation Valkyrie', 2004, 'Drama, History', 'Jo Baier, Gunnar Fuss', 'Jo Baier', 'Sebastian Koch, Ulrich Tukur, Hardy Krüger Jr., Christopher Buchholz, Nina Kunzendorf, Stefania Rocca, Olli Dittrich, Katharina Rivilis', null, 'In 1944, a group of high command officers plot an attempt against Hitler, and one of the leaders of the conspiracy, Stauffenberg, goes to a meeting with the Fuhrer in charge of exploding the place. However, Hitler survives and the officers are executed. This unsuccessful operation was called "Valkyrie Operation", and this realistic movie discloses this true event.', 'In 1944, a group of high command officers plot an attempt against Hitler, and one of the leaders of the conspiracy, Stauffenberg, goes to a meeting with the Fuhrer in charge of exploding the place. However, Hitler survives and the officers are executed. This unsuccessful operation was called "Valkyrie Operation", and this realistic movie discloses this true event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o21Ps0zrLqAi9XGciFlvaZOEmmp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10417'),
  ('568861798460139383', 'Operation Varsity Blues: The College Admissions Scandal', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime, Drama', 'Britton Foster, Chris Smith, Peter Etzweiler', 'Jon Karmen', 'Matthew Modine, Roger Rignack, Jillian Peterson, Courtney Rackley, Wallace Langham, Josh Stamberg, Jeff Rector, William-Christopher Stephens', 'R', 'An examination that goes beyond the celebrity-driven headlines and dives into the methods used by Rick Singer, the man at the center of the shocking 2019 college admissions scandal, to persuade his wealthy clients to cheat an educational system already designed to benefit the privileged.', 'An examination that goes beyond the celebrity-driven headlines and dives into the methods used by Rick Singer, the man at the center of the shocking 2019 college admissions scandal, to persuade his wealthy clients to cheat an educational system already designed to benefit the privileged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZJuctnatinO0OpnruGOWaT4Bga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799555'),
  ('609412458555493395', 'Operation Y and Other Shurik''s Adventures', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Gaidai, Konstantin Brovin, Viktor Babushkin', 'Leonid Gaidai, Yakov Kostyukovskiy, Moris Slobodskoy', 'Aleksandr Demyanenko, Aleksei Smirnov, Mikhail Pugovkin, Vladimir Basov, Natalya Seleznyova, Yuriy Nikulin, Georgiy Vitsin, Yevgeni Morgunov', null, 'The film consists of three independent parts: "Workmate", "Déjà vu" and "Operation Y". The plot follows the adventures of Shurik, the naive and nerdy Soviet student who often gets into ludicrous situations but always finds a way out very neatly.', 'The film consists of three independent parts: "Workmate", "Déjà vu" and "Operation Y". The plot follows the adventures of Shurik, the naive and nerdy Soviet student who often gets into ludicrous situations but always finds a way out very neatly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/di0OpDXkIj53Fv2wy6f5As8AbNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20875'),
  ('582905054919598672', 'Operation Zucker', 2013, 'Crime', 'Rainer Kaufmann', 'Rolf Basedow, Philip Koch', 'Nadja Uhl, Senta Berger, Anatole Taubman, Uwe Preuss, Paraschiva Dragus, Adrian Ernst, Stefan Rudolf, Hans-Uwe Bauer', null, 'The promise of a better life is pivotal in ten-year-old Fee’s decision to travel from her home in Romania to Germany. But she falls victim to child traffickers and is forced to work as a prostitute in a Berlin sex club. She is freed, however, after a police raid. When commissioner Wegemann takes up this serious case of sexual abuse, there’s a shocking discovery: a respected judge is a customer of the crime ring – and the state attorney helping her is a good friend of the judge. Are the police capable of protecting the young girl? Who can be trusted in this quagmire of lies and corruption? This crime drama addresses serious flaws in our society and their weakest victims: children.', 'The promise of a better life is pivotal in ten-year-old Fee’s decision to travel from her home in Romania to Germany. But she falls victim to child traffickers and is forced to work as a prostitute in a Berlin sex club. She is freed, however, after a police raid. When commissioner Wegemann takes up this serious case of sexual abuse, there’s a shocking discovery: a respected judge is a customer of the crime ring – and the state attorney helping her is a good friend of the judge. Are the police capable of protecting the young girl? Who can be trusted in this quagmire of lies and corruption? This crime drama addresses serious flaws in our society and their weakest victims: children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XnIloFcins2E5j1tIofdXCvEbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130742'),
  ('364476464003707932', 'Operation: Daybreak', 1975, 'Action, War', 'Lewis Gilbert', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Timothy Bottoms, Martin Shaw, Joss Ackland, Nicola Pagett, Anthony Andrews, Anton Diffring, Carl Duering, Cyril Shaps', 'PG', 'Czechoslovakia, 1942. Three brave Czech patriots risk everything to rid their country of its brutal Nazi leader, SS-General Reinhard Heydrich.', 'Czechoslovakia, 1942. Three brave Czech patriots risk everything to rid their country of its brutal Nazi leader, SS-General Reinhard Heydrich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JAYPCYXGkOFLeDEyjtn1dR13vU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72882'),
  ('521397402202496264', 'Operation: Endgame', 2010, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Fouad Mikati, Arnaud Stefani', 'Sam Levinson', 'Joe Anderson, Odette Annable, Zach Galifianakis, Rob Corddry, Maggie Q, Ellen Barkin, Jeffrey Tambor, Ving Rhames', 'R', 'A battle ensues among two government spy teams in an underground facility after their boss is assassinated.', 'A battle ensues among two government spy teams in an underground facility after their boss is assassinated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugbGBbzoPQXSgolQVVqRC3NGpIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41135'),
  ('969444948953036735', 'Operation: Rabbit', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Wile E. Coyote, genius, announces to Bugs Bunny that he is going to catch him and eat him, and then employs a variety of gadgets and plans in an attempt to do so.', 'Wile E. Coyote, genius, announces to Bugs Bunny that he is going to catch him and eat him, and then employs a variety of gadgets and plans in an attempt to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLK4KaGFVcVpMclOc8QTsbHQIpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102161'),
  ('548674890537974364', 'Operator', 2015, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Obin Olson, Amariah Olson, Obin Olson', 'Dwain Worrell, Anthony Feole, Amariah Olson', 'Mischa Barton, Luke Goss, Ving Rhames, Michael Paré, Riley Bundick, Tony DeMil, Maurice Chevalier, Walter Hendrix III', null, 'When the daughter of veteran 911 call center operator Pamela, and her estranged husband Jeremy, a Senior Police Officer, is kidnapped and held hostage, they are left desperate, with no choice but to follow the kidnapper''s rules: send messages through dispatch for all police and fire units to scatter to remote locations throughout the city where they are met with chaos. Not knowing who or why, they must race against the clock to make the choice of their lives: save the city — or save their daughter.', 'When the daughter of veteran 911 call center operator Pamela, and her estranged husband Jeremy, a Senior Police Officer, is kidnapped and held hostage, they are left desperate, with no choice but to follow the kidnapper''s rules: send messages through dispatch for all police and fire units to scatter to remote locations throughout the city where they are met with chaos. Not knowing who or why, they must race against the clock to make the choice of their lives: save the city — or save their daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XHpAyRg8KikNG3gZnAM5vE7hsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362185'),
  ('833638083083545860', 'Operator', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Logan Kibens, Steeven Petitteville', 'Sharon Greene, Logan Kibens', 'Martin Starr, Mae Whitman, Nat Faxon, Cameron Esposito, Retta, Christine Lahti, Kris D. Lofton, Kate Cobb', null, 'Joe, a programmer and obsessive self-quantifier, and Emily, a budding comedy performer, are happily married until they decide to use one another in their work. A dark comedy about love, technology, and what can’t be programmed.', 'Joe, a programmer and obsessive self-quantifier, and Emily, a budding comedy performer, are happily married until they decide to use one another in their work. A dark comedy about love, technology, and what can’t be programmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ALC9ZqSpotCkM13b4tkPQ0z5ct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381073'),
  ('793942002480878155', 'Operator 13', 1934, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Richard Boleslawski, Douglas Shearer, George J. Folsey', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Marion Davies, Gary Cooper, Jean Parker, Katharine Alexander, Ted Healy, Russell Hardie, Henry Wadsworth, Douglass Dumbrille', 'NR', 'American Civil War, 1862. After the disaster of the Second Battle of Bull Run, Major Allen, chief of the Secret Service of the Union, asks actress Gail Loveless to become one of his operators and infiltrate enemy territory.', 'American Civil War, 1862. After the disaster of the Second Battle of Bull Run, Major Allen, chief of the Secret Service of the Union, asks actress Gail Loveless to become one of his operators and infiltrate enemy territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n53ekxC0iWdo4Q1aEUXCPlE8b8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111310'),
  ('301906296988423733', 'Ophelia', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Martina Götthansova, David Vondrášek, Petr Bouska', 'Semi Chellas', 'Daisy Ridley, Naomi Watts, Clive Owen, George MacKay, Tom Felton, Devon Terrell, Nathaniel Parker, Dominic Mafham', 'PG-13', 'Ophelia comes of age as lady-in-waiting for Queen Gertrude, and her singular spirit captures Hamlet''s affections. As lust and betrayal threaten the kingdom, Ophelia finds herself trapped between true love and controlling her own destiny.', 'Ophelia comes of age as lady-in-waiting for Queen Gertrude, and her singular spirit captures Hamlet''s affections. As lust and betrayal threaten the kingdom, Ophelia finds herself trapped between true love and controlling her own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ItW1N2L2YIWVlZh1cg2Ylh3i8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428836'),
  ('16319243579904380', 'Ophélia', 1963, 'Drama', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', 'Claude Chabrol, Paul Gégauff', 'Alida Valli, Claude Cerval, André Jocelyn, Juliette Mayniel, Robert Burnier, Jean-Louis Maury, Sacha Briquet, Pierre Vernier', null, 'A young man becomes enraged when his mother remarries his wealthy uncle after his father dies.', 'A young man becomes enraged when his mother remarries his wealthy uncle after his father dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9nSVq4r4zhOYHfCKPS3Yp1t5qa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66905'),
  ('1033018686341777638', 'Opium and the Kung Fu Master', 1984, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Tong Kai, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Wong Ying', 'Ti Lung, Robert Mak Tak-Law, Tong Kai, Chen Kuan-Tai, Leanne Liu, Phillip Ko Fai, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Alan Chan Kwok-Kuen', null, 'A small town is protected by one of the famous Ten Tigers of Kwangtung. The town is very safe as Ti Lung and his Kung Fu students patrol for criminals. Enter the rival Kung Fu school whom Ti Lung''s students have beaten in a lion dance competition and then humiliated in a brawl. The rival school is joined by an opium dealing Kung Fu master who plans to turn the town into a community of addicts!', 'A small town is protected by one of the famous Ten Tigers of Kwangtung. The town is very safe as Ti Lung and his Kung Fu students patrol for criminals. Enter the rival Kung Fu school whom Ti Lung''s students have beaten in a lion dance competition and then humiliated in a brawl. The rival school is joined by an opium dealing Kung Fu master who plans to turn the town into a community of addicts!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5ZvKB2gw2Xw95dwJ2bSLPyVMGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25661'),
  ('769627287534727613', 'Opium Den', 1899, 'Documentary', 'Gabriel Veyre', null, null, null, 'A century-old film depicting opium smokers in French Indochina (Vietnam).', 'A century-old film depicting opium smokers in French Indochina (Vietnam).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ2E9zD7ut0sMbv72sYGVdABrXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195578'),
  ('927653060879407183', 'Opopomoz', 2003, 'Animation, Family', 'Enzo D''Alò, Alessio Giurintano', 'Furio Scarpelli, Enzo D''Alò, Giacomo Scarpelli', 'Ciro Ricci, Xsuela Douglas, Silvio Orlando, John Turturro, Vincenzo Salemme, Peppe Barra, Fabio Volo, Oreste Lionello', null, 'It''s Christmas Eve in Naples. Little Rocco feels increasingly jealous due to the imminent birth of a baby brother. Three bungling devils sent by Satan promise him that if he''ll stop Jesus from being born—entering the Nativity scene his father built by the magic word "opopomoz" and altering the past—his brother won''t be born either.', 'It''s Christmas Eve in Naples. Little Rocco feels increasingly jealous due to the imminent birth of a baby brother. Three bungling devils sent by Satan promise him that if he''ll stop Jesus from being born—entering the Nativity scene his father built by the magic word "opopomoz" and altering the past—his brother won''t be born either.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2ZUOipZQYHP4dZ0ctSs4fUIwb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78328'),
  ('705542464375375784', 'Oppai Chanbara: Striptease Samurai Squad', 2008, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Akira Hirose', 'Akira Hirose', 'Mina Asa, Yôichi Matsuda, Sasa Handa, Ruru Anoa, Ryo Akanishi, Shouichi Matsuda', null, 'Following the death of her mother, 20-year-old Lili has been living with her grandmother and is about to inherit her legacy to become the latest in a long line of female warriors adept at the deadly martial art of Sayama Hashinryu. During an informal ceremony inducting her into the legendary ranks, Lili is mysteriously transported 300 years back in time to a small village in 18th-century Japan. In no time at all she is fulfilling her destiny as a warrior by rescuing a young girl who is being harassed by three ninja members of the Yamishika gang who work for the evil Lady Okinu. Soon, they will all meet, and Lili''s fate will be decided!', 'Following the death of her mother, 20-year-old Lili has been living with her grandmother and is about to inherit her legacy to become the latest in a long line of female warriors adept at the deadly martial art of Sayama Hashinryu. During an informal ceremony inducting her into the legendary ranks, Lili is mysteriously transported 300 years back in time to a small village in 18th-century Japan. In no time at all she is fulfilling her destiny as a warrior by rescuing a young girl who is being harassed by three ninja members of the Yamishika gang who work for the evil Lady Okinu. Soon, they will all meet, and Lili''s fate will be decided!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdjk6RtUqtbfm1zSehm6F4SzY4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80647'),
  ('830846341277788939', 'Oppai Volleyball', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Eiichiro Hasumi, Hiromitsu Nishimura', 'Yoshikazu Okada', 'Haruka Ayase, Munetaka Aoki, Toru Nakamura, Takuya Ishida, Suzuka Ohgo, Seiji Fukushi, Ken Mitsuishi, Hiromasa Taguchi', null, 'Terajima Mikako became a boys volleyball team coach at a junior high school she has been assigned to. As an incentive for the team members who do not show the slightest enthusiasm, she promises to show them her boobs if they win a game.', 'Terajima Mikako became a boys volleyball team coach at a junior high school she has been assigned to. As an incentive for the team members who do not show the slightest enthusiasm, she promises to show them her boobs if they win a game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6V8AZar0SAEm3VyTM24kfvB4rP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28830'),
  ('1062009851003045324', 'Oppenheimer', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Christopher Nolan, Hoyte van Hoytema, Dixon McPhillips', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Cillian Murphy, Emily Blunt, Matt Damon, Robert Downey Jr., Florence Pugh, Josh Hartnett, Casey Affleck, Rami Malek', 'R', 'The story of J. Robert Oppenheimer''s role in the development of the atomic bomb during World War II.', 'The story of J. Robert Oppenheimer''s role in the development of the atomic bomb during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Gxv8gSFCU0XGDykEGv7zR1n2ua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872585'),
  ('1044563649335171540', 'Opportunity Knocks', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Donald Petrie', 'Nat Bernstein, Mitchel Katlin', 'Dana Carvey, James Tolkan, Robert Loggia, Todd Graff, Julia Campbell, Milo O''Shea, Doris Belack, Sally Gracie', 'PG-13', 'Eddie and Lou are a couple of two-bit con men on the lam from a loan shark. They hide out in someone''s house and they hear on the answering machine that (A) the owner of the house is out of the country for a month or two and (B) the housesitter supposed to watch the house for the absent owner won''t be able to watch the house due to a new job in another part of the country. This provides for a pretty nifty arrangement for Eddie and Lou...until the relatives of the house owner drop by to visit. Eddie quickly adopts the guise of the person supposedly housesitting for the owner, and the shenanigans start from there.', 'Eddie and Lou are a couple of two-bit con men on the lam from a loan shark. They hide out in someone''s house and they hear on the answering machine that (A) the owner of the house is out of the country for a month or two and (B) the housesitter supposed to watch the house for the absent owner won''t be able to watch the house due to a new job in another part of the country. This provides for a pretty nifty arrangement for Eddie and Lou...until the relatives of the house owner drop by to visit. Eddie quickly adopts the guise of the person supposedly housesitting for the owner, and the shenanigans start from there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2X2uPNrUAtHDC007SYFuGeOkwgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24073'),
  ('711200478988592320', 'Opposing Force', 1986, 'Action', 'Eric Karson, Michael Jones, Jerry O''Hara', 'Linda J. Cowgill', 'Tom Skerritt, Lisa Eichhorn, Anthony Zerbe, Richard Roundtree, Robert Wightman, John Considine, Dan Hamilton, George Cheung', 'R', 'A group of elite soldiers, including one woman, sign up for the ultimate training mission. The group parachutes onto a remote island, where their objective is to reach the safety zone before the "opposing force" captures them. Everything does not go as expected, and the training mission turns into the real thing.', 'A group of elite soldiers, including one woman, sign up for the ultimate training mission. The group parachutes onto a remote island, where their objective is to reach the safety zone before the "opposing force" captures them. Everything does not go as expected, and the training mission turns into the real thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3LHYWkkf8pSoX37NYZLakdybFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40468'),
  ('642128825700446413', 'Opposite Day', 2009, 'Family, Comedy', 'R. Michael Givens', 'Max Botkin', 'William Brent, Ariel Winter, Pauly Shore, Colleen Crabtree, Dylan Cash, Dick Van Patten, Renée Taylor, French Stewart', 'G', 'The world goes backwards on Opposite Day. The kids become adults, and the adults become kids.', 'The world goes backwards on Opposite Day. The kids become adults, and the adults become kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQkResQ0OstP3xXQIGOmzGQ9D0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55638'),
