  ('544210057562673630', 'Oppressed Majority', 2010, 'Drama', 'Eléonore Pourriat', null, 'Pierre Bénézit, Marie-Lorna Vaconsin, Jamel Barbouche, Céline Menville, Marie Favasuli', null, 'On what seems to be just another ordinary day, a man is exposed to sexism and sexual violence in a society ruled by women.', 'On what seems to be just another ordinary day, a man is exposed to sexism and sexual violence in a society ruled by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwue9tYOJMZdtM5yFvt6rOu0jVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254582'),
