  ('870965155195642246', 'Opus Zero', 2018, 'Drama', 'Matías Penachino, Daniel Graham', 'Daniel Graham', 'Willem Dafoe, Andrés Almeida, Irene Azuela, Brontis Jodorowsky, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Leonardo Ortizgris, Noé Hernández, Valentina Manzini', null, 'Paul, an American composer, arrives in the desert town of Real de Catorce where his father recently died. For the past ten years, Paul has been consumed with the task of composing an ending for the masterpiece of an early twentieth century musician. Being isolated from the world, he sees an opportunity to finish the symphony. However, Paul is caught up in a new mystery, the disappearance thirty years ago of a woman named Marianne.', 'Paul, an American composer, arrives in the desert town of Real de Catorce where his father recently died. For the past ten years, Paul has been consumed with the task of composing an ending for the masterpiece of an early twentieth century musician. Being isolated from the world, he sees an opportunity to finish the symphony. However, Paul is caught up in a new mystery, the disappearance thirty years ago of a woman named Marianne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP6VwfNsZVpSOkZ9mvtahmKoftk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496884'),
  ('544908182366761105', 'Oracle', 2023, 'Horror', 'Luca Del Puppo, Daniel di Grado, Michael L. Walker', 'Corey Harrell, Michael Arlen Ross', 'Ryan Destiny, Heather Graham, Ariel Martin, Samuel Isaiah Hunter, Nicholas Crovetti, Cameron Crovetti, Olive Abercrombie, Lucy Faust', null, 'A young woman accepts a job on a property with a traumatic history. Upon her arrival, she soon realizes that the nightmares of her childhood are connected to the evil in the house.', 'A young woman accepts a job on a property with a traumatic history. Upon her arrival, she soon realizes that the nightmares of her childhood are connected to the evil in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laOpPREcTlDukttovlUGJ3Wmtb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787761'),
