  ('544371028245175432', 'Orders to Kill', 1958, 'War, Thriller, Drama', 'Anthony Asquith, Desmond Dickinson', 'George St. George, Paul Dehn', 'Eddie Albert, Paul Massie, Lillian Gish, James Robertson Justice, Leslie French, Irene Worth, John Crawford, Lionel Jeffries', null, 'A grounded American fighter pilot is switched to espionage on a special job in which he must kill a small-time Paris lawyer suspected of double-crossing France by selling out radio operators to the Nazis.', 'A grounded American fighter pilot is switched to espionage on a special job in which he must kill a small-time Paris lawyer suspected of double-crossing France by selling out radio operators to the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/od0Kya0kkLygcvrU90hRw29IH3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27261'),
