  ('1133339397538595001', 'Oru Vadakkan Veeragatha', 1989, 'Drama, Action', 'T Hariharan, K. Ramachandra Babu', 'M T Vasudevan Nair', 'Mammootty, Balan K Nair, Madhavi, Suresh Gopi, Captain Raju, Geetha, Rajyalakshmi, Jomol', null, 'Chanthu, a poor orphan and Aromal are cousins and belong to the Chekavar clan, a warrior clan who hire themselves out as duellers to settle disputes among the rich and powerful. Aromal, jealous of the much more talented Chanthu, makes life miserable for him and Chanthu decides to leave and live with Aringodar, a rival chekavan, as his pupil. When the two sons of a local landlord have a property dispute and decide to hire Aromal and Aringodar to duel it out, Chanthu has to decide where his loyalty lies - with the family of the uncle who brought him up or with Aringodar who provided him with sanctuary.', 'Chanthu, a poor orphan and Aromal are cousins and belong to the Chekavar clan, a warrior clan who hire themselves out as duellers to settle disputes among the rich and powerful. Aromal, jealous of the much more talented Chanthu, makes life miserable for him and Chanthu decides to leave and live with Aringodar, a rival chekavan, as his pupil. When the two sons of a local landlord have a property dispute and decide to hire Aromal and Aringodar to duel it out, Chanthu has to decide where his loyalty lies - with the family of the uncle who brought him up or with Aringodar who provided him with sanctuary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAHyfIpg9dLCfxCtZYTUyUjoCLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151662'),
  ('1028633263881036360', 'Orwell: 2+2=5', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Raoul Peck', 'Raoul Peck', 'Damian Lewis, George Orwell, George W. Bush, Viktor Orbán, Colin Powell, Joseph Stalin, Malcolm X, Ernest Hemingway', 'R', 'George Orwell was one of the most visionary authors of the 20th century, whose novels 1984 and Animal Farm foretold a chilling, authoritarian future. Acclaimed director Raoul Peck interweaves clips, readings from Orwell''s diary, cinematic references, and modern-day footage to craft not only a portrait of the writer, but a fresh take on how prophetic his work has become.', 'George Orwell was one of the most visionary authors of the 20th century, whose novels 1984 and Animal Farm foretold a chilling, authoritarian future. Acclaimed director Raoul Peck interweaves clips, readings from Orwell''s diary, cinematic references, and modern-day footage to craft not only a portrait of the writer, but a fresh take on how prophetic his work has become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qG1LjcK8ohi4mSJ9j8KHUs5svbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1098534'),
  ('368901412510592935', 'Orz Boyz', 2008, 'Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Chou Yi-wen, Yang Ya-che', 'Yang Ya-che', 'Li Kuan-yi, Pan Chin-yu, Umin Boya, Mei Fang, Hsu Chi-wen, Na-Do, Bamboo Chen', null, 'More than just naughty, they play tricks on classmates, tease girls at school, fight with other boys, and lie to everyone until their teacher breaks down. They are named Liar No. 1 and Liar No. 2. The most important act planned in their life is to go to the mysterious water park, where they can leap through the portal at the end of the water slide to the fairy-tale world OZ and live as grown-ups happily ever after. However, the commitment is torn by a careless betrayal.', 'More than just naughty, they play tricks on classmates, tease girls at school, fight with other boys, and lie to everyone until their teacher breaks down. They are named Liar No. 1 and Liar No. 2. The most important act planned in their life is to go to the mysterious water park, where they can leap through the portal at the end of the water slide to the fairy-tale world OZ and live as grown-ups happily ever after. However, the commitment is torn by a careless betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAFPgdbXHpJ6njWmglGPUu1uA4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77409'),
  ('1044063565071972150', 'Os Caras de Pau em O Misterioso Roubo do Anel', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Felipe Joffily', 'Celso Taddei, Chico Soares, Marcius Melhem', 'Leandro Hassum, Marcius Melhem, Christine Fernandes, André Mattos, Adriano Garib, Márcio Vito, Ricardo Pereira, Antonio Fragoso', null, 'The Tatu Tatuado de Topázio ring, by socialite Gracinha de Medeiros, is on display at a museum. She then hires the clumsy security guards Pedrão and Jorginho to watch over the jewel, a family heirloom. The ring is stolen and the pair accused of theft. To prove that they are innocent, they will have to face Portuguese mobsters and a gang of ninjas.', 'The Tatu Tatuado de Topázio ring, by socialite Gracinha de Medeiros, is on display at a museum. She then hires the clumsy security guards Pedrão and Jorginho to watch over the jewel, a family heirloom. The ring is stolen and the pair accused of theft. To prove that they are innocent, they will have to face Portuguese mobsters and a gang of ninjas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qW90KhASslwJLWzdGhrgpL434FP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228184'),
