  ('496632485236015336', 'Oscar', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Molinaro, Philippe Monnier, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Claude Magnier', 'Louis de Funès, Claude Rich, Agathe Natanson, Claude Gensac, Sylvia Saurel, Dominique Page, Paul Préboist, Mario David', null, 'This film originated as a play in Paris. The story focuses on the one-day adventures of Bertrand Barnier played with a genius of French cinema, Louis de Funes. In the same morning he learns that his daughter is pregnant, an employee stole a large amount of money from his company, his maid is about to resign in order to marry a wealthy neighbor and his body builder is interested in marrying his daughter. The seemingly complicated story-line is full of comedy or errors and some of the most hilarious mime scenes of the French cinema.', 'This film originated as a play in Paris. The story focuses on the one-day adventures of Bertrand Barnier played with a genius of French cinema, Louis de Funes. In the same morning he learns that his daughter is pregnant, an employee stole a large amount of money from his company, his maid is about to resign in order to marry a wealthy neighbor and his body builder is interested in marrying his daughter. The seemingly complicated story-line is full of comedy or errors and some of the most hilarious mime scenes of the French cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imsP4Vl1UpsLf27DPxX1atIubBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2798'),
  ('729008459850624618', 'Oscar', 1991, 'Comedy', 'John Landis, Mac Ahlberg, Frank Capra III', 'Michael Barrie, Jim Mulholland', 'Sylvester Stallone, Marisa Tomei, Vincent Spano, Ornella Muti, Tim Curry, Peter Riegert, Chazz Palminteri, Martin Ferrero', 'PG', 'Angelo "Snaps" Provolone made his dying father a promise on his deathbed: he would leave the world of crime and become an honest businessman. Despite having no experience in making money in a legal fashion, Snaps sets about to keep his promise.', 'Angelo "Snaps" Provolone made his dying father a promise on his deathbed: he would leave the world of crime and become an honest businessman. Despite having no experience in making money in a legal fashion, Snaps sets about to keep his promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGJOzUwHlkx8MKy2oR2qEiT7g4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11890'),
  ('476381068184171048', 'Oscar and Lucinda', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gillian Armstrong, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Laura Jones', 'Ralph Fiennes, Cate Blanchett, Ciarán Hinds, Tom Wilkinson, Richard Roxburgh, Christian Manon, Clive Russell, Barnaby Kay', 'R', 'After a childhood of abuse by his evangelistic father, misfit Oscar Hopkins becomes an Anglican minister and develops a divine obsession with gambling. Lucinda Leplastrier is a rich Australian heiress shopping in London for materials for her newly acquired glass factory back home. Deciding to travel to Australia as a missionary, Oscar meets Lucinda aboard ship, and a mutual obsession blossoms. They make a wager that will alter each of their destinies.', 'After a childhood of abuse by his evangelistic father, misfit Oscar Hopkins becomes an Anglican minister and develops a divine obsession with gambling. Lucinda Leplastrier is a rich Australian heiress shopping in London for materials for her newly acquired glass factory back home. Deciding to travel to Australia as a missionary, Oscar meets Lucinda aboard ship, and a mutual obsession blossoms. They make a wager that will alter each of their destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9naDX3u4hsRM8jZ0Y7k5e2HAKmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39780'),
  ('62682736354535907', 'Oscar and the Lady in Pink', 2009, 'Drama, Family', 'Éric-Emmanuel Schmitt, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Éric-Emmanuel Schmitt', 'Amir Ben Abdelmoumen, Michèle Laroque, Max von Sydow, Mylène Demongeot, Jérôme Kircher, Amira Casar, Constance Dollé, Benoît Brière', null, 'Listening in to a conversation between his doctor and parents, 10-year-old Oscar learns what nobody has the courage to tell him. He only has a few weeks to live. Furious, he refuses to speak to anyone except straight-talking Rose, the lady in pink he meets on the hospital stairs. As Christmas approaches, Rose uses her fantastical experiences as a professional wrestler, her imagination, wit and charm to allow Oscar to live life and love to the full, in the company of his friends Pop Corn, Einstein, Bacon and childhood sweetheart Peggy Blue. Written by American Film Market', 'Listening in to a conversation between his doctor and parents, 10-year-old Oscar learns what nobody has the courage to tell him. He only has a few weeks to live. Furious, he refuses to speak to anyone except straight-talking Rose, the lady in pink he meets on the hospital stairs. As Christmas approaches, Rose uses her fantastical experiences as a professional wrestler, her imagination, wit and charm to allow Oscar to live life and love to the full, in the company of his friends Pop Corn, Einstein, Bacon and childhood sweetheart Peggy Blue. Written by American Film Market', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjBERQq2t1MKhlDnKuob8OTnHsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51880'),
  ('971472485798531069', 'Oscar Niemeyer: Life is a Breath of Air', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Fabiano Maciel', null, 'Oscar Niemeyer, Lúcio Costa, Italo Campofiorito, Ferreira Gullar, Charles-Édouard Jeanneret-Gris, Chico Buarque, Eduardo Galeano, Carlos Heitor Cony', null, 'A documentary made to coincide with Niemeyer''s 100th birthday. The renowned architect talks about his long life, his inspirations, and his aspirations towards a just Brazil, and the ways he tried to help that along in his spectacular and beautiful buildings.', 'A documentary made to coincide with Niemeyer''s 100th birthday. The renowned architect talks about his long life, his inspirations, and his aspirations towards a just Brazil, and the ways he tried to help that along in his spectacular and beautiful buildings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7prXF30ollJkVaTzdHKhU5rezC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148183'),
  ('1082908592251865975', 'Oscar Shaw', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Western', 'R. Ellis Frazier, Justin Nesbitt, Andrew Robinson', 'Don Roff', 'Michael Jai White, Tyrese Gibson, Isaiah Washington, Andrew C. English Jr., Cecile Cubiló, Jeanette Josue, Hiro Ortiz, James Choi', 'NR', 'After retiring from the police force, a relentless detective haunted by the tragic loss of his closest friend sets out on a perilous quest for vengeance, seeking redemption and fighting to restore justice to the streets he once swore to protect.', 'After retiring from the police force, a relentless detective haunted by the tragic loss of his closest friend sets out on a perilous quest for vengeance, seeking redemption and fighting to restore justice to the streets he once swore to protect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsE3nySukwrfUjouz8vzvKTcXNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1601243'),
  ('143712646808443857', 'Oscar Wilde', 1960, 'Drama', 'Gregory Ratoff, Georges Périnal, Nora Roberts', 'Jo Eisinger', 'Robert Morley, Ralph Richardson, Phyllis Calvert, John Neville, Dennis Price, Alexander Knox, Edward Chapman, William Devlin', null, 'England, 1891. Ascending writer Oscar Wilde (1854-1900) meets Lord Alfred Douglas, a young nobleman. Over the years, they will maintain an intimate relationship that will be openly criticized by Alfred''s father, the Marquis of Queensberry, in such a harsh way that Wilde, instigated by Alfred, decides to sue Queensberry in 1895, accusing him of defamation.', 'England, 1891. Ascending writer Oscar Wilde (1854-1900) meets Lord Alfred Douglas, a young nobleman. Over the years, they will maintain an intimate relationship that will be openly criticized by Alfred''s father, the Marquis of Queensberry, in such a harsh way that Wilde, instigated by Alfred, decides to sue Queensberry in 1895, accusing him of defamation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNSNxogmQgf6gZHe28Igm6vy7py.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119601'),
  ('104532002329923091', 'Oscenità', 1980, 'Drama', 'Renato Polselli, Elsio Mancuso', 'Renato Polselli', 'Isarco Ravaioli, Mirella Rossi, Dino Strano, Brad Euston, Franca Grey, Antonio Maronese, Ivana Giordan, Luciano Conti', null, 'A group of people come up with provocative or downright nasty sexual scenarios like rape, bestiality, tree branch masturbation, candle masturbation, corncob masturbation, whipping, lesbian orgies, toe masturbation, and bathtub assault.', 'A group of people come up with provocative or downright nasty sexual scenarios like rape, bestiality, tree branch masturbation, candle masturbation, corncob masturbation, whipping, lesbian orgies, toe masturbation, and bathtub assault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDl2l0iRBrVxwteIBhyf40slrIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107406'),
  ('883893457237576082', 'Osceola', 1971, 'Drama, Western', 'Konrad Petzold', 'Günter Karl, Walter Püschel', 'Gojko Mitić, Horst Schulze, Iurie Darie, Karin Ugowski, Kati Bus, Pepa Nikolova, Audrey Pankey, William Aniche', null, 'Florida, 1830 - Of all eastern Native American tribes, only the Seminoles have resisted being moved to reservations. Having retreated to Florida, they live a simple horticultural life. But white plantation owners, angry at the increasing numbers of black slaves fleeing to Seminole protection, want to take their land. Plantation owner Raynes, in particular, has convinced the military to wipe out the Seminoles. His rival Moore, a sawmill owner from the North who has a Seminole wife, is against slavery and considers it unprofitable. Chief Osceola sees the coming danger; he tries to avoid provoking the whites, but cannot prevent the war that breaks out in 1835.', 'Florida, 1830 - Of all eastern Native American tribes, only the Seminoles have resisted being moved to reservations. Having retreated to Florida, they live a simple horticultural life. But white plantation owners, angry at the increasing numbers of black slaves fleeing to Seminole protection, want to take their land. Plantation owner Raynes, in particular, has convinced the military to wipe out the Seminoles. His rival Moore, a sawmill owner from the North who has a Seminole wife, is against slavery and considers it unprofitable. Chief Osceola sees the coming danger; he tries to avoid provoking the whites, but cannot prevent the war that breaks out in 1835.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIUCdgg42Cx36cKnH2nLDdwXkyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197397'),
  ('343828397540480034', 'Oseam', 2003, 'Drama, Animation', 'Sung Baek-yeop', 'Choi Min-yong', 'Kim Seo-young, Park Seon-yeong, Pyo Yeong-jae, Son Jong-hwan, Bae Jeong-min, Oh Ju-yeon', null, 'After a fire claims the life of her mother and her eyesight, young Ga-mi and her brother, Gil-son — who is unaware of their mother''s death — eventually find a home with Buddhist monks in their mountainside temple.', 'After a fire claims the life of her mother and her eyesight, young Ga-mi and her brother, Gil-son — who is unaware of their mother''s death — eventually find a home with Buddhist monks in their mountainside temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAcCA7T09TM0uG7o85Pn1uavNU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38562'),
  ('351953313893003917', 'Oshi no Ko -The Final Act-', 2024, 'Drama, Music, Fantasy', 'Smith, Hirofumi Kawaguchi, Isao Okudaira', 'Ayako Kitagawa', 'Nagisa Saito, Kaito Sakurai, Asuka Saito, Nanoka Hara, Mizuki Kayashima, ano, Mari Hamada, Kazuto Mokudai', null, 'Goro is a gynecologist and idol fan who’s in shock after his favorite star, Ai, announces an impromptu hiatus. Little does Goro realize that he’s about to forge a bond with her that defies all common sense! Lies are an idol’s weapon!', 'Goro is a gynecologist and idol fan who’s in shock after his favorite star, Ai, announces an impromptu hiatus. Little does Goro realize that he’s about to forge a bond with her that defies all common sense! Lies are an idol’s weapon!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29BjXB8dPvLvJJgZFetd8PvwYiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235431'),
  ('923293170149625967', 'Oshin', 2013, 'Drama', 'Shin Togashi, Tomoyuki Maruo, Chimura Toshimitsu', 'Kota Yamada', 'Kokone Hamada, Aya Ueto, Goro Inagaki, Pinko Izumi, Kayoko Kishimoto, Manami Igashira, Ayako Kobayashi, Shinnosuke Mitsushima', null, 'A young girl named Oshin is sent to work for another family, because of her own family''s financial condition. Nevertheless, the young girl lives strongly.', 'A young girl named Oshin is sent to work for another family, because of her own family''s financial condition. Nevertheless, the young girl lives strongly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvEyrBudkgm31KAc24H2nTGxfTv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252738'),
  ('133493012897625615', 'Osiris', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'William Kaufman', 'William Kaufman, Paul Reichelt', 'Max Martini, Brianna Hildebrand, LaMonica Garrett, Michael Irby, Linda Hamilton, Stanley White Jr., Tyler Galpin, Linds Edwards', null, 'Special Forces commandos on a mission are abducted mid-operation by a mysterious spacecraft. Upon waking aboard, they find themselves prey to a relentless alien race in a fight for survival.', 'Special Forces commandos on a mission are abducted mid-operation by a mysterious spacecraft. Upon waking aboard, they find themselves prey to a relentless alien race in a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YtZHtXPNG5AleisgEatEfZOT2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241470'),
  ('727657607589065977', 'Oskar, das Schlitzohr und Fanny Supergirl', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family', 'Markus Herling, Uwe Bünker, Peter Steuger', null, 'Dieter Hallervorden, Julia Kovacs, Chiara Schoras, Bernhard Piesk, Gesine Cukrowski, Jan Sosniok, Charlotte Hübner, Anna Wittowsky', null, 'Grandpa Oskar takes neither the truth nor himself very seriously. The rascal has just been released from prison, where he was serving a sentence for imposture. Since the ex-con needs a place to stay, he quartered himself in the old construction trailer in the farthest corner of the garden of his daughter Tilda, who is still mad at him. The senior soon meets his autistic granddaughter Fanny, whose antics and peculiarities threaten to break the family under. In contrast to the old man, the 8-year-old takes the truth very seriously. In order to gain their trust, Oskar does not introduce himself to the comic-loving girl as the criminal grandpa, who has been missing for years, but as Professor Krypton. For Fanny, who prefers to wear a brightly colored superhero costume and is teased at school for it, the omniscient mentor from the Superman planet comes along just at the right time, because she has a dream: To win the talent competition at school!', 'Grandpa Oskar takes neither the truth nor himself very seriously. The rascal has just been released from prison, where he was serving a sentence for imposture. Since the ex-con needs a place to stay, he quartered himself in the old construction trailer in the farthest corner of the garden of his daughter Tilda, who is still mad at him. The senior soon meets his autistic granddaughter Fanny, whose antics and peculiarities threaten to break the family under. In contrast to the old man, the 8-year-old takes the truth very seriously. In order to gain their trust, Oskar does not introduce himself to the comic-loving girl as the criminal grandpa, who has been missing for years, but as Professor Krypton. For Fanny, who prefers to wear a brightly colored superhero costume and is teased at school for it, the omniscient mentor from the Superman planet comes along just at the right time, because she has a dream: To win the talent competition at school!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DFDsnEWViAtb8zA62TVvtMWyuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922335'),
  ('27242610959275141', 'Oskar''s Dress', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hüseyin Tabak, Daniel Gottschalk', 'Florian David Fitz', 'Florian David Fitz, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Senta Berger, Burghart Klaußner, Marie Burchard, Rudolf Krause, Nora Boeckler, Juan Carlos Lo Sasso', null, 'Since Ben has been living apart from his ex-wife Mira and his children, his life has fallen apart. But unexpectedly, he gets a second chance: when Mira, pregnant to the teeth, has to be hospitalized, his children live with him again. This time, everything will be fine - he thinks! But his son Oskar brings a small problem: he wears a dress that he doesn''t want to take off.', 'Since Ben has been living apart from his ex-wife Mira and his children, his life has fallen apart. But unexpectedly, he gets a second chance: when Mira, pregnant to the teeth, has to be hospitalized, his children live with him again. This time, everything will be fine - he thinks! But his son Oskar brings a small problem: he wears a dress that he doesn''t want to take off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LPFnZy8jHMbuVtVaimJLEaTBUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916712'),
  ('254419917903311702', 'Oslo', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Janusz Kamiński, Bartlett Sher, Liberty Cheesman', 'J.T. Rogers', 'Ruth Wilson, Andrew Scott, Salim Daw, Waleed Zuaiter, Jeff Wilbusch, Igal Naor, Doval''e Glickman, Rotem Keinan', null, 'The true story of negotiations between implacable enemies — the secret back-channel talks, unlikely friendships and quiet heroics of a small but committed group of Israelis, Palestinians and one Norwegian couple that led to the 1993 Oslo Peace Accords.', 'The true story of negotiations between implacable enemies — the secret back-channel talks, unlikely friendships and quiet heroics of a small but committed group of Israelis, Palestinians and one Norwegian couple that led to the 1993 Oslo Peace Accords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tULZeNNlwLvXPdQpERfrfYyZfTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553087'),
  ('848767081497687913', 'Oslo, August 31st', 2011, 'Drama', 'Joachim Trier, Hans-Jørgen Osnes, Emil Trier', 'Eskil Vogt, Joachim Trier', 'Anders Danielsen Lie, Malin Crépin, Hans Olav Brenner, Ingrid Olava, Tone Beate Mostraum, Øystein Røger, Aksel Thanke, Kjærsti Odden Skjeldal', 'NR', 'A recovering drug addict is granted a day’s leave from rehab and returns to Oslo, where he reconnects with friends, faces the weight of his past, and struggles with uncertainty about his future. Over the course of one day, he drifts through encounters that reflect his longing for connection and his deep sense of alienation.', 'A recovering drug addict is granted a day’s leave from rehab and returns to Oslo, where he reconnects with friends, faces the weight of his past, and struggles with uncertainty about his future. Over the course of one day, he drifts through encounters that reflect his longing for connection and his deep sense of alienation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IJZ252ecJICOShQgymHk7AOVIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75233'),
  ('1089457609990507908', 'Osman Pazarlama', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Kader Ezgeç, Togan Gökbakar, Gérard Simon', 'Togan Gökbakar, Şahan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Mehmet Selim Akgul, Feriştah Senem Yıldırım, Yurtşen Fidan, Liberat Niyoyandika, Şükran Çağman, Salih Ünal, Kerim Ertekin', null, 'Osman, is a small scale entrepreneur in a middle class neighborhood of Istanbul where he operates from a hangar transformed into an office. He dreams of getting rich through the sales of products imported from the Far East and also self invented products, thus marrying the girl he loves from the neighborhood. The biggest challenge he faces to marry the girl he is in love with is to convince the girls father that he is a successful businessman. Osman believes the only way to do this is making a big breakthrough with his company. He embarks on many adventures to sell his products, all end up in hilarious misfortunes and failures. On his journey to become rich, the only companions he has are Erkan and Songül who is the daughter of a family friend from the neighborhood. At the end of the day Osman will come to realize that wealth was never far-off.', 'Osman, is a small scale entrepreneur in a middle class neighborhood of Istanbul where he operates from a hangar transformed into an office. He dreams of getting rich through the sales of products imported from the Far East and also self invented products, thus marrying the girl he loves from the neighborhood. The biggest challenge he faces to marry the girl he is in love with is to convince the girls father that he is a successful businessman. Osman believes the only way to do this is making a big breakthrough with his company. He embarks on many adventures to sell his products, all end up in hilarious misfortunes and failures. On his journey to become rich, the only companions he has are Erkan and Songül who is the daughter of a family friend from the neighborhood. At the end of the day Osman will come to realize that wealth was never far-off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XLZWTD0jY7C4xSDMA80gvWdnxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386376'),
  ('990283734268332189', 'Osmosis Jones', 2001, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Bobby Farrelly, Mark Irwin, Peter Farrelly', 'Marc Hyman', 'Chris Rock, Laurence Fishburne, David Hyde Pierce, Brandy Norwood, Elena Franklin, Bill Murray, William Shatner, Ron Howard', 'PG', 'A white blood cell policeman, with the help of a cold pill, must stop a deadly virus from destroying the human they live in, Frank.', 'A white blood cell policeman, with the help of a cold pill, must stop a deadly virus from destroying the human they live in, Frank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foZpSG88IQUCEBJE3unc5QzO6bQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12610'),
  ('812041072039044624', 'OSS 117 Is Not Dead', 1952, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Jean Sacha, Marcel Weiss', 'Jacques Berland', 'Ivan Desny, Magali Noël, Anne Carrère, Yves Vincent, Danik Patisson, Béatrice Arnac, Marie Déa, Georges Lannes', null, 'OSS 117 is asked for help by a female acquaintance Muriel Rousset. She beseeches him to retrieve secret documents which have been stolen from Sir Anthony Lead, the father of Anita and Marion. He complies with her wish and no obstacle or danger can hinder him from meeting her expectations.', 'OSS 117 is asked for help by a female acquaintance Muriel Rousset. She beseeches him to retrieve secret documents which have been stolen from Sir Anthony Lead, the father of Anita and Marion. He complies with her wish and no obstacle or danger can hinder him from meeting her expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8e9ehDhNxkC9hyn2K3QyJXUyPvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196474'),
