  ('771361330349231833', 'OSS 117: Cairo, Nest of Spies', 2006, 'Crime, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Noureddine Aberdine, Luc Bricault', 'Jean-François Halin', 'Jean Dujardin, Bérénice Bejo, Aure Atika, Philippe Lefebvre, Konstantin Aleksandrov, Saïd Amadis, Laurent Bateau, Claude Brosset', 'NR', 'Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.', 'Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDVHVZVEbTV4JsB8ZjdXNmMK7rA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15152'),
  ('326636417747837683', 'OSS 117: From Africa with Love', 2021, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Laurent Tangy, Nicolas Bedos', 'Jean-François Halin', 'Jean Dujardin, Pierre Niney, Wladimir Yordanoff, Fatou N''Diaye, Natacha Lindinger, Gilles Cohen, Pol White, Brice Fournier', null, '1981. Hubert Bonisseur de la Bath, aka OSS 117, is back. For this new mission – more delicate, more dangerous and more torrid than ever – he is forced to team up with a young new colleague, the promising OSS 1001.', '1981. Hubert Bonisseur de la Bath, aka OSS 117, is back. For this new mission – more delicate, more dangerous and more torrid than ever – he is forced to team up with a young new colleague, the promising OSS 1001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KZun0DjBSVJtAEb7ytNKIKO0SL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604563'),
  ('319090989204289968', 'OSS 117: Lost in Rio', 2009, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Jean-François Halin', 'Jean Dujardin, Louise Monot, Alex Lutz, Reem Kherici, Rüdiger Vogler, Pierre Bellemare, Ken Samuels, Serge Hazanavicius', null, 'In 1967, OSS 117 is sent to Brazil in order to retrieve a microfilm list of French Nazi sympathizers, only to once again unknowingly set foot into a bigger international intrigue.', 'In 1967, OSS 117 is sent to Brazil in order to retrieve a microfilm list of French Nazi sympathizers, only to once again unknowingly set foot into a bigger international intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhv06T3gTFOShIVkQ0UipZFIyDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15588'),
