  ('650467767757912934', 'OSS 117: Panic in Bangkok', 1964, 'Action, Crime', 'André Hunebelle, Jacques Besnard', 'Pierre Foucaud, André Hunebelle, Michel Lebrun', 'Kerwin Mathews, Pier Angeli, Robert Hossein, Dominique Wilms, Gamil Ratib, Henri Virlogeux, Akom Mokranond, Henri Guégan', 'NR', 'A secret agent sets out to stop an evil scientist who is about to unleash on the world a virulent biological strain he has developed during experiments on rats.', 'A secret agent sets out to stop an evil scientist who is about to unleash on the world a virulent biological strain he has developed during experiments on rats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZ6FPs1OqDYsxbpXk0zrv7yiev3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115082'),
  ('705399568951010506', 'Ossessione', 1944, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Domenico Scala, Luchino Visconti, Aldo Tonti', 'Luchino Visconti, Giuseppe De Santis, Mario Alicata', 'Clara Calamai, Massimo Girotti, Dhia Cristiani, Elio Marcuzzo, Vittorio Duse, Michele Riccardini, Juan de Landa, Michele Sakara', null, 'Gino, a drifter, begins an affair with inn-owner Giovanna as they plan to get rid of her older husband.', 'Gino, a drifter, begins an affair with inn-owner Giovanna as they plan to get rid of her older husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgDF8yuJa9eEcfBqEQrqbJuxe5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5155'),
  ('733083552917221094', 'Ossi’s Eleven', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Oliver Mielke', 'Philip Kaetner, Oliver Mielke', 'Tim Wilde, Stefan Jürgens, Andreas Giebel, Helmfried von Lüttichau, Michael Habeck, Karoline Eichhorn, Eva Habermann, Jule Ronstedt', null, 'Finally out again. The attempt to cheat his boss out of a truckload cost haulage driver Oswald a year of his life and his job. Now it''s back home to the prefabricated building. It''s just in time that Oswald''s buddy Karl knows about trophies made from old D-Mark coins. In the iron foundry on the outskirts of the city, old coins worth several hundred thousand Deutschmarks are regularly stored for further processing - virtually unguarded. As the old coins can still be exchanged, this is a small but sure coup. While Karl is still laughing at Oswald''s naivety, he is already beginning to put his plan into action. In a series of tragic and absurd situations, he recruits a team that couldn''t be more different, from doped athletes to hated ex-Stasi men. They are united by their desire to use the money to make a difference.', 'Finally out again. The attempt to cheat his boss out of a truckload cost haulage driver Oswald a year of his life and his job. Now it''s back home to the prefabricated building. It''s just in time that Oswald''s buddy Karl knows about trophies made from old D-Mark coins. In the iron foundry on the outskirts of the city, old coins worth several hundred thousand Deutschmarks are regularly stored for further processing - virtually unguarded. As the old coins can still be exchanged, this is a small but sure coup. While Karl is still laughing at Oswald''s naivety, he is already beginning to put his plan into action. In a series of tragic and absurd situations, he recruits a team that couldn''t be more different, from doped athletes to hated ex-Stasi men. They are united by their desire to use the money to make a difference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzIcDkuHITmp0h6fm0YIV8YNCK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27438'),
  ('1149278727350863884', 'Ossos', 1997, 'Drama', 'Pedro Costa, Emmanuel Machuel', 'Pedro Costa', 'Mariya Lipkina, Vanda Duarte, Nuno Vaz, Isabel Ruth, Miguel Sermão, Berta Susana Teixeira, Inês de Medeiros, Anna Carvalho', null, 'After a suicidal teenage girl gives birth, she misguidedly entrusts her baby’s safety to the troubled, deadbeat father, whose violent actions take the viewer on a tour of the foreboding, crumbling shantytown in which they live.', 'After a suicidal teenage girl gives birth, she misguidedly entrusts her baby’s safety to the troubled, deadbeat father, whose violent actions take the viewer on a tour of the foreboding, crumbling shantytown in which they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8g4lW86bbqxNW2kAjEn8mpX1QNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55700'),
  ('1067513420786725488', 'Ostaggi', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Patrizio Patrizi, Eleonora Ivone, Paolo Fragomeni', 'Eleonora Ivone, Angelo Longoni', 'Gianmarco Tognazzi, Vanessa Incontrada, Francesco Pannofino, Elena Cotta, Jonis Bashir, Alessandro Haber, Eleonora Ivone, Felicitè Mbezelè', null, 'A man who has just robbed a small bank holds four people hostage in a bakery after escaping a police chase. He begins a tense negotiation with the police, who have set up headquarters in a post office overlooking the street where the bakery is located. The situation is made difficult and comically bizarre by the nature of the hostages who just so happen to be in the bakery at the time of the raid.', 'A man who has just robbed a small bank holds four people hostage in a bakery after escaping a police chase. He begins a tense negotiation with the police, who have set up headquarters in a post office overlooking the street where the bakery is located. The situation is made difficult and comically bizarre by the nature of the hostages who just so happen to be in the bakery at the time of the raid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQEdDo3TH1qM9YjYyphq9hd3pIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779015'),
  ('978845650020238816', 'Ostap Bender: The Final Hustle', 2021, 'Adventure, Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Sergey Trofimov, Igor Zaytsev', 'Roman Nepomnyashchiy, Oleg Malovichko', 'Sergei Bezrukov, Aram Vardevanyan, Olga Sutulova, Andrey Burkovskiy, Ivan Kokorin, Konstantin Murzenko, Artyom Tkachenko, Taisiya Vilkova', null, '1919, Solnechnomorsk. Talented adventurers have become too unexpected: now they are wanted by the Russian and Turkish police. They go to the south of Russia to take possession of the golden scepter of Count Rumyantsev. In pursuit of a precious little thing, terrorists, circus performers and even participating ladies can dress up as them. Meanwhile, Ostap’s mother is approaching the paws of the gloomy Satanist Crowley, in whose treasury, by a mysterious coincidence, there is also a scepter ...', '1919, Solnechnomorsk. Talented adventurers have become too unexpected: now they are wanted by the Russian and Turkish police. They go to the south of Russia to take possession of the golden scepter of Count Rumyantsev. In pursuit of a precious little thing, terrorists, circus performers and even participating ladies can dress up as them. Meanwhile, Ostap’s mother is approaching the paws of the gloomy Satanist Crowley, in whose treasury, by a mysterious coincidence, there is also a scepter ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUZiZjWBxuyU1OkKdIGUCldHqm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861126'),
  ('877445215522662734', 'Ostende', 2011, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Laura Citarella, Agustín Mendilaharzu, Soledad Rodríguez', 'Laura Citarella', 'Laura Paredes, Julián Tello, Santiago Gobernori, Debora Dejtiar, Julio Citarella, Fernanda Alarcón, Agustina Liendo, Alberto Suárez', null, 'Waiting alone for her boyfriend at a hotel, a woman starts paying attention to the mysterious behavior of some guests.', 'Waiting alone for her boyfriend at a hotel, a woman starts paying attention to the mysterious behavior of some guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1RBZcYI2SYjEvcJwkF3IZM9T6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313802'),
  ('341936255185081652', 'Ostia', 1970, 'Drama', 'Sergio Citti, Claudio Duccini, Furio Cinelli Pancani', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Sergio Citti', 'Laurent Terzieff, Franco Citti, Anita Sanders, Ninetto Davoli, Lamberto Maggiorani, Celestino Compagnoni, Lily Tirinnanzi, Settimio Picone', null, 'Two anarchistic brothers live by petty thievery and try to recover from their Catholic upbringing. Bandiera and Rabbino were children when they pushed their drunk of a father out of a window for killing their pet sheep. When a girl is raped by her father, she is brought by young "rescuers" to the home of the two brothers who then watch their friends take advantage of her sexually. The brothers take her in, and the three live happy and celibate if not uneventful lives until the brother''s are sent to jail for stealing.', 'Two anarchistic brothers live by petty thievery and try to recover from their Catholic upbringing. Bandiera and Rabbino were children when they pushed their drunk of a father out of a window for killing their pet sheep. When a girl is raped by her father, she is brought by young "rescuers" to the home of the two brothers who then watch their friends take advantage of her sexually. The brothers take her in, and the three live happy and celibate if not uneventful lives until the brother''s are sent to jail for stealing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sL6MfQBRV7fXF0VXF7DrYm4j05Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150958'),
  ('436504445524650791', 'Ostia', 1987, 'Drama', 'Julian Cole', null, 'Derek Jarman, David Dipnall, Oliver Haden, Dominic Power, Jill Cole, Brendan Gallagher, Christian Jones, Tim Burke', null, 'Ostia is a fascinating short film directed by Julian Cole and produced for the Royal College of Art, which reconstructs the events leading up to the murder of Pier Paolo Pasolini. Ostia relocates the proceedings to London and stars Derek Jarman as Pasolini. The film features an evocative dream sequence which is accompanied by poignant excerpts from Pasolini’s own poetry, as read by Jarman.', 'Ostia is a fascinating short film directed by Julian Cole and produced for the Royal College of Art, which reconstructs the events leading up to the murder of Pier Paolo Pasolini. Ostia relocates the proceedings to London and stars Derek Jarman as Pasolini. The film features an evocative dream sequence which is accompanied by poignant excerpts from Pasolini’s own poetry, as read by Jarman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPJMcPRBqnxJeVlec1HJBKKdFWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285913'),
  ('179445999235138925', 'Ostinato', 2024, 'Animation, Music, Drama', 'Sonia Furier, May-Yun Ong, Rhona Rees', 'Sunita Balsara', 'Gabrielle Kaur Cheema', null, 'In this animated short, a composer realizes that incorporating a discordant tone instead of fighting it creates an unexpectedly beautiful harmony. This short was inspired by writer Sunita Balsara''s experience with tinnitus.', 'In this animated short, a composer realizes that incorporating a discordant tone instead of fighting it creates an unexpectedly beautiful harmony. This short was inspired by writer Sunita Balsara''s experience with tinnitus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sLOREWAOBqboIzGUPnKqW3p4p8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1398283'),
