  ('129649011626508610', 'Oswald the Lucky Rabbit', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Eric Goldberg', null, null, 'G', 'For the first time in nearly 95 years, Oswald stars in an all-new hand-drawn short from Walt Disney Animation Studios in celebration of Disney 100 Years of Wonder!', 'For the first time in nearly 95 years, Oswald stars in an all-new hand-drawn short from Walt Disney Animation Studios in celebration of Disney 100 Years of Wonder!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WMAhNXIa6fMRuQrC3wkGogVh1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1055806'),
  ('960128335685468762', 'Otaku no Video', 1991, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Takeshi Mori, Fusanobu Fujiyama, Shoichi Masuo', 'Hiroyuki Yamaga', 'Koji Tsujitani, Toshiharu Sakurai, Kikuko Inoue, Yuko Kobayashi, Yuri Amano, Akio Otsuka, Shigeru Nakahara, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'A hilarious mockumentary featuring an animated tale of an average person who slowly becomes an otaku (obsessive fanatic) and eventually becomes the "Otaking"! Between story segments, live action interviews with fictional die-hard otakus take place.', 'A hilarious mockumentary featuring an animated tale of an average person who slowly becomes an otaku (obsessive fanatic) and eventually becomes the "Otaking"! Between story segments, live action interviews with fictional die-hard otakus take place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WoWVo7ohWSJqMDGnQmq3AfpSgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45228'),
  ('1133487809601898680', 'Otello', 1986, 'Drama, Music', 'Ennio Guarnieri, Franco Zeffirelli', 'Arrigo Boito', 'Plácido Domingo, Katia Ricciarelli, Justino Díaz, Petra Malakova, Urbano Barberini, Massimo Foschi, Edwin Francis, Sergio Nicolai', null, 'Based on Shakespeare''s play, Verdi''s opera depicts the devastating effects of jealousy, "...the green-eyed monster which doth mock the meat it feeds upon". Believing Otello has promoted the fast-rising Cassio over himself, Iago plots to destroy both Cassio and Otello. Iago convinces the jealous Otello that his beautiful wife Desdemona is unfaithful, and that Cassio is her lover. Jealousy is followed by tragedy, then retribution, "Has Heaven no more thunderbolts?"', 'Based on Shakespeare''s play, Verdi''s opera depicts the devastating effects of jealousy, "...the green-eyed monster which doth mock the meat it feeds upon". Believing Otello has promoted the fast-rising Cassio over himself, Iago plots to destroy both Cassio and Otello. Iago convinces the jealous Otello that his beautiful wife Desdemona is unfaithful, and that Cassio is her lover. Jealousy is followed by tragedy, then retribution, "Has Heaven no more thunderbolts?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emPz3c9jQdH5oJbpSUN7zwXLkin.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198469'),
  ('707545992213406537', 'Othello', 1922, 'Drama', 'Dimitri Buchowetzki', null, 'Emil Jannings, Werner Krauss, Ica von Lenkeffy, Theodor Loos, Ferdinand von Alten, Friedrich Kühne, Magnus Stifter, Lya De Putti', null, 'Based on Shakespeare''s play: The treacherous Iago plans to ruin the life of Othello by provoking him to jealousy.', 'Based on Shakespeare''s play: The treacherous Iago plans to ruin the life of Othello by provoking him to jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bnwbfCbPgclpLe8lyqi9cJoNzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85124'),
  ('671754500310076007', 'Othello', 1951, 'Drama', 'Orson Welles, G.R. Aldo, Anchise Brizzi', 'Jean Sacha', 'Orson Welles, Micheál Mac Liammóir, Robert Coote, Suzanne Cloutier, Hilton Edwards, Nicholas Bruce, Michael Laurence, Fay Compton', null, 'Manipulated by his jealous ensign Iago, the Moorish general Othello is driven to believe that his new wife Desdemona is unfaithful, setting in motion a chain of deception, jealousy, and violence that leads to tragedy.', 'Manipulated by his jealous ensign Iago, the Moorish general Othello is driven to believe that his new wife Desdemona is unfaithful, setting in motion a chain of deception, jealousy, and violence that leads to tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UBPF9ii1ema6XFmMiZcekNTDbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47697'),
  ('1092812254069327052', 'Othello', 1955, 'Drama', 'Sergei Yutkevich, Yevgeni Andrikanis, Boris Aretskiy', 'Sergei Yutkevich', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Irina Skobtseva, Andrei Popov, Vladimir Soshalsky, Yevgeni Vesnik, Antonina Maksimova, Mikhail Troyanovsky, Yevgeni Teterin', null, 'Othello, a celebrated Moorish general, secretly marries Desdemona, angering her noble father and inciting the envious Iago’s hatred. Sent to Cyprus, Othello’s victories are overshadowed by Iago’s manipulations: he frames Desdemona as unfaithful with Othello’s lieutenant Cassio. Consumed by jealousy, Othello murders his wife. Discovering Iago’s treachery too late, Othello kills himself as Cyprus learns the bitter truth.', 'Othello, a celebrated Moorish general, secretly marries Desdemona, angering her noble father and inciting the envious Iago’s hatred. Sent to Cyprus, Othello’s victories are overshadowed by Iago’s manipulations: he frames Desdemona as unfaithful with Othello’s lieutenant Cassio. Consumed by jealousy, Othello murders his wife. Discovering Iago’s treachery too late, Othello kills himself as Cyprus learns the bitter truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qABIm2heBHVg5UfQNIrw1LTce9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46708'),
  ('862004015544578556', 'Othello', 1965, 'Drama', 'Stuart Burge, Geoffrey Unsworth', null, 'Frank Finlay, Laurence Olivier, Maggie Smith, Joyce Redman, Derek Jacobi, Robert Lang, Anthony Nicholls, Kenneth MacKintosh', 'PG', 'General Othello''s marriage is destroyed when vengeful Ensign Iago convinces him that his new wife has been unfaithful.', 'General Othello''s marriage is destroyed when vengeful Ensign Iago convinces him that his new wife has been unfaithful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7If3MBeG5LH0iUScL5ddqB0qB3q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44006'),
  ('393953748884116260', 'Othello', 1981, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Miller', null, 'Anthony Hopkins, Anthony Pedley, Bob Hoskins, Geoffrey Chater, Alexander Davion, David Yelland, Joseph O''Conor, Peter Walmsley', null, 'Iago and a comrade-in-arms are outside the Venice home of Desdemona''s father, who does not yet know that she has eloped with Othello. Iago confides to his friend -- who had hoped to marry Desdemona -- that he serves Othello to further his own ends. Venice needs Othello to protect its commercial interests in Cyprus where the Turkish fleet is headed. Desdemona insists on going to Cyprus, too. In Cyprus, Iago plots to convince Othello that Desdemona has betrayed him with Cassio. A lot more than political ambition seems to be motivating Iago.', 'Iago and a comrade-in-arms are outside the Venice home of Desdemona''s father, who does not yet know that she has eloped with Othello. Iago confides to his friend -- who had hoped to marry Desdemona -- that he serves Othello to further his own ends. Venice needs Othello to protect its commercial interests in Cyprus where the Turkish fleet is headed. Desdemona insists on going to Cyprus, too. In Cyprus, Iago plots to convince Othello that Desdemona has betrayed him with Cassio. A lot more than political ambition seems to be motivating Iago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knAMKyQ8ntGpE2xL36xPAQuOV96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119928'),
  ('925847412288082163', 'Othello', 1995, 'Drama', 'Oliver Parker, David Johnson, Sara Desmond', 'Oliver Parker', 'Laurence Fishburne, Irène Jacob, Kenneth Branagh, Nathaniel Parker, Michael Maloney, Anna Patrick, Nicholas Farrell, Indra Ové', 'R', 'The evil Iago pretends to be friend of Othello in order to manipulate him to serve his own end in the film version of this Shakespeare classic.', 'The evil Iago pretends to be friend of Othello in order to manipulate him to serve his own end in the film version of this Shakespeare classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyevuYzW36wKadiE8lftLac5VwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16420'),
  ('429778057661099526', 'Othello', 2026, 'Drama', 'Tom Morris, Bethan Mary-James, Anna Cooper', 'William Shakespeare', 'David Harewood, Toby Jones, Caitlin FitzGerald, Vinette Robinson, Luke Treadaway', null, 'Moorish general Othello is manipulated into thinking that his new wife Desdemona has been carrying on an affair with his lieutenant Michael Cassio when in reality it''s all part of a scheme orchestrated by bitter ensign Iago. Filmed live at the Theatre Royal Haymarket in London especially for the big screen.', 'Moorish general Othello is manipulated into thinking that his new wife Desdemona has been carrying on an affair with his lieutenant Michael Cassio when in reality it''s all part of a scheme orchestrated by bitter ensign Iago. Filmed live at the Theatre Royal Haymarket in London especially for the big screen.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbjpqdwQz9EQu8dXaIXl3Gi4sdi8.jpg', 'plex:movie:othello-2026-1'),
  ('483660733325395185', 'Other', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'David Moreau, Julien Ramirez Hernan', 'David Moreau', 'Olga Kurylenko, Jean Schatz, Lola Bonaventure, Jacqueline Ghaye, Sasha Nugent, Philip Schurer, Ange Nawasadio, Julie Maes', null, 'Alice returns home after her mother''s death to find the house unchanged-and haunted by a dark presence. As fear builds, buried trauma resurfaces, and a terrifying truth is revealed.', 'Alice returns home after her mother''s death to find the house unchanged-and haunted by a dark presence. As fear builds, buried trauma resurfaces, and a terrifying truth is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fo4Ew0RjP0FkFscmXbyJLGachOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1314452'),
  ('120840091976496354', 'Other Cannibals', 2021, 'Drama', 'Francesco Sossai', 'Adriano Candiago', 'Walter Giroldini, Diego Pagotto', null, 'This utterly surprising debut gets cinematically richer with every twist and turn – allowing for moments of fabulously deranged buddy comedy, touching a sense of Western, always staying true to being a descent into the abyss of the human mind and desire.', 'This utterly surprising debut gets cinematically richer with every twist and turn – allowing for moments of fabulously deranged buddy comedy, touching a sense of Western, always staying true to being a descent into the abyss of the human mind and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ucPcKcXxnViBizAlW0NiFXQkzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884787'),
  ('735623271516952023', 'Other Men''s Women', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, Barney McGill', 'Maude Fulton', 'Grant Withers, Mary Astor, Regis Toomey, James Cagney, Fred Kohler, J. Farrell MacDonald, Joan Blondell, Lillian Worth', 'NR', 'The friendship of two working stiff railroad engineers is put to the test when one falls for the other’s wife.', 'The friendship of two working stiff railroad engineers is put to the test when one falls for the other’s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nViV5hSzDvnGsow8MIpp5J1idjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33001'),
  ('908411783793745847', 'Other People', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chris Kelly, Brian Burgoyne, Jake Martin', 'Chris Kelly', 'Jesse Plemons, Molly Shannon, Bradley Whitford, Maude Apatow, Madisen Beaty, John Early, Zach Woods, Josie Totah', 'NR', 'David, a struggling comedy writer fresh off from breaking up with his boyfriend, moves from New York City to Sacramento to help his sick mother. Living with his conservative father and much-younger sisters for the first time in ten years, he feels like a stranger in his childhood home. As his mother’s health declines, David frantically tries to extract meaning from this horrible experience and convince everyone (including himself) that he''s "doing okay.”', 'David, a struggling comedy writer fresh off from breaking up with his boyfriend, moves from New York City to Sacramento to help his sick mother. Living with his conservative father and much-younger sisters for the first time in ten years, he feels like a stranger in his childhood home. As his mother’s health declines, David frantically tries to extract meaning from this horrible experience and convince everyone (including himself) that he''s "doing okay.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JgG3p4FY0fNSgJneNWnVno7X9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371449'),
  ('1148838740665553831', 'Other People''s Children', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marine Longuet, Michaël Ben Hammouda, Mikaël Gaudin', 'Rebecca Zlotowski', 'Virginie Efira, Roschdy Zem, Chiara Mastroianni, Callie Ferreira-Goncalves, Yamée Couture, Henri-Noël Tabary, Victor Lefebvre, Sébastien Pouderoux', 'NR', 'Rachel loves her life, her students, her friends, her ex, her guitar lessons. When she falls in love with Ali, she grows close to his 4-year-old daughter, Leila. She tucks her in, looks after her, and loves her like a mother... which she isn’t. Not yet. Rachel is 40. The desire for a family of her own is growing stronger, and the clock is ticking. Is it too late?', 'Rachel loves her life, her students, her friends, her ex, her guitar lessons. When she falls in love with Ali, she grows close to his 4-year-old daughter, Leila. She tucks her in, looks after her, and loves her like a mother... which she isn’t. Not yet. Rachel is 40. The desire for a family of her own is growing stronger, and the clock is ticking. Is it too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oDu0n0vc7D3t3RhxHDrT0Ezcoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803694'),
  ('426829880832541195', 'Other People''s Letters', 1975, 'Drama', 'Ilya Averbakh, Dmitriy Dolinin, Eduard Vanunts', 'Natalya Ryazantseva', 'Irina Kupchenko, Svetlana Smirnova, Oleg Yankovskiy, Ivan Bortnik, Zinaida Sharko, Maya Bulgakova, Anatoliy Gorin, Sergey Kovalenkov', null, 'Zina is sixteen. She is a manipulative schoolgirl living in a small Russian town among sincere and simple people. Zina is nice on the surface, but so unable to enjoy normal life, that she is desperately trying to hurt someone. She tries to seduce and compromise a handsome young man, but he is smart enough to see through her and escapes from her trap. Zina manipulates her classmates so she looks like a victim. Now Zina''s teacher, Vera, a sweet and loving lady, takes care of her trying to save the troubled girl, but in return, Zina becomes extremely crafty to hurt the teacher.', 'Zina is sixteen. She is a manipulative schoolgirl living in a small Russian town among sincere and simple people. Zina is nice on the surface, but so unable to enjoy normal life, that she is desperately trying to hurt someone. She tries to seduce and compromise a handsome young man, but he is smart enough to see through her and escapes from her trap. Zina manipulates her classmates so she looks like a victim. Now Zina''s teacher, Vera, a sweet and loving lady, takes care of her trying to save the troubled girl, but in return, Zina becomes extremely crafty to hurt the teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1tOY6qxU1gcstpy1yhzviuRttc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74500'),
  ('1143587333430964919', 'Other People''s Money', 1978, 'Drama', 'Christian de Chalonge', null, 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Catherine Deneuve, Claude Brasseur, Michel Serrault, François Perrot, Gérard Séty, Jean Leuvrais, Umberto Orsini', null, 'Henri Rainier has everything a man could want. A glamorous wife, two beautiful daughters and a well-paid job with a large bank. Then, one day, his entire world collapses. In the wake of a high-profile financial scandal, he is summoned into his director''s office and accused of negligence. Rainier has no choice but to resign, but he soon realises that he has been made a scapegoat. He begins his own investigation in an attempt to clear his name and discover who is responsible for the enormous hole in the bank''s finances. It soon becomes apparent that he is up against a very powerful and dangerous opponent.', 'Henri Rainier has everything a man could want. A glamorous wife, two beautiful daughters and a well-paid job with a large bank. Then, one day, his entire world collapses. In the wake of a high-profile financial scandal, he is summoned into his director''s office and accused of negligence. Rainier has no choice but to resign, but he soon realises that he has been made a scapegoat. He begins his own investigation in an attempt to clear his name and discover who is responsible for the enormous hole in the bank''s finances. It soon becomes apparent that he is up against a very powerful and dangerous opponent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mob0QH5DBCqE5CnEmnSjMZ3eTwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78376'),
  ('845682005260302588', 'Other People''s Money', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Norman Jewison, Haskell Wexler', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Danny DeVito, Gregory Peck, Penelope Ann Miller, Piper Laurie, Dean Jones, R. D. Call, Mo Gaffney, Bette Henritze', 'R', 'When a corporate raider threatens a hostile takeover of a ''mom and pop'' company, the patriarch of the company enlists the help of his wife''s attractive daughter—who is a lawyer—to stop the takeover. However, the raider soon becomes infatuated with her, and enjoys the legal manoeuvring as he tries to win her heart.', 'When a corporate raider threatens a hostile takeover of a ''mom and pop'' company, the patriarch of the company enlists the help of his wife''s attractive daughter—who is a lawyer—to stop the takeover. However, the raider soon becomes infatuated with her, and enjoys the legal manoeuvring as he tries to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obnOuFa2yJRorRM3rab3rXZFfEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6463'),
  ('283460447416832728', 'Other Side of the Box', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Caleb J. Phillips', 'Nick Tag, Caleb J. Phillips', 'Tyler Pochop, Teagan Rose, Josh Schell, Nick Tag', null, 'A couple receives a mysterious package from an old friend.', 'A couple receives a mysterious package from an old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urrCNl6jz5h1xIm0JZk0Dn5SEUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595801'),
  ('307630319228907165', 'Other Worlds', 1999, 'Animation, Romance, Drama', 'Makoto Shinkai, Makoto Shinkai', 'Makoto Shinkai', null, null, 'A man and a woman, talking over their relationship.', 'A man and a woman, talking over their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHWfz63P72VSVfKggFFJPH2VqmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73799'),
  ('754499717305281845', 'Other Worlds', 2004, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Jan Kounen', null, 'Jan Kounen', null, 'The secrets about unlocking the mysteries of consciousness by plant-drugs. The related chances and risks involved in this shamanism. While filming Blueberry, the Secret Experience, Jan Kounen met the Shipibo healers of the Peruvian Amazon and discovered their sacred plant: Ayahuasca, the spirit vine. Deeply affected by this experience, he decided to return to Peru to shoot a documentary on the plant and the medicinal rites of the shamans. To this end, he filmed the natives but also met neurologists, philosophers, artists, and chemists working on this subject. He notably interviewed Jean Giraud, the illustrator of Blueberry, and Kary Mullis, winner of the 1993 Nobel Prize in Chemistry. More than a traditional documentary, the film is an invitation to travel, a half-open door to another world or another perception of reality. The secrets about unlocking the mysteries of consciousness by plant-drugs. The related chances and risks involved in this shamanism.', 'The secrets about unlocking the mysteries of consciousness by plant-drugs. The related chances and risks involved in this shamanism. While filming Blueberry, the Secret Experience, Jan Kounen met the Shipibo healers of the Peruvian Amazon and discovered their sacred plant: Ayahuasca, the spirit vine. Deeply affected by this experience, he decided to return to Peru to shoot a documentary on the plant and the medicinal rites of the shamans. To this end, he filmed the natives but also met neurologists, philosophers, artists, and chemists working on this subject. He notably interviewed Jean Giraud, the illustrator of Blueberry, and Kary Mullis, winner of the 1993 Nobel Prize in Chemistry. More than a traditional documentary, the film is an invitation to travel, a half-open door to another world or another perception of reality. The secrets about unlocking the mysteries of consciousness by plant-drugs. The related chances and risks involved in this shamanism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4dutkplAO2THfbQ2gW1gaNM9zo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104718'),
  ('345284162013890516', 'Otherhood', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Cindy Chupack, Declan Quinn, Urs Hirschbiegel', 'Cindy Chupack, Mark Andrus', 'Angela Bassett, Patricia Arquette, Felicity Huffman, Jake Hoffman, Jake Lacy, Sinqua Walls, Heidi Gardner, Frank De Julio', 'R', 'Feeling forgotten on Mother''s Day, three best friends leave the suburbs and drive to New York City to surprise their adult sons.', 'Feeling forgotten on Mother''s Day, three best friends leave the suburbs and drive to New York City to surprise their adult sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qVErJgfMcg3TzfYcrbaXBcrXV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531509'),
  ('1022291719250365418', 'OtherLife', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Mystery', 'Ben C. Lucas, Dan Freene, Michael Faranda', 'Kelley Eskridge, Tommaso Fiacchino, Lucas Howe', 'Jessica De Gouw, T.J. Power, Thomas Cocquerel, Tiriel Mora, Liam Graham, Adriane Daff, Clarence John Ryan, Hoa Xuande', null, 'Ren Amari is the driven inventor of a revolutionary new drug. OtherLife expands the brain''s sense of time and creates virtual reality directly in the user''s mind. With OtherLife, mere seconds in real life feel like hours or days of exciting adventures. As Ren and her colleagues race around the clock to launch OtherLife, the government muscles in to use the drugs as a radical solution to prison overcrowding. They will create virtual cells where criminals serve long sentences in just minutes of real time. When Ren resists, she finds herself an unwilling guinea pig trapped in a prison cell in her mind. She must escape before she descends into madness, and then regain control of OtherLife before others suffer the same fate.', 'Ren Amari is the driven inventor of a revolutionary new drug. OtherLife expands the brain''s sense of time and creates virtual reality directly in the user''s mind. With OtherLife, mere seconds in real life feel like hours or days of exciting adventures. As Ren and her colleagues race around the clock to launch OtherLife, the government muscles in to use the drugs as a radical solution to prison overcrowding. They will create virtual cells where criminals serve long sentences in just minutes of real time. When Ren resists, she finds herself an unwilling guinea pig trapped in a prison cell in her mind. She must escape before she descends into madness, and then regain control of OtherLife before others suffer the same fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stSDsKsb4fS6NPzuHwfAWD2jim8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411999'),
  ('219939101770740907', 'Othon', 1971, 'Drama', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub, Renato Berta', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Adriano Aprà, Anne Brumagne, Ennio Lauricella, Olimpia Carlisi, Anthony Pensabene, Jean-Marie Straub, Jean-Claude Biette, Marilù Parolini', null, 'Straub-Huillet’s first color film, adapts a lesser-known Corneille tragedy from 1664, which in turn was based on an episode of imperial court intrigue chronicled in Tacitus’s Histories. The costuming is classical, and the toga-clad, nonprofessional cast performs the drama’s original French text amid the ruins of Rome’s Palatine Hill while the noise of contemporary urban life hums in the background. Their lines are executed with a terrific flatness and frequently through heavy accents; the language in Othon becomes not merely an expression but a thing itself, an element whose plainness here alerts us to qualities of the work that might otherwise be subordinated.', 'Straub-Huillet’s first color film, adapts a lesser-known Corneille tragedy from 1664, which in turn was based on an episode of imperial court intrigue chronicled in Tacitus’s Histories. The costuming is classical, and the toga-clad, nonprofessional cast performs the drama’s original French text amid the ruins of Rome’s Palatine Hill while the noise of contemporary urban life hums in the background. Their lines are executed with a terrific flatness and frequently through heavy accents; the language in Othon becomes not merely an expression but a thing itself, an element whose plainness here alerts us to qualities of the work that might otherwise be subordinated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wT4ds84b3GHliriwIbBPdKA6gy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198598'),
  ('452753400198500484', 'OTIS', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Tony Krantz, Thomas Yatsko, Richard J. Levin', 'Erik Jendresen, Thomas Schnauz', 'Bostin Christopher, Ashley Johnson, Daniel Stern, Illeana Douglas, Kevin Pollak, Jere Burns, Jared Kusnitz, Tarah Paige', 'R', 'After being captured and tortured by the psychopath Otis, teen cheerleader Riley Lawson escapes and informs her parents, who quickly sidestep sluggish FBI agents and take matters into their own hands. But the Lawsons'' revenge plan hits a snag when Otis''s unusual brother enters the picture.', 'After being captured and tortured by the psychopath Otis, teen cheerleader Riley Lawson escapes and informs her parents, who quickly sidestep sluggish FBI agents and take matters into their own hands. But the Lawsons'' revenge plan hits a snag when Otis''s unusual brother enters the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDujIe7PxXxxkWK844sCTkwqxCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15527'),
  ('5200454220183599', 'Otley', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Dick Clement, Dominic Fulford, Austin Dempster', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'Tom Courtenay, Romy Schneider, Alan Badel, James Villiers, Leonard Rossiter, James Bolam, Fiona Lewis, Freddie Jones', null, 'A petty crook finds himself mistaken for a murderer and a secret agent.', 'A petty crook finds himself mistaken for a murderer and a secret agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YpOYG8r2pQDvbkSyd51ArY4x5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4374'),
  ('793716442158406975', 'Ottilie von Faber-Castell - Eine mutige Frau', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Claudia Garde, Felix Cramer', 'Claudia Garde', 'Kristin Suckow, Martin Wuttke, Johannes Zirner, Hannes Wegener, Eleonore Weisgerber, Maren Eggert, Jasmin Schwiers, Lena Klenke', null, 'Head of the famous pencil corporation tries to make his 16 year old granddaughter ready to take his place.', 'Head of the famous pencil corporation tries to make his 16 year old granddaughter ready to take his place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dJ9ZGAiupD0opDzSuMNIT632ds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631210'),
  ('125632805965548742', 'Otto - The Disaster Movie', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Edzard Onneken, Wolfgang Treu', 'Bernd Eilert, Otto Waalkes, Michel Bergmann', 'Otto Waalkes, Eva Haßmann, Reiner Schöne, Michael Schweighöfer, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Steffen Münster, Tilly Lauenstein, Wilfried Hochholdinger', null, 'A man from Ostfriesland travels to Hamburg and sets course for America on a steamship to conquer this New World as well. What he leaves behind is a swath of devastation, a breach of confusion, a Milky Way full of music, a dead end full of mad jokes and perhaps a touch too much wordplay at the expense of others. But what is worst of all: he has also made a film about it!', 'A man from Ostfriesland travels to Hamburg and sets course for America on a steamship to conquer this New World as well. What he leaves behind is a swath of devastation, a breach of confusion, a Milky Way full of music, a dead end full of mad jokes and perhaps a touch too much wordplay at the expense of others. But what is worst of all: he has also made a film about it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIiaNNye4iFslWcohJtiqkLyWth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9883'),
  ('849406279651830640', 'Otto - The Movie', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Xaver Schwarzenberger, Xaver Schwarzenberger, Michael Stöger', 'Otto Waalkes, Robert Gernhardt, Bernd Eilert', 'Otto Waalkes, Elisabeth Wiedemann, Sky du Mont, Jessika Cardinahl, Peter Kuiper, Andreas Mannkopff, Gottfried John, Karl Lieffen', null, 'East Friesian Otto moves to the big city Hamburg. There he gets into trouble with a loan shark and needs to find a way to impress his love interest Silvia.', 'East Friesian Otto moves to the big city Hamburg. There he gets into trouble with a loan shark and needs to find a way to impress his love interest Silvia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iE6qrXexeZfjV5PtUeKEbgJSCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9657'),
  ('924725629145256075', 'Otto - The Romance Film', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Otto Waalkes, Wolfgang Treu', 'Bernd Eilert, Robert Gernhardt, Peter Knorr', 'Otto Waalkes, Jessika Cardinahl, Peter Schiff, Lonny Kellner, Juraj Kukura, Ralf Wolter, Ruth-Maria Kubitschek, Ingolf Lück', null, 'Cupid, the God of love, gets the order to unite two people. On Earth, Otto fails as a street musician because his guitar breaks. While buying a new string, his hand gets stuck in the purse of Tina, who works at the Dr. Bayerle beauty farm. When she enters the subway, the purse is teared off and Otto is hit by Cupid''s arrow. Now he wants to give back her purse at the doctor''s conference.', 'Cupid, the God of love, gets the order to unite two people. On Earth, Otto fails as a street musician because his guitar breaks. While buying a new string, his hand gets stuck in the purse of Tina, who works at the Dr. Bayerle beauty farm. When she enters the subway, the purse is teared off and Otto is hit by Cupid''s arrow. Now he wants to give back her purse at the doctor''s conference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koO3NOmBxUl6zP06LnAoa2NUY5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9897'),
  ('690763450516335540', 'Otto – The Alien from East Frisia', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Otto Waalkes, Marijan David Vajda, Egon Werdin', null, 'Otto Waalkes, Barbara May, Hans Peter Hallwachs, Volkmar Kleinert, Arnold Marquis, Christine Neubauer, Hansi Jochmann, Vicco von Bülow', null, 'Otto is the only one who is able to save his Frisian fatherland; but he needs the help of his brother, who is abroad. But his brother does not want to fulfill what he has sworn as a child. So it takes Otto a while to convince him while time is running low for his plans to save East-Frisia.', 'Otto is the only one who is able to save his Frisian fatherland; but he needs the help of his brother, who is abroad. But his brother does not want to fulfill what he has sworn as a child. So it takes Otto a while to convince him while time is running low for his plans to save East-Frisia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM89lVuj3qRu0q4e7N4ZyCd1GHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9379'),
  ('669924384956124776', 'Otto – The New Movie', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Michael Stöger, Xaver Schwarzenberger, Otto Waalkes', 'Otto Waalkes, Peter Knorr, Bernd Eilert', 'Otto Waalkes, Anja Jaenicke, Ute Sander, Friedrich Schoenfelder, Dirk Dautzenberg, Joachim Kemmer, Georg Blumensaat, Ronald Nitschke', null, 'Otto is Friesland''s answer to Rambo and stands between two worlds, two women and two animals. While he''s trying to cure a dog with bite inhibition and a cat with suicidal tendencies, the dream of his sleepless nights crosses his path: Gaby. Otto falls instantly in love, but Gaby thinks only of Amboss, a real guy with muscles of steel and a brain of rubber. Well, Otto on the other hand is not exactly well built and attractive. But he''s determined to get the lady''s attention, even if it means taking part in body-building competitions...', 'Otto is Friesland''s answer to Rambo and stands between two worlds, two women and two animals. While he''s trying to cure a dog with bite inhibition and a cat with suicidal tendencies, the dream of his sleepless nights crosses his path: Gaby. Otto falls instantly in love, but Gaby thinks only of Amboss, a real guy with muscles of steel and a brain of rubber. Well, Otto on the other hand is not exactly well built and attractive. But he''s determined to get the lady''s attention, even if it means taking part in body-building competitions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqdAKOsVczoZ82mxShIZEBBTtTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9252'),
  ('309939618370758510', 'Otto; or, Up with Dead People', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy', 'Bruce LaBruce', 'Bruce LaBruce', 'Jey Crisfar, Katharina Klewinghaus, Susanne Sachße, Marcel Schlutt, Gio Black Peter, Guido Sommer, Christophe Chemin, Max Di Costanzo', null, 'A young zombie named Otto appears on a remote highway. He has no idea where he came from or where he is going. After hitching a ride to Berlin and nesting in an abandoned amusement park, he begins to explore the city. Soon he is discovered by underground filmmaker Medea Yarn, who begins to make a documentary about him with the support of her girlfriend, Hella Bent, and her brother Adolf, who operates the camera. Meanwhile, Medea is still trying to finish Up with Dead People, the epic political-porno-zombie movie that she has been working on for years. She convinces its star, Fritz Fritze, to allow the vulnerable Otto to stay in his guest bedroom. When Otto discovers that he has a wallet that contains information about his past, before he was dead, he begins to remember details about his ex-boyfriend, Rudolf. He arranges to meet him at the schoolyard where they met, with devastating results.', 'A young zombie named Otto appears on a remote highway. He has no idea where he came from or where he is going. After hitching a ride to Berlin and nesting in an abandoned amusement park, he begins to explore the city. Soon he is discovered by underground filmmaker Medea Yarn, who begins to make a documentary about him with the support of her girlfriend, Hella Bent, and her brother Adolf, who operates the camera. Meanwhile, Medea is still trying to finish Up with Dead People, the epic political-porno-zombie movie that she has been working on for years. She convinces its star, Fritz Fritze, to allow the vulnerable Otto to stay in his guest bedroom. When Otto discovers that he has a wallet that contains information about his past, before he was dead, he begins to remember details about his ex-boyfriend, Rudolf. He arranges to meet him at the schoolyard where they met, with devastating results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGmyTOXACi6Va1RX5pqCCQgckss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26901'),
  ('714604068355950299', 'Otto''s Eleven', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr., Peter von Haller', 'Bernd Eilert, Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Otto Waalkes, Max Giermann, Arnd Schimkat, Jasmin Schwiers, Martin Hentschel, Sky du Mont, Olli Dittrich, Sara Nuru', null, 'Otto is a man from a little German island, where he lives together with his friends. He gets his treasure, an expensive painting, stolen by a casino owner and his female assistent, so Otto starts travelling to the main land with his friends. Will he get it back?', 'Otto is a man from a little German island, where he lives together with his friends. He gets his treasure, an expensive painting, stolen by a casino owner and his female assistent, so Otto starts travelling to the main land with his friends. Will he get it back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2IXELil9YXgR9Vt7b9p0dteONv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49998'),
  ('177627572547465005', 'Ouija', 2004, 'Horror', 'Juan Pedro Ortega García, Gaizka Bourgeaud', 'Carmen Abarca', 'Núria Font, Jaume Garcia, Montse Mostaza, Carles Olivella, Ricard Sales', null, 'Clara, an attractive young journalism student, has just arrived in town where she will spend her holidays. Shortly after arriving she meets Victor, a passion for the occult that quickly will be fascinated by the charms of her new friend. Together they form a group of young people coming together to live a fun experience while dangerous: make a Ouija session', 'Clara, an attractive young journalism student, has just arrived in town where she will spend her holidays. Shortly after arriving she meets Victor, a passion for the occult that quickly will be fascinated by the charms of her new friend. Together they form a group of young people coming together to live a fun experience while dangerous: make a Ouija session', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnlkSCf59tHnKSfQBbFI50xGWhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143470'),
  ('68722688034637630', 'Ouija', 2014, 'Horror', 'James Moran, Gregory J. Pawlik Jr., Eric Glasser', 'Juliet Snowden, Stiles White', 'Daren Kagasoff, Matthew Settle, Olivia Cooke, Ana Coto, Shelley Hennig, Bianca A. Santos, Douglas Smith, Robyn Lively', 'PG-13', 'A group of friends must confront their most terrifying fears when they awaken the dark powers of an ancient spirit board.', 'A group of friends must confront their most terrifying fears when they awaken the dark powers of an ancient spirit board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwjHlGjK2xXKpjd65BWyAMwzTWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242512'),
  ('59632970899831294', 'Ouija House', 2018, 'Horror', 'Ben Demaree, Ben Demaree', 'Justin Hawkins, Jeff Miller', 'Mischa Barton, Tara Reid, Carly Schroeder, Dee Wallace, Chris Mulkey, Mark Grossman, Grace Demarco, Derrick A. King', null, 'A graduate student, who is trying to finish the last of her research on a book project that she hopes will help her down-on-her-luck mother, brings friends to a house with a dark past, where they soon unwittingly summon an evil entity who makes the house part of its game…', 'A graduate student, who is trying to finish the last of her research on a book project that she hopes will help her down-on-her-luck mother, brings friends to a house with a dark past, where they soon unwittingly summon an evil entity who makes the house part of its game…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meXl6V5ifDJsiOGCZGOeu4N5rGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501851'),
  ('208738870252328938', 'Ouija Shark', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Brett Kelly, John Migliore', 'David A. Lloyd', 'Steph Goodwin, Zoe Towne, Robin Hodge, Christina Roman, Amy Osborne, John Migliore, Peter Whittaker, Chad Walls', null, 'A group of teenage girls summon an ancient man-eating shark after messing with a spirit board that washes up on the beach. An occult specialist must enter the shark''s realm to rid this world of the deadly spirit ghost once and for all.', 'A group of teenage girls summon an ancient man-eating shark after messing with a spirit board that washes up on the beach. An occult specialist must enter the shark''s realm to rid this world of the deadly spirit ghost once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTyIyX2r0hWfwPYyPzUnu7KgoBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674482'),
  ('93215638639686880', 'Ouija Warehouse', 2021, 'Horror', 'Israel Luna, Abby Joy, Bryce Henderson', 'Israel Luna', 'Abby Joy, Angel Rose Keeley, Kristin Keith, Suha Kim, Swisyzinna, Chaselyn Wade', null, 'As some friends prepare a birthday party in a warehouse, Kay and best friend Noah find a Ouija board in a storage room. They try to contact the spirits of the dead, and strange things begin to happen.', 'As some friends prepare a birthday party in a warehouse, Kay and best friend Noah find a Ouija board in a storage room. They try to contact the spirits of the dead, and strange things begin to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybRF4TLvBsdVyUZGaPaoC0pd3TG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842715'),
  ('104032995774800903', 'Ouija: Origin of Evil', 2016, 'Horror', 'Mike Flanagan, Michael Fimognari, Phil DeSanti', 'Mike Flanagan, Jeff Howard', 'Parker Mack, Annalise Basso, Elizabeth Reaser, Lulu Wilson, Henry Thomas, Halle Charlton, Alexis G. Zall, Doug Jones', 'PG-13', 'In 1967 Los Angeles, a widowed mother and her two daughters add a new stunt to bolster their séance scam business and unwittingly invite authentic evil into their home. When the youngest daughter is overtaken by the merciless spirit, this small family confronts unthinkable fears to save her and send her possessor back to the other side.', 'In 1967 Los Angeles, a widowed mother and her two daughters add a new stunt to bolster their séance scam business and unwittingly invite authentic evil into their home. When the youngest daughter is overtaken by the merciless spirit, this small family confronts unthinkable fears to save her and send her possessor back to the other side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwynHc2RrOFaplYMMpQRpr3TIA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335796'),
  ('917558593648985969', 'Our 30-Minute Sessions', 2020, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Music, Comedy', 'Kentaro Hagiwara, Keisuke Imamura, Hisayoshi Yamashita', 'Satomi Oshima', 'Mackenyu, Takumi Kitamura, Sayu Kubota, Shono Hayama, Shuhei Uesugi, Sho Kiyohara, Riho Makise, Michitaka Tsutsui', null, 'College student Sota picks up a cassette tape left behind by musician Aki when he died a year ago. When the tape is played back, Aki takes over Sota''s body for just 30 minutes. They share the same body and rush to reunite a band that split up and bring a smile to Aki''s girlfriend Kana''s face.', 'College student Sota picks up a cassette tape left behind by musician Aki when he died a year ago. When the tape is played back, Aki takes over Sota''s body for just 30 minutes. They share the same body and rush to reunite a band that split up and bring a smile to Aki''s girlfriend Kana''s face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ki8xBZJ20XyNBR6QsBon3o2puCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700173'),
  ('1113465332872389464', 'Our Beloved Month of August', 2008, 'Music, Romance', 'Miguel Gomes, Rui Poças', 'Miguel Gomes, Mariana Ricardo, Telmo Churro', 'Sónia Bandeira, Fábio Oliveira, Joaquim Carvalho, Andreia Santos, Armando Nunes, Manuel Soares, Emmanuelle Fèvre, Paulo Moleiro', null, 'In the heart of Portugal, amid the mountains, the month of August is abuzz with people and activity...', 'In the heart of Portugal, amid the mountains, the month of August is abuzz with people and activity...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlYXLt0ZOki0fVNWOXVk9qBZ3UH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54384'),
  ('281137532244893713', 'Our Betters', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'George Cukor, Charles Rosher, Fred Spencer', 'Jane Murfin, Harry Wagstaff Gribble', 'Constance Bennett, Violet Kemble Cooper, Phoebe Foster, Grant Mitchell, Charles Starrett, Anita Louise, Gilbert Roland, Tyrell Davis', 'NR', 'Soon after being wed, American heiress Lady Pearl Grayston realizes her husband has married her for her money and is keeping a mistress. The two maintain a loveless marriage, a trade-off Pearl accepts in order to gain admittance to her husband''s aristocratic social circle. While Pearl pursues her own affair with gigolo Pepi D''Costa, her visiting sister, Bessie, arrives and is appalled when Pearl''s arrangement is revealed.', 'Soon after being wed, American heiress Lady Pearl Grayston realizes her husband has married her for her money and is keeping a mistress. The two maintain a loveless marriage, a trade-off Pearl accepts in order to gain admittance to her husband''s aristocratic social circle. While Pearl pursues her own affair with gigolo Pepi D''Costa, her visiting sister, Bessie, arrives and is appalled when Pearl''s arrangement is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKm21UgNM5npNwsSu3hMBI4wSj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183886'),
  ('430344448859706759', 'Our Blushing Brides', 1930, 'Drama', 'Harry Beaumont, Douglas Shearer, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Bess Meredyth, John Howard Lawson', 'Joan Crawford, Anita Page, Dorothy Sebastian, Robert Montgomery, Raymond Hackett, John Miljan, Hedda Hopper, Albert Conti', null, 'Gerry, Connie, and Franky are small-town girls seeking wealthy husbands in New York City. But, while Connie and Franky are reckless with their affections — one bedding a married man and the other marrying a scoundrel — Gerry is determined to remain practical. As she mothers her wounded, heartbroken friends, she stalwartly but foolishly resists the advances of the good-hearted and affluent Tony Jardine.', 'Gerry, Connie, and Franky are small-town girls seeking wealthy husbands in New York City. But, while Connie and Franky are reckless with their affections — one bedding a married man and the other marrying a scoundrel — Gerry is determined to remain practical. As she mothers her wounded, heartbroken friends, she stalwartly but foolishly resists the advances of the good-hearted and affluent Tony Jardine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8TVe7RkB2ZHgJdGINTG3hp9KAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156320'),
  ('724076164103338501', 'Our Body', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kim Ju-il, Lee Seong-eun, Han Ka-ram', 'Han Ka-ram', 'Moon Choi, Ahn Ji-hye, Kim Jung-young, Lee Jae-in, Choi Jun-young, Noh Susanna, Oh Dong-min, Kim Sa-Kwon', null, 'A woman becomes disenchanted with life after years of studying for an important exam. One lonely evening, she encounters a beautiful, disciplined woman and becomes fascinated with emulating her lifestyle.', 'A woman becomes disenchanted with life after years of studying for an important exam. One lonely evening, she encounters a beautiful, disciplined woman and becomes fascinated with emulating her lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvYwBgkw1ss3vOo8g7QnP76ggvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545937'),
  ('678913085681721719', 'Our Body', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Claire Simon, Claire Simon, Clara François', null, 'Claire Simon', null, 'In a Parisian public hospital, Claire Simon questions what it means to live in women’s bodies, filming their diversity, singularity and their beauty in all stages throughout life. Unique stories of desires, fears and struggles unfold, including the one of the filmmaker herself.', 'In a Parisian public hospital, Claire Simon questions what it means to live in women’s bodies, filming their diversity, singularity and their beauty in all stages throughout life. Unique stories of desires, fears and struggles unfold, including the one of the filmmaker herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pq960yBVZkp2CBnjO6j6utHEhhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000495'),
  ('456825573579142871', 'Our Brand Is Crisis', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Gordon Green, Tim Orr, Kelly Curley', 'Peter Straughan', 'Sandra Bullock, Anthony Mackie, Billy Bob Thornton, Zoe Kazan, Scoot McNairy, Ann Dowd, Joaquim de Almeida, Reynaldo Pacheco', 'R', 'Based on the documentary "Our Brand Is Crisis", this feature focuses on the use of American political campaign strategies in South America.', 'Based on the documentary "Our Brand Is Crisis", this feature focuses on the use of American political campaign strategies in South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE7oaFegUgfBC0FMZbHdwB9I1lC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10317'),
  ('625988449519137869', 'Our Brothers', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Guillaume Deffontaines, Corentin Thomas', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Kaouther Adimi', 'Reda Kateb, Lyna Khoudri, Raphaël Personnaz, Samir Guesmi, Adam Amara, Laïs Salameh, Wabinlé Nabié, Gérard Watkins', null, 'Inspired by the story of Malik Oussekine, an affair of police violence which is believed to have caused the death of 22-year-old Malik Oussekine on the night of 5-6 December 1986, following several weeks of student protests against a university reform bill', 'Inspired by the story of Malik Oussekine, an affair of police violence which is believed to have caused the death of 22-year-old Malik Oussekine on the night of 5-6 December 1986, following several weeks of student protests against a university reform bill', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJCDc0KiuYQWIAK4IwOcV2SJbRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962541'),
  ('203873431842940742', 'Our Century', 1983, 'Documentary', 'Artavazd Peleshian, Laert Poghosyan, O. Savin', 'Artavazd Peleshian', null, null, 'A man paves his own way to his own soul through an intellectual quest, tragedies of nations and personal drama. The road moving through the cosmic distances is a flight into one''s internal world. This flight and this drama are revealed in this philosophical film-poem.', 'A man paves his own way to his own soul through an intellectual quest, tragedies of nations and personal drama. The road moving through the cosmic distances is a flight into one''s internal world. This flight and this drama are revealed in this philosophical film-poem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kv8GJ5BLpcIOmyqyiSLt71Y807.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200140'),
  ('362853789480165733', 'Our Children', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joachim Lafosse, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Joachim Lafosse, Thomas Bidegain, Matthieu Reynaert', 'Tahar Rahim, Niels Arestrup, Émilie Dequenne, Stéphane Bissot, Mounia Raoui, Claire Bodson, Jean-Charles Hautera, Daniel Feis', 'NR', 'Young and full of life, Murielle has a promising future ahead of her when she meets and falls head over heels for Mounir. A wedding soon follows, and the happy couple quickly set about preparing to make a family. However, with family come ties, and none come as tight as that between Mounir and his adoptive father. As Murielle continues to bring new life into the family, frictions between Mounir and Doctor Pinget reach boiling point. Helpless to extract her husband and children from the wealthy nest that Doctor Pinget has provided for them, Murielle is drawn into an unhealthy family dynamic. There is only one way out of this nightmare, and for Murielle all sense of reasoning begins to abandon her.', 'Young and full of life, Murielle has a promising future ahead of her when she meets and falls head over heels for Mounir. A wedding soon follows, and the happy couple quickly set about preparing to make a family. However, with family come ties, and none come as tight as that between Mounir and his adoptive father. As Murielle continues to bring new life into the family, frictions between Mounir and Doctor Pinget reach boiling point. Helpless to extract her husband and children from the wealthy nest that Doctor Pinget has provided for them, Murielle is drawn into an unhealthy family dynamic. There is only one way out of this nightmare, and for Murielle all sense of reasoning begins to abandon her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzIyf1V3Jjc3u5SWzTqLJr0yTKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121210'),
  ('255895045815445981', 'Our Country', 2006, 'Drama', 'Francesca Comencini', 'Francesca Comencini, Franco Bernini', 'Valeria Golino, Luca Zingaretti, Laura Chiatti, Giuseppe Battiston, Fabio Ghidoni, Teco Celio, Luca Argentero, Valentina Lodovini', null, 'Set in Milan, where people''s lives are invisibly lead by money in its different shapes: too much, too little, stolen, earned, visible and even impalpable. The money flows from one story to the next, from one person to the other, becoming the engine of the film.Everything moves around two antagonist characters: Ugo and Rita. Ugo is a banker involved in a not really clean business. Rita, the Finance Police officer, is a strong and obstinate woman in charge of capturing Ugo. Other characters wander around them, with their weaknesses and fragility, their goodness, their evil and their contradictions. Characters meet, clash, love and hate each other, their lust for money becomes intense feelings.', 'Set in Milan, where people''s lives are invisibly lead by money in its different shapes: too much, too little, stolen, earned, visible and even impalpable. The money flows from one story to the next, from one person to the other, becoming the engine of the film.Everything moves around two antagonist characters: Ugo and Rita. Ugo is a banker involved in a not really clean business. Rita, the Finance Police officer, is a strong and obstinate woman in charge of capturing Ugo. Other characters wander around them, with their weaknesses and fragility, their goodness, their evil and their contradictions. Characters meet, clash, love and hate each other, their lust for money becomes intense feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HfQVdGbU3iu3RTrExhkogBFruK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58771'),
  ('470961331500782196', 'Our Daily Bread', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Robert H. Planck, Ralph Slosser', 'Elizabeth Hill, King Vidor', 'Karen Morley, Tom Keene, Barbara Pepper, Addison Richards, John Qualen, Lloyd Ingraham, Sidney Bracey, Henry Hall', 'NR', 'John and Mary Sims are city-dwellers hit hard by the financial fist of The Depression. Driven by bravery (and sheer desperation) they flee to the country and, with the help of other workers, set up a farming community - a socialist mini-society. The newborn community suffers many hardships - drought, vicious raccoons and the long arm of the law - but ultimately pull together to reach a bread-based Utopia.', 'John and Mary Sims are city-dwellers hit hard by the financial fist of The Depression. Driven by bravery (and sheer desperation) they flee to the country and, with the help of other workers, set up a farming community - a socialist mini-society. The newborn community suffers many hardships - drought, vicious raccoons and the long arm of the law - but ultimately pull together to reach a bread-based Utopia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbJ3osnuxaKckhhG7e6DFUF2I03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126136'),
  ('192942502196085777', 'Our Daily Bread', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Nikolaus Geyrhalter, Nikolaus Geyrhalter, Maria Arlamovsky', 'Wolfgang Widerhofer, Nikolaus Geyrhalter', 'Claus Hansen Petz, Arkadiusz Rydellek, Tibor Korom, András Szarvas', null, 'Welcome to the world of industrial food production and high-tech farming! To the rhythm of conveyor belts and immense machines, the film looks without commenting into the places where food is produced in Europe: monumental spaces, surreal landscapes and bizarre sounds - a cool, industrial environment which leaves little space for individualism.', 'Welcome to the world of industrial food production and high-tech farming! To the rhythm of conveyor belts and immense machines, the film looks without commenting into the places where food is produced in Europe: monumental spaces, surreal landscapes and bizarre sounds - a cool, industrial environment which leaves little space for individualism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdW7HPJqhRQ2HRU9ZurbDbpTyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24565'),
  ('5892084568208996', 'Our Daily Poison', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Marie-Monique Robin', 'Marie-Monique Robin', null, null, 'Extensive investigation about the different "poisons" the food industry leaves or puts in our food, as well as the passivity of the US Food and Drug Administration (FDA) and the European Food Safety Authority (EFSA).', 'Extensive investigation about the different "poisons" the food industry leaves or puts in our food, as well as the passivity of the US Food and Drug Administration (FDA) and the European Food Safety Authority (EFSA).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMssPkDmfY3h4ucGIEatepy3dx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61824'),
