  ('582123282110270610', 'Our Day Will Come', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Romain Gavras, André Chemetoff, Bachir Arfaoui', 'Romain Gavras, Karim Boukercha', 'Vincent Cassel, Olivier Barthélémy, Justine Lerooy, Vanessa Decat, Boris Gamthety, Rodolphe Blanchet, Chloé Catoen, Sylvain Le Mynez', null, 'Redheaded teen Remy is bullied by his soccer teammates and drawn into fights with his younger sister and mother in their cramped apartment. After a flare-up of domestic violence, he flees home and is tracked down by a bitter guidance counselor, Patrick, also a redhead. Patrick looks upon Remy’s sullen insolence with both sympathy and disdain and decides to toughen him up...', 'Redheaded teen Remy is bullied by his soccer teammates and drawn into fights with his younger sister and mother in their cramped apartment. After a flare-up of domestic violence, he flees home and is tracked down by a bitter guidance counselor, Patrick, also a redhead. Patrick looks upon Remy’s sullen insolence with both sympathy and disdain and decides to toughen him up...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGKCzoJunZW8p3GFzMzmKhn0Eu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50365'),
  ('1132421438606909249', 'Our Dead Husband', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Christine Conradt, Emilio Gonzalez Moreno, Rebekah Athey', 'Aaron Hierholzer', 'Brittney Q. Hill, Deb Foster, Molly McCluskey, Libby Blake, Wade Hunt Williams', 'TV-PG', 'When Kris Holland finds her husband Ritchie Kemp murdered in their home, her search for answers uncovers his secret life with another wife, Jennifer Dweck-and as she digs deeper into his deceptions, Kris realizes she''s being framed for his death and must uncover the truth before she becomes the next victim.', 'When Kris Holland finds her husband Ritchie Kemp murdered in their home, her search for answers uncovers his secret life with another wife, Jennifer Dweck-and as she digs deeper into his deceptions, Kris realizes she''s being framed for his death and must uncover the truth before she becomes the next victim.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F3%2Fgracenote%2F316da9309f55b6290b6d51034f04382b.jpg', 'plex:movie:our-dead-husband'),
  ('557589470768644476', 'Our Departures', 2018, 'Drama, Family', 'Yasuhiro Yoshida, Kōzō Shibazaki, Seitaro Kai', 'Yasuhiro Yoshida', 'Kasumi Arimura, Jun Kunimura, Hitomi Miyauchi, Ryusei Kiyama, Houka Kinoshita, Mariko Tsutsui, Itsuji Itao, Munetaka Aoki', null, 'Akira is widowed and left with a pre-teen stepson. Travelling with him to her late husband''s hometown, she meets her odd father-in-law and yet decides to make a go of living and working there. She attends training and joins the railway company where her father-in-law works and her late man dreamt of ending up as a child.', 'Akira is widowed and left with a pre-teen stepson. Travelling with him to her late husband''s hometown, she meets her odd father-in-law and yet decides to make a go of living and working there. She attends training and joins the railway company where her father-in-law works and her late man dreamt of ending up as a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8RRsa05gWE9cuxj18nySIyxgIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542034'),
