  ('1038332950091697088', 'Our Erika', 2026, 'Biography, Drama, Sport', 'German Golub, Rein Kotov, Villem Roosa, Kertu Köösel, Piret Toomvap-Schönberg, Margareta Schönberg, Anna-Liis Lepik, Rebeka Rummel, Kadri Kask, Kristjan Poom, Krismar Rosin, Jonathan Peterson, Analaise Maria Sepp, Iris Kask, Gunita Groša', 'German Golub, Mehis Pihla, Erika Salumae', 'Karolin Jürise, Erki Laur, Rodion Kuzmin, Viktor Lanberg, Katariina Tamm', null, 'The inspiring journey of Estonian track bicycle racer Erika Salumäe, as she navigates the pressures of fame, personal sacrifice, and national pride, redefining resilience in the pursuit of her Olympic dreams.', 'The inspiring journey of Estonian track bicycle racer Erika Salumäe, as she navigates the pressures of fame, personal sacrifice, and national pride, redefining resilience in the pursuit of her Olympic dreams.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FgtNfOp2H7xlEoR1Hsk1s3EXEbkG.jpg', 'plex:movie:our-erika-2026'),
  ('708675259240908555', 'Our Eternal Summer', 2022, 'Drama', 'Emilie Aussel, Mathieu Bertholet', 'Emilie Aussel, Emmanuelle Bayamack-Tam', 'Agathe Talrich, Marcia Feugeas, Matthieu Lucci, Idir Azougli, Nina Villanova, Antonin Totot, Rose Timbert, Louis Pluton', null, 'To live and to love at the age of 18, immersing yourself in the carefree summer days and nights, losing your best friend suddenly, and realizing that nothing lasts forever. It’s a time of decisive encounters in order to be reborn.', 'To live and to love at the age of 18, immersing yourself in the carefree summer days and nights, losing your best friend suddenly, and realizing that nothing lasts forever. It’s a time of decisive encounters in order to be reborn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkh1TAL1NmNftt2NEYJf8d5qxNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846801'),
