  ('453308015195322703', 'Our Family', 2014, 'Drama', 'Yuya Ishii, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Yuya Ishii', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Mieko Harada, Sosuke Ikematsu, Kyōzō Nagatsuka, Mei Kurokawa, Yusuke Santamaria, Shingo Tsurumi, Yuka Itaya', null, 'The emotional journey of a four-member family that fails to recognize that it is rapidly growing apart until the mother is diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'The emotional journey of a four-member family that fails to recognize that it is rapidly growing apart until the mother is diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDozBNgsyPqxdwV6Ff2ViPXr62h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287771'),
  ('509801892125320362', 'Our Family Three More', 2018, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Andrea Porporati, Marcello Montarsi', 'Mauro Caporiccio', 'Vanessa Incontrada, Francesco Emanuele Chinnici, Elia Maugeri, Francesco Tiburzi, Gabriele Provenzano, Rayen Hamzoui, Ilenia Maccarrone, Fabio Galli', null, 'Elena, a Sicilian mother of three, is murdered by her husband. Her cousin, Roberto decides to take the three orphans into custody. Together with his wife, Anna, he takes charge of the maintenance of the three nephews, who join the other two children of the couple. The adaptation of the three children to the new reality is complex and conflicting. The backlash on the family budget is heavy. Roberto and his wife make do to ensure that the children are supported, trying not to let them know how their mother died.', 'Elena, a Sicilian mother of three, is murdered by her husband. Her cousin, Roberto decides to take the three orphans into custody. Together with his wife, Anna, he takes charge of the maintenance of the three nephews, who join the other two children of the couple. The adaptation of the three children to the new reality is complex and conflicting. The backlash on the family budget is heavy. Roberto and his wife make do to ensure that the children are supported, trying not to let them know how their mother died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tSmBNyDZYYOyRkcHHugUfzoTDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569791'),
