  ('557083279503927219', 'Our Futures', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Antoine Monod, Rémi Bezançon', 'Rémi Bezançon, Vanessa Portal, Jean-François Halin', 'Pio Marmaï, Pierre Rochefort, Mélanie Bernier, Kyan Khojandi, Camille Cottin, Laurence Arné, Roxane Mesquida, Zabou Breitman', null, 'Yann who is trying, albeit unsuccessfully, to cope with his life generally and especially bereavement decides to look up Thomas, his best friend from high school. Thomas is thee same crazy character as he ever was and between them they cook up a plan to rearrange Yann''s birthday party from their high school days and get all their old friends to come along. This means locating their friends and a journey to visit and convince some of them to join in their plan. How their friends have changed, their lives and the revelations provide plenty of humour. But why is his friend Thomas just the same as he ever was ?', 'Yann who is trying, albeit unsuccessfully, to cope with his life generally and especially bereavement decides to look up Thomas, his best friend from high school. Thomas is thee same crazy character as he ever was and between them they cook up a plan to rearrange Yann''s birthday party from their high school days and get all their old friends to come along. This means locating their friends and a journey to visit and convince some of them to join in their plan. How their friends have changed, their lives and the revelations provide plenty of humour. But why is his friend Thomas just the same as he ever was ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hljC0W0qFadJ8HilKOFpEDHzGLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344475'),
  ('998711232113084010', 'Our Girl Friday', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Noel Langley, Wilkie Cooper', 'Noel Langley', 'Joan Collins, George Cole, Kenneth More, Robertson Hare, Hermione Gingold, Walter Fitzgerald, Hattie Jacques, Felix Felton', null, 'Rich Sadie Patch is marooned on a desert island after an emergency on her cruise-ship. With her are Irish stoker Pat, prickly young Jimmy Carrol, and bald and bookish Professor Gibble. All fancy their chances.', 'Rich Sadie Patch is marooned on a desert island after an emergency on her cruise-ship. With her are Irish stoker Pat, prickly young Jimmy Carrol, and bald and bookish Professor Gibble. All fancy their chances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJN4iR9t6U1JX3Yz0SbS11ynXtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249348'),
  ('339971138090453037', 'Our Girls', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mike van Diem, Martin Gschlacht', 'Mike van Diem', 'Thekla Reuten, Noortje Herlaar, Fedja van Huêt, Valentijn Dhaenens, Rosa van Leeuwen, Inaya Ulgen, Frédérique van Baarsen, Jeremy Miliker', null, 'A near-fatal accident involving their teen daughters upends the lives of two families as they consider how far they''re willing to go to save their child.', 'A near-fatal accident involving their teen daughters upends the lives of two families as they consider how far they''re willing to go to save their child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8g8kx20bZCJ2nqCwORfRLTbKYWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1457705'),
  ('426481577594475187', 'Our Godfather', 2019, 'Documentary, History', 'Andrew Meier, Mark Franchetti, Lars Skree', 'Andrew Meier, Mark Franchetti, David Charap', 'Nino D''Agata, Brandon Veliz, Filip Kiritsis, Cristina Buscetta, Roberto Buscetta, Roberto Precioso, Lisa Buscetta, John Huber', null, 'The story of how Sicilian Mafia boss Tommaso Buscetta (1928-2000), the Godfather of Two Worlds, revealed, starting in 1984, the deepest secrets of the organization, thus helping to convict the hundreds of mafiosi who were tried in the trial held in Palermo between 1986 and 1987.', 'The story of how Sicilian Mafia boss Tommaso Buscetta (1928-2000), the Godfather of Two Worlds, revealed, starting in 1984, the deepest secrets of the organization, thus helping to convict the hundreds of mafiosi who were tried in the trial held in Palermo between 1986 and 1987.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSI9Gy5xqmObmKoR9D80Bl0c1GC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598065'),
  ('20586919295949332', 'Our Grand Despair', 2011, 'Drama', 'Birgit Guðjónsdóttir, Seyfi Teoman', 'Seyfi Teoman', 'İlker Aksum, Fatih Al, Güneş Sayın, Baki Davrak, Taner Birsel, Mehmet Ali Nuroğlu, Beril Boz, İlker Burma', null, 'The peaceful cohabitation of two 30-something bachelors is disrupted when they both fall in love with the charming young woman who moves in with them.', 'The peaceful cohabitation of two 30-something bachelors is disrupted when they both fall in love with the charming young woman who moves in with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liDt6NQPKgYNvJnDAiwIFY0KrAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69352'),
  ('164418905541587281', 'Our Guys: Outrage at Glen Ridge', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Guy Ferland, Brian Pearson', 'Paul Brown', 'Ally Sheedy, Heather Matarazzo, Sara Botsford, Eric Stoltz, Scott Vickaryous, Eric Keenleyside, Michael Tomlinson, Art Hindle', 'PG-13', 'In 1989, a group of well-known high school athletes in Glen Ridge, New Jersey were accused of the gang rape of a teen girl. When the town rallies to protect their stars, a detective and the prosecutor have to unravel the cover-up by the school board and the police.', 'In 1989, a group of well-known high school athletes in Glen Ridge, New Jersey were accused of the gang rape of a teen girl. When the town rallies to protect their stars, a detective and the prosecutor have to unravel the cover-up by the school board and the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geV6BBQN7xvbCbx2emcT6VEczW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257651'),
  ('125005976889960967', 'Our Happy Holiday', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Cassir', 'Camille Chamoux, Patrick Cassir, Cécile Sellam', 'Camille Chamoux, Jonathan Cohen, Camille Cottin, Jérémie Elkaïm, Vincent Dedienne, Dominique Valadié, Svetlana Gergova, Bar Levy', null, 'Marion and Ben, thirty years old, meet on Tinder. That''s about all they have in common; but the opposites attract each other, and they decide in the early morning of their meeting to go on vacation together despite the advice of their entourage. They will finally leave - to Bulgaria, halfway to their dream destinations: Beirut for Marion, Biarritz for Ben. Without a precise plan and, as they will soon discover, with very different conceptions of what a dream holiday should be.', 'Marion and Ben, thirty years old, meet on Tinder. That''s about all they have in common; but the opposites attract each other, and they decide in the early morning of their meeting to go on vacation together despite the advice of their entourage. They will finally leave - to Bulgaria, halfway to their dream destinations: Beirut for Marion, Biarritz for Ben. Without a precise plan and, as they will soon discover, with very different conceptions of what a dream holiday should be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QhiQaZIA5dxPZA0zFv7EpydyGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490448'),
  ('633592019003952895', 'Our Holiday Story', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Jason Bourque, Jason Habicht, Matt Shay', 'Joie Botkin', 'Nikki DeLoach, Warren Christie, Lisa Durupt, Sydney Scotia, Princess Davis, Gavin Langelo, Brittany Clough, Shanna Giannozio', null, 'Dave and Nell recount the Christmas where they unknowingly fell in love while working as rivals on a town festival, as their daughter’s boyfriend struggles to navigate his own relationship.', 'Dave and Nell recount the Christmas where they unknowingly fell in love while working as rivals on a town festival, as their daughter’s boyfriend struggles to navigate his own relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15TXQSd0RerDV7XNtOcTNhnfhOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360780'),
  ('802573748384872469', 'Our Homeland', 2012, 'Drama', 'Yang Yong-hi, Yoshihisa Toda, Takahiro Takasugi', 'Yang Yong-hi', 'Sakura Ando, Arata Iura, Tatsushi Ōmori, Yang Ik-june, Jun Murakami, Kotomi Kyono, Yoshiko Miyazaki, Masane Tsukayama', null, 'From the late 1950s through the ''70s, more than 90,000 of the ethnic Koreans in Japan emigrated to North Korea, a country that promised them affluence, justice, and an end to discrimination. KAZOKU NO KUNI tells the story of one of their number, who returns for just a short period. For the first time in 25 years, Sonho is reunited with his family in Tokyo after being allowed to undergo an operation there. Sonho’s younger sister Rie is at the centre of the film, and is not hard to recognise as the director’s alter-ego. In her documentaries DEAR PYONGYANG and SONA, THE OTHER MYSELF, Yang Yonghi told the story of her own life, and how, at age six, she experienced the departure of her three older brothers, who left their family for Pyongyang.', 'From the late 1950s through the ''70s, more than 90,000 of the ethnic Koreans in Japan emigrated to North Korea, a country that promised them affluence, justice, and an end to discrimination. KAZOKU NO KUNI tells the story of one of their number, who returns for just a short period. For the first time in 25 years, Sonho is reunited with his family in Tokyo after being allowed to undergo an operation there. Sonho’s younger sister Rie is at the centre of the film, and is not hard to recognise as the director’s alter-ego. In her documentaries DEAR PYONGYANG and SONA, THE OTHER MYSELF, Yang Yonghi told the story of her own life, and how, at age six, she experienced the departure of her three older brothers, who left their family for Pyongyang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoFKsMYsJwZ8KdGF60njJ9eetEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107453'),
  ('600928887032879444', 'Our Hope Is Şaban', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Zafer Par, Hasan Tulgar', 'Bülent Oran, Reha Yurdakul', 'Kemal Sunal, Yadigar Ejder, Serpil Nur, Nejat Gürçen, Alpay İzer, Hakkı Kıvanç, Hikmet Taşdemir, Necip Tekçe', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsU9zMHT4bShuoHEiHZ6Gd110l5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148711'),
  ('1128289124255578709', 'Our Hospitality', 1923, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John G. Blystone, Buster Keaton, Gordon Jennings', 'Joseph A. Mitchell, Jean C. Havez', 'Buster Keaton, Joe Roberts, Natalie Talmadge, Francis X. Bushman Jr., Craig Ward, Joe Keaton, Kitty Bradbury, Buster Keaton Jr.', 'NR', 'A young man falls for a young woman on his trip home; unbeknownst to him, her family has vowed to kill every member of his family.', 'A young man falls for a young woman on his trip home; unbeknownst to him, her family has vowed to kill every member of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAEdL6RzfDSbPO51izl01Njzikx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701'),
  ('768782864254857585', 'Our House', 2017, 'Mystery', 'Yui Kiyohara, Ryota Chida, Akira Yamamoto', 'Noriko Kato, Yui Kiyohara', 'Nodoka Kawanishi, Yukiko Yasuno, Mariwo Osawa, Mei Fujiwara, Masanori Kikuzawa, Akane Yoshida, Toshio Furuya, Nao Kitamura', null, 'There are two worlds in this house. One where a mother and daughter reside, and another where two women reside. The two worlds begin to cross, gradually disrupting the lives of those involved. What will happen when everything connects?', 'There are two worlds in this house. One where a mother and daughter reside, and another where two women reside. The two worlds begin to cross, gradually disrupting the lives of those involved. What will happen when everything connects?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vfMAU3y4fNiAAyEEa69l2a3WWK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488789'),
  ('741118291181535705', 'Our House', 2018, 'Horror', 'Anthony Scott Burns', 'Matt Osterman', 'Thomas Mann, Nicola Peltz Beckham, Kate Moyer, Percy Hynes White, Christine Horne, John Ralston, Lucius Hoyos, Allison Hossack', 'PG-13', 'Ethan is suffering enormous guilt after his parents are killed in a car accident. He quits a promising future at MIT and work on a revolutionary experiment in order to care for his younger siblings.', 'Ethan is suffering enormous guilt after his parents are killed in a car accident. He quits a promising future at MIT and work on a revolutionary experiment in order to care for his younger siblings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1Qt0HtO4ZYY2qcgM42XUd8xgtA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414191'),
  ('1000110223998204218', 'Our House', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri, Saran Srisingchai, Jirasak Chakkrawarn', 'Nophand Boonyai, Kongkiat Khomsiri, Pass Patthanakumjon', 'Teeradetch Metawarayut, Sarunrat Puagpipat, Pichsinee Veerasuthima, Viyada Umarin, Witsarut Himmarat, Pacharapon Jantieng, Sasatorn Buain, Rutrawee Jeeradechakul', null, 'A successful sales executive and his pregnant wife find their dream home. But after moving in, strange occurrences begin to happen, while a mysterious connection between the husband and the house next door emerges.', 'A successful sales executive and his pregnant wife find their dream home. But after moving in, strange occurrences begin to happen, while a mysterious connection between the husband and the house next door emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocSsgFmdD06u6mTRumDjrm4qzjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1477642'),
  ('131595989894154845', 'Our Husbands', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Filippo D''Amico, Dino Risi, Carlo Carlini', 'Rodolfo Sonego, Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Alberto Sordi, Nicoletta Machiavelli, Jean-Claude Brialy, Michèle Mercier, Ugo Tognazzi, Akim Tamiroff, Lando Buzzanca, Liana Orfei', null, 'Three episodes about Italian husbands and their relationships.', 'Three episodes about Italian husbands and their relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cF62E7vmbZuP69PFnEN3bYTlOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59132'),
  ('509805069128388889', 'Our Idiot Brother', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mariela Comitini, Kara Doherty, Jesse Peretz', 'David Schisgall, Evgenia Peretz', 'Paul Rudd, Elizabeth Banks, Zooey Deschanel, Emily Mortimer, Steve Coogan, Rashida Jones, Kathryn Hahn, T.J. Miller', 'R', 'Everybody has one—the sibling who is always just a little bit behind the curve when it comes to getting his life together. For sisters Liz, Miranda and Natalie, that person is their perennially upbeat brother, Ned. But as each of their lives begins to unravel, Ned''s family comes to realise that Ned isn''t such an idiot after all.', 'Everybody has one—the sibling who is always just a little bit behind the curve when it comes to getting his life together. For sisters Liz, Miranda and Natalie, that person is their perennially upbeat brother, Ned. But as each of their lives begins to unravel, Ned''s family comes to realise that Ned isn''t such an idiot after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dEY0ywm5Xb6pyzLZzkw4xa3sXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59968'),
  ('326132537163216715', 'Our Kind of Traitor', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Susanna White, James Foster, Martha Parker', 'Hossein Amini', 'Ewan McGregor, Stellan Skarsgård, Damian Lewis, Naomie Harris, Jeremy Northam, Khalid Abdalla, Mark Gatiss, Saskia Reeves', 'R', 'A young Oxford academic and his attorney girlfriend holiday in Morocco. They bump into a Russian millionaire who owns a peninsula and a diamond watch. He wants a game of tennis. What else he wants propels the lovers on a tortuous journey to the City of London and its unholy alliance with Britain''s intelligence establishment, to Paris and the Alps.', 'A young Oxford academic and his attorney girlfriend holiday in Morocco. They bump into a Russian millionaire who owns a peninsula and a diamond watch. He wants a game of tennis. What else he wants propels the lovers on a tortuous journey to the City of London and its unholy alliance with Britain''s intelligence establishment, to Paris and the Alps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYKzETDzreQKKazVj11J4Oy5Wgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205588'),
  ('306403167200934515', 'Our Ladies', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Denis Crossan', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Alan Warner', 'Eve Austin, Tallulah Greive, Abigail Lawrie, Sally Messham, Rona Morison, Marli Siu, Kate Dickie, Myra McFadyen', 'R', 'In 1996 Scotland, a group of Catholic schoolgirls get an opportunity to go into Edinburgh for a choir competition, but they''re more interested in drinking, partying and hooking up than winning the competition.', 'In 1996 Scotland, a group of Catholic schoolgirls get an opportunity to go into Edinburgh for a choir competition, but they''re more interested in drinking, partying and hooking up than winning the competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYCJrihcGexpdyTHwnJ57LrrOSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626975'),
  ('389144851553523872', 'Our Lady of Guadalupe', 1976, 'War', 'Alfredo Salazar, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Fernando Allende, Valentín Trujillo, Angélica Chain, Enrique Lucero, Carlos Agostí, Carlos Petrel, Ramón G. Larrea, Jorge Mondragón', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZlBLQnAacQvdqiftzdjvlItFta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237199'),
  ('809408915682874293', 'Our Lady of Hormones', 2015, 'Fantasy, Mystery', 'Bertrand Mandico, Pascale Granel', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Elina Löwensohn, Nathalie Richard, Michel Lebayon, Agnès Berthon, Michel Piccoli, Elina Löwensohn', null, 'Two actresses rehearse a play during a week-end in a country house. But one of them digs up a strange thing from earth while walking in the woods. A creature the size of a seal, without any holes nor members. The mass of flesh and skin, covered with hair, breathes loudly. The creature becomes an object of lust for both women. The relationship between the two actresses becomes tense. Both women are desperate to own the thing. This leads to a series of burlesque and violent situations. The two actresses have no idea that they have unearthed "Notre-Dame des Hormones"', 'Two actresses rehearse a play during a week-end in a country house. But one of them digs up a strange thing from earth while walking in the woods. A creature the size of a seal, without any holes nor members. The mass of flesh and skin, covered with hair, breathes loudly. The creature becomes an object of lust for both women. The relationship between the two actresses becomes tense. Both women are desperate to own the thing. This leads to a series of burlesque and violent situations. The two actresses have no idea that they have unearthed "Notre-Dame des Hormones"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kASmPNlu0MKlgPXBs21ZFgdihLd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359170'),
  ('1020951564094558109', 'Our Lady of San Juan, Four Centuries of Miracles', 2021, 'Drama', 'Francisco Pérez, César Plascencia', 'Francisco Pérez', 'Alejandro Peña Arenzana, Alejandra Yañez, Mauricio López Estrada, Franco Méndez, Miguel Ruiz Padilla, Alma Leticia de la Cerda, Sienna Baker Jiménez, Guillermo Ramírez', null, 'In this dramatization, the Virgin Mary works a miracle on a girl in 1623 Mexico. Four centuries later, a family make a pilgrimage for their own child.', 'In this dramatization, the Virgin Mary works a miracle on a girl in 1623 Mexico. Four centuries later, a family make a pilgrimage for their own child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdzSomIRij1EbdetsMvRj4VQoJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675108'),
  ('1062995979741723256', 'Our Lady of the Assassins', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Barbet Schroeder, Jorge Valencia, Hervé Ruet', 'Fernando Vallejo', 'Germán Jaramillo, Anderson Ballesteros, Juan David Restrepo, Manuel Busquets, Wilmar Agudelo, Juan Carlos Álvarez, Jairo Alzate, Zulma Arango', 'R', 'World-weary author Fernando has returned to his native Colombia to live out his days in peace. But Fernando''s once-quiet hometown has become a hotbed of violence, drugs, and corruption. On the brink of despair, Fernando meets Alexis, a beautiful but hardened street kid who lives by the rule of the gun. Together, they forge an unlikely relationship.', 'World-weary author Fernando has returned to his native Colombia to live out his days in peace. But Fernando''s once-quiet hometown has become a hotbed of violence, drugs, and corruption. On the brink of despair, Fernando meets Alexis, a beautiful but hardened street kid who lives by the rule of the gun. Together, they forge an unlikely relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5jT6BBCIWIysr712UIZY7BOGje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44321'),
  ('629926510225517820', 'Our Lady of the Nile', 2020, 'Drama', 'Atiq Rahimi, Thierry Arbogast', 'Ramata-Toulaye Sy, Atiq Rahimi', 'Amanda Mugabezaki, Clariella Bizimana, Albina Kirenga, Belinda Rubango, Malaika Uwamahoro, Pascal Greggory, Ange Elsie Ineza, Kelly Umuganwa Teta', null, 'Rwanda, 1973. In the prestigious catholic institute ''Notre-Dame du Nil'', perched on a hill, young Rwandan girls study to become the elite of the country. In the process of graduating, they share the same dormitory, the same dreams, the same problems of teenage girls. But in every corner of the country as well as in the school there are deep antagonisms that will forever change the destiny of these young girls and the whole country.', 'Rwanda, 1973. In the prestigious catholic institute ''Notre-Dame du Nil'', perched on a hill, young Rwandan girls study to become the elite of the country. In the process of graduating, they share the same dormitory, the same dreams, the same problems of teenage girls. But in every corner of the country as well as in the school there are deep antagonisms that will forever change the destiny of these young girls and the whole country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jABDEE5xEn3fvGmiq7jErVpIjA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582877'),
  ('644530175532321664', 'Our Lady of the Sphere', 1969, 'Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Lawrence Jordan', null, null, null, 'Animation using cutout animation to craft a bizarre science fiction experiment. Moving spheres, such as balloons and bubbles, are superimposed on static backgrounds to suggest travel and discovery.', 'Animation using cutout animation to craft a bizarre science fiction experiment. Moving spheres, such as balloons and bubbles, are superimposed on static backgrounds to suggest travel and discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mn1cPgG29pNlN2IaiMrdhSjPrur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146172'),
  ('642543169727186774', 'Our Lady of the Turks', 1968, 'Drama', 'Carmelo Bene', 'Carmelo Bene', 'Carmelo Bene, Lydia Mancinelli, Salvatore Siniscalchi, Anita Masini, Ornella Ferrari, Vincenzo Musso', null, 'To the protagonist, an intellectual so feverish that he seems pathologically unrecoverable, a confused memory resurfaces of a massacre carried out by the Turks in Otranto. Immersing himself in one of the victims, in the unconscious desire to eviscerate himself, a woman appears to him, Margherita, who, in the guise of Santa Maria d''Otranto, treats him with compassionate love. In the hallucinating succession of memories intertwined with historical events, the protagonist finds himself in contact with his environment, his land, his country.', 'To the protagonist, an intellectual so feverish that he seems pathologically unrecoverable, a confused memory resurfaces of a massacre carried out by the Turks in Otranto. Immersing himself in one of the victims, in the unconscious desire to eviscerate himself, a woman appears to him, Margherita, who, in the guise of Santa Maria d''Otranto, treats him with compassionate love. In the hallucinating succession of memories intertwined with historical events, the protagonist finds himself in contact with his environment, his land, his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLbbIF1Dpsu8B3tE0jvOXzruLG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59048'),
  ('327793950276364851', 'Our Land', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Fabio Cianchetti, Alberto Mangiante, Sergio Rubini', 'Angelo Pasquini, Carla Cavalluzzi, Sergio Rubini', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Paolo Briguglia, Massimo Venturiello, Emilio Solfrizzi, Giovanna Di Rauso, Alisa Bystrova, Marisa Eugeni, Sergio Rubini', null, 'Luigi Di Santo is a professor of philosophy in Milan who returns to his Apulian hometown to finalize the sale, together with his brothers, of an old family farm. But this project is hampered by his violent stepbrother Aldo. Things degenerate further when the four brothers find themselves embroiled in a murder.', 'Luigi Di Santo is a professor of philosophy in Milan who returns to his Apulian hometown to finalize the sale, together with his brothers, of an old family farm. But this project is hampered by his violent stepbrother Aldo. Things degenerate further when the four brothers find themselves embroiled in a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNTbgnTH4GsMKIi1adHBH5NkCqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56980'),
  ('1098815009418724524', 'Our Land', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Lucrecia Martel', 'Lucrecia Martel, María Alché', 'Javier Chocobar, Comunidad Chuschagasta', null, 'Armed men kill Indigenous leader Javier Chocobar during attempted eviction in Argentina, 2009. After years of protests, a court case opens in 2018. Community voices and trial footage are shown amid colonial land struggles.', 'Armed men kill Indigenous leader Javier Chocobar during attempted eviction in Argentina, 2009. After years of protests, a court case opens in 2018. Community voices and trial footage are shown amid colonial land struggles.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fizm27tf5JfIiagXnW2VcuQcpaSx.jpg', 'plex:movie:our-land-2026-1'),
  ('429979562313521230', 'Our Last Tango', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Bruno Roberti, Félix "Chango" Monti, Jo Heim', 'Germán Kral', 'María Nieves Rego, Juan Carlos Copes, Pablo Verón, Alejandra Gutty, Ayelén Álvarez Miño, Juan Malizia, Pancho Martínez Pey, Johana Copes', null, 'María Nieves Rego (80) and Juan Carlos Copes (83) met when they were 14 and 17, and they danced together for nearly fifty years. In all those years they loved and hated each other and went through several painful separations. Now, at the end of their lives, the two dancers are willing to open up about their love, their hatred, and their passion. In "Our Last Tango" Juan and María tell their story to a group of young tango dancers and choreographers from Buenos Aires, who transform the most beautiful, moving and dramatic moments of the lives into incredible tango-choreographies. These beautifully-shot performances compliment the soul-searching interviews and documentary moments of the film to make this an unforgettable journey into the heart of the tango.', 'María Nieves Rego (80) and Juan Carlos Copes (83) met when they were 14 and 17, and they danced together for nearly fifty years. In all those years they loved and hated each other and went through several painful separations. Now, at the end of their lives, the two dancers are willing to open up about their love, their hatred, and their passion. In "Our Last Tango" Juan and María tell their story to a group of young tango dancers and choreographers from Buenos Aires, who transform the most beautiful, moving and dramatic moments of the lives into incredible tango-choreographies. These beautifully-shot performances compliment the soul-searching interviews and documentary moments of the film to make this an unforgettable journey into the heart of the tango.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLu1CyT1w3KpQ4QqAtt2udwXVJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358505'),
  ('286581084028184159', 'Our Last Weekend', 2011, 'Thriller, Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Norberto Ramos del Val', 'Norberto Ramos del Val, Javier Sánchez Donate', 'Marián Aguilera, Javier Albalá, Silma López, Nacho Rubio, Jorge Anegón, Irene Rubio, Alba Messa', null, 'Diana will be promoted at the office and wants to celebrate it. She invites her workmates Lisi, Leo and Roque to her grandmother''s house. The village looks deserted and, event hough the guys don''t know it yet, it hides a big secret. Enjoying the sun, the beach, drinking and parting during three days became a perfect environment to let out every kind of feelings, resentments, attractions and tensions .. They are not as lonely as they believe, and even more, this could be the last weekend for more than one of them...', 'Diana will be promoted at the office and wants to celebrate it. She invites her workmates Lisi, Leo and Roque to her grandmother''s house. The village looks deserted and, event hough the guys don''t know it yet, it hides a big secret. Enjoying the sun, the beach, drinking and parting during three days became a perfect environment to let out every kind of feelings, resentments, attractions and tensions .. They are not as lonely as they believe, and even more, this could be the last weekend for more than one of them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MddxKA5zRVvqdymk5aMrP0Kktm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169453'),
  ('675565213206330258', 'Our Life', 2010, 'Drama', 'Gianni Costantino, Claudio Collepiccolo, Daniele Luchetti', 'Stefano Rulli, Daniele Luchetti, Sandro Petraglia', 'Elio Germano, Isabella Ragonese, Raoul Bova, Stefania Montorsi, Luca Zingaretti, Giorgio Colangeli, Alina Berzunțeanu, Marius Ignat', null, 'Claudio is a construction worker living in the outskirts of Rome. He''s happily married and his wife is pregnant with their third child. However, a dramatic event comes to upset this simple and happy life.', 'Claudio is a construction worker living in the outskirts of Rome. He''s happily married and his wife is pregnant with their third child. However, a dramatic event comes to upset this simple and happy life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygP8WMaiYoDFvgFfmqw3x3Yl2gp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46920'),
  ('184337344734607769', 'Our Lips Are Sealed', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Crime', 'Craig Shapiro, David Lewis', 'Elizabeth Kruger, Craig Shapiro', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Jim Meskimen, Tamara Clatterbuck, Robert Miano, Jason Clarke, Richard Carter, Willie Garson', 'G', 'Mary-Kate and Ashley star in this Down Under adventure filled with nonstop Aussie intrigue, laughs and romance. After running afoul of a notorious gangster, Mary-Kate and Ashley take refuge in the FBI Witness Protection Program. Unfortunately, the girls are uncontrollable blabbermouths and they blow their cover in town after town until there''s only one hiding place left - Australia.', 'Mary-Kate and Ashley star in this Down Under adventure filled with nonstop Aussie intrigue, laughs and romance. After running afoul of a notorious gangster, Mary-Kate and Ashley take refuge in the FBI Witness Protection Program. Unfortunately, the girls are uncontrollable blabbermouths and they blow their cover in town after town until there''s only one hiding place left - Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40gZ2WhqpZVv8woW0fCH8bMFzx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34729'),
  ('3534015809566974', 'Our Little Secret', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen Herek, Graham Robbins', 'Hailey DeDominicis', 'Lindsay Lohan, Ian Harding, Kristin Chenoweth, Jon Rudnitsky, Dan Bucatinsky, Jake Brennan, Judy Reyes, Katie Baker', 'PG-13', 'After discovering their significant others are siblings, two resentful exes must spend Christmas under one roof — while hiding their romantic history.', 'After discovering their significant others are siblings, two resentful exes must spend Christmas under one roof — while hiding their romantic history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkydRYX3VTqMIjJGDT7kXJ6SrfZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1234811'),
  ('504185673983380016', 'Our Little Sister', 2015, 'Drama', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda, Mikiya Takimoto, Kaoru Endô', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Haruka Ayase, Masami Nagasawa, Kaho, Suzu Hirose, Ryo Kase, Ryohei Suzuki, Ikeda Takafumi, Kentaro Sakaguchi', null, 'After the death of their estranged father, 3 adult sisters invite their teenaged half-sister to live with them.', 'After the death of their estranged father, 3 adult sisters invite their teenaged half-sister to live with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9A0AtEg5EEYbDGfP8NqH3C9w8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315846'),
  ('5643043549822166', 'Our love', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Kostas Karagiannis, Aris Papatheodorou', 'Giorgos Lazaridis', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Katerina Helmy, Petros Lohaitis, Joly Garbi, Christos Doxaras, Filios Filippidis, Despoina Stylianopoulou', null, 'An usherette in a theatre, where a distinguished and popular actor performs, gets her big break when the leading actress has an accident. The director decides to take advantage of the heretofore unexploited talent of the girl and asks her to replace the leading actress. This unexpected opportunity transforms her from a humble usherette into a shining star. Later on, she wins the heart of the leading actor with whom she was secretly in love. However, her sudden rise to theatrical-musical stardom creates complications in their love affair, as her companion sinks into disappointment and drowns himself in drink, abandoning his career. Nevertheless, the usherette/leading actress doesn''t give up; She looks for him, finds him and supports him, psychologically and morally, until he makes a comeback to the stage and their love nest.', 'An usherette in a theatre, where a distinguished and popular actor performs, gets her big break when the leading actress has an accident. The director decides to take advantage of the heretofore unexploited talent of the girl and asks her to replace the leading actress. This unexpected opportunity transforms her from a humble usherette into a shining star. Later on, she wins the heart of the leading actor with whom she was secretly in love. However, her sudden rise to theatrical-musical stardom creates complications in their love affair, as her companion sinks into disappointment and drowns himself in drink, abandoning his career. Nevertheless, the usherette/leading actress doesn''t give up; She looks for him, finds him and supports him, psychologically and morally, until he makes a comeback to the stage and their love nest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BSRnhP9nyVrv1G0t7NWrX2QvkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452913'),
  ('1116938631945991849', 'Our Love Story', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kam Jeong-won, Lee Hyun-ju, Son Jin-yong', 'Lee Hyun-ju', 'Lee Sang-hee, Ryu Abel, Park Keun-rok, Im Seong-mi, Kim Jong-soo, Jeong A-mi, Han Sa-myeong, Song Seung-heon', null, 'A fine arts student meets an attractive bartender, and the two women begin an intimate relationship.', 'A fine arts student meets an attractive bartender, and the two women begin an intimate relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOPrgr6ob9ReIaWwThfK7PmMB4C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417758'),
  ('460474294975326558', 'Our Lovers', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Miguel Ángel Lamata, Fran Fernández-Pardo', 'Miguel Ángel Lamata', 'Eduardo Noriega, Michelle Jenner, Fele Martínez, Amaia Salamanca, Gabino Diego, Jorge Usón, Cristina Gallego, Salomé Jiménez', null, 'Carlos is a professionally frustrated screenwriter, and Irene is not sure what she wants to do with her life. When Irene meets Carlos at a coffee shop, she approaches him and, although she doesn''t know him, proposes to play a game.', 'Carlos is a professionally frustrated screenwriter, and Irene is not sure what she wants to do with her life. When Irene meets Carlos at a coffee shop, she approaches him and, although she doesn''t know him, proposes to play a game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xaIsuEW4HZitbh1ZGTqCDqyQi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381707'),
  ('189531506426586488', 'Our Man Flint', 1966, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Daniel Mann, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Ben Starr, Hal Fimberg', 'James Coburn, Lee J. Cobb, Gila Golan, Edward Mulhare, Benson Fong, Shelby Grant, Sigrid Valdis, Gianna Serra', 'NR', 'When scientists use eco-terrorism to impose their will on the world by affecting extremes in the weather, Intelligence Chief Cramden calls in top agent Derek Flint.', 'When scientists use eco-terrorism to impose their will on the world by affecting extremes in the weather, Intelligence Chief Cramden calls in top agent Derek Flint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rd2jKIqFfJ8LgZEaBpAvLL44G10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23728'),
  ('200984442110840762', 'Our Man in Havana', 1960, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Carol Reed, Oswald Morris, Syd Cain', 'Graham Greene', 'Alec Guinness, Burl Ives, Maureen O''Hara, Ernie Kovacs, Noël Coward, Ralph Richardson, Jo Morrow, Grégoire Aslan', 'NR', 'Jim Wormold is an expatriate Englishman living in pre-revolutionary Havana with his teenage daughter Milly. He owns a vacuum cleaner shop but isn’t very successful so he accepts an offer from Hawthorne of the British Secret Service to recruit a network of agents in Cuba.', 'Jim Wormold is an expatriate Englishman living in pre-revolutionary Havana with his teenage daughter Milly. He owns a vacuum cleaner shop but isn’t very successful so he accepts an offer from Hawthorne of the British Secret Service to recruit a network of agents in Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6R6zIKywC8rNo6fT1YBDeEAUmEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25495'),
  ('1002973312392739807', 'Our Man in Marrakesh', 1966, 'Adventure, Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Don Sharp, Michael Reed', 'Harry Alan Towers, Peter Yeldham', 'Tony Randall, Senta Berger, Herbert Lom, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Terry-Thomas, Grégoire Aslan, John Le Mesurier, Klaus Kinski', null, 'One of six travelers who catch the bus from Casablanca airport to Marrakesh is carrying $2 million to pay a local operator to fix United Nations votes. But which one?', 'One of six travelers who catch the bus from Casablanca airport to Marrakesh is carrying $2 million to pay a local operator to fix United Nations votes. But which one?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQJ5P1VNM8F7vjBPxBcZh4pLQDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50761'),
  ('178337495264729990', 'Our Men', 2021, 'Drama', 'Rachel Lang, Fiona Braillon', 'Rachel Lang', 'Louis Garrel, Camille Cottin, Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Naidra Ayadi, Ina Marija Bartaitė, Jean Le Peltier, Jean Michelangeli, Léo Lévy', null, 'They come from all over the world but they have one thing in common : The Foreign Legion, their new family. Our Men tells these stories : stories of women who struggle to keep their love fire burning; stories of men who leave for battle; stories of loving couples on hostile ground.', 'They come from all over the world but they have one thing in common : The Foreign Legion, their new family. Our Men tells these stories : stories of women who struggle to keep their love fire burning; stories of men who leave for battle; stories of loving couples on hostile ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9haRIN4J2yfApPPtfrYQ0uk0AIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660719'),
  ('1009470964908817828', 'Our Miss Brooks', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Al Lewis, Joseph LaShelle, C.M. Florance', 'Joseph Quillan, Al Lewis', 'Eve Arden, Robert Rockwell, Gale Gordon, Jane Morgan, Don Porter, Nick Adams, Leonard Smith, Richard Crenna', 'NR', 'The big-screen translation of the successful television show of the 1950''s. Arden stars as Connie Brooks, wisecracking English teacher at Madison High School, still hoping to tie the knot with shy biology teacher Philip Boynton (Robert Rockwell).', 'The big-screen translation of the successful television show of the 1950''s. Arden stars as Connie Brooks, wisecracking English teacher at Madison High School, still hoping to tie the knot with shy biology teacher Philip Boynton (Robert Rockwell).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijyQkKF8IdXQJkofYPjs7Z2D6gx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78213'),
  ('1131496459618478562', 'Our Modern Maidens', 1929, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jack Conway, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Josephine Lovett', 'Joan Crawford, Rod La Rocque, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Anita Page, Edward Nugent, Josephine Dunn, Albert Gran, Edwina Booth', 'NR', 'Young, vivacious Billie uses her charms on influential businessman Glenn Abbott in hopes of getting her secret fiancé Gil a diplomatic appointment. Meanwhile, Gil''s affections meander to beautiful ingenue Kentucky, Billie''s best friend.', 'Young, vivacious Billie uses her charms on influential businessman Glenn Abbott in hopes of getting her secret fiancé Gil a diplomatic appointment. Meanwhile, Gil''s affections meander to beautiful ingenue Kentucky, Billie''s best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfaoMgnRY7yxpNRDiII564EUeUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109891'),
  ('1108908720067504803', 'Our Mother''s House', 1967, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jack Clayton, Larry Pizer, Claude Watson', 'Jeremy Brooks, Haya Harareet', 'Dirk Bogarde, Margaret Leclere, Pamela Franklin, Louis Sheldon Williams, John Gugolka, Mark Lester, Phoebe Nicholls, Gustav Henry', 'NR', 'Seven children bury their mother and hide her death - until their long-lost father returns.', 'Seven children bury their mother and hide her death - until their long-lost father returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yI1Aoy79FyWdqwekiV765lNjYh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2516'),
  ('105633048269766689', 'Our Mothers', 2019, 'Drama', 'Virginie Surdej, César Díaz', 'César Díaz', 'Armando Espitia, Emma Dib, Aurelia Caal, Julio Serrano Echeverría, Victor Moreira, Patricia Orantes Córdova, Thelma Sarceño', null, 'Guatemala, 2018. The country is riveted on the trial of the military officers who started the civil war. The victims’ testimonials keep pouring in. Ernesto, a young anthropologist at the Forensic Foundation, identifies people who have gone missing. One day, through an old lady’s story, Ernesto thinks he has found a lead that will allow him to find his father, a guerillero who disappeared during the war.', 'Guatemala, 2018. The country is riveted on the trial of the military officers who started the civil war. The victims’ testimonials keep pouring in. Ernesto, a young anthropologist at the Forensic Foundation, identifies people who have gone missing. One day, through an old lady’s story, Ernesto thinks he has found a lead that will allow him to find his father, a guerillero who disappeared during the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhx8o5cIEibvkoz2EVtWXGEjcEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596873'),
  ('991362353787147711', 'Our Mr. Sun', 1956, 'Documentary, TV Movie, Animation', 'Frank Capra, William T. Hurtz, Harold E. Wellman', 'Frank Capra', 'Eddie Albert, Lionel Barrymore, Frank Baxter, Marvin Miller, Sterling Holloway', 'NR', 'One entry in a series of films produced to make science accessible to the masses—especially children—this film describes the sun in scientific but entertaining terms.', 'One entry in a series of films produced to make science accessible to the masses—especially children—this film describes the sun in scientific but entertaining terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQu49IAgbhruwqMg3eMv4psovYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255733'),
  ('969162188551701640', 'Our Neighbor, Miss Yae', 1934, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Shimazu, Takashi Kuwabara, Takeshi Sato', 'Yasujirō Shimazu', 'Yumeko Aizome, Ryōtarō Mizushima, Den Obinata, Chōko Iida, Fumiko Katsuragi, Yukichi Iwata, Yoshiko Okada, Akio Isono', null, 'Keitaro is a law student and Yaeko is a high school girl. They are neighbors, and their friendship is starting to develop into something more romantic. Then, Yaeko''s sister Kyouko has a breakup with her husband and returns home. Kyouko is clearly interested in Keitaro and Yae becomes anxious.', 'Keitaro is a law student and Yaeko is a high school girl. They are neighbors, and their friendship is starting to develop into something more romantic. Then, Yaeko''s sister Kyouko has a breakup with her husband and returns home. Kyouko is clearly interested in Keitaro and Yae becomes anxious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szFtHGbuiXNJnGxTClhKF7gZ3f4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95762'),
  ('757523898485836027', 'Our Own', 2004, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Sergey Machilsky, Dmitry Meskhiev, Andrey Gurkin', 'Valentin Chernykh', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Sergey Garmash, Bohdan Stupka, Mikhail Evlanov, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Sergei Dyachkov, Aleksandr Polovtsev, Oksana Glushkova', null, 'It is August 1941. With the battle line far away in the east, three soldiers who have managed to escape from captivity find it difficult to hide: the territory is occupied by the enemy. The local woods are not safe: you can easily get embogged. Are the villagers loyal? Nobody can say. There is an old man who offers to help them. Is he reliable enough? He may kill them or report them to the local German authorities. Anything may happen, but one of them, the sniper, is his son who is his youngest, his dearest.', 'It is August 1941. With the battle line far away in the east, three soldiers who have managed to escape from captivity find it difficult to hide: the territory is occupied by the enemy. The local woods are not safe: you can easily get embogged. Are the villagers loyal? Nobody can say. There is an old man who offers to help them. Is he reliable enough? He may kill them or report them to the local German authorities. Anything may happen, but one of them, the sniper, is his son who is his youngest, his dearest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQb2cPYcziZ9lmgOuP277wxrUjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63715'),
  ('621049325512403550', 'Our Paradise', 2011, 'Drama', 'Gaël Morel', 'Gaël Morel', 'Stéphane Rideau, Dimitri Durdaine, Béatrice Dalle, Didier Flamand, Raymonde Bronstein, Malik Issolah, Mathis Morisset, Jean-Christophe Bouvet', null, 'Vassili is an aged prostitute with killer instincts. He finds an unconscious young man in the Forest of Boulogne and takes him home. Now lovers and accomplices, the two men become a couple in prostitution and steal from their clients. And yet, menaces of retaliation leave the couple with no choice but to escape from Paris. The runaway begins...', 'Vassili is an aged prostitute with killer instincts. He finds an unconscious young man in the Forest of Boulogne and takes him home. Now lovers and accomplices, the two men become a couple in prostitution and steal from their clients. And yet, menaces of retaliation leave the couple with no choice but to escape from Paris. The runaway begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTzG5MMIkupuluwhppFcgVz5ohp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99119'),
  ('149124283727761670', 'Our Patriots', 2017, 'Drama, War', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Gabriel Le Bomin', 'Gabriel Le Bomin', 'Marc Zinga, Alexandra Lamy, Pierre Deladonchamps, Louane, Audrey Bastien, Lucas Prisor, Astrid Whettnall, Grégory Gadebois', null, 'After the French defeat of summer 1940, Addi Ba, a young Senegalese rifleman escapes and hides in the Vosges. Aided by some villagers, he gets false documents that allow him to live openly.', 'After the French defeat of summer 1940, Addi Ba, a young Senegalese rifleman escapes and hides in the Vosges. Aided by some villagers, he gets false documents that allow him to live openly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPAqgWB0EgpouVXI414MXyRUejr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446045'),
  ('449854659671587720', 'Our President', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Lee Chang-jae, Kim Sun-ryung', 'Yang Hee', 'Roh Moo-hyun, Lee Hwa-chun, Moon Jae-in, Yoo Si-min, Dong Bang-woo, Moon Sung-keun, Cheon Ho-sun, Kim Dae-jung', null, 'In South Korea, 2002, the Democratic Party put the presidential nomination to a plebiscite for the first time. Amongst numerous candidates, the one who brought about the most unexpected result was a fringe candidate named Roh Moo-hyun.', 'In South Korea, 2002, the Democratic Party put the presidential nomination to a plebiscite for the first time. Amongst numerous candidates, the one who brought about the most unexpected result was a fringe candidate named Roh Moo-hyun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nD7mYdUpbeCmScpvuJeNJZaj9bT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460486'),
  ('129569844855640633', 'Our Relations', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Harry Lachman, Rudolph Maté, Leroy Shield', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Betty Brown, Daphne Pollard, Alan Hale, Sidney Toler, James Finlayson, Iris Adrian', 'NR', 'Two sailors get caught in a mountain of mix-ups when they meet their long-lost twins. Laurel and Hardy play themselves and their twins.', 'Two sailors get caught in a mountain of mix-ups when they meet their long-lost twins. Laurel and Hardy play themselves and their twins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pW7fpVDBWRDVXoFleXMgXb3p5bh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46026'),
  ('681078016589018106', 'Our Russia: Eggs of Destiny', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Gleb Orlov, Evgeny Ermolenko, Sergey Bubenko', 'Vyacheslav Dusmukhametov, Aleksei Lyaporov, Garik Martirosyan', 'Sergey Svetlakov, Mikhail Galustyan, Valeriy Magdyash, Viktor Verzhbitskiy, Aleksandr Semchev, Roman Madyanov, Nikolay Baskov, Roman Radov', null, 'Rafshan and Dzhumzhud, migrant workers from Nubarashen, illegally come to Moscow, where the team leader Leonid received an order for super-expensive repairs from one oligarch. Having lost in the capital the “nationalist”, Rafshan and Dzhumzhud are trying to find and save him, wreaking havoc and destruction everywhere. But in the most hopeless situation, fate turns to guest workers - Rafshan and Dzhumzhud learn a terrible secret that will change everything ...', 'Rafshan and Dzhumzhud, migrant workers from Nubarashen, illegally come to Moscow, where the team leader Leonid received an order for super-expensive repairs from one oligarch. Having lost in the capital the “nationalist”, Rafshan and Dzhumzhud are trying to find and save him, wreaking havoc and destruction everywhere. But in the most hopeless situation, fate turns to guest workers - Rafshan and Dzhumzhud learn a terrible secret that will change everything ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVzKZwVAYfz9ls1XtTdAm6cRFoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31059'),
  ('464369269044507613', 'Our School''s E.T.', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Park Kwang-chun', 'Choi Jin-won', 'Kim Soo-ro, Park Bo-young, Lee Chan-ho, Kim Hyeong-beom, Kim Ki-bang, Park Jin-Taek, Kim Yeong-ok, Ha Jung-woo', null, 'Sung geun, a physical education teacher, is at risk of losing his job when the school decides it needs an English teacher instead of a PE teacher. Therefore, he starts to devise a plan to change his job as an English teacher.', 'Sung geun, a physical education teacher, is at risk of losing his job when the school decides it needs an English teacher instead of a PE teacher. Therefore, he starts to devise a plan to change his job as an English teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liAvukYQ5YgB41LkCA7975WBcmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48828'),
  ('259014128009702272', 'Our Secret Diary', 2023, 'Romance', 'Kentarō Takemura, Kinomoto Kohei, Ryosuke Fukawa', 'Nami Kikkawa', 'Fumiya Takahashi, Hiyori Sakurada, Mizuki Kayashima, Ryosuke Sota, Nagisa Saito, Mizuki Itagaki, Maru Kiuchi, Coco Masui', null, 'Nozomi Kuroda is in the 2nd grade of high school. One day, she finds a letter in a classroom desk. The letter has only the word "like" written on it. The person who wrote the letter is Jun Setoyama. He happens to be the most popular boy at the high school. Nozomi Kuroda feels embarrassed, but she eventually leaves a reply in a shoe closet at school. This is how their secret exchange diary begins. Nozomi Kuroda soon learns that the intended recipient for the first letter was her best friend. Nevertheless, Nozomi Kuroda is attracted to Jun Setoyama, who expresses his thoughts and feelings unlike her. She''s unable to tell him the truth that the person exchanging messages is her and not her best friend.', 'Nozomi Kuroda is in the 2nd grade of high school. One day, she finds a letter in a classroom desk. The letter has only the word "like" written on it. The person who wrote the letter is Jun Setoyama. He happens to be the most popular boy at the high school. Nozomi Kuroda feels embarrassed, but she eventually leaves a reply in a shoe closet at school. This is how their secret exchange diary begins. Nozomi Kuroda soon learns that the intended recipient for the first letter was her best friend. Nevertheless, Nozomi Kuroda is attracted to Jun Setoyama, who expresses his thoughts and feelings unlike her. She''s unable to tell him the truth that the person exchanging messages is her and not her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7O3EQA5wuX1t86sLvH9XQQs8tKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124348'),
  ('468291685197989', 'Our Shining Days', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ho Yiu-Leung, Wang Ran, Zhang Yukun', 'Bao Jingjing', 'Xu Lu, Peng Yuchang, Liu Yongxi, Li Nuo, Lu Zhaohua, Eunice Han, Luo Mingjie, Chen Yusi', null, 'A youth inspirational film, about how a group of high school students try to revive Chinese orchestra ensemble. They face many challenges along the way to compete nationally, including a rivalry with the more popular Western orchestra club.', 'A youth inspirational film, about how a group of high school students try to revive Chinese orchestra ensemble. They face many challenges along the way to compete nationally, including a rivalry with the more popular Western orchestra club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6qLksKNblKZ7H3O2IItuUGWx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477306'),
  ('262446994882818079', 'Our Sons', 1991, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Erman, Tony Imi', 'William Hanley', 'Ann-Margret, Julie Andrews, Hugh Grant, Željko Ivanek, Tony Roberts, Hal England, Loyda Ramos, Annabelle Weenick', null, 'When James admits to his mother that he is gay it strains her liberal attitude. A San Diego businesswoman, Audrey believes she is a modern, open-minded mother, but the news sends her reeling. However, the real shock comes when James asks her to travel to Arkansas and inform his lover''s estranged mom, Luanne, that her son has AIDS. As Audrey and Luanne learn to put aside their prejudice toward each other, they soon discover how to share their thoughts, hopes and fears for their sons.', 'When James admits to his mother that he is gay it strains her liberal attitude. A San Diego businesswoman, Audrey believes she is a modern, open-minded mother, but the news sends her reeling. However, the real shock comes when James asks her to travel to Arkansas and inform his lover''s estranged mom, Luanne, that her son has AIDS. As Audrey and Luanne learn to put aside their prejudice toward each other, they soon discover how to share their thoughts, hopes and fears for their sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6kAe8zA3pDSOCLasrPBPeJ84Ef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108202'),
  ('302960142808253802', 'Our Souls at Night', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ritesh Batra, Stephen Goldblatt, Scott Robertson', 'Kent Haruf, Scott Neustadter, Michael H. Weber', 'Robert Redford, Jane Fonda, Matthias Schoenaerts, Iain Armitage, Judy Greer, Phyllis Somerville, Bruce Dern, John C. Ashton', null, 'Addie Moore and Louis Waters, a widow and widower, have lived next to each other for years. The pair have almost no relationship, but that all changes when Addie tries to make a connection with her neighbour.', 'Addie Moore and Louis Waters, a widow and widower, have lived next to each other for years. The pair have almost no relationship, but that all changes when Addie tries to make a connection with her neighbour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5qqikqIXqBzug3G6RCE8LFydKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433252'),
  ('440425793129821088', 'Our Story', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Bertrand Blier, Jean Penzer', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Alain Delon, Nathalie Baye, Gérard Darmon, Geneviève Fontanel, Michel Galabru, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Sabine Haudepin, Vincent Lindon', null, 'Robert Avranche, a middle-aged, alcoholic garage owner, is sitting on a train, reflecting on the emptiness of his life. An attractive young woman, Donatienne, suddenly enters the compartment and offers to make love to him. Robert accepts but, when the woman leaves the train afterwards, he decides to follow her...', 'Robert Avranche, a middle-aged, alcoholic garage owner, is sitting on a train, reflecting on the emptiness of his life. An attractive young woman, Donatienne, suddenly enters the compartment and offers to make love to him. Robert accepts but, when the woman leaves the train afterwards, he decides to follow her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhceLoMLFlyqd53NaEduPGazQ1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58619'),
  ('490390970318055833', 'Our Struggles', 2018, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Senez, Elin Kirschfink', 'Guillaume Senez', 'Romain Duris, Laetitia Dosch, Laure Calamy, Lucie Debay, Marc Robert, Lena Girard Voss, Basile Grunberger, Dominique Valadié', null, 'While Olivier, a 39 year-old foreman gives his job everything he’s got, Laura, his wife and the mother of their two children, abandons the family home, leaving Olivier alone to face his responsibilities. Lost and completely thrown, Olivier is going to have to come to terms with his new status as a single father raising his children alone. Because Laura’s not coming back.', 'While Olivier, a 39 year-old foreman gives his job everything he’s got, Laura, his wife and the mother of their two children, abandons the family home, leaving Olivier alone to face his responsibilities. Lost and completely thrown, Olivier is going to have to come to terms with his new status as a single father raising his children alone. Because Laura’s not coming back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rbE57ZanoU6cdx1AJdABaPrOUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514577'),
  ('956456746957067861', 'Our Sunhi', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Lee Jea-han, Park Hong-yeol', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Jung Yu-mi, Lee Sun-kyun, Kim Sang-joong, Jung Jae-young, Lee Min-woo, Ye Ji-won, Han Jae-yi, Park Joo-hee', null, 'Sunhi, a film major graduate, visits her school to ask her Professor Choi for a recommendation letter to study in U.S. Knowing the professor favors her, she expects a good recommendation from him. Out from her shell after a long time, Sunhi also ends up meeting two men from her past: Munsu, her ex-boy friend, and Jaehak, a director who graduated from the same film school. Through the encounters between Sunhi and the three men, they give each other an ''advice on life'' with good intentions. The three men who all have strong interests in her are led to guess and define her, unable to tell how she really feels inside. Strangely, the mentioned advices and traits of her are similar and seem to pass from one person to the next. The words of ''advice on life'' seem doubtable and slip away as the three men''s thoughts on Sunhi become more and more irrelevant.', 'Sunhi, a film major graduate, visits her school to ask her Professor Choi for a recommendation letter to study in U.S. Knowing the professor favors her, she expects a good recommendation from him. Out from her shell after a long time, Sunhi also ends up meeting two men from her past: Munsu, her ex-boy friend, and Jaehak, a director who graduated from the same film school. Through the encounters between Sunhi and the three men, they give each other an ''advice on life'' with good intentions. The three men who all have strong interests in her are led to guess and define her, unable to tell how she really feels inside. Strangely, the mentioned advices and traits of her are similar and seem to pass from one person to the next. The words of ''advice on life'' seem doubtable and slip away as the three men''s thoughts on Sunhi become more and more irrelevant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67Eokd5TtLaWvYpuTBatRZGXpN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211579'),
  ('152500564673974975', 'Our Ties', 2022, 'Drama', 'Roschdy Zem, Julien Poupard', 'Roschdy Zem, Maïwenn', 'Sami Bouajila, Roschdy Zem, Meriem Serbah, Maïwenn, Rachid Bouchareb, Abel Jafri, Nina Zem, Carl Malapa', null, 'Moussa has always been gentle, altruistic and present for his family. This is the opposite of his brother Ryad, a TV presenter of great notoriety who is reproached for his selfishness by his entourage. Only Moussa defends him, who has great admiration for his brother. One day Moussa falls and hits his head violently. He suffers a head injury. Unrecognizable, he now speaks without a filter and tells his relatives the truth. He ends up falling out with everyone except Ryad.', 'Moussa has always been gentle, altruistic and present for his family. This is the opposite of his brother Ryad, a TV presenter of great notoriety who is reproached for his selfishness by his entourage. Only Moussa defends him, who has great admiration for his brother. One day Moussa falls and hits his head violently. He suffers a head injury. Unrecognizable, he now speaks without a filter and tells his relatives the truth. He ends up falling out with everyone except Ryad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcEaRTwdf79DpRGrQS3Obs8Xv6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971594'),
  ('209784331626577345', 'Our Time', 2018, 'Drama', 'Carlos Reygadas, Diego García, Jofra GG.', 'Carlos Reygadas', 'Carlos Reygadas, Natalia López, Phil Burgers, Maria Hagerman, Yago Martínez, Eleazar Reygadas, Rut Reygadas', null, 'A family lives in the Mexican countryside raising fighting bulls. Esther is in charge of running the ranch, while her husband Juan, a world-renowned poet, raises and selects the beasts. Although in an open marriage, their relationship begins to crumble when Esther falls in love with an American horsebreaker and Juan is unable to control his jealousy.', 'A family lives in the Mexican countryside raising fighting bulls. Esther is in charge of running the ranch, while her husband Juan, a world-renowned poet, raises and selects the beasts. Although in an open marriage, their relationship begins to crumble when Esther falls in love with an American horsebreaker and Juan is unable to control his jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc1PFbsxGSknbb0AqKTA8ArXG5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389218'),
  ('1148434547531080714', 'Our Times', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Chen Kuo-Lung, Chiang Min-chung, Frankie Chen', 'Tseng Yung-ting', 'Vivian Sung, Darren Wang, Dino Lee, Dewi Chien, Andy Lau, Joe Chen, Jerry Yan, Berry Wen-i Kuo', null, 'Office worker Truly Lin goes on a journey through her memories. 20 years ago, she had a crush on the most popular guy in school. Taiyu, a ruffian and a bully, is in love with the campus belle. Truly teams up with Taiyu to tear the golden couple apart and help each other to get the ones they love.', 'Office worker Truly Lin goes on a journey through her memories. 20 years ago, she had a crush on the most popular guy in school. Taiyu, a ruffian and a bully, is in love with the campus belle. Truly teams up with Taiyu to tear the golden couple apart and help each other to get the ones they love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c445M1xu2M0NlcFD9hMOOgsfYFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354072'),
  ('419026797832382006', 'Our Times', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Comedy', 'Chava Cartas', 'Angélica Gudiño, Juan Carlos Garzón', 'Lucero, Benny Ibarra, Renata Vaca, Ofelia Medina, Alejandro Ávila, Lorena Graniewicz, Mario Alberto Monroy, Ana Ortizharo', 'PG-13', 'Husband and wife Nora and Héctor''s scientific breakthrough lets them time travel from 1966 to 2025. As Héctor struggles, Nora thrives—but at what cost?', 'Husband and wife Nora and Héctor''s scientific breakthrough lets them time travel from 1966 to 2025. As Héctor struggles, Nora thrives—but at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJWSUAMJI9mRSzVBJXVUg7iIoJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426680'),
  ('242324676563598815', 'Our Tiny Little Wedding', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Christian Abomnes, Kim Nguyen, Frédéric Quiring', 'Frédéric Quiring', 'Ahmed Sylla, Camille Lou, Grégoire Bonnet, Lola Marois-Bigard, Marc Riso, Andréa Ferréol, Anne Caillon, Barbara Bolotner', null, 'Max and Lou have made a promise to each other. For their wedding it will be only them and their witnesses. But that... That was without counting on the HUGE surprise party that awaits them! They wanted to be 4, they find themselves 300 and everything is going to get out of control very quickly... They were dreaming small, small... They will have big, VERY VERY big!', 'Max and Lou have made a promise to each other. For their wedding it will be only them and their witnesses. But that... That was without counting on the HUGE surprise party that awaits them! They wanted to be 4, they find themselves 300 and everything is going to get out of control very quickly... They were dreaming small, small... They will have big, VERY VERY big!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtGkgTgPGiVXTIw6H2r22KfgYb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982186'),
  ('578541349331082016', 'Our Town', 1940, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sam Wood, Bert Glennon', 'Thornton Wilder, Frank Craven, Harry Chandlee', 'William Holden, Martha Scott, Fay Bainter, Beulah Bondi, Thomas Mitchell, Guy Kibbee, Frank Craven, Stuart Erwin', 'NR', 'Change comes slowly to a small New Hampshire town in the early 20th century. We see birth, life and death in this small community.', 'Change comes slowly to a small New Hampshire town in the early 20th century. We see birth, life and death in this small community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXYWSUIUfiG06XzgSSkd4sQFOru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23283'),
  ('904257123739132357', 'Our Town', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jeong Gil-young', 'Mo Hong-jin', 'Oh Man-seok, Lee Sun-kyun, Ryu Deok-hwan, Park Myung-shin, Jeon Hye-won, Mun Ka-young, Lee Mu-saeng, Jeong In-gi', null, 'A writer kills his landlady and stages the body to look like the work of an active serial killer. Anxious that the police might figure out the truth, he decides to insert himself into the investigation using his detective friend.', 'A writer kills his landlady and stages the body to look like the work of an active serial killer. Anxious that the police might figure out the truth, he decides to insert himself into the investigation using his detective friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xK9TrtbVQbPlCSEtiGa40XdWBCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55767'),
  ('72568716471156080', 'Our Trip to Africa', 1966, null, 'Peter Kubelka', null, null, null, 'Originally commissioned by an Austrian couple in 1961 to photograph a travel diary documenting their wild game hunt, Kubelka shot three hours of film and recorded fourteen hours of audio. Over the next few years, Kubelka toiled in the editing bay, producing a work charged with intricate, ironic brutality.', 'Originally commissioned by an Austrian couple in 1961 to photograph a travel diary documenting their wild game hunt, Kubelka shot three hours of film and recorded fourteen hours of audio. Over the next few years, Kubelka toiled in the editing bay, producing a work charged with intricate, ironic brutality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g5ngf2Qk3v7XUwPzBlUiKZUNlz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109398'),
  ('407172889178913489', 'Our Tropical Island', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Marcello Cesena, Régis Blondeau', 'Hans Turner, Thomas Bahmann, Marcello Cesena', 'Diego Abatantuono, Victoria Abril, Chiara Sani, Giulia Louise Steigerwalt, Barbara Bouchet, Antonio Stornaiolo, Enzo Cannavale, Nando Gazzolo', null, 'A businessman is leaving for his family vacation in the South Pacific when he finds out that a rival has emptied his bank account. To save face he and his family lock themselves in the house, pretending to have gone on their trip, but it is not so easy to hide from the outside world.', 'A businessman is leaving for his family vacation in the South Pacific when he finds out that a rival has emptied his bank account. To save face he and his family lock themselves in the house, pretending to have gone on their trip, but it is not so easy to hide from the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4a33u25JIrzvkJPHi3GHslf84Lr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73074'),
  ('268003933241086142', 'Our Twisted Hero', 1992, 'Drama', 'Park Chong-won, Chung Kwang-suk', 'Jang Hyeon-su', 'Hong Kyung-in, Ko Jeong-il, Choi Min-sik, Tae Min-young, Shin Gu, Kim Hye-ok, Lee Jin-sun', null, 'Han Byung-tae, who teaches at a private after-school academy in Seoul, receives word that his old teacher has passed away and sets off to the rural village where he attended elementary school. In the train, he reminisces about the tough fights he used to get into back in the day.', 'Han Byung-tae, who teaches at a private after-school academy in Seoul, receives word that his old teacher has passed away and sets off to the rural village where he attended elementary school. In the train, he reminisces about the tough fights he used to get into back in the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jto92RktfOsP5cafcNJ0uJ7yFTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271795'),
  ('1142475379938621042', 'Our Uniform', 2023, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Yegane Moghaddam', 'Yegane Moghaddam', null, null, 'An Iranian girl unfolds her school memories through the wrinkles and fabrics of her old uniform. She admits that she''s nothing but a "female" and explores the roots of this idea in her school years.', 'An Iranian girl unfolds her school memories through the wrinkles and fabrics of her old uniform. She admits that she''s nothing but a "female" and explores the roots of this idea in her school years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snlg7HFl14pJLTROxdpG0i5EFDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140605'),
  ('15498586731577958', 'Our Very Own', 1950, 'Drama', 'David Miller, Lee Garmes, Eddie Garvin', 'F. Hugh Herbert', 'Ann Blyth, Farley Granger, Joan Evans, Jane Wyatt, Ann Dvorak, Donald Cook, Natalie Wood, Gus Schilling', null, 'During a heated argument with her sister Joan, Gail discovers the shocking news that she is adopted. With the reluctant support of her adoptive parents and baby sister Penny, Gail goes in search of her biological mother and true identity.', 'During a heated argument with her sister Joan, Gail discovers the shocking news that she is adopted. With the reluctant support of her adoptive parents and baby sister Penny, Gail goes in search of her biological mother and true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXbZVZVQUOLGtbLr2ezuDvJfX1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97332'),
  ('944027552818711673', 'Our Vines Have Tender Grapes', 1945, 'Drama, Family', 'Horace Hough, Roy Rowland, Robert Surtees', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Edward G. Robinson, Margaret O''Brien, James Craig, Frances Gifford, Agnes Moorehead, Morris Carnovsky, Jackie ''Butch'' Jenkins, Arthur Space', 'NR', 'Welcome to Fuller Junction, Wisconsin, a friendly small town settled by Norwegian farmers. Here we see the exploits of two young cousins, Selma and Arnold, who learn about their world and experience the ups and downs of life as the season pass.', 'Welcome to Fuller Junction, Wisconsin, a friendly small town settled by Norwegian farmers. Here we see the exploits of two young cousins, Selma and Arnold, who learn about their world and experience the ups and downs of life as the season pass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pImRa1RwYGtAOk3JxWUG5aOKo08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108843'),
  ('138191549056308707', 'Our War Game', 2000, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Hisashi Mori, Takaaki Yamashita', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Toshiko Fujita, Yuko Mizutani, Youto Kazama, Umi Tenjin, Ai Maeda, Hiroko Konishi, Masami Kikuchi, Kae Araki', 'PG', 'Spring break turns into a summer war when the evil Diaboromon wreaks havoc on the internet, and Tai and Matt must achieve a new Digivolution to defeat him! Will Tai and the Digidestined save the world, and will Sora ever forgive Tai for giving her a hair clip?', 'Spring break turns into a summer war when the evil Diaboromon wreaks havoc on the internet, and Tai and Matt must achieve a new Digivolution to defeat him! Will Tai and the Digidestined save the world, and will Sora ever forgive Tai for giving her a hair clip?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rY7XzmfQgwMYJXAZSIChU5FLP7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75571'),
  ('582576270624525044', 'Our Way To The Sea', 2020, 'Drama', 'Nacho Garassino', 'Juan Faerman', 'Santiago Bal, Federico Bal, Anita Martínez, Zulma Faiad, Laura Laprida', null, 'Living in Tucumán, 75-year-old Julio Pereyra (Santiago Bal) has always dreamed of visiting the coast, and after seeing his doctor, he realizes it’s either now or never. He hopes to enlist his errant son, Marcos (Federico Bal, the star’s real-life son), to take him by motorcycle; both Marcos and his by-the-books sister (Anita Martínez) are opposed to the idea. But before he reaches his final destination, Julio will have the opportunity to check several things off his bucket list in this emotionally resonant road movie.', 'Living in Tucumán, 75-year-old Julio Pereyra (Santiago Bal) has always dreamed of visiting the coast, and after seeing his doctor, he realizes it’s either now or never. He hopes to enlist his errant son, Marcos (Federico Bal, the star’s real-life son), to take him by motorcycle; both Marcos and his by-the-books sister (Anita Martínez) are opposed to the idea. But before he reaches his final destination, Julio will have the opportunity to check several things off his bucket list in this emotionally resonant road movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hD3RoyKADS4qc3hcDVFJXvqda1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656736'),
  ('585679600470493730', 'Our Wife', 1931, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne, Art Lloyd, Jack Stevens', 'Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Babe London, James Finlayson, Ben Turpin, Charley Rogers, Blanche Payson', 'NR', 'Oliver is making plans to marry his sweetheart Dulcy with Stan as his best man, but the plans are thwarted when Dulcy''s father sees a picture of Ollie and forbids the marriage. The couple plan to elope, and run away to a Justice of the Peace. After typical Laurel and Hardy blundering, they manage to sneak the girl away from her father''s house.', 'Oliver is making plans to marry his sweetheart Dulcy with Stan as his best man, but the plans are thwarted when Dulcy''s father sees a picture of Ollie and forbids the marriage. The couple plan to elope, and run away to a Justice of the Peace. After typical Laurel and Hardy blundering, they manage to sneak the girl away from her father''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F7mLznUijB9C5yb5cPsj8adkVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48905'),
  ('412140100176739187', 'Our Women', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Berry', 'Eric Assous, Richard Berry', 'Daniel Auteuil, Thierry Lhermitte, Richard Berry, Pauline Lefèvre, Mireille Perrier, Joséphine Berry, Pascale Louange, Marisa Borini', null, 'Max, Paul and Simon have been friends for 35 years. They take great pleasure in their one vacation a year together without their partners and meet-up regularly to spend evenings drinking or playing cards. Each has a successful career and they all appear to have perfect lives until the night Simon announces to his friends that he has just strangled his wife, Estelle after a blazing row. Max and Paul are horrified by Simon''s confession, but worse is to come when Simon asks them to lie and provide him with an alibi for the time Estelle was killed. Both men are torn between lying or turning over their best friend to the police.', 'Max, Paul and Simon have been friends for 35 years. They take great pleasure in their one vacation a year together without their partners and meet-up regularly to spend evenings drinking or playing cards. Each has a successful career and they all appear to have perfect lives until the night Simon announces to his friends that he has just strangled his wife, Estelle after a blazing row. Max and Paul are horrified by Simon''s confession, but worse is to come when Simon asks them to lie and provide him with an alibi for the time Estelle was killed. Both men are torn between lying or turning over their best friend to the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIS2xmCZgEL0pWlhuv1cyZllVkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332812'),
  ('991369414100493934', 'Our Wonderful Lives', 2019, 'Drama', 'Fabienne Godet, Marie Celette', 'Fabienne Godet, Julie Moulier', 'Julie Moulier, Johan Libéreau, Zoé Héran, Bruno Lochet, Abbes Zahmani, Camille Rutherford, François-Michel Van Der Rest', null, 'Margot, Jeremy, Salome, Caesar, Sonia - They are between 18 and 50 years old. Everything separates them except the urgency to rebuild and restore the relationship to the other that the addiction has destroyed. Solidary, they have as rules, sharing, honesty, authenticity, sincerity, humanity. An incredible band of living people who are screaming loudly that we are doing better than others alone.', 'Margot, Jeremy, Salome, Caesar, Sonia - They are between 18 and 50 years old. Everything separates them except the urgency to rebuild and restore the relationship to the other that the addiction has destroyed. Solidary, they have as rules, sharing, honesty, authenticity, sincerity, humanity. An incredible band of living people who are screaming loudly that we are doing better than others alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIvfe28aeAgEKCvuTx8MCtErBuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575872'),
  ('856149282923830024', 'Our Youth In Taiwan', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Fu Yue', null, null, null, 'A star of the Taiwanese student movement, a celebrity Chinese student who loves Taiwan, and a Taiwanese documentary filmmaker passionate about politics. Each of them shared dreams of rebellion and building a better country. In the wake of the biggest social movement in Taiwan in recent years, they reflect on how close they came to realising their goals, how they were let down, and whether it is still possible to continue fighting for ideals.', 'A star of the Taiwanese student movement, a celebrity Chinese student who loves Taiwan, and a Taiwanese documentary filmmaker passionate about politics. Each of them shared dreams of rebellion and building a better country. In the wake of the biggest social movement in Taiwan in recent years, they reflect on how close they came to realising their goals, how they were let down, and whether it is still possible to continue fighting for ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ugq1bdOPWhczu2wQTZn92g8iQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533574'),
  ('1002303303662919588', 'Ouran High School Host Club', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Satoshi Kan, Masahiko Omi, Hiroki Shibazaki', 'Natsuko Ikeda', 'Haruna Kawaguchi, Yusuke Yamamoto, Shunsuke Daitoh, Ryo Ryusei, Nana Seino, Yudai Chiba, Masaya Nakamura, Manpei Takagi', null, 'Ouran Academy is a prestigious school with most students coming from wealthy families. One of the few students who comes from a modest background is Haruhi Fujioka (Haruna Kawaguchi). Through unexpected circumstances, Haruhi Fujioka ends up joining the male "host club," while hiding her gender. Friendship and love grows between Haruhi Fujioka and the male "host club" members.', 'Ouran Academy is a prestigious school with most students coming from wealthy families. One of the few students who comes from a modest background is Haruhi Fujioka (Haruna Kawaguchi). Through unexpected circumstances, Haruhi Fujioka ends up joining the male "host club," while hiding her gender. Friendship and love grows between Haruhi Fujioka and the male "host club" members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyj8X2HsGImGvOuw526FHpuPNjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152752'),
  ('1003921118820618798', 'Ousama Game', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Norio Tsuruta', 'Junya Kato', 'Yurina Kumai, Airi Suzuki, Dori Sakurada, Hitomi Yoshizawa, Maimi Yajima, Saki Nakajima, Chisato Okai, Mai Hagiwara', null, 'One night, Chiemi Honda and childhood friend Nobuaki Kanazawa receive an email. The sender is the King and the subject of the email is "King Game." The email states that if the recipient does not complete the king''s order within 24 hours then they will be punished. Since that first email all of Chiemi''s classmates receive an email from the King. At first, students think it''s a joke, but perform the orders anyways. Gradually, the orders become worse. Finally, 2 classmates who do not follow the orders are punished. Then classmates start to disappear in sequence. Maria Iwamura stares at one classmate coldly. With Maria Iwamura, Chiema Honda gets closer to uncovering the identity of the King, but tragedy is about to come to Chiemi..', 'One night, Chiemi Honda and childhood friend Nobuaki Kanazawa receive an email. The sender is the King and the subject of the email is "King Game." The email states that if the recipient does not complete the king''s order within 24 hours then they will be punished. Since that first email all of Chiemi''s classmates receive an email from the King. At first, students think it''s a joke, but perform the orders anyways. Gradually, the orders become worse. Finally, 2 classmates who do not follow the orders are punished. Then classmates start to disappear in sequence. Maria Iwamura stares at one classmate coldly. With Maria Iwamura, Chiema Honda gets closer to uncovering the identity of the King, but tragedy is about to come to Chiemi..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2DBvlMgsoP6ZjIR0PHj0WgBkae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125162'),
  ('430201641620299781', 'Out', 1982, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Eli Hollander', 'Ronald Sukenick', 'Peter Coyote, Jim Haynie, Danny Glover, Scott Beach, O-Lan Jones, Semu Haute, Max Grodénchik, Gail Dartez', 'R', 'A self-styled "urban guerrilla" in Greenwich Village is sent on various assignments across the country by a mysterious "commander."', 'A self-styled "urban guerrilla" in Greenwich Village is sent on various assignments across the country by a mysterious "commander."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdPmvQbFiM3qEleRCgXaNSgla20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56674'),
  ('922055363827200234', 'Out', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Denis Parrot', null, 'Campbell Gatley, Brandon Gatley, Mother Gatley, Jesi, Jesi''s Mother, Adam Jernberg, Adam''s Mother, Shayla Miller', null, 'Through a montage of compelling videos posted on the Internet by young gays, bis, lesbians or transsexuals, «Out» makes us experience from within the groundbreaking moment of their coming out – after which their intimate and social life shall be forever changed.', 'Through a montage of compelling videos posted on the Internet by young gays, bis, lesbians or transsexuals, «Out» makes us experience from within the groundbreaking moment of their coming out – after which their intimate and social life shall be forever changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fX39zTZ4mpnfWywOrgJj3AFGtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534369'),
  ('443584282596113685', 'Out', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Family, Romance', 'Steven Clay Hunter, Gordon D.B. Cameron, Matthew Silas', 'Steven Clay Hunter', 'Bernadette Sullivan, Kyle McDaniel, Caleb Cabrera, Matthew Martin', 'PG', 'On an average day, Greg''s life is filled with family, love and a rambunctious little dog - but despite all of this, Greg has a secret. Today is different, though. With some help from his precocious pup, and a little bit of magic, Greg might learn that he has nothing to hide.', 'On an average day, Greg''s life is filled with family, love and a rambunctious little dog - but despite all of this, Greg has a secret. Today is different, though. With some help from his precocious pup, and a little bit of magic, Greg might learn that he has nothing to hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCmtnJqu4Lk4yzEPoLZkHYrpwaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706860'),
  ('433439620019711179', 'Out 1', 1990, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Suzanne Schiffman, Jacques Rivette, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Jacques Rivette, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Juliet Berto, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Michèle Moretti, Hermine Karagheuz, Karen Puig, Pierre Baillot, Marcel Bozonnet, Michael Lonsdale', null, 'While two theater groups rehearse plays by Aeschylus, two solitary individuals wander the Parisian streets hustling the populace for cash.', 'While two theater groups rehearse plays by Aeschylus, two solitary individuals wander the Parisian streets hustling the populace for cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcyr1IZOHtPriQkm0NP6oMXDeLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94528'),
  ('457629756406474020', 'Out 1: Spectre', 1973, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Jacques Rivette, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Suzanne Schiffman, Jacques Rivette', 'Juliet Berto, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Bulle Ogier, Françoise Fabian, Michael Lonsdale, Hermine Karagheuz, Bernadette Lafont, Pierre Baillot', null, 'Out 1: Spectre begins as nothing more than scenes from Parisian life; only as time goes by do we realize that there is a plot—perhaps playful, perhaps sinister—that implicates not just the thirteen characters, but maybe everyone, everywhere. Real life may be nothing but an enormous yarn someone somewhere is spinning...', 'Out 1: Spectre begins as nothing more than scenes from Parisian life; only as time goes by do we realize that there is a plot—perhaps playful, perhaps sinister—that implicates not just the thirteen characters, but maybe everyone, everywhere. Real life may be nothing but an enormous yarn someone somewhere is spinning...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bQKGDsrVsU3pNPlM0YQpwsv8my.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156015'),
  ('601907532956626696', 'Out Cold', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Malcolm Mowbray, Tony Pierce-Roberts', 'Leonard Glasser, George Malko', 'John Lithgow, Teri Garr, Randy Quaid, Bruce McGill, Lisa Blount, Alan Blumenfeld, Carole Goldman, Larry Miller', null, 'Sunny is married to the butcher, Ernie, and their marriage is about to end as both of them have affairs. Thus Sunny hires Lester Atlas as private investigator in order to collect proof for the divorce. One evening drunken Ernie and his partner Dave have a fight in the butcher shop with Ernie getting knocked out in the fridge where he dies during the night. But it was not Dave''s fault but intentional murder by Sunny. Only Lester has proof so Sunny kills him, too. Thus she only has to kill Dave to get rid of all witnesses, but he can free himself out of the fridge and wants to take revenge.', 'Sunny is married to the butcher, Ernie, and their marriage is about to end as both of them have affairs. Thus Sunny hires Lester Atlas as private investigator in order to collect proof for the divorce. One evening drunken Ernie and his partner Dave have a fight in the butcher shop with Ernie getting knocked out in the fridge where he dies during the night. But it was not Dave''s fault but intentional murder by Sunny. Only Lester has proof so Sunny kills him, too. Thus she only has to kill Dave to get rid of all witnesses, but he can free himself out of the fridge and wants to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNZHSsF7HPzldLv5SJnRD2BLpAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120328'),
  ('897585267064767347', 'Out Cold', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Brendan Malloy, Emmett Malloy, Richard Crudo', 'Jon Zack', 'Jason London, Lee Majors, Zach Galifianakis, Victoria Silvstedt, David Koechner, Willie Garson, A. J. Cook, Caroline Dhavernas', 'PG-13', 'Rick Rambis and his friends are having the time of their lives on Bull Mountain—until the legendary Papa Muntz'' son decides to sell the mountain to a sleazy land developer, have the staff fired and turn Bull Mountain into ''Yuppieville''.', 'Rick Rambis and his friends are having the time of their lives on Bull Mountain—until the legendary Papa Muntz'' son decides to sell the mountain to a sleazy land developer, have the staff fired and turn Bull Mountain into ''Yuppieville''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aBepBnMXRs3hmde9Je3rn5bseJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14369'),
  ('732974205945443698', 'Out Come the Wolves', 2024, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Adam MacDonald, Christian Bielz, Cowin Poon', 'Adam MacDonald, Joris Jarsky', 'Missy Peregrym, Joris Jarsky, Damon Runyan', 'R', 'At a cabin deep in the wilderness, a weekend of hunting turns to mayhem and a fight for survival when a pack of wolves attack a man, his female best friend and her fiance.', 'At a cabin deep in the wilderness, a weekend of hunting turns to mayhem and a fight for survival when a pack of wolves attack a man, his female best friend and her fiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDijoX2DQlymtUL44lCxJ1JLsGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216103'),
  ('331498922368054732', 'Out for a Kill', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Michael Oblowitz, Franklin A. Vallette, Mark Vargo', 'Dennis Dimster', 'Steven Seagal, Kata Dobó, Tom Wu, Corey Johnson, Michelle Goh, Bruce Wang, Ozzie Yue, Chike Chan', 'R', 'An unsuspecting university professor is an unwitting accomplice in a foiled Chinese cocaine deal. Wrongly imprisoned, he escapes to take his revenge and prove his innocence.', 'An unsuspecting university professor is an unwitting accomplice in a foiled Chinese cocaine deal. Wrongly imprisoned, he escapes to take his revenge and prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YIdZK06KAmbaNCeUy79zjteHmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30806'),
  ('702547465207234912', 'Out for Blood', 1992, 'Action', 'Richard Pepin, Richard W. Munchkin, Scott McAboy', 'Robert Easter', 'Don Wilson, Shari Shattuck, Michael Delano, Ron Steelman, Ken McLeod, Todd Curtis, Aki Aleong, Beau Billingslea', 'R', 'A lawyer''s family is murdered by drug smugglers, and he is beaten and left for dead, but survives although in a coma. When he awakes he only has a partial memory of what happened. In order to find out the real story, he trains with a karate master and becomes a mysterious avenger known as "The Karate Man".', 'A lawyer''s family is murdered by drug smugglers, and he is beaten and left for dead, but survives although in a coma. When he awakes he only has a partial memory of what happened. In order to find out the real story, he trains with a karate master and becomes a mysterious avenger known as "The Karate Man".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDDrOiknFMeip3GylLqvikaInrN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121820'),
  ('295546343736750215', 'Out for Justice', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Flynn, Jerry Ziesmer, Ric Waite', 'R. Lance Hill', 'Steven Seagal, William Forsythe, Jerry Orbach, Jo Champa, Shareen Mitchell, Sal Richards, Gina Gershon, Jay Acovone', 'R', 'Gino Felino is an NYPD detective from Brooklyn who knows everyone and everything in his neighborhood. Killing his partner was someone''s big mistake... because he''s now out for justice.', 'Gino Felino is an NYPD detective from Brooklyn who knows everyone and everything in his neighborhood. Killing his partner was someone''s big mistake... because he''s now out for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmfM1diysOyrX4JbvwS7uOomyes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14362'),
  ('82748178436578196', 'Out in the Dark', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Michael Mayer, Ran Aviad', 'Yael Shafrir, Michael Mayer', 'Michael Aloni, Nicholas Jacob, Loai Nofi, Alon Pdut, Khawlah Hag-Debsy, Maysa Daw, Jameel Khoury, Shimon Mimran', 'NR', 'Two young men — a Palestinian grad student and an Israeli lawyer — meet and fall in love amidst personal and political intrigue.', 'Two young men — a Palestinian grad student and an Israeli lawyer — meet and fall in love amidst personal and political intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1e4rasagdrAmqlRKOBZ52zy2rt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128154'),
  ('616190530449858391', 'Out in the Open', 2019, 'Drama', 'Benito Zambrano, Pau Esteve Birba', 'Daniel Remón, Pablo Remón, Benito Zambrano', 'Luis Tosar, Luis Callejo, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Kandido Uranga, Mona Martínez, Adriano Carvalho, María Alfonsa Rosso, Yoima Valdés', null, 'A boy escaped from home, listening, crouched in the depths of his hiding place, the cries of the men who seek him. When the game passes, what remains before him is an infinite and arid plain that he must cross if he wants to get away definitively from what has made him flee. His steps will intersect with those of a pastor and, from that moment, nothing will be the same for either of them.', 'A boy escaped from home, listening, crouched in the depths of his hiding place, the cries of the men who seek him. When the game passes, what remains before him is an infinite and arid plain that he must cross if he wants to get away definitively from what has made him flee. His steps will intersect with those of a pastor and, from that moment, nothing will be the same for either of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0sNYuHQmRkmin2dUapIYce7W2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630018'),
  ('719019372013790695', 'Out Live', 2000, 'Drama, Action, Fantasy', 'Kim Young-jun', 'Jeong Yong-ki, Kim Young-jun', 'Shin Hyun-jun, Kim Hee-seon, Jung Jin-young, Jang Dong-jik, Kim Hak-cheol, Ki Joo-bong, Seo Tae-hwa, Choi Yu-jeong', null, 'A sweeping, epic tale of a martial arts warrior who attempts to defy a kingdom to be with his love.', 'A sweeping, epic tale of a martial arts warrior who attempts to defy a kingdom to be with his love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SjrptqgtohCS0U1FPvpqKndrEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16404'),
  ('737394524911505795', 'Out of Africa', 1985, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'David Watkin, Sydney Pollack, David Tomblin', 'Kurt Luedtke', 'Robert Redford, Meryl Streep, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Michael Kitchen, Malick Bowens, Michael Gough, Suzanna Hamilton, Rachel Kempson', 'PG', 'Tells the life story of Danish author Karen Blixen, who at the beginning of the 20th century moved to Africa to build a new life for herself. The film is based on her 1937 autobiographical novel.', 'Tells the life story of Danish author Karen Blixen, who at the beginning of the 20th century moved to Africa to build a new life for herself. The film is based on her 1937 autobiographical novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oMKqh08TfxmvnoFR4mm1wZB67P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606'),
  ('689665261921748148', 'Out of Blue', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Ashley Wright, Kat Hess, Carol Morley', 'Carol Morley', 'Patricia Clarkson, Toby Jones, Mamie Gummer, Aaron Tveit, James Caan, Alyshia Ochse, Yolonda Ross, Tenea Intriago', null, 'Mike Hoolihan is an unconventional New Orleans cop investigating the murder of renowned astrophysicist Jennifer Rockwell, a black hole expert found shot to death in her observatory. As Mike tumbles down the rabbit hole of the disturbing, labyrinthine case, she finds herself grappling with increasingly existential questions of quantum mechanics, parallel universes, and exploding stars. The hunt for a killer draws a detective into an even larger mystery: the nature of the universe itself.', 'Mike Hoolihan is an unconventional New Orleans cop investigating the murder of renowned astrophysicist Jennifer Rockwell, a black hole expert found shot to death in her observatory. As Mike tumbles down the rabbit hole of the disturbing, labyrinthine case, she finds herself grappling with increasingly existential questions of quantum mechanics, parallel universes, and exploding stars. The hunt for a killer draws a detective into an even larger mystery: the nature of the universe itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k74DaMtAhnjeOGX6LIXsvwMStfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477016'),
  ('764086562074014389', 'Out of Bounds', 1986, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Tuggle, Bruce Surtees, Bill Scott', 'Tony Kayden', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Glynn Turman, Jenny Wright, Jeff Kober, Raymond J. Barry, Pepe Serna, Michele Little, Jerry Levine', 'R', 'Farm boy Daryl Cage''s parents ship him off to the big city to live with his brother, hoping he will have a better life there. After a baggage mixup at the airport, Daryl finds himself in possession of a drug cache, which a ruthless drug dealer wants back. The dealer murders Daryl''s brother and the small town boy ends up all alone in the big city, being pursued by both the drug dealer and the police, who suspect him of the murder.', 'Farm boy Daryl Cage''s parents ship him off to the big city to live with his brother, hoping he will have a better life there. After a baggage mixup at the airport, Daryl finds himself in possession of a drug cache, which a ruthless drug dealer wants back. The dealer murders Daryl''s brother and the small town boy ends up all alone in the big city, being pursued by both the drug dealer and the police, who suspect him of the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOp7kLTkp1UAT6LjTX5V7rlnGqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46743'),
  ('796062548460529127', 'Out of Bounds', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Peter Thorwarth, Jan Fehse', 'Alexander M. Rümelin, Peter Thorwarth', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Dirk Benedict, Wolf Roth, Alexandra Neldel, Ralf Richter, Ludger Pistor, Bernd Herzsprung, Ingrid Steeger', null, 'Ingo organizes a charity event for the local golf club. Special guest will be the Hollywood star Douglas Burnett. But who remembers what the aging star looks like today?', 'Ingo organizes a charity event for the local golf club. Special guest will be the Hollywood star Douglas Burnett. But who remembers what the aging star looks like today?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6lXPa9JOO7H8SYThw3xB2x7ufc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11406'),
  ('182129039391272772', 'Out of Control', 1985, 'Action, Drama', 'Allan Holzman, John A. Alonzo', 'Vicangelo Bulluck, Sandra Weintraub', 'Martin Hewitt, Betsy Russell, Claudia Udy, Andrew J. Lederer, Cindi Deitrich, Richard Kantor, Sherilyn Fenn, Jim Youngs', 'R', 'Upon graduation from high school eight teens take a seaplane trip, intending to celebrate on Keith''s parents'' private island. Stormy weather causes the plane to crash and they end up on a deserted isle. They find evidence of other visitors, and soon must fend for their lives against drug smugglers.', 'Upon graduation from high school eight teens take a seaplane trip, intending to celebrate on Keith''s parents'' private island. Stormy weather causes the plane to crash and they end up on a deserted isle. They find evidence of other visitors, and soon must fend for their lives against drug smugglers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRUEqpmpMYpn07zlY0XiMEwJne6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92304'),
  ('187013610540337307', 'Out of Control', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Anne Le Ny, Laurent Dailland', 'Anne Le Ny', 'Omar Sy, Élodie Bouchez, Vanessa Paradis, José Garcia, Marie Ayissi', null, 'Julien and Marie have enjoyed 15 years of seemingly stable marriage until Anaëlle, Julien’s childhood flame, returns. Her sudden presence awakens old insecurities in Marie, who begins to doubt Julien’s devotion and question her self-worth. Amid this emotional storm, Marie is drawn to Thomas, a charismatic stranger who offers her the validation she craves.', 'Julien and Marie have enjoyed 15 years of seemingly stable marriage until Anaëlle, Julien’s childhood flame, returns. Her sudden presence awakens old insecurities in Marie, who begins to doubt Julien’s devotion and question her self-worth. Amid this emotional storm, Marie is drawn to Thomas, a charismatic stranger who offers her the validation she craves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogGfNlDQ8Tdwa1FdmKx4JpnuMJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193115'),
  ('468540476129617639', 'Out of Darkness', 2024, 'Adventure, Horror, Thriller', 'Ben Fordesman, Andrew Cumming', 'Ruth Greenberg', 'Safia Oakley-Green, Kit Young, Chuku Modu, Iola Evans, Arno Luening, Luna Mwezi, Rosebud Melarkey, Tyrell Mhlanga', 'R', 'In the Old Stone Age, a disparate gang of early humans band together in search of a new land. But when they suspect a malevolent, mystical, being is hunting them down, the clan are forced to confront a danger they never envisaged.', 'In the Old Stone Age, a disparate gang of early humans band together in search of a new land. But when they suspect a malevolent, mystical, being is hunting them down, the clan are forced to confront a danger they never envisaged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tG77VE7bP8ve79X86ABwHzDqbb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823491'),
  ('142680023107442759', 'Out of Death', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Peter A. Holland, Mike Burns', 'Bill Lawrence', 'Jaime King, Bruce Willis, Lala Kent, Tyler Jon Olson, Kelly Greyson, Michael Sirow, Megan Leonard, Kayla Eva', 'R', 'As Shannon, a woman who wants to put her father''s ashes away in the woods witnesses a corrupt cop dealing drugs with a junkie, she has to try and run away after she gets rampaged by two discreditable cops after they see her taking secret photographs of their crime maneuver. They then do a cat-and-mouse game around the woods as Shannon teams up with a retired sheriff along the way for more reinforcement. It''s just a diversion of survival and egalitarianism.', 'As Shannon, a woman who wants to put her father''s ashes away in the woods witnesses a corrupt cop dealing drugs with a junkie, she has to try and run away after she gets rampaged by two discreditable cops after they see her taking secret photographs of their crime maneuver. They then do a cat-and-mouse game around the woods as Shannon teams up with a retired sheriff along the way for more reinforcement. It''s just a diversion of survival and egalitarianism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zan6xYKNGKgkp2hFajU398I1iTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774714'),
  ('515314536293035781', 'Out of Exile', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Action, Crime', 'Kyle Kauwika Harris', 'Kyle Kauwika Harris', 'Adam Hampton, Karrie Cox, Kyle Jacob Henry, Ryan Merriman, Peter Greene, Hayley McFarland, Aurelian Smith Jr., Luce Rains', 'R', 'Recently paroled thief Gabriel Russell tries to balance his life and mend a troubled family as an FBI agent hunts him down, along with his crew after a botched armored car robbery.', 'Recently paroled thief Gabriel Russell tries to balance his life and mend a troubled family as an FBI agent hunts him down, along with his crew after a botched armored car robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgF5XaXnJmOgMxulhy2k1f9LNNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729165'),
  ('197460382392270389', 'Out of Hand', 2005, 'Drama', 'Eva Urthaler, Alfio Contini', 'Eva Urthaler', 'Elisabetta Rocchetti, Ludwig Trepte, Sergej Moya, Georg Friedrich, Birgit Doll, Ana Stefanović', null, 'Sebastian and Paul are two bored boys about 16 years of age. They drink alcohol, steal - and attend a private school. They can''t find a sense of meaning in their present adolescent existence. They abduct Sonja and lock her in an old, abandoned factory building. But what shall they do with her? Disorientation, fear, desire and also love are changing into cruel aggression.', 'Sebastian and Paul are two bored boys about 16 years of age. They drink alcohol, steal - and attend a private school. They can''t find a sense of meaning in their present adolescent existence. They abduct Sonja and lock her in an old, abandoned factory building. But what shall they do with her? Disorientation, fear, desire and also love are changing into cruel aggression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUqEKLUmyr1Cavecdj7YUl5oy9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12805'),
  ('355072170586137279', 'Out of Inferno', 2013, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Danny Pang Phat, Oxide Pang Chun, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Szeto Kam-Yuen, Nicholl Tang Nik-Kei, Danny Pang Phat', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Louis Koo, Chen Sicheng, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Crystal Lee, Marc Ma, Jin Qiaoqiao, Zang Jinsheng', 'PG-13', 'On the hottest day in 50 years, a serious fire incident happened to a busy commercial tower, a gaggle of fire fighters with an indestructible enthusiasm are going to save lives.', 'On the hottest day in 50 years, a serious fire incident happened to a busy commercial tower, a gaggle of fire fighters with an indestructible enthusiasm are going to save lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiXP1HoGKxwo8gu7g2hlQPWNBkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244339'),
  ('1151578623846957793', 'Out of It', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Oury, Edmond Séchan', 'Danièle Thompson, Gérard Oury', 'Pierre Richard, Victor Lanoux, Raymond Bussières, Jean-Pierre Darras, Yvonne Gaudeau, Jacques Frantz, Claude Brosset, Blanche Ravalec', null, 'The lawyer is visiting a prison to meet with a violent criminal who has been condemned to death. During the visit, things turn bad, there is a riot where prisoners escape and the criminal escapes taking a lawyer hostage.', 'The lawyer is visiting a prison to meet with a violent criminal who has been condemned to death. During the visit, things turn bad, there is a riot where prisoners escape and the criminal escapes taking a lawyer hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp9GLhiH4oelQAnVRm9EQFwPxrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61864'),
  ('874355687615646229', 'Out of Life', 1991, 'Drama, War', 'Maroun Bagdadi, Patrick Blossier', 'Maroun Bagdadi, Didier Decoin', 'Hippolyte Girardot, Rafic Ali Ahmad, Hussein Sbeity, Majdi Machmouchi, Habib Hammoud, Hassan Farhat, Hamza Nasrallah, Sami Hawat', null, 'Patrick Perrault, a photo-journalist covering the war in Beirut in the late 1980s, is himself caught up in the hostilities when one day he is picked up and bundled into a car at gun-point. Blind-folded, he is taken to an unknown location where he discovers that he is being taken hostage by Lebanese guerrillas.', 'Patrick Perrault, a photo-journalist covering the war in Beirut in the late 1980s, is himself caught up in the hostilities when one day he is picked up and bundled into a car at gun-point. Blind-folded, he is taken to an unknown location where he discovers that he is being taken hostage by Lebanese guerrillas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ3bKnUXQp95Xaql5XIgqNdLEwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66753'),
  ('441148787742330787', 'Out of Love', 2016, 'Drama', 'Paloma Aguilera Valdebenito', null, 'Naomi Velissariou, Daniil Vorobyov, Koosje Bulens, Yara Topp, Régis Dorion, Ilia Gavria, Hicham Outalab, Marc Madeleyn', null, 'Out of Love encapsulates the sweltering and devastating dynamics of love in the turbulent relationship between Varya and Nikolai, where genuine love and hope contend with destruction and despair.', 'Out of Love encapsulates the sweltering and devastating dynamics of love in the turbulent relationship between Varya and Nikolai, where genuine love and hope contend with destruction and despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qe2fIZ9IQgY3Yf7CY3y5LCuQorY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378450'),
  ('738415862389330481', 'Out of Love', 2025, 'Drama', 'Nathan Ambrosioni, Victor Seguin, Michaël Ben Hammouda', 'Nathan Ambrosioni', 'Camille Cottin, Juliette Armanet, Monia Chokri, Manoâ Varvat, Nina Birman, Guillaume Gouix, Féodor Atkine, Frankie Wallach', null, 'When Jeanne, a meticulous insurance assessor, is suddenly left to care for her estranged sister’s two children after their mother vanishes, her carefully ordered life begins to unravel. Confronted with unexpected responsibilities, she must balance the fragile task of earning the children’s trust while also tending to her own relationship with her girlfriend, who struggles to adjust to Jeanne’s new role. As grief, uncertainty, and shifting loyalties mount, Jeanne finds herself redefining what family and love truly mean.', 'When Jeanne, a meticulous insurance assessor, is suddenly left to care for her estranged sister’s two children after their mother vanishes, her carefully ordered life begins to unravel. Confronted with unexpected responsibilities, she must balance the fragile task of earning the children’s trust while also tending to her own relationship with her girlfriend, who struggles to adjust to Jeanne’s new role. As grief, uncertainty, and shifting loyalties mount, Jeanne finds herself redefining what family and love truly mean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLEyWZUTYyeBiGvNUz9wmqT6cFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277882'),
  ('912501369955104882', 'Out of My League', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Luca John Rosati, Alice Filippi, Emanuele Pasquet', 'Michela Straniero, Roberto Proia', 'Ludovica Francesconi, Giuseppe Maggio, Gaja Masciale, Jozef Gjura, Eleonora Gaggero, Alfa, Ilaria Antonello, Gianni Bissacca', null, 'Marta may be an orphan, and she may be affected by a lethal illness, yet she is the most positive person one can meet. She wants a boy to fall for her. Not any boy - the most handsome of them all. One day, she may have found her match.', 'Marta may be an orphan, and she may be affected by a lethal illness, yet she is the most positive person one can meet. She wants a boy to fall for her. Not any boy - the most handsome of them all. One day, she may have found her match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csu16eLYUDvyX64UdqHtwBwAd21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664031'),
  ('77347753802679556', 'Out of My Mind', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Amber Sealey, Noah Greenberg', 'Daniel Stiepleman', 'Phoebe-Rae Taylor, Rosemarie DeWitt, Luke Kirby, Michael Chernus, Courtney Taylor, Judith Light, Emily Mitchell, Nylan Parthipan', 'PG', 'Melody Brooks, a sixth grader with cerebral palsy, has a quick wit and a sharp mind, but because she is non-verbal and uses a wheelchair, she is not given the same opportunities as her classmates. When a young educator notices her student''s untapped potential and Melody starts to participate in mainstream education, Melody shows that what she has to say is more important than how she says it.', 'Melody Brooks, a sixth grader with cerebral palsy, has a quick wit and a sharp mind, but because she is non-verbal and uses a wheelchair, she is not given the same opportunities as her classmates. When a young educator notices her student''s untapped potential and Melody starts to participate in mainstream education, Melody shows that what she has to say is more important than how she says it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zo3DmHvUctMnIlwiJ4sz7JHH8I7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971606'),
  ('6686839154991107', 'Out of Order', 1984, 'Thriller', 'Carl Schenkel, Jacques Steyn', 'Frank Göhre', 'Renée Soutendijk, Götz George, Wolfgang Kieling, Hannes Jaenicke, Klaus Wennemann, Ralf Richter, Kurt Raab, Ekmekyemez Firdevs', null, 'It''s Friday evening. The lift repairman leaves the building and wants to finish his work on Monday. But he doesn''t know there are four men in the building. They use the lift but stay in it about 100 meters from the floor. They have little oxygen and must survive…', 'It''s Friday evening. The lift repairman leaves the building and wants to finish his work on Monday. But he doesn''t know there are four men in the building. They use the lift but stay in it about 100 meters from the floor. They have little oxygen and must survive…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wimasu8RQfZbupONckZE6X8A3OB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10672'),
  ('144533378007280968', 'Out of Order', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Róbert Koltai, András Kern', 'Ray Cooney', 'András Kern, Róbert Koltai, Sándor Gáspár, Kata Dobó, Judit Hernádi, Gábor Reviczky, Dorottya Udvaros, Iván Kamarás', null, 'A Minister and the Secretary of the Opposition party go to a 5 star hotel to conduct a secret affair. Their plans are ruined when they discover a corpse lodged in the window of their room.', 'A Minister and the Secretary of the Opposition party go to a 5 star hotel to conduct a secret affair. Their plans are ruined when they discover a corpse lodged in the window of their room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjqUeuSYTqNZC8nU2OqC0PoptB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50827'),
  ('828567988571733412', 'Out of Reach', 2004, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure, Crime', 'Leong Po-Chih, Richard Crudo, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Trevor Miller', 'Steven Seagal, Ida Nowakowska, Agnieszka Wagner, Krzysztof Pieczyński, Robbie Gee, Murat Yılmaz, Matt Schulze, Nick Brimble', 'R', 'Vietnam veteran Billy Ray Lancing, a former CSA agent who now works on a wildlife refuge in Northern Alaska, has been exchanging letters in a pen-pal relationship with Irina Morawska, a 13-year-old orphaned girl in Poland that he''s helping out financially. When the letters suddenly stop coming, Billy heads to Poland to figure out why -- only to discover that the orphanage that Irina was staying in, which is financed by honest -- and unsuspecting -- good-intentioned Samaritans, is a cover for a human trafficking network.', 'Vietnam veteran Billy Ray Lancing, a former CSA agent who now works on a wildlife refuge in Northern Alaska, has been exchanging letters in a pen-pal relationship with Irina Morawska, a 13-year-old orphaned girl in Poland that he''s helping out financially. When the letters suddenly stop coming, Billy heads to Poland to figure out why -- only to discover that the orphanage that Irina was staying in, which is financed by honest -- and unsuspecting -- good-intentioned Samaritans, is a cover for a human trafficking network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhjIndW3ukB8tTegjUCYV8j4WBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36272'),
  ('791937089577799741', 'Out of Scale', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'NR', 'Donald has a ride-on sized train layout in his backyard. There''s a large tree (home to Chip ''n Dale) that''s out of scale, so Donald moves it while they''re out; they come back to see their tree moving. No problem; one of Donald''s model houses is just their size.', 'Donald has a ride-on sized train layout in his backyard. There''s a large tree (home to Chip ''n Dale) that''s out of scale, so Donald moves it while they''re out; they come back to see their tree moving. No problem; one of Donald''s model houses is just their size.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY7Z55ASYSNvus3ZRmbyAgVWOWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67158'),
  ('907868186044110662', 'Out of Season', 1975, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alan Bridges, Arthur Ibbetson, Martin Atkinson', 'Reuben Bercovitch, Eric Bercovici', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Cliff Robertson, Susan George, Edward Evans, Frank Jarvis', null, 'Middle-aged Ann and her teenage daughter Joanna manage a failing hotel on an island off the British coast. One day, the hotel receives an unexpected guest, a man named Joe.', 'Middle-aged Ann and her teenage daughter Joanna manage a failing hotel on an island off the British coast. One day, the hotel receives an unexpected guest, a man named Joe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0day3zHlPFdYcVZwWl78YUnUqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135126'),
  ('962457221246775755', 'Out of Season', 2024, 'Drama', 'Marie Demaison, Stéphane Brizé, Coralie Amédéo', 'Stéphane Brizé, Marie Drucker', 'Guillaume Canet, Alba Rohrwacher, Sharif Andoura, Emmy Boissard Paumelle, Marie Drucker, Lucette Beudin, Gilberte Bellus, Hugo Dillon', null, 'Mathieu lives in Paris, Alice in a small seaside resort in Western France. He is a famous actor, about to turn fifty. She is a piano teacher in her forties. They were in love fifteen years ago, then separated. Time has passed. They each went their ways and slowly healed. When Mathieu goes try to overcome his melancholia in a thermal spa, he stumbles upon Alice.', 'Mathieu lives in Paris, Alice in a small seaside resort in Western France. He is a famous actor, about to turn fifty. She is a piano teacher in her forties. They were in love fifteen years ago, then separated. Time has passed. They each went their ways and slowly healed. When Mathieu goes try to overcome his melancholia in a thermal spa, he stumbles upon Alice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLbFUAhAKJJRACzSQ1pQoeQkarR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1044741'),
  ('324065292367368295', 'Out of Sight', 1998, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime', 'Steven Soderbergh, Elliot Davis, Michael Risoli', 'Scott Frank', 'George Clooney, Jennifer Lopez, Ving Rhames, Don Cheadle, Steve Zahn, Dennis Farina, Catherine Keener, Isaiah Washington', 'R', 'Meet Jack Foley, a smooth criminal who bends the law and is determined to make one last heist. Karen Sisco is a federal marshal who chooses all the right moves … and all the wrong guys. Now they''re willing to risk it all to find out if there''s more between them than just the law.', 'Meet Jack Foley, a smooth criminal who bends the law and is determined to make one last heist. Karen Sisco is a federal marshal who chooses all the right moves … and all the wrong guys. Now they''re willing to risk it all to find out if there''s more between them than just the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v49q7AMR3pB4M762woWB1NYMCLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1389'),
  ('823220663340513703', 'Out of Sight', 2010, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Yu Ya-Ting', null, 'Ye Yaxuan, Zhong Ling', null, 'The main character of little girl in the story confronts a robbery and strays from the road she is familiar with. After passing a hedge, she enters an unknown world and unfolds a magical adventure depending on senses other than vision and her imagination. With soft and cute colors as the main key, we used simple designs to depict the little girls'' imaginary world.', 'The main character of little girl in the story confronts a robbery and strays from the road she is familiar with. After passing a hedge, she enters an unknown world and unfolds a magical adventure depending on senses other than vision and her imagination. With soft and cute colors as the main key, we used simple designs to depict the little girls'' imaginary world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJTZQviPYLX3V9pN6seBkyvrBrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133204'),
  ('476411998906795087', 'Out of Sync', 2021, 'Drama', 'Juanjo Giménez Peña, Javier Arrontes, Héctor Rodríguez', 'Juanjo Giménez Peña, Pere Altimira', 'Marta Nieto, Miki Esparbé, Luisa Merelas, Fran Lareu, Francisco Reyes, Julius Cotter, Cris Iglesias, Iria Parada', null, 'A sound designer has to rethink her whole life when her sight and hearing start to get out of sync.', 'A sound designer has to rethink her whole life when her sight and hearing start to get out of sync.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArUdCvMVQ9YISz0GAsW2SzlEB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856434'),
  ('345347549628356131', 'Out of the Ashes', 2003, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent, Donald M. Morgan', 'Anne Meredith', 'Christine Lahti, Bruce Davison, Jonathan Cake, Beau Bridges, Richard Crenna, Jolyon Baker, Jessica Beitchman, Oliver Cotton', null, 'The real-life story of Gisella Perl, a Jewish Hungarian doctor imprisoned in the notorious Auschwitz death camp of World War II.', 'The real-life story of Gisella Perl, a Jewish Hungarian doctor imprisoned in the notorious Auschwitz death camp of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dK0ObrwNoLlB8haDO3JZUKoDtOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19338'),
  ('162892805330484465', 'Out of the Blue', 1947, 'Comedy', 'Jackson Rose, Howard W. Koch, Leon Becker', 'Vera Caspary, Edward Eliscu, Walter Bullock', 'George Brent, Virginia Mayo, Turhan Bey, Ann Dvorak, Carole Landis, Elizabeth Patterson, Julia Dean, Richard Lane', 'NR', 'Set in an apartment building whose occupants include Arthur Earthleigh, a meek and mild type married to the beautiful-but-domineering Mae; a Bohemian artist, David Galleo and his always-there model, Deborah Tyler; and Olive Jensen, a Greenwich Village type who is always slightly-but-continuously inebriated, and whose motto is "love and let love." She calls on George while his wife is out, and when she passes out during his attempts to get her out before his wife returns, he thinks she is dead and deposits her on Galleo''s terrace. Galleo takes advantage of the situation by using it in a blackmail scheme against Arthur, which is shaky, at best, as Olive refuses to stay dead.', 'Set in an apartment building whose occupants include Arthur Earthleigh, a meek and mild type married to the beautiful-but-domineering Mae; a Bohemian artist, David Galleo and his always-there model, Deborah Tyler; and Olive Jensen, a Greenwich Village type who is always slightly-but-continuously inebriated, and whose motto is "love and let love." She calls on George while his wife is out, and when she passes out during his attempts to get her out before his wife returns, he thinks she is dead and deposits her on Galleo''s terrace. Galleo takes advantage of the situation by using it in a blackmail scheme against Arthur, which is shaky, at best, as Olive refuses to stay dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhpGygYVXyuxy2VGCxZR7Q68ZLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329827'),
  ('347904975751284046', 'Out of the Blue', 1981, 'Drama', 'Dennis Hopper, Bob Akester, Jacques Hubert', 'Brenda Nielson, Dennis Hopper, Leonard Yakir', 'Linda Manz, Dennis Hopper, Sharon Farrell, Don Gordon, Raymond Burr, Leon Ericksen, Fiona Brodie, David L. Crowley', 'R', 'A young girl whose father is an ex-convict and whose mother is a junkie finds it difficult to conform and tries to find comfort in a quirky combination of Elvis and the punk scene.', 'A young girl whose father is an ex-convict and whose mother is a junkie finds it difficult to conform and tries to find comfort in a quirky combination of Elvis and the punk scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEWfWQDbx2upk9CAPRDDjCjc9a8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39269'),
  ('1074640847580856591', 'Out of the Blue', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Sarkies, Greig Fraser', null, 'Karl Urban, Tandi Wright, Simon Ferry, Matthew Sunderland, Lois Lawn, Paul Glover, William Kircher, Georgia Fabish', null, 'Ordinary people find extraordinary courage in the face of madness. On 13–14 November 1990 that madness came to Aramoana, a small New Zealand seaside town, in the form of a lone gunman with a high-powered semi-automatic rifle. As he stalked his victims the terrified and confused residents were trapped for 24 hours while a handful of under-resourced and under-armed local policemen risked their lives trying to find him and save the survivors. Based on true events.', 'Ordinary people find extraordinary courage in the face of madness. On 13–14 November 1990 that madness came to Aramoana, a small New Zealand seaside town, in the form of a lone gunman with a high-powered semi-automatic rifle. As he stalked his victims the terrified and confused residents were trapped for 24 hours while a handful of under-resourced and under-armed local policemen risked their lives trying to find him and save the survivors. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbn9SiymMpRGRQtZrm9AxTOT7Eg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10844'),
  ('705592801791593503', 'Out of the Blue', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Arnaldo Catinari, Edoardo Leo', 'Edoardo Leo, Herbert Simone Paragnani, Massimiliano Bruno', 'Raoul Bova, Marco Giallini, Edoardo Leo, Nicole Grimaudo, Rosabell Laurenti Sellers, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Mattia Sbragia, Antonino Bruschetta', null, 'Andrea is a handsome and cocky 38-year old man with a successful business career. Shallow, womanizing and a confirmed bachelor, his life seems to be just perfect... until the day he comes home and finds there Layla, a teenage girl who claims to be his daughter. Alongside Layla is her grandfather Enzo, a former rockstar and the father of Andrea''s first fleeting and forgotten conquest. And they''ve come to stay!', 'Andrea is a handsome and cocky 38-year old man with a successful business career. Shallow, womanizing and a confirmed bachelor, his life seems to be just perfect... until the day he comes home and finds there Layla, a teenage girl who claims to be his daughter. Alongside Layla is her grandfather Enzo, a former rockstar and the father of Andrea''s first fleeting and forgotten conquest. And they''ve come to stay!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3ZB3GVSJQQYpVgJBDFpDrsaC3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175116'),
  ('423454051668184966', 'Out of the Blue', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller, Romance', 'Neil LaBute', 'Neil LaBute', 'Diane Kruger, Ray Nicholson, Hank Azaria, Chase Sui Wonders, Victor Slezak, Pamela Jayne Morgan, Gia Crovatin', 'R', 'After spending time in prison following an assault charge, Connor Bates now works in a library and spends his free time running, swimming, and trying to piece his world back together. When he meets Marilyn Chambers, the wife of a wealthy businessman, they collide into an intense physical and emotional relationship that quickly escalates into idle talk about her husband’s murder.', 'After spending time in prison following an assault charge, Connor Bates now works in a library and spends his free time running, swimming, and trying to piece his world back together. When he meets Marilyn Chambers, the wife of a wealthy businessman, they collide into an intense physical and emotional relationship that quickly escalates into idle talk about her husband’s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdi24j24LwJpBhtnUlD2mVYi6e3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003813'),
  ('960955708925433334', 'Out of the Dark', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Schroeder, Julio Macat, Stephen Lillis', 'Zane W. Levitt, J. Greg De Felice', 'Cameron Dye, Karen Black, Bud Cort, Lynn Danielson-Rosenthal, Starr Andreeff, Divine, Geoffrey Lewis, Tracey Walter', 'R', 'A deranged killer wearing a clown mask begins preying on a group of young women working at a phone-sex company.', 'A deranged killer wearing a clown mask begins preying on a group of young women working at a phone-sex company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hO5mCzOKuEXGil8bwBkxpHvNTCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30652'),
  ('1111465602003813865', 'Out of the Dark', 1995, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Poon Kin-Kwan, Bill Chan Wing-Biu', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Stephen Chow, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Lo Hung, Wong Yat-Fei, Lee Kin-Yan, Lee Lik-Chi, Ben Wong Chi-Yin, Bill Chan Wing-Biu', null, 'After being haunted by evil spirits inside a residential building, a security guard seeks help from a mysterious exorcist, who turns out to be an escaped mental patient.', 'After being haunted by evil spirits inside a residential building, a security guard seeks help from a mysterious exorcist, who turns out to be an escaped mental patient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsx6xnk6KoZmslCbD7y6mLB2PHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45452'),
  ('185931447201177552', 'Out of the Dark', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Lluís Quílez, Isaac Vila', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor, Javier Gullón', 'Julia Stiles, Scott Speedman, Stephen Rea, Alejandro Furth, Pixie Davies, Guillermo Morales Vitola, Vanessa Tamayo, Elkin Díaz', 'R', 'A couple and their daughter moves to Colombia to take over a family manufacturing plant, only to realize their new home is haunted.', 'A couple and their daughter moves to Colombia to take over a family manufacturing plant, only to realize their new home is haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Lql2rnNRmKJrjq4FhEUh7IwkNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283686'),
  ('577098954602183655', 'Out of the Darkness', 2022, 'Drama, War', 'Anders Refn, Morten Søborg, Jacob Thomas Pilgaard', 'Anders Refn, Flemming Quist Møller', 'Jesper Christensen, Bodil Jørgensen, Mads Reuther, Gustav Dyekjær Giese, Sara Viktoria, Lue Støvelbæk, Sylvester Byder, Pernille Højmark', null, 'This Danish movie "Out of The Darkness" ( in Danish ''De Forbandede år 2'' ) is a continuation of the popular WW II drama "Into The Darkness" ( in Danish ''De forbandede år'' ) and it portraits the Danish Resistance movements fight. This movie takes place after 1943 where the official politic of ''corporation'' comes to an end, and the Danish Resistance movement is gaining traction. The movie follows the Skov family from 1943 to the end of WWII. The growing opposition to the occupation and the increased brutality of the Germans have fatal consequences for the family.', 'This Danish movie "Out of The Darkness" ( in Danish ''De Forbandede år 2'' ) is a continuation of the popular WW II drama "Into The Darkness" ( in Danish ''De forbandede år'' ) and it portraits the Danish Resistance movements fight. This movie takes place after 1943 where the official politic of ''corporation'' comes to an end, and the Danish Resistance movement is gaining traction. The movie follows the Skov family from 1943 to the end of WWII. The growing opposition to the occupation and the increased brutality of the Germans have fatal consequences for the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owwNYUxjRwJdhjxCl6asIt0v9uV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957176'),
  ('208408558691306698', 'Out of the Fog', 1941, 'Crime, Thriller', 'James Wong Howe, Anatole Litvak, Chuck Hansen', 'Richard Macaulay, Robert Rossen, Jerry Wald', 'Ida Lupino, John Garfield, Thomas Mitchell, Eddie Albert, George Tobias, John Qualen, Aline MacMahon, Jerome Cowan', 'NR', 'A Brooklyn pier racketeer bullies boat-owners into paying protection money but two fed-up fishermen decide to eliminate the gangster themselves rather than complain to the police.', 'A Brooklyn pier racketeer bullies boat-owners into paying protection money but two fed-up fishermen decide to eliminate the gangster themselves rather than complain to the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udoM74cW1L24YP661M2fLAbnQxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26380'),
  ('835282789289641485', 'Out of the Frying Pan Into the Firing Line', 1942, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Thelma Boardman', 'NR', 'Documentary short film demonstrating the process by which waste fats from the kitchens of American homes can be transformed into the raw materials for explosives for the war effort.', 'Documentary short film demonstrating the process by which waste fats from the kitchens of American homes can be transformed into the raw materials for explosives for the war effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/313e2udE7EFCixhIXj5MbUX3UAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64663'),
  ('235876767629219703', 'Out of the Furnace', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Masanobu Takayanagi, Scott Cooper, Jamie Marshall', 'Scott Cooper, Brad Ingelsby', 'Christian Bale, Zoe Saldaña, Woody Harrelson, Sam Shepard, Willem Dafoe, Forest Whitaker, Casey Affleck, Boyd Holbrook', 'R', 'Two brothers live in the economically-depressed Rust Belt, when a cruel twist of fate lands one in prison. His brother is then lured into one of the most violent crime rings in the Northeast.', 'Two brothers live in the economically-depressed Rust Belt, when a cruel twist of fate lands one in prison. His brother is then lured into one of the most violent crime rings in the Northeast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOuQQ4eRpSBxb0G9OXzWE1pHPeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164457'),
  ('881410539425697423', 'Out of the Inkwell', 1938, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Bonnie Poe, Oscar Polk', null, 'In a tribute to the Fleischer brothers shorts of the ''20s, a janitor hypnotizes Max Fleischer''s pen to draw Betty Boop.', 'In a tribute to the Fleischer brothers shorts of the ''20s, a janitor hypnotizes Max Fleischer''s pen to draw Betty Boop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpSEkRdmCRTnN0l2ELXUern7ntN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145758'),
  ('448874675975254140', 'Out of Thin Air', 2017, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson, Dylan Howitt', null, 'Erla Bolladóttir, Sævar Ciesiekski, Tryggvi Leifsson, Albert Skaftason, Guðjón Skarphéðinsson, Kristjan Vídarsson, Geirfinnur Einarsson, Guðmundur Einarsson', null, 'Set within the stark Icelandic landscape, OUT OF THIN AIR examines the 1976 police investigation into the disappearance of two men in the early 1970s.', 'Set within the stark Icelandic landscape, OUT OF THIN AIR examines the 1976 police investigation into the disappearance of two men in the early 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSTd5RGN6ybRJWocc8tAIlmvEX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455479'),
  ('833673015687452703', 'Out of this World', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Marc Fouchard, Pascal Boudet', 'Marc Fouchard', 'Kévin Mischel, Aurélia Poirier, Geneviève Casile, June Assal, Dominique Frot, Jean-Louis Garçon, Patrick Fouchard, Leslie Carles', null, 'Léo is a serial killer who lives out of his car, producing music that he plays on the car radio while he works for a ride service. One day, Léo drives Amélie, a deaf dancer and is frustrated that she doesn''t respond to his music. He increases the volume throughout the ride until she can feel the vibration and rests her ear on the windowsill, seeming to enjoy it. Never having felt attracted to someone before, he tries to learn how to engage in a romantic relationship with a woman with...mixed results.', 'Léo is a serial killer who lives out of his car, producing music that he plays on the car radio while he works for a ride service. One day, Léo drives Amélie, a deaf dancer and is frustrated that she doesn''t respond to his music. He increases the volume throughout the ride until she can feel the vibration and rests her ear on the windowsill, seeming to enjoy it. Never having felt attracted to someone before, he tries to learn how to engage in a romantic relationship with a woman with...mixed results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brP1Yl1JBZhZj408FCrbklJkHbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780898'),
  ('823527758311073316', 'Out of Time', 2003, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Carl Franklin, Theo van de Sande, Richard Fojo', 'David Collard', 'Denzel Washington, Eva Mendes, Sanaa Lathan, John Billingsley, Dean Cain, Alex Carter, Antoni Corone, Robert Baker', 'PG-13', 'Matt Lee Whitlock, respected chief of police in small Banyan Key, Florida, must solve a vicious double homicide before he himself falls under suspicion. Matt Lee has to stay a few steps ahead of his own police force and everyone he''s trusted in order to find out the truth.', 'Matt Lee Whitlock, respected chief of police in small Banyan Key, Florida, must solve a vicious double homicide before he himself falls under suspicion. Matt Lee has to stay a few steps ahead of his own police force and everyone he''s trusted in order to find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMExJ6RdJQmRMydvozhEBlOLX1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2116'),
  ('673271346748685255', 'Out of Time', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Matt Handy', 'Matt Handy', 'Nadege August, Blake Boyd, Kurt Long, Gary Fredo, David Schroeder, Mark Andrews, Jessica Graves Davis, Daniel Gavin', null, 'Three mysterious figures emerge from the Mojave Desert and make their way to Los Angeles, leaving a trail of bodies in their path.', 'Three mysterious figures emerge from the Mojave Desert and make their way to Los Angeles, leaving a trail of bodies in their path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4BUtXUVMP3ch6gyRyH2qnW0nE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816480'),
  ('743405193095046505', 'Out on a Limb', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'NR', 'Donald''s doing a little tree surgery when he spots Chip ''n'' Dale gathering nuts. He saws off the branch outside their hole and paints it with tar, which Dale gets stuck in. Then Donald has a little fun with the long-handled pruning shears.', 'Donald''s doing a little tree surgery when he spots Chip ''n'' Dale gathering nuts. He saws off the branch outside their hole and paints it with tar, which Dale gets stuck in. Then Donald has a little fun with the long-handled pruning shears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1FUcWDabOsVBkvbxlTLHuxXtoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67159'),
  ('825577172020232256', 'Out on a Limb', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Francis Veber, Donald E. Thorin, Brian Steward', 'Daniel Goldin, Joshua Goldin', 'Matthew Broderick, Jeffrey Jones, Heidi Kling, John C. Reilly, Marian Mercer, Larry Hankin, David Margulies, Courtney Peldon', 'PG', 'While heading to the town where his sister, Marci, lives, big-city banker Bill Campbell is robbed by a woman who takes everything he has, including his clothes and a business document worth millions of dollars. Bill eventually reunites with Marci, who is in a tizzy because she thinks their stepfather has been killed. While trying to determine if his sister is right, Bill must also get back his valuable paperwork.', 'While heading to the town where his sister, Marci, lives, big-city banker Bill Campbell is robbed by a woman who takes everything he has, including his clothes and a business document worth millions of dollars. Bill eventually reunites with Marci, who is in a tizzy because she thinks their stepfather has been killed. While trying to determine if his sister is right, Bill must also get back his valuable paperwork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2El6Z9vlsLcOjtcawNESpAzDb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114726'),
  ('594208819961851618', 'Out Standing', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'Mélanie Charbonneau, Ariel Méthot Bellemare', 'Mélanie Charbonneau, Martine Pagé', 'Nina Kiri, Vincent Leclerc, Enrico Colantoni, Adrian Walters, Antoine Pilon, Stephen Kalyn, Conrad Pla, Aris Tyros', null, 'Officer Sandra Perron resigns from the Canadian military after a controversial photo surfaces. Adapting to civilian life amidst an investigation, she denies abuse allegations despite evidence suggesting mistreatment within her unit.', 'Officer Sandra Perron resigns from the Canadian military after a controversial photo surfaces. Adapting to civilian life amidst an investigation, she denies abuse allegations despite evidence suggesting mistreatment within her unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQRaEoRd1fv1A3orWOA9AdSrIjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073572'),
  ('175557569453501572', 'Out Stealing Horses', 2019, 'Drama', 'Thomas Hardmeier, Rasmus Videbæk, Hans Petter Moland', 'Hans Petter Moland', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Tobias Santelmann, Danica Ćurčić, Pål Sverre Hagen, Bjørn Floberg, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Jon Ranes, Gard B. Eidsvold', null, 'November 1999. 67-year-old Trond lives in new-found solitude and looks forward to spending New Year''s Eve 2000 alone. As winter arrives he discovers he has a neighbor, a man Trond knew back in 1948, the summer he turned 15 and the summer Trond''s father prepared him to carry the burden of his forthcoming betrayal and disappearance.', 'November 1999. 67-year-old Trond lives in new-found solitude and looks forward to spending New Year''s Eve 2000 alone. As winter arrives he discovers he has a neighbor, a man Trond knew back in 1948, the summer he turned 15 and the summer Trond''s father prepared him to carry the burden of his forthcoming betrayal and disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8dqUEMK7ANC9NIZEelbCNV9UVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512603'),
  ('391036343007282047', 'Out There', 1995, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Family, TV Movie', 'Sam Irvin', 'Alison Nigh-Strelich, Thomas Strelich', 'Billy Campbell, Wendy Schaal, Bill Cobbs, Rod Steiger, Jill St. John, Julie Brown, P. J. Soles, Leslie Bevis', 'PG-13', 'A Pulitzer Prize winning photographer is fired from his job for not being sensationalistic enough. After he purchases an old camera at a yard sale, he discovers some undeveloped film in it, including photos of an apparent alien abduction. When he goes public with the photos, he garners the attention of his former boss, the government and a woman who thinks her father was the abductee.', 'A Pulitzer Prize winning photographer is fired from his job for not being sensationalistic enough. After he purchases an old camera at a yard sale, he discovers some undeveloped film in it, including photos of an apparent alien abduction. When he goes public with the photos, he garners the attention of his former boss, the government and a woman who thinks her father was the abductee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHgdt0XILxGE3j1Up8j0mleMj6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345268'),
  ('158473874406438262', 'Out to Sea', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martha Coolidge, Lajos Koltai, E.J. Foerster', 'Robert Nelson Jacobs', 'Jack Lemmon, Walter Matthau, Dyan Cannon, Brent Spiner, Gloria DeHaven, Elaine Stritch, Hal Linden, Donald O''Connor', 'PG-13', 'Care-free Charlie cons his widower brother-in-law Herb into an expenses-paid luxury cruise in search of rich, lonely ladies. The catch is that they are required to be dance hosts! With a tyrannical cruise director, and the luscious Liz and lovely Vivian, our heroes have lots of mis-adventures before they finally return to port.', 'Care-free Charlie cons his widower brother-in-law Herb into an expenses-paid luxury cruise in search of rich, lonely ladies. The catch is that they are required to be dance hosts! With a tyrannical cruise director, and the luscious Liz and lovely Vivian, our heroes have lots of mis-adventures before they finally return to port.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de3GHQy3TJAVhgF6ys1aWpe5jWK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18080'),
  ('307303634050564176', 'Out West', 1918, 'Comedy, Western', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, George Peters', 'Roscoe Arbuckle', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Buster Keaton, Al St. John, Alice Lake, Joe Keaton, Ernie Morrison Sr.', 'NR', 'The story involves Arbuckle coming to the western town of Mad Dog Gulch after being thrown off a train and chased by Indians. He teams up with gambler/saloon owner Bill Bullhum, in trying to keep the evil Wild Bill Hickup away from Salvation Army girl, Salvation Sue. Fatty and Buster have a series of adventures trying to beat St. John, until they discover his one weakness: his ticklishness.', 'The story involves Arbuckle coming to the western town of Mad Dog Gulch after being thrown off a train and chased by Indians. He teams up with gambler/saloon owner Bill Bullhum, in trying to keep the evil Wild Bill Hickup away from Salvation Army girl, Salvation Sue. Fatty and Buster have a series of adventures trying to beat St. John, until they discover his one weakness: his ticklishness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5beH3XHPVC7PNIQD2o9LuLpia8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51301'),
  ('1130762087201059410', 'Out-Foxed', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Bill Thompson, Daws Butler', null, 'Droopy is part of a pack of English hunting hounds trying unsuccessfully to catch a tricky, tea-drinking fox.', 'Droopy is part of a pack of English hunting hounds trying unsuccessfully to catch a tricky, tea-drinking fox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iB3KYSSefUJHdRo5t6f9ma56rH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86753'),
  ('989510091242934724', 'Outback', 2020, 'Thriller, Western', 'Mike Green, Tim Nagle', 'Mike Green, Brien Kelly', 'Lauren Lofberg, Taylor Wiese, Brendan Donoghue, Kym Cramp, Jim Winton Porter', null, 'A young American couple’s Australian holiday takes a terrifying turn when they get lost in the outback. With only one another to rely on, the two are driven to extremes in order to stay alive in the harsh and unforgiving wilderness.', 'A young American couple’s Australian holiday takes a terrifying turn when they get lost in the outback. With only one another to rely on, the two are driven to extremes in order to stay alive in the harsh and unforgiving wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eEaliCKndXuINMjcb2ATXUMYIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614626'),
  ('1043004707206683573', 'Outbreak', 1995, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Michael Ballhaus, Peter Kohn', 'Laurence Dworet, Robert Roy Pool', 'Dustin Hoffman, Rene Russo, Morgan Freeman, Kevin Spacey, Cuba Gooding Jr., Donald Sutherland, Patrick Dempsey, Zakes Mokae', 'R', 'A deadly airborne virus finds its way into the USA and starts killing off people at an epidemic rate. Col. Sam Daniels'' job is to stop the virus spreading from a small town, which must be quarantined, and to prevent an over reaction by the White House.', 'A deadly airborne virus finds its way into the USA and starts killing off people at an epidemic rate. Col. Sam Daniels'' job is to stop the virus spreading from a small town, which must be quarantined, and to prevent an over reaction by the White House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KymNvlWR0XF0sqX2BWRd9Z3yXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6950'),
  ('299710632817770499', 'Outbreak', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jeff Wolfe, Cary Lalonde', 'Lance Ochsner, Jeff Wolfe', 'Billy Burke, Alyshia Ochse, Taylor Handley, Raoul Max Trujillo, Jessica Frances Dukes, Dani Oliveros, Kylr Coffman', null, 'A State Park Ranger and his wife, grappling with the disappearance of their teenage son, face a mysterious outbreak that threatens not only their relationship, but in the end, their grip on reality.', 'A State Park Ranger and his wife, grappling with the disappearance of their teenage son, face a mysterious outbreak that threatens not only their relationship, but in the end, their grip on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86veNrARvGRyBRiGT94Lxpy5Z4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217585'),
  ('90369250709098640', 'Outcast', 2014, 'Action, Adventure', 'Joel Ransom, Nick Powell', 'James Dormer', 'Nicolas Cage, Hayden Christensen, Liu Yifei, Andy On Chi-Kit, Anoja Dias Bolt, Byron Lawson, Fernando Chien, Jawed Berni', null, 'A mysterious warrior teams up with the daughter and son of a deposed Chinese Emperor to defeat their cruel brother, who seeks their deaths.', 'A mysterious warrior teams up with the daughter and son of a deposed Chinese Emperor to defeat their cruel brother, who seeks their deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efsgCTlofzIuysfokEp7hwQnUho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289720'),
  ('770925055088422366', 'Outcast of the Islands', 1951, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Carol Reed, John Wilcox, Edward Scaife', 'William Fairchild', 'Trevor Howard, Ralph Richardson, Robert Morley, Wendy Hiller, Kerima, Wilfrid Hyde-White, George Coulouris, Annabel Morley', 'NR', 'After financial improprieties are discovered at the Eastern trading company where he works, Peter Willems flees the resulting disgrace and criminal charges. He persuades the man who gave him his start in life, the merchant ship captain Lingard, to bring him to a trading post on a remote Indonesian island where he can hide out.', 'After financial improprieties are discovered at the Eastern trading company where he works, Peter Willems flees the resulting disgrace and criminal charges. He persuades the man who gave him his start in life, the merchant ship captain Lingard, to bring him to a trading post on a remote Indonesian island where he can hide out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiDzvW8g2w3anqhFvl9KwBOgG8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87349'),
  ('219959529102771769', 'Outcast Rockstar', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Felipe Novaes', 'Hugo Prata, Matias Lovro, Felipe Novaes', 'Alexandre Magno Abrão, Rick Bonadio, Serginho Groisman, Marcelo Nova, João Gordo, Zeca Baleiro, Paulo Vilhena, Otto Maximiliano Pereira', null, 'The life and career of Brazilian singer Chorão, Charlie Brown Jr''s frontman. The story of one of the most important rock stars in Brazil, from testimonies about his personal and professional life and archival footage. Beginning in the early 1990s, when his band released their first album and hit the radio stations, Chorão lived two intense decades of national and international success, full of controversial moments, until his premature death in 2013.', 'The life and career of Brazilian singer Chorão, Charlie Brown Jr''s frontman. The story of one of the most important rock stars in Brazil, from testimonies about his personal and professional life and archival footage. Beginning in the early 1990s, when his band released their first album and hit the radio stations, Chorão lived two intense decades of national and international success, full of controversial moments, until his premature death in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gogfKsMhf4q8iOO8awqi9YWkt4g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637612'),
  ('1077983780045267814', 'Outcome', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jonah Hill, Benoît Debie, Jonas Spaccarotelli', 'Ezra Woods, Jonah Hill', 'Keanu Reeves, Jonah Hill, Cameron Diaz, Matt Bomer, Susan Lucci, Laverne Cox, David Spade, Martin Scorsese', 'R', 'Reef Hawk, Hollywood''s poster child since age six, is not okay. When he learns about an extortion plot tied to a mysterious video, Reef preemptively sets out on a redemption tour to make amends, confront his demons, and avoid getting canceled.', 'Reef Hawk, Hollywood''s poster child since age six, is not okay. When he learns about an extortion plot tied to a mysterious video, Reef preemptively sets out on a redemption tour to make amends, confront his demons, and avoid getting canceled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSzcpfbTy2pXHGvrVU2WhQTo6oU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049471'),
  ('561816961764504905', 'Outer and Inner Space', 1966, null, 'Andy Warhol', null, 'Edie Sedgwick', null, 'A 16mm Warhol film of Edie Sedgwick sitting in front of a television monitor on which is playing a prerecorded videotape of herself. On the videotape, Edie is positioned on the left side of the frame, facing right; she is talking to an unseen person off-screen to our right. In the film, the “real” or “live” Edie Sedgwick is seated on the right side of the film frame, with her video image behind her, and she is talking to an unseen person off-screen to our left. The effect of this setup is that it sometimes creates the rather strange illusion that we are watching Edie in conversation with her own video image.', 'A 16mm Warhol film of Edie Sedgwick sitting in front of a television monitor on which is playing a prerecorded videotape of herself. On the videotape, Edie is positioned on the left side of the frame, facing right; she is talking to an unseen person off-screen to our right. In the film, the “real” or “live” Edie Sedgwick is seated on the right side of the film frame, with her video image behind her, and she is talking to an unseen person off-screen to our left. The effect of this setup is that it sometimes creates the rather strange illusion that we are watching Edie in conversation with her own video image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8W3w90Xb6K4B5Xz8ei3eaKJWYOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94580'),
  ('987597903064945059', 'Outer Space', 1999, 'Horror', 'Peter Tscherkassky, Peter Tscherkassky', 'Peter Tscherkassky', 'Barbara Hershey', null, 'A young woman move towards a house that holds a potentially dangerous spirit that has been tormenting her. The woman tries to fight against the film itself as it starts to cause the world to collapse.', 'A young woman move towards a house that holds a potentially dangerous spirit that has been tormenting her. The woman tries to fight against the film itself as it starts to cause the world to collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A72tOxS7cvdNwNqIw0uN4ElIeQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110650'),
  ('336099125308886218', 'Outer Touch', 1979, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Norman J. Warren, John Metcalfe, Peter Sinclair', 'Andrew Payne', 'Barry Stokes, Tony Maiden, Glory Annen, Michael Rowlatt, Ava Cadell, Kate Ferguson, Lynne Ross, Bill Mitchell', 'R', 'Three specimens from a female race of aliens crash land in England and abduct four earthlings by accident. They decide to use the opportunity to start experimenting... on the males.', 'Three specimens from a female race of aliens crash land in England and abduct four earthlings by accident. They decide to use the opportunity to start experimenting... on the males.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncVba2g4lxTtGsAphu6XUxvXFiQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107107'),
  ('646873803744721054', 'Outfoxed: Rupert Murdoch''s War on Journalism', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Robert Greenwald', null, 'Christiane Amanpour, George W. Bush, George Carlin, Tom Brokaw, Harry Belafonte, Neil Cavuto, Al Franken, Bill O''Reilly', 'NR', 'This film examines how media empires, led by Rupert Murdoch''s Fox News, have been running a "race to the bottom" in television news, and provides an in-depth look at Fox News and the dangerous impact on society when a broad swath of media is controlled by one person. Media experts, including Jeff Cohen (FAIR) Bob McChesney (Free Press), Chellie Pingree (Common Cause), Jeff Chester (Center for Digital Democracy) and David Brock (Media Matters) provide context and guidance for the story of Fox News and its effect on society. This documentary also reveals the secrets of Former Fox news producers, reporters, bookers and writers who expose what it''s like to work for Fox News. These former Fox employees talk about how they were forced to push a "right-wing" point of view or risk their jobs. Some have even chosen to remain anonymous in order to protect their current livelihoods. As one employee said "There''s no sense of integrity as far as having a line that can''t be crossed."', 'This film examines how media empires, led by Rupert Murdoch''s Fox News, have been running a "race to the bottom" in television news, and provides an in-depth look at Fox News and the dangerous impact on society when a broad swath of media is controlled by one person. Media experts, including Jeff Cohen (FAIR) Bob McChesney (Free Press), Chellie Pingree (Common Cause), Jeff Chester (Center for Digital Democracy) and David Brock (Media Matters) provide context and guidance for the story of Fox News and its effect on society. This documentary also reveals the secrets of Former Fox news producers, reporters, bookers and writers who expose what it''s like to work for Fox News. These former Fox employees talk about how they were forced to push a "right-wing" point of view or risk their jobs. Some have even chosen to remain anonymous in order to protect their current livelihoods. As one employee said "There''s no sense of integrity as far as having a line that can''t be crossed."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SodI4NHGIHghH6HGfqryiNlMSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13372'),
  ('761879106069099558', 'Outing 3', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jaeeun Koo', null, 'Sae Bom, Han Yi-seul, Lee Sul-ah, Cheon Yoo-ji, Min Do-yoon, Kang Min-woo', null, 'Eun-young, who is lonely with no lover, is Hyojin, a studio junior. When you hear that you have a lover, ask for an introduction. Hyojin introduces her lover Kyuhyun to Eunyoung on the way to work. Kyuhyun is a lover who broke up three years ago. Kyuhyun secretly begs Eunyoung to come back to Hyojin, but Eun-young is married. We meet again with Kyuhyun''s endless courtship. Hyojin gets caught. Eun-young, who sees the scene of her husband''s cheating, goes to Kyu-hyun.', 'Eun-young, who is lonely with no lover, is Hyojin, a studio junior. When you hear that you have a lover, ask for an introduction. Hyojin introduces her lover Kyuhyun to Eunyoung on the way to work. Kyuhyun is a lover who broke up three years ago. Kyuhyun secretly begs Eunyoung to come back to Hyojin, but Eun-young is married. We meet again with Kyuhyun''s endless courtship. Hyojin gets caught. Eun-young, who sees the scene of her husband''s cheating, goes to Kyu-hyun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2TwdmX3Cy2LY8zCxiIMymjGipl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753012'),
  ('613524782701472638', 'Outing: Engaged by Mistake', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Matteo Vicino, Daniele Poli', 'Matteo Vicino', 'Nicolas Vaporidis, Massimo Ghini, Andrea Bosca, Claudia Potenza, Giulia Michelini, Riccardo Leonelli, Lorenzo Zurzolo, Camilla Ferranti', null, 'In their village of Puglia (Southern part of Italy on the Adriatic side) Federico and Riccardo have been best friends since childhood. Federico is a penniless playboy, while Riccardo is a young fashion designer. To pursue his dream, Riccardo trades his home for Milan. When Frederick discovers that the Puglia Region provides funding in support of business activities, he convinces Riccardo to come back and open a fashion house. But there is a problem: funding is only available to common law couples, and so Federico and Riccardo must pretend to be a gay couple, and enlist the help of the local newspaper editor, a journalist and Richard’s despotic girlfriend ..', 'In their village of Puglia (Southern part of Italy on the Adriatic side) Federico and Riccardo have been best friends since childhood. Federico is a penniless playboy, while Riccardo is a young fashion designer. To pursue his dream, Riccardo trades his home for Milan. When Frederick discovers that the Puglia Region provides funding in support of business activities, he convinces Riccardo to come back and open a fashion house. But there is a problem: funding is only available to common law couples, and so Federico and Riccardo must pretend to be a gay couple, and enlist the help of the local newspaper editor, a journalist and Richard’s despotic girlfriend ..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rNeAt7apxmF6rpCJRz9uxohYw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181565'),
  ('969077091639106077', 'Outland', 1981, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, Crime, Western', 'Peter Hyams, Stephen Goldblatt', 'Peter Hyams', 'Sean Connery, Peter Boyle, Frances Sternhagen, James B. Sikking, Kika Markham, Clarke Peters, Steven Berkoff, John Ratzenberger', 'R', 'On the sunless moon Io, Marshall William T. O’Niel goes toe-to-toe with the corrupt manager of a mining colony and his gang of roughnecks while investigating a rash of worker suicides.', 'On the sunless moon Io, Marshall William T. O’Niel goes toe-to-toe with the corrupt manager of a mining colony and his gang of roughnecks while investigating a rash of worker suicides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmjlDkV8CfCboa8WV06ytZaThqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10540'),
  ('291665205075548685', 'Outlander', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Howard McCain, Pierre Gill, Dusan Strugar', null, 'Jim Caviezel, Sophia Myles, Jack Huston, Ron Perlman, John Hurt, Cliff Saunders, Patrick Stevenson, Aidan Devine', 'R', 'During the reign of the Vikings, a man from another world crash-lands on Earth, bringing with him an alien predator. The man must fuse his advanced technology with the weaponry of the vikings to fight the monster.', 'During the reign of the Vikings, a man from another world crash-lands on Earth, bringing with him an alien predator. The man must fuse his advanced technology with the weaponry of the vikings to fight the monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCZzrFonDkWfYkfxzsPByBY4Lvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10529'),
  ('576926588073801487', 'Outlanders', 1986, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Yusaku Saotome, Katsuhisa Yamada, Yuko Sakurai', 'Yoshinobu Tomita, Toshifumi Terada', 'Fumi Hirano, Mitsuo Iwata, Akira Kamiya, Kenji Utsumi, Emi Shinohara, Mika Doi, Mikio Terashima, Takashi Toyama', 'PG-13', 'In the midst of a violent invasion of Earth by unknown alien forces, photo-journalist Wakatsuki Tetsuya comes across a scantily-clad alien woman, cutting a swath of death through the Terran ranks with her sword. After a chaotic struggle, Tetsuya is knocked unconscious, only to awaken aboard her starship. To his surprise, she turns out to be Kahm, the invaders'' princess - and she has picked Tetsuya for a starring role in her upcoming wedding. As the groom....', 'In the midst of a violent invasion of Earth by unknown alien forces, photo-journalist Wakatsuki Tetsuya comes across a scantily-clad alien woman, cutting a swath of death through the Terran ranks with her sword. After a chaotic struggle, Tetsuya is knocked unconscious, only to awaken aboard her starship. To his surprise, she turns out to be Kahm, the invaders'' princess - and she has picked Tetsuya for a starring role in her upcoming wedding. As the groom....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKiIq3RgFOGMiNTj53wa2M68L7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68828'),
  ('240066870813086202', 'Outlaw', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Nick Love, Sam McCurdy', 'Nick Love', 'Sean Bean, Danny Dyer, Rupert Friend, Sean Harris, Lennie James, Bob Hoskins, Joe Jackson, James Farbell', 'R', 'A group of people who feel betrayed by their government and let down by their police force form a modern-day outlaw posse in order to right what they see as the wrongs of society.', 'A group of people who feel betrayed by their government and let down by their police force form a modern-day outlaw posse in order to right what they see as the wrongs of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46mIRq02fZzbYSzebTQZFNFd2TB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9911'),
  ('111565548217797354', 'Outlaw', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'João Wainer, Miguel Vassy, Marcos Tim França', 'João Wainer, Cesar Gananian, Thaís Nunes', 'Maria Bomani, Jean Luís Amorim, Milhem Cortaz, João Vitor Nascimento, Jorge Hissa, Michely Gabriely, JP Rufino, Wilson Rabelo', null, 'At the age of nine, Rebeca is sold by her grandmother to the bookseller who ran Rocinha. Disputed by bicheiros and drug dealers, the community is going through changes in power. Rebeca becomes the wife of the chief drug dealer and, with the death of her partner, his successor. The electrifying trajectory of crime, violence, drugs and love of a female drug kingpin in Rocinha, Rio de Janeiro in the 1980s.', 'At the age of nine, Rebeca is sold by her grandmother to the bookseller who ran Rocinha. Disputed by bicheiros and drug dealers, the community is going through changes in power. Rebeca becomes the wife of the chief drug dealer and, with the death of her partner, his successor. The electrifying trajectory of crime, violence, drugs and love of a female drug kingpin in Rocinha, Rio de Janeiro in the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGS8SzheANVQicNba0GCE6w1XHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186947'),
  ('934579138886840558', 'Outlaw Brothers', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Frankie Chan Fan-Kei, Michelle Wong Yuk-Ting, Wilson Cheung Wing-Wa', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Frankie Chan Fan-Kei, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Yukari Ôshima, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Kwok Yiu-Wah, Chiang Tao, Sharon Kwok', null, 'Frankie Chan and Max Mok are high-class car thieves whose sticky fingers get them in trouble with some gangsters, and then some really nasty gangsters. Tough policewoman Yukari Oshima wants to put the thieves behind bars, but realizes that by working together against the gangsters they can both benefit more.', 'Frankie Chan and Max Mok are high-class car thieves whose sticky fingers get them in trouble with some gangsters, and then some really nasty gangsters. Tough policewoman Yukari Oshima wants to put the thieves behind bars, but realizes that by working together against the gangsters they can both benefit more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqn8DEXpA8PEc8lyUJ176D3dl9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157887'),
  ('523879204674022879', 'Outlaw Johnny Black', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Western', 'Michael Jai White, Keith L. Smith, Catherina MacDonald', 'Michael Jai White', 'Michael Jai White, Anika Noni Rose, Erica Ash, Byron Minns, Kevin Chapman, Kym Whitley, Tommy Davidson, Buddy Lewis', 'PG-13', 'Hell bent on avenging the death of his father, Johnny Black vows to gun down Brett Clayton and becomes a wanted man in the process while posing as a preacher in a small mining town that''s been taken over by a notorious Land Baron.', 'Hell bent on avenging the death of his father, Johnny Black vows to gun down Brett Clayton and becomes a wanted man in the process while posing as a preacher in a small mining town that''s been taken over by a notorious Land Baron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnMW6UT0sVwPF02cQf0q5lGMf8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889450'),
  ('573525989936021063', 'Outlaw Justice', 1999, 'Action, Western', 'Bill Corcoran', 'Gene Quintano', 'Kris Kristofferson, Willie Nelson, Travis Tritt, Waylon Jennings, Jonathan Banks, Chad Willett, Sancho Gracia, Pablo Scola', null, 'In the tradition of THE WILD BUNCH and THE MAGNIFICENT SEVEN comes this fast paced, action filled western with unforgettable performances by an all star cast: Kris Kristofferson, Willie Nelson, Travis Tritt and Waylon Jennings. All hell breaks loose in this riveting story when a group of former outlaws with bad attitudes teams up to catch a killer with murder and revenge on his mind. After Tobey(Jennings), a retired member of the group, is brutally gunned down by a former member and killer, Clinton Reese, our band of reformed gunslingers, Lee (Nelson, Tarence (Kristofferson), and Dalton (Tritt), sets out on Clinton''s Trail. They are joined by Tobeys reluctatant young son Bryce (Willett).', 'In the tradition of THE WILD BUNCH and THE MAGNIFICENT SEVEN comes this fast paced, action filled western with unforgettable performances by an all star cast: Kris Kristofferson, Willie Nelson, Travis Tritt and Waylon Jennings. All hell breaks loose in this riveting story when a group of former outlaws with bad attitudes teams up to catch a killer with murder and revenge on his mind. After Tobey(Jennings), a retired member of the group, is brutally gunned down by a former member and killer, Clinton Reese, our band of reformed gunslingers, Lee (Nelson, Tarence (Kristofferson), and Dalton (Tritt), sets out on Clinton''s Trail. They are joined by Tobeys reluctatant young son Bryce (Willett).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/su0Nwn1zL2jm7EfLUmUPn0jvgqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82418'),
  ('307880858506590070', 'Outlaw King', 2018, 'Action, History, War', 'David Mackenzie, Barry Ackroyd, Alice Walker', 'Bathsheba Doran, David Mackenzie, James MacInnes', 'Chris Pine, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Florence Pugh, Billy Howle, Sam Spruell, Tony Curran, Callan Mulvey, James Cosmo', 'R', 'Forced into exile by the English after being crowned King of Scotland, legendary warrior Robert the Bruce fights to reclaim the throne.', 'Forced into exile by the English after being crowned King of Scotland, legendary warrior Robert the Bruce fights to reclaim the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rT49ousKUWN3dV7UlhaC9onTNdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454227'),
  ('730615866382835890', 'Outlaw of Gor', 1988, 'Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy', 'John "Bud" Cardos', 'Harry Alan Towers, Rick Marx', 'Urbano Barberini, Rebecca Ferratti, Jack Palance, Donna Denton, Russel Savadier, Alex Heyns, Tullio Moneta, Larry Taylor', 'PG-13', 'An Earthman returns to the planet Gor, and fights against tyranny.', 'An Earthman returns to the planet Gor, and fights against tyranny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct1HFjuesjSFgb564EzMWrrlOPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31131'),
  ('305158377322757235', 'Outlaw: Gangster VIP', 1968, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Toshio Masuda, Kuratarō Takamura, Keiichi Ozawa', 'Kaneo Ikegami, Reiji Kubota', 'Tetsuya Watari, Chieko Matsubara, Mitsuo Hamada, Tamio Kawachi, Kyōsuke Machida, Kayo Matsuo, Yasuko Sanjo, Sanae Kitabayashi', null, 'Goro had grown up in the yakuza world. As an active member of the Mizuhara family crime syndicate, he expressed his loyalty by always putting himself in the forefront of every battle. Violence never bothered him. However, after being sentenced to three years in prison for stabbing a rival gang’s hit man, he becomes disenchanted with the Yakuza life style. Goro is determined to start anew, but karma catches up. His two closest friends are murdered by his ex-boss. He is left with two options: to kill or be killed.', 'Goro had grown up in the yakuza world. As an active member of the Mizuhara family crime syndicate, he expressed his loyalty by always putting himself in the forefront of every battle. Violence never bothered him. However, after being sentenced to three years in prison for stabbing a rival gang’s hit man, he becomes disenchanted with the Yakuza life style. Goro is determined to start anew, but karma catches up. His two closest friends are murdered by his ex-boss. He is left with two options: to kill or be killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wsc31Pq2Jgfrk2NUIzqHhmJ2Fo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361758'),
  ('613601229505159993', 'Outlaw!', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alberto Mangiante, Arnaldo Catinari, Enzo Monteleone', 'Enzo Monteleone, Angelo Orlando', 'Stefano Accorsi, Giovanni Esposito, Emilio Solfrizzi, Antonio Catania, Fabio Ferri, Paolo Graziosi, Andrea Lolli, Alessandro Lombardo', null, 'The movie is based on the autobiography of Horst Fantazzini. Son of an anarchist, he was known in Northern Italy as “the gentleman bandit” because he robbed banks without violence, with only a toy gun. After many convictions and jailbreaks, in the summer of 1973 he''s being held in Fossano, Piedmont when he tries to escape again. This time things get messy and he has to use a real gun and take two prison guards as hostages.', 'The movie is based on the autobiography of Horst Fantazzini. Son of an anarchist, he was known in Northern Italy as “the gentleman bandit” because he robbed banks without violence, with only a toy gun. After many convictions and jailbreaks, in the summer of 1973 he''s being held in Fossano, Piedmont when he tries to escape again. This time things get messy and he has to use a real gun and take two prison guards as hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vO38ySGiaLZkFjxQwcXhUCZO01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125530'),
  ('119031989138172319', 'Outlawed', 2018, 'Action', 'Adam Collins, Luke Radford', 'Adam Collins, Luke Radford', 'Adam Collins, Emmeline Hartley, Andy Calderwood, Andre Squire, Tina Harris, Tobias Fries, Tonia Misuzu Dorrington, Jessica Norris', null, 'An ex-Royal Marine Commando uncovers evidence that could bring down a corrupt official and put him behind bars for life. When his childhood sweetheart is kidnapped, his mission is to rescue her and let nothing stand in his way.', 'An ex-Royal Marine Commando uncovers evidence that could bring down a corrupt official and put him behind bars for life. When his childhood sweetheart is kidnapped, his mission is to rescue her and let nothing stand in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27WJUPZtF5pPM9tm76AsmhR0wBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550290'),
  ('988792175326625159', 'Outlaws', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Stephen McCallum, Simon Green, Stuart Morrice', 'Matt Nable', 'Ryan Corr, Abbey Lee, Simone Kessell, Josh McConville, Matt Nable, Aaron Pedersen, Sam Parsonson, Eddie Baroo', 'R', 'When an Australian motorcycle gang leader is released from prison, he finds his former deputy on the cusp of giving control of their lucrative drug trade to a rival gang. When the deal goes south, the ensuing violence threatens to spin out of control as the gangs must contend with external threats and subversion within their own ranks — culminating in a deadly face-off between the heavily-armed crews in this epic and action-packed biker thriller.', 'When an Australian motorcycle gang leader is released from prison, he finds his former deputy on the cusp of giving control of their lucrative drug trade to a rival gang. When the deal goes south, the ensuing violence threatens to spin out of control as the gangs must contend with external threats and subversion within their own ranks — culminating in a deadly face-off between the heavily-armed crews in this epic and action-packed biker thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uPtTRbduZ2mXcKnccLo4kR03ub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433288'),
  ('1067251920585568892', 'Outlaws', 2021, 'Crime', 'Carles Gusi, Daniel Monzón, Carles Valero', 'Daniel Monzón, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Marcos Ruiz, Begoña Vargas, Chechu Salgado, Pep Tosar, Xavier Martín, Daniel Ibáñez, Guillermo Lasheras, Cintia García', 'R', 'Introverted Girona student Nacho meets two delinquents from the city''s Chinatown and gets caught up in a summer onslaught of burglaries and hold ups that will change his life.', 'Introverted Girona student Nacho meets two delinquents from the city''s Chinatown and gets caught up in a summer onslaught of burglaries and hold ups that will change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrq7sGXraFM6H9OcHFKQTKe8A3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776821'),
  ('997486240185330764', 'Outlaws - For Greater Glory', 2012, 'History, Drama, Action, War', 'Dean Wright', 'Michael Love', 'Eva Longoria, Andy Garcia, Oscar Isaac, Peter O''Toole, Rubén Blades, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Mau Kuri, Adrian Alonso', 'R', 'A chronicle of the Cristeros War (1926-1929), which was touched off by a rebellion against the Mexican government''s attempt to secularize the country.', 'A chronicle of the Cristeros War (1926-1929), which was touched off by a rebellion against the Mexican government''s attempt to secularize the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jgh0ej04j98q2NFpSZLlpDazUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96399'),
  ('602646831352032407', 'Outlaws and Angels', 2016, 'Western, Drama, Thriller', 'JT Mollner, Matthew Irving', 'JT Mollner', 'Francesca Eastwood, Chad Michael Murray, Frances Fisher, Teri Polo, Luke Wilson, Ben Browder, Madisen Beaty, Steven Michael Quezada', null, 'A gang of cold-blooded outlaws narrowly escapes a blood-soaked bank robbery in a grimy frontier town. With a notorious bounty hunter hot on their trail, these nefarious criminals desperately need a place to hide out before night falls. Fate brings them to the home of the Tildons, a seemingly innocent family with two feisty daughters. As the men settle in, an impetuous game of cat and mouse plays out during the cold, black night. Come morning, nothing will ever be the same.', 'A gang of cold-blooded outlaws narrowly escapes a blood-soaked bank robbery in a grimy frontier town. With a notorious bounty hunter hot on their trail, these nefarious criminals desperately need a place to hide out before night falls. Fate brings them to the home of the Tildons, a seemingly innocent family with two feisty daughters. As the men settle in, an impetuous game of cat and mouse plays out during the cold, black night. Come morning, nothing will ever be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEV31TbZoC9mBa0fjJVtw94Pnvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376501'),
  ('737207129413755184', 'Outpost', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Gavin Struthers, Steve Barker', 'Rae Brunton', 'Ray Stevenson, Julian Wadham, Richard Brake, Paul Blair, Brett Fancy, Ene Frost, Julian Rivett, Michael Smiley', 'R', 'In a seedy bar in a town ravaged by war, scientist and businessman Hunt hires mercenary and former Royal Marine D.C. to assemble a crack team of ex-soldiers to protect him on a dangerous journey into no-man''s land. Their mission is to scope out an old military bunker in Eastern Europe. It should be easy – 48 hours at the most. Lots of cash for little risk. Or so he says...', 'In a seedy bar in a town ravaged by war, scientist and businessman Hunt hires mercenary and former Royal Marine D.C. to assemble a crack team of ex-soldiers to protect him on a dangerous journey into no-man''s land. Their mission is to scope out an old military bunker in Eastern Europe. It should be easy – 48 hours at the most. Lots of cash for little risk. Or so he says...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwWEsWV1DNCqZudEiHvk1NPeUla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9017'),
