  ('343909028966145998', 'Outrage', 1993, 'Action, Drama', 'Carlos Saura, Kuki López Rodero', 'Carlos Saura, Enzo Monteleone, Giorgio Scerbanenco', 'Antonio Banderas, Francesca Neri, Eulalia Ramón, Walter Vidarte, Coque Malla, Achero Mañas, Rodrigo Valverde, Chema Mazo', null, 'Marco Vallez (Antonio Banderas) is possessed by the beauty of a circus sharp shooter, and from the second they meet he is willing to give up everything to be with her. But one horrifying night sends them both down a road of revenge leaving behind a trail of bodies to the ultimate showdown with justice.', 'Marco Vallez (Antonio Banderas) is possessed by the beauty of a circus sharp shooter, and from the second they meet he is willing to give up everything to be with her. But one horrifying night sends them both down a road of revenge leaving behind a trail of bodies to the ultimate showdown with justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e08Vdp1P612qqhQv6wuC3keWNeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65671'),
  ('375098989080110004', 'Outrage', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Kirby Dick, Thaddeus Wadleigh', 'Kirby Dick', 'Tammy Baldwin, Wayne Barrett, Elizabeth Birch, Chris Bull, John Byrne, David Catania, Gary Cathey, Steven Clemons', null, 'An indictment of closeted politicians who lobby for anti-gay legislation in the US.', 'An indictment of closeted politicians who lobby for anti-gay legislation in the US.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1t77eunGNzJfeYqyDBBlHFKAbFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30312'),
  ('1147408798239948933', 'Outrage', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Kippei Shiina, Ryo Kase, Tomokazu Miura, Fumiyo Kohinata, Jun Kunimura, Tetta Sugimoto, Renji Ishibashi', 'R', 'When a tough yakuza gangster is betrayed by his bosses, it means all out war. Bodies pile up as he takes out everyone in his way to the top in a brutal quest for revenge.', 'When a tough yakuza gangster is betrayed by his bosses, it means all out war. Bodies pile up as he takes out everyone in his way to the top in a brutal quest for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6VVl5WKuGIDlSAm8hgvTsrzODK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45284'),
  ('642509436576579952', 'Outrage Coda', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima, Hirofumi Inaba', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Toshiyuki Nishida, Ken Mitsuishi, Sansei Shiomi, Yutaka Matsushige, Ren Osugi, Tokio Kaneda, Hakuryu', null, 'Five years after the all-out war between the Sanno and Hanabishi crime families, former yakuza boss Otomo works in South Korea for Mr. Chang, a noted fixer. When tensions rise between Chang and the Hanabishi, and Chang''s life is endangered, Otomo returns to Japan to settle things once and for all.', 'Five years after the all-out war between the Sanno and Hanabishi crime families, former yakuza boss Otomo works in South Korea for Mr. Chang, a noted fixer. When tensions rise between Chang and the Hanabishi, and Chang''s life is endangered, Otomo returns to Japan to settle things once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuQf4HWvMxyKXHrtF7x520vaqU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452323'),
  ('956065524432777968', 'Outrageous Fortune', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Hiller, David M. Walsh, Michael D. Moore', 'Leslie Dixon', 'Shelley Long, Bette Midler, Peter Coyote, Robert Prosky, John Schuck, Anthony Heald, George Carlin, Ji-Tu Cumbuka', 'R', 'Refined actress Lauren Ames finally has a chance to study with the great theatre professor Stanislav Korzenowski. Sandy Brozinsky, a brash, loud actress, decides through happenstance to also study with Korzenowski. The two women end up dating the same man (who turns out to be a double agent) and follow him across the country to force him to choose between them.', 'Refined actress Lauren Ames finally has a chance to study with the great theatre professor Stanislav Korzenowski. Sandy Brozinsky, a brash, loud actress, decides through happenstance to also study with Korzenowski. The two women end up dating the same man (who turns out to be a double agent) and follow him across the country to force him to choose between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZdQaa9HymxGfjBo3mFhhpWXVeG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20242'),
  ('34888119847352128', 'Outrageous!', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Richard Benner, James B. Kelly, Barbara Laffey', 'Margaret Gibson Gilboord, Richard Benner', 'Craig Russell, Hollis McLaren, Richert Easley, Allan Moyle, David McIlwraith, Gerry Salsberg, Andrée Pelletier, Helen Shaver', 'NR', 'Gay hair stylist Robin Turner does a lot of work for drag queens, all the while dreaming that he''ll someday find the courage to perform in drag himself. When his schizophrenic friend, Liza, turns up looking for a place to stay, the two form an increasingly tight bond, Robin helping Liza through an unplanned pregnancy and Liza pushing Robin to develop a successful nightclub act.', 'Gay hair stylist Robin Turner does a lot of work for drag queens, all the while dreaming that he''ll someday find the courage to perform in drag himself. When his schizophrenic friend, Liza, turns up looking for a place to stay, the two form an increasingly tight bond, Robin helping Liza through an unplanned pregnancy and Liza pushing Robin to develop a successful nightclub act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twMUmLYS6PMUJbhiC89aRXIsnYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41923'),
  ('8542098059631840', 'Outside', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Carlo Ledesma, Shing Fung Cheung, Alyssa Villanueva', 'Carlo Ledesma', 'Sid Lucero, Beauty Gonzalez, Marco Masa, Aiden Patdu, James Blanco, Enchong Dee, Joel Torre, Bing Pimentel', 'R', 'A family retreats to an isolated farm during a zombie outbreak, but years of painful secrets take a toll as they navigate their desolate world.', 'A family retreats to an isolated farm during a zombie outbreak, but years of painful secrets take a toll as they navigate their desolate world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPfPeTe1hEdWwJBOnuuPZdfYGsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306764'),
