  ('1120691525966712315', 'Outside Ozona', 1998, 'Thriller, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'J.S. Cardone, Irek Hartowicz, Matt Prescott Morton', 'J.S. Cardone', 'Robert Forster, Kevin Pollak, Sherilyn Fenn, David Paymer, Penelope Ann Miller, Swoosie Kurtz, Taj Mahal, Meat Loaf', 'R', 'A widowed trucker fends off isolation in the company of a dog named Girl, two bickering sisters try to reconcile their differences and a down-and-out circus clown and his stripper girlfriend must fight the temptation of crime on the road. Their common companion is an angry disc jockey at odds with a desperate boss. All these people will find their lives intertwined by the hand of fate. And before the night gives way to day, some will breathe their last breath... Outside Ozona.', 'A widowed trucker fends off isolation in the company of a dog named Girl, two bickering sisters try to reconcile their differences and a down-and-out circus clown and his stripper girlfriend must fight the temptation of crime on the road. Their common companion is an angry disc jockey at odds with a desperate boss. All these people will find their lives intertwined by the hand of fate. And before the night gives way to day, some will breathe their last breath... Outside Ozona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79yHZoOA9ZzEkQqyL2auTBUJUbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140897'),
  ('844826930382154158', 'Outside Providence', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Corrente, Richard Crudo', 'Michael Corrente, Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly', 'Shawn Hatosy, Amy Smart, Alec Baldwin, Jon Abrahams, Richard Jenkins, George Wendt, Robert Turano, Gabriel Mann', 'R', 'In this coming-of-age comedy, Tim Dunphy is leading a go-nowhere existence, spending his days smoking pot and hanging out with his best friend, Drugs Delaney. But Tim''s lazy days of getting high are jettisoned after a brush with the law convinces his blue-collar dad to send him to a Connecticut prep school. The one saving grace of the new school is Jane, a fellow student Tim falls for immediately.', 'In this coming-of-age comedy, Tim Dunphy is leading a go-nowhere existence, spending his days smoking pot and hanging out with his best friend, Drugs Delaney. But Tim''s lazy days of getting high are jettisoned after a brush with the law convinces his blue-collar dad to send him to a Connecticut prep school. The one saving grace of the new school is Jane, a fellow student Tim falls for immediately.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3e67GugVHkEOhl5TwjWAVVxtFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14578'),
  ('712676614142399726', 'Outside Satan', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Bruno Dumont, Yves Cape', 'Bruno Dumont', 'David Dewaele, Alexandra Lemâtre, Christophe Bon, Juliette Bacquet, Aurore Broutin, Sonia Barthélémy, Valérie Mestdagh, Dominique Caffier', null, 'Along the Côte d''Opale, near a hamlet, with its dunes and marshes, lives a mysterious wanderer from nowhere who struggles along, poaches, prays and builds fires...', 'Along the Côte d''Opale, near a hamlet, with its dunes and marshes, lives a mysterious wanderer from nowhere who struggles along, poaches, prays and builds fires...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Fe4M4wqvdBr7B4P4E3v62lpTEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89456'),
  ('779957420631140602', 'Outside the Box', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Philip Koch, Markus Eckert', 'Philip Koch, Anna Katrin Schneider', 'Volker Bruch, Samuel Finzi, Frederick Lau, Vicky Krieps, Lavinia Wilson, Hanns Zischler, Stefan Konarske, Richard Sammel', null, 'Frederick Schopner, a young management consultant, has been invited to participate in a special kind of team-building event. He and his colleagues will be chased across an outdoor obstacle course while being assessed on leadership qualities and their capacity for teamwork via video surveillance. Special highlight: the company has hired two over-the-hill actors to kidnap the consultants with unloaded weapons, keep them hostage, and to demand a high ransom from the company. A realistic role play with fun factor! But things don''t go according to plan: the actors find the make-believe scenario so convincing that they decide to put the plan into action for real, using real weapons. Meanwhile, Human Resources manager Vanessa is observing what''s happening via video surveillance and has to find a way to keep the hostage situation from escalating…', 'Frederick Schopner, a young management consultant, has been invited to participate in a special kind of team-building event. He and his colleagues will be chased across an outdoor obstacle course while being assessed on leadership qualities and their capacity for teamwork via video surveillance. Special highlight: the company has hired two over-the-hill actors to kidnap the consultants with unloaded weapons, keep them hostage, and to demand a high ransom from the company. A realistic role play with fun factor! But things don''t go according to plan: the actors find the make-believe scenario so convincing that they decide to put the plan into action for real, using real weapons. Meanwhile, Human Resources manager Vanessa is observing what''s happening via video surveillance and has to find a way to keep the hostage situation from escalating…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tALGwYf29de7Xust8KF7mAzB0NP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350575'),
  ('146207553435238409', 'Outside the Law', 1921, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Tod Browning, Tom Gubbins, Leo McCarey', 'Lucien Hubbard', 'Priscilla Dean, Wheeler Oakman, Lon Chaney, Ralph Lewis, E. Alyn Warren, Stanley Goethals, Melbourne MacDowell, Wilton Taylor', 'NR', 'Silent Madden and his daughter Molly have left the criminal underworld of San Francisco thanks to the wise teachings of Chang Low, a Confucian master. But the evil Black Mike Sylva is determined to frame Madden to avenge a mistake from the past…', 'Silent Madden and his daughter Molly have left the criminal underworld of San Francisco thanks to the wise teachings of Chang Low, a Confucian master. But the evil Black Mike Sylva is determined to frame Madden to avenge a mistake from the past…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kFx2g6eiOw3micfARbhZte69te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130066'),
  ('888799669569648519', 'Outside the Law', 1956, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jack Arnold, Irving Glassberg', 'Danny Arnold', 'Ray Danton, Leigh Snowden, Grant Williams, Onslow Stevens, Raymond Bailey, Judson Pratt, Jack Kruschen, Floyd Simmons', 'NR', 'A government agent''s son wins respect and love when he challenges counterfeiters.', 'A government agent''s son wins respect and love when he challenges counterfeiters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VuRiYp6mKGbvoaL9UgthNhBd8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116620'),
  ('106266197560413362', 'Outside the Law', 2010, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Rachid Bouchareb', 'Jamel Debbouze, Roschdy Zem, Sami Bouajila, Chafia Boudraa, Bernard Blancan, Sabrina Seyvecou, Assaad Bouab, Thibault de Montalembert', null, 'After losing their family home in Algeria in the 1920s, three brothers and their mother are scattered across the globe. Messaoud joins the French army fighting in Indochina; Abdelkader becomes a leader of the Algerian independence movement in France and Saïd moves to Paris to make his fortune in the shady clubs and boxing halls of Pigalle.', 'After losing their family home in Algeria in the 1920s, three brothers and their mother are scattered across the globe. Messaoud joins the French army fighting in Indochina; Abdelkader becomes a leader of the Algerian independence movement in France and Saïd moves to Paris to make his fortune in the shady clubs and boxing halls of Pigalle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ol0JPw7wcvY34VDBLNjXsemg5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47904'),
  ('84402615180771504', 'Outside the Wall', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Crane Wilbur, Irving Glassberg, Milton Schwarzwald', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Richard Basehart, Marilyn Maxwell, Signe Hasso, Dorothy Hart, Joseph Pevney, Lloyd Gough, Harry Morgan, John Hoyt', 'NR', 'Larry Nelson, paroled from prison after serving nearly half of his thirty-year sentence, is determined to not fall into the clutches of the law again, and takes a quiet job at a country sanitarium. Thete, he meets and falls for a nurse, Charlotte Maynard, and he knows the only way to enter her web is to have a lot of money, for Miss Maynard is somewhat of a gold-digger.', 'Larry Nelson, paroled from prison after serving nearly half of his thirty-year sentence, is determined to not fall into the clutches of the law again, and takes a quiet job at a country sanitarium. Thete, he meets and falls for a nurse, Charlotte Maynard, and he knows the only way to enter her web is to have a lot of money, for Miss Maynard is somewhat of a gold-digger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRpd8Q6vIiB6byGxlQx76rD3HYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73550'),
  ('920300318710999847', 'Outside the Wire', 2021, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Mikael Håfström, Michael Bonvillain, Peter Findley', 'Rob Yescombe, Rowan Athale', 'Anthony Mackie, Damson Idris, Enzo Cilenti, Emily Beecham, Henry Garrett, Kristina Tonteri-Young, Pilou Asbæk, Michael Kelly', 'R', 'In the near future, a drone pilot is sent into a deadly militarized zone and must work with an android officer to locate a doomsday device.', 'In the near future, a drone pilot is sent into a deadly militarized zone and must work with an android officer to locate a doomsday device.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XYLiMxHAaCsoyrVo38LBWMw2p8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775996'),
  ('556691490524301988', 'Outskirts', 1933, 'War, Drama, Comedy', 'Boris Barnet, A. Spiridonov, Mikhail Kirillov', 'Boris Barnet', 'Aleksandr Chistyakov, Yelena Kuzmina, Nikolai Bogolyubov, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Hans Klering, Vladimir Uralskiy, Mikhail Zharov, Sergei Komarov', null, 'In a remote Russian village during World War I, colourful and nuanced characters experience divided loyalties: family loyalty vs. personal desire, nationalism vs. transcendent humanism.', 'In a remote Russian village during World War I, colourful and nuanced characters experience divided loyalties: family loyalty vs. personal desire, nationalism vs. transcendent humanism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xM237sYuNtPq3VnmBsPzlyF9yAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94638'),
  ('601037107009528788', 'Outsource', 2022, 'Action, Comedy', 'John Stephen Baltazar', null, 'Bashar Atiyat, Bashar Atiyat, Noel Blanco, Thais Buchner, Evyn George', null, 'A police chief hires an old friend, who is an international spy, to help him search for a wanted suspect in the Philippines. When the chief dies, all evidence points towards the spy, and he must go to extremes to defend himself.', 'A police chief hires an old friend, who is an international spy, to help him search for a wanted suspect in the Philippines. When the chief dies, all evidence points towards the spy, and he must go to extremes to defend himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38LxG3Z9901QZsoz9A4rOMGoSnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942047'),
  ('394550202854990034', 'Outsourced', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John Jeffcoat, Teodoro Maniaci', 'John Jeffcoat, George Wing', 'Josh Hamilton, Ayesha Dharker, Arjun Mathur, Larry Pine, Asif Basra, Ketan Mehta, Sudha Shivpuri, Siddharth Jadhav', 'PG-13', 'After his entire department is outsourced, an American novelty products salesman heads to India to train his replacement.', 'After his entire department is outsourced, an American novelty products salesman heads to India to train his replacement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbsjim3GhRn1nPwbJ9GOkj2PKIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7861'),
  ('813212194216487344', 'Outward Bound', 1930, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Robert Milton, Hal Mohr', 'J. Grubb Alexander', 'Leslie Howard, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Beryl Mercer, Dudley Digges, Helen Chandler, Alec B. Francis, Montagu Love, Lyonel Watts', null, 'A group of strangers find themselves aboard an unmanned ship, surrounded by fog and uncertain of their destination. As they attempt to make sense of their situation, the group of passengers discover a commonality that changes their perception of the nature of their journey. The film was later remade, with some changes, as Between Two Worlds (1944).', 'A group of strangers find themselves aboard an unmanned ship, surrounded by fog and uncertain of their destination. As they attempt to make sense of their situation, the group of passengers discover a commonality that changes their perception of the nature of their journey. The film was later remade, with some changes, as Between Two Worlds (1944).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7loid8pkByyaCeMMyevWQRy00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120933'),
  ('553027219222488579', 'Outward Signs of Wealth', 1983, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jacques Monnet', 'Jacques Monnet, Alain Godard', 'Claude Brasseur, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Josiane Balasko, Roland Giraud, Xavier Saint-Macary, Jean-François Rémi, Eva Harling, Hélène Arié', null, 'Jean-Jacques Lestrade is the owner of a renowned veterinary clinic in Paris who lives in a luxurious apartment. He is part of Parisian high society and lives a wealthy lifestyle surrounded by young women and money. He relies on his trusty accountant, Jérôme Bouvier, to manage his finances. All goes well until the day that Béatrice Flamand, a tax inspector, shows up at his clinic, at which point Lestrade is now in trouble.', 'Jean-Jacques Lestrade is the owner of a renowned veterinary clinic in Paris who lives in a luxurious apartment. He is part of Parisian high society and lives a wealthy lifestyle surrounded by young women and money. He relies on his trusty accountant, Jérôme Bouvier, to manage his finances. All goes well until the day that Béatrice Flamand, a tax inspector, shows up at his clinic, at which point Lestrade is now in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amGWB8XGA6hq4my0s2Qqhg8SyyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79756'),
  ('946798218165571723', 'Over & Out', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Florian Mag, Julia Becker, Malte Grosche', 'Julia Becker', 'Jessica Schwarz, Nora Tschirner, Julia Becker, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Denis Moschitto, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Sabine Vitua, Elvis Clausen', null, 'Lea, Steffi, Toni & Maja have vowed to celebrate each others weddings together — 26 years ago, things you do at twelve. Now Maja spontaneously invites the others to Italy. A promise is a promise! The trip begins moderately and gets worse and worse. It confronts them with missed opportunities, loss and their long lasting friendship.', 'Lea, Steffi, Toni & Maja have vowed to celebrate each others weddings together — 26 years ago, things you do at twelve. Now Maja spontaneously invites the others to Italy. A promise is a promise! The trip begins moderately and gets worse and worse. It confronts them with missed opportunities, loss and their long lasting friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjWQ0h6K6W5IRPEebhe0uC1MkXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897839'),
  ('930164587121295389', 'Over Drive', 2018, 'Action', 'Eiichiro Hasumi', 'Sayaka Kuwamura', 'Mackenyu, Masahiro Higashide, Aoi Morikawa, Takumi Kitamura, Keita Machida, Kotaro Yoshida, Kozo Sato, Yusuke Hirayama', null, 'At the SCRS (Seiko Cup Rally Series), talented young drivers hope to advance to the WRC (World Rally Championship). Atsuhiro Hiyama is the chief mechanic and an engineer at Supika Racing Factory. He is well regarded by his peers. His younger brother is Naozumi. He is an extremely gifted driver for Supika Racing Factory, but he is also a troublemaker. They continually argue because of Naozumi''s reckless racing style. One day, Hikaru Endo becomes his manager.', 'At the SCRS (Seiko Cup Rally Series), talented young drivers hope to advance to the WRC (World Rally Championship). Atsuhiro Hiyama is the chief mechanic and an engineer at Supika Racing Factory. He is well regarded by his peers. His younger brother is Naozumi. He is an extremely gifted driver for Supika Racing Factory, but he is also a troublemaker. They continually argue because of Naozumi''s reckless racing style. One day, Hikaru Endo becomes his manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoF7zjiHcWUmdHSktqiI4LTpg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517380'),
  ('876942298395040854', 'Over Her Dead Body', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Lowell, Tony Steinberg, John Bailey', 'Jeff Lowell', 'Eva Longoria, Paul Rudd, Lake Bell, Jason Biggs, Lindsay Sloane, Stephen Root, William Morgan Sheppard, Wendi McLendon-Covey', 'PG-13', 'After his fiancée, Kate, dies in an accident on their wedding day, veterinarian Henry grows depressed. To help him move on, his sister has him visit psychic Ashley and gives her Kate''s diary. Ashley uses the journal''s details to convincingly deliver the fake message that Kate wants Henry to move on. However, Kate''s ghost is watching over Ashley and Henry. Furious when they fall for each other, she vows to sabotage their relationship.', 'After his fiancée, Kate, dies in an accident on their wedding day, veterinarian Henry grows depressed. To help him move on, his sister has him visit psychic Ashley and gives her Kate''s diary. Ashley uses the journal''s details to convincingly deliver the fake message that Kate wants Henry to move on. However, Kate''s ghost is watching over Ashley and Henry. Furious when they fall for each other, she vows to sabotage their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85moNqAncGlJXEwt4Ja3DfNbiQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13160'),
  ('894862923587699626', 'Over My Dead Body', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Wu Seon-ho, Hong Seung-chul, Cho Sang-yun', 'Wu Seon-ho', 'Lee Beom-soo, Ryoo Seung-bum, Kim Ok-bin, Jeong Man-sik, Yoo Da-in, Shin Jung-keun, Ko Chang-seok, Jeong In-gi', null, 'A scientist, his friend''s daughter and a con artist get entangled in a scheme to steal the body of a greedy pharmaceutical executive.', 'A scientist, his friend''s daughter and a con artist get entangled in a scheme to steal the body of a greedy pharmaceutical executive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e49T4OCfwxwQNtiTX5n3e2xRnuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114760'),
  ('82741127263381219', 'Over the Brooklyn Bridge', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Menahem Golan, Adam Greenberg', 'Arnold Somkin', 'Elliott Gould, Margaux Hemingway, Sid Caesar, Carol Kane, Burt Young, Shelley Winters, Jerry Lazarus, Francine Beers', 'R', 'A put-upon Jewish deli owner in Brooklyn dreams of getting out from underneath the thumb of his domineering father and his haughty fashion-model girlfriend by buying his own restaurant in midtown Manhattan.', 'A put-upon Jewish deli owner in Brooklyn dreams of getting out from underneath the thumb of his domineering father and his haughty fashion-model girlfriend by buying his own restaurant in midtown Manhattan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYO5Dxvf1L5zT0f17sfE5YMuZ49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251260'),
  ('699342358343922974', 'Over The Cracks', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Camille Japy, Damien Grégoire', 'Camille Japy', 'Ariane Ascaride, Bérénice Bejo, Thomas Scimeca, Marilou Aussilloux, Stéphane Brel, Bernard Alane, Christophe Odent, Zinedine Soualem', null, 'Odile is getting ready to celebrate her birthday. As her kids and grandkids are on their way to visit her, Jean, her husband, unexpectedly passes away. Unable to cope with reality, she hides him under the bed.', 'Odile is getting ready to celebrate her birthday. As her kids and grandkids are on their way to visit her, Jean, her husband, unexpectedly passes away. Unable to cope with reality, she hides him under the bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdNB3YhphjcTXlDup78Xzot3hOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995396'),
